n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\nSale\n\nArctic Ice Bulk Pack\n\nArctic Ice Bulk Pack\n\nRegular price\n\nFrom $120.00\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nFrom $120.00\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\nALL SORTS OF USES!\nView all\n\nAt Home\n\nArctic Ice\u2122 packs are have been rated #1 by America's Test Kitchen... &nbsp;\n\nAt Home\n\nLeisure &amp; Lifestyle\n\nArctic Ice\u2122 cooler packs are the most durable, versatile, and effective cooler... &nbsp;\n\nLeisure &amp; Lifestyle\n\nCamping &amp; Hiking\n\nArctic Ice\u2122 Alaskan Series\u2122 is a great option for all of those... &nbsp;\n\nCamping &amp; Hiking\n\nView all\n\nARCTIC ICE\u00ae\n\nArctic Ice\u00ae cooler packs are the most durable, versatile, and effective cooler packs available. Made from non-toxic, high-performance phase-change materials (PCM), Arctic Ice\u00ae can keep your cooler temperatures anywhere from ice cold to frozen.\nInnovative, high performance Arctic Ice\u00ae cooler packs save time, money, water, and energy while keeping your cooler contents cool, cold or even frozen. Arctic Ice\u00ae cooler packs are reusable and dishwasher-safe (top rack) so you can use them again and again.\nStop buying messy bags of ice or those other discount cooler packs and get Arctic Ice\u00ae high-performance cooler packs. Wherever you travel, fish, tailgate, hunt, or camp \u2013 make sure Arctic Ice\u00ae puts the cool in your cooler!\nProudly made in the U.S.A and guaranteed for a lifetime of use. Please Chill Responsibly\u00ae\n\nShop Now\n\nDiscount available for Military, First Responders, Medical Workers and Teachers\n\nGet Verified\n\nSubscribe to our emails\n\nBe the first to know about new collections and exclusive offers.\n\nEmail\n\nQuick links\n\nSearch\n\nAbout Us\n\nFAQs\n\nVideos\n\nContact Us\n\nAlaskan Series\u2122\n\nChillin' Brew\u2122\n\nChillin' Cradle\n\nTundra Series\u2122\n\nPack Your Cooler\n\nTerms of Service\n\nRefund policy\n\nMilitary Appreciation\n\nFacebook\n\nInstagram\n\nPayment methods\n\nAmerican Express\n\nApple Pay\n\nDiners Club\n\nDiscover\n\nMastercard\n\nShop Pay\n\nVisa\n\n&copy; 2026, Arctic Ice\nPowered by Shopify\n\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n\nOpens in a new window.\n\nDouble click on a word to see the definition. [ Skip to content ][1]\n\n## Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][2]\n\nHave an account?\n\n[Log in][3] to check out faster.\n\n## Your cart\n\nLoading...\n\n## Subtotal\n\n$0.00 USD\n\nTaxes and shipping calculated at checkout\nUpdate Check out\n\nFREE SHIPPING OVER $100!\n* Shop\nShop\n* [ Sample Packs ][4]\n* [ 2 Pack Bundles ][5]\n* [ Variety Packs ][6]\n* [ Bundle Deals ][7]\n* [ Bulk Savings ][8]\n* [ All Products ][9]\n* [ Ice Pack Comparison ][10]\n* FAQs\nFAQs\n* [ FAQ ][11]\n* [ Arctic Ice Uses ][12]\n* [ Pack Your Cooler ][13]\n* [ Videos ][14]\n* [ Our Story ][15]\n* Contact Us\nContact Us\n* [ Contact Us ][16]\n* [ Limited Lifetime Warranty ][17]\n* [ VIDEOS ][18]\n\n[ Log in][19]\n* [ Facebook ][20]\n* [ Instagram ][21]\nSearch\n[Arctic Ice]\n][22]\n* Shop\n* [ Sample Packs ][23]\n* [ 2 Pack Bundles ][24]\n* [ Variety Packs ][25]\n* [ Bundle Deals ][26]\n* [ Bulk Savings ][27]\n* [ All Products ][28]\n* [ Ice Pack Comparison ][29]\n* FAQs\n* [ FAQ ][30]\n* [ Arctic Ice Uses ][31]\n* [ Pack Your Cooler ][32]\n* [ Videos ][33]\n* [ Our Story ][34]\n* Contact Us\n* [ Contact Us ][35]\n* [ Limited Lifetime Warranty ][36]\n* [ VIDEOS ][37]\nSearch\n[ Log in ][38][ Cart][39]\n[ Skip to product information ][40]\n* Open media 1 in modal\n* Open media 2 in modal\n1 / of 1\n\n# Lunch Box Sample Pack\n\n## Lunch Box Sample Pack\n\n][41]\nSize\nSmall .75 lbs Medium 1.5lbs\nProduct variants\nSmall .75 lbs - $24.99Medium 1.5lbs - $29.99\nRegular price $24.99\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336$\u03362\u03368\u0336.\u03369\u03369\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $24.99\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\nQuantity (0 in cart) Decrease quantity for Lunch Box Sample Pack Increase quantity for Lunch Box\nSample Pack\nAdd to cart\n\nDiscover our smaller ice packs with this convenient lunch box sample pack. Choose your size\u2014Small\n(.75 lbs) or Medium (1.5 lbs)\u2014and receive one Alaskan and one Chillin' Brew ice pack. Perfect for\ntesting both premium blends before committing to a full-size purchase. Ideal for lunch boxes,\ncoolers, and on-the-go cooling needs.\n\nNOT FOR ICE CREAM! Only use our Tundra series for frozen items.\n\n## Which series should I use: Alaskan or Tundra?\n\nIt depends on how you intend to use your Arctic Ice**\u00ae**. Keep in mind that the two series were\ndesigned for specific purposes. The Alaskan series is ideal for keeping your chilled goods cold. The\nTundra Series is ideal for keeping frozen items frozen.\n\n## Why not just use the Tundra Series for everything since it freezes much colder than the Alaskan\n## Series?\n\nArctic Ice**\u00ae** and other phase change materials (PCM) are designed to hold a very specific freezing\npoint while absorbing \u201cheat\u201d from the surrounding area. When Arctic Ice**\u00ae** Tundra Series is\nexposed to temperatures greater than its freezing/melting point, it begins to absorb that difference\nin temperature or \u201cheat\u201d. The greater the difference in your payload temperature and the phase\nchange material, the quicker it will change phase from solid to liquid, or melt.\n\nWhat makes Arctic Ice**\u00ae** so much more efficient than other PCM\u2019s is its ability to absorb greater\namounts of heat without greatly increasing its temperature.\n\n**Example:** When you place your chilled food and beverages in a cooler from a refrigerator, they\nare cooled to around 35-36\u00ba F. The Alaskan Series is designed to hold a constant 32\u00b0F while\nabsorbing the \u201cheat\u201d around it. Since only a couple of degrees separate your food and beverages\n(35-36\u00ba F) and our Alaskan Series blocks (32\u00b0F), they are ideal for keeping these items at a\nrefrigerated temperature for a long time.\n\nUsing Tundra Series blocks in the above situation would cause them to absorb a lot of \u201cheat\u201d. The\ndifference in temperature of your chilled items (35-36F ) and the Alaskan Series blocks (5 F) is 30\ndegrees of \u201cheat\u201d. Therefore the Tundra series would melt more quickly and could possibly freeze\nsome of the items it comes in contact with for prolonged periods.\n\n## How much Arctic Ice\u2122 do I need?\n\nYou should choose close to the same weight of Arctic Ice**\u00ae**Alaskan Series as you would regular\nice. Arctic Ice\u2122 comes in 4 convenient sizes \u2013 Small (.75 lbs.), Medium (1.5 lbs.) Large (2.5 lbs)\nand XLarge (5 lbs.) The difference is Arctic Ice\u2122 will last longer, leaves no wet mess, is\ndishwasher safe, and is re-usable for years!\n\n## What if I want to keep something frozen? How much of the Tundra Series should I use?\n\nKeeping items frozen for an extended period of time depends on several factors. Make sure that you\nuse the smallest insulated container needed to hold your cargo and the Tundra Series blocks. Use at\nleast one block to cover the bottom of the container and one to cover the top of the frozen goods.\nThe more blocks you use, the longer your frozen goods will stay frozen. You\u2019ll also find that the\nless you open the container, the longer it will hold frozen temperatures. Remember, if you're\npeeking, you\u2019re not freezing!\n\n## Why won\u2019t my Tundra Series Arctic Ice\u00ae freeze in my freezer?\n\nArctic Ice**\u00ae**Tundra Series has a specific cooling point of -15\u00ba C or 5\u00ba F. Make sure your freezer\nis turned down below this point or to its lowest setting. Most, if not all consumer freezers will\nget this cold or even colder. Some will cool down to -10\u00ba F! The Tundra Series (also a dry ice\nalternative) works best when cooled for at least 36 hours at the lowest setting available on\nconsumer freezers.*(What takes longer to thaw, takes longer to freeze.)*\n\n[ View full details ][42]\n[Lunch Box Sample Pack] [Lunch Box Sample Pack]\n\n## Subscribe to our emails\n\nBe the first to know about new collections and exclusive offers.\n\nEmail\n\n## Quick links\n* [ Search ][43]\n* [ About Us ][44]\n* [ FAQs ][45]\n* [ Videos ][46]\n* [ Contact Us ][47]\n* [ Alaskan Series\u2122 ][48]\n* [ Chillin' Brew\u2122 ][49]\n* [ Chillin' Cradle ][50]\n* [ Tundra Series\u2122 ][51]\n* [ Pack Your Cooler ][52]\n* [ Terms of Service ][53]\n* [ Refund policy ][54]\n* [ Military Appreciation ][55]\n* [ Facebook ][56]\n* [ Instagram ][57]\n\nPayment methods\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [Discover]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\u00a9 2026, [Arctic Ice][58] [Powered by Shopify][59]\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\nDouble click on a word to see the definition.\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/all\n[3]: https://arctic-ice.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[4]: /products/lunch-box-sample-pack\n[5]: /collections/2-pack-bundles\n[6]: /products/small-sample-pack\n[7]: /products/arctic-ice-bundle-pack\n[8]: /products/arctic-ice-bulk-packs\n[9]: /collections/all\n[10]: /pages/arctic-ice-selector\n[11]: /pages/faqs\n[12]: /blogs/arctic-ice-uses\n[13]: /pages/pack-your-cooler\n[14]: /pages/media\n[15]: /pages/about-us\n[16]: /pages/contact-us\n[17]: /pages/limited-lifetime-warranty\n[18]: /blogs/news/arctic-ices-american-made-alaskan-beats-the-competition\n[19]: https://arctic-ice.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[20]: https://www.facebook.com/ArcticIcePacks\n[21]: https://www.instagram.com/arcticicepacks/\n[22]: /\n[23]: /products/lunch-box-sample-pack\n[24]: /collections/2-pack-bundles\n[25]: /products/small-sample-pack\n[26]: /products/arctic-ice-bundle-pack\n[27]: /products/arctic-ice-bulk-packs\n[28]: /collections/all\n[29]: /pages/arctic-ice-selector\n[30]: /pages/faqs\n[31]: /blogs/arctic-ice-uses\n[32]: /pages/pack-your-cooler\n[33]: /pages/media\n[34]: /pages/about-us\n[35]: /pages/contact-us\n[36]: /pages/limited-lifetime-warranty\n[37]: /blogs/news/arctic-ices-american-made-alaskan-beats-the-competition\n[38]: https://arctic-ice.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[39]: /cart\n[40]: #ProductInfo-template--16765556031732__main\n[41]: /products/lunch-box-sample-pack\n[42]: /products/lunch-box-sample-pack\n[43]: /search\n[44]: /pages/about-us\n[45]: /pages/faqs\n[46]: /pages/media\n[47]: /pages/contact-us\n[48]: /products/alaskan-series\n[49]: /products/chillin-brew\n[50]: /products/chillin-cradle\n[51]: /products/tundra-series\n[52]: /pages/pack-your-cooler\n[53]: /poli [ Skip to content ][1]\n\n## Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][2]\n\nHave an account?\n\n[Log in][3] to check out faster.\n\n## Your cart\n\nLoading...\n\n##"
