      "company_summary": "Breg, Inc. is a leading provider of innovative orthopedic bracing and support solutions, dedicated to enhancing patient care and recovery across various medical fields. Their extensive product range includes dynamic braces for shoulders, knees, and ankles, as well as devices for DVT prophylaxis and cold therapy, catering to patients recovering from injuries, surgeries, and those with mobility challenges. With a focus on healthcare, orthopedics, and sports medicine, Breg serves a diverse clientele that includes patients, orthopedic providers, and rehabilitation clinics.",
