Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n[Home][141] / [About Us][142] / Breg Digital Press\n\n# Breg Digital Press\n\n][143]\n\n#### [ CMS Announces Expanded Knee Orthosis Coverage Effective January 2026 ][144]\n\nNew Policy Improves Access and Aligns With Clinical Best Practices The Centers for Medicare &\nMedicaid Services (CMS) has issued a significant update to its Knee Local Coverage Determination\n(LCD) policy, effective January\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][145]\nMarch 2, 2026 No Comments\n][146]\n\n#### [ Breg Achieves HITRUST Certification for Breg Vision\u00ae and Vision Clarity\u2122 ][147]\n\nBreg today announced that it has successfully achieved HITRUST certification, underscoring the\ncompany\u2019s commitment to meeting the highest standards of security, privacy, and compliance across\nits digital solutions, including Breg\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][148]\nFebruary 4, 2026 No Comments\n[Patient IQ logo]\n][149]\n\n#### [ Breg and PatientIQ Announce Marketplace Partnership to Enhance Post-Operative Orthopedic Care\n#### Through EHR-Integrated Cold Therapy pathways ][150]\n\nBreg, Inc., a leader in orthopedic bracing and cold therapy solutions, today announced a new\npartnership with PatientIQ, the leading platform for automating patient-reported outcomes (PROs) and\ndigital care pathways\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][151]\nFebruary 2, 2026 No Comments\n][152]\n\n#### [ AAOE Awards Peer Reviewed\u2122 Designation to Breg Vision\u00ae, Setting a New Standard in DMEPOS\n#### Workflow Management ][153]\n\nThe American Alliance of Orthopaedic Executives (AAOE) has awarded its prestigious Peer Reviewed\u2122\ndesignation to Breg Vision\u00ae, reaffirming what many orthopedic practices already know: Breg Vision is\nthe most complete,\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][154]\nDecember 9, 2025 No Comments\n[Steve Ingel headshot]\n][155]\n\n#### [ Breg, Inc. Announces the Promotion of Steve Ingel to President ][156]\n\nCarlsbad, CA \u2013 February 11, 2025 \u2014 Breg, Inc., a leading provider of orthopedic bracing and support\nsolutions, proudly announces that Steve Ingel has been promoted to President, effective immediately.\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][157]\nFebruary 17, 2025 No Comments\n[Dave Mowry headshot]\n][158]\n\n#### [ Breg, Inc. Announces Organizational Leadership Changes ][159]\n\nCARLSBAD, Calif., Sept. 11, 2024 \u2014 Breg, Inc\u00ae, a leading innovation-driven medical device and\nsoftware solutions company, is proud to announce multiple organizational leadership changes.\nEffective immediately, Dave Mowry has\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][160]\nSeptember 11, 2024 No Comments\nPage1 [Page2][161]\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][162]\n[(760) 795-5440][163]\n\n[ Youtube ][164] [ Linkedin ][165]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][166]\n* [Industry Affiliations][167]\n* [Press Room][168]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu