Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n\n# Teams\n\nBe part of a dynamic, inclusive, and purpose-driven community where your skills and passion make a\ndifference!\n\nWe\u2019re looking for team members who want to help us shape the future of sports medicine. Breg is a\nplace where employees provide support at every step to our customers and their patients, and an\nenvironment where our people support each other to thrive and grow in their professional lives.\n\n**Incredible Growth. Incredible Team.**\nWe\u2019re growing rapidly, so there are a lot of opportunities for career advancement and taking on new\nchallenges. We give employees an opportunity to develop their own skills and create more value for\nthemselves, as well as the organization. Breg provides an environment where team members can grow\npersonally and professionally.\n\n**Our Culture**\nThe difference at Breg stems from our company\u2019s cultural beliefs and our strong commitment to\nsetting the highest standards of quality, performance, innovation, and teamwork.\n\n**Administrative**\nAs an administrative professional at Breg, you\u2019ll have the opportunity to work closely with\ncolleagues from across the organization, contributing to the company\u2019s success by providing critical\nsupport and service to our customers and partners.\n\n[ Search Jobs ][141]\n**Breg Impact \u2013 Wholesale**\nBreg Impact is a customized bracing program that combines clinically trained consultants and\nintegrated workflow software to enhance patient care and control healthcare costs. This division\noffers exciting opportunities to work side-by-side with clinicians in sales, account management, and\nbusiness development to help patients get the care and support they need.\n[ Search Jobs ][142]\n**Customer Support & Service**\nBreg\u2019s Customer Care team is a key part of our commitment to providing exceptional care and support\nto customers and patients. Customer Care delivers top-quality service and support, helping patients\nand healthcare providers get the most out of Breg\u2019s products and services. If you\u2019d like to provide\nexcellent customer service, enjoy resolving issues, or thrive on building relationships, Breg\nCustomer Care may be the home for you.\n[ Search Jobs ][143]\n**Healthcare Administration**\nBreg\u2019s team includes healthcare professionals such as Athletic Trainers and Orthotic Fitters who\nplay a critical role in helping patients recover from injuries and surgeries, improve mobility and\nperformance, and live their lives to the fullest.\n[ Search Jobs ][144]\n**Manufacturing & Operations**\nBreg is a leading provider of orthopedic medical devices, and our Manufacturing and Operations teams\nplay a crucial role in ensuring the high quality and timely delivery of our products. Our team\nmembers work collaboratively to design, manufacture, and distribute products that improve the lives\nof patients around the world.\n[ Search Jobs ][145]\n**Marketing**\nOur marketing team is a talented and innovative group that drives the company\u2019s brand and messaging\nacross all channels. Our team members are creative, data-driven, and focused on delivering results.\nWhether you\u2019re passionate about content creation, product marketing, or brand strategy, there are\nexciting opportunities to make a meaningful impact at Breg.\n[ Search Jobs ][146]\n**Sales**\nWhether you\u2019re a seasoned sales professional or just beginning your sales career, there are a\nvariety of opportunities to make a difference at Breg. We\u2019re committed to providing our sales force\nwith the resources and support they need to excel in their roles. If you\u2019re ready to join a team\nthat values innovation and teamwork, we encourage you to explore the Sales jobs available at Breg.\n[ Search Jobs ][147]\n**Sales Operations**\nBreg\u2019s Sales Operations team plays a critical role in ensuring the success of our salesforce. Our\nteam members work closely with sales leaders to provide support and guidance on a variety of\noperational and strategic initiatives, including sales planning, forecasting, performance analysis,\nand process improvement.\n[ Search Jobs ][148]\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][149]\n[(760) 795-5440][150]\n\n[ Youtube ][151] [ Linkedin ][152]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][153]\n* [Industry Affiliations][154]\n* [Press Room][155]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][156]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][157]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][158]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][159]\n* [Industry Affiliations][160]\n* [Press Room][161]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][162]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][163]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][164]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\