Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n\n# Diversity, Equality, & Inclusion\n\n## We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment that celebrates diversity, respects\n## individuality, and promotes equity for all.\n\n# Diversity, Equality, & Inclusion\n\n#### We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment that celebrates diversity, respects\n#### individuality, and promotes equity for all.\n\n## Resources\n\nStriving for racial equality and diversity is about more than words on a page; it is about having\nvital dialogues, learning from each other, and becoming better. We\u2019ve compiled the following\nresources for those interested in sparking those conversations:\n* Watch this TED Talk Playlist: \u201cTalks to help you understand racism in America\u201d\n* Take Harvard\u2019s Implicit Bias Assessment\n* Subscribe to the About Us newsletter produced by The Washington Post, described as \u201cCandid\nconversations about identity in America\u201d\n* Listen to a podcast that challenges your thinking; some recommendations include The Argument from\nThe New York Times, Nice White Parents or Code Switch from NPR or Pod Save the People from Crooked\nMedia\n\n## Consider these tips when having conversations with co-workers:\n* Accept that you may not change the other person\u2019s mind\n* Be open minded and kind\n* Be self-aware\n* Understand that it is OK to disagree with a co-worker\n* Agree to disagree\n* Know when to end the conversation\n\n## Get to Know Us\n\n[ Follow Us on LinkedIn ][141]\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][142]\n[(760) 795-5440][143]\n\n[ Youtube ][144] [ Linkedin ][145]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][146]\n* [Industry Affiliations][147]\n* [Press Room][148]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][149]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][150]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][151]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][152]\n* [Industry Affiliations][153]\n* [Press Room][154]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][155]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][156]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][157]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][158]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][159]\n* [Patient Privacy][160]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][161]\n* [Affiliate Partners][162]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][163]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][164]\n* [Patient Privacy][165]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][166]\n* [Affiliate Partners][167]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][168]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][169]\n* [Shipping Information][170]\n* [Check Order Status][171]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][172]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][173]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][174]\n* [Become a Customer][175]\n* [Make a Payment][176]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][177]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][178]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][179]\n* [Custom Color Chart][180]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][181]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][182]\n* [Shipping Information][183]\n* [Check Order Status][184]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][185]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][186]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][187]\n* [Become a Customer][188]\n* [Make a Payment][189]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][190]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][191]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][192]\n* [Custom Color Chart][193]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\nThe materials on this website are for your general educational information only. Information you\nread on this website cannot replace the relationship that you have with your healthcare\nprofessional. We do not practice medicine or provide medical services or advice as a part of this\nwebsite. You should always talk to your healthcare professional for diagnosis and treatment.\n\n\u00a92025 Breg, Inc. All rights reserved. All trademarks and registered trademarks are owned by the\ncopyright holder.\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][194]\n* [ADA Accessibility][195]\n* [Privacy Policy][196]\n* [Terms of Use][197]\n* [Compliance][198]\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][199]\n* [ADA Accessibility][200]\n* [Privacy Policy][201]\n* [Terms of Use][202]\n* [Compliance][203]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.breg.com\n[3]: https://www.breg.com/\n[4]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/executive-profiles/\n[7]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/breg-affiliate-partners/\n[8]: https://www.breg.com/breg-international/\n[9]: https://www.breg.com/products/\n[10]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/\n[11]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/functional-ligament/\n[12]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/adjustable-rom/\n[13]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/functional-oa