Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n[Home][141] / [About Us][142] / California Compliance Declaration\n\n# California Compliance Declaration\n\n## California Compliance Program Law Declaration for Breg, Inc.\n\nBreg, Inc. (\u201cBreg\u201d) is dedicated to fostering a culture of and conducting itself in compliance with\nthe ethical, legal and regulatory standards that govern its operations and relationships with\nhealthcare professionals, employees, customers, vendors, government and other third-party payors.\nWith the full support and commitment of senior management and the companys governing body, Breg has\nestablished and maintains a Comprehensive Compliance & Ethics Program (\u201cProgram\u201d) that incorporates\nthe seven elements of an effective compliance program in accordance with the Compliance Program\nGuidance published by the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services Office of Inspector General\n(\u201cOIG\u201d) and the Advanced Medical Technology Association (\u201cAdvaMed\u201d) Code on Interactions with\nHealthcare Professionals.\n\nBreg\u2019s Program, as outlined in the Breg Corporate Code of Conduct and Ethics, includes a designated\nCompliance Officer and a Compliance Committee, a comprehensive set of written policies and\nprocedures including policies addressing the OIG Guidance and the AdvaMed Code and limits on gifts\nand incentives to health professionals, extensive training and education, and a process for audits\nand on-going monitoring of adherence to compliance policies. The Program is designed to prevent,\ndetect and remediate violations of law, regulations and company policies, as well as to promote an\nethical culture. In the event that Breg becomes aware of any potential or actual violations of\npolicy or law, an investigation will be triggered and, if necessary, will be followed by appropriate\nremedial or corrective actions. In order to encourage open lines of communication regarding\npotential violations, Breg has established a toll-free, anonymous compliance hotline 844-474-BREG\n(844-474-2734) and online reporting website [www.intouchwebsite.com/breg][143] for individuals who\nwish to report a potential compliance concern.\n\nAs described herein, Breg has established, adopted and is actively implementing its Comprehensive\nCompliance & Ethics Program. Breg hereby declares that, to the best of its knowledge, it is in\ncompliance with the California statutory requirements of the requirements of California Health and\nSafety Code Section \u00a7119402. Any questions regarding Breg\u2019s Comprehensive Compliance & Ethics\nProgram may be directed to:\n\nEmail: [compliance@breg.com][144]\n\nMail to: Breg, Inc., Attn: Compliance Officer\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Suite 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\nBreg\u2019s Anonymous Compliance Hotline:\n844-474-2734 (BREG) (English/Spanish)\n01 800 681 5340 (Mexico Only)\n\n[Poster (PDF)][145]\n\nBreg\u2019s Anonymous Reporting Website: [www.intouchwebsite.com/breg][146]\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][147]\n[(760) 795-5440][148]\n\n[ Youtube ][149] [ Linkedin ][150]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][151]\n* [Industry Affiliations][152]\n* [Press Room][153]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][154]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][155]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][156]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][157]\n* [Industry Affiliations][158]\n* [Press Room][159]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][160]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][161]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][162]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][163]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][164]\n* [Patient Privacy][165]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][166]\n* [Affiliate Partners][167]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][168]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][169]\n* [Patient Privacy][170]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][171]\n* [Affiliate Partners][172]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][173]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][174]\n* [Shipping Information][175]\n* [Check Order Status][176]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][177]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][178]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][179]\n* [Become a Customer][180]\n* [Make a Payment][181]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][182]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][183]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][184]\n* [Custom Color Chart][185]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][186]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][187]\n* [Shipping Information][188]\n* [Check Order Status][189]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][190]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][191]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][192]\n* [Become a Customer][193]\n* [Make a Payment][194]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][195]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][196]\n* [Eur