Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n[Home][141] / [About Us][142] / Breg Leadership\n\n# Breg Leadership\n\n[ [Dave Mowry headshot] ][143]\n\n## Dave Mowry\n\nExecutive Chairman and Chief Executive Officer\n\n[ [Steve Ingel headshot] ][144]\n\n## Steve Ingel\n\nPresident\n\n[ [Matt Simon headshot] ][145]\n\n## Matt Simons\n\nChief Financial Officer\n\n[ [Ashley Chandler headshot] ][146]\n\n## Ashley Chandler\n## PHR, SHRM-CP\n\nChief Human Resource Officer\n\n[ [Paula Richmond headshot] ][147]\n\n## Paula Richmond\n\nGeneral Counsel, Secretary & Compliance Officer\n\n[ [Steve Romeo headshot] ][148]\n\n## Steve Romeo\n\nChief Information & Commercial Software Officer\n\n[ [Srinivas Pinapati headshot] ][149]\n\n## Srinivas Pinapati\n\nSenior Vice President, Global Supply Chain & Operational Excellence\n\n[ [Jeff Culhane headshot] ][150]\n\n## Jeff Culhane\n\nSenior Vice President, Engineering\n\n## Kevin H. Adams\n\nSenior Vice President, Global Operations\n\n## Breg Board of Directors\n\nOur Board of Directors brings unparalleled expertise and leadership to Breg. Comprised of industry\nveterans, our board members play a crucial role in guiding our strategic direction and ensuring we\nuphold our commitment to innovation and excellence. Their insights and governance help steer Breg\ntowards continued success and growth.\n\n[ [Dave Mowry headshot] ][151]\n\n## Dave Mowry\n\nExecutive Chairman and Chief Executive Officer\n\n[ [Wilson Constantine headshot] ][152]\n\n## Wilson Constantine\n\nDirector\n\n[ [Mayu Sris headshot] ][153]\n\n## Mayu Sris\n\nDirector\n\n[ [Vickie Capps headshot] ][154]\n\n## Vickie Capps\n\nDirector & Audit Committee Chair\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][155]\n[(760) 795-5440][156]\n\n[ Youtube ][157] [ Linkedin ][158]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][159]\n* [Industry Affiliations][160]\n* [Press Room][161]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][162]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][163]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][164]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][165]\n* [Industry Affiliations][166]\n* [Press Room][167]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][168]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][169]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][170]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][171]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][172]\n* [Patient Privacy][173]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][174]\n* [Affiliate Partners][175]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][176]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][177]\n* [Patient Privacy][178]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][179]\n* [Affiliate Partners][180]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][181]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][182]\n* [Shipping Information][183]\n* [Check Order Status][184]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][185]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][186]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][187]\n* [Become a Customer][188]\n* [Make a Payment][189]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][190]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][191]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][192]\n* [Custom Color Chart][193]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][194]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][195]\n* [Shipping Information][196]\n* [Check Order Status][197]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][198]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][199]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][200]\n* [Become a Customer][201]\n* [Make a Payment][202]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][203]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][204]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][205]\n* [Custom Color Chart][206]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\nThe materials on this website are for your general educational information only. Information you\nread on this website cannot replace the relationship that you have with your healthcare\nprofessional. We do not practice medicine or provide medical services or advice as a part of this\nwebsite. You should always talk to your healthcare professional for diagnosis and treatment.\n\n\u00a92025 Breg, Inc. All rights reserved. All trademarks and registered trademarks are owned by the\ncopyright holder.\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][207]\n* [ADA Accessibility][208]\n* [Privacy Policy][209]\n* [Terms of Use][210]\n* [Compliance][211]\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][212]\n* [ADA Accessibility][213]\n* [Privacy Policy][214]\n* [Terms of Use][215]\n* [Compliance][216]\n\n## Dave Mowry\n\n**Executive Chairman and Chief Executive Officer**\n\nDave Mowry, Breg\u2019s Executive Chairperson, stepped in as interim CEO in May 2024. Dave is an\nexecutive with extensive medical device company leadership experience having led publicly traded and\nprivate equity-owned businesses across several market segments. Dave has specific expertise in the\northopedic industry, running Tornier, Inc. (now part of Stryker), a leading extremities business, as\nPresident and CEO prior to its acquisition.\n\nDave is excited about Breg and its future. He is committed to working with the management team to\nidentify and make critical investments that will deliver near-term improvements, drive continued\nmarket share growth, and build the business into a market leader. Dave\u2019s orthopedic experience will\nserve Breg well as we work closely with our distribution partners, customers, and their patients to\nprovide best-in-class products through value-added services.\n\nDave and his wife reside in Orange County, a short commute into the Breg offices in Carlsbad,\nCalifornia. He has two daughters and three grandchildren and considers himself an avid sports fan.\n\n## Steve Ingel\n\n**President**\n\nSteve Ingel is a highly accomplished executive with more than thirty-five years of experience in the\northopedic device industry. As President of Breg, Steve oversees the company\u2019s total revenue and\nleads all commercial functions, including marketing, domestic and international sales, national\naccounts, impact solutions, billing, and customer care.\n\nPrior to joining Breg, Steve owned a Southern California-based medical distribution business; he\nserved as Western Regional Sales Manager at Professional Care Products (ProCare); and he joined\nDJO\u2014then Smith & Nephew DonJoy, now Enovis\u2014after acquisition of ProCare. He spent more than\ntwenty-eight years in C-suite roles for DJO leading multiple divisions and playing a key role in\ndeveloping and launching many successful products. He also served as the CEO of Precision Medical.\n\nSteve is the son of a medical sales professional, so he effectively grew up in the industry. He and\nhis wife Tracy, are longtime residents of Carlsbad, Calif. They are the proud parents of three grown\nchildren: Ashley, Tyler, and Michael. Steve fondly refers to his family as his \u201cfoundation.\u201d\n\n## Matt Simons\n\n**Chief Financial Officer**\n\nMatt Simons is an experienced senior financial executive with over 25 years of strategic financial\nleadership experience, having driven rapid growth and transformation across multiple industries. He\nleads Breg\u2019s finance initiatives, business development efforts, and accounting and finance teams.\n\nPrior to joining Breg, Matt spent more than 13 years with DJO Global, he also served as the CFO at\nCubex, a global leader in automated medication dispensing for medical, veterinary and dental\npractices and CEO of Assault Fitness, a leading fitness equipment brand, located in Carlsbad\nCalifornia.\n\nMatt is an avid philanthropist and amateur athlete. Together with colleagues, Matt helped raise over\n$250,000 for the Leukemia Society thru their Team in Training program. In 2016, he also raised over\n$50,000 for Challenged Athlete Foundation (CAF) and competed in and finished the Ironman World\nChampionships in Kona Hawaii. He also competed his second Boston Marathon in 2022.\n\nHe served 11 years as the Chairman of the City of Carlsbad\u2019s Parks and Recreation Commission and was\nan Advisory Board Member of San Diego Sports Innovators (SDSI). Matt earned his Accounting degree\nfrom the University of San Diego and is a former CPA.\n\nMatt lives in Carlsbad, California, with his wife, Dawn, and two children.\n\n## Ashley Chandler \u2013 PHR, SHRM-CP\n\n**Chief Human Resource Officer**\n\nAshley brings more than 10 years of experience cultivating robust corporate cultures and serving in\na variety of key Human Resources and training roles.\n\nAshley graduated with her B.B.A. in Organizational Behavior and Human Resources Management from the\nUniversity of North Texas. Her degree includes International Management and Business Policy, which\nshe earned in a European Study Abroad program. Ashley is a Professional in Human Resources, PHR;\ncertified trainer in Situational Leadership;, master trainer for Culture Partners Culture of\nAccountability framework; and is also certified in Predictive Index.\n\nOn a personal level, she is a committed dog mom of a spunky Yorkie named King, and in her free time,\nshe enjoys traveling and entertaining family and friends.\n\n## Paula Richmond\n\n**General Counsel, Secretary & Compliance Officer**\n\nPaula joined Breg in 2014 and has an extensive background in compliance and legal affairs in the\nmedical industry. Some of her main duties include ensuring Breg adheres to all industry regulations\nand policies as well as managin"
          },
