Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n\n# Careers At Breg\n\n## Make a meaningful impact by helping to provide solutions that improve patients\u2019 quality of life.\n\n# Careers At Breg\n\n#### Make a meaningful impact by helping to provide solutions that improve patients\u2019 quality of\n#### life.\n\n[ Life at Breg Video ][141]\n\n### Teams\n\nWe\u2019re looking for team members who want to help us shape the future of sports medicine. Breg is a\nplace where employees provide support at every step to our customers and their patients, and an\nenvironment where our people support each other to thrive and grow in their professional lives.\n\n[ Find your perfect fit ][142]\n\n### Benefits\n\nWe offer competitive compensation, health benefits and flexible PTO plans that allow you to manage\nyour work/life balance \u2013 which our employees greatly appreciate.\n\n[ What we can offer you ][143]\n\n### Diversity\n\nA main strength of Breg\u2019s employee culture comes from its diversity. We welcome people of all\nbackgrounds and passions, and we place a high value on the unique and wide-ranging perspectives that\nmake up Breg.\n\n[ Find your perfect fit ][144]\n\n## Find Your Future at Breg\n\n### Supervisor, Health Information Management\n\n**Elmhurst, IL**\nYou are a forward-thinking professional who values collaboration, innovation, and making a\nmeaningful difference. You bring expertise in your ability to demonstrate ownership and\naccountability; the ability to plan, execute, control and deliver; communicate effectively both\nwritten and verbal.\nLearn More\n][145]\n\n#### Patient Access Representative/Medical Biller\n\n**Staten Island, NY**\nYou are a forward-thinking professional who values collaboration, innovation, and making a\nmeaningful difference. You bring expertise in communicating effectively both written and verbally\nand are eager to contribute to a team that is committed to delivering exceptional patient outcomes.\nLearn More\n][146]\n\n### Sr Continuous Improvement Quality Engineer\n\n**Mexicali, MX**\nYou are a results-driven professional with a passion for continuous improvement, operational\nexcellence, and quality. You enjoy analyzing processes, identifying inefficiencies, and leading\ninitiatives that drive measurable impact. You thrive in fast-paced manufacturing environments where\ncollaboration, data-driven decisions, and problem-solving are key.\nLearn More\n][147]\n[ See Full List of Openings ][148]\n\n## Life at Breg\n\n#### Breg Wins NBRI Circle of Excellence for Six Years in a Row!\n\n#### Breg Recognized as \u201cBest Places to Work\u201d company by Business Intelligence Group.\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][149]\n[(760) 795-5440][150]\n\n[ Youtube ][151] [ Linkedin ][152]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][153]\n* [Industry Affiliations][154]\n* [Press Room][155]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][156]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][157]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][158]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][159]\n* [Industry Affiliations][160]\n* [Press Room][161]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][162]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][163]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][164]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][165]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][166]\n* [Patient Privacy][167]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][168]\n* [Affiliate Partners][169]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][170]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][171]\n* [Patient Privacy][172]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][173]\n* [Affiliate Partners][174]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][175]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][176]\n* [Shipping Information][177]\n* [Check Order Status][178]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][179]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][180]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][181]\n* [Become a Customer][182]\n* [Make a Payment][183]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][184]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][185]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][186]\n* [Custom Color Chart][187]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][188]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][189]\n* [Shipping Information][190]\n* [Check Order Status][191]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][192]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][193]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][194]\n* [Become a Customer][195]\n* [Make a Payment][196]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][197]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][198]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][199]\n* [Custom Color Chart][200]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\nThe materials on this website are for your general educational information only. Information you\nread on this website cannot replace the relationship that you have with your healthcare\nprofessional. We do not practice medicine or provide medical services or advice as a part of this\nwebsite. You should always talk to your healthcare professional for diagnosis and treatment.\n\n\u00a92025 Breg, Inc. All rights reserved. All trademarks and registered trademarks are owned by the\ncopyright holder.\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][201]\n* [ADA Accessibility][202]\n* [Privacy Policy][203]\n* [Terms of Use][204]\n* [Compliance][205]\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][206]\n* [ADA Accessibility][207]\n* [Privacy Policy][208]\n* [Terms of Use][209]\n* [Compliance][210]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.breg.com\n[3]: https://www.breg.com/\n[4]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/executive-profiles/\n[7]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/breg-affiliate-partners/\n[8]: https://www.breg.com/breg-international/\n[9]: https://www.breg.com/products/\n[10]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/\n[11]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/functional-ligament/\n[12]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/adjustable-rom/\n[13]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/functional-oa/\n[14]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/patellofemoral/\n[15]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/post-op/\n[16]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/soft-supports/\n[17]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/\n[18]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/devices/\n[19]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/gel-accessories/\n[20]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/pads/\n[21]: https://www.breg.com/products/dvt-prophylaxis/\n[22]: https://www.breg.com/products/hip-bracing/\n[23]: https://www.breg.com/products/hip-bracing/hip-bracing-post-op/\n[24]: https://www.breg.com/products/shoulder-bracing/\n[25]: https://www.breg.com/products/shoulder-bracing/slings-braces/\n[26]: https://www.breg.com/products/shoulder-bracing/immobilizers-stabilizers/\n[27]: https://www.breg.com/products/elbow-wrist-bracing/fracture-bracing/\n[28]: https://www.breg.com/products/elbow-wrist-bracing/\n[29]: https://www.breg.com/products/elbow-wrist-bracing/elbow/\n[30]: https://www.breg.com/products/elbow-wrist-bracing/wrist/\n[31]: https://www.breg.com/products/spine-bracing/\n[32]: https://www.breg.com/products/spine-bracing/lower-spine/\n[33]: https://www.breg.com/products/spine-bracing/upper-spine/\n[34]: https://www.breg.com/products/spine-bracing/\n[35]: https://www.breg.com/products/foot-ankle-bracing/\n[36]: https://www.breg.com/products/foot-ankle-bracing/ankle/\n[37]: https://www.breg.com/products/foot-ankle-bracing/calf/\n[38]: https://www.breg.com/products/foot-ankle-bracing/foot/\n[39]: https://www.breg.com/products/foot-ankle-bracing/walker-boots/\n[40]: https://www.breg.com/products/patient-care/\n[41]: https://www.breg.com/products/patient-care/canes/\n[42]: https://www.breg.com/products/patient-care/crutches/\n[43]: https://www.breg.com/products/patient-care/walkers/\n[44]: https://www.breg.com/products/home-therapy-kits/\n[45]: https://www.breg.com/products/home-therapy-kits/home-therapy-kits-ankle/\n[46]: https://www.breg.com/products/home-therapy-kits/home-therapy-kits-knee/\n[47]: https://www.breg.com/products/home-therapy-kits/home-therapy-kits-shoulder/\n[48]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/\n[49]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/collar/\n[50]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/elbow-pediatric/\n[51]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/foot-pediatric/\n[52]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/hip/\n[53]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/knee/\n[54]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/miscellaneous/\n[55]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/shoulder/\n[56]: https://www.breg.com/products/pediatric/wrist-pediatric/\n[57]: /customer-care/pdac-sadmerc-letters/\n[58]: https://www.breg.com/patients/\n[59]: https://www.breg.com/patients/\n[60]: https://www.breg.com/psc/\n[61]: https://www.breg.com/providers/\n[62]: https://www.breg.com/providers/\n[63]: https://www.breg.com/impact/\n[64]: https://www.breg.com/impact/vision-clarity/\n[65]: https://www.breg.com/capture/\n[66]: https://www.breginvoiceportal.com/\n[67]: https://www.breg.com/profit/\n[68]: https://www.breg.com/customer-care/new-customer/\n[69]: https://www.breg.com/providers/rep-finder/\n[70]: /product-catalog\n[71]: https://store.breg.com/\n[72]: https://www.breg.com/\n[73]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[74]: htt"
