Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n\n# About Breg\n\n#### We partner with the orthopedic community to deliver innovative products, advanced technologies,\n#### expert consulting, and efficient services all focused on lowering the cost of care while\n#### enhancing outcomes.\n\n#### \u201cBreg Impact^{\u00ae} is a combination of both technology and support behind the scenes that allows\n#### us to be able to confidently provide service to our patients in our EDs, in our urgent cares,\n#### in our inpatient rehab locations, and in orthopedic clinic locations.\u201d\n\n\u2013 Robin Ducey, Director of Integrated DME Services, Providence, Portland, OR\n\n## Driving What\u2019s Next in Orthopedic Care\n\nFounded in 1989, Breg began as a sports medicine company focused on high-quality bracing and cold\ntherapy. Today, we are a trusted partner to over 9,700 clinics, 38,000 orthopedic providers, and\n300+ Integrated Delivery Networks, serving almost two million patients annually. Headquartered in\nCarlsbad, California, with approximately 1,500 employees across the U.S. and Mexico, Breg\u2019s products\nare distributed through a global network spanning 59 countries.\nDriven by our philosophy to **Keep Moving Forward\u00ae,** Breg has evolved into a total solutions\nprovider for orthopedic care \u2013 integrating bracing, cold therapy, consulting, and technology to\nsupport better patient outcomes. Our comprehensive approach helps healthcare professionals deliver\nmore effective and efficient care.\nWith ongoing investment in innovation and a deep commitment to customer success, we continue to lead\nthe industry in delivering personalized solutions that move healthcare and people forward.\n\n## Our Culture\n\nAt Breg, we believe that exceptional outcomes start with a strong culture. What sets us apart is our\nunwavering commitment to quality, performance, and collaboration. We champion fresh thinking and\nbold ideas, working as one team to deliver meaningful solutions. By combining innovation with\nteamwork, we empower our people to deliver the highest level of service and value to our customers.\n\nEmployees\nProviders\nCountries\nFounded\n\n## Cultural Beliefs\n\n[Think Big icon shows a person with a light bulb indicating having big ideas]\n\n### Think Big\n\nI commit and contribute to making Breg THE market leader.\n\n[Excellence icon depicts a star and ribbon award]\n\n### Excellence\n\nI challenge the status quo to create world-class processes and deliver continuous improvement.\n\n[Team icon with Breg logo shows 5 pieces completing a circle]\n\n### One Team\n\nI build trust by collaboratively setting goals and owning results.\n\n[Icon of two thought balloons converging]\n\n### Dare to Share\n\nI seek and offer authentic and actionable feedback in a professional manner.\n\n## Life at Breg\n\n## Sustainability at Breg\n\nAt Breg, we are committed to integrating sustainability into our operations, facilities, and\npartnerships. We continue to make meaningful progress across environmental responsibility while\nsupporting the healthcare communities we serve.\n\nReducing Environmental Impact\n\nWe have significantly reduced paper use through the implementation of electronic Quality Management\nSystems and digital billing. These efforts streamline operations, improve efficiency, and reduce\noverall resource consumption.\n\nResponsible Materials & Product Initiatives\n\nWe are actively working to reduce plastics in our product ecosystem, including initiatives such as\nthe plastic-reduction program for Polar Care\u00ae cooler packaging, launched in 2025. These efforts help\nminimize material waste while maintaining the performance and reliability our customers expect.\n\nEnergy Efficiency\n\nEnergy efficiency remains a priority across our global footprint. Investments at manufacturing\nlocations include solar panel installations and full LED lighting conversions designed to reduce\nenergy consumption and environmental impact.\n\nSustainable Logistics\n\nBreg partners with logistics providers that participate in the EPA SmartWay\u00ae program, which measures\nemissions and promotes cleaner transportation practices such as fuel efficiency improvements and\nreduced truck idling. By 2026, we expect nearly 90% of our freight spend to be aligned with SmartWay\npartners.\n\nSmarter Packaging & Shipping\n\nOur pack-size optimization initiative customizes shipping box sizes to reduce material use, lower\nshipping volume, and improve transportation efficiency.\n\nCommunity & Environmental Partnerships\n\nBeyond our own operations, Breg supports recognized environmental organizations such as the World\nWildlife Fund and contributes product donations through qualified 501(c)(3) organizations to help\nextend care and support where it\u2019s needed most.\n\n## News From Breg\n\n[ Follow Us on LinkedIn ][141]\n\n## Join Breg\n\nAt Breg, we commit to a clear set of cultural beliefs that unite us and help us all align to obtain\nour key results. We commit to making Breg THE market leader: we challenge the status quo to create\nworld-class processes and deliver continuous improvement; we build trust by collaborating to set\ngoals and own results; and we exchange authentic and actionable feedback in a professional manner.\n\n### Incredible Growth.\n### Incredible Team.\n\nWe\u2019re growing rapidly, so there are a lot of opportunities for career advancement and tackling new\nchallenges. We give employees an opportunity to develop their own skills and create more value for\nthemselves, as well as the organization. Breg provides an environment where team members can grow\npersonally and professionally.\n\n[ More About Careers ][142]\n\n### Supervisor, Health Information Management\n\n**Elmhurst, IL**\nYou are a forward-thinking professional who values collaboration, innovation, and making a\nmeaningful difference. You bring expertise in your ability to demonstrate ownership and\naccountability; the ability to plan, execute, control and deliver; communicate effectively both\nwritten and verbal.\nLearn More\n][143]\n\n#### Patient Access Representative/Medical Biller\n\n**Staten Island, NY**\nYou are a forward-thinking professional who values collaboration, innovation, and making a\nmeaningful difference. You bring expertise in communicating effectively both written and verbally\nand are eager to contribute to a team that is committed to delivering exceptional patient outcomes.\nLearn More\n][144]\n\n### Sr Continuous Improvement Quality Engineer\n\n**Mexicali, MX**\nYou are a results-driven professional with a passion for continuous improvement, operational\nexcellence, and quality. You enjoy analyzing processes, identifying inefficiencies, and leading\ninitiatives that drive measurable impact. You thrive in fast-paced manufacturing environments where\ncollaboration, data-driven decisions, and problem-solving are key.\nLearn More\n][145]\n[ See Full List of Openings ][146]\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][147]\n[(760) 795-5440][148]\n\n[ Youtube ][149] [ Linkedin ][150]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][151]\n* [Industry Affiliations][152]\n* [Press Room][153]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][154]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][155]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][156]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][157]\n* [Industry Affiliations][158]\n* [Press Room][159]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][160]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][161]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][162]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][163]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][164]\n* [Patient Privacy][165]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][166]\n* [Affiliate Partners][167]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][168]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][169]\n* [Patient Privacy][170]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][171]\n* [Affiliate Partners][172]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][173]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][174]\n* [Shipping Information][175]\n* [Check Order Status][176]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][177]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][178]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][179]\n* [Become a Customer][180]\n* [Make a Payment][181]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][182]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][183]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][184]\n* [Custom Color Chart][185]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][186]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][187]\n* [Shipping Information][188]\n* [Check Order Status][189]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][190]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][191]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][192]\n* [Become a Customer][193]\n* [Make a Payment][194]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][195]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][196]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][197]\n* [Custom Color Chart][198]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\nThe materials on this website are for your general educational information only. Information you\nread on this website cannot replace the relationship that you have with your healthcare\nprofessional. We do not practice medicine or provide medical services or advice as a part of this\nwebsite. You should always talk to your healthcare professional for diagnosis and treatment.\n\n\u00a92025 Breg"
