Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n[Home][141] / [Products][142] / [Elbow Wrist Bracing][143] / [Wrist][144] / Low Profile Wrist\nSupport Brace\n\n# Low Profile Wrist Support Brace\n\nSizes: xs, s, m, l, xl\n\nLow Profile Wrist Supports are constructed of a premium perforated material. Its single-pull lace\nclosure and adjustable thumb strap enhance ease of application and patient fit. Both wrist supports\ncontain a malleable palmer stay for stabilization and soft flannel lining for comfort.\n\n### Common Examples of Use\n* Sprains and strains\n* Scaphoid injuries\n* Carpal tunnel syndrome\n* De Quervain\u2019s syndrome\n\n### Product Features\n* Promotes wrist stabilization without limiting thumb rotation, and dorsal stays provide additional\nsupport\n* Malleable palmar stay properly positions the wrist\n* Deluxe perforated material with flannel lining for added patient comfort\n* Lacing hook and loop closure for easy application\n* Unique stockinette liner provides comfort\n* Available in 7\u2033 and 9\u2033 length\n\n[[Low Profile Wrist Support Brace]][145][][146]\n\n[Printer-Friendly PDF][147]\n\nLoading...\n* [ Instructions for Use ][148]\n* [ Part Numbers ][149]\n* [ Product Sizing Chart ][150]\n\n## Instructions for Use\n\n[Instructions for Use][151]\n\n## Part Numbers\n\n### Part Numbers\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPart #\u2502Description\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1055X \u2502Low Profile Wrist Support 7\u2033, Right\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1054X \u2502Low Profile Wrist Support 7\u2033, Left\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1057X \u2502Low Profile Wrist Support 9\u2033, Right\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1056X \u2502Low Profile Wrist Support 9\u2033, Left\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Sizing Chart\n\n[Low Profile Wrist Support Sizing Chart]\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Related products\n* [[Apollo Universal Wrist Brace]\n\n## Apollo^{\u00ae} Universal Wrist Brace\n\n][152]\n* [[The Volley Tennis Elbow Strap]\n\n## The Volley Tennis Elbow Strap\n\n][153]\n* [[Universal Wrist Splint]\n\n## Universal Wrist Splint\n\n][154]\n* [[Wrist Lacer Wrist Brace]\n\n## Wrist Lacer Wrist Brace\n\n][155]\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][156]\n[(760) 795-5440][157]\n\n[ Youtube ][158] [ Linkedin ][159]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][160]\n* [Industry Affiliations][161]\n* [Press Room][162]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][163]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][164]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][165]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][166]\n* [Industry Affiliations][167]\n* [Press Room][168]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][169]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][170]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][171]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][172]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][173]\n* [Patient Privacy][174]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][175]\n* [Affiliate Partners][176]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][177]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][178]\n* [Patient Privacy][179]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][180]\n* [Affiliate Partners][181]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][182]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][183]\n* [Shipping Information][184]\n* [Check Order Status][185]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][186]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][187]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][188]\n* [Become a Customer][189]\n* [Make a Payment][190]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List]