Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n[Home][141] / [Products][142] / [Elbow Wrist Bracing][143] / [Wrist][144] / Premier Thumb Splint\nwith Stays\n\n# Premier Thumb Splint with Stays\n\nSizes: universal\n\nThe Premier Thumb Splint with Stays is a versatile thumb splint made of perforated Neoprene. It\nfeatures pockets on the radial, palmar and dorsal sides of the thumb and contains a malleable\naluminum stay, a spiral stay and a rigid stay. These can be mixed and matched for desired\ndirectional support. The brace has a wraparound design making for an easy one-hand application.\n\n### Common Examples of Use\n* Scaphoid injuries\n* Carpal tunnel syndrome\n* Gamekeeper\u2019s Thumb\n* De Quervain\u2019s syndrome\n* Thumb arthiritis and tendonitis\n\n### Product Features\n* Interchangable flexible and rigid stays help provide the desired support and comfort\n* Universal design fits either left or right\n* 1/8\u2033 perforated neoprene wrap style is easy to apply\n* Latex free\n\n[[Premier Thumb Splint with Stays]][145][][146]\n\n[Printer-Friendly PDF][147]\n\nLoading...\n* [ Instructions for Use ][148]\n* [ Part Numbers ][149]\n\n## Instructions for Use\n\n[Instructions for Use][150]\n\n## Part Numbers\n\n### Part Numbers\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPart #\u2502Description\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n10201 \u2502Premier Thumb Splint with Stays Universal\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Related products\n* [[Apollo Universal Wrist Brace]\n\n## Apollo^{\u00ae} Universal Wrist Brace\n\n][151]\n* [[Apollo Universal Wrist Brace with Thumb Spica]\n\n## Apollo^{\u00ae} Universal Wrist Brace with Thumb Spica\n\n][152]\n* [[T-Chek Elbow Brace]\n\n## T-Chek Elbow Brace\n\n][153]\n* [[Wee Bow Post-Op]\n\n## Wee Bow Post-Op\n\n][154]\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][155]\n[(760) 795-5440][156]\n\n[ Youtube ][157] [ Linkedin ][158]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][159]\n* [Industry Affiliations][160]\n* [Press Room][161]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][162]\n* [Purchasing Term