Hip Bracing][91]\n* [Post Op][92]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][93]\n* [Slings and Braces][94]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][95]\n* [Fracture Bracing][96]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow][98]\n* [Wrist][99]\n* [Spine Bracing][100]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][101]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][102]\n* [All Spine Bracing][103]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][104]\n* [Ankle][105]\n* [Calf][106]\n* [Foot][107]\n* [Walker Boots][108]\n* [Patient Care][109]\n* [Canes][110]\n* [Crutches][111]\n* [Walkers][112]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][113]\n* [Ankle][114]\n* [Knee][115]\n* [Shoulder][116]\n* [Pediatric][117]\n* [Collar][118]\n* [Elbow][119]\n* [Foot][120]\n* [Hip][121]\n* [Knee][122]\n* [Miscellaneous][123]\n* [Shoulder][124]\n* [Wrist][125]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][126]\n* [Patients][127]\n* [Patient Overview][128]\n* [Patient Service Centers][129]\n* [Providers][130]\n* [Provider Overview][131]\n* [Impact Solutions][132]\n* [Vision with Clarity][133]\n* [Capture][134]\n* [BregPay][135]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][136]\n* [Become a Customer][137]\n* [Find Your US Rep][138]\n* [Download Product Catalog][139]\n* [Store][140]\nSearch\n[Home][141] / [Products][142] / [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][143] / [Walker\nBoots][144] / Achilles Wedges\n\n# Achilles Wedges\n\nSizes: s, m, l\n\nBreg\u2019s Achilles Wedge is designed to comfortably place the foot in plantar flexion to offload the\nAchilles tendon during rehab. The Achilles Wedge provides customized height adjustments and is\navailable for all walkers except ROM walkers, Vectra Lite (unless a Heel Clip is used with the\nVectra Lite) and the Integrity Walkers.\n\n### Common Examples of Use\n* Achilles tendon rehabilitation\n\n### Product Features\n* Distinctive design disperses body weight evenly across the foot, eliminating pressure points\n* Polypropylene wedge material provides rigid support that does not compress like other wedges made\nof foam or rubber\n* Comfort pad places the foot at ease and on a soft surface during use\n* Comes with a forefoot and ankle extension strap to fit various sizes of walking boots\n\n### Sizing Information\n* The Achilles Wedges \u201csmall\u201d fits an extra small and small Vectra walking boot and small Full Shell\nwalking boot\n* The Achilles Wedges \u201cmedium\u201d fits a medium and large Vectra walking boot and medium Full Shell\nwalking boot\n* The Achilles Wedges \u201clarge\u201d fits a large Full Shell walking boot and extra large Vectra walking\nboot\n\n[[Achilles Wedges]][145][][146]\n[][147][[Achilles Wedges]][148]\n[][149][[Achilles Wedges]][150]\n[][151][[Achilles Wedges]][152]\n[][153][[Achilles Wedges]][154]\n[][155][[Achilles Wedges]][156]\n[Achilles Wedges]\n[Achilles Wedges]\n[Achilles Wedges]\n[Achilles Wedges]\n[Achilles Wedges]\n[Achilles Wedges]\n\n[Printer-Friendly PDF][157]\n\nLoading...\n* [ Instructions for Use ][158]\n* [ Part Numbers ][159]\n* [ Product Sizing Chart ][160]\n\n## Instructions for Use\n\n[Instructions for Use][161]\n\n## Part Numbers\n\n### Part Numbers\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPart #\u2502Description\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n00092 \u2502Achilles Wedges Small\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n00093 \u2502Achilles Wedges Medium\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n00094 \u2502Achilles Wedges Large\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\