82]\n* [Functional OA][83]\n* [Patellofemoral][84]\n* [Post Op][85]\n* [Soft Supports][86]\n* [Cold Therapy][87]\n* [Devices][88]\n* [Gel Accessories][89]\n* [Pads][90]\n* [DVT Prophylaxis][91]\n* [Hip Bracing][92]\n* [Post Op][93]\n* [Shoulder Bracing][94]\n* [Slings and Braces][95]\n* [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][96]\n* [Fracture Bracing][97]\n* [Elbow Wrist Bracing][98]\n* [Elbow][99]\n* [Wrist][100]\n* [Spine Bracing][101]\n* [Featured Lower Spine][102]\n* [Featured Upper Spine][103]\n* [All Spine Bracing][104]\n* [Walking Boots, Foot & Ankle Bracing][105]\n* [Ankle][106]\n* [Calf][107]\n* [Foot][108]\n* [Walker Boots][109]\n* [Patient Care][110]\n* [Canes][111]\n* [Crutches][112]\n* [Walkers][113]\n* [Home Therapy Kits][114]\n* [Ankle][115]\n* [Knee][116]\n* [Shoulder][117]\n* [Pediatric][118]\n* [Collar][119]\n* [Elbow][120]\n* [Foot][121]\n* [Hip][122]\n* [Knee][123]\n* [Miscellaneous][124]\n* [Shoulder][125]\n* [Wrist][126]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][127]\n* [Patients][128]\n* [Patient Overview][129]\n* [Patient Service Centers][130]\n* [Providers][131]\n* [Provider Overview][132]\n* [Impact Solutions][133]\n* [Vision with Clarity][134]\n* [Capture][135]\n* [BregPay][136]\n* [Breg ProFit\u2122][137]\n* [Become a Customer][138]\n* [Find Your US Rep][139]\n* [Download Product Catalog][140]\n* [Store][141]\nSearch\n[Home][142] / [Products][143] / [Spine Bracing][144] / [Lumbar][145] / Back Support with Pocket\n\n# Back Support with Pocket\n\nSizes: xs, s, m, l, xl, xxl, xxxl\n\nThe Back Support with Pocket provide compression for lumbar stabilization. The durable construction\nprovides double-pull side panels for added support.\n\n### Common Examples of Use\n* Low back pain\n* Low back sprains/strains\n\n### Product Features\n* Durable flexible construction with double pull side panels for additional support\n* Specially constructed pocket accommodates moldable insert or cold therapy packs\n* 9\u2033 in back tapering to 6\u2033 in front\n* Hook and loop closure\n\n[[Back Support with Pocket]][146][][147]\n[][148][[Back Support with Pocket]][149]\n[][150][[Back Support with Pocket]][151]\n[][152][[Back Support with Pocket]][153]\n[Back Support with Pocket]\n[Back Support with Pocket]\n[Back Support with Pocket]\n[Back Support with Pocket]\n\n[Printer-Friendly PDF][154]\n\nLoading...\n* [ Instructions for Use ][155]\n* [ Part Numbers ][156]\n* [ Product Sizing Chart ][157]\n\n## Instructions for Use\n\n[Instructions for Use][158]\n\n## Part Numbers\n\n### Part Numbers\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPart #\u2502Description\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n07XXX \u2502Back Support with Pocket\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n07010 \u2502Back Support Panel Accessory\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Sizing Chart\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Related products\n* [[Pinnacle \u00ae Cervical Collar 172]\n\n## Pinnacle^{\u00ae} Cervical Collar 172\n\n][159]\n* [[Pinnacle \u00ae LO 627/642]\n\n## Pinnacle^{\u00ae} LO 627/642\n\n][160]\n* [[Ambu\u00ae Perfit ACE and ACE Mini]\n\n## Ambu\u00ae Perfit ACE and ACE Mini\n\n][161]\n* [[Ascend\u00ae LSO 631/648]\n\n## Ascend\u00ae LSO 631/648\n\n][162]\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][163]\n[(760) 795-5440][164]\n\n[ Youtube ][165] [ Linkedin ][166]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][167]\n* [Industry Affiliations][168]\n* [Press Room][169]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][170]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][171]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][172]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][173]\n* [Industry Affiliations][174]\n* [Press Room][175]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][176]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][177]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][178]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Patients\n* [Contact Us][179]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][180]\n* [Patient Privacy][181]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][182]\n* [Affiliate Partners][183]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][184]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][185]\n* [Patient Privacy][186]\n* [Patient Bill Pay][187]\n* [Affiliate Partners][188]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\n## Providers\n* [Contact Us][189]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][190]\n* [Shipping Information][191]\n* [Check Order Status][192]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][193]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][194]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][195]\n* [Become a Customer][196]\n* [Make a Payment][197]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][198]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][199]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][200]\n* [Custom Color Chart][201]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Contact Us][202]\n* [Warranty/Return Policy][203]\n* [Shipping Information][204]\n* [Check Order Status][205]\n* [PDAC / SADMERC Letters][206]\n* [Custom Brace Order Form (US Only)][207]\n* [New Idea Submission Form][208]\n* [Become a Customer][209]\n* [Make a Payment][210]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [GTIN Product List][211]\n* [Instructions for Use (IFU)][212]\n* [European Union Instructions for Use (IFU)][213]\n* [Custom Color Chart][214]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n\nThe materials on this website are for your general educational information only. Information you\nread on this website cannot replace the relationship that you have with your healthcare\nprofessional. We do not practice medicine or provide medical services or advice as a part of this\nwebsite. You should always talk to your healthcare professional for diagnosis and treatment.\n\n\u00a92025 Breg, Inc. All rights reserved. All trademarks and registered trademarks are owned by the\ncopyright holder.\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][215]\n* [ADA Accessibility][216]\n* [Privacy Policy][217]\n* [Terms of Use][218]\n* [Compliance][219]\n* [Authorized Resale Policy][220]\n* [ADA Accessibility][221]\n* [Privacy Policy][222]\n* [Terms of Use][223]\n* [Compliance][224]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: /aspen-to-breg-cross-walk/\n[3]: https://www.breg.com\n[4]: https://www.breg.com/\n[5]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/\n[7]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/executive-profiles/\n[8]: https://www.breg.com/about-us/breg-affiliate-partners/\n[9]: https://www.breg.com/breg-international/\n[10]: https://www.breg.com/products/\n[11]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/\n[12]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/functional-ligament/\n[13]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/adjustable-rom/\n[14]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/functional-oa/\n[15]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/patellofemoral/\n[16]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/post-op/\n[17]: https://www.breg.com/products/knee-bracing/soft-supports/\n[18]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/\n[19]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/devices/\n[20]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/gel-accessories/\n[21]: https://www.breg.com/products/cold-therapy/pads/\n[22]: https://www.breg.com/products/dvt-prophylaxis/\n[23]: https://www.breg.com/products/hip-bracing/\n[24]: https://www.breg.com/products/hip-bracing/hip-bracing-post-op/\n[25]: https://www.breg.com/products/shoulder-bracing/\n[26]: https://www.breg.com/products/shoulder-bracing/slings-