ons for Use\n\n[Instructions for Use][151]\n\n## Part Numbers\n\n### Part Numbers\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPart # \u2502Size\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nVP20105-010\u2502XS\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nVP20105-020\u2502S\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nVP20105-030\u2502M\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nVP20105-040\u2502L\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nVP20105-050\u2502XL\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Product Sizing Chart\n\n[Shoulder Slings Sizing Chart]\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Related products\n* [[ARC\u00ae 2.0 Shoulder Brace]\n\n## ARC\u00ae 2.0 Shoulder Brace\n\n][152]\n* [[Atlas Minor Shoulder Brace]\n\n## Atlas Minor Shoulder Brace\n\n][153]\n* [[Universal Essential Shoulder Sling]\n\n## Universal Essential Shoulder Sling\n\n][154]\n* [[Universal Sling and Swathe]\n\n## Universal Sling and Swathe\n\n][155]\n\n[BREG Logo in White]\n\n2382 Faraday Avenue, Ste 300\nCarlsbad, CA 92008\n\n[(800) 321-0607][156]\n[(760) 795-5440][157]\n\n[ Youtube ][158] [ Linkedin ][159]\n\n## Company\n* [Careers][160]\n* [Industry Affiliations][161]\n* [Press Room][162]\n\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][163]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][164]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][165]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Careers][166]\n* [Industry Affiliations][167]\n* [Press Room][168]\nHamburger Toggle Menu\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][169]\n* [Purchasing Terms and Conditions][170]\n* [Legal Requests for Patient Medical Billing Documentation][17