      "polished_summary": "Cardinal Health is a leading provider of healthcare services and products, specializing in medical products, pharmaceutical distribution, and supply chain solutions. The company serves a diverse range of markets, including hospitals, pharmacies, long-term care facilities, and ambulatory surgery centers, delivering innovative solutions that enhance patient care and operational efficiency. With a commitment to sustainability and community relations, Cardinal Health plays a pivotal role in the healthcare ecosystem.",
