      "company_summary": "ColPac is a leading manufacturer of innovative paperboard food packaging solutions, specializing in a diverse range of products designed to protect and preserve food. Their offerings include sandwich packaging, chilled and hot food-to-go solutions, bakery packaging, and party packaging, catering primarily to food service providers, restaurants, retailers, caterers, and event planners. With a commitment to quality and efficiency, ColPac serves various industries, including food delivery, quick-service restaurants, and retail food packaging.",
