acks\n\nDelivered Food\n\nDelivered Food\nBack\n\nBoxes\n\nPots\n\nParty Packaging\n\nParty Packaging\nBack\n\nMeal Box Kits\n\nPatterned Meal Boxes\n\nSeasonal Meal Boxes\n\nColoured Meal Boxes\n\nCombi Trays\n\nBakery Packaging\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\nClearance\n\nClearance\nBack\n\nSandwich Packs\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\nParty\n\nDrinks\n\nAbout\n\nAbout\n\nAbout\nBack\n\nAbout Us\n\nFood Packaging Certifications\n\nMarkets\n\nMarkets\nBack\n\nFood Delivery Packaging\n\nQSR Packaging\n\nRetail Food Packaging\n\nTravel Packaging\n\nBespoke\n\nBespoke\nBack\n\nCustom Food Packaging\n\nCase Studies\n\nBrands\n\nBrands\nBack\n\nClasp\u00ae\n\nMulti-Food Pots\n\nStagione\u00ae\n\nSouper Pots\n\nZest\u2122\n\nSustainability\n\nExtended Producer Responsibility (EPR)\n\nBusiness as a Force for Good\n\nPackaging Sustainability\n\nRecyclable Food Packaging\n\nCompostable Food Packaging\n\nResources\n\nNews\n\nNews\nBack\n\nCertifications\n\nCompany\n\nProducts\n\nSustainability\n\nSee all News\n\nFAQs\n\nFAQs\nBack\n\nOperations\n\nProduct\n\nSales\n\nSustainability\n\nSee all FAQs\n\nCase Studies\n\nCase Studies\nBack\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\nDelivered Food\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\nSandwich Packaging\n\nSee all Case Studies\n\nResources\n\nResources\nBack\n\nCatalogues\n\nFlyers\n\nVideos\n\nSee all Resources\n\nContact\n\nPackaging Selector\nView Sabert catalogue\n\nPackaging Selector\n\nPlatters\n\nOur new platters support food developers and chefs with showcasing expanding menus and new foods, elevating food presentation and back-of-house efficiency.\n\nRead news story\nSee Product Details\n\nSabert & Colpac\n\nSabert Acquires Colpac Limited\n\nEXPANDED PORTFOLIO\n\nSabert Catalogue\n\nCLEARANCE\n\nFuzione\u00ae Trays\n\nCLEARANCE\n\nElegance Baguette Box\n\nCustom Food Packaging\n\nSpeak to us\n\nOur products\n\nOur off-the-shelf paperboard food packaging is designed to protect and preserve your products. Our stock range gives you choice, consistency, and continuity of supply.\n\nUse our packaging selector\nView Sabert catalogue\n\nSandwich Packaging\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\nParty Packaging\n\nBakery Packaging\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\nWorking to get to the best solution for you\n\nCustom Food Packaging\n\nWe offer bespoke solutions to suit your needs, across functionality, design, and print.\n\nSustainability\n\nWe focus on sustainability in product development and across all areas of our business.\n\nResources\n\nVisit our resources area to view literature and watch videos on our products and services.\n\nBrands\n\nOur brands represent certain formats and materials across our wide product offering.\n\n\u201cThe team&#8217;s ability to produce a finished product from just a vision is great. They turn projects around as quickly as they can and they really make my projects seamless.\u201d\n\nShelly Levy\n\nSenior Account Manager at Around Noon\n\n\u201cWorking with the team has been fantastic. As we move forward with this partnership we cannot wait to expand the range into other areas of our business.\u201d\n\nAaron Watson\n\nExecutive Chef at Air Culinaire\n\n\u201cWe have built a solid partnership and we continue to be impressed with the team\u2019s dedication to creating the best solutions to present our fresh food.\u201d\n\nSimon Oxley\n\nGlobal Head of Packaging at Pret\n\n\u201cWe recognised the team&#8217;s strength in bringing innovative solutions to complex challenges.\u201d\n\nIan Mullin\n\nHead of Innovation at Freshways\n\n\u201cThe new packaging allows us to offer our bestselling meals in a simple, convenient format.\u201d\n\nJulie Nisbet\n\nManaging Director at Strathmore Foods\n\nSubscribe today to our newsletter for the latest news and updates about our products and services.\n\nYour First Name (Required)\n\nYour Surname (Required)\n\nYour Email (Required)\n\nProducts\n\nSandwich Packaging\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\nParty Packaging\n\nBakery Packaging\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact\n\nFAQs\n\nResources\n\nContact\n\nSabert UK Ltd, Enterprise Way, Maulden Road, Flitwick, Bedfordshire, MK45 5BW, England\n\nFlitwickSales@sabert.com\n\n+44 (0) 1525 712 261\n\nBrowse the Sabert Online Catalogue\n\n\u00a9 Sabert UK Ltd 2026\n\nBusiness Registration Number: 09664605\n\nVAT Number: GB218238414\n\nSee all certifications\n\nCookie Policy\n\nEnvironmental Policy Statement\n\nModern Slavery Statement\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nPurchasing Terms and Conditions\n\nSupplier Code of Conduct\n\nTerms and Conditions of Sale\n\nWebsite Terms\n\nAll Sabert UK Ltd original products displayed on this website are protected by Intellectual Property Rights, including copyright and unregistered design rights and they may also be the subject of one or more registered designs or patents (or applications for such rights) where appropriate. All rights in the displayed products are reserved by Colpac Limited and no license is granted under those rights unless there is a written agreement to the contrary.\n\nManage Cookie Consent\n\nTo provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions.\n\nFunctional\n\nFunctional\n\nAlways active\n\nThe technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network.\n\nPreferences\n\nPreferences\n\nThe technical storage or access is necessary for the legitimate purpose of storing preferences that are not requested by the subscriber or user.\n\nStatistics\n\nStatistics\n\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes.\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. Without a subpoena, voluntary compliance on the part of your Internet Service Provider, or additional records from a third party, information stored or retrieved for this purpose alone cannot usually be used to identify you.\n\nMarketing\n\nMarketing\n\nThe technical storage or access is required to create user profiles to send advertising, or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes.\n\nManage options\nManage services\nManage {vendor_count} vendors\nRead more about these purposes\n\nAccept\nDeny\nView preferences\nSave preferences\nView preferences\n\n{titl [ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Paperboard Food Packaging Solutions - Sabert UK Ltd] ][2]\ntogether with Colpac\n* [Products][3]\n* ### Our **products**\n\nOur off-the-shelf food packaging solutions are designed to protect and preserve your products.\n\n[Use our packaging selector][4] [View Sabert catalogue][5]\n\n[View clearance products][6]\n\n[ [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil,\ntomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.] ][7] [\n\n### Sandwich Packaging\n\n][8]\n[ [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.] ][9] [\n\n### Chilled Food-to-Go\n\n][10]\n[ [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori\npillow packs, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.] ][11] [\n\n### Hot Food-to-Go\n\n][12]\n[ [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.] ][13] [\n\n### Party Packaging\n\n][14]\n[ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebrat