s, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][104]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][105]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][106] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][107]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][108]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][109]\n* [ Party ][110]\n* [ Drinks ][111]\n* [ About ][112]\n* [ About ][113]\n[About][114] Back\n* [ About Us ][115]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][116]\n* [ Markets ][117]\n[Markets][118] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][119]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][120]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][121]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][122]\n* [ Bespoke ][123]\n[Bespoke][124] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][125]\n* [ Case Studies ][126]\n* [ Brands ][127]\n[Brands][128] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][129]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][130]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][131]\n* [ Souper Pots ][132]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][133]\n* [ Sustainability ][134]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][135]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][136]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][138]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][139]\n* [ Resources ][140]\n* [ News ][141]\n[News][142] Back\n* [ Certifications ][143]\n* [ Company ][144]\n* [ Products ][145]\n* [ Sustainability ][146]\n* [ See all News ][147]\n* [ FAQs ][148]\n[FAQs][149] Back\n* [ Operations ][150]\n* [ Product ][151]\n* [ Sales ][152]\n* [ Sustainability ][153]\n* [ See all FAQs ][154]\n* [ Case Studies ][155]\n[Case Studies][156] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][157]\n* [ Delivered Food ][158]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][159]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][160]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][161]\n* [ Resources ][162]\n[Resources][163] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][164]\n* [ Flyers ][165]\n* [ Videos ][166]\n* [ See all Resources ][167]\n* [ Contact ][168]\n[Packaging Selector][169] [View Sabert catalogue][170]\n[Packaging Selector][171]\n[Dark blue banner graphic with C icon.][Dark blue banner graphic with C icon.]\n\n# Products\n\n## Our **products**\n\nSelect one of our product categories below to see our off-the-shelf packaging solutions or filter\nour entire stock range using our packaging selector. Or view our [clearance lines][172].\n\n[Use our packaging selector][173] [View Sabert catalogue][174]\n[ [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil, tomatoes,\nand kitchen towels in background.][Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of\nfillings. Bread, basil, tomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.] ][175] [\n\n### Sandwich Packaging\n\n][176]\n[ [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions\non black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.] ][177] [\n\n### Chilled Food-to-Go\n\n][178]\n[ [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft hot\nfood-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and souper pots,\nwith contents details in front of each packaging type.] ][179] [\n\n### Hot Food-to-Go\n\n][180]\n[ [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys,\nsurrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging\nincluding meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.] ][181] [\n\n### Party Packaging\n\n][182]\n[ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake stand,\nwooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.] ][183] [\n\n### Bakery Packaging\n\n][184]\n[ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.] ][185] [\n\n### Packaging Machinery\n\n][186]\n[Overhead shot of three kraft Pret platter bases set next to each other at an angle. Filled with\nsmall baguettes and sandwich triangles. Platter bases on grey slate surface.][Overhead shot of three\nkraft Pret platter bases set next to each other at an angle. Filled with small baguettes and\nsandwich triangles. Platter bases on grey slate surface.]\n\n## Creativity and Bespoke Packaging\n\nWe develop [custom food packaging][187] to suit specific customer requirements. Whether it\u2019s bespoke\npackaging construction or custom print, we can help you to develop ideal packaging for your food\nproducts.\n\n[ Custom food packaging ][188]\n\n## Packaging **sustainability**\n\nWe consider several key elements around our commitment to [packaging sustainability][189].\n\n### Sustainable sourcing\n\nWe advocate the use of sustainably sourced materials, undertake strict due diligence with suppliers\nand pioneer sustainable materials and coatings.\n\n### Considered design\n\nWe use circular design principles, adapt designs to meet sustainability legislation, and adjust\nweights, shapes and tapers to improve transport efficiency.\n\n### Reducing impact\n\nWe use recycled materials, educate consumers on recycling and composting guidelines and partner with\nproviders of closed-loop composting solutions.\n\n### Reducing food waste\n\nWe offer heat seal packaging and [Modified Atmosphere Packaging][190] (MAP) solutions to extend the\nshelf-life of food contents.\n\n#### **Subscribe today to our newsletter** for the latest news and updates about our products and\n#### services.\n\nYour First Name(Required)\nYour Surname(Required)\nYour Email(Required)\n\n### Products\n* [Sandwich Packaging][191]\n* [Chilled Food-t"
