            "text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Paperboard Food Packaging Solutions - Sabert UK Ltd] ][2]\ntogether with Colpac\n* [Products][3]\n* ### Our **products**\n\nOur off-the-shelf food packaging solutions are designed to protect and preserve your products.\n\n[Use our packaging selector][4] [View Sabert catalogue][5]\n\n[View clearance products][6]\n\n[ [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil,\ntomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.] ][7] [\n\n### Sandwich Packaging\n\n][8]\n[ [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.] ][9] [\n\n### Chilled Food-to-Go\n\n][10]\n[ [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori\npillow packs, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.] ][11] [\n\n### Hot Food-to-Go\n\n][12]\n[ [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.] ][13] [\n\n### Party Packaging\n\n][14]\n[ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.] ][15] [\n\n### Bakery Packaging\n\n][16]\n[ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.] ][17] [\n\n### Packaging Machinery\n\n][18]\n* [About][19]\n* * [\n\nAbout\n\n][20]\n* [About Us][21]\n* [Food Packaging Certifications][22]\n* [\n\nMarkets\n\n][23]\n* [Food Delivery Packaging][24]\n* [QSR Packaging][25]\n* [Retail Food Packaging][26]\n* [Travel Packaging][27]\n* [\n\nBespoke\n\n][28]\n* [Custom Food Packaging][29]\n* [Case Studies][30]\n* [\n\nBrands\n\n][31]\n* [Clasp\u00ae][32]\n* [Multi-Food Pots][33]\n* [Stagione\u00ae][34]\n* [Souper Pots][35]\n* [Zest\u2122][36]\n\nNEW Case Study\n\nDirect Food Contact Inks\n\n][37]\n* [Sustainability][38]\n* [Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)][39]\n\n[Business as a Force for Good][40]\n\n[Packaging Sustainability][41]\n\n[Recyclable Food Packaging][42]\n\n[Compostable Food Packaging][43]\n\nResource\n\nDownload ESG Report\n\n][44]\n* [Resources][45]\n* * [\n\nNews\n\n][46]\n* [Certifications][47]\n* [Company][48]\n* [Products][49]\n* [Sustainability][50]\n* [See all News][51]\n* [\n\nFAQs\n\n][52]\n* [Operations][53]\n* [Product][54]\n* [Sales][55]\n* [Sustainability][56]\n* [See all FAQs][57]\n* [\n\nCase Studies\n\n][58]\n* [Chilled Food-to-Go][59]\n* [Delivered Food][60]\n* [Hot Food-to-Go][61]\n* [Sandwich Packaging][62]\n* [See all Case Studies][63]\n* [\n\nResources\n\n][64]\n* [Catalogues][65]\n* [Flyers][66]\n* [Videos][67]\n* [See all Resources][68]\n\nNEW Video\n\nOur Paperboard Expertise\n\n][69]\n* [Contact][70]\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][71]\n[Search][Search]\n[Home][72] / Case studies\n[ [Paperboard Food Packaging Solutions - Sabert UK Ltd] ][73] together with Colpac\n[Phone][Phone]\n][74]\n[Search][Search]\n[Search][Search]\n* [ Products ][75]\n* [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil, tomatoes,\nand kitchen towels in background.][Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of\nfillings. Bread, basil, tomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.]\n\nSandwich Packaging\n\n[Sandwich Packaging][76] Back\n* [ Same Day Sandwich Packaging ][77]\n* [ Longer Shelf-Life Sandwich Packaging ][78]\n* [ Extended Shelf-Life Sandwich Packaging ][79]\n* [ Square Cut Sandwich Packaging ][80]\n* [ Wrap Packaging ][81]\n* [ Baguette Packaging ][82]\n* [ Bags & Inserts ][83]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][84]\n* [ Platter Trays ][85]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][86] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][87]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][88]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Pots ][90]\n* [ Boxes ][91]\n* [ Trays ][92]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][93]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][94]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][95] Back\n* [ Boxes ][96]\n* [ Pots ][97]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][98] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][99]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][100]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][101]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][102]\n* [ Combi Trays ][103]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][104]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][105]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][106] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][107]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][108]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][109]\n* [ Party ][110]\n* [ Drinks ][111]\n* [ About ][112]\n* [ About ][113]\n[About][114] Back\n* [ About Us ][115]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][116]\n* [ Markets ][117]\n[Markets][118] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][119]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][120]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][121]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][122]\n* [ Bespoke ][123]\n[Bespoke][124] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][125]\n* [ Case Studies ][126]\n* [ Brands ][127]\n[Brands][128] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][129]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][130]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][131]\n* [ Souper Pots ][132]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][133]\n* [ Sustainability ][134]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][135]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][136]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][138]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][139]\n* [ Resources ][140]\n* [ News ][141]\n[News][142] Back\n* [ Certifications ][143]\n* [ Company ][144]\n* [ Products ][145]\n* [ Sustainability ][146]\n* [ See all News ][147]\n* [ FAQs ][148]\n[FAQs][149] Back\n* [ Operations ][150]\n* [ Product ][151]\n* [ Sales ][152]\n* [ Sustainability ][153]\n* [ See all FAQs ][154]\n* [ Case Studies ][155]\n[Case Studies][156] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][157]\n* [ Delivered Food ][158]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][159]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][160]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][161]\n* [ Resources ][162]\n[Resources][163] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][164]\n* [ Flyers ][165]\n* [ Videos ][166]\n* [ See all Resources ][167]\n* [ Contact ][168]\n[Packaging Selector][169] [View Sabert catalogue][170]\n[Packaging Selector][171]\n\n# Case Studies\n\nLooking for inspiration? Take a look at some of our previous work.\n\n[Two wedge sandwich packs in yellow and blue, and one square sandwich pack in green, on turfed pitch\nsurface with net in background.][Two wedge sandwich packs in yellow and blue, and one square\nsandwich pack in green, on turfed pitch surface with net in background.]\nSandwich Packaging\n\n### Levy UK\n\nAn All-Paper Packaging Solution for World-Class Events\n\nLevy UK, home of the world\u2019s greatest guest experiences, required a high-quality range of sandwich\npackaging that could stand proudly at an internationally recognised sporting event in London. The\npacks needed to protect and preserve food freshness to reduce food\u2026\n[Read more][172]\nFilter by category Filter by category Chilled Food-to-Go Delivered Food Hot Food-to-Go Non-Food\nSandwich Packaging\n[Stagione pot, filled with cake, blueberries and garnish. Navy blue print and white Air Culinaire\nlogo to the pot exterior. Pot on wooden surface in private jet, in front of aircraft\nwindow.][Stagione pot, filled with cake, blueberries and garnish. Navy blue print and white Air\nCulinaire logo to the pot exterior. Pot on wooden surface in private jet, in front of aircraft\nwindow.]\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n### Air Culinaire\n\nA custom printed range to replace plastic packaging for a private air travel caterer.\n\n][173]\n[Two white multi-food pots, one filled with mozzarella and tomato salad, and one with rice, chicken\nand green vegetables. Both pots being held by people.][Two white multi-food pots, one filled with\nmozzarella and tomato salad, and one with rice, chicken and green vegetables. Both pots being held\nby people.]\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n### Nonna\n\nA collaboration with Nonna to package pre-prepared salads for an international retailer.\n\n][174]\n[Two brown upright wrap packs, filled with chicken and salad wraps. Presented on wooden surface with\ncafe setting in the background.][Two brown upright wrap packs, filled with chicken and salad wraps.\nPresented on wooden surface with cafe setting in the background.]\nSandwich Packaging\n\n### Freshways\n\nA versatile merchandising solution for a premium, tortilla wrap range.\n\n][175]\n[Person in blue shirt holding red Islabben ice cream tray containing six pots of vanilla ice\ncream.][Person in blue shirt holding red Islabben ice cream tray containing six pots of vanilla ice\ncream.]\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n### Islabben\n\nA high-quality, unique packaging solution, strong enough to securely hold filled ice cream pots.\n\n][176]\n[Three paperboard boxes with red and yellow graphics and macaroni cheese image on the outside. Boxes\npiled in a pyramid on a wooden worktop.][Three paperboard boxes with red and yellow graphics and\nmacaroni cheese image on the outside. Boxes piled in a pyramid on a wooden worktop.]\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n### Strathmore Foods\n\nA highly certified hot food-to-go pack for a major UK retailer.\n\n][177]\n[Green carton with apple pattern to exterior, filled with granny apple fries and whipped cream in\ndip corner. Food truck in background.][Green carton with apple pattern to exterior, filled with\ngranny apple fries and whipped cream in dip corner. Food truck in background.]\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n### Aramark\n\nA branded, bespoke solution for an international group of theme parks.\n\n][178]\n[Overhead shot of white bespoke Pret salad bowl, filled with salmon with chili, edamame beans,\navocado, lime, dressing, mango, coriander, and pickles. Pret napkin and wooden cutlery in\nforeground.][Overhead shot of white bespoke Pret salad bowl, filled with salmon with chili, edamame\nbeans, avocado, lime, dressing, mango, coriander, and pickles. Pret napkin and wooden cutlery in\nforeground.]\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n### Pret A Manger\n\nA recyclable solution for a high-end salad range, to present fresh ingredients with maximum\nvisibility.\n\n][179]\n[Pile of black Noodl Plus soup pots with brightly coloured graphics of noodle dishes.][Pile of black\nNoodl Plus soup pots with brightly coloured graphics of"
