, metal cutlery, glasses and glass water\nbottle alongside.]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n#### What is the process for ordering samples?\n\nTo order samples, please speak to your account manager, or to our sales team. We will assess your\nrequirements and send our samples to you as quickly as possible.\n\n#### Can I buy directly from you?\n\nOur buying process is dependent on order quantities. We supply most of our customers through our\nexten"
