kaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Medium kraft platter base with pop-out handles, filled with croissants, Danish pastries, maple &\npecan plaits and a pot of yoghurt, granola & fruit.][Medium kraft platter base with pop-out handles,\nfilled with croissants, Danish pastries, maple & pecan plaits and a pot of yoghurt, granola &\nfruit.] ][175]\n[ [Large kraft platter base with three inserts. One insert filled with wraps, one with strawberry\nand chocolate cupcakes, and one with twenty-four sandwich rounds.][Large kraft platter base with\nthree inserts. One insert filled with wraps, one with strawberry and chocolate cupcakes, and one\nwith twenty-four sandwich rounds.] ][176]\n[ [Extra small kraft platter box with clear window sleeve, filled with smoked salmon, sliced\navocado, red and yellow tomatoes, salad leaves and a lemon wedge, half out of sleeve.][Extra small\nkraft platter box with clear window sleeve, filled with smoked salmon, sliced avocado, red and\nyellow tomatoes, salad leaves and a lemon wedge, half out of sleeve.] ][177]\n[ [Extra small kraft platter base, with kraft exterior and white interior, filled with nine golden\npuff pastry sausage rolls, neatly arranged in two rows.][Extra small kraft platter base, with kraft\nexterior and white interior, filled with nine golden puff pastry sausage rolls, neatly arranged in\ntwo rows.] ][178]\n[ [Medium kraft platter box with clear window lid, filled with sandwich rounds and salad.][Medium\nkraft platter box with clear window lid, filled with sandwich rounds and salad.] ][179]\n[ [Flat-packed medium kraft platter base with cut-out handles, displayed before folding and\nassembly.][Flat-packed medium kraft platter base with cut-out handles, displayed before folding and\nassembly.] ][180]\n[ [Flat-packed large kraft platter base showing die-cut shape before assembly.][Flat-packed large\nkraft platter base showing die-cut shape before assembly.] ][181]\n[ [Large kraft platter lid with clear window, shown from the side.][Large kraft platter lid with\nclear window, shown from the side.] ][182]\n[ [Close-up of a paperboard platter trays, filled with croissants, pain au chocolat, fresh berries,\nand decorative flowers on a marble surface.][Close-up of a paperboard platter trays, filled with\ncroissants, pain au chocolat, fresh berries, and decorative flowers on a marble surface.] ][183]\n[ [Overhead view of assorted platter trays containing sandwiches, wraps, pastries, savoury snacks,\nmini quiches, frittata slices, and fresh garnishes, with some platters featuring clear windowed\nsleeves and lids.][Overhead view of assorted platter trays containing sandwiches, wraps, pastries,\nsavoury snacks, mini quiches, frittata slices, and fresh garnishes, with some platters featuring\nclear windowed sleeves and lids.] ][184]\n[ [Screenshot of Colpac's platter ranges video.][Screenshot of Colpac's platter ranges video.]\n][185]\n\n# Platter Trays, Sleeves and Lids\n\n[View all product options][186]\n\nOur platter trays, sleeves, and lids deliver efficiency for back-of-house teams and elevate the\npresentation of your food.\n\nWe offer two platter ranges, giving you the flexibility to serve a variety of food types across day\nparts.\n\nOur traditional platters feature bases with double-walled sides for robust construction and pop-out\nhandles to support hygiene. The range includes sleeves for all sizes, protecting contents when used\nas [food delivery packaging][187].\n\nOur light platters use lighter, lower-cost bases to showcase your food. Light lids simply rest on\ntop of the bases without touching the contents. Watch our light [platter trays with lid][188]\nconstruction video to see how simple they are to put together.\n\nThe small and extra small light bases can be used as \u00bd and \u00bc inserts within the large platter bases.\nThe sleeves and lids fit interchangeably across both base styles. Recycle all our platter trays,\nsleeves, and lids once you have removed the windows.\n* Recyclable (once wind"
