* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, filled with green pesto pasta, chickpeas, and\nsalad leaves.][Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, filled with green pesto pasta,\nchickpeas, and salad leaves.] ][175]\n[ [Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, empty, front view.][Brown heat seal paperboard\nbox with clear window, empty, front view.] ][176]\n[ [Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, empty, side view.][Brown heat seal paperboard\nbox with clear window, empty, side view.] ][177]\n[ [Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, empty, back side view.][Brown heat seal\npaperboard box with clear window, empty, back side view.] ][178]\n[ [Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, empty, back view.][Brown heat seal paperboard\nbox with clear window, empty, back view.] ][179]\n[ [Brown heat seal paperboard box with clear window, empty, open.][Brown heat seal paperboard box\nwith clear window, empty, open.] ][180]\n\n# Heat Seal Salad Box\n\n[View all product options][181]\n\nOur Heat Seal Salad Box is manufactured from recyclable whiteboard and has a printed kraft effect.\n\nIt is suitable for dressed salads due to its interior PE coating which prevents absorption. Its heat\nseal also keeps the contents secure once applied using heat sealing machinery.\n\nThe pack has a PET window so that customers can see the food within.\n\nOur Heat Seal Salad Box is ideal for cafeterias, markets, catering, supermarkets and food outlets.\n* Recyclable\n* Leakproof seal and PE coating to interior\n* Heat sealed using machinery\n* Custom print available\n* Delivered nested\n\n[Enquire about this product][182]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][183]\n* [ Product Options ][184]\n* [ Alternative Products ][185]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Desc\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ript\u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502mean?][186]\n\u2502ion \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502pac\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ity\u2502ty \u2502[RECYCL\u2502[EXTENDE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ABLE \u2502D\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][\u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502RECYCLA\u2502FE][EXTE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502NDED\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD] \u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u25