ckaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [rPET sandwich bag insert for square cut sandwiches, side view.][rPET sandwich bag insert for\nsquare cut sandwiches, side view.] ][175]\n[ [rPET sandwich bag insert for square cut sandwiches, view from above.][rPET sandwich bag insert\nfor square cut sandwiches, view from above.] ][176]\n[ [rPET sandwich bag insert for square cut sandwiches, angled view.][rPET sandwich bag insert for\nsquare cut sandwiches, angled view.] ][177]\n\n# Plastic rPET Sandwich Bag Insert\n\n[View all product options][178]\n\nOur rPET Sandwich Bag Insert is for extra stability for square cut sandwiches inside a bag.\n\nIt works in combination with our laminated [deli bags][179]. It is food safe so is suitable for food\ncontact. It is also made from recycled plastic and is recyclable after use.\n\nIdeal for food-to-go outlets and sandwich shops, this insert allows retailers and food service\nproviders to maintain the presentation of sandwiches throughout transportation, display, and\ndelivery.\n\nWith over 70% recycled content, our sandwich bag insert is not subject to the plastic tax.\n* rPET\n* Recyclable\n* Delivered nested for transport efficiency\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][180]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][181]\n* [ Product Options ][182]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Description\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dimens\u2502Case\u2502[What do these\n\u2502 \u2502e \u2502 \u2502ions \u2502Quan\u2502mean?][183]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x W\u2502tity\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x H) \u2502 \u2502[RECYCL\u2502[RECYCLED\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ABLE][R\u2502LID][RECY\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ECYCLAB\u2502CLED LID]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LE] \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [rPET sandwich bag insert for square cut\u2502**Plastic \u2502103\u2502rPET \u2502150 x \u25021000\u2502 \u2502\nsandwiches, side view.][rPET sandwich bag \u2502rPET \u250277 \u2502[Sustainabi\u2502102 x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ninsert for square cut sandwiches, side \u2502Sandwich \u2502 \u2502lity \u250265mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nview.] More Images ][184] \u2502Bag \u2502 \u2502Credentials\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Insert** \u2502 \u2502][185] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are made from recycled plastic material (rPET).\n[RECYCLABLE BOARD][RECYCLABLE BOARD] RECYCLABLE BOARD\nThe board for these products is recyclable.\n[RECYCLED BOARD][RECYCLED BOARD] RECYCLED BOARD\nThe board for these products is made from recycled material.\n[SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE][SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE] SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE\nThe product is suitable for microwave use.\n[SUITABLE FOR OVEN][SUITABLE FOR OVEN] SUITABLE FOR OVEN\nThe product is suitable for oven use.\n[SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET][SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET] SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET\nThe product is suitable for use in hot cabinets.\n[SUITABLE FOR FREEZER][SUITABLE FOR FREEZER] SUITABLE FOR FREEZER\nThe product is suitable for freezer use.\n[SHORT SHELF-LIFE][SHORT SHELF-LIFE] SHORT SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with a shorter shelf-life.\n[LONGER SHELF-LIFE][LONGER SHELF-LIFE] LONGER SHELF-LIFE\nProduct with a longer shelf-life.\n[EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE][EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE] EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with an extended shelf-life.\n\n**Glossary**\n\nIn our material descriptions we use abbreviations, this glossary explains the materials.\n\n**GMO** \u2013 Genetically Modified Organism\n**PE** \u2013 Polyethylene\n**PET** \u2013 Polyethylene Terephthalate\n**PLA** \u2013 Polylactic Acid**\n**PP**** \u2013 Polypropylene\n"
