 [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food clamshell, filled with burger with two beef patties, a slice\nof cheese, salad leaves, and sweet potato wedges.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food clamshell,\nfilled with burger with two beef patties, a slice of cheese, salad leaves, and sweet potato wedges.]\n][175]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food clamshell, closed, front view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori\nhot food clamshell, closed, front view.] ][176]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food clamshell, closed, side view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot\nfood clamshell, closed, side view.] ][177]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food clamshell, open, angled view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot\nfood clamshell, open, angled view.] ][178]\n\n# Savori\u2122 Hot Food Clamshell\n\n[View all product options][179]\n\nOur Savori\u2122 hot food clamshell is ideal for burgers, pies, baked potatoes and loaded fries.\n\nIts solid construction and simple closures make it quick and easy to fill and close, and it holds\nits shape during eating. It is made from fluted corrugate board which provides insulation to keep\nthe food contents warm and provides protection for the consumer from hot food within. It is also\nsuitable for display in a hot cabinet.\n\nIt has a laminated PET coating which provides superior grease resistance, making it perfect for\nloaded fries covered in sauce and salsas. It is made from recyclable paperboard, so can be\nresponsibly disposed of after use.\n\nOur Savori\u2122 hot food clamshell is a fantastic packaging solution for hot food in fast food outlets\nand at hot food counters. See full [Savori\u2122 range][180].\n* Recyclable\n* Insulated\n* Suitable for hot hold\n* Delivered nested\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][181]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][182]\n* [ Product Options ][183]\n* [ Alternative Products ][184]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Desc\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dim\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ript\u2502e \u2502 \u2502ens\u2502e \u2502mean?][185]\n\u2502ion \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502s \u2502nti\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L \u2502ty \u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x W\u2502 \u2502[RECY\u2502[SUITABL\u2502[SHOR\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x \u2502 \u2502CLABL\u2502E FOR \u2502T\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502E \u2502HOT \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD\u2502CABINET]\u2502-LIFE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502][REC\u2502[SUITABL\u2502][SHO\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502YCLAB\u2502E FOR \u2502RT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LE \u2502HOT \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD\u2502CABINET]\u2502-LIFE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502] \u2502 \u2502]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food \u2502**Sa\u2502100\u2502Kraft fluted \u2502155\u2502250\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nclamshell, filled with burger with two beef \u2502vori\u250202 \u2502board. White to\u2502/13\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\npatties, a slice of cheese, salad leaves, and \u2502\u2122 \u2502 \u2502interior. PET \u25025 x\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsweet potato wedges.][Kraft effect fluted \u2502Hot \u2502 \u2502laminated \u2502125\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nSavori hot food clamshell, filled with burger \u2502Food\u2502 \u2502interior \u2502/10\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwith two beef patties, a slice of cheese, \u2502Clam\u2502 \u2502[Sustainability\u25025 x\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsalad leaves, and sweet potato wedges.] More \u2502shel\u2502 \u2502Credentials][18\u250276m\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nImages ][186] \u2502l** \u2502 \u25027] \u2502m \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Medium kraft clamshell, filled with burger with lettuce, tomato, red onion, patty, and\ncheese.][Medium kraft clamshell, filled with burger with lettuce, tomato, red onion, patty, and\ncheese.]\n\n### Kraft Clamshells\n\n][188]\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are mad"
