ding small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food box, filled with tacos with red and green chilies and grated\ncheese.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food box, filled with tacos with red and green chilies and\ngrated cheese.] ][175]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food box, closed, front view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food\nbox, closed, front view.] ][176]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food box, closed, side view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food\nbox, closed, side view.] ][177]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food box, open, angled view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori hot food\nbox, open, angled view.] ][178]\n\n# Savori\u2122 Hot Food Box\n\n[View all product options][179]\n\nOur Savori\u2122 hot food box part of our wider Savori\u2122 range and is suitable for packaging hot\nfood-to-go.\n\nIt is made from printed kraft effect fluted corrugate board material which gives insulation to\nretain the heat of food contents. This box also has webbed corners to make it leakproof, so it can\nhold wet and oily foods. It has a simple over the top closure, making it easy to fill and close.\n\nIt is made from recyclable paperboard, so can be responsibly disposed of after use.\n\nOur Savori\u2122 hot food box is suitable for hot food counters, takeaway outlets, delis, canteens,\nmarkets, catering, and event industry. See full [Savori\u2122 range][180].\n* Recyclable\n* Insulated\n* Delivered nested\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][181]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][182]\n* [ Product Options ][183]\n* [ Alternative Products ][184]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Desc\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ript\u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502mean?][185]\n\u2502ion \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502pac\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ity\u2502ty \u2502[RECYC\u2502[SUITABLE\u2502[SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LABLE \u2502FOR HOT \u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD]\u2502CABINET][\u2502LIFE][\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502[RECYC\u2502SUITABLE \u2502SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LABLE \u2502FOR HOT \u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD]\u2502CABINET] \u2502LIFE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori hot \u2502**Sa\u2502101\u2502Kraft fluted \u2502150/\u2502116\u2502125\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfood box, filled with tacos with red\u2502vori\u250240 \u2502board. White to \u2502120 \u25020ml\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nand green chilies and grated \u2502\u2122 \u2502 \u2502interior. PET \u2502x \u2502/40\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncheese.][Kraft effect fluted Savori \u2502Hot \u2502 \u2502laminated \u2502130/\u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nhot food box, filled with tacos with\u2502Food\u2502 \u2502interior \u2502100 \u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nred and green chilies and grated \u2502Box*\u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502x \u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncheese.] More Images ][186] \u2502* \u2502 \u2502Credentials][187]\u250275mm\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Small white food box, with lid open, filled with deep fried chicken and French fries.][Small white\nfood box, with lid open, filled with deep fried chicken and French fries.]\n\n### White Boxes\n\n][188]\n[Kraft multi-food box, closed, angled view.][Kraft multi-food box, closed, angled view.]\n\n### Kraft Multi-Food Boxes\n\n][189]\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are made from recycled plastic material (rPET).\n[RECYCLABLE BOARD][RECYCLABLE BOARD] RECYCLABLE BOARD\nThe board for these products is recyclable.\n[RECYCLED BOARD][RECYCLED BOARD] RECYCLED BOARD\nThe board for these products is made from recycled material.\n[SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE][SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE] SUITABLE"
