tudies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori square tray, filled with noodles, salad leaves, spring onions, red\nonion, and red chilies.][Kraft effect fluted Savori square tray, filled with noodles, salad leaves,\nspring onions, red onion, and red chilies.] ][175]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori square tray, empty, front view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori square\ntray, empty, front view.] ][176]\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori square tray, empty, side view.][Kraft effect fluted Savori square\ntray, empty, side view.] ][177]\n\n# Savori\u2122 Square Tray\n\n[View all product options][178]\n\nOur Savori\u2122 Square Tray is easy and quick to fill with pasta, noodles, burgers, pies, or baked\npotatoes.\n\nThe tray is constructed from a fluted corrugate board, which provides great insulation. It is\nsuitable for use in hot cabinets\n\nIt also has a PET lamination to the interior which provides an excellent grease resistant\nbarrier. Our Savori\u2122 Square Tray is recyclable after use.\n\nSee our full [Savori\u2122 range][179].\n* Recyclable\n* Suitable for hot cabinet\n* Insulated to keep contents warm\n* Delivered nested\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][180]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][181]\n* [ Product Options ][182]\n* [ Alternative Products ][183]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Desc\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ript\u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502e \u2502mean?][184]\n\u2502ion \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ty \u2502[RECYCL\u2502[SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502ABLE \u2502SHELF-L\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][\u2502IFE][SH\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502RECYCLA\u2502ORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502SHELF-L\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD] \u2502IFE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Kraft effect fluted Savori square tray, \u2502**Sa\u2502100\u2502Kraft fluted board.\u2502150/\u2502250\u2502 \u2502\nfilled with noodles, salad leaves, spring \u2502vori\u250253 \u2502White to interior. \u2502125 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nonions, red onion, and red chilies.][Kraft \u2502\u2122 \u2502 \u2502PET laminated \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\neffect fluted Savori square tray, filled with \u2502Squa\u2502 \u2502interior \u2502150/\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nnoodles, salad leaves, spring onions, red \u2502re \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502125 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nonion, and red chilies.] More Images ][185] \u2502Tray\u2502 \u2502Credentials][186] \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502** \u2502 \u2502 \u250260mm\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Small kraft tray with white interior, filled with barbeque glazed chicken topped with\nchives.][Small kraft tray with white interior, filled with barbeque glazed chicken topped with\nchives.]\n\n### Open Trays\n\n][187]\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are made from recycled plastic material (rPET).\n[RECYCLABLE BOARD][RECYCLABLE BOARD] RECYCLABLE BOARD\nThe board for these products is recyclable.\n[RECYCLED BOARD][RECYCLED BOARD] RECYCLED BOARD\nThe board for these products is made from recycled material.\n[SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE][SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE] SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE\nThe product is suitable for microwave use.\n[SUITABLE FOR OVEN][SUITABLE FOR OVEN] SUITABLE FOR OVEN\nThe product is suitable for oven use.\n[SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET][SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET] SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET\nThe product is suitable for use in hot cabinets.\n[SUITABLE FOR FREEZER][SUITABLE FOR FREEZER] SUITABLE FOR FREEZER\nThe product is suitable for freezer use.\n[SHORT SHELF-LIFE][SHORT SHELF-LIFE] SHORT SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with a shorter shelf-life.\n[LONGER SHELF-LIFE][LONGER SHELF-"
