ke.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, filled with a chicken\nsalad sandwich.][77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, filled\nwith a chicken salad sandwich.] ][175]\n[ [68/56 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, filled with a chicken\nand bacon sandwich.][68/56 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics,\nfilled with a chicken and bacon sandwich.] ][176]\n[ [77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, empty, front\nview.][77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, empty, front\nview.] ][177]\n[ [77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, empty, angled\nview.][77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, empty, angled\nview.] ][178]\n[ [77/65 black heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, flat packed.][77/65\nblack heat seal sandwich pack, with white stripes and salad graphics, flat packed.] ][179]\n\n# Black Heat Seal Sandwich Packs\n\n[View all product options][180]\n\nOur black heat seal sandwich packs can extend product shelf-life.\n\nWe also have a black heat seal wrap pack available. Due to the heat seal technology, sandwiches can\nbe kept fresh for P+3 days. The sandwiches are easy to view through the clear window. They also have\na PE coating to provide grease-resistance.\n\nThe bold design helps products to stand out on shelf, as it offers an alternative colour and design\nto popular kraft and kraft effect options. Our black heat seal sandwich packs are also recyclable\nafter the window is removed.\n\nA sealing [machine][181] is required for the sealing of this packaging, we offer solutions suitable\nfor back-of-house sandwich shops and in line production.\n* Recyclable once the window is removed\n* PE coating\n* Heat sealing machinery required\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][182]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][183]\n* [ Product Options ][184]\n* [ Alternative Products ][185]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descrip\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502tion \u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502e \u2502mean?][186]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ty \u2502[RECYCL\u2502[EXTENDE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502ABLE \u2502D\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][\u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502RECYCLA\u2502FE][EXTE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502NDED\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD] \u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [68/56 black heat seal sandwich pack, \u2502**68/56\u2502103\u2502White board, print \u2502119.\u2502500\u2502 \u2502\nwith white stripes and salad graphics, \u2502Black \u250215 \u2502to exterior. PE \u25025 x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfilled with a chicken and bacon \u2502Heat \u2502 \u2502coating to \u250268/5\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich.][68/56 black heat seal sandwich \u2502Seal \u2502 \u2502interior. PET \u25026 x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\npack, with white stripes and salad \u2502Sandwic\u2502 \u2502window \u2502119.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ngraphics, filled with a chicken and bacon \u2502h \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u25025mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich.] More Images ][187] \u2502Pack** \u2502 \u2502Credentials][188] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250