aft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][106]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][107]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][108] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][109]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][110]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Party ][112]\n* [ Drinks ][113]\n* [ About ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n[About][116] Back\n* [ About Us ][117]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][118]\n* [ Markets ][119]\n[Markets][120] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][121]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][122]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][123]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][124]\n* [ Bespoke ][125]\n[Bespoke][126] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][127]\n* [ Case Studies ][128]\n* [ Brands ][129]\n[Brands][130] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][131]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][132]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][133]\n* [ Souper Pots ][134]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][135]\n* [ Sustainability ][136]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][137]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][138]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][139]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][140]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Resources ][142]\n* [ News ][143]\n[News][144] Back\n* [ Certifications ][145]\n* [ Company ][146]\n* [ Products ][147]\n* [ Sustainability ][148]\n* [ See all News ][149]\n* [ FAQs ][150]\n[FAQs][151] Back\n* [ Operations ][152]\n* [ Product ][153]\n* [ Sales ][154]\n* [ Sustainability ][155]\n* [ See all FAQs ][156]\n* [ Case Studies ][157]\n[Case Studies][158] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][159]\n* [ Delivered Food ][160]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][161]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][162]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n[Resources][165] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][166]\n* [ Flyers ][167]\n* [ Videos ][168]\n* [ See all Resources ][169]\n* [ Contact ][170]\n[Packaging Selector][171] [View Sabert catalogue][172]\n[Packaging Selector][173]\n[ [Individual cupcake box filled with pink cupcake for size representation.][Individual cupcake box\nfilled with pink cupcake for size representation.] ][174]\n[ [Medium white recyclable cake box filled with Victoria sponge cake for size\nrepresentation.][Medium white recyclable cake box filled with Victoria sponge cake for size\nrepresentation.] ][175]\n[ [Medium white recyclable cake box insert filled with pink cupcake for size representation.][Medium\nwhite recyclable cake box insert filled with pink cupcake for size representation.] ][176]\n[ [White, recyclable cake boxes including large boxes containing cookies and cupcakes, a box\ncontaining a large cake, an empty individual cake box, cupcakes, muffins, and a knife on white\nnapkin.][White, recyclable cake boxes including large boxes containing cookies and cupcakes, a box\ncontaining a large cake, an empty individual cake box, cupcakes, muffins, and a knife on white\nnapkin.] ][177]\n\n# Cake and Cupcake Boxes\n\n[View all product options][178]\n\nOur white, recyclable cake boxes come in two sizes.\n\nOur small cake box option is an ideal individual cupcake box, that can also be used for muffins. Our\nmedium cake box is ideal for a large cake or four cupcakes.\n\nOur medium cake boxes have a removable, white insert, specifically designed for cupcakes, which\nprovides stability during transport. Our recyclable cake boxes feature a colourful pattern and\nsquare cut-out windows for product visibility.\n\nOur recyclable cake boxes and individual cupcake boxes are suitable for outlets such as\nsupermarkets, delis, and bakeries.\n* Recyclable\n* Great product visibility\n* Available in different sizes\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][179]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][180]\n* [ Product Options ][181]\n* [ Alternative Products ][182]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descri\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ption \u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502e \u2502mean?][183]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ty \u2502[RECYCLA\u2502[SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][R\u2502FE][SHOR\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ECYCLABL\u2502T\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E BOARD]\u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2