g ][85]\n* [ Bags & Inserts ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Clasp clip pocket roll, filled with pastrami, mozzarella, and rocket.][Clasp clip pocket roll,\nfilled with pastrami, mozzarella, and rocket.] ][175]\n[ [Clasp seal pie sleeve, filled with wholemeal roll with ham and salad filling.][Clasp seal pie\nsleeve, filled with wholemeal roll with ham and salad filling.] ][176]\n[ [Clasp clip pocket roll, empty, open ended front view.][Clasp clip pocket roll, empty, open ended\nfront view.] ][177]\n[ [Clasp clip pocket roll, empty, open ended angled view.][Clasp clip pocket roll, empty, open ended\nangled view.] ][178]\n[ [Clasp seal pie sleeve, flat packed.][Clasp seal pie sleeve, flat packed.] ][179]\n[ [Clasp clip pocket roll, flat packed.][Clasp clip pocket roll, flat packed.] ][180]\n\n# Clasp\u00ae Roll Packs\n\n[View all product options][181]\n\nOur Clasp^{\u00ae} roll packs are great for packaging bread rolls, bagels, or pies.\n\nOur Clasp^{\u00ae }roll packs feature two of our [Clasp^{\u00ae }brands][182], both products feature a board\nand film combination that gives excellent product visibility. These packs are easy to use both for\nthe packaging of the food and for the end customer to hold and transport.\n\nOur Clasp^{\u00ae }Clip Pocket Roll can be sealed by hand and features a ready sealed pocket and an\nadjustable closure to fit different sized products.\n\nOur Clasp^{\u00ae }Seal Pie, the sleeve features an open-ended film that is easy to insert product into\nand can be quickly and easily secured with our ColSeal^{\u00ae} KFC200 [impulse sealer][183].\n\nBoth products are recyclable once the film is separated and are suitable for longer shelf-life food\nproducts. They are ideal for a variety of food service outlets such as supermarkets, delis, and\nmarkets.\n* Recyclable\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][184]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][185]\n* [ Product Options ][186]\n* [ Alternative Products ][187]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descri\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dimens\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ption \u2502e \u2502 \u2502ions \u2502e \u2502mean?][188]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x W\u2502Qua\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x H) \u2502nti\u2502[RECYCLA\u2502[LONGER\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ty \u2502BLE \u2502SHELF-LIF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][R\u2502E][LONGER\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ECYCLABL\u2502SHELF-LIF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E BOARD]\u2502E]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Clasp seal pie sleeve, filled with \u2502**Clas\u2502102\u2502White board kraft \u2502167 x \u2502500\u2502 \u2502\nwholemeal roll with ham and salad \u2502p\u00ae \u250275 \u2502print effect to \u2502238mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfilling.][Clasp seal pie sleeve, \u2502Seal \u2502 \u2502exterior. PET film \u2502\u00d8 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfilled with wholemeal roll with ham \u2502Pie \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u250255-115\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nand salad filling.] More Images ][189]\u2502Sleeve\u2502 \u2502Credentials][190] \u2502.5 mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502** \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Clasp clip pocket roll, filled with\u2502**Clas\u2502102\u2502Kraft board. PP film\u2502190 x \u2502100\u2502 \u2502\npastrami, mozzarella, and \u2502p\u00ae \u250277 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502356mm \u25020 \u2502 \u2502\nrocket.][Clasp clip pocket roll, \u2502Clip \u2502 \u2502Credentials][192] \u2502\u00d8 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfilled with pastrami, mozzarella, and \u2502Pocket\u2502 \u2502 \u250297-102\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nrocket.] More Images ][191] \u2502Roll**\u2502 \u2502 \u2502mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Clasp clip square cut sandwich pack, filled with a ham and salad square cut sandwich.][Clasp clip\nsquare cut sandwich pack, filled with a ham and salad square cut sandwich.]\n\n### Clasp\u00ae Square Cut Sandwich Packs\n\n][193]\n[Kraft sofa sandwich tray, filled with bacon, lettuce, and tomato square cut sandwiches.][Kraft sofa\nsandwich tray, filled with bacon, lettuce, and tomato square cut sandwiches.]\n\n### Sofa Sandwich Tray\n\n][194]\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN134"
