 [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Printed kraft effect, 430ml Cookpac box, filled with pasta with tomato sauce.][Printed kraft\neffect, 430ml Cookpac box, filled with pasta with tomato sauce.] ][175]\n[ [Printed kraft effect, 580ml Cookpac box, filled with white rice, black beans, sweetcorn, diced\npeppers, and pulled pork.][Printed kraft effect, 580ml Cookpac box, filled with white rice, black\nbeans, sweetcorn, diced peppers, and pulled pork.] ][176]\n[ [Printed kraft effect, 700ml Cookpac box, filled with noodle salad with spinach, carrots,\nbeansprouts, and red peppers.][Printed kraft effect, 700ml Cookpac box, filled with noodle salad\nwith spinach, carrots, beansprouts, and red peppers.] ][177]\n[ [Printed kraft effect, 1060ml Cookpac box, filled with sliced chicken, tomatoes, red peppers,\nrice, and tomato sauce.][Printed kraft effect, 1060ml Cookpac box, filled with sliced chicken,\ntomatoes, red peppers, rice, and tomato sauce.] ][178]\n[ [Selection of brown Cookpac ovenable food packaging on table, filled with chicken wings, curry\nwith rice, and deep fried chicken.][Selection of brown Cookpac ovenable food packaging on table,\nfilled with chicken wings, curry with rice, and deep fried chicken.] ][179]\n\n# Cookpac\u00ae Same Day\n\n[View all product options][180]\n\nOur Cookpac^{\u00ae} Same Day products are ideal for ready meals, delivery, and can be heated in the\nmicrowave and oven.\n\nThey are made from FSC^{\u00ae} certified, recyclable board and are available in five sizes. The printed\nkraft effect gives a natural look and can be wiped clean.\n\nWith the option to freeze, regenerate in the microwave or oven and store in a hot hold cabinet,\nCookpac^{\u00ae} Same Day is a versatile pack that can be used across the supply chain.\n\nOur Cookpac^{\u00ae} Same Day packs are leakproof due to the webbed design and have an integrated lid\nwith secure closure to keep food contents to temperature.\n\nThis [ovenable food packaging][181] is suitable for freezing, so is ideal for supermarkets food\nsuppliers that would like to give customers the option to store frozen food before cooking.\n* Webbed leakproof design\n* Oven, microwave and freezer safe\n* Delivered nested\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][182]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][183]\n* [ Product Options ][184]\n* [ Case Studies ][185]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Des\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dim\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these mean?][186]\n\u2502cri\u2502e \u2502 \u2502ens\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502\n\u2502pti\u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502on \u2502 \u2502 \u2502s \u2502pac\u2502nti\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L \u2502ity\u2502ty \u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x W\u2502 \u2502 \u2502[SUITA\u2502[SUIT\u2502[SUITAB\u2502[SUITA\u2502[SHOR\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502ABLE \u2502LE FOR \u2502BLE \u2502T\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FOR \u2502FOR \u2502HOT \u2502FOR \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502MICROW\u2502OVEN]\u2502CABINET\u2502FREEZE\u2502-LIFE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502AVE][S\u2502[SUIT\u2502][SUITA\u2502R][SUI\u2502][SHO\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502UITABL\u2502ABLE \u2502BLE FOR\u2502TABLE \u2502RT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E FOR \u2502FOR \u2502HOT \u2502FOR \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502MICROW\u2502OVEN]\u2502CABINET\u2502FREEZE\u2502-LIFE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502AVE] \u2502 \u2502] \u2502R] \u2502]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Printed kraft effect, \u2502**C\u2502100\u2502FSC\u00ae certified \u2502101\u2502430\u2502500\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n430ml Cookpac box, filled \u2502ook\u250263 \u2502ovenable white \u2502/85\u2502ml \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwith pasta with tomato \u2502pac\u2502 \u2502board kraft print \u2502x \u2502/ \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsauce.][Printed kraft \u2502\u00ae \u2502 \u2502effect to exterior.\u2502101\u250215 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\neffect, 430ml Cookpac box,\u2502430\u2502 \u2502White with PET \u2502/85\u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfilled with pasta with \u2502ml \u2502 \u2502coating to interior\u2502x \u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ntomato sauce.] More Images\u2502Sam\u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u250250m\u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n][187] \u2502e-d\u2502 \u2502Credentials][188] \u2502m \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502ay*\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502* \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Printed kraft effect, \u2502**C\u2502100\u2502FSC\u00ae certified \u2502116\u2502580\u2502250\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n580ml Cookpac box, filled \u2502ook\u250264 \u2502ovenable white \u2502/10\u2502ml \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwith white rice, black"
