* [ Bags & Inserts ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Front loading printed kraft effect standard sandwich pack, filled with ham and cheese\nsandwich.][Front loading printed kraft effect standard sandwich pack, filled with ham and cheese\nsandwich.] ][175]\n[ [Front loading printed kraft effect deep fill sandwich pack, filled with chicken, avocado, and\nbacon sandwich.][Front loading printed kraft effect deep fill sandwich pack, filled with chicken,\navocado, and bacon sandwich.] ][176]\n[ [Front loading printed kraft effect standard sandwich pack, empty, front view.][Front loading\nprinted kraft effect standard sandwich pack, empty, front view.] ][177]\n[ [Front loading printed kraft effect deep fill sandwich pack, empty, angled view.][Front loading\nprinted kraft effect deep fill sandwich pack, empty, angled view.] ][178]\n\n# Printed Kraft Front Loading Sandwich Packs\n\n[View all product options][179]\n\nOur printed kraft, front loading packs are available in two sizes, standard (52mm wide) and deep\nfill (72mm).\n\nThese packs are made from recyclable white board and have a kraft effect print to the exterior. They\nhave large PLA windows which provide fantastic product visibility to showcase the freshness of the\nsandwiches and fillings within.\n\nOur printed kraft effect front loading sandwich packs are quick to construct, easy to fill and\nsimple to close with a side locking tab. This closure enables easy opening and are ideal for\napplying a tamper proofing label.\n\nThese packs offer simple but effective packaging solutions, suitable for a multitude of food service\noutlets.\n* Recyclable\n* Front loading\n* Two sizes available\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][180]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][181]\n* [ Product Options ][182]\n* [ Alternative Products ][183]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descripti\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dim\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502on \u2502e \u2502 \u2502ens\u2502e \u2502mean?][184]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502s \u2502nti\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L \u2502ty \u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x W\u2502 \u2502[COMPOS\u2502[RECYC\u2502[SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x \u2502 \u2502TABLE \u2502LABLE \u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502WINDOW]\u2502BOARD]\u2502LIFE][\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502[COMPOS\u2502[RECYC\u2502SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502TABLE \u2502LABLE \u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502WINDOW]\u2502BOARD]\u2502LIFE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Front loading printed kraft effect \u2502**Front \u2502103\u2502White board, \u2502123\u2502500\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nstandard sandwich pack, filled with \u2502Loading \u250209 \u2502kraft effect \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nham and cheese sandwich.][Front \u2502Standard \u2502 \u2502print to \u250252 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nloading printed kraft effect standard \u2502Sandwich \u2502 \u2502exterior. Non-GMO\u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich pack, filled with ham and \u2502Pack \u2502 \u2502PLA window \u2502123\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncheese sandwich.] More Images ][185] \u2502Kraft \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Effect** \u2502 \u2502Credentials][186]\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Front loading printed kraft effect \u2502**Front \u2502103\u2502White board, \u2502123\u2502500\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ndeep fill sandwich pack, filled with \u2502Loading \u250210 \u2502kraft effect \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nchicken, avocado, and bacon \u2502Deepfill \u2502 \u2502print to \u250272 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich.][Front loading printed kraft\u2502Sandwich \u2502 \u2502exterior. Non-GMO\u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\neffect deep fill sandwich pack, filled\u2502Pack \u2502 \u2502PLA window \u2502123\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwith chicken, avocado, and bacon \u2502Kraft \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502mm \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich.] More Images ][187] \u2502Effect** \u2502 \u2502Credentials][188]\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[72mm kraft rear loading sandwich pack, filled with cheese, bacon, and lettuce.][72mm kraft rear\nloading sandwich pack, filled with cheese, bacon, and lettuce.]\n\n### Kraft Rear Loading Sandwich Packs\n\n][189]\n[Zest 72mm kraft rear loading sandwich pack, filled with deep fill, beetroot, spinach and hummus\nsandwich.][Zest 72mm kraft rear loading sandwich pac"
