erts ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Kraft laminated sandwich deli bag, filled with ham and coleslaw deep fill sandwich.][Kraft\nlaminated sandwich deli bag, filled with ham and coleslaw deep fill sandwich.] ][175]\n[ [Elegance laminated sandwich deli bag, filled with prawn salad deep fill sandwich.][Elegance\nlaminated sandwich deli bag, filled with prawn salad deep fill sandwich.] ][176]\n[ [Kraft laminated deli bag filled with granola cookies.][Kraft laminated deli bag filled with\ngranola cookies.] ][177]\n[ [Kraft laminated sandwich deli bag, flat packed.][Kraft laminated sandwich deli bag, flat packed.]\n][178]\n[ [Elegance laminated sandwich deli bag, empty, angled view.][Elegance laminated sandwich deli bag,\nempty, angled view.] ][179]\n[ [Elegance laminated sandwich deli bag, empty, front view.][Elegance laminated sandwich deli bag,\nempty, front view.] ][180]\n\n# Laminated Deli Bags\n\n[View all product options][181]\n\nOur laminated deli bags are perfect for sandwiches, snacks, pastries, and baked goods.\n\nOur laminated deli bags have a block bottom which provides a wide base for contents, so for example\nwould suit square cut sandwiches. For extra stability these bags can be used in conjunction with our\nrPET sandwich bag insert.\n\nWe have printed kraft effect and [Elegance][182] options available, with a unique bread shaped\nwindow that offers an interesting differential to other bags. There is also a kraft version with a\nround window.\n\nThey have a laminated coating to the inside, making them grease resistant. The lamination also\nenables a heat seal closure, to help products to last longer, using a bar sealing machine such as\nour [ColSeal impulse sealer][183]. This closure option gives the bags a secure and tamper evident\nclosure, perfect for takeaway and deliveries.\n\nThis packaging is suitable for delicatessens, bakeries, cafes, and coffee shops. It is also great\nfor the catering and leisure industries.\n* Can also be heat sealed\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][184]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][185]\n* [ Product Options ][186]\n* [ Alternative Products ][187]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descript\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dimen\u2502Cas\u2502[What do\n\u2502ion \u2502e \u2502 \u2502sions\u2502e \u2502these\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x \u2502Qua\u2502mean?][1\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502nti\u250288]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502ty \u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502[SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FE][SHOR\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502T\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Kraft laminated deli bag filled with \u2502**Kraft \u2502102\u2502White paper, kraft printed \u2502108 x\u2502250\u2502\ngranola cookies.][Kraft laminated deli \u2502Laminate\u250279 \u2502effect to exterior, white \u250275 x \u2502 \u2502\nbag filled with granola cookies.] More \u2502d Deli \u2502 \u2502with PP laminate to \u2502218mm\u2502 \u2502\nImages ][189] \u2502Bag** \u2502 \u2502interior [Sustainability \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502Credentials][190] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Kraft laminated sandwich deli bag, \u2502**Kraft \u2502103\u2502White paper, kraft printed \u2502157 x\u2502250\u2502\nfilled with ham and coleslaw deep fill \u2502Laminate\u250276 \u2502effect to exterior, white \u250273 x \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich.][Kraft laminated sandwich deli\u2502d \u2502 \u2502with PP laminate to \u2502220mm\u2502 \u2502\nbag, filled with ham and coleslaw deep \u2502Sandwich\u2502 \u2502interior [Sustainability \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfill sandwich.] More Images ][191] \u2502Bag** \u2502 \u2502Credentials][192] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Elegance laminated sandwich deli bag,\u2502**Elegan\u2502103\u2502White paper, printed design\u2502157 x\u2502250\u2502\nfilled with prawn salad deep fill \u2502ce \u250275 \u2502to exterior, white with PP \u250273 x \u2502 \u2502\nsandwich.][Elegance laminated sandwich \u2502Laminate\u2502 \u2502laminate to interior \u2502220mm\u2502 \u2502\ndeli bag, filled with prawn salad deep \u2502d \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfill sandwich.] More Images ][193] \u2502Sandw"
