 [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Small printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, filled with cheesy\nlasagne.][Small printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, filled with\ncheesy lasagne.] ][175]\n[ [Small printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, empty, side view.][Small\nprinted kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, empty, side view.] ][176]\n[ [Medium printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, filled with lentils,\nnoodles, diced chicken, and garnish.][Medium printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with\nclear window, filled with lentils, noodles, diced chicken, and garnish.] ][177]\n[ [Medium printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, empty, front\nview.][Medium printed kraft effect microwave food box and lid with clear window, empty, front view.]\n][178]\n[ [Person taking microwave food box, filled with hot food, from hot hold cabinet.][Person taking\nmicrowave food box, filled with hot food, from hot hold cabinet.] ][179]\n\n# Microwave Food Boxes and Lids\n\n[View all product options][180]\n\nOur microwave food boxes are all microwave safe and are suitable for use in hot cabinets.\n\nThey have been specifically created for the hot food-to-go market, and for retailers that would like\nto regenerate food and then display it in hot cabinets for sale.\n\nThey are available in two sizes: small and medium, with a base and a lid. Our microwave food boxes\nare made from printed kraft effect board which has a PP coating. The lids have a large PET window so\nthat consumers can see the food contents within.\n\nOur microwave food boxes and lids are recyclable once the window has been removed and disposed of\nseparately, so the packs can be recycled after use once any food contents has been removed.\n* Recyclable\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][181]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][182]\n* [ Product Options ][183]\n* [ Lids ][184]\n* [ Alternative Products ][185]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descr\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dim\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these mean?][186]\n\u2502iptio\u2502e \u2502 \u2502ens\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502\n\u2502n \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502s \u2502pac\u2502nti\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L \u2502ity\u2502ty \u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x W\u2502 \u2502 \u2502[RECY\u2502[SUITAB\u2502[SUITAB\u2502[SHOR\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502CLABL\u2502LE FOR \u2502LE FOR \u2502T\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E \u2502MICROWA\u2502HOT \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD\u2502VE][SUI\u2502CABINET\u2502-LIFE\n\u2