ing ][85]\n* [ Bags & Inserts ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [77/65 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, filled with chicken tikka salad sandwich.][77/65\nkraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, filled with chicken tikka salad sandwich.] ][175]\n[ [68/56 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, filled with sausage, egg, and bacon sandwich.][68/56\nkraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, filled with sausage, egg, and bacon sandwich.] ][176]\n[ [78/68 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, filled with bacon, lettuce and tomato\nsandwich.][78/68 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, filled with bacon, lettuce and tomato\nsandwich.] ][177]\n[ [77/65 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, empty, front view.][77/65 kraft effect heat seal\nsandwich pack, empty, front view.] ][178]\n[ [77/65 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, empty, angled view.][77/65 kraft effect heat seal\nsandwich pack, empty, angled view.] ][179]\n[ [77/65 kraft effect heat seal sandwich pack, flat packed.][77/65 kraft effect heat seal sandwich\npack, flat packed.] ][180]\n\n# Printed Kraft Effect Heat Seal Sandwich Packs\n\n[View all product options][181]\n\nOur kraft effect, heat-seal packs can extend shelf-life and protect from grease marks.\n\nDepending on ingredients, heat-sealing can extend shelf-life by P+3 days. The PET window film\nprovides superb product visibility.\n\nOur printed kraft effect heat seal sandwich packs provide a natural and authentic look and are\nrecyclable once the window is removed and disposed of separately. They can also be custom printed to\nreflect your brand.\n\n[Packaging machinery][182] is required for the sealing of this product. We offer solutions suitable\nfor a variety of customers, from small scale back-of-house operations through to high speed in-line\nfactory production.\n* Recyclable\n* Extends product shelf-life\n* Heat sealing machinery required\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][183]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][184]\n* [ Product Options ][185]\n* [ Alternative Products ][186]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descripti\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502on \u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502e \u2502mean?][187]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ty \u2502[RECYCL\u2502[EXTENDE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502ABLE \u2502D\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][\u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502RECYCLA\u2502FE][EXTE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502NDED\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD] \u2502SHELF-LI\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502FE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250