 ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [850ml, red and white striped popcorn carton, filled with giant pink and while\nmarshmallows.][850ml, red and white striped popcorn carton, filled with giant pink and while\nmarshmallows.] ][175]\n[ [1170ml, red and white striped popcorn carton, filled with popcorn.][1170ml, red and white striped\npopcorn carton, filled with popcorn.] ][176]\n[ [1695ml, red and white striped popcorn carton, filled with gummy sweets including fried eggs,\nrings, hearts, cola bottles, and gummy bears.][1695ml, red and white striped popcorn carton, filled\nwith gummy sweets including fried eggs, rings, hearts, cola bottles, and gummy bears.] ][177]\n\n# Popcorn Cartons\n\n[View all product options][178]\n\nOur popcorn cartons are eye catching and attractive and are fantastic for serving sweet or savory\nsnacks such as popcorn, sweets, or crisps.\n\nWe have three sizes available: 850ml, 1170ml, and 1695ml. Each size is made from recyclable white\npaperboard and features a red and cream striped print.\n\nOur popcorn cartons are delivered flat and can be filled easily. They are ideal for take-away\noutlets, cinemas, leisure parks and funfairs, and concerts, to name a few!\n* Recyclable\n* Three sizes available\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][179]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][180]\n* [ Product Options ][181]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descr\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502iptio\u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502mean?][182]\n\u2502n \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502pac\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ity\u2502ty \u2502[COMPO\u2502[RECYC\u2502[SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502STABLE\u2502LABLE \u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD]\u2502BOARD]\u2502LIFE][\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502[COMPO\u2502[RECYC\u2502SHORT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502STABLE\u2502LABLE \u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD]\u2502BOARD]\u2502LIFE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [850ml, red and white striped popcorn \u2502**850\u2502101\u2502White board,\u250286/6\u2502850\u2502500\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncarton, filled with giant pink and while \u2502ml \u250222 \u2502printed \u25022 x \u2502ml/\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nmarshmallows.][850ml, red and white striped\u2502Popco\u2502 \u2502design to \u250286/6\u250230 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\npopcorn carton, filled with giant pink and \u2502rn / \u2502 \u2502exterior \u25022 x \u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwhile marshmallows.] More Images ][183] \u2502Sweet\u2502 \u2502[Sustainabil\u2502155m\u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Carto\u2502 \u2502ity \u2502m \u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502n** \u2502 \u2502Credentials]\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502[184] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [1170ml, red and white striped popcorn \u2502**117\u2502101\u2502White board,\u250292/6\u2502117\u2502500\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncarton, filled with popcorn.][1170ml, red \u25020ml \u250220 \u2502printed \u25023 x \u25020ml\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nand white striped popcorn carton, filled \u2502Popco\u2502 \u2502design to \u250292/6\u2502/41\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwith popcorn.] More Images ][185] \u2502rn / \u2502 \u2502exterior \u25023 x \u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Sweet\u2502 \u2502[Sustainabil\u2502195m\u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Carto\u2502 \u2502ity \u2502m \u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502n** \u2502 \u2502Credentials]\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502[186] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [1695ml, red and white striped popcorn \u2502**169\u2502101\u2502White board,\u2502112/\u2502169\u2502500\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncarton, filled with gummy sweets including \u25025ml \u250221 \u2502printed \u250282 x\u25025ml\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nfried eggs, rings, hearts, cola bottles, \u2502Popco\u2502 \u2502design to \u2502112/\u2502/59\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nand gummy bears.][1695ml, red and white \u2502rn / \u2502 \u2502exterior \u250282 x\u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nstriped popcorn carton, filled with gummy \u2502Sweet\u2502 \u2502[Sustainabil\u2502180m\u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsweets including fried eggs, rings, hearts,\u2502Carto\u2502 \u2502ity \u2502m \u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncola bottles, and gummy bears.] More Images\u2502n** \u2502 \u2502Credentials]\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n][187] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502[188] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u