s ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Fuzione small paperboard tray with clear lid, filled with chicken, sweetcorn, and pomegranate\nseeds.][Fuzione small paperboard tray with clear lid, filled with chicken, sweetcorn, and\npomegranate seeds.] ][175]\n[ [Fuzione medium paperboard tray with clear lid, filled with salmon, asparagus, and lemon.][Fuzione\nmedium paperboard tray with clear lid, filled with salmon, asparagus, and lemon.] ][176]\n[ [Fuzione large paperboard tray with clear lid, filled with salad leaves, rocket, radish, and\ncroutons.][Fuzione large paperboard tray with clear lid, filled with salad leaves, rocket, radish,\nand croutons.] ][177]\n[ [Close up of kraft chilled food trays, filled with sushi rolls and salad, in chiller.][Close up of\nkraft chilled food trays, filled with sushi rolls and salad, in chiller.] ][178]\n\n# Fuzione\u00ae\n\n[View all product options][179]\n\n[Fuzione^{\u00ae}][180] has several features that make it ideal for packaging chilled food-to-go.\n\nIt is made from printed kraft effect board and has a PE coating to the interior which acts as a\nmoisture and grease barrier. The lids have corner grips for easy and secure closing and align with\nthe bases for on-shelf stacking.\n\nWe have several shapes across three sizes, 522ml, 825ml, and 1053ml. They have a webbed construction\nso are leakproof.\n\nOur Fuzione^{\u00ae }boxes are made from FSC^{\u00ae} certified, recyclable paperboard. The lids are made from\nrecycled material and are also recyclable after use. Perfect for labelling to demonstrate tamper\nevidence and to showcase brand messaging.\n* FSC^{\u00ae} certified paperboard\n* Recyclable\n* Corner grips for simple closure and tight seal\n* Delivered nested\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][181]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][182]\n* [ Product Options ][183]\n* [ Lids ][184]\n* [ Alternative Products ][185]\n* [ Case Studies ][186]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Desc\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Volu\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ript\u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502me/C\u2502e \u2502mean?][187]\n\u2502ion \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502apac\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502ity \u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502 \u2502ty \u2502[RECYCL\u2502[LONGER\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ABLE \u2502SHELF-L\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][\u2502IFE][LO\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502RECYCLA\u2502NGER\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502SHELF-L\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD] \u2502IFE]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Fuzione small paperboard tray \u2502**Fu\u2502103\u2502FSC\u00ae certified white \u2502107/\u2502522m\u2502500\u2502 \u2502\nwith clear lid, filled with chicken,\u2502zion\u250242 \u2502board kraft print effect\u250284 x\u2502l / \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsweetcorn, and pomegranate \u2502e\u00ae \u2502 \u2502to exterior. White with \u250289/6\u250218.4\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nseeds.][Fuzione small paperboard \u2502Smal\u2502 \u2502PE coating to interior \u25023 x \u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ntray with clear lid, filled with \u2502l \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u250272mm\u2502fl.o\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nchicken, sweetcorn, and pomegranate \u2502Tray\u2502 \u2502Credentials][189] \u2502 \u2502z \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nseeds.] More Images ][188] \u2502** \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Fuzione medium paperboard tray \u2502**Fu\u2502103\u2502FSC\u00ae certified white \u2502160/\u2502825m\u2502500\u2502 \u2502\nwith clear lid, filled with salmon, \u2502zion\u250238 \u2502board kraft print effect\u2502140 \u2502l / \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nasparagus, and lemon.][Fuzione \u2502e\u00ae \u2502 \u2502to exterior. White to \u2502x \u250229 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nmedium paperboard tray with clear \u2502Medi\u2502 \u2502interior with PE coating\u2502120/\u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nlid, filled with salmon, asparagus, \u2502um \u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502100 \u2502fl.o\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nand lemon.] More Images ][190] \u2502Tray\u2502 \u2502Credentials][191] \u2502x \u2502z \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502** \u2502 \u2502 \u250250mm\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Fuzione large paperboard tray \u2502**Fu\u2502103\u2502FSC\u00ae certified white \u2502190/\u25021053\u2502500\u2502 \u2502\nwith clear lid, filled with salad \u2502zion\u250237 \u2502board kraft print effect\u2502170 \u2502ml /\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nleaves, rocket, radish, and \u2502e\u00ae \u2502 \u2502to exterior. White to \u2502x \u250237 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncroutons.][Fuzione large paperboard \u2502Larg\u2502 \u2502interior with PE coating\u250214"
