            "text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Paperboard Food Packaging Solutions - Sabert UK Ltd] ][2]\ntogether with Colpac\n* [Products][3]\n* ### Our **products**\n\nOur off-the-shelf food packaging solutions are designed to protect and preserve your products.\n\n[Use our packaging selector][4] [View Sabert catalogue][5]\n\n[View clearance products][6]\n\n[ [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil,\ntomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.] ][7] [\n\n### Sandwich Packaging\n\n][8]\n[ [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.] ][9] [\n\n### Chilled Food-to-Go\n\n][10]\n[ [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori\npillow packs, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.] ][11] [\n\n### Hot Food-to-Go\n\n][12]\n[ [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.] ][13] [\n\n### Party Packaging\n\n][14]\n[ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.] ][15] [\n\n### Bakery Packaging\n\n][16]\n[ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.] ][17] [\n\n### Packaging Machinery\n\n][18]\n* [About][19]\n* * [\n\nAbout\n\n][20]\n* [About Us][21]\n* [Food Packaging Certifications][22]\n* [\n\nMarkets\n\n][23]\n* [Food Delivery Packaging][24]\n* [QSR Packaging][25]\n* [Retail Food Packaging][26]\n* [Travel Packaging][27]\n