 [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Kraft, 800ml microwave food box, filled with spinach, sliced carrot, red onion, and edamame\nbeans.][Kraft, 800ml microwave food box, filled with spinach, sliced carrot, red onion, and edamame\nbeans.] ][175]\n[ [White, 985ml microwave food box, filled with lentils, red pesto, sliced salami, prawns, and red\npeppers.][White, 985ml microwave food box, filled with lentils, red pesto, sliced salami, prawns,\nand red peppers.] ][176]\n[ [Kraft, 1250ml microwave food box, filled with pie and sweet potato wedges.][Kraft, 1250ml\nmicrowave food box, filled with pie and sweet potato wedges.] ][177]\n[ [Kraft, 1950ml microwave food box, filled with tortilla chips, guacamole, grated cheddar cheese,\nsundried tomatoes, slices olives, and garnish.][Kraft, 1950ml microwave food box, filled with\ntortilla chips, guacamole, grated cheddar cheese, sundried tomatoes, slices olives, and garnish.]\n][178]\n[ [Kraft, 985ml microwave food box, closed, right side view.][Kraft, 985ml microwave food box,\nclosed, right side view.] ][179]\n\n# Microwaveable Multi-Food Boxes\n\n[View all product options][180]\n\nOur microwaveable multi-food boxes are available in a range of colours and sizes.\n\nOur natural kraft microwaveable multi-food boxes are available in a range of five sizes, ranging\nfrom 750ml to 1950ml. Our kraft boxes are made from recyclable paperboard which is microwave safe.\nThe entire range has a webbed construction and has a PP coating to the interior to provide leakproof\nsolutions.\n\nOur microwavable multi-food boxes can be used to package a range of dishes such as curries, pasta,\nnoodles. Their leakproof construction and properties mean that they are suitable for wet, acidic and\noily food types. The packs are suitable for use in the freezer, in ambient and chilled environments,\nand can be reheated in the microwave.\n* Recyclable\n* Superior grease resistance\n* Leakproof and microwave safe\n* Delivered nested\n\n[Enquire about this product][181]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][182]\n* [ Product Options ][183]\n* [ Alternative Products ][184]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descri\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dim\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these mean?][185]\n\u2502ption \u2502e \u2502 \u2502ens\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ion\u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502s \u2502pac\u2502nti\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L \u2502ity\u2502ty \u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x W\u2502 \u2502 \u2502[RECY\u2502[SUITAB\u2502[SUITA\u2502[SHOR\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502CLABL\u2502LE FOR \u2502BLE \u2502T\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E \u2502MICROWA\u2502FOR \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD\u2502VE][SUI\u2502FREEZE\u2502-LIFE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502][REC\u2502TABLE \u2502R][SUI\u2502][SHO\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502YCLAB\u2502FOR \u2502TABLE \u2502RT\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LE \u2502MICROWA\u2502FOR \u2502SHELF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD\u2502VE] \u2502FREEZE\u2502-LIFE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502] \u2502 \u2502R] \u2502]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Kraft, 750ml microwave food box, \u2502**Micr\u2502101\u2502Kraft board \u2502118\u2502750\u2502250\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nclosed, angled view.][Kraft, 750ml \u2502owavea\u250211 \u2502to exterior. \u2502/84\u2502ml/\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nmicrowave food box, closed, angled \u2502ble \u2502 \u2502White with PP\u2502x \u250226 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nview.] More Images ][186] \u2502750ml \u2502 \u2502coating to \u250297/\u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Kraft \u2502 \u2502interior \u250263 \u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Multi-\u2502 \u2502[Sustainabili\u2502x \u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Food \u2502 \u2502ty \u250292m\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502Box** \u2502 \u2502Credentials][\u2502m \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502187] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25