ing ][85]\n* [ Bags & Inserts ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Heat seal square cut sandwich pack, filled with pastrami and coleslaw sandwiches.][Heat seal\nsquare cut sandwich pack, filled with pastrami and coleslaw sandwiches.] ][175]\n[ [Heat seal square cut sandwich pack, empty, front view.][Heat seal square cut sandwich pack,\nempty, front view.] ][176]\n[ [Heat seal square cut sandwich pack, empty, angled view.][Heat seal square cut sandwich pack,\nempty, angled view.] ][177]\n[ [Heat seal square cut sandwich pack, flat packed.][Heat seal square cut sandwich pack, flat\npacked.] ][178]\n\n# Heat Seal Square Cut Sandwich Pack\n\n[View all product options][179]\n\nOur heat seal square cut sandwich packs provide effective solutions to extend product shelf-life.\n\nThe^{ }heat seal packs are manufactured from FSC^{\u00ae} certified, white board which has a printed\nkraft effect to the exterior. Our heat seal square cut sandwich packs are recyclable.\n\nHeat sealing can be done using tabletop or large-scale machinery. Speak to our sales representatives\nabout our machinery products or visit our [packaging machinery][180] pages.\n\nThese packs are suitable for a multitude of food outlets, as well as catering for meetings and\nevents.\n* Recyclable\n* Heat sealed to extend shelf-life\n* Suitable for two deep filled sandwich halves\n* Delivered flat\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][181]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][182]\n* [ Product Options ][183]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descript\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these\n\u2502ion \u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502e \u2502mean?][184]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ty \u2502[RECYCLA\u2502[EXTENDED\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502BLE \u2502SHELF-LIF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD][R\u2502E][EXTEND\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ECYCLABL\u2502ED\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E BOARD]\u2502SHELF-LIF\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502E]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Heat seal square cut sandwich \u2502**Heat \u2502102\u2502White board, kraft \u2502125 \u2502500\u2502 \u2502\npack, filled with pastrami and \u2502Seal \u250244 \u2502effect print to \u2502x 77\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ncoleslaw sandwiches.][Heat seal \u2502Square \u2502 \u2502exterior. PE coating to \u2502x \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsquare cut sandwich pack, filled \u2502Cut \u2502 \u2502interior. PET window \u250272mm\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nwith pastrami and coleslaw \u2502Sandwich\u2502 \u2502[Sustainability \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nsandwiches.] More Images ][185] \u2502Pack** \u2502 \u2502Credentials][186] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are made from recycled plastic material (rPET).\n[RECYCLABLE BOARD][RECYCLABLE BOARD] RECYCLABLE BOARD\nThe board for these products is recyclable.\n[RECYCLED BOARD][RECYCLED BOARD] RECYCLED BOARD\nThe board for these products is made from recycled material.\n[SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE][SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE] SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE\nThe product is suitable for microwave use.\n[SUITABLE FOR OVEN][SUITABLE FOR OVEN] SUITABLE FOR OVEN\nThe product is suitable for oven use.\n[SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET][SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET] SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET\nThe product is suitable for use in hot cabinets.\n[SUITABLE FOR FREEZER][SUITABLE FOR FREEZER] SUITABLE FOR FREEZER\nThe product is suitable for freezer use.\n[SHORT SHELF-LIFE][SHORT SHELF-LIFE] SHORT SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with a shorter shelf-life.\n[LONGER SHELF-LIFE][LONGER SHELF-LIFE] LONGER SHELF-LIFE\nProduct with a longer shelf-li"
          },
