 ][86]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][87]\n* [ Platter Trays ][88]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][89] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][90]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][91]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][92] Back\n* [ Pots ][93]\n* [ Boxes ][94]\n* [ Trays ][95]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][96]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][97]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][98] Back\n* [ Boxes ][99]\n* [ Pots ][100]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][101] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][102]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][105]\n* [ Combi Trays ][106]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][107]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][108]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][109] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][110]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][112]\n* [ Party ][113]\n* [ Drinks ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n* [ About ][116]\n[About][117] Back\n* [ About Us ][118]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][119]\n* [ Markets ][120]\n[Markets][121] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][122]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][123]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][124]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][125]\n* [ Bespoke ][126]\n[Bespoke][127] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][128]\n* [ Case Studies ][129]\n* [ Brands ][130]\n[Brands][131] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][132]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][133]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][134]\n* [ Souper Pots ][135]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][136]\n* [ Sustainability ][137]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][138]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][139]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][140]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][142]\n* [ Resources ][143]\n* [ News ][144]\n[News][145] Back\n* [ Certifications ][146]\n* [ Company ][147]\n* [ Products ][148]\n* [ Sustainability ][149]\n* [ See all News ][150]\n* [ FAQs ][151]\n[FAQs][152] Back\n* [ Operations ][153]\n* [ Product ][154]\n* [ Sales ][155]\n* [ Sustainability ][156]\n* [ See all FAQs ][157]\n* [ Case Studies ][158]\n[Case Studies][159] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][160]\n* [ Delivered Food ][161]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][162]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][163]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][164]\n* [ Resources ][165]\n[Resources][166] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][167]\n* [ Flyers ][168]\n* [ Videos ][169]\n* [ See all Resources ][170]\n* [ Contact ][171]\n[Packaging Selector][172] [View Sabert catalogue][173]\n[Packaging Selector][174]\n[ [Natural kraft, Stagione PE 500ml rectangular pot filled with black and green olives, sundried\ntomatoes, and salad.][Natural kraft, Stagione PE 500ml rectangular pot filled with black and green\nolives, sundried tomatoes, and salad.] ][175]\n[ [Natural kraft, Stagione PE 500ml rectangular pot with clear lid, empty, angled view.][Natural\nkraft, Stagione PE 500ml rectangular pot with clear lid, empty, angled view.] ][176]\n[ [Natural kraft, Stagione PE 750ml rectangular pot with clear lid, empty, angled view.][Natural\nkraft, Stagione PE 750ml rectangular pot with clear lid, empty, angled view.] ][177]\n[ [Natural kraft, Stagione PE 1000ml rectangular pot with clear lid, empty, angled view.][Natural\nkraft, Stagione PE 1000ml rectangular pot with clear lid, empty, angled view.] ][178]\n\n# Stagione\u00ae PE Coated Pots and Lids\n\n[View all product options][179]\n\nOur Stagione^{\u00ae} PE coated pots are suitable for packaging and displaying chilled food-to-go or hot\ndishes.\n\nWe offer three sizes of our Stagione^{\u00ae} PE coated pots, in 500ml, 750ml, and 1000ml. Our\nStagione^{\u00ae} PE coated range offers the same high quality as our [Stagione^{\u00ae }PP coated\nrange][180], but with a different specification and functionality.\n\nOur Stagione^{\u00ae} PE coated range is an ideal pack for chilled foods, such as salads and pastas. It\ncan also be used to serve instant eat hot food, or in hot-hold cabinets subject to specific\nguidelines. *\n\nOne lid size fits all three pots within our PE coated range. We offer two lid variations to cater\nfor different usages. Our rPET lids with anti-mist coating remain clear in chilled cabinets. Our\nsingle skinned self-venting paperboard lid is ideal for hot and delivered foods, providing heat\nretention and ventilation.\n\nSee full [Stagione^{\u00ae} range][181]\n\n** ***contact us for further information\n* Recyclable\n* Delivered nested\n* Custom print available\n\n[Enquire about this product][182]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][183]\n* [ Product Options ][184]\n* [ Lids ][185]\n* [ Alternative Products ][186]\n* [ Case Studies ][187]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Descr\u2502Cod\u2502Material \u2502Dime\u2502Vol\u2502Cas\u2502[What do these mean?][188]\n\u2502iptio\u2502e \u2502 \u2502nsio\u2502ume\u2502e \u2502\n\u2502n \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ns \u2502/Ca\u2502Qua\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L x\u2502pac\u2502nti\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502W x \u2502ity\u2502ty \u2502[RECYC\u2502[SUITABL\u2502[SUITAB\u2502[LONGE\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LABLE \u2502E FOR \u2502LE FOR \u2502R\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD]\u2502HOT \u2502FREEZER\u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502[RECYC\u2502CABINET]\u2502][SUITA\u2502LIFE][\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502LABLE \u2502[SUITABL\u2502BLE FOR\u2502LONGER\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502BOARD]\u2502E FOR \u2502FREEZER\u2502SHELF-\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502HOT \u2502] \u2502LIFE]\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502CABINET]\u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Natural kraft, Stagione PE \u2502**Sta\u2502103\u2502Kraft \u2502171 \u2502500\u2502300\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n500ml rectangular pot filled with \u2502gione\u250292 \u2502board, PE \u2502/ \u2502ml \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nblack and green olives, sundried \u2502\u00ae PE \u2502 \u2502coating to \u2502152 \u2502/ \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ntomatoes, and salad.][Natural \u2502500ml\u2502 \u2502interior \u2502x \u250217.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nkraft, Stagione PE 500ml \u2502Kraft\u2502 \u2502[Sustainabi\u2502118 \u25025 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nrectangular pot filled with black \u2502Base*\u2502 \u2502lity \u2502/ \u2502UK \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nand green olives, sundried \u2502* \u2502 \u2502Credentials\u2502100 \u2502fl.\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\ntomatoes, and salad.] More Images \u2502 \u2502 \u2502][190] \u2502x \u2502oz \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n][189] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u250240mm\u2502 \u2502 \u