57]\n[Case Studies][158] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][159]\n* [ Delivered Food ][160]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][161]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][162]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n[Resources][165] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][166]\n* [ Flyers ][167]\n* [ Videos ][168]\n* [ See all Resources ][169]\n* [ Contact ][170]\n[Packaging Selector][171] [View Sabert catalogue][172]\n[Packaging Selector][173]\n[ [Stainless steel impulse sealer machine with manual operation to seal packaging.][Stainless steel\nimpulse sealer machine with manual operation to seal packaging.] ][174]\n\n# ColSeal\u2122 Impulse Sealer\n\n[View all product options][175]\n\nOur ColSeal\u2122 Impulse Sealer is a manual, hand operated clamp sealer.\n\nIt is quick and efficient to set up and use back of store, catering and production environments or\nfor demonstrations.\n\nOur ColSeal\u2122 Impulse sealer is easy and safe to operate on small work surfaces. It weighs 2kg and is\nideal for sealing PP and PE film for bags/trays. It is suitable for our [Clasp^{\u00ae}][176] products\nand other bag and lay-flat tube packaging to hold baguettes, paninis, sandwiches, pies, toasties and\nmore.\n\nIt has an integral sliding cutter blade that makes sealing or combined sealing and cutting easy. The\nsealing temperature is adjustable, and its simple design makes it safe and easy to operate. It\nrequires minimal maintenance and is easy to clean thoroughly and quickly.\n* Film sealer with integral sliding cutter blade\n* Efficient processing of film for bags/trays (up to 200mm wide)\n* Seals polypropylene (PP) and polyethylene (PE)\n* Light weight \u2013 can be bench or work surface mounted\n* Easy to clean\n\n[Enquire about this product][177]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][178]\n* [ Product Options ][179]\n* [ Resources ][180]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Cod\u2502Descrip\u2502Produ\u2502Sealing \u2502Dimens\u2502Wei\u2502Power\n\u2502e \u2502tion \u2502ction\u2502Capacity \u2502ions \u2502ght\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502Speed\u2502 \u2502(L x W\u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502x H) \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Stainless steel impulse sealer machine with \u2502**1\u2502ColSeal\u2502Varia\u2502Length <200mm \u2502310 x \u25022kg\u2502230V x\nmanual operation to seal packaging.][Stainless \u2502134\u2502\u2122 \u2502ble \u2502in width, \u250280 x \u2502 \u25021-phas\nsteel impulse sealer machine with manual \u25026**\u2502Impulse\u2502 \u2502optional 300mm \u2502140mm \u2502 \u2502e x\noperation to seal packaging.] ][181] \u2502 \u2502Sealer \u2502 \u2502available \u2502 \u2502 \u250250Hz\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Screenshot of Colpac's impulse sealer video.][Screenshot of Colpac's impulse sealer video.]\nVideos\n\n### ColSeal\u2122 Impulse Sealer Video\n\n][182]\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are made from recycled plastic material (rPET).\n[RECYCLABLE BOARD][RECYCLABLE BOARD] RECYCLABLE BOARD\nThe board for these products is recyclable.\n[RECYCLED BOARD][RECYCLED BOARD] RECYCLED BOARD\nThe board for these products is made from recycled material.\n[SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE][SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE] SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE\nThe product is suitable for microwave use.\n[SUITABLE FOR OVEN][SUITABLE FOR OVEN] SUITABLE FOR OVEN\nThe product is suitable for oven use.\n[SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET][SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET] SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET\nThe product is suitable for use in hot cabinets.\n[SUITABLE FOR FREEZER][SUITABLE FOR FREEZER] SUITABLE FOR FREEZER\nThe product is suitable for freezer use.\n[SHORT SHELF-LIFE][SHORT SHELF-LIFE] SHORT SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with a shorter shelf-life.\n[LONGER SHELF-LIFE][LONGER SHELF-LIFE] LONGER SHELF-LIFE\nProduct with a longer shelf-life.\n[EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE][EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE] EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with an extended shelf-life.\n\n**Glossary**\n\nIn our material descriptions we use abbreviations, this glossary explains the materials.\n\n*"
