 kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][106]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][107]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][108] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][109]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][110]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Party ][112]\n* [ Drinks ][113]\n* [ About ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n[About][116] Back\n* [ About Us ][117]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][118]\n* [ Markets ][119]\n[Markets][120] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][121]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][122]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][123]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][124]\n* [ Bespoke ][125]\n[Bespoke][126] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][127]\n* [ Case Studies ][128]\n* [ Brands ][129]\n[Brands][130] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][131]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][132]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][133]\n* [ Souper Pots ][134]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][135]\n* [ Sustainability ][136]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][137]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][138]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][139]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][140]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Resources ][142]\n* [ News ][143]\n[News][144] Back\n* [ Certifications ][145]\n* [ Company ][146]\n* [ Products ][147]\n* [ Sustainability ][148]\n* [ See all News ][149]\n* [ FAQs ][150]\n[FAQs][151] Back\n* [ Operations ][152]\n* [ Product ][153]\n* [ Sales ][154]\n* [ Sustainability ][155]\n* [ See all FAQs ][156]\n* [ Case Studies ][157]\n[Case Studies][158] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][159]\n* [ Delivered Food ][160]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][161]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][162]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n[Resources][165] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][166]\n* [ Flyers ][167]\n* [ Videos ][168]\n* [ See all Resources ][169]\n* [ Contact ][170]\n[Packaging Selector][171] [View Sabert catalogue][172]\n[Packaging Selector][173]\n[ [Stainless steel sealing machine with manual handle on the right hand side.][Stainless steel\nsealing machine with manual handle on the right hand side.] ][174]\n\n# ColSeal\u2122 CT200 Manual Heat Sealer\n\n[View all product options][175]\n\nOur ColSeal\u2122 CT200 is a hand operated, multi-functional heat and film sealer.\n\nThis machine is easy to use and has adjustable seal temperature, meaning it can be used to seal\ndifferent films. It is quick to set up and is made from food grade S304 stainless steel.\n\nOur ColSeal\u2122 CT200 can be used to seal our range of [heat seal packaging][176] and our\n[Stagione^{\u00ae}][177] range. It can also be used to seal other [salad boxes][178] and trays, so this\nsmall and lightweight sealer offers versatility.\n\nOur ColSeal\u2122 CT200 is ideal for use in coffee shops, retail outlets, and catering environments.\n* Heat and film sealer\n* Adjustable seal temperature\n* Seals heat seal packaging\n* Light weight \u2013 can be bench or work surface mounted\n* Easy to clean\n\n[Enquire about this product][179]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][180]\n* [ Product Options ][181]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Cod\u2502Descriptio\u2502Production Speed\u2502Seali\u2502Dimens\u2502Wei\u2502Power\n\u2502e \u2502n \u2502 \u2502ng \u2502ions \u2502ght\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502Capac\u2502(L x W\u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ity \u2502x H) \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Stainless steel sealing machine with \u2502**1\u2502ColSeal\u2122 \u2502Variable <400 \u2502200 x\u2502550 x \u250221k\u2502230V\nmanual handle on the right hand \u2502134\u2502CT200 \u2502units/hour \u2502260mm\u2502270 x \u2502g \u2502or\nside.][Stainless steel sealing machine with \u25023**\u2502Manual \u2502(subject to load\u2502 \u2502310mm \u2502 \u2502110V\nmanual handle on the right hand side.] \u2502 \u2502Heat \u2502and reload) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u25021-phas\n][182] \u2502 \u2502Sealer \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502e\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[COMPOSTABLE BOARD][COMPOSTABLE BOARD] COMPOSTABLE BOARD\nThe paperboard material in these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard), where facilities are available.\n[COMPOSTABLE WINDOW][COMPOSTABLE WINDOW] COMPOSTABLE WINDOW\nThe film material used for these products is commercially compostable within 90 days (EN13432\nstandard).\n[RECYCLABLE][RECYCLABLE] RECYCLABLE\nThe plastic lids/window films used for these products are recyclable.\n[RECYCLED LID][RECYCLED LID] RECYCLED LID\nThe lids for these products are made from recycled plastic material (rPET).\n[RECYCLABLE BOARD][RECYCLABLE BOARD] RECYCLABLE BOARD\nThe board for these products is recyclable.\n[RECYCLED BOARD][RECYCLED BOARD] RECYCLED BOARD\nThe board for these products is made from recycled material.\n[SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE][SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE] SUITABLE FOR MICROWAVE\nThe product is suitable for microwave use.\n[SUITABLE FOR OVEN][SUITABLE FOR OVEN] SUITABLE FOR OVEN\nThe product is suitable for oven use.\n[SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET][SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET] SUITABLE FOR HOT CABINET\nThe product is suitable for use in hot cabinets.\n[SUITABLE FOR FREEZER][SUITABLE FOR FREEZER] SUITABLE FOR FREEZER\nThe product is suitable for freezer use.\n[SHORT SHELF-LIFE][SHORT SHELF-LIFE] SHORT SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with a shorter shelf-life.\n[LONGER SHELF-LIFE][LONGER SHELF-LIFE] LONGER SHELF-LIFE\nProduct with a longer shelf-life.\n[EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE][EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE] EXTENDED SHELF-LIFE\nProducts with an extended shelf-life.\n\n**Glossary**\n\nIn our material descriptions we use abbreviations, this glossary explains the materials.\n\n**GMO** \u2013 Genetically Modified Organism\n**PE** \u2013 Polyethylene\n**PET** \u2013 Polyethylene Terephthalate\n**PLA** \u2013 Polylactic Acid**\n**PP**** \u2013 Polypropylene\n\n## Product **enquiry**\n\nComplete the form below and we will get back to you as soon as possible.\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nPhone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n\n* First Name*\n* Surname*\n* Email*\n* Phon"
