            "text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Paperboard Food Packaging Solutions - Sabert UK Ltd] ][2]\ntogether with Colpac\n* [Products][3]\n* ### Our **products**\n\nOur off-the-shelf food packaging solutions are designed to protect and preserve your products.\n\n[Use our packaging selector][4] [View Sabert catalogue][5]\n\n[View clearance products][6]\n\n[ [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil,\ntomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.] ][7] [\n\n### Sandwich Packaging\n\n][8]\n[ [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.] ][9] [\n\n### Chilled Food-to-Go\n\n][10]\n[ [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori\npillow packs, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.] ][11] [\n\n### Hot Food-to-Go\n\n][12]\n[ [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.] ][13] [\n\n### Party Packaging\n\n][14]\n[ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.] ][15] [\n\n### Bakery Packaging\n\n][16]\n[ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.] ][17] [\n\n### Packaging Machinery\n\n][18]\n* [About][19]\n* * [\n\nAbout\n\n][20]\n* [About Us][21]\n* [Food Packaging Certifications][22]\n* [\n\nMarkets\n\n][23]\n* [Food Delivery Packaging][24]\n* [QSR Packaging][25]\n* [Retail Food Packaging][26]\n* [Travel Packaging][27]\n* [\n\nBespoke\n\n][28]\n* [Custom Food Packaging][29]\n* [Case Studies][30]\n* [\n\nBrands\n\n][31]\n* [Clasp\u00ae][32]\n* [Multi-Food Pots][33]\n* [Stagione\u00ae][34]\n* [Souper Pots][35]\n* [Zest\u2122][36]\n\nNEW Case Study\n\nDirect Food Contact Inks\n\n][37]\n* [Sustainability][38]\n* [Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR)][39]\n\n[Business as a Force for Good][40]\n\n[Packaging Sustainability][41]\n\n[Recyclable Food Packaging][42]\n\n[Compostable Food Packaging][43]\n\nResource\n\nDownload ESG Report\n\n][44]\n* [Resources][45]\n* * [\n\nNews\n\n][46]\n* [Certifications][47]\n* [Company][48]\n* [Products][49]\n* [Sustainability][50]\n* [See all News][51]\n* [\n\nFAQs\n\n][52]\n* [Operations][53]\n* [Product][54]\n* [Sales][55]\n* [Sustainability][56]\n* [See all FAQs][57]\n* [\n\nCase Studies\n\n][58]\n* [Chilled Food-to-Go][59]\n* [Delivered Food][60]\n* [Hot Food-to-Go][61]\n* [Sandwich Packaging][62]\n* [See all Case Studies][63]\n* [\n\nResources\n\n][64]\n* [Catalogues][65]\n* [Flyers][66]\n* [Videos][67]\n* [See all Resources][68]\n\nNEW Video\n\nOur Paperboard Expertise\n\n][69]\n* [Contact][70]\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][71]\n[Search][Search]\n[Home][72] / [Products][73] / [Packaging Machinery][74] / Products\n[ [Paperboard Food Packaging Solutions - Sabert UK Ltd] ][75] together with Colpac\n[Phone][Phone]\n][76]\n[Search][Search]\n[Search][Search]\n* [ Products ][77]\n* [Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of fillings. Bread, basil, tomatoes,\nand kitchen towels in background.][Black and kraft same day sandwich packaging, with variety of\nfillings. Bread, basil, tomatoes, and kitchen towels in background.]\n\nSandwich Packaging\n\n[Sandwich Packaging][78] Back\n* [ Same Day Sandwich Packaging ][79]\n* [ Longer Shelf-Life Sandwich Packaging ][80]\n* [ Extended Shelf-Life Sandwich Packaging ][81]\n* [ Square Cut Sandwich Packaging ][82]\n* [ Wrap Packaging ][83]\n* [ Baguette Packaging ][84]\n* [ Bags & Inserts ][85]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packaging ][86]\n* [ Platter Trays ][87]\n* [Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging solutions on black table. Includes boxes and\npots, all filled with different salads.][Overhead shot of lots of chilled food packaging\nsolutions on black table. Includes boxes and pots, all filled with different salads.]\n\nChilled Food-to-Go\n\n[Chilled Food-to-Go][88] Back\n* [ Salad Pots ][89]\n* [ Salad Boxes ][90]\n* [Range of kraft hot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow\npacks, and souper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.][Range of kraft\nhot food-to-go packaging in black hot cabinet, including Stagione, Savori pillow packs, and\nsouper pots, with contents details in front of each packaging type.]\n\nHot Food-to-Go\n\n[Hot Food-to-Go][91] Back\n* [ Pots ][92]\n* [ Boxes ][93]\n* [ Trays ][94]\n* [ Cones & Scoops ][95]\n* [ Hot Sandwich Packs ][96]\n* [Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being eaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad,\ncurry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.][Takeaway food packaging on wooden table, being\neaten from. Filled with prawns, sushi, salad, curry, noodles, and tomato pasta with meatballs.]\n\nDelivered Food\n\n[Delivered Food][97] Back\n* [ Boxes ][98]\n* [ Pots ][99]\n* [Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food packaging including meal boxes and paperboard\ntoys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.][Selection of Colpac's sustainable party food\npackaging including meal boxes and paperboard toys, surrounded by balloons and streamers.]\n\nParty Packaging\n\n[Party Packaging][100] Back\n* [ Meal Box Kits ][101]\n* [ Patterned Meal Boxes ][102]\n* [ Seasonal Meal Boxes ][103]\n* [ Coloured Meal Boxes ][104]\n* [ Combi Trays ][105]\n* [ [Spread of bakery packaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes,\ndressed with cake stand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.][Spread of bakery\npackaging including small kraft slice boxes, white boxes full of cupcakes, dressed with cake\nstand, wooden board, and pink and white celebration cake.]\n\nBakery Packaging\n\n][106]\n* [ [Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by machine\noperative.][Heat seal packaging for sandwiches in silver machine, about to be heat sealed by\nmachine operative.]\n\nPackaging Machinery\n\n][107]\n* [Overhead shot of black Combione salad tray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet.\nFilled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes, and salad leaves.][Overhead shot of black Combione salad\ntray, Colpac special offers product, in chilled cabinet. Filled with sweetcorn, plum tomatoes,\nand salad leaves.]\n\nClearance\n\n[Clearance][108] Back\n* [ Sandwich Packs ][109]\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][110]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][111]\n* [ Party ][112]\n* [ Drinks ][113]\n* [ About ][114]\n* [ About ][115]\n[About][116] Back\n* [ About Us ][117]\n* [ Food Packaging Certifications ][118]\n* [ Markets ][119]\n[Markets][120] Back\n* [ Food Delivery Packaging ][121]\n* [ QSR Packaging ][122]\n* [ Retail Food Packaging ][123]\n* [ Travel Packaging ][124]\n* [ Bespoke ][125]\n[Bespoke][126] Back\n* [ Custom Food Packaging ][127]\n* [ Case Studies ][128]\n* [ Brands ][129]\n[Brands][130] Back\n* [ Clasp\u00ae ][131]\n* [ Multi-Food Pots ][132]\n* [ Stagione\u00ae ][133]\n* [ Souper Pots ][134]\n* [ Zest\u2122 ][135]\n* [ Sustainability ][136]\n* [ Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) ][137]\n* [ Business as a Force for Good ][138]\n* [ Packaging Sustainability ][139]\n* [ Recyclable Food Packaging ][140]\n* [ Compostable Food Packaging ][141]\n* [ Resources ][142]\n* [ News ][143]\n[News][144] Back\n* [ Certifications ][145]\n* [ Company ][146]\n* [ Products ][147]\n* [ Sustainability ][148]\n* [ See all News ][149]\n* [ FAQs ][150]\n[FAQs][151] Back\n* [ Operations ][152]\n* [ Product ][153]\n* [ Sales ][154]\n* [ Sustainability ][155]\n* [ See all FAQs ][156]\n* [ Case Studies ][157]\n[Case Studies][158] Back\n* [ Chilled Food-to-Go ][159]\n* [ Delivered Food ][160]\n* [ Hot Food-to-Go ][161]\n* [ Sandwich Packaging ][162]\n* [ See all Case Studies ][163]\n* [ Resources ][164]\n[Resources][165] Back\n* [ Catalogues ][166]\n* [ Flyers ][167]\n* [ Videos ][168]\n* [ See all Resources ][169]\n* [ Contact ][170]\n[Packaging Selector][171] [View Sabert catalogue][172]\n[Packaging Selector][173]\n[ [Stainless steel automatic sealing machine on wheels.][Stainless steel automatic sealing machine\non wheels.] ][174]\n\n# ColSeal\u2122 FSL195 Automatic Inline Heat Sealing Machine\n\n[View all product options][175]\n\nOur ColSeal\u2122 FSL195 is an automatic conveyor, lidder and sealer for high volume manufacturers.\n\nIt is suitable for [heat seal packaging][176] including sandwiches, wraps, baguette packs, [salad\npots][177], [microwave soup pots][178], and [Stagione^{\u00ae} pots][179]. The ColSeal\u2122 FSL195 runs at\n20 cycles per minute, sealing plate has a Teflon coating, and the sealing area capacity is 170 x\n195mm.\n\nThe FSL195 weighs 378kg and has feet and wheels for maximum flexibility. This sealer requires a\nsingle 3 phase socket (415-volt, 50 Hz, 16 amp) and clean air supply at 6 bar pressure and 9CFM.\n\nThis includes adjustable tooling, and we have longer length conveyor options available for larger\nmanufacturers. Standard construction is left-to-right operation; however, a right-to-left operation\nis also available on request. In addition, a film sealing unit and a date coder can be added as\noptions.\n* 20 cycles per minute\n* Film sealing option available\n* Day/date coder optional\n* Air compressor supplier separately\n\n[Enquire about this product][180]\nCall the sales team on\n[+44 (0) 1525 712 261][181]\n* [ Product Options ][182]\nSwipe right to see more tabs & table info\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502Cod\u2502Description \u2502Produc\u2502Sealin\u2502Dimensio\u2502Wei\u2502Power\n\u2502e \u2502 \u2502tion \u2502g \u2502ns \u2502ght\u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502Speed \u2502Capaci\u2502(L x W x\u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ty \u2502H) \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ [Stainless steel automatic sealing \u2502**1\u2502ColSeal\u2122 FSL195 \u250220 \u2502170 x \u25022500 x \u2502378\u2502415V x\nmachine on wheels.][Stainless steel \u2502177\u2502Automatic Inline \u2502cycles\u2502195mm \u2502864 x \u2502kg \u25023-phase x\nautomatic sealing machine on wheels.]\u25022**\u2502Heat Sealing Machine\u2502/minut\u2502 \u25021183mm \u2502 \u250250Hz x 16A\n][183] \u2502 \u2502 \u2502e \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u250