      "company_summary": "Cryopak is a leading provider of cold chain packaging solutions, specializing in temperature-controlled packaging designed to maintain product integrity across various industries, including pharmaceuticals, food and beverage, retail, and cannabis. The company offers a comprehensive range of services, including package testing, temperature monitoring, and sustainable refrigerants, ensuring optimal thermal performance and compliance with industry standards. With a commitment to innovation and sustainability, Cryopak delivers engineered solutions that meet the unique needs of its clients worldwide.",
