ns][53]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][54]\n  * [Refrigerants][55]\n  * [Retail][56]\n  * [Temperature Monitoring][57]\n* [Services][58]\n  * [R3 Reuse Program][59]\n  * [Package Testing][60]\n  * [Temperature Mapping][61]\n  * [Thermal Equipment Qualification][62]\n  * [Shipping Lane Mapping][63]\n  * [CFD Modeling and Thermal Simulation][64]\n* [Industries][65]\n  * [Pharma][66]\n  * [Food & Beverage][67]\n  * [Retail][68]\n  * [Cannabis][69]\n* [About][70]\n  * [Company Overview][71]\n  * [Integreon Global][72]\n  * [Careers][73]\n* [Contact][74]\n* [News and Events][75]\nNexBlu\nRing Series\nGraphite\nExpanded\nPolystyrene\nCoolers A Greener Way to Protect\nWhat Matters Engineered\nSustainable\nSolutions and\nOptimized Thermal\nPerformance Contact us to learn more\n\n## Experts in\n\n## Cold Chain Solutions\n\nInnovating and delivering sustainable temperature control solutions worldwide.\n\n[Contact Our Sales Team][76] [Contact Us to Learn More][77] Summer Mapping Ensure Your Product\nStability Amidst Hot Temperatures\n\n# Cold Chain Packaging Design, Engineering and Testing\n\nCryopak is a complete cold chain packaging solutions provider specializing in the field of\ntemperature-controlled packaging. From needs assessment to package qualification, Cryopak handles\nyour packaging projects with one paramount goal: Maintaining the integrity of your products. Our\nmaterials and processes cover the spectrum from converting EPS or fabricating boxes to manufacturing\nphase change materials and temperature monitors.\n\n[ [Cold-chain-Packaging-icon][Cold-chain-Packaging-icon] ][78]\n\n#### [Cold-chain Packaging][79]\n\n[ [Refrigerants][Refrigerants] ][80]\n\n#### [Refrigerants][81]\n\n[ [Temperature Monitoring][Temperature Monitoring] ][82]\n\n#### [Temperature Monitoring][83]\n\n[ [CryopakBucketRetail][CryopakBucketRetail] ][84]\n\n#### [Cryopak Retail][85]\n\n## Services\n\nCryopak offers a wide range of services to go along with our one-of-a-kind solutions. From testing\nand qualification to recycling and reuse, we are a full-service company ready to provide you with\nwhat you need.\n\n[ Learn More ][86]\n[all-products---CPA-CDI--enhanced-sh][all-products---CPA-CDI--enhanced-sh]\n* ### Helping the cannabis industry\n  \n  Prevent mold growth without [Skip to content][1]\n\n\nEnglish\n* English\n* Fran\u00e7ais\n* Espa\u00f1ol\n* Deutsch\n* Nederlands\n* Italiano\n* Portugu\u00eas\n* \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439\n* \u4e2d\u6587\n[ [Cryopak-colour-bk.svg] ][2]\n* [Solutions ][3]\n  \n  ##### Solutions\n  \n  ##### [Cold Chain\n  ##### Packaging][4]\n  \n  [ [Cold Chain Packaging] ][5]\n  \n  ##### [Refrigerants][6]\n  \n  [ [Refrigerants] ][7]\n  \n  ##### [Shop Reusable Ice Packs & Ice Cubes][8]\n  \n  [ [Retail] ][9]\n  \n  ##### [Temperature Monitoring][10]\n  \n  [ [Temperature Monitoring] ][11]\n* [Services ][12]\n  \n  ##### Services\n  \n  ##### [R3 Reuse\n  ##### Program][13]\n  \n  [ [R3 Reuse Program] ][14]\n  \n  ##### [Package Testing][15]\n  \n  [ [Package Testing] ][16]\n  \n  ##### [Temperature\n  ##### Mapping][17]\n  \n  [ [Temperature Mapping] ][18]\n  \n  ##### [Thermal Equipment Qualification][19]\n  \n  [ [Thermal Equipment Qualification] ][20]\n  \n  ##### [Shipping Lane Mapping][21]\n  \n  [ [Shipping Lane Mapping] ][22]\n  \n  ##### [CFD Modeling and Thermal Simulation][23]\n  \n  [ [CFD Modeling and Thermal Simulation] ][24]\n* [Industries ][25]\n  \n  ##### Industries\n  \n  ##### [Pharma][26]\n  \n  [ [Pharma] ][27]\n  \n  ##### [Food & Beverage][28]\n  \n  [ [Food & Beverage] ][29]\n  \n  ##### [Retail][30]\n  \n  [ [Retail] ][31]\n  \n  ##### [Cannabis][32]\n  \n  [ [Cannabis] ][33]\n* [About ][34]\n  \n  ##### About\n  \n  ##### [Company Overview][35]\n  \n  [ [Company Overview] ][36]\n  \n  ##### [Integreon Global][37]\n  \n  [ [Integreon Global] ][38]\n  \n  ##### [Careers][39]\n  \n  [ [Careers] ][40]\n* [Resources ][41]\n  \n  ##### Resources\n  \n  ##### [News & Articles][42]\n  \n  [ [News Articles] ][43]\n  \n  ##### [Cryopak Blog][44]\n  \n  [ [Cryopak Blog] ][45]\n  \n  ##### [How to Recycle and Reuse][46]\n  \n  [ [Recycling] ][47]\n  \n  ##### [FAQs][48]\n  \n  [ [FAQs icon] ][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n[\u00d7][51]\n* [Home][52]\n* [Solutions][53]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][54]\n  * [Refrigerants][55]\n  * [Retail][56]\n  * [Temperature Monitoring][57]\n* [Services][58]\n  * [R3 Reuse Program][59]\n  * [Package Testing][60]\n  * [Temperature Mapping][61]\n  * [Thermal Equipment Qualification][62]\n  * [Shipping Lane Mapping][63]\n  * [CFD Modeling and Thermal Simulation][64]\n* [Industries][65]\n  * [Pharma][66]\n  * [Food & Beverage][67]\n  * [Retail][68]\n  * [Cannabis][69]\n* [About][70]\n  * [Company Overview][71]\n  * [Integreon Global][72]\n  * [Careers][73]\n* [Contact][74]\n* [News and Events][75]\nNexBlu\nRing Series\nGraphite\nExpanded\nPolystyrene\nCoolers A Greener Way to Protect\nWhat Matters Engineered\nSustainable\nSolutions and\nOptimized Thermal\nPerformance Contact us to learn more\n\n## Experts in\n\n## Cold Chain Solutions\n\nInnovating and delivering sustainable temperature control solutions worldwide.\n\n[Contact Our Sales Team][76] [Contact Us to Learn More][77] Summer Mapping Ensure Your Product\nStability Amidst Hot Temperatures\n\n# Cold Chain Packaging Design, Engineering and Testing\n\nCryopak is a complete cold chain packaging solutions provider specializing in the field of\ntemperature-controlled packaging. From needs assessment to package qualification, Cryopak handles\nyour packaging projects with one paramount goal: Maintaining the integrity of your products. Our\nmaterials and processes cover the spectrum from converting EPS or fabricating boxes to manufacturing\nphase change materials and temperature monitors.\n\n[ [Cold-chain-Packaging-icon][Cold-chain-Packaging-icon] ][78]\n\n#### [Cold-chain Packaging][79]\n\n[ [Refrigerants][Refrigerants] ][80]\n\n#### [Refrigerants][81]\n\n[ [Temperature Monitoring][Temperature Monitoring] ][82]\n\n#### [Temperature Monitoring][83]\n\n[ [CryopakBucketRetail][CryopakBucketRetail] ][84]\n\n#### [Cryopak Retail][85]\n\n## Services\n\nCryopak offers a wide range of services to go along with our one-of-a-kind solutions. From testing\nand qualification to recycling and reuse, we are a full-service company ready to provide you with\nwhat you need.\n\n[ Learn More ][86]\n[all-products---CPA-CDI--enhanced-sh][all-products---CPA-CDI--enhanced-sh]\n* ### Helping the cannabis industry\n  \n  Prevent mold growth without drying out the cannabinoids and terpenes, and increase shelf life by\n  transporting your products within the proper temperature and humidity ranges, with our\n  specifically design pallet shippers and insulated boxes.\n* ### Serving the Pharmaceutical Industry\n  \n  The pharmaceutical industry demands stringent monitoring of your payload\u2019s temperature. Just one\n  degree off can spoil products and cause financial losses. Don\u2019t risk it. Let Cryopak provide you\n  with accurate monitoring solutions.\n* ### Providing Premium Retail Products\n  \n  Our Ice-Pak Brand is an integral part of any lunch box or cooler. From bottles and blankets to hot\n  packs and coolers, we have the solution for your every need.\n* ### Keeping Food & Beverage Cold\n  \n  There\u2019s no use in crying over spoiled milk. With Cryopak\u00b4s temperature and humidity monitoring\n  solutions, you can track the enviroment of your product in real-time.\n\n## News & Events\n\n[failure points]\n\n### Cryopak Engineering Insights: Common Failure Points in Cold Chain Packaging and Why Operational\n### Execution Matters\n\nIn pharma and food cold chain logistics, validated packaging is only part of...\n[illustration of DQ]\n\n### Cryopak Engineering Insights: Validating Cold Chain Packaging\n\nBefore a temperature-controlled packaging solution reaches the market at Cryopak, it undergoes a...\n[Fig1 A simulation 3D model]\n\n### Computer Based Simulation for Timely and Cost-effective Design and Optimization of Cold Chain\n### Shipping Systems\n\nIbrahima Cont\u00e9, ing., PhD. Numerical Simulation Expert Thermal Shipping Package Design &\nValidation...\n\n## Subscribe to our Newsletter\n\nEnter your details below to make sure you don't miss out on our monthly newsletter:\n\n[ [Cryopak-White.svg][Cryopak-White.svg] ][87]\n\nNew Jersey\n551 Raritan Center Parkway\nEdison, NJ 08837\n\nVirginia\n72 Executive Circle\nRoanoke, VA 24012\n\nQuebec\n11000 Parkway Blvd\nAnjou QC Canada, H1J 1R6\n\nBritish Columbia\n110-1081 Cliveden Ave\nDelta, BC Canada V3M 5V1\n\nAlberta\n1867 120 Ave NE, Calgary\nAB Canada, T3K 0S5\n\nMaromme\n1 Rue Berthelot\nMarome, France 76150\n\nContact Information\n\n[\n\nEdison: 1.888.827.3393\n\n][88]\n[\n\nMontreal: 1.888.423.7251\n\n][89]\n[\n\nVancouver: 1.800.667.2532\n\n][90]\n[\n\nMaromme: +33 2 32 93 98 84\n\n][91]\n\n\u00a9 Cryopak. All Rights Reserved. [Sitemap][92]\n\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device\ninformation. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing\nbehavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect\ncertain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nThe technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use\nof a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of\ncarrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences Preferences\nThe technical storage or access is necessary for the legitimate purpose of storing preferences that\nare not requested by the subscriber or user.\nStatistics Statistics\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes. The technical\nstorage or access that is used exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes