        "crawl_text": "FlexiFreeze, Inc. North America Uses pure water for better cooling efficiency Innovative designs that eliminate mess from traditional ice United States United States FlexiFreeze\n\nUnlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n\n(262) 236-3970\n\nLog in\n\nCart ( 0 )\n\nCheckout\n\nHome\n\nProducts&nbsp;\n\nPersonal Cooling\n\nFreezable Coolers\n\nParty Mat\n\nHealth and Wellness\n\nFlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts\n\nLearn&nbsp;\n\nFlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions\n\nWhy FlexiFreeze Uses Water\n\nSizing and Fitting\n\nAbout FlexiFreeze\n\nHome\n\nProducts&nbsp;\n\nPersonal Cooling\n\nFreezable Coolers\n\nParty Mat\n\nHealth and Wellness\n\nFlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts\n\nLearn&nbsp;\n\nFlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions\n\nWhy FlexiFreeze Uses Water\n\nSizing and Fitting\n\nAbout FlexiFreeze\n\nstyle=\"object-fit:cover;object-position:50.0% 50.0%;\"\nwidth=\"4617\"\nheight=\"1964\"\n\nWhat is Flexifreeze?\n\nFlexiFreeze is a sheet of 88 encased cubes filled with 100% water. There are channels which enable the sheet to be flexible and fold-able even when frozen. Water (when frozen), actually absorbs 35% more heat, pound for pound, as it thaws than chemical gels. FlexiFreeze coolers are high performance - the only coolers with real, purified ice built right in. A blanket of ice surrounds your food and beverages keeping them refrigerator cold for optimal freshness, safety and taste. FlexiFreeze is the cold without the wet.\n\nShop our best Sellers\n\nstyle=\"\"\nwidth=\"1000\"\nheight=\"1000\"\n\nstyle=\"\"\nwidth=\"1000\"\nheight=\"1000\"\n\nQuick Shop\n\nRefreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n\nfrom\n\n$ 24.99\n\n| /\n\nstyle=\"\"\nwidth=\"2000\"\nheight=\"2000\"\n\nQuick Shop\n\nFlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Ice Vest\n\n$ 99.99\n\n| /\n\nstyle=\"\"\nwidth=\"2000\"\nheight=\"2000\"\n\nstyle=\"\"\nwidth=\"2000\"\nheight=\"2000\"\n\nQuick Shop\n\nCooler Cubes Bag - Refreezable Ice Cubes\n\nfrom\n\n$ 34.99\n\n| /\n\nstyle=\"\"\nwidth=\"1000\"\nheigh