 to keep food fresh, safe\nand appetizing for hours. Never leave your shrimp floating in half-melted ice again! Great for\ndesserts, salads, jello, cheese and meat trays, seafood, egg, and dairy based items. The insulated\nbacking helps protect your furniture from condensation and the removable FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet\nslides out for easy and compact freezing. The clear top surface means easy cleaning.\n\n**Product Detail:**\n* Made from easy to clean nylon materials\n* Includes 88 cube sheet of removable/refreezable FlexiFreeze Ice\n* Measurements:\n20"
