            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] Refreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\n][30]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, blue, closed top]\n][31]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, blue, open top]\n][32]\n[Folded FlexiFreeze can cooler, blue]\n][33]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze refreezable 9 can cooler, blue, in freezer]\n][34]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 can cooler, blue, open top]\n][35]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, zipped shut, diagonal view]\n][36]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, zipped shut, front view]\n][37]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 can cooler, gray, zipped shut]\n][38]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 can cooler, gray, open top]\n][39]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, blue, closed top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, blue, open top]\n[Folded FlexiFreeze can cooler, blue]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze refreezable 9 can cooler, blue, in freezer]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 can cooler, blue, open top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, zipped shut, diagonal view]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, zipped shut, front view]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 can cooler, gray, zipped shut]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 can cooler, gray, open top]\n\n# Refreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n\n$ 24.99\n\n| /\n\nThe FlexiFreeze Refreezable Soft Sided Cooler is a patented fold flat design with FlexiFreeze ice\ncubes sewn right into the sides of the cooler to surround the contents in cold. Nothing outperforms\nthe cooling power of natural ice. FlexiFreeze uses 100% pure water to provide long lasting cold\nwithout the soggy mess of ice alone. Zippers on the top and bottom of the cooler allow it to fold\nflat and store conveniently inside your freezer. Say good-bye to blue goo and chemical gel packs\nforever. Just fold flat and store the cooler in the freezer and it's ready to go whenever you are.\nMade with safe and durable materials, the cooler can be frozen over and over again. Freeze It, Zip\nIt and GO!\n**Product Highlights:**\n* Made from easy to clean, durable nylon materials\n* Patented bottom zipper design fold flat to save space in the freezer\n* Adjustable, removable, 48\" shoulder strap for easy transport\n* Convenient front pocket to store utensils or other small items\n* Insulation helps keep cold longer\n* 9 Can contains 36 cubes; 12 Can contains 60 cubes\n\n[via GIPHY][40]\n\n**Specifications:**\n9 Can\n\nFolded 2\" H x 14\" L x 7\" W\nUnfolded 10\" L x 6\" W x 7\" H\n2.2 Lbs\n\n12 Can\n\nFolded 2\" H x 14\" L x 9.5\" W\nUnfolded 9.5\" L x 6\" W x 10\" H\n3 Lbs\n\nGray / 9 Can Gray / 12 Can Blue / 9 Can Blue / 12 Can\nColor\nGray\nBlue\nSize\n9 Can\n12 Can\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][41] [Share][42] [Pin It][43] [Email][44]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][45]\n* [Shipping][46]\n* [Terms of service][47]\n* [Contact US][48]\n* [Privacy Policy][49]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][50]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][51]. [Powered by Shopify][52]\n\n[American Expres