            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] FlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, blue, face-up]\n][30]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, black, face-down]\n][31]\n[Hands inserting FlexiFreeze ice sheet into black FlexiFreeze Party Mat]\n][32]\n[Food platter sitting on FlexiFreeze party mat]\n][33]\n[Shrimp platter sitting on FlexiFreeze party mat]\n][34]\n[Dessert in tray sitting on FlexiFreeze party mat]\n][35]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze ice sheet into freezer]\n][36]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, blue, face-down]\n][37]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, red, face-down]\n][38]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods]\n][39]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods]\n][40]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, blue, face-up]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, black, face-down]\n[Hands inserting FlexiFreeze ice sheet into black FlexiFreeze Party Mat]\n[Food platter sitting on FlexiFreeze party mat]\n[Shrimp platter sitting on FlexiFreeze party mat]\n[Dessert in tray sitting on FlexiFreeze party mat]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze ice sheet into freezer]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, blue, face-down]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, red, face-down]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods]\n\n# FlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods\n\n$ 34.99\n\n| /\n\n***Party Mat. ***Some of the best party foods just don't hold up very long, even when they are\ninside. The FlexiFreeze Party Mat harnesses the cooling power 88 ice cubes to keep food fresh, safe\nand appetizing for hours. Never leave your shrimp floating in half-melted ice again! Great for\ndesserts, salads, jello, cheese and meat trays, seafood, egg, and dairy based items. The insulated\nbacking helps protect your furniture from condensation and the removable FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet\nslides out for easy and compact freezing. The clear top surface means easy cleaning.\n\n**Product Detail:**\n* Made from easy to clean nylon materials\n* Includes 88 cube sheet of removable/refreezable FlexiFreeze Ice\n* Measurements:\n20\"L x 16\"W x 1\"H\n* Shipping weight is 4.0 lbs\n\n**2-Pack Party Mat**: Includes (2) FlexiFreeze Party Mats and (2) Additional Refill Ice Sheets\n\nType Black Blue Red Black/Black 2 Pack Red/Blue 2 Pack\nType\nBlack\nBlue\nRed\nBlack/Black 2 Pack\nRed/Blue 2 Pack\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][41] [Share][42] [Pin It][43] [Email][44]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\nQuick Shop\nRefreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n*from* $ 24.99\n\n| /\n\n][45]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat Refill Ice Sheet]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat Refill Ice Sheet]\nQuick Shop\nParty Mat Chiller Refill Ice Sheet - Extra Replacement Ice for Extended Cooling\n*from* $ 13.99\n\n| /\n\n][46]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][47]\n* [Shipping][48]\n* [Terms of service][49]\n* [Contact US][50]\n* [Privacy Policy][51]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[Coolin