            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Ice Vest\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal Series Ice Vest - blue, front view]\n][30]\n\n# FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Ice Vest\n\n$ 99.99\n\n| /\n\n***ICE VEST.* ** The patented FlexiFreeze Ice Vest uses FlexiFreeze Re-Freezable Ice Sheets to\nharness the power of 96 pure water ice cubes into 3 \u00bd pounds of efficient cooling capability. Pure\nwater is used because pound for pound, water is a more efficient cooling medium than gel packs. The\nvest is constructed from neoprene to provide soft, flexible, lightweight insulation. At less than 1\"\nthick, the vest allows for maximum mobility and flexibility. Each vest is outfitted with three\nre-freezable, removable panels that are attached with Velcro for easy replacement. Adjustable in\nfour places, the FlexiFreeze Ice Vest has been designed to provide a snug fit everyone from XS to\n6X. The vest and panels are machine washable with ice sheets removed.\n\nDesigned for a variety of uses, the FlexiFreeze Ice Vest is perfect for individuals who are in heat\nstress related occupations or who are heat sensitive due a medical condition. The vest is also great\nfor everyday tasks on hot days such as gardening, mowing the lawn, walking the dog and more.\n\n**Product Detail:**\n* One Size fits most, adjustable from XS to 6XX\n* Weighs just 3 1/2 lbs\n* Less than 1\" thick\n* Compatible with replacement panel item #FFVRP-BK\n* FF0IV02-0IVNV\n\nStyle Zipper\nStyle\nZipper\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][31] [Share][32] [Pin It][33] [Email][34]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze personal cooling ice vest, black]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze personal cooling ice vest, black]\nQuick Shop\nIce Vest Replacement Panels\n$ 39.99\n\n| /\n\n][35]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional series ice vest, charcoal, zipper, front view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional series ice vest, charcoal, zipper, front view]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Charcoal\n$ 134.99\n\n| /\n\n][36]\n[Personal Series Cooling Kit - blue, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, with gray insulated\nbag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Personal Series Cooling Kit - blue, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, with gray insulated\nbag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit\n$ 179.99\n\n| /\n\n][37]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][38]\n* [Shipping][39]\n* [Terms of service][40]\n* [Contact US][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][43]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][44]. [Powered by Shopify][45]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collecti