\n\n# Cooler Cubes Bag - Refreezable Ice Cubes\n\n$ 34.99\n\n| /\n\n**FlexiFreeze Cooler Cubes**\n\nCooler Cubes are the eco friendly reusable ice. Made in the USA with 100% pure water and covered in\na durable food grade plastic. The perfect solution to filling a cooler; all the benefits of real ice\nwithout leaving a pool of water behind. Simply freeze before use for long-lasting, mess-free\ncooling.\n* Made with Pure Water\n* 5 lbs of Ice (5 lb)/8 lbs of Ice (8 lb)\n* Includes mesh bag for freezing and transport\n* Hand wash and lay flat to dry\n* Includes approximately 175+ cubes of ice (in 5 lb). Approximately 280+ cubes of ice (in 8 lb)\n\nSize 5 lb 8 lb\nSize\n5 lb\n8 lb\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\nThis item is a deferred, subscription, or recurring purchase. By continuing, I agree to the\ncancellation policy and authorize you to charge my payment method at the prices, frequency and dates\nlisted on this page until my order is fulfilled or I cancel, if permitted.\n[Tweet][37] [Share][38] [Pin It][39] [Email][40]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][41]\n* [Shipping][42]\n* [Terms of service][43]\n* [Contact US][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][46]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][47]. [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[12]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[13]: