n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, charcoal, on mannequin, close up]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, blue, on mannequin, close up]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, blue, on mannequin]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, blue, with 1 ice strip]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, blue, with 2 ice strips]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, blue]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, red, on mannequin, close up]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, red, on mannequin]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, red, with 1 ice strip]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, red, with 2 ice strips]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, red]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, charcoal, on mannequin]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, charcoal, with ice strip]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, charcoal, with 2 ice strips]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, charcoal]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, orange, with 2 ice strips]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, orange, on mannequin]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, orange, with ice strip]\n[FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar, orange, on mannequin, close up]\n\n# FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar\n\n$ 14.99\n\n| /\n\nThe FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar is a re-freezable neck wrap designed to keep you cool and comfortable\nin hot environments. The FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar contains two 8 cube strips of FlexiFreeze Ice to\nprovide long lasting cooling. With it's soft inner lining, this cooling collar is very comfortable.\nGreat for work or play. Simply freeze and use. Reuse over and over again.\n\n**To use:** Simply freeze the ice cube strip, place it into the cooling collar and wrap around the\nneck as shown in the picture. The hook and loop closure allows the cooling collar to adjust\ncomfortably to all neck sizes.\n\n**Dimensions:**\n\n28\" long x 2.5\" high. (cooling area is 15.5\" long)\n\n**Item includes:**\n\n(1) FlexiFreeze Cooling Collar\n\n(2) 8 cube strips of FlexiFreeze Refreezable Ice\n\n**Product Details**\n\nNavy Blue\nFFCC2-01\nRed\nFFCC2-02\nOrange\nFFCC2-08\nCharcoal\nFFCC2-09\nColor Charcoal Gray Orange Red Navy Blue\nColor\nCharc