            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)\n[FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)]\n][30]\n[Close up view of the ice cubes of a FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n][31]\n[FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)]\n[Close up view of the ice cubes of a FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n\n# FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)\n\n$ 24.99 $ 29.99\n\n| /\n\nThe power behind all of our innovative cooling solutions is the FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet. This uniquely\ndesigned ice sheet can be cut, along the gutter between the cubes, to a size that works in your\nexisting coolers or to meet your other cooling needs.\n\nProduct Detail:\n* 44 Ice Cubes in a 4 pack\n* Measurement for each 44 cube sheet is: 7 1/2\" x 19 1/2\"\n* Shipping weight is 7 lbs\n* FF4PK-44\n\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\nThis item is a deferred, subscription, or recurring purchase. By continuing, I agree to the\ncancellation policy and authorize you to charge my payment method at the prices, frequency and dates\nlisted on this page until my order is fulfilled or I cancel, if permitted.\n[Tweet][32] [Share][33] [Pin It][34] [Email][35]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze cooler cubes bag of individual refreezable ice cubes spilling out]\n[FlexiFreeze cooler cubes bag of individual refreezable ice cubes spilling out]\nQuick Shop\nCooler Cubes Bag - Refreezable Ice Cubes\n*from* $ 34.99\n\n| /\n\n][36]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][37]\n* [Shipping][38]\n* [Terms of service][39]\n* [Contact US][40]\n* [Privacy Policy][41]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][42]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][43]. [Powered by Shopify][44]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[12]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[13]: /pages/water-is-better\n[14]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting\n[15]: /pages/frontpage\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[19]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[20]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[21]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[22]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[23]: /pages/about-us\n[24]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[25]: /pages/water-is-better\n[26]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting\n[27]: /pages/frontpage\n[28]: /\n[29]: /collections/all\n[30]: //flexifreeze.com/cdn/shop/files/FlexiFreezeIce4Packv.2_800x2_6a88a00e-ecd5-4c4a-92d8-256968be\ndf62_2048x.webp?v=1732121252\n[31]: //flexifreeze.com/cdn/shop/products/Ice_Sheet-Up_Close_01_410ec5b3-8bd0-424c-9c5f-dfae23aef927\n_2048x.jpg?v=1715806635\n[32]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)&url=https://fl\nexifreeze.com/products/flexifreeze-ice-sheet-4-pack-44-cube\n[33]: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://flexifreeze.com/products/flexifreeze-ice-\nsheet-4-pack-44-cube\n[34]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://flexifreeze.com/products/flexifreeze-ice-\nsheet-4-pack-44-cube&description=FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)&media=https://flexifreeze\n.com/cdn/shop/files/FlexiFreezeIce4Packv.2_800x2_6a88a00e-ecd5-4c4a-92d8-256968bedf62_600x.webp?v=17\n32121252\n[35]: mailto:?subject=Thought you might like FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)&body=Hey, I w\nas browsing FlexiFreeze.com and found FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes). I wanted to share i\nt with you.%0D%0A%0D%0Ahttps://flexifreeze.com/products/flexifreeze-ice-sheet-4-pack-44-cube\n[36]: /products/cooler-cubes-5-lb-bag-refreezable-ice-cubes\n[37]: /pages/warranty-returns\n[38]: /pages/shipping\n[39]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[40]: /pages/contact-us\n[41]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[42]: http://coolingvest.com\n[43]: /\n[44]: https://www.shopify.com?utm_campaign=poweredby&utm_medium=shopify&utm_source=onlinestore"
