lexiFreeze Ice Vest is perfect for individuals who are in heat\nstress related occupations or who are heat sensitive due to medically related reasons. The vest is\nalso great for everyday tasks on hot days such as gardening, mowing the lawn, walking the dog and\nmore.\n\n**Features:**\n* Made with Heavy Duty Rip-Stop fabric\n* 2 Large front pockets\n* Solid YKK Zippers\n* 3 Removable washable vest panels\n* Fits most sizes with adjustable sides and shoulder straps. NEW easy pull, slide and zip to fit.\n* Mesh bag for freezer or laundry\n\n**Specs:**\n* One Size fits most, adjustable from XS to 6X\n* Weighs just 3 1/2 lbs\n* Less than 1\" thick\n* Compatible with replacement panel item # FFVRP-18\n\n**FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit Includes:**\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Vest - Charcoal\n* FlexiFreeze Replacement Panels\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet (88 Cubes)\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Vest Insulated Carry Bag\n\n**Product SKU**: FFCKZ-PSCH\n\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][43] [Share][44] [Pin It][45] [Email][46]\n\n## You may also like\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][47]\n* [Shipping][48]\n* [Terms of service][49]\n* [Contact US][50]\n* [Privacy Policy][51]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][52]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][53]. [Powered by Shopify][54]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[12]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[1