            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] Pocketbook Breastmilk Cooler, Gray\n[Hand placing Flexifreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, into handbag]\n][30]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, open to display interior]\n][31]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, charcoal, next to formula and a container of\nmilk]\n][32]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, charcoal, laying open on its side with a\ncontainer of milk inside]\n][33]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, into freezer]\n][34]\n[Hand placing Flexifreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, into handbag]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, open to display interior]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, charcoal, next to formula and a container of\nmilk]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, charcoal, laying open on its side with a\ncontainer of milk inside]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, into freezer]\n\n# Pocketbook Breastmilk Cooler, Gray\n\n$ 19.99\n\n| /\n\nOur new FlexiFreeze\u00ae Pocketbook Cooler is a safe and discreet necessity for temporarily storing or\ntransporting breastmilk. A perfect solution for new moms. This wallet-sized cooler has 16 ice\ncubes with real, purified, filtered 100% USA water built right in. Water (when frozen) is 35% more\neffective than gel. Safely store your milk (or whatever you need to keep cold) between 16 frozen\ncubes of pure water! Just unzip and freeze flat in your freezer. Then zip easily and place in your\nhandbag or purse allowing for discreet, subtle, dry storage and transportation of precious breast\nmilk. Comfortably carry mini hospital bottles (2), popular brand baggies (several) or even a zip top\nstorage bag in this pocketbook cooler! A great product for you- Safe for your milk...Safe for your\nbaby.\n\n* Finally! A Perfect solution for new moms with nursing babies to discretely store and carry their\nbreast milk\n* Wallet-size fits right into a handbag or purse\n* 16 cubes of PURE WATER built right into this FREEZABLE cooler\n* Mini hospital bottles (2), popular brand baggies (several) or several zip top bags can easily fit\ninto the cooler\n* Durable, compact and convenient\n* Measurements:\n4.5\" W x 2.25\" D x 8\" H\n* Shipping Weight is 1.3 lbs\n\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][35] [Share][36] [Pin It][37] [Email][38]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\nQuick Shop\nRefreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n*from* $ 24.99\n\n| /\n\n][39]\n[Hand placing Flexifreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, black, into handbag]\n[Hand placing Flexifreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, black, into handbag]\nQuick Shop\nPocketbook Breastmilk Cooler, Black\n$ 19.99\n\n| /\n\n][40]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][41]\n* [Shipping][42]\n* [Terms of service][43]\n* [Contact US][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limite