view]\n[Man putting on FlexiFreeze Professional Ice vest - blue, velcro]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional ice vest, adjusting shoulder strap, navy]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, navy, adjusting sizing strings]\n[Open FlexiFreeze professional cooling vest, with refreezable ice panels displayed]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Navy Zipper, front view]\n[Open FlexiFreeze professional cooling vest, with refreezable ice panels displayed]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice vest,\nblack]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels, front and back panels for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice\nvest]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels in mesh bag for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice vest]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, navy, adjusting sizing strings]\n\n# FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Blue Velcro\n\n$ 134.99\n\n| /\n\nICE VEST\u00ae. The patented FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae uses FlexiFreeze\u00ae Re-Freezable Ice Sheets to\nharness the power of 96 pure water ice cubes into 3 \u00bd pounds of efficient cooling capability. Pure\nwater is used because pound for pound, water is a more efficient cooling medium than gel packs. At\nless than 1\" thick, the vest allows for maximum mobility and flexibility. Each vest is outfitted\nwith three re-freezable, removable panels that are attached with Velcro for easy replacement.\nAdjustable in four places, the FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae has been designed to provide a snug fit\neveryone from XS to 6X. The vest and panels are machine washable with ice sheets removed.\n\nDesigned for a variety of uses, the FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae is perfect for individuals who are in\nheat stress related occupations or who are heat sensitive due to medically related reasons.\n\n* Made with Heavy Duty Rip-Stop fabric,\n* 2 Large front pockets\n* All Hook and loop closures\n* 3 Removable washable vest panels\n* Fits most sizes with adjustable sides and shoulder straps.\n* Mesh bag for freezer or laundry\n\nProduct Details:\n\n* One Size fits most, adjustable from XS to 6X\n* Weighs just 3 1/2 lbs\n* Less than 1\" thick\n* Compatible with replacement panel item # FFVRP-18\n\nSKU: FFPFVV-20\n\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][41] [Share][42] [Pin It][43] [Email][44]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal Series Ice Vest - blue, front view]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Ice Vest\n$ 99.99\n\n| /\n\n][45]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice vest,\nblack]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice vest,\nblack]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest Replacement Panels - Blue Velcro\n$ 39.99\n\n| /\n\n][46]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Velcro, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, gray\ninsulated bag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Velcro, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, gray\ninsulated bag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\nQuick Shop\nProfessional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Velcro\n$ 234.99\n\n| /\n\n][47]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\nQuick Shop\nProfessional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper\n$ 234.99\n\n| /\n\n][48]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][49]\n* [Shipping][50]\n* [Terms of service][51]\n* [Contact US][52]\n* [Privacy Policy][53]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][54]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][55]. [Powered by Shopify][56]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mast