            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] FlexiFreeze ReFreezable Ice Sheets 88 Cubes\n[FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet]\n][30]\n[FlexiFreeze 3-Pack Ice Sheets]\n][31]\n[FlexiFreeze 6-Pack Ice Sheets]\n][32]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 Pack Ice Sheets]\n][33]\n[Close up view of the ice cubes of a FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n][34]\n[Hands with scizzors cutting a FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n][35]\n[Open cooler with a frozen FlexiFreeze ice sheet on top of food and drinks]\n][36]\n[FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet]\n[FlexiFreeze 3-Pack Ice Sheets]\n[FlexiFreeze 6-Pack Ice Sheets]\n[FlexiFreeze 12 Pack Ice Sheets]\n[Close up view of the ice cubes of a FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Hands with scizzors cutting a FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Open cooler with a frozen FlexiFreeze ice sheet on top of food and drinks]\n\n# FlexiFreeze ReFreezable Ice Sheets 88 Cubes\n\n$ 29.99 $ 30.00\n\n| /\n\nFlexiFreeze Re-Freezable Ice Sheets are the convenient and economical replacement for soggy bags of\nice. FlexiFreeze can be cut to just the right size and is flexible when frozen. Store FlexiFreeze\nRe-Freezable Ice Sheets in your freezer so that they are ready to use whenever you need them. Forget\nthe trip to the local convenience store for bags of ice that leave your cooler a soggy mess.\nFlexiFreeze Ice is made from 100% pure water and can be frozen over and over again.\n\n#### Each Ice Sheet has the following specifications:\n* 88 Ice Cubes\n* Measures 15 1/2\" x 19 1/2\" X .625\"\n* Weight 2.5 lbs\n\nSize 3 Pack 6 Pack 12 Pack\nSize\n3 Pack\n6 Pack\n12 Pack\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\nThis item is a deferred, subscription, or recurring purchase. By continuing, I agree to the\ncancellation policy and authorize you to charge my payment method at the prices, frequency and dates\nlisted on this page until my order is fulfilled or I cancel, if permitted.\n[Tweet][37] [Share][38] [Pin It][39] [Email][40]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)]\n[FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Ice Sheet - 4 Pack (44 cubes)\n$ 24.99 $ 29.99\n\n| /\n\nSale\n][41]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][42]\n* [Shipping][43]\n* [Terms of service][44]\n* [Contact US][45]\n* [Privacy Policy][46]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][47]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][48]. [Powered by Shopify][49]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[12]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[13]: /pages/water-is-better\n[14]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting\n[15]: /pages/frontpage\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[19]: /products/refreez