            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] Professional Series Ice Vest Cooling Vest\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Hi-Vis, orange, front view]\n][30]\n[Man putting on Professional series ice vest, charcoal, side view, panels visible]\n][31]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest Hi-Vis yellow, front view]\n][32]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional series ice vest - blue velcro, front view]\n][33]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional ice vest, adjusting shoulder strap, charcoal]\n][34]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, charcoal, adjusting zipper ]\n][35]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, charcoal, adjusting sizing strings]\n][36]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional Hi-Vis zipper ice vest, Hi-Vis yellow, side view]\n][37]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, charcoal, adjusting sizing strings]\n][38]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Hi-Vis Ice Vest, open with panels viewable, orange]\n][39]\n[Open FlexiFreeze professional cooling vest, with refreezable ice panels displayed]\n][40]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Hi-Vis, orange, front view]\n[Man putting on Professional series ice vest, charcoal, side view, panels visible]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest Hi-Vis yellow, front view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional series ice vest - blue velcro, front view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional ice vest, adjusting shoulder strap, charcoal]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, charcoal, adjusting zipper ]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, charcoal, adjusting sizing strings]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional Hi-Vis zipper ice vest, Hi-Vis yellow, side view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze professional zipper ice vest, charcoal, adjusting sizing strings]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Hi-Vis Ice Vest, open with panels viewable, orange]\n[Open FlexiFreeze professional cooling vest, with refreezable ice panels displayed]\n\n# Professional Series Ice Vest Cooling Vest\n\n$ 134.99\n\n| /\n\n***ICE VEST.* ** The patented FlexiFreeze Ice Vest uses FlexiFreeze Re-Freezable Ice Sheets to\nharness the power of 96 pure water ice cubes into 3 \u00bd pounds of efficient cooling capability. Pure\nwater is used because pound for pound, water is a more efficient cooling medium than gel packs. At\nless than 1\" thick, the vest allows for maximum mobility and flexibility. Each vest is outfitted\nwith three re-freezable, removable panels that are attached with Velcro for easy replacement.\nAdjustable in four places, the FlexiFreeze Ice Vest has been designed to provide a snug fit everyone\nfrom XS to 6XX. The vest and panels are machine washable with ice sheets removed.\n\nDesigned for a variety of uses, the FlexiFreeze Ice Vest is perfect for individuals who are in heat\nstress related occupations or who are heat sensitive due a medical condition. The vest is also great\nfor everyday tasks on hot days such as gardening, mowing the lawn, walking the dog and more.\n* Made with Heavy Duty Rip-Stop fabric,\n* 2 Large front pockets\n* Solid YKK Zippers\n* Available in 3M Hi-Vis (Class 1, Type O) in Orange or Yellow\n* 3 Removable washable vest panels\n* Fits most sizes with adjustable sides and shoulder straps. NEW easy pull, slide and zip to fit.\n* Mesh bag for freezer or laundry\n\n**Product Details:**\n* One Size fits most, adjustable from XS to 6X\n* Weighs just 3 1/2 lbs\n* Less than 1\" thick\n* Compatible with replacement panel item # FFVRP-18\n\nStyle Charcoal Gray Blue Velcro Hi-Vis Yellow Hi-Vis Orange\nStyle\nCharcoal Gray\nBlue Velcro\nHi-Vis Yellow\nHi-Vis Orange\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][41] [Share][42] [Pin It][43] [Email][44]\n\n## You may also like\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][45]\n* [Shipping][46]\n* [Terms of service][47]\n* [Contact US][48]\n* [Privacy Policy][49]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][50]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][51]. [Powered by Shopify][52]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[12]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[13]: /pages/water-is-better\n[14]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting\n[15]: /pages/frontpage\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[19]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[20]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[21]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[22]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[23]: /pages/about-us\n[24]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[25]: /pages/water-is-better\n[26]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting