            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit\n[Personal Series Cooling Kit - blue, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, with gray insulated\nbag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n][30]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal velcro ice vest, blue, open, front view, ice panels visible]\n][31]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal Series Ice Vest - blue, front view]\n][32]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal velcro ice vest, blue, adjusting sizing strings]\n][33]\n[Open FlexiFreeze personal cooling vest, with refreezable ice panels displayed]\n][34]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal ice vest, adjusting shoulder strap, blue]\n][35]\n[Man unzipping FlexiFreeze personal zipper ice vest, blue, open, front view]\n][36]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal velcro ice vest, blue, open, front view]\n][37]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels in mesh bag for FlexiFreeze personal cooling ice vest]\n][38]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze personal cooling ice vest, black]\n][39]\n[FlexiFreeze insulated tote bag, large, black]\n][40]\n[Personal Series Cooling Kit - blue, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, with gray insulated\nbag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal velcro ice vest, blue, open, front view, ice panels visible]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal Series Ice Vest - blue, front view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal velcro ice vest, blue, adjusting sizing strings]\n[Open FlexiFreeze personal cooling vest, with refreezable ice panels displayed]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal ice vest, adjusting shoulder strap, blue]\n[Man unzipping FlexiFreeze personal zipper ice vest, blue, open, front view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal velcro ice vest, blue, open, front view]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels in mesh bag for FlexiFreeze personal cooling ice vest]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze personal cooling ice vest, black]\n[FlexiFreeze insulated tote bag, large, black]\n\n# FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit\n\n$ 179.99\n\n| /\n\n***PERSONAL COOLING KIT.*** The FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit is a personal cooling solution for\npeople with jobs in the heat, those who are heat sensitive due to medical reasons, and those who are\nlooking for relief from the heat for everyday tasks. The patented FlexiFreeze Ice Vest uses\nFlexiFreeze Ice Sheets to harness the power of 96 pure water ice cubes into 3 \u00bd pounds of cooling\nefficiency. The vest is made of neoprene to provide soft, flexible, lightweight insulation. At less\nthan 1\" thick, the vest provides maximum mobility and flexibility. Each vest has three re-freezable,\nremovable cooling panels. Fully adjustable, the ice vest provides a snug fit for sizes from XS to\n6XX. Vest and panels are machine washable when ice sheets are removed. The Kit includes an ice vest\nwith panels, additional replacement panels, FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet and insulated cooler/carry bag.\n\n**FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit Includes:**\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Vest (Velcro)\n* FlexiFreeze Replacement Panels\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet (88 Cubes)\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Vest Insulated Carry Bag\n\n9 items left\nS