ries Ice Vest - Hi-Vis, yellow, side view]\n][39]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest, open with panels viewable, orange]\n][40]\n[FlexiFreeze insulated tote bag, large, gray]\n][41]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice vest,\ngray]\n][42]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - charcoal, includes replacement panels, ice vest, charcoal, with\ngray insulated bag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Hi-Vis orange, includes replacement panels, Hi-Vis ice vest,\norange, with gray insulated bag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Hi-Vis Yellow, includes replacement panels, Hi-Vis ice vest,\nyellow, with gray insulated bag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Velcro, includes replacement panels, blue ice vest, gray\ninsulated bag, and FlexiFreeze ice sheet]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Hi-Vis, orange, front view]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Hi-Vis, orange, vest open with panels\nvisible, front view]\n[Man putting on FlexiFreeze Professional Ice vest - blue, velcro]\n[Man adjusting shoulder straps with FlexiFreeze professional series ice vest, charcoal]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest, gray, pockets open]\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest - Hi-Vis, yellow, side view]\n[FlexiFreeze Professional Series Ice Vest, open with panels viewable, orange]\n[FlexiFreeze insulated tote bag, large, gray]\n[FlexiFreeze refreezable ice panels and mesh bag for FlexiFreeze professional cooling ice vest,\ngray]\n\n# Professional Series Cooling Kit\n\n$ 234.99\n\n| /\n\n***PROFESSIONAL SERIES COOLING KIT.***The patented FlexiFreeze Ice Vest uses FlexiFreeze\nRe-Freezable Ice Sheets to harness the power of 96 pure water ice cubes into 3 \u00bd pounds of efficient\ncooling capability. Pure water is used because pound for pound, water is a more efficient cooling\nmedium than gel packs. At less than 1\" thick, the vest allows for maximum mobility and flexibility.\nEach vest is outfitted with three re-freezable, removable panels that are attached with Velcro for\neasy replacement. Adjustable in four places, the FlexiFreeze Ice Vest has been designed to provide a\nsnug fit everyone from XS to 6XX. The vest and panels are machine washable with ice sheets removed.\nDesigned for a variety of uses, the FlexiFreeze Ice Vest is perfect for individuals who are in heat\nstress related occupations or who are heat sensitive due to medically related reasons. The vest is\nalso great for everyday tasks on hot days such as gardening, mowing the lawn, walking the dog and\nmore.\n\n**Features:**\n* Made with Heavy Duty Rip-Stop fabric\n* 2 Large front pockets\n* Solid YKK Zippers\n* Available 3M Hi-Vis (Class 1, Type O) in Orange or Yellow\n* Blue Vest Features a velcro closure\n* 3 Removable washable vest panels\n* Fits most sizes with adjustable sides and shoulder straps. NEW easy pull, slide and zip to fit.\n* Mesh bag for freezer or laundry\n\n**Specs:**\n* One Size fits most, adjustable from XS to 6X\n* Weighs just 3 1/2 lbs\n* Less than 1\" thick\n* Compatible with replacement panel item # FFVRP-18\n\n**FlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Kit Includes:**\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Vest\n* FlexiFreeze Replacement Panels\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Sheet (88 Cubes)\n* FlexiFreeze Ice Vest Insulated Carry Bag\n\nColor Charcoal Gray Hi-Vis Yellow Hi-Vis Orange Blue Velcro\nColor\nCharcoal Gray\nHi-Vis Yellow\nHi-Vis Orange\nBlue Velcro\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][43] [Share][44] [Pin It][45] [Email][46]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\nQuick Shop\nRefreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n*from* $ 24.99\n\n| /\n\n][47]\n[Hand placing Flexifreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, into handbag]\n[Hand placing Flexifreeze refreezable breastmilk pocketbook cooler, gray, 