            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] Party Mat Chiller Refill Ice Sheet - Extra Replacement Ice for\nExtended Cooling\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat Refill Ice Sheet]\n][30]\n[Hands inserting FlexiFreeze ice sheet into black FlexiFreeze Party Mat]\n][31]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze ice sheet into freezer]\n][32]\n[FlexiFreeze Party Mat Refill Ice Sheet]\n[Hands inserting FlexiFreeze ice sheet into black FlexiFreeze Party Mat]\n[Hand placing folded FlexiFreeze ice sheet into freezer]\n\n# Party Mat Chiller Refill Ice Sheet - Extra Replacement Ice for Extended Cooling\n\n$ 13.99\n\n| /\n\nAn additional ice sheet to the FlexiFreeze Party Mat to keep your food cold and safe longer. 88 Ice\n\"Cubes\" keep your food cool, and will provide cooling for approximately 2-3 hours depending on\ntemperature and shade factors. Each sheet contains only non-toxic, 100% pure water to ensure safety.\nWater is the most effective at transferring and removing heat. The durable, refreezable design\nfeatures multi-layered plastic for puncture resistance, ensuring long life and many freezing cycles.\nFits perfectly in the FlexiFreeze Party Mat to provide a 19\"x15\" area, providing ample surface area\nto keep food cold.\n\nFlexiFreeze Party Mat NOT INCLUDED.\n\nSize Single 2 Pack\nSize\nSingle\n2 Pack\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][33] [Share][34] [Pin It][35] [Email][36]\n\n## You may also like\n\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, blue, face-up]\n[FlexiFreeze party mat, blue, face-up]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Party Mat - Buffet Cooler Mat for Cold Served Foods\n*from* $ 29.99\n\n| /\n\n][37]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][38]\n* [Shipping][39]\n* [Terms of service][40]\n* [Contact US][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][43]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][44]. [Powered by Shopify][45]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[12]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[13]: /pages/water-is-better\n[14]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting\n[15]: /pages/frontpage\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[19]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[20]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[21]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[22]: /collections/flexifreeze-ice-and-refill-inserts\n[23]: /pages/about-us\n[24]: /pages/flexifreeze-instructions\n[25]: /pages/water-is-better\n[26]: /pages/sizing-and-fitting\n[27]: /pages/frontpage\n[28]: /\n[29]: /collections/all\n[30]: //flexifreeze.com/cdn/shop/files/FlexiFreezeIceSheet_2048x.jpg?v=1716212371\n[31]: //flexifreeze.com/cdn/shop/files/FFMAT-03_c_a85e7495-f1e4-4