            "text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\n* [Personal Cooling][7]\n* [Freezable Coolers][8]\n* [Party Mat][9]\n* [Health and Wellness][10]\n* [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\n* [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n* [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n* [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products ][17]\n* [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n* [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n* [ Party Mat ][20]\n* [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn ][23]\n* [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n* [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n* [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[ Home ][28] [ Products ][29] Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n][30]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n][31]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n][32]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n][33]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n[Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper]\n\n# Professional Series Cooling Kit - Blue Zipper\n\n$ 234.99\n\n| /\n\n**PROFESSIONAL SERIES COOLING KIT** - The patented FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae uses FlexiFreeze\u00ae\nRe-Freezable Ice Sheets to harness the power of 96 pure water ice cubes into 3 \u00bd pounds of efficient\ncooling capability. Pure water is used because pound for pound, water is a more efficient cooling\nmedium than gel packs. At less than 1\" thick, the vest allows for maximum mobility and flexibility.\nEach vest is outfitted with three re-freezable, removable panels that are attached with Velcro for\neasy replacement. Adjustable in four places, the FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae has been designed to provide\na snug fit everyone from XS to 6X. The vest and panels are machine washable with ice sheets removed.\nDesigned for a variety of uses, the FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae is perfect for individuals who are in\nheat stress related occupations or who are heat sensitive due to medically related reasons. The vest\nis also great for everyday tasks on hot days such as gardening, mowing the lawn, walking the dog and\nmore.\n\n**Features:**\n* Made with Heavy Duty Rip-Stop fabric\n* 2 Large front pockets\n* 3 Removable washable vest panels\n* Fits most sizes with adjustable sides and shoulder straps.\n* Mesh bag for freezer or laundry\n\n**Specs:**\n* One Size fits most, adjustable from XS to 6X\n* Weighs just 3 1/2 lbs\n* Less than 1\" thick\n* Compatible with replacement panel item # FFVRP-18\n\n**FlexiFreeze\u00ae Personal Cooling Kit Includes:**\n* FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae - Blue Zipper\n* FlexiFreeze\u00ae Replacement Panels\n* FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Sheet (88 Cubes)\n* FlexiFreeze\u00ae Ice Vest\u00ae Insulated Carry Bag\n\nQuantity\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\n[Tweet][34] [Share][35] [Pin It][36] [Email][37]\n\n###### Useful Links\n* [Warranty & Returns][38]\n* [Shipping][39]\n* [Terms of service][40]\n* [Contact US][41]\n* [Privacy Policy][42]\n\n###### Sign up for our newsletter\n\nSign up for insider tips, special offers, limited editions & more...\n\n###### Our Other Brands\n\n[[CoolingVest.com]][43]\nUnited States (USD $)\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (US $)\nSubmit\n\n## Country\n\nUnited States (USD $)\n* United States (USD $)\n\n\u00a9 2026 [FlexiFreeze.com][44]. [Powered by Shopify][45]\n\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [Mastercard] [PayPal] [Shop\nPay] [Visa]\n\n[1]: tel:(262)2363970\n[2]: /account/login\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: /cart\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/personal-cooling\n[8]: /products/refreezable-soft-sided-cooler\n[9]: /products/flexifreeze-party-mat\n[10]: /collections/health-wellness-1\n[11]: /co