Business Support Group Finance\nGroup About Us About Medline Code of Conduct Environmental, Social And Governance Medline\nInternational Insights Careers Contact Us\n* [Capabilities][49]\n* [Information Technology][50]\n* [Business Support Group][51]\n* [Finance Group][52]\n\n[About Us][53]\n* [About Medline][54]\n* [Code of Conduct][55]\n* [Sustainability][56]\n* [Medline International][57]\n* [Fast Facts][58]\n* [Values][59]\n\n[Careers][60]\n\n[Contact Us][61]\n* [ Home ][62]\n* **About Us**\n\n**About Medline**\nMedline is the largest provider of medical\u2013surgical products and supply chain solutions, serving\nevery point of care. Founded in 1966 by Jim and Jon Mills, the company began as a medical supply\nmanufacturer and, in less than 60 years, has grown to hold leading positions across multiple product\nfamilies. This success has been driven by a culture of innovation, a relentless focus on customer\nneeds, and a deep commitment to improving healthcare delivery. With roots dating back to 1910 in\nChicago\u2014when Medline started by manufacturing butcher\u2019s aprons and soon after surgical gowns\u2014the\ncompany has a long history of revolutionizing healthcare. Today, Medline is a trusted global\nhealthcare partner known for being easy to work with, delivering high-quality products, solving\nchallenges, and creating long-term value for healthcare facilities worldwide.\n\n**Medline in India**\nMedline India was established in 2010 in Pune as an Offshore Development Center to support Medline\nIndustries LP, headquartered in Chicago, USA. Over the years, it has grown into a 1,600+ strong team\nof technology, finance, and business support professionals who contribute to Medline\u2019s global\nmission: to make healthcare run better. Medline India offers a dynamic and collaborative work\nenvironment with ample opportunities to learn, innovate, and grow. With a highly engaged and\nempowered team, Medline India plays a vital role in driving business excellence and supporting\nhealthcare systems across the globe.\n\n**About Medline**\nMedline is the largest provider of medical\u2013surgical products and supply chain solutions, serving\nevery point of care. Founded in 1966 by Jim and Jon Mills, the company began as a medical supply\nmanufacturer and, in less than 60 years, has grown to hold leading positions across multiple product\nfamilies. This success has been driven by a culture of innovation, a relentless focus on customer\nneeds, and a deep commitment to improving healthcare delivery. With roots dating back to 1910 in\nChicago\u2014when Medline started by manufacturing butcher\u2019s aprons and soon after surgical gowns\u2014the\ncompany has a long history of revolutionizing healthcare. Today, Medline is a trusted global\nhealthcare partner known for being easy to work with, delivering high-quality products, solving\nchallenges, and creating long-term value for healthcare facilities worldwide.\n\n**Medline in India**\nMedline India was established in 2010 in Pune as Global Capability Center to support Medline,\nheadquartered in Chicago, USA. Over the years, it has grown into a 1,800+ strong team of technology,\nfinance, and business support professionals who contribute to Medline\u2019s global mission: to make\nhealthcare run better. Medline India offers a dynamic and collaborative work environment with ample\nopportunities to learn, innovate, and grow. With a highly engaged and empowered team, Medline India\nplays a vital role in driving business excellence and supporting healthcare systems across the\nglobe.\n\n#### About Us\n* [Our Company][63]\n* [Code of Conduct][64]\n\n#### Careers\n* [How to Apply][65]\n\n#### Contact\n\nMedline Offices\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n[Medline-logo]\n\n**ABOUT US**\n\n[Our Company][66]\n\n[Code Of Conduct][67]\n\n**CAREERS**\n\n[How To Apply][68]\n\n**CONTACT**\n\nMedline Offices\n\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n\u00a9 2022 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a 