Business Support Group Finance\nGroup About Us About Medline Code of Conduct Environmental, Social And Governance Medline\nInternational Insights Careers Contact Us\n* [Capabilities][49]\n* [Information Technology][50]\n* [Business Support Group][51]\n* [Finance Group][52]\n\n[About Us][53]\n* [About Medline][54]\n* [Code of Conduct][55]\n* [Sustainability][56]\n* [Medline International][57]\n* [Fast Facts][58]\n* [Values][59]\n\n[Careers][60]\n\n[Contact Us][61]\n* [ Home ][62]\n* **Code of Conduct**\nCode of Conduct\n\nOur Code of Conduct is the foundation of our ethics and compliance program. It serves as a guide to\nensure that everyone who works for our company acts legally and with integrity\n\n### Ethics & Compliance\n\nWithin Medline, we put integrity first to show our fellow colleagues, customers and communities that\nwe are an employer and partner they can trust who will do the right thing every time.\n\nMedline promotes a positive work environment for all employees and we expect honest and ethical\nconduct in every part of our business and in each customer interaction. We fight to protect and\npreserve our reputation that we\u2019ve earned through generations of hard work and dedication to our\ncustomers.\n\nOur Code of Conduct elaborates on our core values and principles, and governs our relationships with\ngovernment agencies, customers, competitors, and each other. Moreover, the Code of Conduct aims to\nprotect everyone in order to help our customers improve patient care.\n\nDownload Medline\u2019s Code of Conduct [here][63].\n\n#### About Us\n* [Our Company][64]\n* [Code of Conduct][65]\n\n#### Careers\n* [How to Apply][66]\n\n#### Contact\n\nMedline Offices\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n[Medline-logo]\n\n**ABOUT US**\n\n[Our Company][67]\n\n[Code Of Conduct][68]\n\n**CAREERS**\n\n[How To Apply][69]\n\n**CONTACT**\n\nMedline Offices\n\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n\u00a9 2022 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n### Connect with Medline\n\n#### Contact Us\n\nWe're here to answer your questions and provide any guidance you need\n\n[Get in touch][70]\n\n#### Explore Careers\n\nFind opportunities to do your best work with us every day\n\n[Find your passion][71]\n\n#### Read our news stories\n\nLearn about our partnerships, products and solutions in the news.\n\n[Visit our newsroom][72]\n* [LEGAL][73]\n* [PRIVACY][74]\n\n[ [linkedin] ][75]\n\u00a9 2024 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n[1]: https://in.medlineasia.com/\n[2]: https://in.medlineasia.com/catalogsearch/advanced/\n[3]: #contentarea\n[4]: #store.menu\n[5]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin\n[6]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/nursing-supplies\n[7]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/stethoscope\n[8]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/accessories\n[9]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/clipper-blade\n[10]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/cssd-others\n[11]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/electro-surgery\n[12]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/quicksuite\n[13]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/scalpels-blades\n[14]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/skin-markers\n[15]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/sterlization-wrap\n[16]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/surgical-drapes\n[17]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/face-mask\n[18]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/surgical-gowns\n[19]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/therapy-rehabilitation\n[20]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/medication-delivery\n[21]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/oximeter\n[22]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/oxygen-mask\n[23]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/exam-gloves\n[24]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/surgical-gloves\n[25]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/caps-hoods\n[26]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/coverall\n[27]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/disposable-scrub-wear\n[28]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/gowns\n[29]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/shoe-covers\n[30]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/acute-wound-care\n[31]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/bandges\n[32]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/oral-care\n[33]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/casting-products\n[34]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/cotton-balls\n[35]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/cotton-pads\n[36]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/cotton-rounds\n[37]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/emesis-sickness-bags\n[38]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/incontinence\n[39]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/bags-liners\n[40]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/aerosol-therapy\n[41]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/humidification\n[42]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/oxygen-therapy\n[43]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/pulmonary-hygiene\n[44]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/vascular-access\n[45]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/vascular-access/manifolds\n[46]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/vascular-access/fluid-management\n[47]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/vascular-access/stopcocks\n[48]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/vascular-access/hemostasis-devices\n[49]: #\n[50]: https://in.medlineasia.com/capabilities/information-systems\n[51]: https://in.medlineasia.com/capabilities/business-support-group\n[52]: https://in.medlineasia.com/capabilities/finance-group\n