            "text": "The store will not work correctly when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\nToggle Nav [ [Medline India] ][1]\n**Search**\nSearch\n[ Advanced Search ][2]\nSearch\n[ Skip to Content ][3]\n[ Main Menu ][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Nursing Supplies][6]\n* [Stethoscope][7]\n* [Accessories][8]\n* [Clipper & Blade][9]\n* [CSSD - Others][10]\n* [Electro Surgery][11]\n* [QuickSuite][12]\n* [Scalpels & Blades][13]\n* [Skin Markers][14]\n* [Sterlization Wrap][15]\n* [Surgical Drapes][16]\n* [Face Mask][17]\n* [Surgical Gowns][18]\n* [Therapy & Rehabilitation][19]\n* [Medication Delivery][20]\n* [Oximeter][21]\n* [Oxygen Mask][22]\n* [Exam Gloves][23]\n* [Surgical Gloves][24]\n* [Caps & Hoods][25]\n* [Coverall][26]\n* [Disposable Scrub Wear][27]\n* [Gowns][28]\n* [Shoe Covers][29]\n* [Acute Wound Care][30]\n* [Bandges][31]\n* [Oral Care][32]\n* [Casting Products][33]\n* [Cotton Balls][34]\n* [Cotton Pads][35]\n* [Cotton Rounds][36]\n* [Emesis Sickness Bags][37]\n* [Incontinence][38]\n* [Bags & Liners][39]\n* [Aerosol Therapy][40]\n* [Humidification][41]\n* [Oxygen Therapy][42]\n* [Pulmonary Hygiene][43]\n* [Vascular Access][44]\n* [Manifolds][45]\n* [Fluid Management][46]\n* [Stopcocks][47]\n* [Hemostasis Devices][48]\n* ProductsNursing SuppliesStethoscopeAccessoriesClipper & BladeCSSD - OthersElectro\nSurgeryQuickSuiteScalpels & BladesSkin MarkersSterlization WrapSurgical DrapesFace MaskSurgical\nGownsTherapy & RehabilitationMedication DeliveryOximeterOxygen MaskExam GlovesSurgical GlovesCaps\n& HoodsCoverallDisposable Scrub WearGownsShoe CoversAcute Wound CareBandgesOral CareCasting\nProductsCotton BallsCotton PadsCotton RoundsEmesis Sickness BagsIncontinenceBags & LinersAerosol\nTherapyHumidificationOxygen TherapyPulmonary HygieneVascular AccessManifoldsHemostasis\nDevicesStopcocksFluid Management capabilities Information Systems Business Support Group Finance\nGroup About Us About Medline Code of Conduct Environmental, Social And Governance Medline\nInternational Insights Careers Contact Us\n* [Capabilities][49]\n* [Information Technology][50]\n* [Business Support Group][51]\n* [Finance Group][52]\n\n[About Us][53]\n* [About Medline][54]\n* [Code of Conduct][55]\n* [Sustainability][56]\n* [Medline International][57]\n* [Fast Facts][58]\n* [Values][59]\n\n[Careers][60]\n\n[Contact Us][61]\n* [ Home ][62]\n* **ESG**\n\n##### Sustainability\n\n## Discover how we bring our global\n## commitments to life.\n\n[Read our 2024 report][63]\n\n## OUR PURPOSE\n\nAt Medline India, we are dedicated to sustainability initiatives that create a lasting & positive\nimpact. We strategically leverage our resources to foster sustainable community development, guided\nby our core values. Our commitment to environmental and social responsibility is reflected in our\ndedicated \"Sustainability\" team, working towards a long-term, sustainable future. As Medline\nevolves, so does our approach to sustainability. We have rebranded our Sustainability Program to the\nSustainability Program to better encapsulate our holistic commitment to society and the environment,\nwith a strong focus on responsible governance practices.\n\nMedline India has been actively engaged in projects & initiatives across the 3 focus areas,\nparticularly in Pune and its surrounding regions, creating a meaningful and positive impact in the\ncommunity.\n\n## Environment\n* **Our Commitment to Reforestation:** Supporting tree planting to create healthier ecosystems.\n* **Green Space Preservation:** Providing infrastructure support for the maintenance of vital green\nspaces.\n* **Protecting Natural Ecosystems:** Participating in nature conservation and restoration for a\nthriving planet.\n\n[Take a closer look][64]\n\n## Health & Care\n* **Distributing Essential Medical Supplies:** Delivering critical medical supplies to underserved\npopulations.\n* **Improved Community Health:** Organizing health check-up camps to promote early detection and\nprevention.\n* **Providing Medical Aid:** Donating medical supplies to those in need.\n* **Prioritizing Employee Health and Well-being:** Implementing programs to support the physical and\nmental health of our workforce.\n\n## Community impact\n* **Education:** Providing support and resources to promote access to quality education.\n* **Rural Development:** Improving living standards in rural areas and villages by addressing basic\nneeds such as clean water, electricity, sanitation, and hygiene.\n* **Women and Girl Empowerment:** Creating opportunities and fostering the potential of women and\ngirls through various initiatives.\n* **Care for the disadvantaged groups:** Providing care and support for underprivileged children\n,senior citizens & differently abled community.\n* **Disaster Relief:** Offering assistance and resources to communities affected by natural\ncalamities.\n\n[Take a closer look][65]\n\n## Robust governance\n\nWe do what is right, not only what is required, and hold our business, employees\nand suppliers to high ethical standards.\n\nKey topics:\n* Ethical sourcing\n* Business ethicsy\n* Data privacy and security\n\n## Current report\n\n## Read about our latest ESG efforts\n\nOur annual Medline ESG report details our global impact and the progress we're making to reduce our\nenvironmental footprint, foster an inclusive work\nenvironment, support our communities and more.\n\n[Download our 2023 report][66]\n\n## KEY HIGHLIGHTS\n\n## See how we made an impact in 2023\n\n**$34.5M** invested in\nglobal solar energy\nto date\n\n**185 metric tons **of\nproduct donated\nfor medical relief\n\n**10 Medline**\n**facilities** are ISO\n14001 certified\n\n**7 employee**\n**resource groups**\ncreated to support\ndiversity\n\n**100+ charities**\nsupported with\n9,100+ volunteer\nhours logged on\nDeed\n\n**2.5M+ reprocessed**\n**medical devices**\nthrough Medline\nReNewal program\u2019s\nown facilities\n\n## Connect with Medline\n\n### Contact us\n\nWe\u2019re here to answer your questions and\nprovide any guidance you need.\n\n[Get in touch][67]\n\n### Explore careers\n\nFind opportunities to do your best work with\nus.\n\n[Learn more][68]\n\n#### About Us\n* [Our Company][69]\n* [Code of Conduct][70]\n\n#### Careers\n* [How to Apply][71]\n\n#### Contact\n\nMedline Offices\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n[Medline-logo]\n\n**ABOUT US**\n\n[Our Company][72]\n\n[Code Of Conduct][73]\n\n**CAREERS**\n\n[How To Apply][74]\n\n**CONTACT**\n\nMedline Offices\n\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n\u00a9 2022 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n### Connect with Medline\n\n#### Contact Us\n\nWe're here to answer your questions and provide any guidance you need\n\n[Get in touch][75]\n\n#### Explore Careers\n\nFind opportunities to do your best work with us every day\n\n[Find your passion][76]\n\n#### Read our news stories\n\nLearn about our partnerships, products and solutions in the news.\n\n[Visit our newsroom][77]\n* [LEGAL][78]\n* [PRIVACY][79]\n\n[ [linkedin] ][80]\n\u00a9 2024 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n[1]: https://in.medlineasia.com/\n[2]: https://in.medlineasia.com/catalogsearch/advanced/\n[3]: #contentarea\n[4]: #store.menu\n[5]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin\n[6]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/nursing-supplies\n[7]: https://in.medlineasia.com/pr