Business Support Group Finance\nGroup About Us About Medline Code of Conduct Environmental, Social And Governance Medline\nInternational Insights Careers Contact Us\n* [Capabilities][49]\n* [Information Technology][50]\n* [Business Support Group][51]\n* [Finance Group][52]\n\n[About Us][53]\n* [About Medline][54]\n* [Code of Conduct][55]\n* [Sustainability][56]\n* [Medline International][57]\n* [Fast Facts][58]\n* [Values][59]\n\n[Careers][60]\n\n[Contact Us][61]\n* [ Home ][62]\n* **Fast Facts Medline India**\n\n#### FAST FACTS\n\n# About Medline\n\nWe are the largest medical-surgical product and supply chain solutions company, serving healthcare\nproviders across the continuum of care.\n\n~335,000\n\nproducts to serve all points of care\n\n][63]\n\n100+ countries and territories\n\nwhere we do business\n\n][64]\n\n2,700+\n\nquality control\nemployees\nglobally\n\n][65]\n\n29+\nmillion\n\nsquare feet of warehousing globally*\n\n][66]\n\n98%+\n\nPrime Vendor customer retention rate over the last five years\n\n[3 outlines of people with a thumbs up above]\n\nNext-day delivery to\n\n95%\n\nof U.S. customers\n\n[Open box]\n\n2,100+\n\nMedTrans trucks\nin the U.S.\n\n[Hand pointing at clipboard with checkmark]\n\n45,000+\n\nemployees worldwide\n\n[Globe that has 4 pinpoints with an outline a person]\n\n50+ years\n\nof consecutive annual growth in revenue\n\n[Bar chart with increasing values with line chart trending upwards above]\n\nglobal distribution centers*\n\nmanufacturing sites across North America**\n\n[Medical products on a conveyor belt]\n\n$28.4 billion\n\nin overall 2025 net sales\n\n[Dollar with coints stacked in front]\n\n*Includes warehouses, cross-docks, and transship facilities\n**30 global manufacturing sites\nUnless otherwise indicated, all figures are as of December 31, 2025.\n\nMarket position based on total net sales of medical-surgical (\u201cmed-surg\u201d) products compared to\nreported net sales of med-surg products by companies that are both med-surg manufacturers and\ndistributors.\n\n#### About Us\n* [Our Company][67]\n* [Code of Conduct][68]\n\n#### Careers\n* [How to Apply][69]\n\n#### Contact\n\nMedline Offices\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n[Medline-logo]\n\n**ABOUT US**\n\n[Our Company][70]\n\n[Code Of Conduct][71]\n\n**CAREERS**\n\n[How To Apply][72]\n\n**CONTACT**\n\nMedline Offices\n\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n\u00a9 2022 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n### Connect with Medline\n\n#### Contact Us\n\nWe're here to answer your questions and provide any guidance you need\n\n[Get in touch][73]\n\n#### Explore Careers\n\nFind opportunities to do your best work with us every day\n\n[Find your passion][74]\n\n#### Read our news stories\n\nLearn about our partnerships, products and solutions in the news.\n\n[Visit our newsroom][75]\n* [LEGAL][76]\n* [PRIVACY][77]\n\n[ [linkedin] ][78]\n\u00a9 2024 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n[1]: https://in.medlineasia.com/\n[2]: https://in.medlineasia.com/catalogsearch/advanced/\n[3]: #contentarea\n[4]: #store.menu\n[5]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin\n[6]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/nursing-supplies\n[7]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/stethoscope\n[8]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/accessories\n[9]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/clipper-blade\n[10]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/cssd-others\n[11]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/ele