[Pharmaceuticals][48]\n    * [Specialty Pharmacy][49]\n    * [GLP-1 Cold Chain Solutions][50]\n    * [Clinical Trials][51]\n    * [Blood & Tissue][52]\n    * [Animal Health][53]\n    * [Peptide Therapies][54]\n    * [Longevity Medications][55]\n    * [Long-Term Care Facility Pharmacies][56]\n    * [Trigger Point Injections][57]\n  * [Food & Perishables][58]\n    * [Fresh Food][59]\n    * [Frozen Food][60]\n  * [Industrial][61]\n* [Services][62]\n  * [Lab Services][63]\n  * [Kitting Solutions][64]\n  * [Conditioning Services][65]\n  * [Product Engineering][66]\n  * [Supply Chain Services][67]\n  * [Consulting][68]\n* [Resources][69]\n  * [News][70]\n  * [Media Gallery][71]\n  * [Blog][72]\n  * [Frequently Asked Questions][73]\n* [About][74]\n  * [Why Us][75]\n  * [Executive Leadership Team][76]\n  * [Environmental Commitment][77]\n  * [History][78]\n  * [Partnerships][79]\n  * [Careers][80]\n* [Contact][81]\n* [Products][82]\n  * [Refrigerants][83]\n    * [Cold Chain Gel Packs][84]\n      * [Nordic\u00ae Ice-Eco Paper Gel Packs][85]\n      * [Nordic Drain Safe\u00ae][86]\n      * [Nordic Ice\u00ae Regular Gel Packs][87]\n      * [Nordic Ice\u00ae Linked Gel Packs][88]\n      * [Nordic Ice\u00ae No Sweat Gel Packs][89]\n    * [Nordic Ice\u00ae Wraps][90]\n    * [Nordic Ice\u00ae Bricks][91]\n  * [Thermal Packaging][92]\n    * [Polyurethane Cooler Boxes][93]\n    * [Nordic Molded EPS Shipping Coolers][94]\n    * [Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][95]\n    * [Insulated Mailers][96]\n      * [Reflective Bubble Mailers][97]\n      * [Cotton & Expansion Insulated Mailers][98]\n  * [Design Tested Solutions][99]\n    * [\ud83c\udf1f Nordic GLP-1 Express Pack\u2122][100]\n    * [Nordic Express\u2122 Design-Tested Cotton Shippers][101]\n    * [Nordic Express\u2122 Design-Tested EPS Shippers][102]\n    * [Global 456 Design-Tested Pallet Shipper][103]\n    * [Design-Tested Frozen Vaccine Shippers][104]\n    * [Nordic Extreme PUR Frozen Shipper][105]\n  * [Sustainable Packaging][106]\n    * [Nordic\u00ae Ice-Eco Paper Gel Packs][107]\n    * [Cotton Mailers][108]\n    * [Nordic Drain Safe\u00ae][109]\n    * [Nordic Elements\u2122 Sustainable Paper Liners][110]\n    * [Nordic Express\u2122 Design-Tested Cotton Shippers][111]\n    * [Sustainable Cotton Shippers][112]\n  * [Cold Chain Pallet Shippers][113]\n    * [1800 CRT Pallet Shipper][114]\n    * [Pallet Shippers][115]\n    * [Global 456 Design-Tested Pallet Shipper][116]\n    * [Pallet Covers][117]\n  * [Custom Solutions][118]\n  * [Temperature & Data Loggers][119]\n    * [Thermis Tag 1E Single-use LED Temperature Indicator][120]\n    * [Fresh Tag 1 USB Temperature Data Logger][121]\n    * [TagPlus-TH LCD Display Temperature and Humidity Data Logger][122]\n* [Market Solutions][123]\n  * [Life Sciences][124]\n    * [Vaccines][125]\n    * [Pharmaceuticals][126]\n    * [Specialty Pharmacy][127]\n    * [GLP-1 Cold Chain Solutions][128]\n    * [Clinical Trials][129]\n    * [Blood & Tissue][130]\n    * [Animal Health][131]\n    * [Peptide Therapies][132]\n    * [Longevity Medications][133]\n    * [Long-Term Care Facility Pharmacies][134]\n    * [Trigger Point Injections][135]\n  * [Food & Perishables][136]\n    * [Fresh Food][137]\n    * [Frozen Food][138]\n  * [Industrial][139]\n* [Services][140]\n  * [Lab Services][141]\n  * [Kitting Solutions][142]\n  * [Conditioning Services][143]\n  * [Product Engineering][144]\n  * [Supply Chain Services][145]\n  * [Consulting][146]\n* [Resources][147]\n  * [News][148]\n  * [Media Gallery][149]\n  * [Blog][150]\n  * [Frequently Asked Questions][151]\n* [About][152]\n  * [Why Us][153]\n  * [Executive Leadership Team][154]\n  * [Environmental Commitment][155]\n  * [History][156]\n  * [Partnerships][157]\n  * [Careers][158]\n* [Contact][159]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][160]\n[GLP-1 Vials]\n\n## From Packout to Patient\n\nIntroducing the GLP-1 & Small-Format Packaging Innovation Lab\nA customer-first initiative built to help teams move from pack-out concept to high-volume parcel\nshipping, without sacrificing consistency, compliance, or performance.\n[ Explore the Lab ][161]\n\n# Your True Partner\n# in the Cold Chain Process\n\n## Nordic Cold Chain Solutions is committed to providing quality, cost-effective solutions for your\n## cold chain packaging needs.\n\n[ Learn More ][162]\n\n## Our People\n\n## Our Process\n\n## Our Capabilities\n\n## Your Success\n\n## Introducing the World\u2019s First\n\n## Zero-Waste Gel Pack\n\n## Nordic^{\u00ae} Ice-Eco\n## Paper Gel Packs\n\n## Built for Businesses.\n## Designed for the Planet.\n\n[ Learn More ][163]\n[Nordic Elements]\nAs an industry leader in temperature-controlled packaging, we are proud to introduce Nordic\nElements, our brand-new line of eco-friendly packaging products.\n[ Learn More ][164]\n[\nLife Science Cold Chain Solutions\nOur company creates packaging with the highest quality materials for a wide range of lifestyle\nsciences.\nLearn More\n][165]\n[\nFood & Perishables\nRefrigerants, thermal packaging, sustainable packaging, and commercial bulk pallet shipping systems\nto ensure perishable food products arrive at their destination safely.\nLearn More\n][166]\n[\nSustainability\nWe offer products made from sustainable packaging materials making them safe for your buyers and the\nenvironment.\nLearn More\n][167]\n[\nPharmaceutical\nCold Chain Experts\nThe pharmaceutical packing industry has strict demands on their shipping materials. Nordic Cold\nChain Solutions meets and exceeds these demands.\nLearn More\n][168]\n\n## Let the experts at Nordic architect the right solution for your cold chain needs.\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\n[ Speak With a Cold Chain\nSolutions Expert Today! ][169]\n\n## Let the experts at Nordic architect the right solution for your cold chain needs.\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\n[ Speak With a Cold Chain\nSolutions Expert Today! ][170]\n\n## From high-quality materials to fully-custom solutions, Nordic Cold Chain Solutions has a proven\n## ability to scale with customers unmatched by the rest of the industry.\n\n## Nordic Cold Chain Solutions delivers more than half a billion products every single year with the\n## highest customer satisfaction.\n\n[ Speak With a Cold Chain Solutions Expert ][171]\n\n## Your products demand the highest quality temperature-controlled cold chain packaging products and\n## services.\n\n## Nordic Cold Chain Solutions is a leader in flexible, innovative, and sustainable cold chain\n## solutions across a wide spectrum of industry applications.\n\n## Contact a Nordic cold chain solutions specialist today to discuss your application needs.\n\n## Our team of experts will help solve your cold chain needs.\n\n## [(866) 427-1919][172]\n\n## Give us a call today!\n\nNordic Cold Chain Solutions is a leader in the cold chain landscape providing expert cold chain\nproducts and services to industry leaders. Nordic Cold Chain Solutions is a company of Temperatsure,\nLLC.\n\n[ Facebook-f ][173] [ Linkedin-in ][174]\n[Products][175]\n* [Cold Chain Refrigerants][176]\n* [Thermal Packaging][177]\n* [Design Tested Solutions][178]\n* [Sustainable Packaging][179]\n* [Cold Chain Pallet Shippers][180]\n* [Custom Cold Chain Solutions][181]\n* [Temperature & Data Loggers][182]\n* [Cold Chain Refrigerants][183]\n* [Thermal Packaging][184]\n* [Design Tested Solutions][185]\n* [Sustainable Packaging][186]\n* [Cold Chain Pallet Shippers][187]\n* [Custom Cold Chain Solutions][188]\n* [Temperature & Data Loggers][189]\n[Market Solutions][190]\n* [Life Sciences][191]\n* [Vaccines][192]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][193]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][194]\n* [Clinical Trials][195]\n* [Blood & Tissue][196]\n* [Animal Health][197]\n* [Food & Perishables][198]\n* [Industrial][199]\n* [Life Sciences][200]\n* [Vaccines][201]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][202]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][203]\n* [Clinical Trials][204]\n* [Blood & Tissue][205]\n* [Animal Health][206]\n* [Food & Perishables][207]\n* [Industrial][208]\n[Services][209]\n* [Lab Services][210]\n* [Kitting Solutions][211]\n* [Conditioning Services][212]\n* [Product Engineering][213]\n* [Supply Chain Services][214]\n* [Consulting][215]\n* [Lab Services][216]\n* [Kitting Solutions][217]\n* [Conditioning Services][218]\n* [Product Engineering][219]\n* [Supply Chain Services][220]\n* [Consulting][221]\n* [ **Contact Sales**\n  866-427-1919 ][222]\n* [ **Customer Support**\n  866-427-1919 ][223]\n\u00a9 2026 Nordic Cold Chain Solutions. All rights reserved. A Temperatsure, LLC. company.\n[Site Map \u00a0|][224]\n[Privacy Policy][225]\n[Website Design & Development by Amplify Industrial Marketing + Guidance][226]\nPlease ensure Javascript is enabled for purposes of [website accessibility][227]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: tel:8664271919\n[3]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com\n[4]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/\n[5]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/refrigerants/\n[6]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/refrigerants/gel-packs/\n[7]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-ice-paper-gel-packs/\n[8]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-drain-safe/\n[9]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-ice-regular-gel-packs/\n[10]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-ice-linked-gel-packs/\n[11]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-ice-no-sweat/\n[12]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-ice-wraps/\n[13]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-ice-bricks/\n[14]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/thermal-packaging/\n[15]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/polyurethane-cooler-boxes/\n[16]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-molded-eps-shipping-coolers/\n[17]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/insulated-foil-bubble-box-liners/\n[18]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/insulated-mailers/\n[19]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/reflective-bubble-mailers/\n[20]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/cotton-expansion-insulated-mailers/\n[21]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/thermal-packaging/design-tested-solutions/\n[22]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-glp-1-express-pack/\n[23]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-express-design-tested-cotton-shippers/\n[24]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-express-design-tested-eps-shippers/\n[25]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/global-456-design-tested-pallet-shipper/\n[26]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/design-tested-frozen-vaccine-shippers/\n[27]: https://www.nordiccoldchain.com/products/nordic-extreme-"
