      "polished_summary": "Nordic Ice specializes in cold chain solutions, offering a comprehensive range of products including gel packs, thermal packaging, and insulated shipping containers. The company serves diverse markets such as life sciences, pharmaceuticals, food and perishables, and industrial sectors, providing innovative and sustainable packaging solutions to ensure temperature-sensitive products are delivered safely and efficiently.",
