      "company_summary": "Owens & Minor is a healthcare logistics company that specializes in providing innovative supply chain solutions and services to healthcare providers and manufacturers, aimed at improving patient outcomes. Their core offerings include products such as SurgiTrack for surgical supply management, QSight for inventory management, and PANDAC for suture management, all designed to enhance efficiency and safety in hospitals and surgical centers. By leveraging advanced analytics and tailored services, Owens & Minor supports healthcare facilities in optimizing their operational processes and inventory management.",
