        "products": "SurgiTrack; QSight Kanban; HALYARD* Custom Procedure Trays; SurgiTrack; PANDAC; QSight; Medical Kitting Services; SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery; PANDAC: Suture Management; OMFreight+",
