            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* [Distribution & Logistics][4]\n* * [3PL Services][5]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][6]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][7]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][8]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][9]\n* [OMFreight+][10]\n* [Supplier Management][11]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][12]\n* [Procedural Services][13]\n* Close\n* [Procedural Services][14]\n* * [QSight][15]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][16]\n* [QSight Kanban][17]\n* [QSight RFID][18]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][19]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][20]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][21]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][22]\n* [Proprietary Products][23]\n* [About][24]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][25]\n* [Sustainability][26]\n* * [Careers][27]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][28]\n* [Newsroom][29]\n* [Insights][30]\n* [Insights][31]\n* Close\n* [Insights][32]\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][33]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][34]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][35]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][36]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][37]\n[More Topics][38]\n* [Inventory Management][39]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][40]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][41]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][42]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][45]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][46]\n[More Topics][47]\n* [Consulting][48]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][49]\n* [Infection Prevention][50]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][51]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][52]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][53]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][54]\n[More Topics][55]\n* [Contact Us][56]\n* [Search][57]\n* Close\n* Search\n[SurgiTrack logo]\n\n# Perioperative Supply Chain Management Made Easy\n\nSurgiTrack\u00ae delivers custom surgical procedure kitting, logistics, data analytics, that drive OR\nefficiencies\n\n[ Schedule an Assessment ][58]\n[Home][59]\n[Services][60]\nSurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery\n\n## Address Operating Room Inefficiencies\n\nOperating rooms face challenges related to operational inefficiencies, lack of visibility to cost\nand inventories, and discarded products due to expiration or lack of need. In fact, the average\nannual cost of unused, discarded supplies is $200 Million. SurgiTrack is a comprehensive clinical\nsupply delivery service that delivers ready-to-use custom surgery packs right to your facility based\non procedure and physician preference. We provide the supplies and the staff to pick those supplies\nso you don\u2019t have to, enabling you to focus your time, effort, and attention on patient care.\n\n## Taking the Stress out of Inventory Management\n\nSurgiTrack is an end-to-end case management solution that delivers the full list of disposable\nproducts needed to perform each procedure combined with powerful reporting capabilities that\ntransforms your perioperative supply chain.\n\nAdvanced Analytics\nSurgiTrack takes the guesswork out of perioperative inventory management, using sophisticated\nmethodologies and advanced analytics to drive efficiencies and lower costs.\nCustomized Surgery Packs\nSurgiTrack enables clinicians to focus on patient care by assisting in determining the right product\nconfiguration and delivering the necessary supplies at the right time.\nProduct Consumption with Easy Returns\nSurgiTrack provides a customized product configuration to reduce wasted product based on your actual\nusage. We deliver the necessary supplies at the right time with the ability to return the unopened\nor unused products for a full refund.\nOnsite Resources & Productivity Efficiencies\nThe Operating Room is a busy setting that doesn\u2019t leave much room for wasted time or effort.\nIncorrect inventory can have a real impact on staff morale, overall process efficiency and patient\nsafety.\n[ Download the SurgiTrack Overview ][61]\n\n## A Well-Balanced Perioperative Supply Chain\n\nSurgiTrack\u00ae is Owens & Minor\u2019s industry-leading unitized delivery system that combines lean\nmethodologies, technology, surgical products, and physician preference products into one streamlined\nprocess.\n\nFlexible Solution\nYour SurgiTrack kit is custom built to your exact needs, driving standardization and allowing for\nsurgeon preference.\nEasy Returns\nSimple return process that reduces waste, increases utilization and captures lost costs.\nReady to Use\nYour kits are prepared in one of our Controlled Access Restricted Environments (CARE) rooms then\ndelivered right to your hospital, typically within 24 hours.\nAdvanced Analytics\nSurgiTrack turns your data into actionable insights through regular reporting on product usage,\nprocedure, and surgeon comparison.\n\n## The Power of Analytics\n\nSurgiTrack turns your physician preference card, returns, and usage data into actionable insights so\nyou can make informed decisions that save time and expense.\n\n## How it Works\n\nBased on the customer\u2019s schedule, we deliver SurgiTrack individualized kits from our distribution\ncenters directly to the OR\u2014freeing up clinicians and staff time and storage space. This end-to-end\ncase management includes products from Owens & Minor\u2019s 1,200 manufacturer\u2019s partners.\n\nOrder\nProcedure kits assembled at the Distribution Center\nDelivery\nOwens & Minor driver delivers the procedures kits daily\nReceipt & Storage\nProcedure kits are received into inventory and products are stored in the sterile processing supply\narea\nAggregation\nSurgiTrack procedures, PPI, and implants are aggregated\nCredit\nOnce procedure is completed, qualified unused product can be returned for credit\nAnalytics\nDrive smarter, better decisions based on data\n\n## The Value of SurgiTrack\n\nMinimize case set-up time\nGreater efficiency in the sourcing and receiving of supplies\nMore accurate charge capture\nLower procedural supply costs\nGreater efficiency in the sourcing and receiving of supplies\nReduce on-hand inventory\n\n> \"Customers love the data from SurgiTrack. Often, I\u2019ll present some key findings and they\u2019ll have\n> an \u201caha\u201d moment and discover some new insight they didn\u2019t know before.\"\n> -SurgiTrack teammate\n\n## SurgiTrack by the Numbers\n\nOperating Rooms in a variety of hospital settings are benefiting from SurgiTrack. We deliver\nSurgiTrack kits nationally from 7 CARE rooms.\n\n> 300k\nProcedures delivered annually\n1.2 M\ncomponents shipped annually\n> 99\nhospitals trust SurgiTrack\n\n## What to Expect at an Assessment\n\nWe offer a free assessment conducted by an experienced team of clinical and supply chain leaders\nwith years of OR experience and established best practices. The SurgiTrack Assessment mirrors\nestablished clinical processes to provide realistic opportunities for improved operational\nefficiency and costs savings.\n\nRequest Data\nA SurgiTrack representative will review your procedure data and inventory history.\nSpend Three Days On-Site\nOur team will spend time on-site and interview your leadership to make sure we understand your\nunique needs.\nAnalysis\nWe'll review the data you provided and findings from our time on-site to make detailed\nrecommendations for improvement.\nAssessment\nOur SurgiTrack team will provide a transition plan from current to future workflows, procedure\nsupply, and financial impact analysis.\nApproval and Implementation\nWe'll make sure our teams are aligned on next steps and deliver a proposed implementation outline.\n\n## Contact us for a free assessment\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nHow can we help?(Required)\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][62]\n* [OM MarketPlace][63]\n* * [QSight][64]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][67]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][68]\n* [Linkedin][69]\n* [Instagram][70]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][71]\n* [Privacy Policy][72]\n* [Web Content Statement][73]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][74]\n* [Glossary][75]\n* [Sitemap][76]\n* [CA SB 261][77]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][78]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[26]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[28]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[35]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[38]: /about/news-pr/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[41]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[46]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics"
