          {
            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n[Owens Minor QSight]\n\n# RFID\n\nThe Future of Inventory Management\n\n[ Book a Demo ][55]\n\n## A More Effective Way to Track Inventory\n\nTrying to track inventory effectively and safely in procedural areas can be a challenge. Some people\ntake items because they might be needed elsewhere. Others bring items in and do not use them. The\nresult is inventory you don\u2019t know you have and inventory you think you have but don\u2019t. In short,\nyou have inaccurate counts causing you to order too much or too little replenishment product. The\nsolution? QSight RFID.\n\n## QSight RFID\n\nQSight RFID combines this innovative technology with Owens & Minor\u2019s end-to-end perpetual inventory\nmanagement system. This powerful, easy-to-use solution enables you to track products as they enter\nand leave your procedural area, obtain fast and accurate inventory counts, and provide you with\ncritical information to better manage your supply chain. Equally important, it provides you\nvisibility into your current inventory\u2014total amounts and locations.\n\nScalable\nOur RFID solutions are easily scalable. You can start small in a single location. Then, as you work\nthe RFID technology into your workflow, you can quickly expand to other locations.\nFlexible\nWe can configure our RFID solutions to fit your needs. Whether you have a small storage room or a\nlarge procedural area, our solutions can be customized to fit any location.\nAccurate\nOur RFID solutions provide you counts that are up to 99.9% accurate, enabling a user to identify\nmissing and/or misplaced items quickly and easily.\nActionable Information\nThe data collected from the RFID scans is instantly conveyed to your QSight dashboard where it is\nturned into actional information, enabling you to make smarter, faster decisions.\n\n## How it Works\n\nPlaced\nRFID tags are placed on products at the hospital\nScanned\nBarcodes and RFID tags are scanned into QSight\nRead\nTags are read by RFID readers affixed to cabinets or in storage rooms\nTransmitted\nData is transmitted to QSight\nAnalyzed\nThe data is analyzed in QSight for actionable insights\n\n## Owens & Minor offers two RFID solutions to meet your needs\n\nOpen Architecture Solution\n\u2022 Fixed and hand-held units for storage rooms.\n\u2022 Designed for areas where products are kept unsecured in open spaces.\n\u2022 Wall-mounted and hand-held units enable users to take quick and accurate inventory counts.\nClosed Architecture Solution\n\u2022 RFID enabled cabinets customized to your needs.\n\u2022 Ideal for costly or temperature-controlled inventory.\n\u2022 Available in different sizes and temperature configurations.\n\n## What is Ultra-High Frequency Radio Frequency (UHF) RFID\n\nUHF RFID identification is an automatic wireless communication technology that allows users to read\ndata from a distance. Owens & Minor uses UFT because it is the highest frequency available for RFID,\nenabling over 900 reads a second of RFID tags.\n\n## RFID Integrated with QSight Solution\n\nOwens and Minor\u2019s RFID solutions are tightly integrated within QSight. The data collected by our\nRFID devices is instantly conveyed to QSight. By logging into QSight, you can see inventory counts\navailable in specified storage areas\u2014items that should be there and those that should not\u2014and counts\nof items that are not there but should be.\n\n## Getting Started with QSight RFID\n\n**Three Steps to Get You Started**\n\nGetting started with QSight\u2019s RFID technology is easy and fast with our team of RFID experts. We\nfollow a three-step process to get you up and running quickly, while minimizing any disruptions to\nyour current workflow.\n\nAssess Your Needs\nEach hospital is different and yours is no exception, with different needs, space configurations and\nso much more. That\u2019s why the first step getting started with RFID technology is assessing your\nneeds. Our team of RFID experts will be on-site at your facility, talking to staff, and taking a\ndeep dive into how you manage your inventory today.\nCollaborate on a Solution\nWe\u2019ll take the information obtained from the assessment and work with you to determine the best RFID\nsolution that meets your needs, timeline, and budget.\nImplement the Solution\nOnce we\u2019ve determined what solution works best for you, our implementation team will work closely\nwith you on installing the equipment, training the staff, and setting you up. On your go-live day,\nwe\u2019ll be right there with you to ensure that everything goes smoothly.\n\n## Want to Learn More?\n\nTo find out more about how our QSight RFID solutions can help you, complete the form below. We look\nforward to working to help you find the best solution for your inventory management.\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nPhone Number(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nState(Required)\nAlabamaAlaskaArizonaArkansasCaliforniaColoradoConnecticutDelawareDistrict of\nColumbiaFloridaGeorgiaHawaiiIdahoIllinoisIndianaIowaKansasKentuckyLouisianaMaineMarylandMassachusett\nsMichiganMinnesotaMississippiMissouriMontanaNebraskaNevadaNew HampshireNew JerseyNew MexicoNew\nYorkNorth CarolinaNorth DakotaOhioOklahomaOregonPennsylvaniaRhode IslandSouth CarolinaSouth\nDakotaTennesseeTexasUtahVermontVirginiaWashingtonWest VirginiaWisconsinWyoming\nAre you a Qsight customer?(Required)\nYesNo\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][56]\n* [OM MarketPlace][57]\n* * [QSight][58]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][59]\n* [Careers][60]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][61]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][62]\n* [Linkedin][63]\n* [Instagram][64]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][65]\n* [Privacy Policy][66]\n* [Web Content Statement][67]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][68]\n* [Glossary][69]\n* [Sitemap][70]\n* [CA SB 261][71]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][72]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[35]: /about/news-pr/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[38]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[41]: /about/news-pr/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[46]: /about/news-pr/\n[47]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[49]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[5"
