            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n[Owens Minor QSight]\n\n# Inventory Management for Procedural Supply Chain\n\nImprove inventory visibility and reduce costs with our revolutionary cloud-based healthcare\ninventory management system\n\n[ Book a Demo ][55]\n[Home][56]\n[Services][57]\nQSight\n\n## QSight Transforms How You Manage Inventory\n\nHealthcare providers today are faced with dynamic challenges in the clinical and procedural areas\ndue to carrying large amounts of inventory and unpredictable demand. QSight is Owens & Minor\u2019s\nend-to-end perpetual inventory management system that integrates with a health system\u2019s IT\ninfrastructure to capture the total picture of inventory while improving utilization and patient\ncharge capture.\n\n[ Download Overview ][58]\n\n## Streamline inventory from end-to-end\n\nHospital systems often have little visibility into actual supply utilization, usage patterns, and\navailable inventory. Aligning demand with proper inventory levels is important when reducing\nexcessive inventory and product waste. QSight addresses these challenges through automation of\nsupply documentation via seamless integration with the electronic health record. The system provides\nthe inventory support needed throughout every point of the supply chain. We have developed the tools\nnecessary to simplify and right-size any inventory management system, solving for system-wide\ncomplexity.\n\n[ Top 5 Reasons to Switch to QSight ][59]\nSave Time by Eliminating Manual Tasks\nWith QSight, instead of manually typing a bar code to take product in or out of inventory, users\nscan the bar code of a product instead. Those inventory levels are then automatically maintained\nwithin QSight, easily accessible to users, all while minimizing errors.\nMake Smarter Decisions Based on Data\nOur robust platform provides the inventory support needed throughout every point of the supply\nchain. We have developed the tools necessary to simplify and right-size any inventory management\nsystem, solving for system-wide complexity.\nEnhance Patient Safety by Reducing Risk\nProduct recalls are matched up with your current inventory, with QSight alerting you to the\ninventory that must be removed. QSight will even alert a clinician if they try to use a recalled\nproduct. And for expired products, users set up custom alerts to trigger when a product is about to\nexpire.\n\n## The Power of QSight\u2019s Product Database\n\nOne of the aspects that makes QSight truly unique and powerful is its 600,000+ SKU database. Once a\nuser scans a product into QSight, that product is automatically matched up against this database and\nrelevant information, such as serial number, lot, description. The result is the elimination of\nmanually entering this information and far fewer errors.\n\n## Benefits Throughout the Supply Chain\n\nIt takes an extraordinary amount of technology and experience to create a system as powerful as\nQSight. And it takes Owens & Minor\u2014the industry leader in providing great customer service\u2014to make\nit all work seamlessly.\n\nGreater Efficiency\nThe average implementation for QSight is 90 days- wasting no time getting you up and running.\nLowering Costs\nQSight provides actionable data about what inventory you have on hand to help you make smarter\ndecisions that drive down costs.\nImproved Visibility\nGet real time visibility into your inventory levels with counts that are continually kept up-to-date\nand accurate.\nEnhancing Patient Safety\nQSight reduces the risk of \u201cnever events\u201d by notifying you of recalled and expired product so you\ncan pull them before they are used.\nGreater Transparency\nQSight provides you with real time visibility into your inventory levels with counts that are\ncontinually kept up-to-date and accurate.\n\n## Additional Features of QSight\n\nTrack Bone and Tissue Implants\nSimplify tissue management by digitizing information and eliminating time-consuming manual tasks.\nLearn More\nReduce Waste and Drive Compliance with QSight\u2122 RFID\nAutomatically track and monitor high-value inventory 24/7, without redesigning your system.\nLearn More\nManage Consumables with our Kanban Storage Solution\nEasily manage consumables with our unique two-bin solution.\nLearn More\n\n## A Complete View Of Your Supply Chain, Faster Than Ever\n\n##### With greater visibility into their inventory, Supply Chain Managers can make smarter,\n##### better-informed decisions about every facet of their supply chain. The end result is often a\n##### dramatic reduction in costs throughout the supply chain, from supply spend to reduction in\n##### overstocks to inventory reductions.\n#####\n##### The easy-to-read QSight dashboard provides a single view of all inventory data. At a glance,\n##### immediately see overstocks, understocks, and backorders, while tracking usage and trends at a\n##### system-wide level.\n\n[ Learn More ][60]\n\n## How it works\n\nQSight integrates seamlessly with your existing interfaces to automate your entire inventory\nmanagement process.\n\nScan\nEasily scan the product barcode.\nMatch\nThe scanned information will be matched within the QSight database.\nManage\nImmediately use the actionable data to make effective, informed inventory decisions.\n\n## Empowers clinicians through efficiency\n\n##### QSight streamlines inventory management and eliminates manual tasks so clinicians can spend\n##### more time on what they do best, patient care. With QSight, clinicians simply scan products out\n##### of inventory once they are used in a procedure and automatically link it to the patient's\n##### Electronic Medical Records (EMR). QSight will even alert clinicians before they use a recalled\n##### product in a procedure. And with product counts maintained in QSight, clinicians no longer\n##### have to count inventory by hand. Ultimately, this means more efficient workflows for\n##### clinicians and more time focusing on patients.\n\n## Reduces risks and enhance patient safety\n\n##### The Unique Device Indicator (UDI) includes lot and expiration date information that is\n##### captured with a scan and links to a database of over 600,000 products. QSight seamlessly\n##### manages expired products while mitigating liability risks and increasing patient safety.\n\n## Recent Insights\n\nQSight\n7 Key Achievements Sharp Memorial Hospital Realized by Using QSight\nMarch 29, 2024\nRevolutionizing Healthcare Inventory Management at Sharp Memorial Hospital Sharp Memorial Hospital\n(SMH), part of Sharp HealthCare, San Diego\u2019s most comprehensive healthcare...\nRead More\nQSight\nA Look Back at QSight in 2023\nDecember 15, 2023\nThis year, we made managing consumables considerably easier with the launch of QSight Kanban, a\ntwo-bin inventory management solution. QSight...\nRead More\nQSight\nRFID in Hospital Inventory Management: Myth Versus Reality\nJune 8, 2023\nBy Will Shultz, Principal Consultant, Emerging Technology, Owens & MinorDespite RFID being proven\neffective and efficient for supply management across...\nRead More\n[ View All Insights ][61]\n\n## Contact us to improve your inventory management systems.\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nHow can we help?(Required)\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][62]\n* [OM MarketPlace][63]\n* * [QSight][64]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][67]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][68]\n* [Linkedin][69]\n* [Instagram][70]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][71]\n* [Privacy Policy][72]\n* [Web Content Statement][73]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][74]\n* [Glossary][75]\n* [Sitemap][76]\n* [CA SB 261][77]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][78]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.ow"
