          {
            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n[Owens Minor QSight]\n\n# TISSUE MANAGEMENT\n\nHuman Tissue Tracking: track bone and tissue implants in the cloud with QSight.\n\n[ Book a Demo ][55]\n[Home][56]\n[Services][57]\n[QSight][58]\nQSight Tissue Management\n\n## Digital Tissue Management - No More Logbooks\n\nTracking bone and tissue implants require more record-keeping than other products used by hospitals.\nDocumenting chain of custody with manual, paper-bound logbook entries, populating regulatory\ndetails, and tracing multiple data points to keep patients safe places demands on clinicians\u2019\ntime\u2013time that could be spent providing patient care.\n\n## Ensuring safety, reliability, and convenience\n\nQSight users have the ability to upload manufacturer IFUs, Tissue Bank Accreditation/ License, and\nmore. Easily populate required details including inspection, temperature, tissue preparation\nmaterials, and implanting physician.\n\nRegulatory Compliance\nQSight makes meeting the regulations of The Joint Commission, AATB, the FDA, and others easier by\ndigitizing information and using it to create required logs that can be accessed with just a few\nkeystrokes.\nVisibility Into Your Inventory\nWith an intuitive user interface and easy-to-use dashboards, QSight enables you to access\nat-a-glance inventory levels of tissue implants, stock below par, backorders, recall alerts, and\nother important information. With just a few clicks, you can get product-specific information and\neven order implants.\nIntegrates with Your Systems\nQSight easily integrates with your existing systems, including your Materials Management Information\nSystems (MMIS), Operating Room Information System (ORIS), and Admission, discharge, and transfer\nsystem (ADT) systems, to provide a seamless experience. With direct integration to your Electronic\nHealth Record (EHR) solution, there is no toggling back and forth during a procedure, and you can\neasily tie implant information directly to the patient\u2019s record.\n\n## Decrease Risk and Support Compliance\n\nBenefit from automated processes that empower data-driven decisions.\n\nReduce Manual Errors\nPrecise charging through barcode scanning minimizes errors.\nSupport Patient Safety\nAutomatic alerts notify you of expiring and recalled products.\nImprove Regulatory Compliance\nStaff is automatically notified of expiring product allowing for proactive management.\nClinical Record Integration\nQSight integrates with your existing systems, enabling data-driven decisions.\n\n## How it Works\n\nWith QSight, tracking tissue inventory becomes as easy as Scan, Match, Track.\n\nScan\nUse a simple hand-held scanner to scan the barcode of tissue implants.\nMatch\nThe information is matched up to our database to provide critical product information.\nTrack\nFrom the initial inspection at the dock to final disposition upon patient implantation, QSight\nprovides a full chain of custody tracking, with the information available right at your fingertips.\n\n> \u201cQSight supports the chain of custody documentation and provides bi-directional traceability for\n> bone and tissue implants.\u201d\n> Debra Mraz, Tissue & Transfusion Safety Officer, Yale New Haven Hospital\n\n## Recent Insights\n\n[7 KEY ACHIEVEMENTS SHARP MEMORIAL HOSPITAL REALIZED BY USING QSIGHT][7 KEY ACHIEVEMENTS SHARP\nMEMORIAL HOSPITAL REALIZED BY USING QSIGHT]\n\n#### 7 Key Achievements Sharp Memorial Hospital Realized by Using QSight\n\nMarch 29, 2024\n\nRevolutionizing Healthcare Inventory Management at Sharp Memorial Hospital Sharp Memorial Hospital\n(SMH), part of Sharp HealthCare, San Diego\u2019s most comprehensive\u2026\n\n[Read More][59]\n[Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital][Kanban: a\nsimple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital]\n\n#### Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n\nOctober 5, 2023\n\nThe term \u201cKanban\u201d in Japanese roughly translates to \u201csignal.\u201d It\u2019s a methodology that\u2019s been used\nfor decades across many industries,\u2026\n\n[Read More][60]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\n\n#### Kanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n\nOctober 5, 2023\n\nThe term \u201cKanban\u201d in Japanese roughly translates to \u201csignal.\u201d It\u2019s a methodology that\u2019s been used\nfor decades across many industries,\u2026\n\n[Read More][61]\n[ View All Insights ][62]\n\n## Contact us to eliminate manual tasks with QSight\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nHow can we help?(Required)\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][63]\n* [OM MarketPlace][64]\n* * [QSight][65]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][66]\n* [Careers][67]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][68]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][69]\n* [Linkedin][70]\n* [Instagram][71]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][72]\n* [Privacy Policy][73]\n* [Web Content Statement][74]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][75]\n* [Glossary][76]\n* [Sitemap][77]\n* [CA SB 261][78]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][79]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[35]: /about/news-pr/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[38]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[41]: /about/news-pr/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[46]: /about/news-pr/\n[47]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[49]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: #contact\n[56]: https://www.owens-minor.com\n[57]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[58]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[59]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/7-key-achievements-sharp-memorial-hospital-realized-by-us\ning-qsight/\n[60]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[61]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[62]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[63]: https://billonly.qsight.net\n[64]: https://ommarketplace.com/OM.CustomerPortal/Account/Home/Login\n[65]: https://qsight.net/\n[66]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/\n[67]: https://ow"
