            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n[Owens Minor QSight]\n\n# Bill Only Management\n\nAutomate the entire purchase cycle for bill only and physician preference items while eliminating\nmanual requisition requests and pricing confirmations.\n\n[ Book a Demo ][55]\n[Home][56]\n[Services][57]\nBill-Only Management\n\n## A Better Way to Manage Bill Only Purchases\n\nThe purchase cycle can become unnecessarily confusing and time-intensive dealing with paper forms\nand manual entry. Hospitals often rely on vendors for pricing validation, resulting in valuable time\nand money spent filling out paper forms, verifying pricing and re-entering information into legacy\nsystems\nand a billing cycle that takes months instead of days to complete.\n\n## Automation saves time, stress, and expense\n\nQSight Bill Only Management is an easy to use, cloud-based solution that automates the entire\npurchase cycle for bill only and physician preference products, and ensures contract pricing\naccuracy to save you money. Stop wasting time and valuable resources on outdated manual processes by\nimplementing QSight Bill Only Management, and start enjoying a streamlined, visible, and accurate\nimplant purchasing process.\n\nVerified Pricing\nQSight Bill Only Management digitizes your paper documents like requisition requests and\nautomatically verifies prices submitted by vendor reps against your pricing agreements, ensuring\nyou\u2019re paying the right price, every time.\nEfficient Routing\nRequisitions are automatically routed to the right person for approval and conveyed to your\nMaterials Management System (MMS) to be turned into Purchase Orders.\nInformation at Your Fingertips\nAn easy-to-use interface enables you to quickly see items waiting for approval from you or from\nsomeone else.\n\n## Streamline your Entire Purchase Cycle\n\nYour facility and staff do not have to worry about server space, maintenance or security. The\nintuitive design and easy to use interface of QSight Bill Only Management will allow you to optimize\ntime and reduce costs when training staff.\n\nAutomate\nInstead of relying on paper forms or time-intensive processes, everything from pricing management to\nrequisitions, POs, and invoice receipts are automated.\nMinimize Time To Requisition\nRequiring far less of your time to manage while provides greater accuracy- reducing the purchase\ncycle from weeks or months to days and even hours.\nIntegrate with Existing Systems\nYour legacy systems are easily integrated- creating a seamless user experience and enabling you to\nmanage the entire purchase life cycle.\n\n## Cutting the Purchase Cycle\n\nQSight Bill Only Management dramatically reduces the time it to takes to issue a PO for implants and\nphysician preference items. By digitizing critical information and automating manual tasks such as\nprice verification, QSight Bill Only Management can cut from weeks or even months of the purchase\ncycle time to days or even hours, and with a lot less work on your part.\n\n## How it Works\n\nQSight Bill Only Management digitizes your paper documents\u2013such as requisition requests\u2013and\nautomatically verifies prices submitted by vendor reps against your pricing agreements. Using\nadvanced automation workflows, those requisitions are automatically routed to the right person for\napproval and conveyed to your MMS system to be turned into POs. The result: A purchase process that\nrequires far less of your time to manage and provides greater accuracy and visibility.\n\nCapture\nThe vendor rep creates a requisition for the bill-only products.\nMatch\nThe information is matched against the contract pricing in the system to ensure you\u2019re paying the\nright price, every time.\nRoute\nAdvanced automation workflows automatically route to the right person for approval.\nApprove\nHospital approves the requisition.\nIssue\nPurchase order (PO) is issued to the vendor.\n\n## Eliminating Inefficiencies in Implant Purchases\n\nThe current way of processing implant purchases and preference items is draining supply chain teams\nof their most precious commodity \u2013 time.\n\n[ Read more ][58]\nContract and Capitation Management\nAutomated system for identifying capitation opportunities and modifying requisitions to reflect\ncorrect pricing to ensure you pay the right price every time\nEfficient Processes\nCentralize bill\u2013only purchase approvals to 1-2 people across a single hospital or network by\nautomating requisitions, purchase orders, and invoice receipts\n\n## Real-Time Visibility\n\n##### QSight Bill Only Management provides you with real-time visibility so that you know exactly\n##### where a requisition is in the approval process. Just log in to Bill Only Management and from a\n##### single screen see the status of all your requisitions.\n#####\n##### With this enhanced visibility, you won\u2019t be the only one spending less time chasing\n##### requisitions down. Your vendor reps will too. Instead of calling you, they\u2019ll just log in to\n##### QSight Bill Only Management to quickly see the status.\n\n[Bill Only tablet][Bill Only tablet]\n\n## Contact us for more information on QSight inventory management.\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nHow can we help?(Required)\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][59]\n* [OM MarketPlace][60]\n* * [QSight][61]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][62]\n* [Careers][63]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][64]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][65]\n* [Linkedin][66]\n* [Instagram][67]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][68]\n* [Privacy Policy][69]\n* [Web Content Statement][70]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][71]\n* [Glossary][72]\n* [Sitemap][73]\n* [CA SB 261][74]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][75]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[35]: /about/news-pr/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[38]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[41]: /about/news-pr/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[46]: /about/news-pr/\n[47]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[49]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: #contact\n[56]: https://www.owens-minor.com\n[57]: https://www.owe"
