            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n[pandac logo]\n\n# Wound Closure Inventory Management\n\nPANDAC is a comprehensive, on-site product inventory program that helps control purchases and\neliminates excess wound closure inventory while maintaining supply levels.\n\n[ Schedule an Assessment ][55]\n[Home][56]\n[Services][57]\nPANDAC: Suture Management\n\n## Reduce PAR Levels, Waste, and Freight\n\nInventory management, especially for wound closures, can be challenging, time-consuming, and highly\nvariable, resulting in wasted inventory and high costs. For more than 45 years, PANDAC has helped\ncustomers control purchases and eliminate excess wound closure inventory while maintaining supply\nlevels. PANDAC includes dedicated on-site service, in-depth reporting and integration with materials\nmanagement, business reviews and the ability to expand management to other product categories.\n\n## PANDAC takes the stress out of managing your sutures and endo-mechanical supply\n\nUsing PANDAC, hospital administrators immediately gain access to all the information they need to\ncheck wound closure inventory status. These same reports enable Owens & Minor to make\nrecommendations for controlling inventory costs and saving money in the OR Setting.\n\nSimplified Process\nWith easy product returns, reduced obsolete inventory, and detailed data analytics, end-to-end\nsupply management remains simple and stress-free.\nFocus Soley on Patient Care\nSpend more time focused on patient care and less on inventory and supply chain activities.\nSupply Chain Efficiency\nPANDAC provides a reduction in PAR levels, obsolete inventory, and freight- creating less supply\nchain tasks to manage.\n[$4.1 Million][$4.1 Million]\n\n## 1st year savings realized with PANDAC by a large medical center in the Southeast\n\n## Proven Savings, Ongoing Value\n\nTapping into patented technology to routinely monitor purchases and utilization, adjust stocking\nlevels, and provide continuous reporting on all aspects of purchasing and inventory, one of our\non-site experts manages the suture inventory in primary stocking locations within each department.\n\nCost Savings\nPANDAC helps customers reduce waste and reduce PAR levels resulting in valuable savings.\nSuture and Endo-Mechanical Management\nOwens & Minor will manage every facet- from ordering to maintaining inventory to providing\ncomprehensive reports.\nRegular Business Reviews\nData and recommendations are presented regularly for continuous improvement and optimization.\nDedicated On-Site Resource\nWith PANDAC, we will place an Owens & Minor teammate on-site to manage wound closure and other\nhigh-value supplies in each department-stocking location.\n\n#### PANDAC customers consistently save a minimum of 5% during their first year on their wound\n#### closure and high-value supply spend.\n\n## How it works\n\nStreamlining sutures, from start to finish.\n\nAccess Inventory\nWe take a physical inventory and establish benchmarks.\nManage Stock\nThe on-site Owens & Minor resource manages PAR, on-demand inventory value, and backorders.\nCreate Actionable Reports\nCustomers receive visibility into overall departments, inventory analysis, high-cost purchases, and\nmore.\nAdjust planning\nCustomers benefit from tailored adjustments according to changes in pricing, item mix, and case\nvolume.\n\n> \u201cCustomers like the fact that with PANDAC, everything is taken care of.\u201d\n> - Benny Chinchilla, O&M Teammate, Manages PANDAC at a Florida Hospital\n\n## Take our free PANDAC assessment\n\nTo find out whether PANDAC is right for you, sign up for our free assessment. Our team of experts\nwill go to your facility and conduct a thorough review of your sutures and endo inventory and spend.\nFrom that, we\u2019ll provide you with recommendations on how PANDAC can help you based on that\nassessment.\n\nOn-site\nOur team will be onsite to gather data and talk to staff.\nAnalysis\nWe\u2019ll analyze that data and identify how PANDAC can help you.\nAssessment\nWe\u2019ll provide an assessment with projected savings.\nImplementation\nWorking with your team, we\u2019ll deliver an implementation plan.\n\n## Increasing Inventory Turns with PANDAC\n\nOne of the benefits customers realize with PANDAC is an increase in inventory turns of their sutures\nand endo mechanical. PANDAC will work with a hospital to consolidate slower-moving SKUs into\nfaster-moving SKUs so that there are fewer SKUs to manage. The result if is less inventory carried,\nlower costs and a higher number of turns for the suture and endo-mechanical inventory.\n\n## Contact us for a seamless inventory process\n\nSee how PANDAC can drive value and simplify wound closure inventory management.\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nHow can we help?(Required)\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][58]\n* [OM MarketPlace][59]\n* * [QSight][60]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][61]\n* [Careers][62]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][63]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][64]\n* [Linkedin][65]\n* [Instagram][66]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][67]\n* [Privacy Policy][68]\n* [Web Content Statement][69]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][70]\n* [Glossary][71]\n* [Sitemap][72]\n* [CA SB 261][73]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][74]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[35]: /about/news-pr/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[38]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[41]: /about/news-pr/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[46]: /about/news-pr/\n[47]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[49]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: #contact\n[56]: https://www.owens-minor.com\n[57]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[58]: https://billonly.qsight.net\n[59]: https://ommarketplace.com/OM.CustomerPortal/Account/Home/Login\n[60]: https://qsight.net/\n[61]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/\n[62]: https://owensminor.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/OMCareers\n[63]: https://www.facebook.com/owensandminor/\n[64]: https://x.com/Owens_Minor\n[65]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/owens-&-minor\n[66]: https://www.instagram.com/owens_minor/\n[67]: https://www.owens-mi"
