            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n\n# Medical Kitting Services\n\n[Home][55]\n[Services][56]\nMedical Kitting Services\n\n## At Owens & Minor,\n## We Are Kitting Even Better\n\nHALYARD* Kitting stands apart because of the dedicated team that partners closely with you to\nimplement, manage, and continually optimize your entire pack program, ensuring lasting value at\nevery step. By routinely reviewing your kits and trays and enabling you to select preferred,\nhigh-quality components, we help streamline your operations, enhance consistency, and support better\noutcomes. It\u2019s a level of service designed to keep your packs performing at their best.\n\nHALYARD*\nCustom Procedure Trays\nHALYARD* Custom Procedure Trays (CPTs) provide value in your OR and ensure that your trays and kits\nhelp your staff to be more efficient and improve patient outcomes.\nLearn More\nMEDICAL ACTION\u00ae\nMinor Procedure Trays\nMinor Procedure Trays (MPTs) are designed to help your staff follow protocol by providing the right\npack for each procedure throughout your facility.\nLearn More\nSURGITRACK\u00ae Procedural Delivery\nSurgiTrack combines HALYARD* Kitting products, including custom and minor procedure trays, with\ncommodity products and physician preference items into one tote, shifting much of the procedure\nsupply chain management to O&M.\nLearn More\n\n### Kitting Center of Excellence\n\nHalyard Kitting\u2019s main hub of operations is located in Villanueva, Honduras. With more than three\ndecades of manufacturing experience in Honduras, this flagship facility incorporates the latest\ntechnology and processes for assembling custom procedure trays, including visual management\nsequencing and automated packaging systems, that nearly double Owens & Minor\u2019s current network\nkitting capacity.\n* Approaching 420,000 square feet including warehouse, production, and office space\n* Nearly 40,000 square feet of positive pressure-controlled environments and adjoining gowning rooms\n* Ability to run 24/7 with up to 2,000 teammates\n\nWatch the video to learn how this medical kitting facility is designed to help ensure exceptional\nquality, enhanced reliability, greater flexibility, and a more consistent kitting experience for\ncustomers.\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][57]\n* [OM MarketPlace][58]\n* * [QSight][59]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][62]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][63]\n* [Linkedin][64]\n* [Instagram][65]\n\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][66]\n* [Privacy Policy][67]\n* [Web Content Statement][68]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][69]\n* [Glossary][70]\n* [Sitemap][71]\n* [CA SB 261][72]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][73]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https:/