ology/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[38]: /about/news-pr/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[41]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[46]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[47]: /about/news-pr/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[49]: /about/news-pr/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[52]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[54]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[55]: /about/news-pr/\n[56]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[57]: #\n[58]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/9120+Lockwood+Blvd,+Mechanicsville,+VA+23116/\n[59]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution-locations/\n[60]: https://billonly.qsight.net\n[61]: https://ommarketplace.com/OM.CustomerPortal/Account/Home/Login\n[62]: https://qsight.net/\n[63]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/\n[64]: https://owensminor.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/OMCareers\n[65]: https://www.facebook.com/owensandminor/\n[66]: https://x.com/Owens_Minor\n[67]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/owens-&-minor\n[68]: https://www.instagram.com/owens_minor/\n[69]: https://www.owens-minor.com/website-terms-of-use/\n[70]: https://www.o"
