            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/about/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n\n# Care Starts Here\n\n[Home][55]\nAbout Us\n\n## Who We Are\n\nOwens & Minor is a global healthcare solutions company providing essential products, services and\ntechnology solutions that support care delivery in leading hospitals, health systems and research\ncenters around the world. For over 140 years, Owens & Minor has delivered comfort and confidence\nbehind the scenes so healthcare stays at the forefront, helping to make each day better for\nthe hospitals, healthcare partners, and communities we serve. Powered by more than 14,000 teammates\nworldwide, Owens & Minor exists because every day, everywhere, *Life Takes Care\u00ae*\n\n## Global Reach with a Local Touch\n* 140+ years serving healthcare\n* Over 14,000 teammates worldwide\n* Serving healthcare partners in 80 countries\n* Manufacturing facilities in the U.S., Honduras, Mexico, Thailand and Ireland\n* 40+ distribution centers\n* Portfolio of 300 propriety and branded product offerings\n* 1,000 branded medical product suppliers\n* 4,000 healthcare partners served\n\n## A Fierce Commitment to Growth & Innovation\n* **1882:** Former rivals Otho O. Owens and George Gilmer Minor II partner on a new pharmaceutical\nwholesale and retail company in downtown Richmond, VA.\n* **1954:** Owens & Minor purchases Bodeker Drug Company, a local drug wholesaler. In less than\nforty years, the company expands from a regional wholesaler with revenue of $5M into a nationwide\nbusiness with revenue over $1B.\n* **1966:** The purchase of A&J Hospital Supply in Richmond, Virginia, signals the beginning of a\nlongstanding commitment to medical and surgical distribution services.\n* **1981:** G. Gilmer \u201cGil\u201d Minor, III, great-grandson of founder George Gilmer Minor II, expands\nthe company\u2019s presence in medical distribution.\n* **1994:** Owens & Minor acquires Stuart Medical, nearly doubling in size.\n* **2018:** Owens & Minor [acquires][56] Halyard Health\u2019s surgical and infection prevention\nbusiness, significantly growing its acute and non-acute product portfolio and manufacturing\ncapabilities.\n* **2020:** Owens & Minor [selected][57] by Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) to produce\npersonal protective equipment (PPE) as part of the U.S. COVID-19 pandemic response.\n* **2026:** Owens & Minor\u2019s Products & Healthcare Services (P&HS) segment, comprised of medical\ndistribution as well as product, service and technology solutions for acute and non-acute care\nsettings, is [acquired][58] by Platinum Equity\n\n## Why We Exist\n\nOwens & Minor knows that healthcare is personal, and that its true impact is felt at the point of\ncare. Our approach is grounded in the understanding that our work touches countless lives and that\n*Life Takes Care* every step along the way.\n\n## Empowering Our Customers to Advance Healthcare\u00ae\n\nOur customers are at the heart of everything we do, and we never lose sight of the people at the end\nof the supply chain: the patients. Owens & Minor combines unstoppable strength, undeniable\ncompassion and leading industry expertise to help keep healthcare moving.\n\n## Doing Business the Right Way\n\nOur IDEAL values (Integrity, Development, Excellence, Accountability, and Listening) guide the way\nwe interact with each other and keep the needs of the healthcare partners we support front and\ncenter.\n\n## Visit the newsroom for the latest stories and updates from Owens & Minor.\n\n[ Newsroom ][59]\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][60]\n* [OM MarketPlace][61]\n* * [QSight][62]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][63]\n* [Careers][64]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][65]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][66]\n* [Linkedin][67]\n* [Instagram][68]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][69]\n* [Privacy Policy][70]\n* [Web Content Statement][71]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][72]\n* [Glossary][73]\n* [Sitemap][74]\n* [CA SB 261][75]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][76]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https:/