sights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: https://www.owens-minor.com\n[56]: https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/75252/000119312517329671/d484398dex992.htm\n[57]: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20210121005970/en/Thank-you-President-Biden---Owens-Min\nor-Welcomes-President-Biden-Strategy-on-COVID-Response\n[58]: /pressreleases/owens-minor-announces-definitive-agreement-to-divest-products-healthcare-servic\nes-segment-to-platinum-equity-for-375mm-in-cash-and-a-retained-equity-stake/\n[59]: /press\n[60]: https://billonly.qsight.net\n[61]: https://ommarketplace.com/OM.CustomerPortal/Account/Home/Login\n[62]: https://qsight.net/\n[63]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/\n[64]: https://owensminor.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/OMCareers\n[65]: https://www.facebook.com/owensandminor/\n[66]: https://x.com/Owens_Minor\n[67]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/owens-&-minor\n[68]: https://www.instagram.com/owens_minor/\n[69]: https://www.owens-minor.com/website-terms-of-use/\n[70]: https://www.owens-minor.com/privacy-policy/\n[71]: https://www.owens-minor.com/web-content-accessibility-statement/\n[72]: https://transparency-in-coverage.uhc.com/\n[73]: https://www.owens-minor.com/glossary/\n[74]: https://www.owens-minor.com/sitemap/\n[75]: /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/OM_CA_SB_261_Compliance_2026_FINAL.pdf\n[76]: https://www.owens-minor.com/frequently-asked-questions-about-owens-minor/"
