            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/products/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n\n# Products for Every Care Setting\n\nOwens & Minor designs, manufactures, and sources market-leading products that help reduce risks and\nsupport superior patient care.\n\n[Home][55]\nProducts\n\n## Better Products Support Quality of Care and Reduce Total Cost\n\nOwens & Minor\u2019s Global Products features an unmatched portfolio of self-manufactured and outsourced\nproducts, including our best-in-class HALYARD*, MediChoice\u00ae, and Medical Action\u00ae brands. With\nquality and performance metrics that meet and exceed industry standards, as well as clinical\nexpertise and point of care support, you\u2019ll have the optimal inventory you need, when you need it,\nreducing risks and helping your facility run more efficiently.\n\n[ Visit the HALYARD products website ][56]\nClinical Solutions\nKnown for our infection prevention and surgical solutions for patients and staff, we deliver safe\nand effective solutions in a range of clinical settings.\nLearn More\nSupply Resilience\nWith 80% Americas-based manufacturing footprint and world-class facilities, we provide essential\nproducts so you can provide essential care.\nLearn More\nResource Database\nWe're proud to leverage our innovative research to provide extensive learning resources and\nopportunities.\nLearn More\n\n## Simplify. Standardize. Increase efficiency and quality.\n\nThe Owens & Minor Global Products Division provides clinically-superior solutions that are essential\nfor our healthcare customers to do what they do best\u2014provide superior patient care.\n\nWith our significant Americas-based manufacturing footprint, vertically-integrated supply process,\nand rigorous quality standards, we empower the best possible clinical and patient outcomes by\nensuring that care providers have what they need, when they need it, no matter the situation.\n\nReliability\nOur vertically integrated supply chain protects customers from risks and disruptions to delivering\ncare. Additionally, we have world-class facilities and staff that are prepared to maintain product\ncontinuity in any emergency event.\nStandardization & Efficiency\nStandardized inventory solutions to reduce unnecessary SKUs provide opportunities for staff to be\nmore productive. Expert guidance in product selection, as well as ongoing inventory analysis, drive\ncontinual efficiency.\nKnowledge & Expertise\nWe provide support through tenured teams with O.R. expertise, backed by research and product\ninnovation to ensure our solutions are executed with a holistic approach that helps you save money\nand advance patient care.\n\n## Global Products by the Numbers\n\nA robust manufacturing footprint along with ongoing innovation and education supports supply\nsecurity and efficiency for customers around the world.\n80%\nAmericas-based manufacturing\n600+\npatents\n90+\ncountries served\n323,191+\nAccredited programs delivered\n\n## Recent Insights\n\n[Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient][Principles of Antibiotic\nStewardship: Impacting Every Patient]\n\n#### Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n\nSeptember 7, 2022\n\nPreviously recorded, this webinar discusses the impacts of antibiotic resistance in both inpatient\nand outpatient settings and the need for\u2026\n\n[Read More][57]\n[Principles of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services][Principles of\nEvidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services]\n\n#### Principles of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n\nAugust 1, 2022\n\nPreviously recorded, this webinar discusses the core principles of objective product evaluation for\ninfection prevention and control products utilized in\u2026\n\n[Read More][58]\n[The Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare][The Evolving Role of Infection\nPrevention and Control in Healthcare]\n\n#### The Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n\nAugust 1, 2022\n\nPreviously recorded, this webinar discusses the evolving role of the modern Infection Preventionist\nin today\u2019s healthcare environment. The Infection Prevention\u2026\n\n[Read More][59]\n[ View All Insights ][60]\n\n## Contact Us\n\nIf you\u2019re ready to streamline operations to drive efficiencies, improve profitability, and support\nthe best possible patient outcomes, contact us today to get started.\n\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nPhone Number(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nAddress(Required)\nCity(Required)\nState(Required)\nAlabamaAlaskaArizonaArkansasCaliforniaColoradoConnecticutDelawareDistrict of\nColumbiaFloridaGeorgiaHawaiiIdahoIllinoisIndianaIowaKansasKentuckyLouisianaMaineMarylandMassachusett\nsMichiganMinnesotaMississippiMissouriMontanaNebraskaNevadaNew HampshireNew JerseyNew MexicoNew\nYorkNorth CarolinaNorth DakotaOhioOklahomaOregonPennsylvaniaRhode IslandSouth CarolinaSouth\nDakotaTennesseeTexasUtahVermontVirginiaWashingtonWest VirginiaWisconsinWyoming\nZip Code(Required)\nAre you a current customer?(Required)\nYes\nWhich proprietary product do you have a question about?(Required)\nHALYARD*\nMediChoice\nHow can we help?(Required)\nI would like to receive updates on Owens & Minor products, services, and solutions. Please refer to\nour Privacy Policy for more information.(Required)\nYes\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][61]\n* [OM MarketPlace][62]\n* * [QSight][63]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][64]\n* [Careers][65]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][66]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][67]\n* [Linkedin][68]\n* [Instagram][69]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][70]\n* [Privacy Policy][71]\n* [Web Content Statement][72]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][73]\n* [Glossary][74]\n* [Sitemap][75]\n* [CA SB 261][76]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][77]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[35]: /about/news-pr/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[38]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[41]: /about/news-pr/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[46]: /about/news-pr/\n[47]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[49]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: https://www.owens-minor.com\n[56]: https://www.halyardhealth.com/\n[57]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pa"
