            "url": "https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* * [3PL Services][4]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][5]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][6]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][7]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][8]\n* [OMFreight+][9]\n* [Supplier Management][10]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][11]\n* [Procedural Services][12]\n* Close\n* * [QSight][13]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][14]\n* [QSight Kanban][15]\n* [QSight RFID][16]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][17]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][18]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][19]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][20]\n* [Proprietary Products][21]\n* [About][22]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][23]\n* [Sustainability][24]\n* * [Careers][25]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][26]\n* [Newsroom][27]\n* [Insights][28]\n* [Insights][29]\n* Close\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][30]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][31]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][32]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][33]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][34]\n[More Topics][35]\n* [Inventory Management][36]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][37]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][38]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][39]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][40]\n[More Topics][41]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][42]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Consulting][45]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][46]\n* [Infection Prevention][47]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][48]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][49]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][50]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][51]\n[More Topics][52]\n* [Contact Us][53]\n* [Search][54]\n* Close\n* Search\n\n# You Belong at Owens & Minor\n\nOur aim is to maintain an environment where every Teammate can thrive. We value the contributions of\nall of our Teammates as we work together to serve our healthcare customers.\n\n[ Apply Today ][55]\n[Home][56]\n[About Us][57]\nCareers\n\n## Our greatest strength?\n## The unrivaled dedication of our teammates.\n\nPowered by more than 14,000 teammates worldwide, Owens & Minor delivers comfort and confidence\nbehind the scenes so healthcare stays at the forefront. Our culture of belonging ensures that all\nteammates\u2019 contributions, experiences, and perspectives are valued, strengthening our company as we\ninnovate and grow together.\n\nAt Owens & Minor, we celebrate the diverse contributions and perspectives of all teammates, knowing\nour differences are our strengths to drive innovation and overcome challenges. When teammates feel\nvalued and respected, they are empowered to do their best work and thrive.\n\n## Teammate Benefits\n\nAs an Owens & Minor teammate, your journey to well-being begins with you. Our comprehensive benefits\nprograms offer a wide range of benefit choices for every stage of your life.\n* **Comprehensive Healthcare Plan** - Medical, dental, and vision plans start on Day one of\nemployment for full-time teammates.\n* **Educational Assistance** - We offer educational assistance to all eligible teammates enrolled in\nan approved, accredited collegiate program.\n* **Employer-Paid Life Insurance and Disability** - We offer employer-paid life insurance and\ndisability coverage.\n* **Voluntary Supplemental Programs** \u2013 We offer additional options to secure your financial future\nincluding supplemental life, hospitalization, critical illness, and other insurance programs.\n* **Support for your Growing Family** \u2013 Adoption assistance, fertility benefits (in medical plan)\nand parental leave are available for teammates planning for a family.\n* **Health Savings Account (HSA) and 401(k)** - We offer these voluntary financial programs to help\nteammates prepare for their future, as well as other voluntary benefits.\n* **Paid Leave** - In addition to sick days and short-term leave, we offer holidays, vacation days,\npersonal days, and additional types of leave \u2013 including parental leave.\n* **Well-Being** \u2013 Also included in our offering is a Teammate Assistance Program (TAP), Calm\nHealth, Cancer Resources Services, and discount programs \u2013 all at no cost to you.\n\n## Interested in joining a Company where you can make a difference?\n\n[ Search all jobs ][58]\n\n## Accommodations for Applicants with Disabilities\n\nOwens & Minor is an Equal Opportunity Employer (EEO) that considers all qualified applicants for\nemployment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, age,\nnational origin, or protected veteran status.\n\n[ Federal Contractor Pay Transparency\nNon-Discrimination Provision ][59]\n[ Equal Opportunity Employment Poster ][60]\n[ Equal Opportunity Employment Poster Supplement ][61]\n\n* * Customer Portals\n* * [Bill Only Management][62]\n* [OM MarketPlace][63]\n* * [QSight][64]\n* * Connect With Us\n* * [Contact Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* * Follow Us\n* [Facebook][67]\n* [\ud835\udd4fX][68]\n* [Linkedin][69]\n* [Instagram][70]\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][71]\n* [Privacy Policy][72]\n* [Web Content Statement][73]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][74]\n* [Glossary][75]\n* [Sitemap][76]\n* [CA SB 261][77]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][78]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/customer-owned-inventory-management/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/emergency-pandemic-preparedness/\n[7]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/expanded-access-standardization/\n[8]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/lum/\n[9]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/omfreightplus/\n[10]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/supplier-management/\n[11]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/consulting/\n[12]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/\n[13]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/\n[14]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/tissue-management/\n[15]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-kanban/\n[16]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/qsight/qsight-rfid/\n[17]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/bill-only/\n[18]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/medical-kitting-services/\n[19]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/surgitrack-unitized-delivery/\n[20]: https://www.owens-minor.com/services/pandac/\n[21]: https://www.owens-minor.com/products/\n[22]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[23]: https://www.owens-minor.com/?page_id=1022645\n[24]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/sustainability/\n[25]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/careers/\n[26]: https://compliance.owens-minor.com/\n[27]: https://www.owens-minor.com/press/\n[28]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[29]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/\n[30]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/services/\n[31]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[32]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/improving-the-cath-lab-through-rfid-technology/\n[33]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[34]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[35]: /about/news-pr/\n[36]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/inventory-management/\n[37]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-a-simple-effective-solution-to-consumable-supply-m\nanagement-in-the-hospital/\n[38]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/kanban-how-to-extend-value-through-technology-solution-in\ntegration/\n[39]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/5-myths-about-kanban-in-hospital-inventory-management/\n[40]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/seamless-it-solution-integration-is-a-must-have-for-hospi\ntals/\n[41]: /about/news-pr/\n[42]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/healthcare-logistics/\n[43]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/four-ways-healthcare-logistics-helps-build-resilient-supp\nly-chains/\n[44]: /about/news-pr/\n[45]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/resource-management/\n[46]: /about/news-pr/\n[47]: https://www.owens-minor.com/topic/infection-prevention/\n[48]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-antibiotic-stewardship-impacting-every-pati\nent/\n[49]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/principles-of-evidence-based-purchasing-of-infection-cont\nrol-products-and-services/\n[50]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/the-evolving-role-of-infection-prevention-and-control-in-\nhealthcare/\n[51]: https://www.owens-minor.com/insights/stopping-life-threatening-sepsis-in-its-tracks-an-imminen\nt-threat-to-patient-safety/\n[52]: /about/news-pr/\n[53]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/#contact\n[54]: #\n[55]: https://owensminor.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/OMCareers\n[56]: https://www.owens-minor.com\n[57]: https://www.owens-minor.com/about/\n[58]: https://owensminor.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/OMCareers\n[59]: https://www.owens-minor.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/pay-transp_formattedesqa508c-3.pdf\n[60]: https://www.owens-minor.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/eeopost-3.pdf\n[61]: https://www.owens-minor.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/ofccp_eeo_supplement_final_jrf_qa_508c-\n2.pdf\n[62]: https://billonly.qsight.net\n[63]: https://ommarketplace.com/OM.CustomerPortal/Account/Home/Login\n[64]: https://qsight.net/\n[65]: https://www.owens-minor.com/contact/\n[66]: https://owensminor.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/OMCareers\n[67]: https://www.facebook.com/owensandminor/\n[68]: https://x.com/Owens_Minor\n[69]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/owens-&-minor\n[70]: https://www.instagram.com/owens_minor/\n[71]: https://www.owens-minor.com/website-terms-of-use/\n[72]: https://www.owens-minor.com/privacy-policy/\n[73]: https://www.owens-minor.com/web-content-accessibility-statement/\n[74]: https://transparency-in-coverage.uhc.com/\n[75]: https://www.owens-minor.com/glossary/\n[76]: https://www.owens-minor.com/sitemap/\n[77]: /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/OM_CA_SB_261_Compliance_2026_FINAL.pdf\n[78]: https://www.owens-minor.com/frequently-asked-questions-about-owens-minor/"
