            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n* Close\n* [Distribution & Logistics][4]\n* * [3PL Services][5]\n* [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][6]\n* [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][7]\n* [Expanded Access Standardization][8]\n* * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][9]\n* [OMFreight+][10]\n* [Supplier Management][11]\n* [Supply Chain Consulting][12]\n* [Procedural Services][13]\n* Close\n* [Procedural Services][14]\n* * [QSight][15]\n* [QSight Tissue Management][16]\n* [QSight Kanban][17]\n* [QSight RFID][18]\n* [QSight Bill Only Management][19]\n* * [Medical Kitting Services][20]\n* [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][21]\n* [PANDAC: Suture Management][22]\n* [Proprietary Products][23]\n* [About][24]\n* Close\n* * [Leadership][25]\n* [Sustainability][26]\n* * [Careers][27]\n* [Ethics And Compliance][28]\n* [Newsroom][29]\n* [Insights][30]\n* [Insights][31]\n* Close\n* [Insights][32]\n* * TOPICS\n* [Services][33]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][34]\nImproving the Cath Lab Through RFID Technology\n[Learn More][35]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][36]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][37]\n[More Topics][38]\n* [Inventory Management][39]\n* Close\n* [Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital][Kanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the\nhospital]\nKanban: a simple, effective solution to consumable supply management in the hospital\n[Learn More][40]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nKanban: How to extend its value through technology solution integration\n[Learn More][41]\n[Kanban Inventory Management][Kanban Inventory Management]\nDispelling 5 Myths About Kanban in Hospital Inventory Management\n[Learn More][42]\n[Owens & Minor Supply Chain][Owens & Minor Supply Chain]\nWhy Seamless IT Solution Integration is Essential for Hospitals\n[Learn More][43]\n[More Topics][44]\n* [Healthcare Logistics][45]\n* Close\n* Four Ways Healthcare Logistics Helps Build Resilient Supply Chains\n[Learn More][46]\n[More Topics][47]\n* [Consulting][48]\n* Close\n* [More Topics][49]\n* [Infection Prevention][50]\n* Close\n* Principles of Antibiotic Stewardship: Impacting Every Patient\n[Learn More][51]\nPrinciples of Evidence-Based Purchasing of Infection Control Products and Services\n[Learn More][52]\nThe Evolving Role of Infection Prevention and Control in Healthcare\n[Learn More][53]\nStopping Life-Threatening Sepsis in its Tracks: An Imminent Threat to Patient Safety\n[Learn More][54]\n[More Topics][55]\n* [Contact Us][56]\n* [Search][57]\n* Close\n* Search\n\n# Contact Us\n\nConnect with the world of healthcare. Connect with Owens & Minor.\n\n## O&M Global Headquarters\n\n### PHONE\n\n+1 (804) 723-7000\n\n+1 (800) 488-8850\n\n### PHYSICAL ADDRESS\n\n10900 Nuckols Road\nSuite 400\nGlen Allen, VA 23060\n\n[ View in Google Maps ][58]\n\n### MAILING ADDRESS\n\nP.O. Box 27626\nRichmond, VA 23261-7626\n\n### Locations\n\n[ Our Locations ][59]\n\n### CONTACT US\n\nPlease select one of the following options that best describes how we can address your\nneeds.(Required)\nPlease select oneI am a current customerI am not a current customer and I want to place an orderI\nhave a question about your distribution, services, or technologiesI have a question about your\nproprietary productsI am inquiring about a job or have a human resources (HR) question\nWhat is your Owens & Minor account number?\nWhat is the name of your Owens & Minor sales representative?\nWhich proprietary product do you have a question about?(Required)\nHALYARD*\nMediChoice\nFirst Name(Required)\nLast Name(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nPhone Number(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nFacility / Hospital Name(Required)\nAddress(Required)\nCity(Required)\nState(Required)\nStateAlabamaAlaskaArizonaArkansasCaliforniaColoradoConnecticutDelawareDistrict of\nColumbiaFloridaGeorgiaHawaiiIdahoIllinoisIndianaIowaKansasKentuckyLouisianaMaineMarylandMassachusett\nsMichiganMinnesotaMississippiMissouriMontanaNebraskaNevadaNew HampshireNew JerseyNew MexicoNew\nYorkNorth CarolinaNorth DakotaOhioOklahomaOregonPennsylvaniaRhode IslandSouth CarolinaSouth\nDakotaTennesseeTexasUtahVermontVirginiaWashingtonWest VirginiaWisconsinWyoming\nZip Code(Required)\nCountry(Required)\nCountryAfghanistanAlbaniaAlgeriaAmerican SamoaAndorraAngolaAnguillaAntarcticaAntigua and\nBarbudaArgentinaArmeniaArubaAustraliaAustriaAzerbaijanBahamasBahrainBangladeshBarbadosBelarusBelgium\nBelizeBeninBermudaBhutanBoliviaBonaire, Sint Eustatius and SabaBosnia and HerzegovinaBotswanaBouvet\nIslandBrazilBritish Indian Ocean TerritoryBrunei DarussalamBulgariaBurkina FasoBurundiCabo\nVerdeCambodiaCameroonCanadaCayman IslandsCentral African RepublicChadChileChinaChristmas IslandCocos\nIslandsColombiaComorosCongoCongo, Democratic Republic of theCook IslandsCosta\nRicaCroatiaCubaCura\u00e7aoCyprusCzechiaC\u00f4te d'IvoireDenmarkDjiboutiDominicaDominican\nRepublicEcuadorEgyptEl SalvadorEquatorial GuineaEritreaEstoniaEswatiniEthiopiaFalkland IslandsFaroe\nIslandsFijiFinlandFranceFrench GuianaFrench PolynesiaFrench Southern\nTerritoriesGabonGambiaGeorgiaGermanyGhanaGibraltarGreeceGreenlandGrenadaGuadeloupeGuamGuatemalaGuern\nseyGuineaGuinea-BissauGuyanaHaitiHeard Island and McDonald IslandsHoly SeeHondurasHong\nKongHungaryIcelandIndiaIndonesiaIranIraqIrelandIsle of\nManIsraelItalyJamaicaJapanJerseyJordanKazakhstanKenyaKiribatiKorea, Democratic People's Republic\nofKorea, Republic ofKuwaitKyrgyzstanLao People's Democratic\nRepublicLatviaLebanonLesothoLiberiaLibyaLiechtensteinLithuaniaLuxembourgMacaoMadagascarMalawiMalaysi\naMaldivesMaliMaltaMarshall\nIslandsMartiniqueMauritaniaMauritiusMayotteMexicoMicronesiaMoldovaMonacoMongoliaMontenegroMontserrat\nMoroccoMozambiqueMyanmarNamibiaN