apaya / Poppy\n\nShop Kids Lunch &raquo;\n\nShop Baby &raquo;\n\nShop Wellness &raquo;\n\nWITH YOU FOR THE JOURNEY\u00ae\n\nPatented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology\n\nThe walls are built with freezable gel that, once frozen, creates continuous cooling surrounding your contents.\n\nThis built-in gel packs not only improve cooling efficiency, but also eliminates bulk, reduces mess, and simplifies the entire experience in a ready-to-use design.\n\nKeep your food cool for hours in real-world conditions.\n\nECOFREEZE\u00ae technology redefines how cooling works.\nLEARN MORE &raquo;\n\nBuilt With Triple (3x) Layer technology for added insulation, protection, and durability.\n\nECOFREEZE\u00ae+ COLLECTION\n\nElevated Cooling Performance\nThis advanced multi-layer construction works together to retain cold longer, shield contents more effectively, and maintain structure through everyday use-delivering a higher level of cooling performance in every bag.\nThe result is a more efficient, longer-lasting cooling experience-built for higher performance in real-world conditions.\n\nshop now \u00bb\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\nPeace of Mind When Packing Lunches!\n\nI absolutely love the PackIt brand of products, there is nothing better than knowing I'm sending my kids to school with a lunch that will stay cool until lunchtime. I wish I had found this brand when my twins were much younger.\n\n- Mac\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\nReally Cool!\n\nIt\u2019s so easy, you just throw it in the freezer and that\u2019s it! The cold packs are already built into it, so it\u2019s nice and simple. It\u2019s also compact enough to just put it in the freezer - it won\u2019t take up too much space and can still fit a fairly large bottle of wine. It sits flat but stretches out. Actually keeps the bottle quite cool over time!\n\n- Maddie\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\ncompact and comfortable\n\nI like this little cooler! It's the perfect size for packing a few essentials for a day trip or picnic. The freezable feature is genius - just pop it in the freezer before use and it keeps everything inside cool and fresh for hours. The material is sturdy and easy to clean. What I love most is how versatile it is - it's perfect for small items like water bottles, sandwiches, and fruit, but it's also great for keeping medications or skincare products cool and protected.\n\n- Arcenciel\n\n@packitcool\n\nFollow Us\n\nShop our Instagram\n\nSHOP TRAVEL\n\nSHOP HOSTING\n\nshop Work/Commute\n\nshop school\n\nHave a Question?\n\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nPress\nFAQ\nTrack Your Order\nWarranty\nRefund Policy\nWholesale\nLoyalty Program\nAffiliate Program\nConditions Of Use\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\n\n\u00a92026 PACKIT\n\nfollow us on\n\ninstagram\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nYouTube\n\nPinterest\n\nTikTok\n\nicon-X\n\"Close (esc)\"\n\nicon-X\n\nLunch Boxes &amp; Bags | Shop Freezable Lunch Boxes, Snack Bags &amp; Bento Containers by PackIt"
