cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [PackIt#color_truck] ][111]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][112]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][113]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][114]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][115]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][116]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][117]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][118]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][119]\n[ [PackIt#color_unicorn] ][120]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][121]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][122]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][123]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][124]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][125]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][126]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][127]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][128]\n[ [PackIt#color_fox] ][129]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][130]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][131]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][132]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][133]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][134]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][135]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][136]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][137]\n[ [PackIt#color_dog] ][138]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][139]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][140]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][141]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][142]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][143]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][144]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][145]\n[ [Freezable Friends Lunch Box] ][146]\n[ [PackIt#color_ALL] ][147]\n\n# Freezable Friends Lunch Box\n\nRegular price$64.99\nThe Coolest Friend at the Lunch Table. A lunch box that keeps food fresh-and makes every day more\nfun. [Read More \u00bb][148]\nColor: Truck Color\nTruck\nUnicorn\nDog\nFox\nAdd to cart Truck - $64.99 USD Unicorn - $64.99 USD Dog - $64.99 USD Fox - $64.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**The Coolest Friend at the Lunch Table. A lunch box that keeps food fresh-and makes every day more\nfun.\n**********\n\n**Meet Their New Favorite Lunch Buddy**\nSay hello to Freezable Friends - the lunch box that shows up ready to play and keep things cool.\nDesigned for little ones on the go, each bag brings personality to lunchtime with playful styles\nlike Dog, Unicorn, Fox, and Truck.\n\nBecause lunch is better with a friend.\n\n**Built-In Cooling (No Ice Packs Needed)**\nLike all PackIt bags, Freezable Friends features patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, with freezable gel\nbuilt right into the walls.\n\nJust freeze it overnight, pack it in the morning, and snacks stay chilled for hours-no extra steps,\nno added bulk.\n\n**Designed For Little Routines**\nFrom school days and daycare to playdates and weekend adventures, this bag is made to keep up with\nbusy kids.\n\nThe adjustable, removable crossbody strap makes it easy to carry hands-free, while the top handle is\nperfect for grab-and-go moments.\n\n**Playful Design, Practical Details**\nIt\u2019s not just cute-it\u2019s thoughtfully designed.\n\nThe 3D front zip pocket adds a fun, character-inspired touch while giving kids a place to stash\nsmall essentials. A side mesh pocket holds drinks, and the name tag helps keep everything where it\nbelongs.\n\nFeatures\n* Built-in cooling system \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls of the bag\nkeeps food fresh for hours\n* No ice packs needed \u2013 Less mess, more room for lunch\n* Kid-friendly designs \u2013 Dog, Unicorn, Fox, and Truck characters\n* 3D front zip pocket \u2013 Fun, interactive design with extra storage\n* Hands-free carry \u2013 Adjustable, removable crossbody strap\n* Top handle \u2013 Easy grab-and-go\n* Side mesh pocket \u2013 Perfect for drinks\n* Name tag included \u2013 Helps personalize and keep track at school or daycare\n* Collapsible + freezable \u2013 Collapses flat for easy freezer storage\n\n**Measurements**\nOpen: 6.2 x 8.2 x 9.75 in.\nCollapsed: 3 x 8.25 x 9.75 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":44732532195414,\"title\":\"Truck\",\"option1\":\"Truck\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-FF-\nTRU\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36833048166486,\"product_id\":7670\n966550614,\"position\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-15T11:34:44-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-15T11:34:47-07\n:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_truck\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/\nFreezable-Friends-Truck-Front-Down-Lores.jpg?v=1778870087\",\"variant_ids\":[44732532195414]},\"availabl\ne\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable Friends Lunch Box -\nTruck\",\"public_title\":\"Truck\",\"options\":[\"Truck\"],\"price\":6499,\"weight\":816,\"compare_at_price\":null,\n\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035\n028930\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_truck\",\"id\":28831671746646,\"position\":1,\"preview_image\n\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Freezable-\nFriends-Truck-Front-Down-Lores.jpg?v=1778870087\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_alloc\nations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":