cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [PackIt#color_agave] ][111]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][112]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][113]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][114]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][115]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][116]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][117]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][118]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][119]\n[ [PackIt#color_almond] ][120]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][121]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][122]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][123]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][124]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][125]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][126]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][127]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][128]\n[ [PackIt#color_black] ][129]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][130]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][131]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][132]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][133]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][134]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][135]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][136]\n[ [PackIt#color_plum] ][137]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][138]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][139]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][140]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][141]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][142]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][143]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][144]\n[ [Freezable Houston Lunch Bag] ][145]\n[ [PackIt#color_ALL] ][146]\n\n# Freezable Houston Lunch Bag\n\nRegular price$38.99\nThe original lunch bag, made cooler. Roll it. Clip it. Go. Built-in cooling for wherever the day\nleads. [Read More \u00bb][147]\nColor: Agave Color\nAgave\nPlum\nAlmond\nBlack\nAdd to cart Agave - $38.99 USD Plum - $38.99 USD Almond - $38.99 USD Black - $38.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**The original lunch bag, made cooler. Roll it. Clip it. Go. Built-in cooling for wherever the day\nleads.**\n\n**A New Take On Everyday Cooling**\nMeet the Freezable Houston Lunch Bag - a reimagined version of our classic, designed with upgraded\nmaterials and added versatility. Built with PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, it keeps meals\nand drinks chilled for hours without the need for ice packs.\nSame smart cooling. Built to do more.\n\n**Flexible Space, Built To Adapt**\nThe roll-top design with adjustable buckle closure lets you pack it your way - expand it when you\nneed more room or roll it down for a more compact carry.\n\nWith a wide capacity, it easily fits meals, snacks, and drinks, making it ideal for longer days or\nbigger appetites.\n\n**Designed For Movement & Durability**\nFrom workdays and commutes to outdoor plans, travel, and everyday use, this bag is built to handle\nit all.\n\nThe top handle and removable, adjustable crossbody strap give you multiple ways to carry, while the\nback slip pocket keeps essentials close.\n\n**Upgraded Materials, Elevated Performance**\nCrafted with a durable ripstop exterior and cotton blend webbing trim, the Houston is made to go\nfurther.\n\nInside, the welded liner helps protect against leaks and makes cleanup easy - so it\u2019s ready for\nwhatever you pack next.\n\nFeatures\n* Built-in cooling system \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, freezable gel built into the walls keeps food and\ndrinks chilled for hours\n* Roll-top closure \u2013 Adjustable capacity with secure buckle closure\n* Wide interior \u2013 Fits meals, snacks, and drinks with ease\n* Durable ripstop exterior \u2013 Designed for everyday use and beyond\n* Cotton blend webbing trim \u2013 Comfortable, elevated detailing\n* Multiple carry options:\n- Top handle for quick grab-and-go\n- Adjustable, removable crossbody strap for hands-free use\n* Back slip pocket \u2013 Easy access to essentials\n* Welded liner \u2013 Helps protect against leaks and simplifies cleanup\n* Collapsible + freezable \u2013 Folds flat for easy freezer storage\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nUNROLLED:\nOpen: 8.6 x 6.25 x 15.75 in.\nCollapsed: 8.6 x 2.25 x 15.75 in.\nROLLED UP: 8.6 x 6.25 x 9.25 in. (rolled height is adjustable)\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":44657467129942,\"title\":\"Agave\",\"option1\":\"Agave\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-HO-\nAGA\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36833177272406,\"product_id\":7712\n343916630,\"position\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-15T12:43:41-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-15T12:43:44-07\n:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_agave\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/\nfreezable-houston-lunch-bag-agave-front.jpg?v=1778874224\",\"variant_ids\":[44657467129942]},\"available\n\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable Houston Lunch Bag -\nAgave\",\"public_title\":\"Agave\",\"options\":[\"Agave\"],\"price\":3899,\"weight\":862,\"compare_at_price\":null,\n\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035\n029173\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_agave\",\"id\":28831799410774,\"position\":1,\"preview_image\n\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-\nhouston-lunch-bag-agave-front.jpg?v=1778874224\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_alloca\ntions\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":44657467097174,\"title\":\"Plum\",\"o\nption1\":\"Plum\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-HO-PLU\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":t\nrue,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36853930131542,\"product_id\":7712343916630,\"position\":27,\"created_at\":\"202\n6-05-20T10:49:13-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-20T10:49:15-07:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_plum\",\"width\":2\n500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Houston-Lunch-Bag-Plum-Front-Down-Lores_1\n.jpg?v=1779299355\",\"variant_ids\":[44657467097174]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable Houston Lunch\nBag -\nPlum\",\"public_title\":\"Plum\",\"options\":[\"Plum\"],\"price\":3899,\"weight\":862,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"in\nventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035029\n166\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_plum\",\"id\":28851775307862,\"position\":27,\"preview_image\":{\n\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Houston-Lunch\n-Bag-Plum-Front-Down-Lores_1.jpg?v=1779299355\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocat\nions\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":44657467064406,\"title\":\"Almond\",\"\noption1\":\"Almond\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-HO-ALM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\n\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36833188020310,\"product_id\":7712343916630,\"position\":10,\"created_at\":\"\n2026-05-15T12:48:12-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-15T12:48:13-07:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_almond\",\"wid\nth\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-houston-lunch-bag-almond-f\nront.jpg?v=1778874493\",\"variant_ids\":[44657467064406]},\"available\":true,\"name