cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [PackIt#color_sky-blue] ][111]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][112]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][113]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][114]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][115]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][116]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][117]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][118]\n[ [PackIt#color_black] ][119]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][120]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][121]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][122]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][123]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][124]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][125]\n[ [PackIt#color_lavender] ][126]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][127]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][128]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][129]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][130]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][131]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][132]\n[ [Freezable York Lunch Bag] ][133]\n[ [PackIt#color_ALL] ][134]\n\n# Freezable York Lunch Bag\n\nRegular price$44.99\nCool Style, Cooler Lunches. Polished on the outside. Built-in chill on the inside. Your everyday\nlunch bag-refined. [Read More \u00bb][135]\nColor: Black Color\nBlack\nSky Blue\nLavender\nAdd to cart Black - $44.99 USD Sky Blue - $44.99 USD Lavender - $44.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Cool Style, Cooler Lunches. Polished on the outside. Built-in chill on the inside. Your everyday\nlunch bag-refined.**\n\n**Meet The New Standard For Lunch On The Go**\nIntroducing the Freezable York Lunch Bag - where elevated design meets built-in cooling performance.\nWith a modern silhouette, premium finishes, and thoughtful details, this is the lunch bag that fits\nseamlessly into your everyday style.\nBecause your lunch deserves better than an afterthought.\n\n**Cooling That Works Smarter**\nPowered by PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, the York Lunch Bag features freezable gel built\ndirectly into the walls - so it keeps meals and drinks chilled for hours without the need for ice\npacks.\nJust freeze it overnight, pack it in the morning, and go.\n\n**Designed For How You Actually Pack**\nThe fully opening lid and dual zipper closure make packing simple and frustration-free.\nFrom full meals and snacks to drinks and extras, everything fits-and everything stays easy to\naccess. No digging, no rearranging.\n\n**Elevated Details, Everywhere You Look**\nThis is where York stands out.\nFrom the soft nylon puffer exterior to the shiny silver hardware, every detail is designed to feel\nmore refined.\nThe removable, adjustable crossbody strap features a wide woven design with a pop of color, adding\ncomfort and a subtle statement-while the front slip pocket keeps essentials within reach.\n\n**Made For Everyday Movement**\nFrom workdays and commutes to travel, errands, and weekend plans, this bag moves with you.\nCarry it hands-free with the crossbody strap or grab it by hand - it\u2019s designed to fit into your\nroutine without missing a beat.\n\nFeatures\n* Built-in cooling system \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, freezable gel built into the walls, keeps food\nand drinks chilled for hours\n* No ice packs needed \u2013 More space, less mess\n* Dual zipper + full-opening lid \u2013 Easy packing and full visibility\n* Premium puffer exterior \u2013 Lightweight, modern, and soft to the touch\n* Elevated hardware \u2013 Shiny silver finishes for a polished look\n* Statement crossbody strap \u2013 Wide woven design with a pop of color (27.5\" drop)\n* Multiple carry options \u2013 Removable, adjustable strap for hands-free use\n* Front slip pocket \u2013 Quick access to essentials\n* Collapsible + freezable \u2013 Collapses flat for easy freezer storage\n* BPA and Lead Free\n\nMEASUREMENTS\nOpen: 11.25 x 5.5 x 9 in.\nCollapsed: 11.25 x 3.25 x 9 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":44657455366230,\"title\":\"Black\",\"option1\":\"Black\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-YK-\nBAK\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36853968044118,\"product_id\":7712\n342999126,\"position\":9,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-20T11:24:00-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-20T11:24:02-07\n:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_black\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/\nYork-Lunch-Bag-Black-Front-Down-Lores_1.jpg?v=1779301442\",\"variant_ids\":[44657455366230]},\"available\n\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable York Lunch Bag -\nBlack\",\"public_title\":\"Black\",\"options\":[\"Black\"],\"price\":4499,\"weight\":907,\"compare_at_price\":null,\n\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035\n029180\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_black\",\"id\":28851812794454,\"position\":9,\"preview_image\n\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/York-Lunch\n-Bag-Black-Front-Down-Lores_1.jpg?v=1779301442\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_alloca\ntions\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":44657456218198,\"title\":\"Sky\nBlue\",\"option1\":\"Sky\nBlue\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-YK-SKI\",\"requir