de\n\":\"819035029203\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_lavender\",\"id\":28857130516566,\"position\":16,\"\npreview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/file\ns\\/York-Lunch-Bag-Lavender-Front-Down-Lores_1.jpg?v=1779391145\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"sel\nling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}}]\n{\"id\":44657455366230,\"title\":\"Black\",\"option1\":\"Black\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-YK-B\nAK\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36853968044118,\"product_id\":77123\n42999126,\"position\":9,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-20T11:24:00-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-20T11:24:02-07:\n00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_black\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Y\nork-Lunch-Bag-Black-Front-Down-Lores_1.jpg?v=1779301442\",\"variant_ids\":[44657455366230]},\"available\"\n:true,\"name\":\"Freezable York Lunch Bag -\nBlack\",\"public_title\":\"Black\",\"options\":[\"Black\"],\"price\":4499,\"weight\":907,\"compare_at_price\":null,\n\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035\n029180\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_black\",\"id\":28851812794454,\"position\":9,\"preview_image\n\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/York-Lunch\n-Bag-Black-Front-Down-Lores_1.jpg?v=1779301442\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_alloca\ntions\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}}\n\n## HOW IT WORKS\n\nFlatten or Collapse\nDesigned to be collapsed for compact storage in the freezer.\nFreeze It\nFreeze the lunch bag overnight (8 hours for optimal performance).\nPack & Go\nFill with your favorite fresh snacks - then head out and enjoy.\nBuilt with Ecofreeze\u00ae Technology\nPackIt is the only foldable, freezable bag that keeps food and drinks cool for hours - no ice packs\nneeded. It's secret sauce? Patented cooling technology that's built into the walls of the bag.\nCollapse\nFreeze\nPack & Go\n[Reusable]\nReusable\n[No Ice Or Ice Packs Needed]\nNo Ice Or Ice Packs Needed\n[Fully Freezable]\nFully Freezable\n[Collapsible]\nCollapsible\n\n### You May Also Like\n\n[PackIt#color_sky-blue]\n][136]\nFreezable York Lunch Bag\n$44.99\n[ Black ][137][ Sky Blue ][138][ Lavender ][139]\n\n> \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n> Love the modular design!\n> \"I had to come back to buy a second one because my husband keeps using mine! This makes taking\n> lunch to work such a breeze. Being able to separate my refrigeratables from the freezables without\n> taking things out of the bag has made a huge difference.\"\n> Maria C.\n\n## With you for the Journey\n\n[ Shop Best Sellers \u00bb ][140]\n[ SHOP TRAVEL ][141]\n[ SHOP HOSTING ][142]\n[ sho"
