ch Box - PackIt] ][139]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][140]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][141]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][142]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt PackIt#color_almond] ][143]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][144]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][145]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - ] ][146]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][147]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][148]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][149]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][150]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt#color_sage] ][151]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][152]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][153]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][154]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][155]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][156]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][157]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt] ][158]\n[ [PackIt#color_papaya] ][159]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][160]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][161]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][162]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][163]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][164]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][165]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][166]\n[ [PackIt#color_azure-blue] ][167]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][168]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][169]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][170]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][171]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][172]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][173]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box] ][174]\n[ [Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box - PackIt#color_ALL] ][175]\n\n# Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box\n\nRegular price$32.99\nEffortless carry. Fresh every time. Built-in freezing tech meets hands-free style-because busy days\ndeserve smarter lunch. [Read More \u00bb][176]\nColor: Lemonade Color\nLemonade\nPapaya\nAzure Blue\nLavender\nSage\nAlmond\nMidnight Navy\nBlack\nAdd to cart Lemonade - $32.99 USD Papaya - $32.99 USD Azure Blue - $32.99 USD Lavender - $28.99 USD\nSage - $28.99 USD Almond - $28.99 USD Midnight Navy - $28.99 USD Black - $28.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Effortless carry. Fresh every time. Built-in freezing tech meets hands-free style-because busy\ndays deserve smarter lunch.**\n\n**Cooler Tech, Built Right In**\nThe Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box features PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae technology, with freezable\ngel built directly into the walls. That means no ice packs, no extra steps-just a sleek, upright\ndesign that keeps food and drinks cool for hours. Freeze it overnight, and you\u2019re good to go by\nmorning.\n\n**PackIt Your Way**\nThe upright design makes packing feel effortless.\nFit bento containers, snacks, and full-size drink bottles without cramming or rearranging.\nWide zip access lets the lid fold back so you can see (and grab) everything easily-no digging\nrequired.\n\n**Made For Movement**\nDesigned for days on the go.\nFrom school and work to travel, errands, and everyday adventures, it fits seamlessly into your\nroutine.\n\nThe adjustable crossbody strap + top handle means multiple ways to carry-hands-free,\nover-the-shoulder, or grab-and-go.\n\nFeatures\n\n**Built-in cooling system** \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls - keeps\neverything chilled for hours\n**No ice packs required** \u2013 Less bulk, more space\n**Upright, structured design** \u2013 Perfect for bottles, bentos, and snacks\n**Crossbody carry option** \u2013 Adjustable, removable strap for hands-free convenience\n**Top handle grab-and-go** \u2013 Quick and easy to carry your way\n**Mesh side pocket** - for water bottles\n**Front slip pocket** - for utensils, notes, or extras\n**Zip pocket - **for ID cards or wipes\nMade with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\nIt\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen: 8.25 x 4.5 x 10 in.\nCollapsed: 8.25 x 2.25 x 10 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":44788237795414,\"title\":\"Lemonade\",\"option1\":\"Lemonade\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"P\nKO-CS-LEM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36882159632470,\"product_id\n\":7459779543126,\"position\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-27T10:33:45-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-27T10:33\n:47-07:00\",\"alt\":null,\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-\ncrossbody-lunch-box-lemonade-left.jpg?v=1779903227\",\"variant_ids\":[44788237795414]},\"available\":true\n,\"name\":\"Freezable Crossbody Lunch Box -\nLemonade\",\"public_title\":\"Lemonade\",\"options\":[\"Lemonade\"],\"price\":3299,\"weight\":626,\"compare_at_pri\nce\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\n\":\"819035029128\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":null,\"id\":28878804222038,\"position\":5,\"preview_image\":{\"asp\nect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-crossbo\ndy-lunch-box-lemonade-left.jpg?v=1779903227\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocatio\nns\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":44788237729878,\"title\":\"Papaya\",\"op\ntion1\":\"Papaya\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-CS-PAP\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":\ntrue,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36882144493654,\"product_id\":7459779543126,\"position\":53,\"created_at\":\"20\n26-05-27T10:30:47-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-27T10:30:49-07:00\",\"alt\":null,\"width\":2500,\"height\"