36]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][237]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][238]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][239]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][240]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt#color_lavender] ][241]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][242]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][243]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][244]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][245]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][246]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][247]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt#color_diamond-chevron] ][248]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][249]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][250]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][251]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][252]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][253]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt] ][254]\n[ [PackIt#color_daisy-plum] ][255]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][256]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][257]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][258]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][259]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][260]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][261]\n[ [PackIt#color_butterfly-paisley] ][262]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][263]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][264]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][265]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][266]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][267]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][268]\n[ [PackIt#color_lemonade] ][269]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][270]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][271]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][272]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][273]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][274]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box] ][275]\n[ [Freezable Snack Box - PackIt#color_ALL] ][276]\n\n# Freezable Snack Box\n\nRegular price$21.99\nSnack time, anytime-always fresh. Wherever the day takes you, your snacks stay cool. [Read More\n\u00bb][277]\nColor: Lemonade Color\nLemonade\nCitrus Orchard\nButterfly Paisley\nDaisy Plum\nLavender\nDiamond Chevron\nTeal\nSea Shark\nTie Dye Sorbet\nMagenta\nSweet Strawberry\nTriangle Stripes\nRainbow Sky\nBlue Sky\nGray Fog\nChecked Out\nCity Charcoal\nCharcoal Camo\nTrue Blue\nSporty Camo Charcoal Navy\nStriped Bolts\nCamo Sharks\nSpaceman\nBlack\nAdd to cart Lemonade - $21.99 USD Citrus Orchard - $21.99 USD Butterfly Paisley - $21.99 USD Daisy\nPlum - $21.99 USD Lavender - $19.99 USD Diamond Chevron - $19.99 USD Teal - $19.99 USD Sea Shark -\n$19.99 USD Tie Dye Sorbet - $19.99 USD Magenta - $19.99 USD Sweet Strawberry - $19.99 USD Triangle\nStripes - $19.99 USD Rainbow Sky - $19.99 USD Blue Sky - $19.99 USD Gray Fog - $19.99 USD Checked\nOut - $19.99 USD City Charcoal - $19.99 USD Charcoal Camo - Sold Out True Blue - $19.99 USD Sporty\nCamo Charcoal Navy - $19.99 USD Striped Bolts - $19.99 USD Camo Sharks - $19.99 USD Spaceman -\n$19.99 USD Black - $19.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Snack time, anytime-always fresh. Wherever the day takes you, your snacks stay cool.**\n\n**A Simple Way To Keep Snacks Fresh**\nMeet the Freezable Snack Box: your go-to for everyday snacks. Built with PackIt\u2019s patented\nECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, it keeps snacks chilled for hours without the need for ice packs.\nJust freeze it overnight, pack it in the morning, and you\u2019re set.\n\n**One Space, Done Right **\nThis single-compartment design is perfect for fresh snacks, small containers, and a 12oz drink\u2014no\nextra compartments, no overthinking.\n\nEverything fits in one easy-to-pack space, so you can grab what you need and go.\n\n**Made For Everyday Routines**\nFrom workdays and school schedules to errands, travel, and quick outings, this snack box fits\nseamlessly into your day.\n\nToss it into your bag or clip it onto a backpack, tote, or stroller with the buckle handle for easy\naccess on the move.\n\nFeatures\n* **Built-in cooling technology **\u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls of\nthe bag keeps snacks chilled for hours\n* **No ice packs needed **\u2013 More room, less bulk\n* **Compact insulated snack box **\u2013 Perfect for snacks, small meals, and drinks\n* **Structured rectangular design** \u2013 Keeps contents organized and protected\n* **Clip-on buckle handle** \u2013 Attach to backpacks, totes, or gym bags\n* **Secure zip closure **\u2013 Seals in cool, dry air\n* **Collapsible + freezable **\u2013 Folds flat for easy freezer storage\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen: 8 x 4 x 5 in.\nFlattened: 8 x 2.5 x 5 in.\n\n**NOTE:** Logo/Lab"
