ble Snack Bag - PackIt#color_mermaids] ][145]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][146]\n[ [PackIt Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][147]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][148]\n[ [PackIt Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][149]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][150]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_city-charcoal] ][151]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][152]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][153]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][154]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][155]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][156]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][157]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_gray-fog] ][158]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][159]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][160]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][161]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][162]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][163]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][164]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_true-blue] ][165]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][166]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][167]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][168]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][169]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][170]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][171]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_seaside-stripe] ][172]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][173]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][174]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][175]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][176]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][177]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][178]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_sage] ][179]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][180]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][181]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][182]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][183]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][184]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][185]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_poppy] ][186]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][187]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][188]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][189]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][190]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][191]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt] ][192]\n[ [PackIt#color_ice-cream-critters] ][193]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][194]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][195]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][196]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][197]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][198]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][199]\n[ [PackIt#color_blue-skate-checker] ][200]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][201]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][202]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][203]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][204]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][205]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][206]\n[ [PackIt#color_construction-trucks] ][207]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][208]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][209]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][210]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][211]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][212]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag] ][213]\n[ [Freezable Snack Bag - PackIt#color_ALL] ][214]\n\n# Freezable Snack Bag\n\nRegular price$19.99\nThe small bag with smart chill. Designed for quick trips, fresh snacks, and everything in\nbetween-freshness made easy. [Read More \u00bb][215]\nColor: Ice Cream Critters Color\nIce Cream Critters\nConstruction Trucks\nBlue Skate Checker\nFruit Toss Ivory\nPoppy\nMermaids\nSage\nTrue Blue\nCity Charcoal\nSeaside Stripe\nBlack Grid\nBlack\nSpaceman\nGray Fog\nPolka Dots\nAdd to cart Ice Cream Critters - $19.99 USD Construction Trucks - $19.99 USD Blue Skate Checker -\n$19.99 USD Fruit Toss Ivory - $19.99 USD Poppy - $17.99 USD Mermaids - $17.99 USD Sage - $17.99 USD\nTrue Blue - $17.99 USD City Charcoal - $17.99 USD Seaside Stripe - $17.99 USD Black Grid - $17.99\nUSD Black - $17.99 USD Spaceman - $17.99 USD Gray Fog - Sold Out Polka Dots - Sold Out\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**The small bag with smart chill. Designed for quick trips, fresh snacks, and everything in\nbetween-freshness made easy.**\n\n**Cooling Power, Built Right In**\nWhere convenience meets clever design. The Freezable Snack Bag uses PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae\nTechnology, with freezable gel built directly into the walls-so the bag itself keeps contents cool.\n\nNo ice packs. No extra bulk. Just a compact insulated snack bag that keeps things fresh without\nslowing you down.\n\n**Small Size, Surprisingly Versatile**\nDon\u2019t let the size fool you-this one does a lot.\nPerfect for snacks, teethers, small containers, medicine, or cosmetics, it\u2019s built for those\nin-between moments when you don\u2019t need a full lunch setup.\n\nThe tapered shape slides easily into totes, backpacks, diaper bags, and gym bags-basically wherever\nyou need it.\n\n**Made For Quick Trips + Everyday Moments**\nThis is our grab-it-and-go essential. Ideal for short outings, errands, travel, gym sessions, and\ndaily routines where convenience matters most.\n\nLightweight, compact, and always ready when you are.\n\nFeatures\n* **Built-in cooling system **\u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the lining of the\nwalls - keeps snacks and essentials chilled for hours\n* **No ice packs needed **\u2013 More space, less hassle\n* **Ultra-compact design** \u2013 Perfect for short trips and small essentials\n* **Tapered shape** \u2013 Slides easily into bags without taking up space - may look slightly different\nfrom photos\n* **Wide zip opening** \u2013 Easy access, even on the go\n* **Structured base** \u2013 Fits small containers without tipping\n* **Collapsible + freezable** \u2013 Folds flat for easy freezer storage\n* **Secure zip closure** \u2013 Locks in cool, dry air\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen: 9 x 4 x 5 in.\nClosed : 9.5 x 1.5 x 5.25 in.\n\n**NOTE:** Logo/Label color may vary\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":44788112457814,\"title\":\"Ice Cream Critters\",\"option1\":\"Ice Cream\nCritters\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-SN-ICC\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"\nfeatured_image\":{\"id\":36882000248918,\"product_id\":1943983095894,\"position\":83,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-\n27T09:11:03-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-27T09:11:05-07:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_ice-cream-critters\",\n\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-snack-bag-ice-cream-cr\nitters-right.jpg?v=1779898265\",\"variant_ids\":[44788112457814]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable\nSnack Bag - Ice Cream Critters\",\"public_title\":\"Ice Cream Critters\",\"options\":[\"Ice Cream\nCritters\"],\"price\":1999,\"weight\":170,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_mana\ngement\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035029050\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt\n#color_ice-cream-critters\",\"id\":28878646214742,\"position\":83,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"he\night\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-snack-bag-ice-cream-critt\ners-right.jpg?v=1779898265\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_\nrule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":44788112523350,\"title\":\"Construction\nTrucks\",\"option1\":\"Construction\nTrucks\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-SN-CON\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"fe\natured_image\":{\"id\":36882019418198,\"product_id\":1943983095894,\"position\":97,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-27\nT09:23:54-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-27T09:23:56-07:00\",\"alt\":\"PackIt#color_construction-trucks\",\"\nwidth\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-snack-bag-construction-\ntrucks-right.jpg?v=1779899036\",\"variant_ids\":[44788112523350]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable\nSnack Bag - Construction Trucks\",\"public_title\":\"Construction Trucks\",\"options\":[\"Construction\nTrucks\"],\"price\":1999,\"weight\":170,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_manage\nment\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035029074\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"PackIt#c\nolor_construction-trucks\",\"id\":28878665285718,\"position\":97,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"hei\nght\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-snack-bag-construction-tru\ncks-right.jpg?v=1779899036\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_\nrule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":44788112556118,\"title\":\"Blue Skate\nChecke"
