cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt#color_papaya-poppy] ][111]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small] ][112]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][118]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt#color_sky-blue-azure-blue] ][119]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small] ][120]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][124]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][125]\n[ [MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt] ][126]\n\n# MOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small\n\nRegular price$44.99\nOne lunch box, multiple ways to pack it. A modular design that lets you mix, match, and move through\nyour day-your way. [Read More \u00bb][127]\nColor: Sky Blue / Azure Blue Color\nSky Blue / Azure Blue\nPapaya / Poppy\nAdd to cart Sky Blue / Azure Blue - $44.99 USD Papaya / Poppy - $44.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**One lunch box, multiple ways to pack it. A modular design that lets you mix, match, and move\nthrough your day-your way.**\n\n**Modular Design Meets Built-In Cooling**\nWhy choose one lunch bag when you can have three? The MOD\u2122 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small is designed for\ntotal flexibility-with a smart, dual-compartment system that lets you pack, separate, or combine\nyour meals your way.\n\nOne compartment features PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, with built-in freezable gel that\nkeeps cold foods chilled for hours-no ice packs needed. The other offers insulated storage for\neverything else. Together? A perfectly balanced lunch setup.\n\n**Pack Smarter, Not Harder**\nThis is organization without overthinking it.\n\nUse the compartments zipped together or separately to fit your day.\n\nPack snacks, small meals, sandwiches, fruit, or bento containers-cold items stay chilled, dry items\nstay just right. It\u2019s compact, but surprisingly capable.\n\n**Built For Real Life **\nFrom school lunches and office days to travel, errands, and snack runs, this bag adapts to\nwhatever\u2019s on your schedule.\n\nCarry one, carry both-clip on the adjustable crossbody strap for hands-free days, or grab the top\nhandles and go.\n\nFeatures\n* **3-In-1 modular design** \u2013 Use together or separately for ultimate flexibility\n* **Built-in cooling (no ice packs)** \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls -\nkeeps cold foods chilled for hours\n* **Dual-function compartments:**\nFreezable section for perishables\nInsulated section for dry or room-temp foods\n* **Compact but capable** \u2013 Perfect for snacks, small meals, and lighter days\n* **Multiple carry options** \u2013 Adjustable crossbody strap + top handles\n* **Lightweight + portable** \u2013 Easy to grab, go, and adapt on the fly\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS\n**Combined Open:\n6.5 x 6.5 x 9.75 in\nCombined Collapsed:\n6.5 x 6.5 x 6.25 in\nInsulated Lunch Box:\n6.5 x 6.5 x 3.75 in\nFreezable Lunch Box:\n6.5 x 6.5 x 5.75 in\nFreezable Lunch Box Collapsed:\n6.5 x 6.5 x 2.5 in\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":43792030531670,\"title\":\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure Blue\",\"option1\":\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-ML-ASB-SM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"f\neatured_image\":{\"id\":36027935948886,\"product_id\":7581808623702,\"position\":12,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-0\n5T12:35:16-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:29:08-07:00\",\"alt\":\"MOD 3-In-1 Small -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-sma\nll-azure-sky-blue-right-straps-up.jpg?v=1773080948\",\"variant_ids\":[43792030531670]},\"available\":true\n,\"name\":\"MOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small - Sky Blue \\/ Azure Blue\",\"public_title\":\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\",\"options\":[\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\"],\"price\":4499,\"weight\":499,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_manageme\nnt\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"continue\",\"barcode\":\"819035028862\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"MOD\n3-In-1 Small -\nPackIt\",\"id\":28096128614486,\"position\":12,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":\n2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-small-azure-sky-blue-right-straps\n-up.jpg?v=1773080948\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":\n{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":43792030957654,\"title\":\"Papaya \\/ Poppy\",\"option1\":\"Papaya\nPoppy\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-ML-PPA-SM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"\nfeatured_image\":{\"id\":36028091826262,\"product_id\":7581808623702,\"position\":4,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-0\n5T13:17:29-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:29:23-07:00\",\"alt\":\"MOD 3-In-1 Small -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-sma\nll-papaya-poppy-right-straps-up.jpg?v=1773080963\",\"variant_ids\":[43792030957654]},\"available\":true,\"\nname\":\"MOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small - Papaya \\/ Poppy\",\"public_title\":\"Papaya \\/\nPoppy\",\"options\":[\"Papaya \\/\nPoppy\"],\"price\":4499,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_managemen\nt\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"continue\",\"barcode\":\"819035028879\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"MOD\n3-In-1 Small -\nPackIt\",\"id\":28096284196950,\"position\":4,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2\n500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-small-papaya-poppy-right-straps-up\n.jpg?v=1773080963\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"m\nin\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}}] {\"id\":43792030531670,\"title\":\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\",\"option1\":\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-ML-ASB-SM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"f\neatured_image\":{\"id\":36027935948886,\"product_id\":7581808623702,\"position\":12,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-0\n5T12:35:16-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:29:08-07:00\",\"alt\":\"MOD 3-In-1 Small -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-sma\nll-azure-sky-blue-right-straps-up.jpg?v=1773080948\",\"variant_ids\":[43792030531670]},\"available\":true\n,\"name\":\"MOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small - Sky Blue \\/ Azure Blue\",\"public_title\":\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\",\"options\":[\"Sky Blue \\/ Azure\nBlue\"],\"price\":4499,\"weight\":499,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_manageme\nnt\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"continue\",\"barcode\":\"819035028862\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"MOD\n3-In-1 Small -\nPackIt\",\"id\":28096128614486,\"position\":12,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":\n2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-small-azure-sky-blue-right-straps\n-up.jpg?v=1773080948\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":\n{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}}\n\n## HOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Separate It\nSimply unzip to detach the two different compartments and separate the freezable section.\n2. Freeze\nSimply freeze the lunch box overnight (8 hours for optimal cooling performance).\n3. Pack & Go\nPack the freezable section with perishables and the insulated section with dry or room temperature\nfoods, combine the two sections, and enjoy on the go.\nBuilt with Ecofreeze\u00ae Technology\nPackIt is the only foldable, freezable bag that keeps food and drinks cool for hours - no ice packs\nneeded. It's secret sauce? Patented cooling technology that's built into the walls of the bag.\nCollapse\nFreeze\nPack & Go\n[Reusable]\nReusable\n[No Ice Or Ice Packs Needed]\nNo Ice Or Ice Packs Needed\n[Fully Freezable]\nFully Freezable\n[Collapsible]\nCollapsible\n\n### You May Also Like\n\n[MOD 3-In-1 Small - PackIt#color_papaya-poppy]\n][128]\nMOD 3-In-1 Lunch Box Small\n$44.99\n[ Sky Blue / Azure Blue ][129][ Papaya / Poppy ][130]\n\n> \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n> Love the modular design!\n> \"I had to come back to buy a second one because my husband keeps using mine! This makes taking\n> lunch to work such a breeze. Being able to separate my refrigeratables from the freezables without\n> taking things out of the bag has made a huge difference.\"\n> Maria C.\n\n## With you for the Journey\n\n[ Shop Best Sellers \u00bb ][131]\n[ SHOP TRAVEL ][132]\n[ SHOP HOSTING ][133]\n[ shop Work/Commute ][134]\n[ shop school ][135]\n\n## Have a Question?\n\n][136]\n* [Contact Us][137]\n* [About Us][138]\n* [Press][139]\n* [FAQ][140]\n* [Track Your Order][141]\n* [Warranty][142]\n* [Refund Policy][143]\n* [Wholesale][144]\n* [Loyalty Program][145]\