cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt#color_plum] ][111]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box] ][112]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][118]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt#color_black] ][119]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][120]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][124]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][125]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][126]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt#color_true-blue] ][127]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][128]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][129]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][130]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][131]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][132]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][133]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][134]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt#color_agave] ][135]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box] ][136]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][137]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][138]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][139]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][140]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][141]\n[ [MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box - PackIt] ][142]\n\n# MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box\n\nRegular price$49.99\nThree ways to pack, zero compromises. This modular lunch system lets you separate, combine, and\ncustomize every meal exactly how your day demands. [Read More \u00bb][143]\nColor: Agave Color\nAgave\nPlum\nTrue Blue\nBlack\nAdd to cart Agave - $49.99 USD Plum - $49.99 USD True Blue - $49.99 USD Black - $49.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Three ways to pack, zero compromises. This modular lunch system lets you separate, combine, and\ncustomize every meal exactly how your day demands.**\n\n**The Ultimate Modular Lunch System**\nThis is lunch, reimagined. The MOD\u2122 3-In-1 Lunch Box is built for total flexibility, combining smart\ndesign with PackIt\u2019s signature cooling innovation.\n\nTwo separate compartments work independently or zip together-so whether you\u2019re packing a full meal\nor just the essentials, your lunch adapts to you.\n\nThe blue-lined compartment features patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae technology, with built-in freezable gel that\nkeeps cold foods chilled for hours (no ice packs needed). The gray-lined compartment keeps\neverything else perfectly insulated and ready to go.\n\n**Pack With Purpose And Precision**\nNo more mixing what shouldn\u2019t mix.\nUse each compartment on its own or together to create a setup that actually makes sense for your\nday.\n\nPack bento containers, snacks, drinks, sandwiches, and more-cold items stay chilled, dry items stay\nfresh, and everything stays organized.\n\n**From Full Days To Light Days**\nWhether you\u2019re heading to work, school, travel days, or long outings, this bag flexes with your\nschedule.\n\nCarry both compartments when you need a full setup, or grab just one when you\u2019re keeping it light.\nThe adjustable crossbody strap clips onto either compartment for easy, hands-free movement.\n\nFeatures\n* **3-In-1 modular design **\u2013 Use compartments separately or together\n* **Built-in cooling system** \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls - keeps\nfood chilled for hours\n* **Dual-purpose storage\n**Freezable compartment keeps perishables cool\nInsulated compartment for dry goods\n* **Flexible carry options** \u2013 Removable, adjustable crossbody strap attaches to either compartment\n* **Top handles on each **\u2013 Easy grab-and-go convenience\n* **Fits your routine **\u2013 Compatible with MOD\u2122 Lunch Bento, Snack Bento, and Mini Bento\n* **Wide zip openings** \u2013 Top lid folds over for easy packing, zipper locks in cool, dry air\n* **Space-saving design** \u2013 Freezable compartment folds flat for freezing\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nCombined Open:\n6.5 x 8.75 x 9.75 in\nInsulated Lunch Box:\n6.5 x 8.75 x 4 in\nFreezable Lunch Box:\n6.5 x 8.75 x 5.75 in\nFreezable Lunch Box Collapsed:\n6.5 x 8.75 x 2.25 in\nLunch Box Combined Collapsed:\n6.5 x 8.75 x 6.25 in\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":43792114876502,\"title\":\"Agave\",\"option1\":\"Agave\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-ML-\nAGV\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36028194947158,\"product_id\":7380\n610646102,\"position\":28,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-05T14:13:22-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:28:46-0\n7:00\",\"alt\":\"MOD 3-in-1 Lunch Box -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/MOD-3-in-1-lunch-box-aga\nve-right-straps-up.jpg?v=1773080926\",\"variant_ids\":[43792114876502]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"MOD\n3-in-1 Lunch Box -\nAgave\",\"public_title\":\"Agave\",\"options\":[\"Agave\"],\"price\":4999,\"weight\":1225,\"compare_at_price\":null\n,\"invent