cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt#color_almond] ][111]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][112]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt#color_black] ][118]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][119]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][120]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt#color_midnight-navy] ][124]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][125]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][126]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][127]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][128]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][129]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt PackIt#color_sage] ][130]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - ] ][131]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][132]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][133]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][134]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt] ][135]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt#color_ALL] ][136]\n[ [Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box - PackIt PackIt#color_all] ][137]\n\n# Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box\n\nRegular price$26.99\nDouble the snacks, double the freshness, smarter storage. Keep cool and dry foods perfectly in\ntheir place. [Read More \u00bb][138]\nColor: Sage Color\nSage\nAlmond\nMidnight Navy\nBlack\nAdd to cart Sage - $26.99 USD Almond - $26.99 USD Midnight Navy - $26.99 USD Black - $26.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Double the snacks, double the freshness, smarter storage. Keep cool and dry foods perfectly in\ntheir place.**\n\n**Two Compartments. One Smarter Snack System.**\nUpgrade the way you snack. The Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box is designed with two separate\nzip compartments-so you can keep cold items chilled and dry snacks perfectly stored, all in one\ncompact bag.\n\nOne side features PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, with built-in freezable gel that keeps\nperishable snacks cool for hours. The other side offers insulated storage for everything else.\n\n**Pack It Your Way**\nBecause not all snacks need the same treatment.\nUse the dual compartments to separate fresh foods like fruit, yogurt, or cheese from dry snacks like\ncrackers, bars, or trail mix.\n\nNo mixing, no soggy snacks-just a setup that actually works.\n\n**Made For Days On The Move**\nFrom workdays and school schedules to gym sessions, travel, and everyday errands, this snack box\nfits seamlessly into your routine.\n\nClip it onto a backpack, tote, gym bag, or stroller with the buckle handle-or toss it inside and go.\n\nFeatures\n* **Dual compartment design **\u2013 Separate chilled and non-chilled snacks in one bag\n* **Built-in cooling system** \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel in the walls of the bag keeps\nperishable snacks cold for hours\n* **Compact + portable** \u2013 Easy to carry or stash in any bag\n* **Clip-on buckle handle** \u2013 Attaches to backpacks, totes, gym bags, and more\n* **Two zip compartments** \u2013 Organized, accessible, and easy to use\n* **Collapsible + freezable** \u2013 Folds flat for easy freezer storage\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen: 5 x 8 x 4.75 in.\nFlattened: 2 x 8 x 4.75 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":42390973284438,\"title\":\"Sage\",\"option1\":\"Sage\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-DS-SG\nE\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":34568392147030,\"product_id\":745977\n5184982,\"position\":21,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-17T11:19:06-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-27T15:27:39-07:\n00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box -\n\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-dual-compartment-sna\nck-box-sage-left-angle.jpg?v=1751063259\",\"variant_ids\":[42390973284438]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Fr\neezable Dual Compartment Snack Box -\nSage\",\"public_title\":\"Sage\",\"options\":[\"Sage\"],\"price\":2699,\"weight\":360,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"in\nventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035028\n657\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box -\n\",\"id\":26869366292566,\"position\":21,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"\nsrc\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-dual-compartment-snack-box-sage-left-angle.jpg?v=1\n751063259\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"m\nax\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":42390973218902,\"title\":\"Almond\",\"option1\":\"Almond\",\"option2\":null,\"op\ntion3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-DS-ALM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":345683\n38014294,\"product_id\":7459775184982,\"position\":2,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-17T10:54:28-07:00\",\"updated_a\nt\":\"2025-08-21T12:54:41-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-dual-compartme\nnt-snack-box-almond-left-angle.jpg?v=1755806081\",\"variant_ids\":[42390973218902]},\"available\":true,\"n\name\":\"Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box -\nAlmond\",\"public_title\":\"Almond\",\"options\":[\"Almond\"],\"price\":2699,\"weight\":360,\"compare_at_price\":nu\nll,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819\n035028640\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box -\nPackIt\",\"id\":26869332738134,\"position\":2,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2\n500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-dual-compartment-snack-box-almond-left-angle.\njpg?v=1755806081\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"mi\nn\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":42390973251670,\"title\":\"Midnight Navy\",\"option1\":\"Midnight\nNavy\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-DS-MNN\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"feat\nured_image\":{\"id\":34568365408342,\"product_id\":7459775184982,\"position\":15,\"created_at\":\"2025-06-17T1\n1:03:16-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-08-21T12:54:41-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Dual Compartment Snack Box\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-dual-compartme\nnt-sna