cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt#color_mint] ][111]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][112]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [Mod Lunch Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [Mod Lunch Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt#color_steel-gray] ][118]\n[ [Mod Lunch Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][119]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][120]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt] ][124]\n\n# MOD Bento Lunch Container\n\nRegular price$19.99\nOne container, fully in control. Customize every meal without packing multiple boxes. A modular\nbento designed to handle whatever you\u2019re packing. [Read More \u00bb][125]\nColor: Mint Color\nMint\nSteel Gray\nAdd to cart Mint - $19.99 USD Steel Gray - $19.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**One container, fully in control. Customize every meal without packing multiple boxes. A modular\nbento designed to handle whatever you\u2019re packing.**\n\n**The Bento That Adapts To You**\nThis is your everyday lunch, simplified. The MOD\u2122 Lunch Bento Container is designed to give you\nstructure and flexibility-so you can pack exactly what you want, how you want it.\n\nWith a clean, all-in-one design and removable dividers, it replaces the need for multiple containers\n(and the chaos that comes with them).\n\n**Customize Your Compartments**\nBecause not everything belongs together.\nWith two removable dividers, you can create separate sections for mains, sides, snacks, or\nsauces-keeping flavors and textures exactly where they should be.\n\nSnap them in, adjust as needed, and build your meal your way.\n\n**Made For Everyday Lunches**\nFrom workdays and school lunches to meal prep and on-the-go meals, this container is built to keep\nup.\n\nDesigned to fit inside select PackIt Freezable Bags, it becomes part of a complete\nsystem-organization + temperature control, working together.\n\nFeatures\n* All-in-one design \u2013 Replaces multiple containers with one streamlined solution\n* Customizable compartments \u2013 Includes 2 removable, snap-in dividers\n* Leak-resistant design \u2013 Lid locks in place to help prevent spills\n* Everyday capacity (3.75 cups) \u2013 Perfect for balanced meals and portion control\n* MOD\u2122 system compatible \u2013 Designed to fit in select PackIt Freezable Bags\n* Durable Tritan\u2122 base \u2013 BPA-free, shatter-resistant, and crystal clear\n* Microwave + freezer safe \u2013 Built for real-life routines (do not microwave lid)\n* Top-rack dishwasher safe \u2013 Easy cleanup, every time\n* PVC-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\n2.75 x 7.25 x 5.5 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Easy Care, Every Day**\nMicrowave (without lid), freeze, and toss it in the top rack of the dishwasher when you\u2019re done.\n\n[{\"id\":19695307325526,\"title\":\"Mint\",\"option1\":\"Mint\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"AMC-MD-MI\nN\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":32245029896278,\"product_id\":199392\n5820502,\"position\":1,\"created_at\":\"2024-04-01T10:55:12-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-24T07:18:41-07:0\n0\",\"alt\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nPackIt#color_mint\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Mod-Lunch-Ben\nto-Mint-FloatingDivider-WithLid-Lores.jpg?v=1750774721\",\"variant_ids\":[19695307325526]},\"available\":\ntrue,\"name\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nMint\",\"public_title\":\"Mint\",\"options\":[\"Mint\"],\"price\":1999,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inve\nntory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"81903502228\n0\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nPackIt#color_mint\",\"id\":24979196608598,\"position\":1,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":250\n0,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Mod-Lunch-Bento-Mint-FloatingDivider-WithLid\n-Lores.jpg?v=1750774721\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rul\ne\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":19755497422934,\"title\":\"Steel Gray\",\"option1\":\"Steel\nGray\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"AMC-MD-STG\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"feat\nured_image\":{\"id\":32245039333462,\"product_id\":1993925820502,\"position\":8,\"created_at\":\"2024-04-01T10\n:58:39-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-24T20:11:46-07:00\",\"alt\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nPackIt#color_steel-gray\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Mod-Lun\nch-Bento-SteelGray-FloatingDivider-WithLid-Lores.jpg?v=1750821106\",\"variant_ids\":[19755497422934]},\"\navailable\":true,\"name\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container - Steel Gray\",\"public_title\":\"Steel\nGray\",\"options\":[\"Steel\nGray\"],\"price\":1999,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\n\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035022297\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"MOD Bento\nLunch Container -\nPackIt#color_steel-gray\",\"id\":24979206176854,\"position\":8,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"heigh\nt\":2500,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Mod-Lunch-Bento-SteelGray-FloatingDivi\nder-WithLid-Lores.jpg?v=1750821106\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"q\nuantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}}]\n{\"id\":19695307325526,\"title\":\"Mint\",\"option1\":\"Mint\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"AMC-MD-MIN\n\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":32245029896278,\"product_id\":1993925\n820502,\"position\":1,\"created_at\":\"2024-04-01T10:55:12-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-24T07:18:41-07:00\n\",\"alt\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nPackIt#color_mint\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Mod-Lunch-Ben\nto-Mint-FloatingDivider-WithLid-Lores.jpg?v=1750774721\",\"variant_ids\":[19695307325526]},\"available\":\ntrue,\"name\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nMint\",\"public_title\":\"Mint\",\"options\":[\"Mint\"],\"price\":1999,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inve\nntory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"81903502228\n0\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"MOD Bento Lunch Container -\nPackIt#color_mint\",\"id\":24979196608598,\"position\":1,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":250\n0,\"width\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/Mod-Lunch-Bento-Mint-FloatingDivider-WithLid\n-Lores.jpg?v=1750774721\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rul\ne\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}}\n\n## HOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Start With An Empty Base\nHave your delicious fresh food ready to pack. Including any viscous liquids like ranch dressing,\nyogurt, hummus etc.\n2. Insert Dividers\nTake one of the 2 dividers included to snap into the grooves. You decide how much space you need in\nbetween each compartment.\n3. Pack, Seal, and Enjoy!\nFill each section, secure the lid, and take your meal on the go! Remove the dividers for a quick\nsalad shake-up, or keep things neat by leaving the dividers on.\n\n### You May Also Like\n\n[MOD Bento Lunch Container - PackIt#color_mint]\n][126]\nMOD Bento Lunch Container\n$19.99\n[ Mint ][127][ Steel Gray ][128]\n\n> \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n> Love the modular design!\n> \"I had to come back to buy a second one because my husband keeps using mine! This make staking\n> lunch to work such a breeze. Being able to separate my refrigeratables from the freezables without\n> taking things out of the bag has made a huge difference.\"\n> Maria C.\n\n## With you for the Journey\n\n[ Shop Best Sellers \u00bb ][129]\n[ SHOP TRAVEL ][130]\n[ SHOP HOSTING ][131]\n[ shop Work/Commute ][132]\n[ shop school ][133]\n\n## Have a Question?\n\n][134]\n* [Contact Us][135]\n* [About Us][136]\n* [Press][137]\n* [FAQ][138]\n* [Track Your Order][139]\n* [Warranty][140]\n* [Refund Policy][141]\n* [Wholesale][142]\n* [Loyalty Program][143]\n* [Affiliate Program][144]\n* [Conditions Of Use][145]\n* [Terms of Service][146]\n* [Privacy Policy][147]\n* [\u00a92026 PACKIT][148]\n\nfollow us on\n* [ [instagram] Instagram ][149]\n* [ Facebook ][150]\n* [ YouTube ][151]\n* [ Pinterest ][152]\n* [ TikTok ][153]\n\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[icon-X]\nMOD Bento Lunch Container\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags\n[3]: /collections/freezable-snack-bags\n[4]: /collections/customizable-bento-containers\n[5]: /collections/grocery-totes-bags\n[6]: /collections/freezable-coolers-totes\n[7]: /collections/freezable-wine-bags\n[8]: /collections/baby-bottle-bags\n[9]: /collections/hydration\n[10]: /collections/ecofreezeplus\n[11]: /collections/best-sellers\n[12]: /collections/new-arrivals\n[13]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags-for-adults\n[14]: /collections/kids-lunch-bags-and-boxes\n[15]: /collections/baby-bottle-bags\n[16]: /collections/back-to-school-lunch-boxes\n[17]: /collections/wellness\n[18]: /pages/about-us\n[19]: /pages/about-us\n[20]: /pages/press\n[21]: /blogs/packit-blog\n[22]: /pages/our-technology\n[23]: /pages/contact-us\n[24]: /pages/contact-us\n[25]: /pages/faq\n[26]: /pages/cleaning\n[27]: /pages/tracking\n[28]: /pages/warranty\n[29]: /pages/back-to-school-bundle\n[30]: /account\n[31]: https://www.instagram.com/packitcool/\n[32]: https://www.facebook.com/PackItCool\n[33]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2el-0sV1-Yxv9qc0pxhPdA\n[34]: https://www.pinterest.com/packitcool/\n[35]: https://www.tiktok.com/@packitcool\n[36]: /\n[37]: /\n[38]: #\n[39]: #\n[40]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags\n[41]: /collections/freezable-snack-bags\n[42]: /collections/customizable-bento-containers\n[43]: /collections/grocery-totes-bags\n[44]: /collections/freezabl"
