cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt#color_steel-gray] ][111]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][112]\n[ [MOD Bento Snack Container - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [MOD Bento Snack Container - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [MOD Bento Snack Container - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt#color_mint] ][117]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][118]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][119]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][120]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [MOD Bento Snack Container - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [MOD Bento Snack Container - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt] ][124]\n\n# MOD Bento Snack Container\n\nRegular price$14.99\nSnacks, sorted. A perfectly portioned bento that keeps everything in its place. [Read More \u00bb][125]\nColor: Steel Gray Color\nSteel Gray\nMint\nAdd to cart Steel Gray - $14.99 USD Mint - $14.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Snacks, sorted. A perfectly portioned bento that keeps everything in its place.**\n\n**Smarter Snacking Starts Here**\nThis is your go-to for everything in between meals. The MOD\u2122 Snack Bento Container is designed to\nkeep snacks organized, fresh, and easy to pack-without overcomplicating your routine.\n\nSimple, streamlined, and endlessly useful, it\u2019s the kind of container you\u2019ll reach for every day.\n\n**Customize Your Snack Setup**\nBecause snacks deserve structure too.\nThe removable divider lets you split your container into sections-perfect for pairing yogurt and\ngranola, fruit and crackers, or sweet and savory combos.\n\nSnap it in, adjust as needed, and keep everything exactly where it belongs.\n\n**Made For Everyday Moments**\nFrom school snacks and work breaks to travel days and quick bites on the go, this container fits\nseamlessly into your routine.\n\nDesigned to fit inside select PackIt Freezable Bags, it\u2019s part of a smarter system that keeps your\nsnacks cool and organized.\n\nFeatures\n* Perfect snack-size capacity (2.5 cups) \u2013 Ideal for snacks, sides, and lighter meals\n* Customizable compartments \u2013 Includes 1 removable, snap-in divider\n* Leak-resistant design \u2013 Lid locks in place to help prevent spills\n* MOD\u2122 system compatible \u2013 Designed to fit in select PackIt Freezable Bags\n* Durable Tritan\u2122 base \u2013 BPA-free, shatter-resistant, and crystal clear\n* Microwave + freezer safe \u2013 Built for everyday use (lid is not microwavable)\n* Top-rack dishwasher safe \u2013 Easy cleanup, no extra effort\n* PVC-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\n2.75 x 5 x 5.5 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Easy Care, Every Day**\nMicrowave (without lid), freeze, and toss it in the top rack of the dishwasher when you\u2019re done.\n\n[{\"id\":19755559092310,\"title\":\"Steel Gray\",\"option1\":\"Steel\nGray\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKC-MS-STG\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"feat\nured_image\":{\"id\":6830687354966,\"product_id\":1993926377558,\"position\":1,\"created_at\":\"2019-03-28T09:\n58:32-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-25T06:54:36-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 -\nPackIt#color_steel-gray\",\"width\":2328,\"height\":2176,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/products\\/MS_G\nRAY-THUMB.png?v=1750859676\",\"variant_ids\":[19755559092310]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"MOD Bento Snack\nContainer - Steel Gray\",\"public_title\":\"Steel Gray\",\"options\":[\"Steel\nGray\"],\"price\":1499,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\n\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035022327\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Mod Snack\nBento Container\u2122 -\nPackIt#color_steel-gray\",\"id\":966244204630,\"position\":1,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.07,\"height\n\":2176,\"width\":2328,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/products\\/MS_GRAY-THUMB.png?v=1750859676\"}},\"r\nequires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"incre\nment\":1}},{\"id\":19695308865622,\"title\":\"Mint\",\"option1\":\"Mint\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"\nAMC-MS-MIN\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":6831405629526,\"product_id\n\":1993926377558,\"position\":7,\"created_at\":\"2019-03-28T13:01:38-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-25T07:04\n:05-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 -\nPackIt#color_mint\",\"width\":2328,\"height\":2176,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/products\\/MS_MInt-TH\nUMB.png?v=1750860245\",\"variant_ids\":[19695308865622]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"MOD Bento Snack\nContainer -\nMint\",\"public_title\":\"Mint\",\"options\":[\"Mint\"],\"price\":1499,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inve\nntory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"81903502231\n0\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 -\nPackIt#color_mint\",\"id\":966593740886,\"position\":7,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.07,\"height\":2176\n,\"width\":2328,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/products\\/MS_MInt-THUMB.png?v=1750860245\"}},\"require\ns_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":\n1}}] {\"id\":19755559092310,\"title\":\"Steel Gray\",\"option1\":\"Steel\nGray\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKC-MS-STG\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"feat\nured_image\":{\"id\":6830687354966,\"product_id\":1993926377558,\"position\":1,\"created_at\":\"2019-03-28T09:\n58:32-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-06-25T06:54:36-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 -\nPackIt#color_steel-gray\",\"width\":2328,\"height\":2176,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/products\\/MS_G\nRAY-THUMB.png?v=1750859676\",\"variant_ids\":[19755559092310]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"MOD Bento Snack\nContainer - Steel Gray\",\"public_title\":\"Steel Gray\",\"options\":[\"Steel\nGray\"],\"price\":1499,\"weight\":0,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\n\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035022327\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Mod Snack\nBento Container\u2122 -\nPackIt#color_steel-gray\",\"id\":966244204630,\"position\":1,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.07,\"height\n\":2176,\"width\":2328,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/products\\/MS_GRAY-THUMB.png?v=1750859676\"}},\"r\nequires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"incre\nment\":1}}\n\n## HOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Start With An Empty Base\nHave your delicious fresh snacks ready to pack. Including any viscous liquids like ranch dressing,\nyogurt, hummus etc.\n2. Insert Divider\nTake the divider & snap into the grooves. You decide how much space you need in between each\ncompartment.\n3. Pack, Seal, and Enjoy!\nFill with your favorite snacks in each compartment. Remove the divider to combine, or leave in to\nkeep things neat.\n\n### You May Also Like\n\n[Mod Snack Bento Container\u2122 - PackIt#color_steel-gray]\n][126]\nMOD Bento Snack Container\n$14.99\n[ Steel Gray ][127][ Mint ][128]\n\n> \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n> Love the modular design!\n> \"I had to come back to buy a second one because my husband keeps using mine! This make staking\n> lunch to work such a breeze. Being able to separate my refrigeratables from the freezables without\n> taking things out of the bag has made a huge difference.\"\n> Maria C.\n\n## With you for the Journey\n\n[ Shop Best Sellers \u00bb ][129]\n[ SHOP TRAVEL ][130]\n[ SHOP HOSTING ][131]\n[ shop Work/Commute ][132]\n[ shop school ][133]\n\n## Have a Question?\n\n][134]\n* [Contact Us][135]\n* [About Us][136]\n* [Press][137]\n* [FAQ][138]\n* [Track Your Order][139]\n* [Warranty][140]\n* [Refund Policy][141]\n* [Wholesale][142]\n* [Loyalty Program][143]\n* [Affiliate Program][144]\n* [Conditions Of Use][145]\n* [Terms of Service][146]\n* [Privacy Policy][147]\n* [\u00a92026 PACKIT][148]\n\nfollow us on\n* [ [instagram] Instagram ][149]\n* [ Facebook ][150]\n* [ YouTube ][151]\n* [ Pinterest ][152]\n* [ TikTok ][153]\n\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[icon-X]\nMOD Bento Snack Container\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags\n[3]: /collections/freezable-snack-bags\n[4]: /collections/customizable-bento-containers\n[5]: /collections/grocery-totes-bags\n[6]: /collections/freezable-coolers-totes\n[7]: /collections/freezable-wine-bags\n[8]: /collections/baby-bottle-bags\n[9]: /collections/hydration\n[10]: /collections/ecofreezeplus\n[11]: /collections/best-sellers\n[12]: /collections/new-arrivals\n[13]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags-for-adults\n[14]: /collections/kids-lunch-bags-and-boxes\n[15]: /collections/baby-bottle-bags\n[16]: /collections/back-to-school-lunch-boxes\n[17]: /collections/wellness\n[18]: /pages/about-us\n[19]: /pages/about-us\n[20]: /pages/press\n[21]: /blogs/packit-blog\n[22]: /pages/our-technology\n[23]: /pages/contact-us\n[24]: /pages/contact-us\n[25]: /pages/faq\n[26]: /pages/cleaning\n[27]: /pages/tracking\n[28]: /pages/warranty\n[29]: /pages/back-to-school-bundl