cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt#color_almond] ][111]\n[ [Freezable Essential Cooler] ][112]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][118]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt#color_true-blue] ][119]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][120]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][124]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][125]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][126]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt#color_black] ][127]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][128]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][129]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][130]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][131]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][132]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][133]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][134]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt#color_gray-fog] ][135]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][136]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][137]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][138]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][139]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][140]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][141]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][142]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt#color_sage] ][143]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][144]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][145]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][146]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][147]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][148]\n[ [Essential Freezable Cooler Bag - PackIt] ][149]\n\n# Freezable Essential Cooler\n\nRegular price$36.99\nYour everyday cooler, reengineered. Built-in freezing power meets grab-and-go versatility - for\nlunch, or any other adventure, effortlessly. [Read More \u00bb][150]\nColor: Almond Color\nAlmond\nSage\nGray Fog\nTrue Blue\nBlack\nAdd to cart Almond - $36.99 USD Sage - $36.99 USD Gray Fog - $36.99 USD True Blue - $36.99 USD Black\n- $36.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Your everyday cooler, reengineered. Built-in freezing power meets grab-and-go versatility - for\nlunch, or any other adventure, effortlessly.**\n\n**Cooling Tech That Does The Work For You**\nSkip the ice packs and upgrade your routine. The Freezable Essential Cooler is powered by PackIt\u2019s\npatented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, with freezable gel built directly into the walls-so the cooler\nitself keeps everything chilled.\n\nJust freeze it overnight, and you\u2019re set for hours of fresh, cool food and drinks the next day.\n\n**Pack It, Stack It, Go**\nThe structured, cube-shaped design makes packing simple and efficient.\nFit meals, snacks, drinks, and containers without the squeeze-perfect for everything from salads to\nfull-day fuel.\n\nTop-load access means less digging and faster packing, so you can grab what you need and keep\nmoving.\n\n**Built For Wherever The Day Takes You**\nFrom workdays and road trips to gym sessions, picnics, and outdoor adventures, this cooler is made\nto move.\n\nCarry it your way with the top handle, clip-on buckle, or adjustable crossbody strap-hands-free when\nyou need it, grab-and-go when you don\u2019t.\n\nFeatures\n* **Built-in cooling system **\u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls of the\nlunch box - keeps contents chilled for hours\n* **No ice packs required **\u2013 More space, less mess\n* **Cube-shaped design** \u2013 Easy packing for meals, snacks, and drinks\n* **Top-load opening** \u2013 Quick access and efficient packing\n* **Front zip pocket** - for small essentials\n* **Side mesh pocket** - for bottles or quick-grab items\n* **Collapses for compact freezing** \u2013 Space-saving and convenient\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen: 9.5 x 7.75 x 7.75 in.\nCollapsed: 9.5 x 7.75 x 2.25 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":43793626267734,\"title\":\"Almond\",\"option1\":\"Almond\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-E\nS-ALM\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":36031081873494,\"product_id\":69\n78882175062,\"position\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-06T12:42:48-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-13T12:28:57-\n07:00\",\"alt\":\"Essential Freezable Cooler Bag -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-essential-cool\ner-almond-left-strap-up.jpg?v=1776108537\",\"variant_ids\":[43793626267734]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"F\nreezable Essential Cooler -\nAlmond\",\"public_title\":\"Almond\",\"optio