cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt#color_teal] ][111]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote] ][112]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][118]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt#color_magenta] ][119]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote] ][120]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][124]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][125]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][126]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt#color_lemonade] ][127]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][128]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][129]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][130]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][131]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][132]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][133]\n[ [Freezable Market Tote - PackIt] ][134]\n\n# Freezable Market Tote\n\nRegular price$62.99\nGroceries in, freshness locked. From market runs to beach days, it keeps food fresh wherever you go.\n[Read More \u00bb][135]\nColor: Magenta Color\nMagenta\nTeal\nLemonade\nAdd to cart Magenta - $62.99 USD Teal - $62.99 USD Lemonade - $62.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Groceries in, freshness locked. From market runs to beach days, it keeps food fresh wherever you\ngo.**\n\n**A Tote That Actually Keeps Things Cool**\nThis isn\u2019t your average reusable bag. The Freezable Market Tote is powered by PackIt\u2019s patented\nECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, with freezable gel built directly into the walls-so the bag itself keeps\ngroceries and meals chilled.\n\nNo ice packs. No last-minute scrambling. Just a smart freezable grocery tote that works as hard as\nyou do.\n\n**Room For The Real Haul**\nDesigned with a wide, structured base that makes packing effortless.\nCarry groceries, meal prep containers, fresh produce, drinks, or full picnic spreads-all in one\nplace.\n\nIt\u2019s spacious without feeling bulky, and strong enough to handle the everyday (and then some).\n\n**From Errands To Everything Else**\nThis is more than a grocery bag-it\u2019s your go-to for farmer\u2019s market runs, beach days, picnics, road\ntrips, and everyday errands.\n\nThe padded shoulder straps make it comfortable to carry, even when fully loaded-because real life\ndoesn\u2019t travel light.\n\nFeatures\n* **Built-in cooling system** \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls - keeps\ngroceries and perishables chilled for hours\n* **No ice packs needed** \u2013 More space for what matters\n* **Spacious rectangular design** \u2013 Ideal for groceries, meal prep, and large items\n* **Flip-back lid** \u2013 Easy loading and quick access\n* **Inner Mesh Pocket **- on the lid to keep essentials stored & easily accessible\n* **Smart exterior strap + D-ring** \u2013 Secure items like flowers or bread, or keep the bag folded in\nthe freezer\n* **Padded shoulder straps** \u2013 Comfortable carrying, even when full\n* **Collapsible + freezable** \u2013 Folds flat for easy freezer storage\n* **Secure zip closure** \u2013 Locks in cool, dry air\n* Made with **antimicrobial, food-safe lining**\n* It\u2019s **PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free**\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen : 8 x 16 x 12.5 in\nFlattened: 11.5 x 16 x 3.75 in\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":43749651251286,\"title\":\"Magenta\",\"option1\":\"Magenta\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO\n-MT-MAG\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":35886817083478,\"product_id\":\n7581808722006,\"position\":12,\"created_at\":\"2025-12-18T12:41:54-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:27:\n58-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-ma\ngenta-right.jpg?v=1773080878\",\"variant_ids\":[43749651251286]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable\nMarket Tote -\nMagenta\",\"public_title\":\"Magenta\",\"options\":[\"Magenta\"],\"price\":6299,\"weight\":2041,\"compare_at_price\n\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\n\"819035028909\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"id\":27962461782102,\"position\":12,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":\n2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-magenta-right.jpg?v=1773080878\"}\n},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"i\nncrement\":1}},{\"id\":42423015440470,\"title\":\"Teal\",\"option1\":\"Teal\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sk\nu\":\"PKO-MT-TEA\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":35886766129238,\"produ\nct_id\":7581808722006,\"position\":4,\"created_at\":\"2025-12-18T12:03:41-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T\n11:27:58-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-te\nal-right.jpg?v=1773080878\",\"variant_ids\":[42423015440470]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable Market\nTote -\nTeal\",\"public_title\":\"Teal\",\"options\":[\"Teal\"],\"price\":6299,\"weight\":2041,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"i\nnventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"81903502\n8886\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"id\":27962411843670,\"position\":4,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2\n500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-teal-right.jpg?v=1773080878\"}},\"r\nequires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"incre\nment\":1}},{\"id\":43749651218518,\"title\":\"Lemonade\",\"option1\":\"Lemonade\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null\n,\"sku\":\"PKO-MT-LMD\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":35886811545686,\"p\nroduct_id\":7581808722006,\"position\":20,\"created_at\":\"2025-12-18T12:37:27-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-0\n3-09T11:27:58-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-le\nmonade-right.jpg?v=1773080878\",\"variant_ids\":[43749651218518]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable\nMarket Tote -\nLemonade\",\"public_title\":\"Lemonade\",\"options\":[\"Lemonade\"],\"price\":6299,\"weight\":2041,\"compare_at_pr\nice\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcod\ne\":\"819035028893\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"id\":27962456932438,\"position\":20,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":\n2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-lemonade-right.jpg?v=1773080878\"\n}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"\nincrement\":1}}]\n{\"id\":43749651251286,\"title\":\"Magenta\",\"option1\":\"Magenta\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-\nMT-MAG\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":35886817083478,\"product_id\":7\n581808722006,\"position\":12,\"created_at\":\"2025-12-18T12:41:54-08:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:27:5\n8-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-ma\ngenta-right.jpg?v=1773080878\",\"variant_ids\":[43749651251286]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Freezable\nMarket Tote -\nMagenta\",\"public_title\":\"Magenta\",\"options\":[\"Magenta\"],\"price\":6299,\"weight\":2041,\"compare_at_price\n\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\n\"819035028909\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable Market Tote -\nPackIt\",\"id\":27962461782102,\"position\":12,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":\n2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-market-tote-magenta-right.jpg?v=1773080878\"}\n},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"i\nncrement\":1}}\n\n## HOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Flatten or Fold\nFlatten or fold the tote for compact storage in the freezer. Secure the strap to the d-ring to keep\nthe bag flattened.\n2. Freeze\nFreeze the reusable tote overnight (8 hours for optimal cooling performance).\n3. Pack & Go\nPack with your favorite fresh produce or perishables to keep cool from the grocery store to your\nfridge.\nBuilt with Ecofreeze\u00ae Technology\nPackIt is the only foldable, freezable bag that keeps food and drinks cool for hours - no ice packs\nneeded. It's secret sauce? Patented cooling technology that's built into the walls of the bag.\nCollapse\nFreeze\nPack & Go\n[Reusable]\nReusable\n[No Ice Or Ice Packs Needed]\nNo Ice Or Ice Packs Needed\n[Fully Freezable]\nFully Freezable\n[Collapsible]\nCollapsible\n\n### You May Also Like\n\n[Freezable Market Tote - PackIt#color_teal]\n][136]\nFreezable Market Tote\n$62.99\n[ Magenta ][137][ Teal ][138][ Lemonade ][139]\n\n> \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n> Love the modular design!\n> \"I had to come back to buy a second one because my husband keeps using mine! This makes taking\n> lunch to work such a breeze. Being able to separate my refrigeratables from the freezables without\n> taking things out of the bag has made a huge difference.\"\n> Maria C.\n\n## With you for the Journey\n\n[ Shop Best Sellers \u00bb ][140]\n[ SHOP TRAVEL ][141]\n[ SHOP HOSTING ][142]\n[ shop Work/Commute ][143]\n[ shop school ][144]\n\n## Have a Question?\n\n][145]\n* [Contact Us][146]\n* [About "
