cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_poppy] ][111]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][112]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][113]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][114]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][115]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][116]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][117]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][118]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][119]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_city-charcoal] ][120]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][121]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][122]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][123]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][124]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][125]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][126]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][127]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][128]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_seaside-stripe] ][129]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][130]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][131]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][132]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][133]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][134]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][135]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][136]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt] ][137]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_black] ][138]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_blue-bouquet] ][139]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_sky-blue] ][140]\n[ [Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - PackIt#color_ALL] ][141]\n\n# Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler\n\nRegular price$49.99\nTote meets cooler-with built-in chill. Made to carry more, keep it fresh, and go wherever the day\ntakes you. Large capacity tote cooler for all your necessities. [Read More \u00bb][142]\nColor: Poppy Color\nPoppy\nSeaside Stripe\nCity Charcoal\nBlack\nBlue Bouquet\nSky Blue\nAdd to cart Poppy - $49.99 USD Seaside Stripe - $49.99 USD City Charcoal - $49.99 USD Black - $49.99\nUSD Blue Bouquet - $49.99 USD Sky Blue - $49.99 USD\nFree Shipping on U.S. Orders $50+\n30 Day Guarantee\n90 Day Warranty\nProduct Description\n\n**Tote meets cooler-with built-in chill. Made to carry more, keep it fresh, and go wherever the day\ntakes you. Large capacity tote cooler for all your necessities.**\n\n**Cooling Power, Built Into Every Carry**\nThis isn\u2019t just a tote-it\u2019s a fully functional freezable cooler bag. The Freezable 12-Can Tote\nCooler features PackIt\u2019s patented ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology, with freezable gel built directly into the\nwalls.\n\nSo instead of dealing with melting ice packs, you freeze the bag itself. The result? A cleaner,\nsmarter way to keep drinks and food chilled for hours.\n\n**Sized For The Full Lineup**\nBig enough for plans, compact enough to carry with ease.\nWith a 10L capacity (fits up to 12 cans), there\u2019s room for drinks, snacks, and meals-perfect for\nsharing or stocking up for the day.\n\nThe structured tote design keeps everything upright, organized, and easy to access.\n\n**Your Go-To For Plans That Don\u2019t Sit Still**\nFrom beach days and picnics to road trips, workdays, and weekend errands, this tote cooler is built\nto move.\n\nThe comfortable shoulder straps make it easy to carry, even when packed full-so you can bring more\nwithout thinking twice.\n\nFeatures\n* Built-in cooling system \u2013 ECOFREEZE\u00ae Technology - freezable gel built into the walls of the tote -\nkeeps drinks and food chilled for hours\n* No ice packs needed \u2013 More room, less mess\n* 10L capacity (fits up to 12 cans) \u2013 Ideal for day trips, sharing, and food transport\n* Leakproof welded liner \u2013 Easy cleanup and spill protection\n* Antimicrobial interior \u2013 Food-safe liner Helps inhibit the growth of bacteria\n* Tote-style design \u2013 Comfortable shoulder straps for easy carrying\n* Front zip pocket \u2013 Keeps essentials within reach\n* Collapsible + freezable \u2013 Folds flat for easy freezer storage\n* Secure zip closure \u2013 Locks in cool, dry air\n* Made with antimicrobial, food-safe lining\n* It\u2019s PVC-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free, and lead-free\n\n**MEASUREMENTS**\nOpen: 17.25 x 7.5 x 12.5 in.\nFolded: 17.25 x 7.5 x 4 in.\n\nCare Instructions\n\n**Care, Made Simple: **Wipe the interior clean or hand wash as needed, and spot clean the exterior.\nLet the bag dry completely before placing it back in the freezer. Not machine or dishwasher safe.\n\n[{\"id\":42263794384982,\"title\":\"Poppy\",\"option1\":\"Poppy\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-TC-\nPPY\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"featured_image\":{\"id\":34305785954390,\"product_id\":7542\n180773974,\"position\":5,\"created_at\":\"2025-04-23T11:25:11-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:26:41-07\n:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-12-can-tote-co\noler-poppy-left-angled.jpg?v=1773080801\",\"variant_ids\":[42263794384982]},\"available\":true,\"name\":\"Fr\neezable 12 Can Tote Cooler -\nPoppy\",\"public_title\":\"Poppy\",\"options\":[\"Poppy\"],\"price\":4999,\"weight\":1043,\"compare_at_price\":null\n,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_management\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"81903\n5028268\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler -\nPackIt\",\"id\":26678311223382,\"position\":5,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":2\n500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-12-can-tote-cooler-poppy-left-angled.jpg?v=17\n73080801\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"ma\nx\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":42263794417750,\"title\":\"Seaside Stripe\",\"option1\":\"Seaside\nStripe\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO-TC-SST\",\"requires_shipping\":true,\"taxable\":true,\"fe\natured_image\":{\"id\":34305831567446,\"product_id\":7542180773974,\"position\":23,\"created_at\":\"2025-04-23\nT11:32:22-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-09T11:27:20-07:00\",\"alt\":\"Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler -\nPackIt\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-12-can-tote-co\noler-city-seaside-stripe-left-angled.jpg?v=1773080840\",\"variant_ids\":[42263794417750]},\"available\":t\nrue,\"name\":\"Freezable 12 Can Tote Cooler - Seaside Stripe\",\"public_title\":\"Seaside\nStripe\",\"options\":[\"Seaside\nStripe\"],\"price\":4999,\"weight\":1043,\"compare_at_price\":null,\"inventory_quantity\":24,\"inventory_manag\nement\":\"shopify\",\"inventory_policy\":\"deny\",\"barcode\":\"819035028251\",\"featured_media\":{\"alt\":\"Freezab\nle 12 Can Tote Cooler -\nPackIt\",\"id\":26678346973270,\"position\":23,\"preview_image\":{\"aspect_ratio\":1.0,\"height\":2500,\"width\":\n2500,\"src\":\"\\/\\/packit.com\\/cdn\\/shop\\/files\\/freezable-12-can-tote-cooler-city-seaside-stripe-left-\nangled.jpg?v=1773080840\"}},\"requires_selling_plan\":false,\"selling_plan_allocations\":[],\"quantity_rul\ne\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"increment\":1}},{\"id\":42263794352214,\"title\":\"City Charcoal\",\"option1\":\"City\nCharcoal\",\"option2\":null,\"option3\":null,\"sku\":\"PKO