cery Totes & Bags ][84]\n[ Coolers & Totes ][85]\n[ Wine Bags ][86]\n[ Baby Bottle Bags ][87]\n[ Hydration Crossbody Bags ][88]\n[ ECOFREEZE+ Collection ][89]\n[Featured][90]\n[ Best Sellers ][91]\n[ New Arrivals ][92]\n[ Adult Bags ][93]\n[ Kids Bags ][94]\n[ Baby Bags ][95]\n[Back To School][96]\n[Shop Wellness][97]\n* [ About ][98]\n[Our Brand][99]\n[ About Us ][100]\n[ Press ][101]\n[ Blog ][102]\n[ Technology ][103]\n[Need Help?][104]\n[ Contact Us ][105]\n[ FAQ ][106]\n[ Care & Cleaning ][107]\n[ Track Your Order ][108]\n[ Warranty ][109]\n* [ Bundle & Save ][110]\nSearch\nSearch\n[MOD Bento Large Container - PackIt]\n\n# Let\u2019s connect\n\nWe\u2019re here to help!\n\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out.\nFor the fastest response, email us at customerservice@packit.com. Our team will get back to you as\nquickly as possible.\n\nFor orders with a subtotal over $1,000, please contact sales@packit.com.\nFor Wholesale inquiries, please email us at wholesale@packit.com.\n\nContact Customer Service \u00bb\n\nEmail us at\n\n#### **customerservice@packit.com**\n\nCall us at\n\n#### **1-800-287-5513**\n\nContact Customer Service\n\"Close (esc)\"\nHave a question? Need assistance? We're here! Please provide detailed info about your PackIt order\nfor the fastest support. We empower our team to resolve issues quickly.\n1. Order Adjustment 2. Product Issue 3. Order Status 4. Return/Refund/Exchange 5. Product Questions\n6. Other\nNeed to make an adjustment to your order?\nCancellation Inquiry Change Shipping Address (Detail Below) Other Change (Detail Below) Website\nOrdering Issue\nOrder cancellations can't be guaranteed. We will contact you shortly with a resolution. Thank you!\nPlease provide the corrected shipping address and recipient name if applicable. Address changes\ncan't be guaranteed. We will reach out to you with a resolution shortly. Thank you!\nPlease provide a detailed request of your change in the comments below. We reach out to you with a\nresolution shortly. Thank you!\nPlease provide a detailed description of your issue in the comments below. We will reach out to you\nonce we review the issue with a solution. Thank you!\nWhat product issue are you contacting us about?\nDamaged item Wrong item received\nPlease provide a DETAILED description of your issue in the comments below. We will reach out to you\nonce we review the issue with a solution. Thank you!\nPlease provide a DETAILED description of your issue in the comments below. We will reach out to you\nonce we review the issue with a solution. Thank you!\nWant to check up on your order?\nOrder status update Order tracking Order not received\nGive us your order # and the date you ordered it and we will be in touch!\nTo track your order, please visit our website and click the [Track Your Order link][111]. The\nwebsite will ask for your order number, email address and billing zip/postal code. Once that is\nentered, you may check the status throughout the day. Please note that if your order has not been\nshipped yet, there will be no tracking number.\nGive us your order # and the date you ordered it and we will be in touch!\nHave a question about returning, refunding or exchaning a PackIt order?\nHow to Return/Refund/Exchange Status update\nTo initiate a return/exchange, please visit our website and click the [Return & Refunds][112]\nOnce your return is received, it will be processed within 10 business days. PackIt will not be\nresponsible for loss or damage of return shipments. A credit will be issued to your original method\nof payment within 15 business days of receiving your returned item(s). Once the adjustment has been\nmade to your credit card account, you will receive an email confirming that transaction. You can\nread more here: [Return & Refunds][113]\nPlease provide your question including the product name below. We will reach out to you with a\nresponse shortly. Thank you!\nPlease provide your question below and we wiill reach out to you with a response shortly. Thank you!\n\nOh No!\n\nSomething went wrong on our end. You might have some success trying again.\n\nThank you for contacting us.\n\nYour message has been submitted and we will be in touch with you as soon as possible.\n\nContact Us \u00bb Close\n\n## Still have questions?\n\n[ Track your order \u00bb ][114] [ See our faq \u00bb ][115]\n[ SHOP TRAVEL ][116]\n[ SHOP HOSTING ][117]\n[ shop Work/Commute ][118]\n[ shop school ][119]\n\n## Have a Question?\n\n][120]\n* [Contact Us][121]\n* [About Us][122]\n* [Press][123]\n* [FAQ][124]\n* [Track Your Order][125]\n* [Warranty][126]\n* [Refund Policy][127]\n* [Wholesale][128]\n* [Loyalty Program][129]\n* [Affiliate Program][130]\n* [Conditions Of Use][131]\n* [Terms of Service][132]\n* [Privacy Policy][133]\n* [\u00a92026 PACKIT][134]\n\nfollow us on\n* [ [instagram] Instagram ][135]\n* [ Facebook ][136]\n* [ YouTube ][137]\n* [ Pinterest ][138]\n* [ TikTok ][139]\n\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[icon-X]\nPackIt LLC: Contact Us\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags\n[3]: /collections/freezable-snack-bags\n[4]: /collections/customizable-bento-containers\n[5]: /collections/grocery-totes-bags\n[6]: /collections/freezable-coolers-totes\n[7]: /collections/freezable-wine-bags\n[8]: /collections/baby-bottle-bags\n[9]: /collections/hydration\n[10]: /collections/ecofreezeplus\n[11]: /collections/best-sellers\n[12]: /collections/new-arrivals\n[13]: /collections/lunch-boxes-bags-for-adults\n[14]: /collections/kids-lunch-bags-and-boxes\n[15]: /collections/baby-bottle-bags\n[16]: /collections/back-to-school-lunch-boxes\n[17]: /collections/wellness\n[18]: /pages/about-us\n[19]: /pages/about-us\n[20]: /pages/press\n[21]: /blogs/packit-blog\n[22]: /pages/our-technology\n[23]: /pages/contact-us\n[24]: /pages/contact-us\n[25]: /pages/faq\n[26]: /pages/cleaning\n[27]: /pages/tracking\n[28]: /pages/warranty\n[29]: /pages/back-to-school-bundle\n[30]: /account\n[31]: htt