            "text": "The store will not work correctly in the case when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n[Questions? Chat Now]\n[ [Performance Health] [Performance Health] ][1]\n[ My Cart ][2]\n[ Skip to Content ][3]\n* My Account Login / Register\nMy Account\nEmail\nPassword\nLogin\n[Forgot Password?][4]\n[Create an Account][5]\n* [ Support ][6]\n[Contact Us][7]\n[Support Center & FAQs][8]\n[Service & Repair][9]\n[Blog][10]\n[Ask a Clinician][11]\n[Performance Health Academy][12]\n* .\n* [Current Country]\n* US\n* [Canada][13]\n* [UK][14]\n* [France][15]\n* [Australia][16]\n**Search**\nSearch\nSearch\n[Shop By Category][17]\n[Shop By Brand][18][Shop By Brand][19]\n[What We Sell][20]\n[Online Sale][21]\nCreate an Account\n\nHome Care\n& Daily Living\n\nPerformance Health offers a full range of home aids and daily living supplies to enhance comfort and\nindependence. From dining aids to shower chairs, our solutions make everyday tasks easier.\n\n**Shop by Category**\nBrowse a wide variety of home care and daily living products.\n\n[Bathing][22]\n\n[[Bathing Products][Bathing Products]][23]\n\n[Tables & Trays][24]\n\n[[Tables and Trays][Tables and Trays]][25]\n\n[Dining][26]\n\n[[Dining Utensils][Dining Utensils]][27]\n\n[Dressing & Grooming Aids][28]\n\n[[Grooming and Dressing Products][Grooming and Dressing Products]][29]\n\n[Feeders & Arm Supports][30]\n\n[[Arm Support Products][Arm Support Products]][31]\n\n[Home Rehab Accessories][32]\n\n[[Home Rehab Accessories][Home Rehab Accessories]][33]\n\n[Medication Supplies][34]\n\n[[Medication Supply Products][Medication Supply Products]][35]\n\n[Reachers][36]\n\n[[Reacher Products][Reacher Products]][37]\n\n[Respiratory][38]\n\n[[Respiratory Products][Respiratory Products]][39]\n\n[Speech & Cognitive Therapy][40]\n\n[[Speech Cognitive Therapy Products][Speech Cognitive Therapy Products]][4