            "text": "The store will not work correctly in the case when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n[Questions? Chat Now]\n[ [Performance Health] [Performance Health] ][1]\n[ My Cart ][2]\n[ Skip to Content ][3]\n* My Account Login / Register\nMy Account\nEmail\nPassword\nLogin\n[Forgot Password?][4]\n[Create an Account][5]\n* [ Support ][6]\n[Contact Us][7]\n[Support Center & FAQs][8]\n[Service & Repair][9]\n[Blog][10]\n[Ask a Clinician][11]\n[Performance Health Academy][12]\n* .\n* [Current Country]\n* US\n* [Canada][13]\n* [UK][14]\n* [France][15]\n* [Australia][16]\n**Search**\nSearch\nSearch\n[Shop By Category][17]\n[Shop By Brand][18][Shop By Brand][19]\n[What We Sell][20]\n[Online Sale][21]\nCreate an Account\n\nPhysical Therapy &\nRehab Clinic Supplies\n\nPerformance Health features professional-grade products for rehabilitation. Support pre- &\npost-surgical care, injury prevention & rehab, sports performance and beyond.\n\n**Shop by Category**\nFrom resistance bands and kinesiology tapes to reference materials to display in your facility, we\noffer a comprehensive range of clinical supplies.\n\n[Balance & Strengthening][22]\n\n[[Balance & Strengthening][Balance & Strengthening]][23]\n\n[Reference Materials][24]\n\n[[Reference Materials][Reference Materials]][25]\n\n[Resistance Products][26]\n\n[[Resistance Products][Resistance Products]][27]\n\n[Storage & Supplies][28]\n\n[[Storage & Supplies][Storage & Supplies]][29]\n\n[Topical Treatments][30]\n\n[[Topical Treatments][Topical Treatments]][31]\n\n[Upper Extremity Exercise][32]\n\n[[Upper Extremity Exercise][Upper Extremity Exercise]][33]\n\n**Popular Clinic Supplies**\n\n[[THERABAND Non-Latex][THERABAND Non-Latex]][34]\n\n[THERABAND Non-Latex][35]\n\n[[Rolyan Reach N Range Pulley][Rolyan Reach N Range Pulley]][36]\n\n[Rolyan Reach N Range Pulley][37]\n\n[[Sissel Balance Board][Sissel Balance Board]][38]\n\n[Sissel Balance Board][39]\n\n[[THERABAND Tubing][THERABAND Tubing]][40]\n\n[THERABAND Tubing][41]\n\n[[Rolyan Exercise Balls][Rolyan Exercise Balls]][42]\n\n[Rolyan Exercise Balls][43]\n\n[[Nitrile Gloves][Nitrile Gloves]][44]\n\n[Nitrile Gloves][45]\n\n[[THERABAND CLX][THERABAND CLX]][46]\n\n[THERABAND CLX][47]\n\n[[GymWipes][GymWipes]][48]\n\n[GymWipes][49]\n\n**THERABAND Professional**\nNon-Latex Resistance Tubing\n\nThe ideal solution for upper & lower body resistance training & rehabilitation, with 6 progressive,\ncolor-coded resistance levels.\n\n[SHOP NOW][50]\n[[Performance Health | THERABAND Non-Latex Tubing - 100 FT][Performance Health | THERABAND Non-Latex\nTubing - 100 FT]][51]\n\n**Trending Clinical Articles**\n\n[[5 Steps for Using Kinesiology Tape to Reduce Swelling][5 Steps for Using Kinesiology Tape to\nReduce Swelling]][52]\n\n[5 Steps for Using Kinesiology Tape\nto Reduce Swelling][53]\n\n[[THERABAND Proven to Last Five Times Longer][THERABAND Proven to Last Five Times Longer]][54]\n\n[THERABAND Proven to Last\nFive Times Longer][55]\n\n[[What Clinic Supplies You Need for Your New PT Facility][What Clinic Supplies You Need for Your New\nPT Facility]][56]\n\n[What Clinic Supplies You Need\nfor Your New PT Facility][57]\n\n**Top Brands for Clinic Supplies**\n\n[ ][58]\n\nCreated by clinicians, for clinicians - THERABAND is the originator and global leader in resistance\nbands and products. With the Trusted Progression System, the color-coded system uses engineered\nprogression levels that are pull-force tested.\n**[LEARN MORE][59]**\n\n[ ][60]\n\nFrom Swedish roots, Sissel focuses on the natural way, developing natural, simple, effective\nproducts for healthy sitting, sleeping, moving and well-being.\n**[LEARN MORE][61]**\n\n[ ][62]\n\nProviding sports medicine professionals the best solutions for pre-activity preparation, on-field\nperformance, and post-injury protection, Cramer has over 100 years of excellence behind their\nproducts.\n[**SEE WHY ATs LOVE CRAMER**][63]\n\n[ ][64]\n\nAs the leader in thermoplastic splinting, Rolyan has established a spectrum of splinting materials.\nHowever, their reach goes beyond just splinting, offering upper extremity tools for exercise and\nrehabilitation.\n**[LEARN MORE][65]**\n\n**ACCOUNT**\n\n[Getting Started Online][66]\n\n[Login/Register][67]\n\n[Forgot Password][68]\n\n[Track Web Order][69]\n\n**CUSTOMER SUPPORT**\n\n[Live Chat][70]\n\n[How-To Videos][71]\n\n[Support Center & FAQs][72]\n\n[Returns][73]\n\n[Request a Quote][74]\n\n[Contact Customer Service][75]\n\n[Product Recalls][76]\n\n[Equipment Solutions & Repair Services][77]\n\n[Accessibility Statement][78]\n\n**RESOURCES**\n\n[Performance Health Academy][79]\n\n[Articles][80]\n\n[Digital Catalogs][81]\n\n[Online Sale][82]\n\n**COMPANY**\n\n[About Us][83]\n\n[Customer Promise][84]\n\n[What We Sell][85]\n\n[Brands][86]\n\n[Partners][87]\n\n[Career Openings][88]\n\n[News][89]\n\n### Questions? [Ask an Expert][90]\n\n#### Sign Up for Performance Health Updates\n\nBy signing up, you accept the terms of our [Privacy Policy][91]\n\n**Newsletter**\nSign Up for Our Newsletter:\nSubscribe\n[Globe]\n\nAre you visiting PerformanceHealth.com\n\n**from outside of the US?**\n\nVisit your regional site for relevant pricing, promotions, and products.\n\n\u00a9 2026 Performance Health\n\n[Trademarks][92][Privacy Policy][93][Terms & Conditions][94]\n\n[\uf0e1][95]\n\n[1]: https://www.performancehealth.com/\n[2]: https://www.performancehealth.com/checkout/cart/\n[3]: #contentarea\n[4]: https://www.performancehealth.com/customer/account/forgotpassword/\n[5]: javascript:void(0)\n[6]: #\n[7]: https://www.performancehealth.com/contact-customer-service\n[8]: https://support.performancehealth.com/support/home\n[9]: https://www.performancehealth.com/equipment-solutions\n[10]: https://www.performancehealth.com/articles\n[11]: https://www.performancehealth.com/ask-a-clinician\n[12]: https://www.perf