            "text": "The store will not work correctly in the case when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n[Questions? Chat Now]\n[ [Performance Health] [Performance Health] ][1]\n[ My Cart ][2]\n[ Skip to Content ][3]\n* My Account Login / Register\nMy Account\nEmail\nPassword\nLogin\n[Forgot Password?][4]\n[Create an Account][5]\n* [ Support ][6]\n[Contact Us][7]\n[Support Center & FAQs][8]\n[Service & Repair][9]\n[Blog][10]\n[Ask a Clinician][11]\n[Performance Health Academy][12]\n* .\n* [Current Country]\n* US\n* [Canada][13]\n* [UK][14]\n* [France][15]\n* [Australia][16]\n**Search**\nSearch\nSearch\n[Shop By Category][17]\n[Shop By Brand][18][Shop By Brand][19]\n[What We Sell][20]\n[Online Sale][21]\nCreate an Account\n\nMobility & Ambulation\n\nPerformance Health offers a comprehensive selection of mobility products to support movement and\nindependence. From transfer assists to walking aids and wheelchairs, our solutions help individuals\nstay active and confident.\n\n**Shop by Category**\nBrowse our range of mobility and ambulation equipment from globally renowned manufacturers.\n\n[Canes, Crutches & Walkers][22]\n\n[[Canes, Crutches & Walkers][Canes, Crutches & Walkers]][23]\n\n[Mobility Accessories][24]\n\n[[Mobility Accessories][Mobility Accessories]][25]\n\n[Transfer Assists & Lifts][26]\n\n[[Transfer Assists & Lifts][Transfer Assists & Lifts]][27]\n\n[Wheelchairs][28]\n\n[[Wheelchairs][Wheelchairs]][29]\n\n[Wheelchair Accessories][30]\n\n[[Wheelchair Accessories][Wheelchair Accessories]][31]\n\n[Cushions & Positioning][32]\n\n[[Wheelchair Cushions & Positioning][Wheelchair Cushions & Positioning]][33]\n\n**Popular Mobility & Ambulation Products**\n\n[[U-Step Collator][U-Step Collator]][34]\n\n[U-Step II Wheeled Parkinson's Walker][35]\n\n[[Drive Cruiser III Wheelchair][Drive Cruiser III Wheelchair]][36]\n\n[Drive Cruiser III