            "text": "The store will not work correctly in the case when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n[Questions? Chat Now]\n[ [Performance Health] [Performance Health] ][1]\n[ My Cart ][2]\n[ Skip to Content ][3]\n* My Account Login / Register\nMy Account\nEmail\nPassword\nLogin\n[Forgot Password?][4]\n[Create an Account][5]\n* [ Support ][6]\n[Contact Us][7]\n[Support Center & FAQs][8]\n[Service & Repair][9]\n[Blog][10]\n[Ask a Clinician][11]\n[Performance Health Academy][12]\n* .\n* [Current Country]\n* US\n* [Canada][13]\n* [UK][14]\n* [France][15]\n* [Australia][16]\n**Search**\nSearch\nSearch\n[Shop By Category][17]\n[Shop By Brand][18][Shop By Brand][19]\n[What We Sell][20]\n[Online Sale][21]\nCreate an Account\n\nLymphedema\n\nPerformance Health offers a wide array of products from the most trusted brands in lymphedema\ntreatment and recovery.\n\n**Shop by Category**\nBrowse our selection of high-quality lymphedema products from renowned manufacturers.\n\n[Padding & Foam][22]\n\n[[Lymphedema - Padding & Foam][Lymphedema - Padding & Foam]][23]\n\n[Tape & Gauze][24]\n\n[[Lymphedema - Tape & Gauze][Lymphedema - Tape & Gauze]][25]\n\n[Arm & Hand Compression][26]\n\n[[Arm & Hand Compression][Arm & Hand Compression]][27]\n\n[Tubular Bandages & Stockinette][28]\n\n[[Lymphedema - Tubular Bandages & Stockinette][Lymphedema - Tubular Bandages & Stockinette]][29]\n\n[Knee, Leg & Foot Compression][30]\n\n[[Lymphedema - Knee, Leg & Foot Compression][Lymphedema - Knee, Leg & Foot Compression]][31]\n\n[Wound Care Products][32]\n\n[[Lymphedema - Wound Care Products][Lymphedema - Wound Care Products]][33]\n[VIEW ALL PRODUCTS][34]\n\n**Shop by Body Part**\nShop lymphedema products, based on your body part.\n\nHEAD & TORSO ARM HAND ANKLE & FOOT THIGH/KNEE/LOWER LEG\n\nHead & Torso\n\nLymphedema of the head and neck can contribute to difficulty swallowing, breathing, or easily moving\nyour head or neck muscles (such as looking over your shoulder).\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][35]\n\nArm\n\nLymphedema is swelling due to build-up of lymph fluid in the body. It usually happens in the arms or\nlegs, but can occur in other parts of the body.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][36]\n\nHand\n\nLymphedema refers to tissue swelling caused by an accumulation of protein-rich fluid that's usually\ndrained through the body's lymphatic system.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][37]\n\nKnee High\n\nLymphedema of the Knee is swelling that\u2019s caused by a collection of too much lymph fluid. It usually\nhappens in your arms and legs.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][38]\n\nThigh High\n\nLymphedema is a build-up of lymph fluid in the fatty tissues just under your skin. This build-up\nmight cause swelling and discomfort.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCT][39]\n\nAnkle & Foot\n\nSometimes our legs or feet become swollen and feel uncomfortable. This is known as oedema and it\nhappens when fluid in our lower legs or feet has trouble returning back up through the body.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][40]\n\nLeggings\n\nLymphedema refers to tissue swelling caused by an accumulation of protein-rich fluid that's usually\ndrained through the body's lymphatic system.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][41]\n\nThigh/Knee/Lower Leg\n\nLymphedema refers to tissue swelling caused by an accumulation of protein-rich fluid that's usually\ndrained through the body's lymphatic system.\n\n[VIEW PRODUCTS][42]\n\n**Popular Lymphedema Products**\n\n[[Caresia Gauntlet][Caresia Gauntlet]][43]\n\n[Caresia Gauntlet][44]\n\n[[Tribute Wrap Compression][Tribute Wrap Compression]][45]\n\n[Tribute Wrap Compression][46]\n\n[[LymphaTouch Pro][LymphaTouch Pro]][47]\n\n[LymphaTouch Pro][48]\n\n[[CompreFlex Lite][CompreFlex Lite]][49]\n\n[CompreFlex Lite][50]\n\n[[TributeWrap Glove][TributeWrap Glove]][51]\n\n[TributeWrap Glove][52]\n\n[[Lower Leg Reduction Kit][Lower Leg Reduction Kit]][53]\n\n[Lower Leg Reduction Kit][54]\n\n[[Kinesio Fan Cut Tape][Kinesio Fan Cut Tape]][55]\n\n[Kinesio Fan Cut Tape][56]\n\n[[ReadyWrap Gauntlet][ReadyWrap Gauntlet]][57]\n\n[ReadyWrap Gauntlet][58]\n\n**Shop by Brand**\nPerformance Health features the most trusted brands for lymphedema products.\n\n[[Jobst][Jobst]][59]\n[[Ganzoni Sigvaris][Ganzoni Sigvaris]][60]\n[[Lohmann & Rauscher][Lohmann & Rauscher]][61]\n[[Solaris][Solaris]][62]\n\n**Clinical Articles for Lymphedema**\n\n[[How to Reduce Lymphedema Swelling][How to Reduce Lymphedema Swelling]][63]\n\n[How to Reduce\nLymphedema Swelling][64]\n\n[[The Best Products to Make Managing Lymphedema Easier][The Best Products to Make Managing\nLymphedema Easier]][65]\n\n[The Best Products to Make\nManaging Lymphedema Easier][66]\n\n[[Top Products for Managing Lymphedema After Breast Cancer][Top Products for Managing Lymphedema\nAfter Breast Cancer]][67]\n\n[Top Products for Managing Lymphedema\nAfter Breast Cancer][68]\n\n**Top Brands in Lymphedema**\n\n[Lohmann & Rauscher][Lohmann & Rauscher]\n\nTributeNight\u2122\n\nTrbuteNight\u2122 custom garments are made with foam technology combined with our microfiber fabric\nthat's breathable, wickable and provides thermal release to keep your patients comfortable\nthroughout the night.\n\n[[TributeNight\u2122 Wraps][TributeNight\u2122 Wraps]][69]\n[SHOP NOW][70]\n[[LymphaTouch Pro][LymphaTouch Pro]][71]\n\nNegative Pressure...\nPositive Results!\n\nLymphaTouch Pro can be used in a variety of settings. LymphaTouch Pro is a safe, comfortable, and a\neffective form of pain relief that accelerates lymphatic drainage.\n\n[[LymphaTouch Pro][LymphaTouch Pro]][72]\n[SHOP NOW][73]\n\n**ACCOUNT**\n\n[Getting Started Online][74]\n\n[Login/Register][75]\n\n[Forgot Password][76]\n\n[Track Web Order][77]\n\n**CUSTOMER SUPPORT**\n\n[Live Chat][78]\n\n[How-To Videos][79]\n\n[Support Center & FAQs][80]\n\n[Returns][81]\n\n[Request a Quote][82]\n\n[Contact Customer Service][83]\n\n[Product Recalls][84]\n\n[Equipment Solutions & Repair Services][85]\n\n[Accessibility Statement][86]\n\n**RESOURCES**\n\n[Performance Health Academy][87]\n\n[Articles][88]\n\n[Digital Catalogs][89]\n\n[Online Sale][90]\n\n**COMPANY**\n\n[About Us][91]\n\n[Customer Promise][92]\n\n[What We Sell][93]\n\n[Brands][94]\n\n[Partners][95]\n\n[Career Openings][96]\n\n[News][97]\n\n### Questions? [Ask an Expert][98]\n\n#### Sign Up for Performance Health Updates\n\nBy signing up, you accept the terms of our [Privacy Policy][99]\n\n**Newsletter**\nSign Up for Our Newsletter:\nSubscribe\n[Globe]\n\nAre you visiting PerformanceHealth.com\n\n**from outside of the US?**\n\nVisit your regional site for relevant pricing, promotions, and products.\n\n\u00a9 2026 Performance Health\n\n[Trademarks][100][Privacy Policy][101][Terms & Conditions][102]\n\n[\uf0e1][103]\n\n[1]: https://www.performancehealth.com/\n[2]: https://www.performancehealth.com/checkout/cart/\n[3]: #contentarea\n[4]: https://www.performancehealth.com/customer/account/forgotpassword/\n[5]: javascript:void(0)\n[6]: #\n[7]: https://www.performancehealth.com/contact-customer-service\n[8]: https://support.performancehealth.com/support/home\n[9]: https://www.performancehealth.com/equipment-solutions\n[10]: https://www.performancehealth.com/articles\n[11]: https://www.performancehealth.com/ask-a-clinician\n[12]: https://www.performancehealthacademy.com/\n[13]: https://www.performancehealth.ca/\n[14]: https://www.performancehealth.co.uk/\n[15]: https://www.performancehealth.fr/\n[16]: https://www.performancehealth.au/\n[17]: #\n[18]: https://www.performancehealth.com/our-brands\n[19]: #\n[20]: https://www.performancehealth.com/what-we-sell\n[21]: https://www.performancehealth.com/products/volume-discount-overstock\n[22]: /products/lymphedema-products/padding-foam\n[23]: /products/lymphedema-products/padding-foam\n[24]: /products/lymphedema-products/tape-gauze\n[25]: /products/lymphedema-products/tape-gauze\n[26]: /products/lymphedema-products/arm-hand-compression\n[27]: /products/lymphedema-products/arm-ha