            "text": "The store will not work correctly in the case when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n[Questions? Chat Now]\n[ [Performance Health] [Performance Health] ][1]\n[ My Cart ][2]\n[ Skip to Content ][3]\n* My Account Login / Register\nMy Account\nEmail\nPassword\nLogin\n[Forgot Password?][4]\n[Create an Account][5]\n* [ Support ][6]\n[Contact Us][7]\n[Support Center & FAQs][8]\n[Service & Repair][9]\n[Blog][10]\n[Ask a Clinician][11]\n[Performance Health Academy][12]\n* .\n* [Current Country]\n* US\n* [Canada][13]\n* [UK][14]\n* [France][15]\n* [Australia][16]\n**Search**\nSearch\nSearch\n[Shop By Category][17]\n[Shop By Brand][18][Shop By Brand][19]\n[What We Sell][20]\n[Online Sale][21]\nCreate an Account\n\nFall Prevention\n\nPerformance Health offers a full range of fall prevention products for your facility, enabling the\njourney of independence and rehabilitation.\n\n**Shop by Category**\nDiscover our complete offering of fall prevention products.\n\n[Alarms & Monitors][22]\n\n[[Performance Health | Alarms & Monitors][Performance Health | Alarms & Monitors]][23]\n\n[Bathroom Safety][24]\n\n[[Performance Health | Bathroom Safety][Performance Health | Bathroom Safety]][25]\n\n[Balance Training][26]\n\n[[Performance Health | Balance Training][Performance Health | Balance Training]][27]\n\n[Fall Mats][28]\n\n[[Performance Health | Fall Mats][Performance Health | Fall Mats]][29]\n\n[Gait Belts][30]\n\n[[Performance Health | Gait Belts][Performance Health | Gait Belts]][31]\n\n[Grab Bars & Safety Rails][32]\n\n[[Performance Health | Grab Bars & Safety Rails][Performance Health | Grab Bars & Safety Rails]][33]\n\n[Personal Safety][34]\n\n[[Performance Health | Personal Safety][Performance Health | Personal Safety]][35]\n\n**Fall Prevention Catalog**\n\nWe offer a full range of fall prevention products for your facility, enabling the journey of\nindependence and rehabilitation.\n\n[VIEW THE CATALOG][36]\n[[Fall Prevention Catalog | Together we enable the journey of Independence and performance][Fall\nPrevention Catalog | Together we enable the journey of Independence and performance]][37]\n\n**Popular Fall Prevention Products**\n\n[[Sammons Preston Gait Belts][Sammons Preston Gait Belts]][38]\n\n[Sammons Preston\nGait Belts][39]\n\n[[Homecraft Drop Arm Padded Commode][Homecraft Drop Arm Padded Commode]][40]\n\n[Homecraft Drop Arm Padded Commode][41]\n\n[[M-Rail Bedside Assist][M-Rail Bedside Assist]][42]\n\n[M-Rail\nBedside Assist][43]\n\n[[Sammons Preston Transfer Board with Slots][Sammons Preston Transfer Board with Slots]][44]\n\n[Sammons Preston\nTransfer Board with Slots][45]\n\n[[Skil-Care Tri-Fold Bedside Mat][Skil-Care Tri-Fold Bedside Mat]][46]\n\n[Skil-Care Tri-Fold Bedside Mat][47]\n\n[[Sammons Preston Alarm Monitors][Sammons Preston Alarm Monitors]][48]\n\n[Sammons Preston\nAlarm Monitors][49]\n\n[[THERABAND Stability Trainers][THERABAND Stability Trainers]][50]\n\n[THERABAND Stability Trainers][51]\n\n[[Portable Parallel Bars][Portable Parallel Bars]][52]\n\n[Portable Parallel Bars][53]\n\n**Clinical Articles on Fall Prevention**\n\n[[The Ultimate Fall Prevention Guide: Keeping Seniors Safe][The Ultimate Fall Prevention Guide:\nKeeping Seniors Safe]][54]\n\n[The Ultimate Fall Prevention Guide:\nKeeping Seniors Safe][55]\n\n[[The Best Transfer Aids for Seniors & People with Disabilities][The Best Transfer Aids for Seniors\n& People with Disabilities]][56]\n\n[The Best Transfer Aids for Seniors\n& People with Disabilities][57]\n\n[[5 Simple Exercises for Seniors to Prevent Falls][5 Simple Exercises for Seniors to Prevent\nFalls]][58]\n\n[5 Simple Exercises\nfor Seniors to Prevent Falls][59]\n\n**Top Brands in Fall Prevention**\n\n[[Sammons Preston. Power in Rehabilitation.][Sammons Preston. Power in Rehabilitation.]][60]\n\n[Performance Health Brand][61]\n\n[[Homecraft. Making daily living tasks easier.][Homecraft. Making daily living tasks easier.]][62]\n\n[Performance Health Brand][63]\n\n[[Drive Medical][Drive Medical]][64]\n\n[Industry Partner Brand][65]\n\n[[Stander. Be Independent.][Stander. Be Independent.]][66]\n\n[Industry Partner Brand][67]\n\n[[Invacare][Invacare]][68]\n\n[Industry Partner Brand][69]\n\n[[MTS Medical Supply. Make Your Life Easier.][MTS Medical Supply. Make Your Life Easier.]][70]\n\n[Industry Partner Brand][71]\n\n[[Skil-Care][Skil-Care]][72]\n\n[Industry Partner Brand][73]\n\n[[Chattanooga][Chattanooga]][74]\n\n[Industry Partner Brand][75]\n\n**TAKE ACTION NOW!**\n\n**The SAFE Act****\nStopping Addiction & Falls for the Elderly**\nLandmark legislation with the potential to save lives, prevent injuries, and reduce healthcare\nspending.\n\n[GET STARTED][76]\n[[The SAFE Act Stopping Addiction & Falls for the Elderly Landmark legislation with the potential to\nsave lives, prevent injuries, and reduce healthcare spending.][The SAFE Act Stopping Addiction &\nFalls for the Elderly Landmark legislation with the potential to save lives, prevent injuries, and\nreduce healthcare spending.]][77]\n\n**ACCOUNT**\n\n[Getting Started Online][78]\n\n[Login/Register][79]\n\n[Forgot Password][80]\n\n[Track Web Order][81]\n\n**CUSTOMER SUPPORT**\n\n[Live Chat][82]\n\n[How-To Videos][83]\n\n[Support Center & FAQs][84]\n\n[Returns][85]\n\n[Request a Quote][86]\n\n[Contact Customer Service][87]\n\n[Product Recalls][88]\n\n[Equipment Solutions & Repair Services][89]\n\n[Accessibility Statement][90]\n\n**RESOURCES**\n\n[Performance Health Academy][91]\n\n[Articles][92]\n\n[Digital Catalogs][93]\n\n[Online Sale][94]\n\n**COMPANY**\n\n[About Us][95]\n\n[Customer Promise][96]\n\n[What We Sell][97]\n\n[Brands][98]\n\n[Partners][99]\n\n[Career Openings][100]\n\n[News][101]\n\n### Questions? [Ask an Expert][102]\n\n#### Sign Up for Performance Health Updates\n\nBy signing up, you accept the terms of our [Privacy Policy][103]\n\n**Newsle