      "polished_summary": "Performance Health is a leading provider of rehabilitation, wellness, and fitness products and services, dedicated to enhancing health and performance across various sectors. The company offers a diverse range of products, including safety solutions, daily living aids, therapeutic equipment, and orthopedic supplies, primarily targeting healthcare facilities, rehabilitation centers, and individuals with mobility challenges. With a commitment to improving patient outcomes, Performance Health serves industries such as healthcare, physical therapy, and wellness.",
