      "company_summary": "Sofrigam specializes in temperature-controlled packaging solutions, offering a wide range of passive and active cold chain products designed to maintain optimal conditions for sensitive goods during transport. Their product lineup includes insulated shipping boxes, coolers, and temperature recorders, catering to industries such as pharmaceuticals, biotechnology, and food logistics. With a commitment to customer support, Sofrigam ensures tailored solutions to meet specific temperature management needs.",
