ventures to the next level with the Techni Ice Signature Hybrid Premium Ice\nBox, now with wheels! This 35L track and airline-friendly powerhouse is your perfect companion for\nany outdoor escapade, from sunny beach days to rugged bush treks. Its metal telescopic handle and\nheavy-duty stainless steel axle, wheels, and stainless steel lock nuts ensure you can easily bring\nthe party anywhere \u2013 be it a campsite, a beach party, an outdoor festival, a BBQ, or a day on the\nboat.\n\nDesigned with the Australian love for the great outdoors in mind, this cooler boasts a robust,\neco-friendly roto-moulded LLDPE construction and is packed with extra-thick polyurethane foam\ninsulation injected under high pressure to ensure long ice-keeping performanceThe result? Your\ndrinks and snacks stay refreshingly cold for longer. An airtight lid gasket, interlocking latches,\nand an integrated hinge system enhance its durability and cooling efficiency, while the built-in\nstainless steel bottle openers are just the cherry on top for your outdoor gatherings.\n\nNot just a cooler, it's a versatile outdoor accessory. The recessed sides make for easy lifting,\nand in addition to being able to wheel it like a travel bag and the Plus, doubling as a non-slip\nseat, a practical tabletop complete with 25cm-deep cup holders, or a handy cutting board, it's the\nultimate tool for any outdoor enthusiast.\n\n**Key Features:**\nEspecially developed light-colored UV-treated Exteriors like light blue and white reflect heat,\nensuring much longer ice-keeping than dark heat absorbing. Colours like dark grey and orange, etc\nwhich heat up, reduce ice retention.\n\n\u2022 Roto-moulded technology for unmatched durability\n\n\u2022 High-pressure-injected premium closed-cell PU foam compound for superior insulation\n\n\u2022 35 litres of storage capacity \u2013 enough for all your favourites\n\n\u2022 Convenient, easy-lift recessed sides\n\n\u2022 Dual built-in bottle openers for your convenience\n\n\u2022 No-condensation design, keeping it dry on the outside\n\n\u2022 Quick-drain water release valve for easy maintenance\n\n\u2022 EXCLUSIVE 4-year Warranty for peace of mind\n\nReady for an upgrade? Grab the Techni Ice 35L cooler and let the good times roll, wherever your\nAussie spirit takes you!\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 4 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n75%\n(3)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n25%\n(1)\nSilas Lee\n**The Ice Box I\u2019ve always dreamed of owning**\n\nHave just received and unboxed this. It looks very well constructed and I\u2019m very much looking\nforward to using it for the first time.\n\nCustomer service was amazing and they were very kind to give me an additional six dry ice packs\nfor a discounted price.\n\nMia\n****\n\nIt works great. Perfect for what I want. Cooled things down really quickly. Very happy with my\npurchase\n\nTerry SEAY\n**Misleading Advertising?**\n\nIt appears that the advertised internal dimensions are incorrect in respect of width. I emailed\nTechni Ice on 18 January asking for their feedback. To date I have not been given the courtesy of\na reply.\n\nJo-Anne Cooper\n**Techni Ice excellent AusPost atrocious**\n\n14 days since purchase. Still sitting in AusPost processing facility. Given up on it being a\nBirthday present, Christmas present maybe. Gives AusPost 5 months to deliver. I wonder?\n[Techni Ice Signature Hybrid Premium Ice Box 35L White with Wheels & Telescopic Travel Handle *FREE\n6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hybrid\nPremium Ice Box 35L White with Wheels & Telescopic Travel Handle *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS\nVALUES $37 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hybrid Premium Ice Box 35L White\nwith Wheels & Telescopic Travel Handle *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR\nJULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hybrid Premium Ice Box 35L White with Wheels & Telescopic\nTravel Handle *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES