336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336$\u03368\u03369\u0336.\u03369\u03365\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $69.95\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\nQuantity Decrease quantity for Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Black\nStainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock just arrived Increase quantity for Techni Ice 950ml\n(32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Black Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock just\narrived\nProduct variants\nDefault Title - $69.95\nI want to send this as a gift\n\n## Please adjust the following:\n\nRecipient email Recipient email (optional)\nRecipient name (optional)\nMessage (optional)\n200 characters max\nSend on (optional)\nAdd to cart\n[ Find In Store ][81]\n[ View full details ][82]\nEasy Returns\n3 Year Warranty\n* [Description][83]\n* [Reviews][84]\n* The new Techni Ice stainless steel dog bowls have been developed to outperform all existing dog\nbowls on the market. Backed by over 3 decades of thermal product development and a very long\nhistory of caring for and supporting all kinds of domestic and farm animals, you owe it to\nyourself to treat your pet to a Techni Ice dog bowl.\n\nThe thermal ability of these sturdy food and water bowls to keep your dogs water and food cool or\nwarm is second to none. Available in several sizes, they include deep bowls that hold a full day\nof water kept nice and cold or are great for enthusiastic eaters that normally get more food on\nthe floor than in the bowl.\n\nThese are bowls that don\u2019t slide all over the place and stay put. They are seriously Techni\nIce tough for adventurous families and pets. The best part is that they are 18/8 stainless steel,\ncan be washed with a hose or go into the dishwasher, and are fitted with a Pegrip non-slip ring\nembedded into the base of the bowl. Now that is tough!\n\nTechni Ice overengineered, not overpriced.\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 2 reviews\n[Write a review][85]\n100%\n(2)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nDarren OBrien\n**Dog bowl combo**\n\nExtremely happy with the products and the water stays cooler for my dog\n\nRobyn Lieb\n**Techni ice bowls**\n\nthese bowls are excellent, easy to clean and keeps the water at a nice temperature\n[Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Black Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty\n*fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Black\nStainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64\noz.) Dog Bowl Combo Black Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice\n950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Black Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock\njust arrived]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][86]\n* [ Facebook ][87]\n* [ Instagram ][88]\n* [ YouTube ][89]\nInformation\n* [ Contact Us ][90]\n* [ About Us ][91]\n* [ Warranty Information ][92]\n* [ Delivery Policy ][93]\n* [ Returns & Refunds Policy ][94]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][95]\n* [ Terms of Use Policy ][96]\n* [ Zippay ][97]\n* [ Site Map ][98]\nMy Account\n* [ My Account ][99]\n* [ Checkout ][100]\nContact Us\n\n**Phone Number:**\n[03 9783 1922][101]\n\n**Email:**\n[support@techniice.com][102]\n\n**Address:**\n13 Tooyal St, Frankston VIC 3199, Australia\n\nPayment methods\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Union Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\u00a9 2026, [Techni Ice][103] Global National Australia Pty Ltd. Melbourne Australia | ABN:22 006 310\n989\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n[x][104]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n[\u00d7][105]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/all\n[3]: /account/login\n[4]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[5]: /a/store-locator/li