gineered, not overpriced.\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 1 review\n[Write a review][85]\n100%\n(1)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nDebra\n**Whitton - Dog Bowl**\n\nVery good quality, currently used for water. 1920ml is a decent size for this purpose. Robust and\nso easy to clean.\n[Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty\n*fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Emerald\nStainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64\noz.) Dog Bowl Combo Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice\n950ml (32 oz.) + 1920ml (64 oz.) Dog Bowl Combo Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty *fresh\nstock just arrived]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][86]\n* [ Facebook ][87]\n* [ Instagram ][88]\n* [ YouTube ][89]\nInformation\n* [ Contact Us ][90]\n* [ About Us ][91]\n* [ Warranty Information ][92]\n* [ Delivery Policy ][93]\n* [ Returns & Refunds Policy ][94]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][95]\n* [ Terms of Use Policy ][96]\n* [ Zippay ][97]\n* [ Site Map ][98]\nMy Account\n* [ My Account ][99]\n* [ Checkout ][100]\nContact Us\n\n**Phone Number:**\n[03 9783 1922][101]\n\n**Email:**\n[support@techniice.com][102]\n\n**Address:**\n13 Tooyal St, Frankston VIC 3199, Australia\n\nPayment methods\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Union Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\u00a9 2026, [Techni Ice][103] Global National Australia Pty Ltd. Melbourne Australia | ABN:22 006 310\n989\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n[x][104]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n[\u00d7][105]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/all\n[3]: /account/login\n[4]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[5]: /a/store-locator/list\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[8]: /coll