 Packs]\nDry Ice Packs\n][53]\n* [[Dry Ice Packs]\nReusable Ice Pack\n][54]\n* [[Dry Ice Packs]\nDisposable Ice Packs\n][55]\n* [[Cooler Bags]\nCooler Bags\n][56]\n* [[Cooler Bags]\nTechni Ice\u2122 High Performance Cooler Bags\n][57]\n* [[Cooler Bags]\nESKY\u2122\n][58]\n* [[Combo Deals]\nCombo Deals\n][59]\n* [[Camping Gear]\nCamping Gear\n][60]\n* [\nSwags\n][61]\n* [\nRatchets\n][62]\n* [\nFishing Rod Holders\n][63]\n* [[Caravan Gear]\nCaravan Gear\n][64]\n* [[Tool boxes]\nTool boxes\n][65]\n* [[Outdoor Doormats]\nOutdoor Doormats\n][66]\n* New\n* [[New | Tumbler & Drinkware]\nNew | Tumbler & Drinkware\n][67]\n* [[New | Dog Bowls]\nNew | Dog Bowls\n][68]\n* [ Gallery ][69]\n* [ Custom Branding ][70]\n[[Techni Ice] ][71]\nSearch\n[ Cart][72][ Log in ][73]\n* Customer Support\n* [FAQ][74]\n* [Register][75]\n* [Contact Us][76]\n* [ Find A Store ][77]\n* Company\n* [About Us][78]\n[ Skip to product information ][79]\n* Open media 1 in modal\n1 / of 1\n\nTechni Ice\n\n# Techni Ice 1200ml (40 oz.) Tumbler Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty + 3 Techni Ice\n# Reusable Dry Ice Packs *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED\n\nTechni Ice 1200ml (40 oz.) Tumbler Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty + 3 Techni Ice Reusable\nDry Ice Packs *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED\n][80]\n1 review\nRegular price $55.00\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336$\u03366\u03365\u0336.\u03360\u03360\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $55.00\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\nQuantity Decrease quantity for Techni Ice 1200ml (40 oz.) Tumbler Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years\nWarranty + 3 Techni Ice Reusable Dry Ice Packs *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED Increase quantity for\nTechni Ice 1200ml (40 oz.) Tumbler Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty + 3 Techni Ice Reusable\nDry Ice Packs *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED\nProduct variants\nDefault Title - $55.00\nI want to send this as a gift\n\n## Please adjust the following:\n\nRecipient email Recipient email (optional)\nRecipient name (optional)\nMessage (optional)\n200 characters max\nSend on (optional)\nAdd to cart\n[ Find In Store ][81]\n[ View full details ][82]\nEasy Returns\n6 Year Warranty\n* [Description][83]\n* [Reviews][84]\n* YOUR BEVERAGE ON THE MOVE. PERFECTLY SIZED FOR MOST CAR HOLDERS.\n\nThe Techni Ice 40 oz. / 1200ml tumbler is your reliable companion throughout the day. Keep your\nmorning coffee piping hot or your iced beverage refreshingly cold \u2014 there's no rush. Crafted\nwith 18/8 stainless steel and featuring dual-wall vacuum insulation, this tumbler is designed to\nsafeguard your drink under any circumstances. Just like the entire Drinkware Family, the 40 oz. /\n1200ml Tumbler and Lid are dishwasher-safe for effortless cleaning.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n\u2022 18/8 stainless steel\n\n\u2022 Overengineered not overpriced\n\n\u2022 Dual wall vacuum insulation for longest hot and cold temperature retention\n\n\u2022 Leak resistant design\n\n\u2022 Dishwasher compatible\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 1 review\n[Write a review][85]\n(0)\n100%\n(1)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nStefan Kamoda\n**Tumbler 1200ml**\n\nI have one small problem with this tumbler is that you can\u2019t take it travelling as it is not\nsealable otherwise it is very good in keeping water cold for a long time. I have not used the ice\npacks as yet so can\u2019t comment. ps do you have a sealable lid for this\n[Techni Ice 1200ml (40 oz.) Tumbler Emerald Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty + 3 Techni Ice Reusable\nDry Ice Packs *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][86]\n* [ Facebook ][87]\n* [ Instagram ][88]\n* [ YouTube ][89]\nInformation\n* [ Contact Us ][90]\n* [ About Us ][91]\n* [ Warranty Information ][92]\n* [ Delivery Policy ][93]\n* [ Returns & Refunds Policy ][94]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][95]\n* [ Terms of Use Policy ][96]\n* [ Zippay ][97]\n* [ Site Map ][98]\nMy Account\n* [ My Account ][99]\n* [ Checkout ][100]\nContact Us\n\n**Phone Number:**\n[03 9783 1922][101]\n\n**Email:**\n[support@techniice.com][102]\n\n**Address:**\n13 Tooyal St, Frankston VIC 3199, Australia\n\nPayment methods\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Union Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\u00a9 2026, [Techni Ice][103] Global National Australia Pty Ltd. Melbourne Australia | ABN:22 006 310\n989\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n[x][104]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n[\u00d7][105]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/all\n[3]: /account/login\n[4]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[5]: /a/store-locator/list\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[8]: /collections/dog-bowls\n[9]: /collections/techni-ice-classic\n[10]: /collections/techni-ice-signature\n[11]: https://techniice.com/collections/wheeled-ice-boxes\n[12]: /collections/travel-ice-boxes\n[13]: /collections/techni-ice-compact\n[14]: /collections/commercial-ice-box\n[15]: /collections/techni-ice-chilly-chest\n[16]: /collections/food-carriers\n[17]: /collections/live-bait-boxes\n[18]: /collections/ice-box-spare-parts\n[19]: /collections/reusable-dry-ice-packs\n[20]: /collections/disposable-ice-packs\n[21]: /collections/techni-ice-cooler-bags\n[22]: /collections/esky-cooler-bags\n[23]: /collections/combo-deals\n[24]: /collections/swags\n[25]: /collections/rope-ratchets\n[26]: /collections/single-rod-holders\n[27]: /collections/caravan-equipment\n[28]: /collections/tool-boxes\n[29]: /collections/outdoor-doormats\n[30]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[31]: /collections/dog-bowls\n[32]: /pages/gallery\n[33]: /pages/copy-of-custom-branding\n[34]: /account/login\n[35]: https://twitter.com/techni_ice\n[36]: https://www.facebook.com/Tech