cks *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED\nProduct variants\nDefault Title - $45.00\nI want to send this as a gift\n\n## Please adjust the following:\n\nRecipient email Recipient email (optional)\nRecipient name (optional)\nMessage (optional)\n200 characters max\nSend on (optional)\nAdd to cart\n[ Find In Store ][81]\n[ View full details ][82]\nEasy Returns\n6 Year Warranty\n* [Description][83]\n* [Reviews][84]\n* YOUR BEVERAGE ON THE MOVE. PERFECTLY SIZED FOR MOST CAR HOLDERS.\n\nThe Techni Ice 30 oz. / 900ml tumbler is your reliable companion throughout the day. Keep your\nmorning coffee piping hot or your iced beverage refreshingly cold \u2014 there's no rush. Crafted\nwith 18/8 stainless steel and featuring dual-wall vacuum insulation, this tumbler is designed to\nsafeguard your drink under any circumstances. Just like the entire Drinkware Family, the 30 oz. /\n900ml Tumbler and Lid are dishwasher-safe for effortless cleaning.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n\u2022 18/8 stainless steel\n\n\u2022 Overengineered not overpriced\n\n\u2022 Dual wall vacuum insulation for longest hot and cold temperature retention\n\n\u2022 Leak resistant design\n\n\u2022 Dishwasher compatible\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBe the first to write a review\n[Write a review][85]\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n[Techni Ice 900ml (30 oz.) Tumbler Aqua Stainless Steel 6 Years Warranty + 3 Techni Ice Reusable Dry\nIce Packs *FRESH STOCK JUST ARRIVED]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][86]\n* [ Facebook ][87]\n* [ Instagram ][88]\n* [ YouTube ][89]\nInformation\n* [ Contact Us ][90]\n* [ About Us ][91]\n* [ Warranty Information ][92]\n* [ Delivery Policy ][93]\n* [ Returns & Refunds Policy ][94]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][95]\n* [ Terms of Use Policy ][96]\n* [ Zippay ][97]\n* [ Site Map ][98]\nMy Account\n* [ My Account ][99]\n* [ Checkout ][100]\nContact Us\n\n**Phone Number:**\n[03 9783 1922][101]\n\n**Email:**\n[support@techniice.com][102]\n\n**Address:**\n13 T