00\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal Dimensions (W x L x H) \u250228 x 57 x 32 cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u250213 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOuter Casing \u2502High density polyethylene\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInsulation Density \u2502High pressure injected Multi compound closed cell PU\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**TECHNI ICE CLASSIC HARDCORE SERIES**\n\n\u2022 Rope handles \u2013 save bending over\n\n\u2022 Unique Quad-Latch system\n\n\u2022 Stainless steel latches plus latest super resilient silicone meul rubberized pull downs for\nincreased performance and lid stability\n\n\u2022 Recessed fridge seal\n\n\u2022 Weight bearing construction\n\n\u2022 Divider and basket compatible (sliding basket available at extra cost)\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 7 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n86%\n(6)\n14%\n(1)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nJudy Munday\n****\n\nEsky was for my son and he loves it . Delivery time was a bit long .\n\nEdwina Bidwell\n**55l Esky with reusable dry ice packs**\n\nAbsolutely amazing experience with Techni Ice! We purchased the 55L esky, which also came with\nfree reusable dry ice packs \u2014 such a great bonus. Customer service was outstanding with excellent\ncommunication and regular updates throughout the process. Delivery was incredibly fast, even\nduring the extremely busy Christmas period. The esky itself is top quality and my son absolutely\nloved it. We will definitely be purchasing from Techni Ice again. Thank you so much!\n\nShaun Harker\n**Don\u2019t overthink it! It\u2019s a box to keep stuff cold, it just works.**\n\nThis is every bit as good as Yeti (which a mate had on the same trip) and with the change I had\ncompared to his I filled it with rum and beers and paid for the fuel!!!!\nUsing only the techni ice dry ice packs that I rotated through the engel it was great in the boot\nof the car.The size is big enough to be useful and small enough to carry and throw in the\nboot/tray of the car.I really like the design of the handles as you can tie down from the top lip\ninstead of the handle itself.\nI think ice is great for short trips or bbq, s etc but heavy compared to the ice packs.Very happy,\nthanks.\n\nAnthony\n****\n\nAmazing esky. Would recommend.\n\nLizzy Marsh\n**Great service**\n\nI reckon Techni Ice know how to run a business! Just sayin' keep up the good work !!!\n\n[Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR\nJULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66\n*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE\nPACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12\nREUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L\nWhite *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore\nIce Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\n[Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR\nJULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66\n*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Ice Box 55L White *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE\nPACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][89]\n* [ Facebook ][90]\n* [ Instagram ][91]\n* [ YouTube ][92]\nInformation\n* [ Contact Us ][93]\n* [ About Us ][94]\n* [ Warranty Information ][95]\n* [ Delivery Policy ][96]\n* [ Returns & Refunds Policy ][97]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][98]\n* [ Terms of Use Policy ][99]\n* [ Zippay ][100]\n* [ Site Map ][101]\nMy Account\n* [ My Account ][102]\n* [ Checkout ][103]\nContact Us\n\n**Phone Number:**\n[03 9783 1922][104]\n\n**Email:**\n[support@techniice.com][105]\n\n**Address:**\n13 Tooyal St, Frankston VIC 3199, Australia\n\nPayment methods\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Union Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\u00a9 2026, [Techni Ice][106] Global National Australia Pty Ltd. Melbourne Australia | ABN:22 006 310\n989\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n[x][107]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n[\u00d7][108]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/all\n[3]: /account/login\n[4]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[5]: /a/store-locator/list\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[8]: /collections/dog-bowls\n[9]: /collections/techni-ice-classic\n[10]: /collections/techni-ice-signature\n[11]: https://techniice.com/collections/wheeled-ice-boxes\n[12]: /collections/travel-ice-boxes\n[13]: /collections/techni-ice-compact\n[14]: /collections/commercial-ice-box\n[15]: /collections/techni-ice-chilly-chest\n[16]: /collections/food-carriers\n[17]: /collections/live-bait-boxes\n[18]: /collections/ice-box-spare-parts\n[19]: /collections/reusable-dry-ice-packs\n[20]: /collections/disposable-ice-packs\n[21]: /collections/techni-ice-cooler-bags\n[22]: /collections/esky-cooler-bags\n[23]: /collections/combo-deals\n[24]: /collections/swags\n[25]: /collections/rope-ratchets\n[26]: /collections/single-rod-holders\n[27]: /collections/caravan-equipment\n[28]: /collections/tool-boxes\n[29]: /collections/outdoor-doormats\n[30]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[31]: /collections/dog-bowls\n[32]: /pages/gallery\n[33]: /pages/copy-of-custom-branding\n[34]: /account/login\n[35]: https://twitter.com/techni_ice\n[36]: https://www.facebook.com/TechniIceOfficial/\n[37]: https://www.instagram.com/techniice_au/\n[38]: https://www.youtube.com/@Tehniiceworld\n[39]: /\n[40]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[41]: /collections/dog-bowls\n[42]: /collections/ice-boxes\n[43]: /collections/techni-ice-classic\n[44]: /collections/techni-ice-signature\n[45]: https://techniice.com/collections/wheeled-ice-boxes\n[46]: /collections/travel-ice-boxes\n[47]: /collections/techn