g\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOuter Casing \u2502High density polyethylene\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInsulation Density \u2502High pressure injected Multi compound closed cell PU\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n******TECHNI ICE CLASSIC HYBRID SERIES **\n\n\u2022 Rope handles \u2013 save bending over\n\n\u2022 Latest super resilient silicone meul rubberized pull downs\n\n\u2022 Recessed fridge seal\n\n\u2022 Weight bearing construction\n\n\u2022 Divider and basket compatible (sliding basket available at extra cost)\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 7 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n43%\n(3)\n29%\n(2)\n(0)\n14%\n(1)\n14%\n(1)\nAndrew Kunze\n**Slimy dry packs**\n\nIs there a way to stop the ice trays from getting slimy? After a day in the esky they made\neverything slimy.\n\nSimon Rose\n**Brilliant product!!**\n\nThis is a brilliant Australian Ice Box!!\nQuality made product and super fast delivery at half the price of foreign competitors how could\nyou go wrong!\n\nWilliam Shepherd\n**Warehouse needs more training**\n\nAt first I wasn\u2019t sent out the right ice box contacted customer service and was told someone would\npick up the ice box and then they would send the right one out plus an extra tumbler for one\ntrouble, waited all day for the person to be a no show, contacted them again told they would come\nout again the next day, they finally took the ice box had to wait even longer for the right one to\nbe sent out got it but no Tumbler, contact them again to let them know, after another 2 days got\ntumbler\n\nDonald Cheong\n**Great esky as always!**\n\nReceived my 25L classic hybrid esky and used it already\u2026 performed exceptionally even for a small\nesky. Met my expectations following many years of using my 70L signature classic.\n\nDelivery was delayed, which was unfortunately the case with my 70L\n\nLyn\n****\n\nPerfect size for my needs.\n\n[Techniice Classic Hybrid Ice box 25L Light Blue *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37\n*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techniice Classic Hybrid Ice box 25L Light Blue *FREE 6 REUSABLE\nDRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techniice Classic Hybrid Ice box 25L\nLight Blue *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techniice\nClassic Hybrid Ice box 25L Light Blue *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR\nJULY DISPATCH]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][89]\n* [ Facebook ][90]\n* [ Instagram ][91]\n* [ YouTu