0\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal Dimensions (W x L x H) \u250257 x 30 x 33 cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal Wheel Arches \u2502Allow for the wheel arch thickness on the base\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u250215 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOuter Casing \u2502High density polyethylene\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInsulation Density \u2502High pressure injected Multi compound closed cell PU\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\nGet ready for your next Aussie adventure with Techni Ice's 55L cooler, offering a generous\n55-litre capacity. Perfectly designed for the Australian love of the outdoors, whether you're\nheading for a beach BBQ, a fishing trip, or a bush camp, this cooler won't let you down. Its\ntaller design makes accessing your cold drinks and food a breeze. Crafted with eco-conscious,\ndurable roto-moulded LLDPE polyethylene, and extra-thick walls injected under pressure with\npremium closed-cell polyurethane compound foam insulation to keep your supplies chilled for\nextended periods\n\nThis cooler is not only robust but also user-friendly. Equipped with heavy-duty wheels with\nmarine-grade stainless steel axles and locknuts, nylon-rope handles, interlocking latches, and a\ncollapsible pull handle, it ensures effortless transport over any terrain. The design incorporates\nrecessed side handles and elevated durable nylon rope handles to help save your back for easy\nlifting and an indented front for simple lid opening,even with your hands full. But it's more than\njust a cooler; it also serves as a non-slip bench, tabletop, or cutting board, making it a\nversatile outdoor companion for a lifetime of adventures and not too big to fit into the boot of\nmost sedans or small SUVs.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n\u2022 60mm thick wall\n\n\u2022 Roto-moulded technology for rugged durability\n\n\u2022 Superior insulation with pressure-injected PU foam in walls and lids\n\n\u2022 Airtight lid gasket to maintain cool temperatures\n\n\u2022 Capacity to hold up to 74 regular cans\n\n\u2022 Heavy-duty wheels and rubber feet\n\n\u2022 Dual built-in stainless steel bottle openers\n\n\u2022 Quick-drain water release valve for easy maintenance\n\n\u2022 Rope handles: save bending over\n\n\u2022 Unique Quad-Latch system\n\n\u2022 Stainless steel latches plus latest super resilient silicone meul rubberized pull-downs for\nincreased performance and lid stability\n\n\u2022 Recessed fridge seal\n\n\u2022 Weight-bearing construction\n\n\u2022 Built-in Pad lock options and bottle opener\n\n\u2022 10-year peace of mind Techni Ice Warranty\n\n\u2022 Divider and basket compatible (sliding basket available at extra cost)\n\nGear up with Techni Ice and make your next outdoor excursion a memorable one!\n\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 3 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n100%\n(3)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nAmanda Jewell\n**Brilliant Icebox**\n\nIt's fantastic and works well.\n\nMatt B\n**Great experience**\n\nSolid construction, easily mobile with the wheels and keeps ice cold for days. Similar to other\nbrands with a better price tag. Very happy with the purchase\n\nHans Braaksma\n**Excellent Product; Excellent Company**\n\nWe went with Techniice in part because it came up very well in the recent Choice review. The\nproduct met our needs, the online reviews were excellent, it's an Australian company and many\nreviewers commented on the great support.\nLiving in a regional area, we were not able to see the product we ordered in person but had a very\ngood look at many other cooler brands, including some that were (very) significantly more\nexpensive for a similar product.\nIt was delivered in a few days and the cooler did not disappoint. It is made in Australia by an\nAustralian company, very solidly constructed (4 closures!!), the surfaces are smooth (meaning it\nis so much easier to keep clean).\nI did wonder about environmental impacts, and there is some interesting reading on their website.\nWe have had to throw out a number of other coolers over many years of camping because spare parts\nwere not available in Australia. There is feedback on the websites of competing products\nsuggesting that support for their products is not what it should be in Australia. Techniice lists\nmany spare parts on their website, which are obviously readily available - no need to throw put\nyet another cooler.\nUnfortunately our order was not complete - we ordered the basket and divider, which were not\nincluded. We wrote to the company which responded relatively quickly, They were very apologetic\nand immediately organised to send us the missing items, including a very nice bonus! We can report\nthat support is second to none!! We would highly recommend their products.\n[Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L White with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS\nVALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L\nWhite with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\n[Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L White with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS\nVALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L\nWhite with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\n[Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L White with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS\nVALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L\nWhite with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\n[Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L White with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS\nVALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Hardcore Premium Ice Box 55L\nWhite with Wheels *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66 *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][89"
