\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal Dimensions (W x L x H) \u250228 x 57 x 32 cm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWeight \u250213 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOuter Casing \u2502High density polyethylene\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInsulation Density \u2502High pressure injected Multi compound closed cell PU\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**TECHNI ICE CLASSIC HARDCORE SERIES**\n\n\u2022 Rope handles \u2013 save bending over\n\n\u2022 Unique Quad-Latch system\n\n\u2022 Stainless steel latches plus latest super resilient silicone meul rubberized pull downs for\nincreased performance and lid stability\n\n\u2022 Recessed fridge seal\n\n\u2022 Weight bearing construction\n\n\u2022 Divider and basket compatible (sliding basket available at extra cost)\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 2 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n100%\n(2)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nRussell O'Farrell\n****\n\nI love my 55 litre techni ice Esky. It's strong and so well built. The lid seals very well. I am a\nkeen fishermen and spend up to a week on the water. My beer is still cold when I get home. Food\nand fish and crabs are kept fresh. I haven't used the tech ice sheets yet . I did have to wait a\nlong time for Esky to arrive and was starting to worry a bit. But I suppose you folks would have\nbeen busy with Christmas orders. Thank you.\n\nGareth Parker\n**Excellent Product**\n\nI purchased the 55l Classic Hardcore Icebox and I am extremely satisfied with the product. It is\nvery well made and looks like it could last a lifetime. We went camping in hot weather and the ice\nbox along with the Techni Ice reusable ice blocks performed really well.\nThe delivery was also really quick too.\n[Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR\nJULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES\n$66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY\nICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE\n12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L\nLight Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic\nHardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY\nDISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES\n$66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE 12 REUSABLE DRY\nICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Classic Hardcore Icebox 55L Light Blue *FREE\n12 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $66*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH]\nSign Me Up\n\nBe the first to know about new products, films, and events.\n\nEmail\n* [ Twitter ][89]\n* [ Facebook ][90]\n* [ Instagram ][91]\n* [ YouTube ][92]\nInformation\n* [ Contact Us ][93]\n* [ About Us ][94]\n* [ Warranty Information ][95]\n* [ Delivery Policy ][96]\n* [ Returns & Refunds Policy ][97]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][98]\n* [ Terms of Use Policy ][99]\n* [ Zippay ][100]\n* [ Site Map ][101]\nMy Account\n* [ My Account ][102]\n* [ Checkout ][103]\nContact Us\n\n**Phone Number:**\n[03 9783 1922][104]\n\n**Email:**\n[support@techniice.com][105]\n\n**Address:**\n13 Tooyal St, Frankston VIC 3199, Australia\n\nPayment methods\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Union Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\u00a9 2026, [Techni Ice][106] Global National Australia Pty Ltd. Melbourne Australia | ABN:22 006 310\n989\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n[x][107]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n[\u00d7][108]\n[storeify-storelocator]\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/all\n[3]: /account/login\n[4]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[5]: /a/store-locator/list\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/drinkware-tumbler\n[8]: /collections/dog-bowls\n[9]: /collections/techni-ice-classic\n[10]: /collections/techni-ice-si