me (optional)\nMessage (optional)\n200 characters max\nSend on (optional)\nAdd to cart\n[ Find In Store ][81]\n\n## Check Out These Independant Comparison Reviews:\n* [\"Best insulation on the planet\" - Best Cooler.com][82]\n* [\"Their ice life is simply unparalleled\" - The Cooler Zone.com][83]\n* [\"Actually holds ice better when compared\" - Coolers On Sale.com][84]\n\n[ View full details ][85]\nEasy Returns\n10 Year Warranty\n* [Description][86]\n* [Reviews][87]\n* \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSize \u25027L\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nExternal Dimensions\u250232.5 x 31.5 x 32 cm (W x L x H)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal Dimensions\u250219 x 19 x 25 cm (W x L x H)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\nTechni Ice 7L Drink Dispenser / Cooler\n****\n\nA really handy companion holds 7L of icy cold drinks or water throughout the day\n\n**Material:** Rotomolded polyethylene LLDPE\n**Process:** Disposable rotational molding process\n**Cold holding temperature:** -20\u2103 \uff5e +8\u2103\n**Cold storage time:** Over 60-80 hours\n\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 2 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n50%\n(1)\n50%\n(1)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nMichael Surman\n****\n\nLove the 7L bucket jug\n\nRodney\n****\n\nThe ice test is questionable as I first simply added ice into the cooler. This only lasted 48\nhours.\n\nNow with the cooler temperature inside the cooler I added ice to the chilly water.\n\nTest on going.\n[Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock\njust arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES\n$37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY\nICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE\n6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink\nDispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L\nClassic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived]\n[Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock\njust arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES\n$37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY\nICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE\n6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink\nDispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived] [Techni Ice 7L\nClassic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY ICE PACKS VALUES $37 *Fresh stock just arrived]\n[Techni Ice 7L Classic Drink Dispenser Cooler *FREE 6 REUSABLE DRY