2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHandles \u25021000 Kilo Rated Recessed Into Box For Tight Spaces and Extend Above The Box\n\u2502To Minimize Back Strain When Lifting\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWarranty \u2502Lifetime Warranty To Original Purchaser\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## **Never before has the world seen an Ice Box like this!!**\n\n****\n\n**CONSTRUCTION**\n\nThis model has 74mm walls (**Yes you Read it Right !! 74 mm Walls) **that is more than twice as\nthick as most polyethylene ice boxes, and much thicker than fiberglass ice boxes.\n\nThe huge lid and walls are injected under extreme pressure with highest quality **high density\nmulti compound PU insulation**.\n\nTwin padlock facility is also available for security.\n\n**Bung**\n\nThe bung is a huge **50mm diameter** (about the size of a tow ball). This allows the box to be\nemptied quickly when leaving a camp site especially as there could be still many large chunks of\nice left after weeks of camping that can be emptied through this bung.\n\n**Hinges**\n\nThis box incorporates a fully moulded and **integrated hinge system** designed to last for a life\ntime even in commercial applications.\n\n**Seals**\n\n**Dual Air Lock Seal System** comprises one EVAS Seal plus a Fridge Gasket Seal. This system\nprovides a perfect seal at virtually all ambient temperatures.\n\n**Air Circulation**\n\n4 sturdy feet are provided that allow **360 degree air circulation **that provides a cool thermal\nair barrier under and around the box so the box can be put on hot metal Ute trays, trailers or hot\nground surfaces without effecting the performance of the box through rising heat under the box.\n\n**Handles**\n\nDual Handles, Heavy duty reinforced nylon handles with comfortable hand grips plus comfortable\nrecessed carry ledge handles in the top body of the box.\n\n**Tie Down Points**\n\nTie down points are provided via the rope handles or the integrated points on the base of the box.\n\n**Fish Ruler**\n\nIntegrated ruler on the top of the lid.\n\n**Basket**\n\nThe Signature Series is basket and divider compatible.\n\n**Summary **\n\nIf you are in the market for the best ice box with outstanding ice keeping ability and structural\nstrength this is the best there is. In nearly 30 years in this industry we have never seen\nanything in the world that comes close to this. Our new model is a True No. 1.** **\n\n******White colour Ice Boxes keep ice up to 20% longer than coloured ones due to their ability to\nreflect more heat.**\n\n**Did you know?**\n\nTechni ice is the actual brand used by Department of Defense, CFA, SES, Police, Ambulance, Qantas,\nAir France, KLM, Dept. of Primary industries, Royal Flying Doctor Service, McDonalds, Australian\nNavy, Air Force, Coles and thousands of other companies and government departments worldwide that\nrequire the highest level of cold chain performance and reliability.\n\n* ## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 3 reviews\n[Write a review][88]\n100%\n(3)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\n(0)\nRick Jessen\n**70ltr signature series cooler..**\n\nExcellent cooler, best ever..awesome quick service aswell, love he tthick lid & real quality Parts\n& all the ingredients with the thong, inc the rope handles which are perfect lenght, , , keeps ice\nas cold as u could possibly want...thanks techni ice, you do it well, it's perfect for me outback\nadventures...cheers Rick (Sth Aust)\n\nShane Verrall\n**Testing her out now :)**\n\n3nights - still full of ice - the whole box feels cold which I really haven\u2019t experienced with\nother brands 5 stars\n\nDavid Billingsley\n**Techni Ice Signature Series Icebox 70L Long**\n\nFantastic service from the Techni Ice Crew. Great communication and the staff could not of been\nmore helpful with my order. Esky is fantastic. Thanks crew.\n[Techni Ice Signature Series Icebox 70L Long Free Heavy Duty Wire Basket *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY\nDISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Series Icebox 70L Long Free Heavy Duty Wire Basket *PRE-ORDER NOW\nFOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Series Icebox 70L Long Free Heavy Duty Wire Basket\n*PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Series Icebox 70L Long Free Heavy Duty Wire\nBasket *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Series Icebox 70L Long Free Heavy\nDuty Wire Basket *PRE-ORDER NOW FOR JULY DISPATCH] [Techni Ice Signature Seri"
