      "key_products": "Reusable Dry Ice Packs, Classic Hardcore Ice Box 45L, Signature Series 85L with Wheels, Techni Ice High Performance Cooler Bag 5L, Classic Ice Box 40L",
      "polished_summary": "Techni Ice specializes in high-performance cooler products and accessories tailored for outdoor adventures, camping, and food preservation. Their extensive range includes innovative ice boxes, cooler bags, and drinkware, designed for outdoor enthusiasts, families, and pet owners, ensuring superior insulation and durability for various activities. With a commitment to quality and functionality, Techni Ice delivers solutions that enhance the outdoor experience.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Techni Ice manufactures and sells a variety of ice-related products, including reusable dry ice packs and cooler boxes, which are directly relevant to the gel ice pack market. Their focus on high-performance insulation technology and outdoor products aligns well with the needs of consumers looking for effective cooling solutions.",
