        "crawl_text": "[Siddhi Cooltech]\n\n\u00a0\n* [Siddhi Cooltech]\n* Email : [info@siddhicooltech.com][1]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0Home][2]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0 About Us][3]\n  * [The Company][4]\n  * [Research & Development ][5]\n  * [Our Team][6]\n  * [Quality Control ][7]\n  * [Our Infrastructure ][8]\n  * [Customer Satisfaction ][9]\n  * [Why Us? ][10]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0 Products ][11]\n  * [Ice Gel Packs (LDPE Pouches) ][12]\n  * [Ice Gel Packs (HDPE Hard Container)][13]\n  * [PCM Packs (HDPE Hard Container)][14]\n  * [TCD Boxes / Thermal Packaging & Testing][15]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0 Vision & Mission ][16]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0 Our Client ][17]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0Download ][18]\n* [\u00a0\u00a0Contact us ][19]\n\n[First slide]\n[Second slide]\n[Third slide]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Siddhi Cool tech]\n\n# Welcome to Siddhi Cool tech\n\nLeveraging on the latest technologies and dedicated workforce, we Siddhi Cool Tech Pvt. Ltd. (an ISO\n9001:2015 certified organization) are internationally renowned for offering world class and high\nquality products. Our company is identified as specialized manufacturer, supplier and exporter of an\nextensive array of supreme quality of different types of Coolit Ice Gel Packs, Coolant Packs, **[Gel\nIce Packs][20]**, Chill Packs, and **[PCM Packs][21]** in LDPE pouch form & HDPE Container bottle\nform of various sizes, **[TCD Boxes][22]** (Temperature Controlled Distribution Box). Siddhi Cool\nTech Private Limited is a manufacturer, Supplier and exporter of cold chain solutions products.\n\n\u00a0\n\n### Satisfaction Guaranteed\n\nWe manufacture products with well tested raw material with an objective to achieve complete customer\nsatisfaction.\n\n[\n\n**Read More ..**\n\n][23]\n\n\u00a0\n\n### Why Us?\n\nOur ability to manage and meet the bulk demands in the most efficient manner, we have been able to\ncater to the needs of our valuable customers.\n\n[\n\n**Read More ..**\n\n][24]\n\n\u00a0\n\n### Our Vision\n\nTo be a leading and trusted supplier of temperature controlled thermal packaging at most affordable\nprocess to pharmaceuticals, biotech, life sciences, clinical research and food industry.\n\n[\n\n**Read More ..**\n\n][25]\n\n\n# Product Showcase\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n[PCM Packs in HDPE Hard Container]\n\nPCM Packs in HDPE Hard Container\n\n[More Info..][26]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[TCD Boxes]\n\nTCD Boxes\n\n[More Info..][27]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Ice Gel Packs in HDPE Hard Container]\n\nIce Gel Packs in HDPE Hard Container\n\n[More Info..][28]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Ice gel pack in HDPC Hard container]\n\nIce gel pack in HDPC Hard container\n\n[More Info..][29]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[TCD Boxes]\n\nTCD Boxes\n\n[More Info..][30]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[PCM Packs in HDPE Hard Container]\n\nPCM Packs in HDPE Hard Container\n\n[More Info..][31]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[TCD Boxes]\n\nTCD Boxes\n\n[More Info..][32]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Ice Gel Packs in HDPE Hard Container]\n\nIce Gel Packs in HDPE Hard Container\n\n[More Info..][33]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Ice gel pack in HDPC Hard container]\n\nIce gel pack in HDPC Hard container\n\n[More Info..][34]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[TCD Boxes]\n\nTCD Boxes\n\n[More Info..][35]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[PCM Packs in HDPE Hard Container]\n\nPCM Packs in HDPE Hard Container\n\n[More Info..][36]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[TCD Boxes]\n\nTCD Boxes\n\n[More Info..][37]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Ice Gel Packs in HDPE Hard Container]\n\nIce Gel Packs in HDPE Hard Container\n\n[More Info..][38]\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Siddhi cooltech]\n\n1, Joshi Estate, Nr. Bhagyoday Hotel, B/h, Ginger Hotel, Canal Road, Nr. Siddhi Oil Limited,\nChangodar, Ta: Sanand, Ahmedabad - 382213\n\nPhone : +91 9624031020\n\nEmail : [info@siddhicooltech.com][39]\n\nWebsite : [www.siddhicooltech.com][40]\n\n**Browse**\n\n[Ice Gel Packs][41]\n\n[Coolant Packs][42]\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][43]\n\n[Chill Packs][44]\n\n[PCM Packs][45]\n\n[HDPE Container bottle ][46]\n\n[Company][47]\n\n[Our Products][48]\n\n[Contact us][49]\n\n[Sitemap][50]\n\n[Inquiry][51]\n\n[world Map]\n\nCopyright \ufffd 2017, All Rights Reserved by Siddhi Cool Tech Pvt. Ltd.\n\n[ SiteM