        "crawl_text": "* [CCT SMART SOLUTIONS][1]\n* [SOLUTION SELECTOR TOOL][2]\n* [CONTACT US][3]\n[ [CCT_Logo_Without_Tagline_color] ][4]\n* [CUSTOMERS][5]\n  * [Life Science Manufacturers][6]\n  * [Life Science Distributors][7]\n  * [Logistics Providers][8]\n  * [Clinical Trials][9]\n  * [Diagnostics][10]\n  * [Specialty Pharmacies][11]\n  * [Cell & Gene Therapy][12]\n  * [Airlines & Freight Forwarders][13]\n* [PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS][14]\n  * [Parcel Shippers][15]\n  * [Pallet Shippers][16]\n  * [Thermal Covers][17]\n  * [Sustainable & Reusable Solutions][18]\n  * [Monitoring Solutions][19]\n* [DIGITAL SOLUTIONS][20]\n  * [MedAssure][21]\n  * [Rx Secure][22]\n* [VALUE ADDED SERVICES][23]\n  * [C.A.R.E][24]\n  * [Technical Solutions][25]\n  * [Thermal Services][26]\n    * [Thermal Design][27]\n    * [Thermal Qualification][28]\n    * [Thermal Analysis][29]\n    * [Ambient Temperature Profile Analysis][30]\n  * [Rental & On Demand Solutions ][31]\n    * [Rental Programs][32]\n    * [Preconditioned Solutions][33]\n    * [On Demand Ordering][34]\n  * [Easy Return (CCT ReNew)][35]\n* [RESOURCES][36]\n  * [Events][37]\n    * [Webcasts][38]\n    * [Tradeshows][39]\n  * [Blogs][40]\n  * [Knowledge Center][41]\n    * [Case Studies & Technical Resources][42]\n    * [Policies & Certificates][43]\n    * [FAQs][44]\n    * [Glossary][45]\n  * [Professional & Regulatory Groups][46]\n* [COMPANY][47]\n  * [Sustainability Hub][48]\n  * [Locations][49]\n  * [Partners][50]\n  * [Our Culture][51]\n    * [Diversity, Equity, Inclusion (DEI)][52]\n  * [CCT Leadership][53]\n  * [News][54]\n  * [Careers][55]\n\n# Complete Cold Chain Assurance\n# for the Life Sciences\n\nAdvancing Thermal Solutions & Services... Protecting Lives\n[ Compare & Find your solution ][56]\n[ Contact Us ][57]\n\n## Customers\n\nAt CCT, we focus on understanding the unique challenges experienced by each of the segments we\nserve. Our extensive thermal packaging background enables us to provide problem-solving solutions\nand services to the life sciences industry worldwide.\u00a0\n\n[Life Science Manufacturers]\n\n### [ Life Science Manufacturers ][58]\n\nFully qualified thermal packaging to withstand multiple scenarios.\n[Life Science Distributors@300x]\n\n### [ Life Science Distributors ][59]\n\nFreight and cost saving solutions to meet regulation challenges.\n[Logistics Providers]\n\n### [ Logistics Providers ][60]\n\nMeet client demands with the help of our engineers and specialists.\n[Clinical Trials]\n\n### [ Clinical Trials ][61]\n\nTemperature sensitive packaging that will maintain tight parameters.\n[Diagnostics]\n\n### [ Diagnostics ][62]\n\nMaintaining necessary temperatures to ensure accurate results.\n[Specialty Pharmacies]\n\n### [ Specialty Pharmacies ][63]\n\nReduce labor and shipping costs to maintain product integrity.\n[Cell & Gene Therapy]\n\n### [ Cell & Gene Therapy ][64]\n\nThermal packaging designed for rigorous temperature requirements.\n[Airlines_FreightForwarders]\n\n### [ Airlines & Forwarders ][65]\n\nMaintain thermal requirements throughout the cold chain journey.\n\n## Products & Solutions\n\nWe provide performance driven thermal packaging.\n\n\nYou can trust CCT to help you ensure the value and integrity of your life science products\nthroughout their journey.\n\n[ Find Your Solution ][66]\n\n### Rental & On Demand\n### Solutions\n\n### Sustainable & Reusable\n### Solutions\n\n### Product\n### Catalog\n\n## Solving Cold Chain Challenges to Protect Lives\n\n[ Explore How CCT Can Help ][67]\n\n## ANNOUNCEMENT\n\nCold Chain Technologies (\u201cCCT\u201d), a leading global provider of advanced thermal packaging and digital\nmonitoring solutions for the transportation of temperature-sensitive life sciences products, today\nannounced it has acquired Tower Cold Chain (\u201cTower\u201d), a global provider of advanced passive reusable\ncold chain solutions. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.\u00a0\n[ Learn More ][68]\n\n## Our Results\n\nOur customers experience incredible results with our thermal packaging solutions and services.\n\n*Updated June 2025.*\n\n### +13.5\n### Million\n\nShipped Over 13.5 Million Reusable & Sustainable Shippers * [CCT SMART SOLUTIONS][1]\n* [SOLUTION SELECTOR TOOL][2]\n* [CONTACT US][3]\n[ [CCT_Logo_Without_Tagline_color] ][4]\n* [CUSTOMERS][5]\n  * [Life Science Manufacturers][6]\n  * [Life Science Distributors][7]\n  * [Logistics Providers][8]\n  * [Clinical Trials][9]\n  * [Diagnostics][10]\n  * [Specialty Pharmacies][11]\n  * [Cell & Gene Therapy][12]\n  * [Airlines & Freight Forwarders][13]\n* [PRODUCTS & SOLUTIONS][14]\n  * [Parcel Shippers][15]\n  * [Pallet Shippers][16]\n  * [Thermal Covers][17]\n  * [Sustainable & Reusable Solutions][18]\n  * [Monitoring Solutions][19]\n* [DIGITAL SOLUTIONS][20]\n  * [MedAssure][21]\n  * [Rx Secure][22]\n* [VALUE ADDED SERVICES][23]\n  * [C.A.R.E][24]\n  * [Technical Solutions][25]\n  * [Thermal Services][26]\n    * [Thermal Design][27]\n    * [Thermal Qualification][28]\n    * [Thermal Analysis][29]\n    * [Ambient Temperature Profile Analysis][30]\n  * [Rental & On Demand Solutions ][31]\n    * [Rental Programs][32]\n    * [Preconditioned Solutions][33]\n    * [On Demand Ordering][34]\n  * [Easy Return (CCT ReNew)][35]\n* [RESOURCES][36]\n  * [Events][37]\n    * [Webcasts][38]\n    * [Tradeshows][39]\n  * [Blogs][40]\n  * [Knowledge Center][41]\n    * [Case Studies & Technical Resources][42]\n    * [Policies & Certificates][43]\n    * [FAQs][44]\n    * [Glossary][45]\n  * [Professional & Regulatory Groups][46]\n* [COMPANY][47]\n  * [Sustainability Hub][48]\n  * [Locations][49]\n  * [Partners][50]\n  * [Our Culture][51]\n    * [Diversity, Equity, Inclusion (DEI)][52]\n  * [CCT Leadership][53]\n  * [News][54]\n  * [Careers][55]\n\n# Complete Cold Chain Assurance\n# for the Life Sciences\n\nAdvancing Thermal Solutions & Services... Protecting Lives\n[ Compare & Find your solution ][56]\n[ Contact Us ][57]\n\n## Customers\n\nAt CCT, we focus on understanding the unique challenges experienced by each of the segments we\nserve. Our extensive thermal packaging background enables us to provide problem-solving solutions\nand services to the life sciences industry worldwide.\u00a0\n\n[Life Science Manufacturers]\n\n### [ Life Science Manufacturers ][58]\n\nFully qualified thermal packaging to withstand multiple scenarios.\n[Life Science Distributors@300x]\n\n### [ Life Science Distributors ][59]\n\nFreight and cost saving solutions to meet regulation challenges.\n[Logistics Providers]\n\n### [ Logistics Providers ][60]\n\nMeet client demands with the help of our engineers and specialists.\n[Clinical Trials]\n\n### [ Clinical Trials ][61]\n\nTemperature sensitive packaging that will maintain tight parameters.\n[Diagnostics]\n\n### [ Diagnostics ][62]\n\nMaintaining necessary temperatures to ensure accurate results.\n[Specialty Pharmacies]\n\n### [ Specialty Pharmacies ][63]\n\nReduce labor and shipping costs to maintain product integrity.\n[Cell & Gene Therapy]\n\n### [ Cell & Gene Therapy ][64]\n\nThermal packaging designed for rigorous temperature requirements.\n[Airlines_FreightForwarders]\n\n### [ Airlines & Forwarders ][65]\n\nMaintain thermal requirements throughout the cold chain journey.\n\n## Products & Solutions\n\nWe provide performance driven thermal packaging.\n\n\nYou can trust CCT to help you ensure the value and integrity of your life science products\nthroughout their journey.\n\n[ Find Your Solution ][66]\n\n### Rental & On Demand\n### Solutions\n\n### Sustainable & Reusable\n### Solutions\n\n### Product\n### Catalog\n\n## Solving Cold Chain Challenges to Protect Lives\n\n[ Explore How CCT Can Help ][67]\n\n## ANNOUNCEMENT\n\nCold Chain Technologies (\u201cCCT\u201d), a leading global provider of advanced thermal packaging and digital\nmonitoring solutions for the transportation of temperature-sensitive life sciences products, today\nannounced it has acquired Tower Cold Chain (\u201cTower\u201d), a global provider of advanced passive reusable\ncold chain solutions. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.\u00a0\n[ Learn More ][68]\n\n## Our Results\n\nOur customers experience incredible results with our thermal packaging solutions and services.\n\n*Updated June 2025.*\n\n### +13.5\n### Million\n\nShipped Over 13.5 Million Reusable & Sustainable Shippers\n\n### +130\n### Million\n\nAvoided Over 130\u00a0Million Pounds of Landfill\nWaste\n\n### +500\n### Million\n\nDistributed Over 500 Million COVID-19 Vaccine\nDoses\n\n## Services\n\nOur team understands the logistical challenges your life science products will face during the cold\nchain journey. We partner with you to ensure your expectations are met.\n\n[ Contact Us ][69]\n[Cold Chain Best Practices/Consulting]\n\n### [ Cold Chain Best\n### Practices / Consulting ][70]\n\nTechnical and quality assessment of your temperature sensitive distribution process.\u00a0\n[Digital Services]\n\n### [ Digital\n### Services ][71]\n\nTrust us to do our best for you so you can focus on doing your best for your customers.\u00a0\n[Thermal Engineering Services]\n\n### [ Thermal\n### Services ][72]\n\nSmart and efficient thermal packaging solutions specific to your unique challenges.\u00a0\n*We were faced with unexpected and unprecedented volumes of orders. These orders had to be shipped\ndirectly to health care facilities all over the country for hospitalized patients with very severe\nCOVID. This did not end up being an event for a few days but rather for many weeks. I wish I could\nquantify how many patients ultimately will see their next birthday, their kids grow up, their future\ngrandchildren, because of\u2026 the support your teams provided. I am sure your manufacturing, planning,\nand materials management teams were working crazy hours as our team did \u2013 but I do know the work is\nimportant work and we made a difference for thousands of patients. Please share our appreciation!*\n- Biotechnology Company\n[ [CCT_Logo_Without_Tagline_white-1] ][73]\n* [ ][74]\n* [ ][75]\n* [ ][76]\n\n#### Contact Info\n\nCCT Global Headquarters\n135 Constitution Boulevard\nFranklin, Massachusetts 02038\n[+1 (800) 370-8566][77]\n\n#### More Info\n* [Privacy Policy][78]\n* [Cookie Policy][79]\n* [Terms & Conditions][80]\n* [ISO Certificate][81]\n* [Quality Policy][82]\n\n#### Search\n\n##### Copyright \u00a9 2026 Cold Chain Technologies\n\n```html\n[Cold Chain Technologies Logo]\n\n## We Use Website Cookies\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized content, and analyze our\ntraffic. We recommend that you keep all these cookies but if you don't agree you can easily change\nthem by clicking the cookie settings option below. Full details are in our [cookie policy][83]. By\nclicking \"Accept\", you consent to our use of cookies.\n\nAccept Cookie Settings\nAbout Cookies\n\u00d7\n\nThis site uses cookies. We use cookies mainly to improve and analyze your experience on our websites\nand for marketing purposes. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow\nsome types of cookies. Blocking some types of cookies may negatively impact your experience.\n\n\u2190 Back to main cookie notice\nNecessary\nRequired for core functionality.\nAlways active\nAnalytics\nHelps us understand site usage.\nAdvertisement\nUsed for personalized ads.\nFunctionality\nImproves personalization.\nSave Accept All\n\n[1]: https://smartsolutions.coldchaintech.com/\n[2]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/solution-selector-tool\n[3]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/contact-us\n[4]: https://www.coldchaintech.com\n[5]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/customers\n[6]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/customers/life-science-manufacturers\n[7]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/customers/life-science-distributors\n[8]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/customers/logistics-providers\n[9]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/customers/clinical-trials\n[10]: https://www.coldchaintech.com/custome