        "crawl_text": "Tempack Packaging Solutions, S.L. ISO 9001 certified Europe Global ISO 9001:2015 ISO 14001:2015 Rigorous testing and qualification processes Collaborative approach to client solutions Commitment to technological innovation Ethical and environmentally-conscious policies ISTA IATA WHO AFNOR Av. Verge de Montserrat, 2, 08820 El Prat de Llobregat, Barcelona, SPAIN Vagtstrasse 48/49, D-28203 Bremen, Germany Spain Germany Tempack | Temperature Controlled Packaging &amp; Cold Chain Solutions\n\nEnglish\n\nEspa\u00f1ol\n\nDeutsch\n\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\nProducts\nSingle-use\nPackaging\nPET Thermpack\nGreenin\nLipbox\nReusable\nPackaging\nInTempack Insert\nIsoBox 2Door\nCarryTemp\u00ae Bag\nPallet Shippers\nContainers for Delivery Vehicles\nCarryTemp\u00ae\nTransforming Vehicles\nLife Sciences\nPackaging\nDSX Diagnosach\nPatient Bags\nATP650 Box\nP650 Termovial\nCold Packs\nRigid Cold\nPacks/Plates\nRigid Frozen\nPacks/Plates\nFlexible Cold/Frozen Packs\nMarkets\nCold Chain Insights\nAbout\nContact\n\nTEMPACK\u00ae by CSafe\nExperts in passive temperature-controlled packaging (TCP) since 1996, we support the distribution of fresh and frozen products\nFIND OUT MORE\n\nThe high-performance, low cost per use thermal shipper specifically tailored to the needs of food fulfilment centres\nCASE STUDY ISOBOX 2DOOR\nIsoBox 2Door, the ultimate alternative to EPP shippers\nFIND OUT MORE\n\nTRANSFORMING DELIVERY VEHICLES RANGE\nWe transform any conventional vehicle into a multitemperature delivery vehicle in no time and ensure an unbroken food cold chain.\nATP certified shippers under request\nFIND OUT MORE\n\nTHERMAL PACKAGING FOR THE FOOD SUPPLY CHAIN\nWholesalers, Distribution, Fulfilment, Retailers, eCommerce, Transport & Logistics, Food Service\nAI-generated image\nFIND OUT MORE\n\nTEMPACK\u00ae by CSafe\nMastering the Cold Chain to prevent Food Waste\nFIND OUT MORE\n\nTemperature-controlled packaging\n\nTempack, by CSafe, is a leading global provider in the isothermal and refrigerated packaging sector. Our primary activity focuses on the manufacture, development and qualification of packaging solutions for transporting and distributing essential, temperature-sensitive goods, with a special focus on food products, which require a cold chain delivery .\n\nProducts\n\nSingle-use\n\nPackaging\n\nSustainable, disposable solutions offering reliable short-term temperature control for perishable goods, maintaining stability for up to 48 hours.\n\nReusable\n\nPackaging\n\nDurable, long-lasting shippers designed for daily use, ideal for maintaining the cold chain of fresh, chilled and/or frozen perishable foods.\n\nContainers for Delivery Vehicles\n\nModular units designed to maintain temperature in delivery vehicles (cargo vans, bikes, trikes, etc), ensuring chilled and frozen food products stay at the required temperature during last-mile transportation.\n\nLife Sciences\n\nPackaging\n\nSpecialized packaging for medical and biological materials requiring strict temperature control.\n\nCold\n\nPacks\n\nFlexible and rigid packs that keep chilled and frozen shipments within specific temperature ranges, offering a safer and more cost-effective alternative to dry ice without the associated handling risks and higher costs.\n\nCustomised\n\nSystems\n\nTailor-made solutions designed to meet the strictest requirements and ensure optimal thermal protection.\n\nExperts in passive temperature controlled packaging\n\nOur passive temperature-controlled packaging solutions are designed to support reliable food cold chain logistics operations , ensuring the safe distribution of chilled, fresh and frozen products such as fruit, vegetables, dairy, meat and seafood.\n\nDeveloped with the operational realities of grocery delivery, food retail distribution and e-commerce fulfilment in mind, our systems help maintain product stability throughout preparation, staging, transport and last-mile delivery.\n\nWhile primarily focused on food distribution environments, our solutions can also be adapted to other temperature-sensitive transport requirements when operational conditions demand it.\n\nSupported by rigorous testing and qualification processes, our product range combines thermal performance with practical efficiency, enabling temperature control in demanding real-world logistics scenarios.\n\nOptimize your cold chain management for last-mile home delivery with Tempack\n\nTempack\u2019s passive temperature-controlled solutions are specifically developed to support food last-mile delivery operations , ensuring that chilled and frozen products maintain stability from fulfilment preparation through to final distribution.\n\nOur systems help retailers, e-grocery operators and logistics providers preserve product quality while improving operational efficiency in urban delivery environments.\n\nPreservation of Freshness and Quality\n\nOur packaging maintains the precise temperature ranges required for chilled and frozen food distribution, preventing spoilage and preserving product quality throughout last-mile delivery routes.\n\nGuaranteed Cold Chain Integrity\n\nDesigned specifically for last-mile deliveries, our packaging solutions maintain stable temperatures even in varying external conditions, ensuring cold chain integrity from the distribution or fulfilment centre to the customer.\n\nReduced Spoilage and Waste\n\nBy protecting chilled and frozen products during home delivery, our solutions minimize product loss, reducing waste and supporting both sustainability efforts and cost savings for retailers.\n\nCompliance with Home Delivery Standards\n\nAll packaging solutions are built to meet the necessary regulations and best practices for transporting perishable goods, ensuring compliance and reducing the risk of product returns or customer dissatisfaction upon delivery.\n\nTraceability and monitoring\n\nOur packaging solutions can integrate monitoring technologies to provide visibility across food distribution routes, suporting quality assurance and operational control in last-mile delivery. Depending on operational needs, features may include temperature alerts, location visibility and connectivity tools that help logistics teams maintain product integrity throughout delivery.\n\nBenefits\n\nPersonalised service\n\nCustomised to individual requirements\n\nVariable sizes and configurations\n\nIndustry-specific qualification services\n\nTransport-specific design capabilities\n\nIn-house and external training\n\nSpecialised technical support\n\nProblem evaluation and analysis\n\nPrimary focus: food retail, e-grocery and last-mile food logistics\n\nDistribution and Fulfilment Centres:\n\nWe support food retail fulfilment operations and e-grocery distribution centres , helping maintain temperature stability from order preparation and staging through to last-mile dispatch.\n\nOur solutions are designed to perform in high-volume food logistics environments, enabling efficient handling of chilled and frozen products across store-based picking, dark store operations and automated fulfilment systems.\n\nFood Retail \u2013 From store to \u201cdoorstep\u201d:\n\nOur temperature-controlled solutions enable food retailers such as supermarkets, hypermarkets, convenience networks and meal kit providers to manage reliable grocery delivery operations .\n\nThey ensure safe product distribution while improving efficiency across store-based picking, fulfilment processes and last-mile delivery.\n\nOnline Grocers / eCommerce Home Delivery:\n\nAs e-grocery operations continue to expand and delivery networks become more complex, maintaining consistent temperature control has become a critical operational priority.\n\nOur passive enable online grocers preserve the stability of chilled and frozen products across fulfilment preparation, route consolidation and last-mile delivery . Designed for high-frequency distribution models, they contribute to improved logistics efficiency while enabling more sustainable reusable delivery systems .\n\nLogistics for Last-Mile Delivery:\n\nWe collaborate with last-mile food logistics providers t o enable reliable temperature control across increasingly complex urban delivery operations.\n\nOur passive solutions are designed to perform in multi-stop distribution environments, helping operators manage mixed delivery loads, variable dwell times and the operational pressures associated with high-frequency food delivery routes.\n\nThey are also suitable for emerging delivery models such as parcel networks, food lockers, click-and-collect systems and alternative micro-mobility fleets.\n\nOther temperature-controlled distribution appli * [ English][1]\n* [ Espa\u00f1ol][2]\n* [ Deutsch][3]\n\n[[Tempack][Tempack]][4]\n* Products\n* [[softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon\n]Single-use\nPackaging][5]\n* [PET Thermpack][6]\n* [Greenin][7]\n* [Lipbox][8]\n* [[softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon]Reusable\nPackaging][9]\n* [InTempack Insert][10]\n* [IsoBox 2Door][11]\n* [CarryTemp\u00ae Bag][12]\n* [Pallet Shippers][13]\n* [[tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu][tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu]Container\ns for Delivery Vehicles][14]\n* [CarryTemp\u00ae][15]\n* [Transforming Vehicles][16]\n* [[tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue][tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue]Life Sciences\nPackaging][17]\n* [DSX Diagnosach][18]\n* [Patient Bags][19]\n* [ATP650 Box][20]\n* [P650 Termovial][21]\n* [[tempack-cold-packs][tempack-cold-packs]Cold\nPacks][22]\n* [Rigid Cold\nPacks/Plates][23]\n* [Rigid Frozen\nPacks/Plates][24]\n* [Flexible Cold/Frozen Packs][25]\n* [Markets][26]\n* [Cold Chain Insights][27]\n* [About][28]\n* [Contact][29]\n\n# Contact Us\n\n[Temperature controlled packaging][30] \u00bb Contact Us\n\n## Enquiry Form\n\n#### Download our corporate brochure\n\n[DOWNLOAD NOW][31]\n\nHeadquarters\n\nAv. Verge de Montserrat, 2\n08820\nEl Prat de Llobregat\nBarcelona, SPAIN\n\n[(+34) 93 366 10 25][32]\n\nGermany\n\nVagtstrasse 48/49\nD-28203 Bremen\n\n[+49 (0) 421 84 13 94 87][33]\n\nOur Global Network\n\n[][34]\n\nContact Us\n\nFor product information, requests or comments, please fill out the contact form:\n\n[CONTACT US][35]\n\nFollow Our Activity\n\nTEMPACK \u00a9 copyright 2024 | All rights reserved | TEMPACK\u00ae is a registered trademark of Tempack\nPackaging Solutions, S.L.\n[Cookies Policy][36] | [CSafe Group Code of Conduct][37] | [Legal Notice & Terms of Use][38] |\n[Privacy Policy][39] | [Recycling Instructions][40] | [Supplier Code of Conduct][41] | [Tempack\nSales T&Cs][42]\n\n[1]: #\n[2]: https://tempack.com/es/contacto/\n[3]: https://tempack.com/de/kontakt/\n[4]: https://tempack.com/\n[5]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/\n[6]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/pet-thermpack/\n[7]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/greenin/\n[8]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/lipbox/\n[9]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/\n[10]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/intempack-insert/\n[11]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/isobox-2door/\n[12]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/carrytemp-bag/\n[13]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/pallet-shippers/\n[14]: https://tempack.com/containers-for-delivery-vehicles/\n[15]: https://tempack.com/containers-for-delivery-vehicles/carrytemp/\n[16]: https://tempack.com/containers-for-delivery-vehicles/transforming-vehicles/\n[17]: https://tempack.com/life-sciences-packaging/\n[18]: https://tempack.com/life-sciences-packaging/dsx-diagnosach/\n[19]: https://tempack.com/life-sciences-packaging/patient-bags/\n[20]: https://tempack.com/life-sciences-packaging/atp650-insulated-box/\n[21]: https://tempack.com/life-sciences-packaging/p650-termovial/\n[22]: https://tempack.com/cold-packs/\n[23]: https://tempack.com/cold-packs/rigid-cold-packs/\n[24]: https://tempack.com/cold-packs/rigid-frozen-packs/\n[25]: https://tempack.com/cold-packs/flexible-cold-packs/\n[26]: /markets/\n[27]: https://tempack.com/news/\n[28]: https://tempack.com/about-tempack/\n[29]: /contact-us/?ref=direct-en\n[30]: https://tempack.com/\n[31]: https://tempack.com/corporate-brochure-download/\n[32]: tel:+34933661025\n[33]: tel:+4902184139487\n[34]: /about-tempack/#network\n[35]: https://tempack.com/contact-us/?ref=footer-en\n[36]: https:"
