            "text": "* [ English][1]\n* [ Espa\u00f1ol][2]\n* [ Deutsch][3]\n\n[[Tempack][Tempack]][4]\n* Products\n* [[softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon\n]Single-use\nPackaging][5]\n* [PET Thermpack][6]\n* [Greenin][7]\n* [Lipbox][8]\n* [[softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon]Reusable\nPackaging][9]\n* [InTempack Insert][10]\n* [IsoBox 2Door][11]\n* [CarryTemp\u00ae Bag][12]\n* [Pallet Shippers][13]\n* [[tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu][tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu]Container\ns for Delivery Vehicles][14]\n* [CarryTemp\u00ae][15]\n* [Transforming Vehicles][16]\n* [[tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue][tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue]Life Sciences\nPackaging][17]\n* [DSX Diagnosach][18]\n* [Patient Bags][19]\n* [ATP650 Box][20]\n* [P650 Termovial][21]\n* [[tempack-cold-packs][tempack-cold-packs]Cold\nPacks][22]\n* [Rigid Cold\nPacks/Plates][23]\n* [Rigid Frozen\nPacks/Plates][24]\n* [Flexible Cold/Frozen Packs][25]\n* [Markets][26]\n* [Cold Chain Insights][27]\n* [About][28]\n* [Contact][29]\n\n# **About Tempack**\n\n[Temperature controlled packaging][30] \u00bb About Tempack\n* [Who we are][31]\n* [Global Network][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Sustainability][34]\n* [IMS Policy][35]\n\n## Who we** are**\n\nTempack, by CSafe, is a leading global provider in the isothermal and refrigerated packaging sector.\nOur primary activity focuses on the manufacture, development and qualification of packaging\nsolutions for transporting and distributing essential, temperature-sensitive goods, with a special\nfocus on food products, which require a cold chain delivery.\n\nThe levels of innovation employed in our packing solutions guarantee an unbroken cold chain for\nperishable, fresh, and frozen products, such as fruits, vegetables, dairy, meat and seafood, as well\nas chemical and pharmaceutical products throughout their transit. To accommodate such diversity, our\nown product range is highly extensive.\n\nWith a commitment to rigorous testing and qualification, we tailor solutions to perform in the kind\nof demanding environments to which our customers\u2019 stock is often exposed. Despite an exemplary track\nrecord with results, you\u2019ll still find us well-adjusted in terms of costs.\n\n## Why** Tempack**\n\n1We treasure our collaborative approach to finding perfect solutions for our clients\n\n2 We enjoy solid relationships with many of the world\u2019s leading pharma, biotech, e-commerce and food\ncompanies\n\n3 We offer benchmark solutions that are flexible and dynamic, often going beyond industry compliance\n\n4 Our commitment to technological innovation is ever-present\n\n5 Our policies are ethically and environmentally-astute\n\n## Our global network\n\nSpain\n\nAv. Verge de Montserrat, 2\n08820\nEl Prat de Llobregat\nBarcelona\n\n(+34) 93 366 10 25\n\nGermany\n\nSchubertstr. 13**\n**D-28209 Bremen\n\n+49 (0) 421 84 13 94 87\n\n## Services\n\n### Customised Solutions\n\nWe design and produce fully-customised solutions to comply with the most rigorous requirements and\nspecifications of products that are sensitive to temperature change. To ensure optimal performance,\nthese solutions are tested and qualified, taking into account the logistical economics that packages\nwill face during transportation under temperature-controlled conditions.\n\nPhysical features such as volume and weight will be assessed in context with the logistics circuit\ncharacteristics selected by our customers. Typically these would include mode of transport, duration\nand expected temperature exposures based on the climatic conditions of the shipping regions\ninvolved.\n\nWe then take a modular approach to stock management. This reduces the component variables \u2013 and\nultimately the costs \u2013 related to logistics and distribution.\n\n### **Customised Solutions Features**\n\nPersonalised service\n\n[tempack-custom][tempack-custom]\n\nCustomised to individual requirements\n\nVariable sizes and configurations\n\n[simulation][simulation]\n\nIndustry-specific qualification services\n\nTransport-specific design capabilities\n\nIn-house and external training\n\n[kit-lock][kit-lock]\n\nSpecialised technical support\n\nProblem evaluation and analysis\n\n### Laboratory Testing and Qualification Process\n\nThe entire design, simulation and testing processes, as well as qualification of packaging autonomy\nfor a complete cold chain logistics circuit, are carried out at Tempack\u2019s ISO 9001 certified\nlaboratory. Equipped with cutting-edge technology, the facility ensures our cold chain packaging\nsolutions comply with our customers\u2019 profiles, as well as with the sector\u2019s standards (ISTA, IATA,\nUN, WHO, AFNOR).\n\nEvery single thermal solution is developed in line with regulations and will guarantee the integrity\nof your product in transit. To ensure this, climate personnel carry out more than 500 tests a year,\nencompassing capacities from 0.1 litres to 2,500 litres and temperatures that range from -25\u2070 C to\n+60\u2070 C.\n\n### Qualification Process\n\n## **Stage 1**\n\n### Analysis of customer\u2019s needs\n\n## **Stage 2**\n\n### Analysis of ideal solution, prototype and pre-qualification\n\n## **Stage 3**\n\n### Qualification of final thermal solution\n\n## Social Responsibility and Environmental Policy\n\nTempack, as a CSafe group company, is committed to leadership and continuous improvement in the\nspecialty packaging industry by striving to minimize the environmental impact of shipping perishable\nfood and high-value life science products and by taking into consideration the main issues relevant\nto our company according to the industry: energy consumption, water usage, waste management and the\nhealth and safety of our customers.\n\nThe key points of its strategy to achieve this are:\n\n\u2022 Minimize waste by evaluating operations and ensuring that they are as efficient as possible and\nthat items that are recyclable and/or reusable are optimized.\n\u2022 Actively promote reuse and recycling both internally and among its customers and suppliers.\n\u2022 Consistently design and manufacture a range of products that have the lowest environmental impact\nof other competitive products.\n\u2022 Encourage the rational use of energy and water by all our employees on an annual basis.\n\u2022 Comply with all environmental legislation that relates to the company ensuring the health and\nsafety of our employees, neighbors, and customers.\n\nCSR is a very important issue for Tempack. Consequently, our efforts are not only focused on\ndeveloping sustainable packaging solutions, but also on applying processes and improvements in-house\nto optimise our environmental footprint. To that end, we installed solar panels that enabled us to\ngenerate our own energy and become a more sustainable company. From May 2023 we have the following:\n\n90.21MWh\n\nGenerated Energy\n\n42.85tons\n\nCarbon Savings\n\n42.85tons\n\nC02 Reduction\n\n59trees\n\nEquivalent Planted\n\n## Integrated Management System (IMS) Policy\n\nTEMPACK defines its Integrated Management System (IMS) Policy as an integral part of the General\nPolicy of TEMPACK and is therefore committed to apply, spread and ensure compliance of IMS Policy by\nall staff.\n\nAs a way to express its commitment to quality management and environmental management, the\nmanagement system of TEMPACK is based on the standards:\n* UNE-EN-ISO 9001:2015 \u201cQuality management systems \u2014 Requirements\u201d\n* UNE-EN-ISO 14001:2015 \u201cEnvironmental management systems \u2014 Requirements with guidance for use\u201d.\n\nTo verify that all requirements in these regulations are met, an external Certification Authority\nreviews and certifies our IMG on a regular basis.\n\nThe Integrated Management System Policy of TEMPACK includes all the actions integrated into our IMS\nand is defined as follows:\n* Our commitment to continuously improve the integrated quality and environmental management system,\nas well as to prevent environmental pollution.\n* Being in constant contact with our customers to offer solutions customised to their needs while\nrespecting the environment to the maximum.\n* Reaching long-term and/or exclusive agreements with our suppliers. Being pioneers in bringing new\nproducts to the market.\n* Comparing the solutions in our laboratory.\n* Meeting all legal requirements applicable to our activity, as well as those subscribed by the\nOrganisation.\n\n###### [Download here our IMS Policies][36]\n\n###### [Download here the Informative Note on our Supplier Evaluation Criteria][37]\n\n[[quality logo iso 9001 & iso 14001][quality logo iso 9001 & iso 14001]][38]\n\n#### Download our corporate brochure\n\n[DOWNLOAD NOW][39]\n\nHeadquarters\n\nAv. Verge de Montserrat, 2\n08820\nEl Prat de Llobregat\nBarcelona, SPAIN\n\n[(+34) 93 366 10 25][40]\n\nGermany\n\nVagtstrasse 48/49\nD-28203 Bremen\n\n[+49 (0) 421 84 13 94 87][41]\n\nOur Global Network\n\n[][42]\n\nContact Us\n\nFor product information, requests or comments, please fill out the contact form:\n\n[CONTACT US][43]\n\nFollow Our Activity\n\nTEMPACK \u00a9 copyright 2024 | All rights reserved | TEMPACK\u00ae is a registered trademark of Tempack\nPackaging Solutions, S.L.\n[Cookies Policy][44] | [CSafe Group Code of Conduct][45] | [Legal Notice & Terms of Use][46] |\n[Privacy Policy][47] | [Recycling Instructions][48] | [Supplier Code of Conduct][49] | [Tempack\nSales T&Cs][50]\n\n[1]: #\n[2]: https://tempack.com/es/sobre-tempack/\n[3]: https://tempack.com/de/ueber-uns/\n[4]: https://tempack.com/\n[5]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/\n[6]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/pet-thermpack/\n[7]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/greenin/\n[8]: https://tempack.com/single-use-packaging/lipbox/\n[9]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/\n[10]: https://tempack.com/reusable-packaging/intempa