      "key_products": "Cold Packs, Rigid Cold Packs/Plates, Flexible Cold/Frozen Packs",
      "polished_summary": "Tempack, a leading global provider in the isothermal and refrigerated packaging sector, specializes in the manufacture and development of innovative packaging solutions for transporting temperature-sensitive goods, particularly in the food and healthcare industries. With a focus on both single-use and reusable packaging, including products like PET Thermpack and DSX Diagnosach, the company caters primarily to food distribution centers and healthcare providers, ensuring compliance with rigorous temperature control standards through customized solutions and rigorous testing processes.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Tempack manufactures and develops specialized packaging solutions, including cold packs, that are directly relevant to the gel ice pack market. Their products are designed for temperature-sensitive goods, particularly in food and healthcare, which aligns with the target market.",
