      "polished_summary": "Becton Dickinson (BD) is a global leader in medical technology, dedicated to advancing the world of health through innovative products and solutions. With a focus on enhancing safety and efficiency in healthcare, BD offers a comprehensive portfolio that includes devices, services, and systems designed for various segments of the healthcare community. The company serves a diverse range of markets, including hospitals, laboratories, and home healthcare, aiming to improve patient outcomes and streamline healthcare processes.",
