        "crawl_text": "ColdStar Solutions Pvt. Ltd. India Karimpur, Nazirabad, PS: Uchhepota, Near URBANA Complex, Kolkata 700150, W.B. India India Pan-India Successfully participated in the 20th International Foodtech Exhibition 2023 held in Kolkata. ColdStar Solutions Pvt. Ltd. - Manufacturer & Supplier Of Commercial Kitchen Equipments, Display Freezer And Chillers, Ice Cream Plant, Bakery Equipment, Bean to Cup Coffee Machine, Catering Equipment In Kolkata, Display Showcase manufacturer\n\n+91-8334917073\n\ninfo@coldstar.in\n\nNavigations\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nProducts\n\nRefrigeration Equipments\n\nReach-Ins\n\nChiller &#038; Freezer\n\nCold Room\n\nIce Cream Plant\n\nIce Machine\n\nSoft Serve Ice Cream Machine\n\nApplication Based\n\nBakery Equipments\n\nMixers &#038; Ovens\n\nDisplay Showcase\n\nCounters\n\nKitchen Equipments\n\nBurner &#038; Ovens\n\nState-of-Art Equipments\n\nKitchen Utilities\n\nContact Us\n\nDownload Brochure\n\nDownload Brochure\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nProducts\n\nRefrigeration Equipments\n\nReach-Ins\n\nChiller &#038; Freezer\n\nCold Room\n\nIce Cream Plant\n\nIce Machine\n\nSoft Serve Ice Cream Machine\n\nApplication Based\n\nBakery Equipments\n\nMixers &#038; Ovens\n\nDisplay Showcase\n\nCounters\n\nKitchen Equipments\n\nBurner &#038; Ovens\n\nState-of-Art Equipments\n\nKitchen Utilities\n\nContact Us\n\nDownload Brochure\n\nDownload Brochure\n\nPremium Quality\n\nCommercial Refrigeration\n\nWe specialize in complete commercial refrigeration at a low cost and in a\nprofessional manner.\n\nSee More\n\nDifferent Shapes & Sizes of\n\nDisplay Showcase\n\nWe specialize in premium quality display counters at a low cost and in a\nprofessional manner.\n\nSee More\n\nCommercial & Other\n\nKitchen Equipment\n\nOur wide range are driven by the ambition to provide all the chefs in the world with the best tools for hot food preparartion.\n\nSee More\n\nPremium Quality & Easy To Operate\n\nBakery Equipments\n\nWe are offering premium quality, easy to operate, safe and reilable bakery equipments, they are an ideal choice for any bakery.\n\nSee More\n\nIf You Need Any technical solution ... We Are Available For You We provide best kind of Commercial Kitchen Solution\n\nCall Us Now\n\nFeatured Products\n\nIce Cream Plant\n\nIce Cream Plant\n\nAn awesome piece of machinery is designed from state-of-the-art equipments and offers solutions for all your needs.\nSee More\n\nBakery Equipments\n\nBakery Equipments\n\nWe are offering premium quality, easy to operate, safe and reilable bakery equipments, they are an ideal choice for any bakery.\nRead More\n\nDisplay Showcase\n\nDisplay Showcase\n\nWe are offering different sizes of curved glass, flat glass, panaromic glass & counter top display showcases.\nSee More\n\nKitchen Equipments\n\nKitchen Equipments\n\nOur wide range are driven by the ambition to provide all the chefs in the world with the best tools for hot food preparartion.\nSee More\n\nHappy Clients\n\nService Done\n\nTotal Experts\n\nTotal Installation\n\nChef's Own Choice\n\nProfessional Chefs Deserve Professional Products\n\nA truly world class range of GN Refrigeration products. That enhance the skills of modern kitchen professionals. With Coldstar Reach Ins. You say good bye to power guzzing. Rust catching. Equipment build with AISI 304 grade stainless steel.\n\n\"We Also Make Equipment As Per Customer Requirement\"\n\nOur Brands\n\nProducts Range\n\n&#8226; Freezers &#8226; Showcase Coolers &#8226; Reach-ins &#8226; Under Counter Refrigerator &#8226; Back Bars &#8226; Wine Coolers &#8226; Minibars &#8226; Ice Cube Making Machine &#8226; Ice Flakers &#8226; Ultra Low Temp. Freezers &#8226; Water Coolers Bottled &#8226; Water Dispensers &#8226; Pastry Showcase &#8226; Ice Cream Scooping Cabinets &#8226; Cold Rooms &#8226; Supermarket Refrigeration Products &#8226; Expresso Coffee Machines &#8226; Juice Dispenser &#8226; Soft Serve Ice-cream Machines &#8226; Microwave Combination Ovens &#8226; Impinger Ovens &#8226; Combi Ovens &#8226; Fryers &#8226; Sandwich Grillers &#8226; Bakery Mixers &#8226; Commercial Dish Washers &#8226; Bar Blenders &#8226; Cutting And Cooking Equipments &#8226; Blast Freezers / Chillers\n\n20th International Foodtech Kolkata 2023\n\nBiggest exhibition of eastern India in food and hospitality segment.\n\nWe are proud to announce that we have successfully participated 20th International Foodtech Exhibition 2023 held in Kolkata. Foodtech is a premier exhibition for Food & Hospitality Industry in Eastern India. This 20 years old established trade show has proved to be an ideal platform to bridge between the suppliers & consumers. Kolkata Foodtech is one exhibition that is being projected as a business forum for FMCG companies, Bakers, Hoteliers, Dairy, Sweet and Snacks Mfg. to source their annual requirements.\n\nOur Clientele\n\nKarimpur, Nazirabad,\nPS : Uchhepota,\nNear URBANA Complex, Kolkata 700150\n\n+91-8334917073\n\ninfo@coldstar.in\n\n11:00am to 8:00pm\n\nOpen All Days\n\nColdstar have been pioneers and leaders in the manufacture of commercial kitchen equipments more than a decade.\n\nDownload Product Brochure\n\nFreezer Brochure\n\nFollow Us:\n\nProducts Range\n\nIce Cream Hardener With Fan\n\nChest Freezer\n\nL-Type Showcase\n\nBaking Oven\n\nFour Burner Oven\n\nEngine Diagnostic & Repair\n\nMaintanence Inspaection\n\nElectrical System Diagnostic\n\nWheel Allignment & Installation\n\nAir Conditioner Service & Repair\n-->\n\nQuality Policy\n\nWe have developed and adopted several policies in our business procedures that enable us in garnering maximum client satisfaction. One such policy is the customer feedback policy, wherein we receive advice and suggestions for our clients that are incorporated in the products to improve them.\n\nDisclaimer\n\nBefore making any decision or taking any action, you should consult a Coldstar professional. Coldsstar is not responsible for any errors or omissions, or for the results obtained from the use of this information. We make no warranty that coldstar.in or the provided services will meet user\u2019s requirements.\n\nCopyrights \u00a9 2019 coldstar.in All Rights Reserved. Powered By TRG Software Consultancy [+91-8334917073][1]\n\n[info@coldstar.in][2]\n\nNavigations\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Refrigeration Equipments][6]\n* [Reach-Ins][7]\n* [Chiller & Freezer][8]\n* [Cold Room][9]\n* [Ice Cream Plant][10]\n* [Ice Machine][11]\n* [Soft Serve Ice Cream Machine][12]\n* [Application Based][13]\n* [Bakery Equipments][14]\n* [Mixers & Ovens][15]\n* [Display Showcase][16]\n* [Counters][17]\n* [Kitchen Equipments][18]\n* [Burner & Ovens][19]\n* [State-of-Art Equipments][20]\n* [Kitchen Utilities][21]\n* [Contact Us][22]\n* [Download Brochure][23]\n[Download Brochure][24]\n* [Home][25]\n* [About Us][26]\n* [Products][27]\n* [Refrigeration Equipments][28]\n* [Reach-Ins][29]\n* [Chiller & Freezer][30]\n* [Cold Room][31]\n* [Ice Cream Plant][32]\n* [Ice Machine][33]\n* [Soft Serve Ice Cream Machine][34]\n* [Application Based][35]\n* [Bakery Equipments][36]\n* [Mixers & Ovens][37]\n* [Display Showcase][38]\n* [Counters][39]\n* [Kitchen Equipments][40]\n* [Burner & Ovens][41]\n* [State-of-Art Equipments][42]\n* [Kitchen Utilities][43]\n* [Contact Us][44]\n* [Download Brochure][45]\n\n[Download Brochure][46]\n\n# ABOUT US\n* [Home][47]\n* About Us\n\n## About Coldstar\n\n**Coldstar** have been pioneers and leaders in the manufacture of commercial kitchen equipments more\nthan a decade, **Coldstar** offers complete range of products on world class research and\ndevelopment and rich experience. **Coldstar** products incorporate leading technology and are\nmanufacture at state-of-the-art plants in accordance with international standards.\n**Coldstar**, as the name suggest is formed by professionals associated in the field creating and\nproviding commercial solutions of refregeration and food-serving products.\nThe organization is one of the market leader in the restaurant, industrial canteen, hospitality,\nflight catering units, boarding schools, star and budget hotel segment, resorts and corporate\nsector.\n\n### [Business Verticals][48]\n\n**Coldstar** brings to India a range of international refrigeration, freezing and food-serving\nproducts to serve and provide solutions for Hotels, restaurants, coffee shops, ice creame and\nbreverages, malls, food- retail and health care segments, enabling its customers into upgrade their\nbusiness.\n\n##### Total experts\n\n##### Service Done\n\n##### Happy Client\n\n##### Total Installation\n\n## Our Clientele\n\nKarimpur, Nazirabad, PS:Uchhepota, Near URBANA Complex, Kolkata 700150\n\n[+91-8334917073][49]\n\n[info@coldstar.in][50]\n\n10:00am to 6:00pm\n\nSunday Closed\n\n**Coldstar** have been pioneers and leaders in the manufacture of commercial kitchen equipments more\nthan a decade.\n* [Download Product Brochure][51]\n* [Freezer Brochure][52]\n\n#### Follow Us:\n\n## Products Range\n* [Ice Cream Hardener With Fan][53]\n* [Chest Freezer][54]\n* [L-Type Showcase][55]\n* [Baking Oven][56]\n* [Four Burner Oven][57]\n\n## Quality Policy\n\nWe have developed and adopted several policies in our business procedures that enable us in\ngarnering maximum client satisfaction. One such policy is the customer feedback policy, wherein we\nreceive advice and suggestions for our clients that are incorporated in the products to improve\nthem.\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nBefore making any decision or taking any action, you should consult a Coldstar professional.\nColdsstar is not responsible for any errors or omissions, or for the results obtained from the use\nof this information. We make no warranty that coldstar.in or the provided services will meet user\u2019s\nrequirements.\n\nCopyrights \u00a9 2019 coldstar.in All Rights Reserved. Powered By [ TRG Software Consultancy][58]\n\n[1]: tel:+91-8334917073\n[2]: mailto:info@coldstar.in\n[3]: https://coldstar.in/\n[4]: https://coldstar.in/about-u