            "text": "[+91-8334917073][1]\n\n[info@coldstar.in][2]\n\nNavigations\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Refrigeration Equipments][6]\n* [Reach-Ins][7]\n* [Chiller & Freezer][8]\n* [Cold Room][9]\n* [Ice Cream Plant][10]\n* [Ice Machine][11]\n* [Soft Serve Ice Cream Machine][12]\n* [Application Based][13]\n* [Bakery Equipments][14]\n* [Mixers & Ovens][15]\n* [Display Showcase][16]\n* [Counters][17]\n* [Kitchen Equipments][18]\n* [Burner & Ovens][19]\n* [State-of-Art Equipments][20]\n* [Kitchen Utilities][21]\n* [Contact Us][22]\n* [Download Brochure][23]\n[Download Brochure][24]\n* [Home][25]\n* [About Us][26]\n* [Products][27]\n* [Refrigeration Equipments][28]\n* [Reach-Ins][29]\n* [Chiller & Freezer][30]\n* [Cold Room][31]\n* [Ice Cream Plant][32]\n* [Ice Machine][33]\n* [Soft Serve Ice Cream Machine][34]\n* [Application Based][35]\n* [Bakery Equipments][36]\n* [Mixers & Ovens][37]\n* [Display Showcase][38]\n* [Counters][39]\n* [Kitchen Equipments][40]\n* [Burner & Ovens][41]\n* [State-of-Art Equipments][42]\n* [Kitchen Utilities][43]\n* [Contact Us][44]\n* [Download Brochure][45]\n\n[Download Brochure][46]\n* #### Premium Quality\n\n## Commercial Refrigeration\n\nWe specialize in complete commercial refrigeration at a low cost and in a\nprofessional manner.\n[See More][47]\n* #### Different Shapes & Sizes of\n\n## Display Showcase\n\nWe specialize in premium quality display counters at a low cost and in a\nprofessional manner.\n[See More][48]\n* #### Commercial & Other\n\n## Kitchen Equipment\n\nOur wide range are driven by the ambition to provide all the chefs in the world with the best\ntools for hot food preparartion.\n[Booking Now][49]\n* #### Premium Quality & Easy To Operate\n\n## Bakery Equipments\n\nWe are offering premium quality, easy to operate, safe and reilable bakery equipments, they are an\nideal choice for any bakery.\n[See More][50]\n\n### If You Need Any technical solution ... We Are Available For You We provide best kind of\n### Commercial Kitchen Solution\n\n[Call Us Now][51]\n\n## Featured Products\n\n#### Ice Cream Plant\n\n#### [Ice Cream Plant][52]\n\nAn awesome piece of machinery is designed from state-of-the-art equipments and offers solutions for\nall your needs.\n\n[See More ][53]\n\n#### Bakery Equipments\n\n#### [Bakery Equipments][54]\n\nWe are offering premium quality, easy to operate, safe and reilable bakery equipments, they are an\nideal choice for any bakery.\n\n[Read More ][55]\n\n#### Display Showcase\n\n#### [Display Showcase][56]\n\nWe are offering different sizes of curved glass, flat glass, panaromic glass & counter top display\nshowcases.\n\n[See More ][57]\n\n#### Kitchen Equipments\n\n#### [Kitchen Equipments][58]\n\nOur wide range are driven by the ambition to provide all the chefs in the world with the best tools\nfor hot food preparartion.\n\n[See More ][59]\n\n### Happy Clients\n\n### Service Done\n\n### Total Experts\n\n### Total Installation\n\n## Chef's Own Choice\n\nProfessional Chefs Deserve Professional Products\n\nA truly world class range of GN Refrigeration products. That enhance the skills of modern kitchen\nprofessionals. With Coldstar Reach Ins. You say good bye to power guzzing. Rust catching. Equipment\nbuild with AISI 304 grade stainless steel.\n\n\"We Also Make Equipment As Per Customer Requirement\"\n\n## Our Brands\n\n## Products Range\n\n\u2022 Freezers \u2022 Showcase Coolers \u2022 Reach-ins \u2022 Under Counter Refrigerator \u2022 Back Bars \u2022 Wine Coolers \u2022\nMinibars \u2022 Ice Cube Making Machine \u2022 Ice Flakers \u2022 Ultra Low Temp. Freezers \u2022 Water Coolers Bottled\n\u2022 Water Dispensers \u2022 Pastry Showcase \u2022 Ice Cream Scooping Cabinets \u2022 Cold Rooms \u2022 Supermarket\nRefrigeration Products \u2022 Expresso Coffee Machines \u2022 Juice Dispenser \u2022 Soft Serve Ice-cream Machines\n\u2022 Microwave Combination Ovens \u2022 Impinger Ovens \u2022 Combi Ovens \u2022 Fryers \u2022 Sandwich Grillers \u2022 Bakery\nMixers \u2022 Commercial Dish Washers \u2022 Bar Blenders \u2022 Cutting And Cooking Equipments \u2022 Blast Freezers /\nChillers\n\n## 20th International Foodtech Kolkata 2023\n\n\u2022 Biggest exhibition of eastern India in food and hospitality segment\n\n## Our Clientele\n\n156A, Picnic Garden Road, Kolkata - 700039, W.B, India\n\n[+91-33-2344 2956][60]\n\n[info@coldstar.in][61]\n\n10:00am to 6:00pm\n\nSunday Closed\n\n**Coldstar** have been pioneers and leaders in the manufacture of commercial kitchen equipments more\nthan a decade.\n* [Download Product Brochure][62]\n* [Freezer Brochure][63]\n\n#### Follow Us:\n\n## Products Range\n* [Ice Cream Hardener With Fan][64]\n* [Chest Freezer][65]\n* [L-Type Showcase][66]\n* [Baking Oven][67]\n* [Four Burner Oven][68]\n\n## Quality Policy\n\nWe have developed and adopted several policies in our business procedures that enable us in\ngarnering maximum client satisfaction. One such policy is the customer feedback policy, wherein we\nreceive advice and suggestions for our clients that are incorporated in the products to improve\nthem.\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nBefore making any decision or taking any action, you should consult a Coldstar professional.\nColdsstar is not responsible for any errors or omissions, or for the results obtained from the use\nof this information. We make no warranty that coldstar.in or the provided services will meet user\u2019s\nrequirements.\n\nCopyrights \u00a9 2019 coldstar.in All Rights Reserved. Powered By [ TRG Software Consultancy][69]\n\n[1]: tel:+91-8334917073\n[2]: mailto:info@coldstar.in\n[3]: https://coldstar.in/\n[4]: https://coldstar.in/about-us/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/refrigeration-equipments/\n[7]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/reach-ins/\n[8]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/commercial-refrigerators-manfacturer-kolkata/\n[9]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/commercial-cold-room-manufacturer-kolkata/\n[10]: https://coldstar.in/product-type