ers \u2022 Bakery\nMixers \u2022 Commercial Dish Washers \u2022 Bar Blenders \u2022 Cutting And Cooking Equipments \u2022 Blast Freezers /\nChillers\n\n## 20th International Foodtech Kolkata 2023\n\n\u2022 Biggest exhibition of eastern India in food and hospitality segment\n\n## Our Clientele\n\n156A, Picnic Garden Road, Kolkata - 700039, W.B, India\n\n[+91-33-2344 2956][60]\n\n[info@coldstar.in][61]\n\n10:00am to 6:00pm\n\nSunday Closed\n\n**Coldstar** have been pioneers and leaders in the manufacture of commercial kitchen equipments more\nthan a decade.\n* [Download Product Brochure][62]\n* [Freezer Brochure][63]\n\n#### Follow Us:\n\n## Products Range\n* [Ice Cream Hardener With Fan][64]\n* [Chest Freezer][65]\n* [L-Type Showcase][66]\n* [Baking Oven][67]\n* [Four Burner Oven][68]\n\n## Quality Policy\n\nWe have developed and adopted several policies in our business procedures that enable us in\ngarnering maximum client satisfaction. One such policy is the customer feedback policy, wherein we\nreceive advice and suggestions for our clients that are incorporated in the products to improve\nthem.\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nBefore making any decision or taking any action, you should consult a Coldstar professional.\nColdsstar is not responsible for any errors or omissions, or for the results obtained from the use\nof this information. We make no warranty that coldstar.in or the provided services will meet user\u2019s\nrequirements.\n\nCopyrights \u00a9 2019 coldstar.in All Rights Reserved. Powered By [ TRG Software Consultancy][69]\n\n[1]: tel:+91-8334917073\n[2]: mailto:info@coldstar.in\n[3]: https://coldstar.in/\n[4]: https://coldstar.in/about-us/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/refrigeration-equipments/\n[7]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/reach-ins/\n[8]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/commercial-refrigerators-manfacturer-kolkata/\n[9]: https://coldstar.in/product-type/commercial-cold-room-manufacturer-kolkata/\n[10]: https://coldstar.in/product-type