2 pm EST will be\nshipped within the day and orders made after that will be shipped the following day.\n\nOur products are made from medical-grade material and can withstand intense temperatures. They\u2019re\nmulti-purpose, versatile therapy packs that put your ol\u2019 bag of peas to shame.\n\nHowever, if there\u2019s any chance that you aren\u2019t satisfied with your order for any reason, don\u2019t\nfret!\n\nWe have a no-hassle 30-day money-back guarantee to ensure customer satisfaction. You can simply\nmessage us within 30 days and we will be happy to refund you or replace your order.\n\n## Behind the Brand\n\nWe put great faith in our products because they\u2019ve been tried and tested by our team.\n\n#### Michael Jackness - President & CEO\n\nMichael is the CEO of Terran, LLC, the parent company of IceWraps.com.\n\nAs an outdoorsy man himself, he loves playing tennis, traveling, SCUBA diving, and spending time\nwith his wife.\n\nMichael puts prime focus in providing amazing customer service and that reflects in everything we\ndo. It\u2019s basically why we have our no-hassle return policy and why all emails are answered within 1\nbusiness day.\n\n#### Michele Yeh - Creative Director\n\nMichele knows every nook and cranny of the online marketing world, with over a decade of experience\nunder her belt.\n\nAs Icewraps.com continues to grow, she has been instrumental in keeping the team organized, online\nand offline. Michele\u2019s attention to detail is what makes every product go out the door smoothly.\n\nOutside the office, Michele and her husband enjoy hiking and cooking with local harvesters.\n\nTogether with our dynamic customer support team, we aim to provide the best products and customer\nservice day in and day out.\n\nWith IceWraps.com, pain relief is just a click away!\n\n## SIGN UP FOR EXCLUSIVE SALES AND LATEST NEWS\n\n### Get In Touch\n* [ Facebook][53]\n* [ Instagram][54]\n* [ Twitter][55]\n* [ Youtube][56]\n\n### Questions? Call\n### [1-800-650-9727][57]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [About Us][58]\n* [Contact Us][59]\n* [FAQ][60]\n* [Privacy Policy][61]\n* [Blog][62]\n* [Shipping Policy][63]\n* [Return Policy][64]\n* [Why Shop At IceWraps.com?][65]\n* [Custom Ice Packs][66]\n* [ActiveWrap][67]\n* [Pro Ice][68]\n* [IceWraps Brand][69]\n\nIcewraps is your one-stop-shop for everything hot and cold therapy. We take your health and comfort\nseriously, so we make sure you only get the best products through fast delivery, hassle-free returns\nand excellent customer service. Get back to feeling your best with IceWraps.\n\n\u00a9 2026 [IceWraps][70]. - A Terran, LLC online store. 8275 South Eastern Avenue Suite 200 Las Vegas,\nNV 89123. All prices are in USD.\n\n[1]: https://www.icewraps.com\n[2]: /cart\n[3]: /\n[4]: /collections/all\n[5]: /pages/shop-by-brands\n[6]: /collections/custom-packs\n[7]: /blogs/news\n[8]: /pages/about-us\n[9]: /pages/shipping-return-policy\n[10]: /pages/contact-us\n[11]: tel:+18006509727\n[12]: https://www.icewraps.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[13]: tel:+18006509727\n[14]: /pages/contact-us\n[15]: /cart\n[16]: /account\n[17]: /\n[18]: /collections/all\n[19]: /pages/shop-by-brands\n[20]: /collections/custom-packs\n[21]: https://www.icewraps.com\n[22]: /blogs/news\n[23]: /pages/about-us\n[24]: /pages/shipping-return-policy\n[25]: /collections/shoulder\n[26]: /collections/neck\n[27]: /collections/elbow\n[28]: /collections/wrist\n[29]: /collections/ankle\n[30]: /collections/knee\n[31]: /collections/back\n[32]: /collections/hip\n[33]: /collections/gel-packs\n[34]: /collections/gel-packs\n[35]: /collections/clay-packs\n[36]: /collections/instant-ice-packs\n[37]:\n[38]: /collections/shoulder\n[39]: /collections/neck\n[40]: /collections/elbow\n[41]: /collections/wrist\n[42]:\n[43]: /collections/ankle\n[44]: /collections/knee\n[45]: /collections/back\n[46]: /collections/hip\n[47]: /collections/gel-packs\n[48]: /collections/gel-packs\n[49]: /collections/clay-packs\n[5