[ Spinal & Orthopaedic ][104]\n    * [ Stroke Care ][105]\n    * [ Urological ][106]\n  * [ Medical Specialties ][107]\n    * Back to Medical Specialties\n    * [ Cardiac Surgery ][108]\n    * [ Electrophysiology ][109]\n    * [ Gastroenterology ][110]\n    * [ Hernia Repair ][111]\n    * [ Interventional Cardiology ][112]\n    * [ Spine Surgery ][113]\n  * [ Services & Solutions ][114]\n    * Back to Services & Solutions\n    * [ Ambulatory Surgery Center Resources ][115]\n    * [ Care Management Services ][116]\n    * [ Digital Connectivity IT Support ][117]\n    * [ Equipment Services & Support ][118]\n    * [ Innovation Lab ][119]\n    * [ Medtronic Healthcare Consulting ][120]\n    * [ Office-Based Sinus Surgery ][121]\n  * [ MRI Resources ][122]\n  * [ Reimbursement ][123]\n  * [ Clinical Research & Trials ][124]\n    * Back to Clinical Research & Trials\n    * [ External Research Program ][125]\n  * [ Education & Training ][126]\n  * [ eIFUs ][127]\n* [ Patients & Caregivers ][128]\n  * Back\n  * [ Overview ][129]\n  * [ Conditions ][130]\n    * Back to Conditions\n    * [ Conditions Overview ][131]\n    * [ Airway & Lung ][132]\n    * [ Brain ][133]\n    * [ Diabetes ][134]\n    * [ Digestive & Gastrointestinal ][135]\n    * [ Ear, Nose & Throat ][136]\n    * [ Heart & Vascular ][137]\n    * [ Pain ][138]\n    * [ Spine & Orthopaedic ][139]\n    * [ Urinary ][140]\n    * [ Women's Health ][141]\n  * [ Treatments & Therapies ][142]\n    * Back to Treatments & Therapies\n    * [ Treatments & Therapies Overview ][143]\n    * [ Airway & Lung ][144]\n    * [ Brain ][145]\n    * [ Diabetes ][146]\n    * [ Digestive & Gastrointestinal ][147]\n    * [ Ear, Nose & Throat ][148]\n    * [ Heart & Vascular ][149]\n    * [ Mouth & Dental ][150]\n    * [ Pain ][151]\n    * [ Spine & Orthopaedic ][152]\n    * [ Urinary ][153]\n    * [ Weight Loss & Obesity ][154]\n    * [ Women's Health ][155]\n  * [ Response Care ][156]\n  * [ DBS Sahayata ][157]\n* [ Our Company ][158]\n  * Back to Our Company\n  * [ Who we are ][159]\n  * [ Mission ][160]\n  * [ Leadership ][161]\n  * [ Key Facts ][162]\n  * [ History ][163]\n  * [ Locations ][164]\n  * [ Medtronic in India ][165]\n  * [ Research & Development (MEIC) ][166]\n  * [ Careers ][167]\n* [ Our Impact ][168]\n  * Back to Our Impact\n  * [ Our Impact ][169]\n  * [ Impact Reporting ][170]\n  * [ Health Equity ][171]\n  * [ Inclusion, Diversity & Equity ][172]\n  * [ Planet ][173]\n  * [ Communities ][174]\n\nHome\n\nWho we are\n\nEngineering the\u00a0\n\nextraordinary\n\n# Groundbreaking healthcare technology solutions for the most complex and challenging conditions.\n# Inspiring hope and new possibility in people all over the world.\n\n[ See how ][175]\n\nHEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY\n\n## Medtronic Engineering & Innovation Center (MEIC)\n\nMEIC symbolizes Medtronic\u2019s commitment to R&D and innovation in healthcare. It serves as a\ntechnology hub to deliver on our mission.\n\n[ Learn more ][176]\n\nPUT PATIENTS FIRST\n\n## See the signs, seize your destiny.\n\nThe #TimetoDecideDestiny campaign aims to create awareness about the importance of stroke prevention\nand timely treatment by reaching the nearest stroke-ready hospital.\n\n[ Learn more ][177]\n\nPATIENT EQUITY\n\n## Decode your rhythm\n\nLearn about bradycardia and leadless pacemaker therapy. Explore causes, symptoms, and care tips.\n#DecodeYourRhythm\n\n[ Learn more ][178]\n\nHealthCare Technology\n\n## Medtronic Global Diabetes Capability Center\n\nEngineering technology that simplifies diabetes care\n\n[ Learn more ][179]\nPrevious Next\n1. DiversityInc List\n2. Medtronic AI Compass\n3. Medtronic AI Compass\n4. Medtronic AI Compass\n\nHealthcare Professionals\n\n## Creating connections to optimize healthcare systems\n\nInnovation without collaboration isn't enough. We work closely with healthcare professionals to\nintroduce new therapies and optimize treatments.\n\n[ Read more ][180]\nPrevious Next\n1. Slide 1\n\nOur impact\n\n## Impact with purpose\n\n#### With 95,000-plus people in over 150 countries, we see extraordinary possibilities to further\n#### increase our positive impact in the world. We are committed to accelerating access to\n#### healthcare technology, advancing inclusion, diversity & equity, and protecting our planet.\n\n[ Learn more ][181]\n[------------------]\n\nCareers\n\n\u00a0\n\n## Join the team that powers the extraordinary\n\nWant to do work that has the potential to make the world a better place? Then join us. Speed and\ndecisiveness run through our DNA. Diverse perspectives inspire bold solutions to the world\u2019s most\ncomplex and challenging conditions. Our careers change lives.\n\n[ Join us ][182]\n* [ Open share options ][183]\n* [ Print ][184]\n* [ Email ][185]\n* [ Copy Link ][186]\n* [ Close share options ][187]\n[ Facebook ][188] [ Youtube ][189] [ LinkedIn ][190] [ Instagram ][191]\n\n### Patients and Caregivers\n* [Overview][192]\n* [Conditions][193]\n* [Treatments & Therapies][194]\n* [Response Care][195]\n* [DBS Sahayata][196]\n\n### Healthcare Professionals\n* [Overview][197]\n* [Therapies & Procedures][198]\n* [Products][199]\n\n### Our Company\n* [Who we are][200]\n* [Mission][201]\n* [Leadership][202]\n* [Key Facts][203]\n* [History][204]\n* [Locations][205]\n* [Medtronic in India][206]\n* [Research & Development (MEIC)][207]\n* [Voice Your Concern][208]\n* [Governance][209]\n* [Careers][210]\n\n### Our Impact\n* [Our Impact][211]\n* [Impact Reporting][212]\n* [Health Equity][213]\n* [Inclusion, Diversity & Equity][214]\n* [Planet][215]\n* [Communities][216]\n\n[Medtronic logo with tagline Engineering the extraordinary]\n* [Privacy Statement][217]\n* [Terms of Use][218]\n* [Contact][219]\nLast Updated February 2026 \u00a9 2026 Medtronic\n\n[1]: #\n[2]: #\n[3]: \n[4]: http://www.outdatedbrowser.com\n[5]: #\n[6]: #header-skip\n[7]: https://www.medtronic.com/in-en/index.html\n[8]: #\n[9]: javascript:void(0);\n[10]: https://www.medtronic.com/in-en/index.html\n[11]: https://adriatic.medtronic.com/xa-en/index.html\n[12]: https://www.medtronic.com/en-sa/index.html\n[13]: https://www.medtronic.com/ar-es/index.html\n[14]: https://www.medtronic.com/au-en/index.html\n[15]: https://www.medtronic.com/bd-en/index.html\n[16]: https://www.medtronic.com/be-fr/index.html\n[17]: https://www.medtronic.com/be-nl/index.html\n[18]: https://www.medtronic.com/br-pt/index.html\n[19]: https://www.medtronic.com/bg-bg/index.html\n[20]: https://www.medtronic.com/en-ca/index.html\n[21]: https://www.medtronic.com/fr-ca/index.html\n[22]: https://www.medtronic.com/me-en/index.html\n[23]: https://www.medtronic.com/cz-cs/index.html\n[24]: https://www.medtronic.com/cl-es/index.html\n[25]: https://www.medtronic.com/cn-zh/index.html\n[26]: https://www.medtronic.com/es-co/index.html\n[27]: https://www.medtronic.com/cr-es/index.html\n[28]: https://www.medtronic.com/rs-sr/index.html\n[29]: https://www.medtronic.com/dk-da/index.html\n[30]: https://www.medtronic.com/de-de/index.html\n[31]: https://www.medtronic.com/ec-es/index.html\n[32]: https://www.medtronic.com/es-es/index.html\n[33]: https://www.medtronic.com/en-ie/index.html\n[34]: https://www.medtronic.com/fr-fr/index.html\n[35]: https://www.medtronic.com/gr-el/index.html\n[36]: https://global.medtronic.com/xg-en/about/hong-kong.html\n[37]: https://www.medtronic.com/in-en/index.html\n[38]: https://www.medtronic.com/il-h"
