      "polished_summary": "Medtronic is a global leader in medical technology, dedicated to transforming healthcare through innovative solutions. The company specializes in advanced surgical technology and cardiac rhythm management, offering a wide range of products designed to improve patient outcomes across various medical fields. Targeting healthcare professionals and institutions, Medtronic aims to enhance the quality of care and accessibility of medical treatments worldwide.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Medtronic specializes in advanced surgical technology and cardiac rhythm management, which does not directly relate to the manufacturing or distribution of gel ice packs. There is no indication that they produce or sell products specifically for the gel ice pack market.",
