      "company_summary": "ActiveWrap specializes in the design and manufacture of innovative heat and ice wraps and packs tailored for pain management and recovery, developed by physical therapy professionals. Since 1997, the company has offered a range of products, including targeted wraps for knees, shoulders, backs, and more, catering to individuals recovering from injuries or surgeries across the healthcare, physical therapy, and sports medicine industries.",
