emen\n\nYER\n\nZambia\n\nUSD\n\nZimbabwe\n\nUSD\n\nFacebook\n\nInstagram\n\nTikTok\n\nYouTube\n\nKnee Wrap\n\nShoulder Wrap\n\nPost Op Shoulder Wrap\n\nBack Wrap\n\nWrist Wrap\n\nFoot &amp; Ankle Wrap\n\nHip Wrap\n\nNeck Wrap\n\nUltra Flex Ice &amp; Heat Packs\n\nLong Duration Ice Packs\n\nConnect\n\nContact\n\nDetailed FAQs\n\nHow to Videos\n\nOur Blog\n\nLogin\n\nCart\n\nElite Ice & Heat Wraps Designed by Physical Therapy Professionals\n\nGet targeted relief and lasting comfort with ice and heat packs designed by physical therapy pros\u2014perfect for pain, swelling, and recovery.\n\nEXPLORE PRODUCT\n\nFSA / HSA Approved Ice & Heat Wraps Designed by Physical Therapy Professionals\n\nEasy-Comfortable-Cost Effective pain management for post op knee surgery & knee pain. Stay mobile-reduce stiffness with our flexible ice wrap systems.\n\nEXPLORE PRODUCT\n\nLong Duration Ice Packs for Hours Of Post Op Pain Relief\n\nThe ice machine alternative! Lasting relief over 2+ hrs with these ice packs designed by the pros\u2014 Designed for pain, swelling and post op recovery. Ranked #1 Best Knee Ice Pack in independent PT testing .\n\nEXPLORE PRODUCT\n\nShoulder Ice & Heat Wraps Designed by Physical Therapy Professionals\n\nShoulder injuries are not easy to ice while keeping mobility. ActiveWrap\u00ae solves this with a no mess, pro-grade shoulder ice support delivering effective relief with max comfort. From rotator cuff injuries to dislocations & frozen shoulder. This is shoulder relief made easy .\n\nEXPLORE PRODUCT\n\nKnee Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nKnee Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 5,400.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 5,400.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 5,400.00\n\nShoulder Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nShoulder Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 5,400.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 5,400.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 5,400.00\n\nHip Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nHip Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 5,300.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 5,300.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 5,300.00\n\nBack Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nBack Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 3,900.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 3,900.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 3,900.00\n\nWrist Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nWrist Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 2,900.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 2,900.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 2,900.00\n\nFoot and Ankle Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nSale\n\nFoot and Ankle Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 2,000.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 3,200.00 INR\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 2,000.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 2,000.00\n\nSale\n\nNeck Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nNeck Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 2,000.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 2,000.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 2,000.00\n\nSold out\n\nUltra Flex Ice &amp; Heat Packs\n\nUltra Flex Ice &amp; Heat Packs\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 1,200.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 1,200.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 1,200.00\n\nLong Duration Ice Packs\n\nLong Duration Ice Packs\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 1,500.00 INR\n\nRegular price\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 1,500.00 INR\n\nUnit price\n\n&nbsp;per&nbsp;\n\n+ QUICK ADD - Rs. 1,500.00\n\nWHAT HURTS?\n\nBack Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nIS IDEAL FOR LOREM IPSUM IS SIMPLY DUMMY TEXT AND GREAT FOR\n\nShop product\n\nHip Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nIS IDEAL FOR LOREM IPSUM IS SIMPLY DUMMY TEXT AND GREAT FOR\n\nShop product\n\nFoot and Ankle Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nIS IDEAL FOR LOREM IPSUM IS SIMPLY DUMMY TEXT AND GREAT FOR\n\nShop product\n\nShoulder Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nIS IDEAL FOR LOREM IPSUM IS SIMPLY DUMMY TEXT AND GREAT FOR\n\nShop product\n\nNeck\n\nback\n\nHIP\n\nfOOT & aNKLE\n\nknee & leg\n\nwrist & hAND\n\nElbow\n\nHead\n\nshoulder\n\nNeck Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nShop product\nSold out\n\nKnee Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nIS IDEAL FOR LOREM IPSUM IS SIMPLY DUMMY TEXT AND GREAT FOR\n\nShop product\n\nWrist Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\n\nIS IDEAL FOR LOREM IPSUM IS SIMPLY DUMMY TEXT AND GREAT FOR\n\nShop product\n\nour ICE & HEAT PACKS\n\nUltra Flex Ice & Heat Packs\n\n\"No-Flow-Gel\" Soft & Flexible When Frozen\nLasts Up to 40 Minutes per Use\nDesigned for Heat and Cold Therapy Use EXPLORE PRODUCTS\n\nlong duration ice packs\n\nExceptional Post Surgery Pain & Swelling Relief 2hr to 4hr Long Lasting Cold Per Application Designed for Cold Therapy Use Only EXPLORE PRODUCTS\n\nOUR CUSTOMERS\n\n4.8 | 100K+ Happy Customers\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nWhich Do I Choose...Long Duration Ice or Ultra Flex Ice &amp; Heat Packs?\n\nWe Recommend Ultra Flex Ice & Heat Packs if :\nYou want flexibility- freedom to move while using for both cold and hot therapy.\nYou that want the lightest and softest elastic ice and heat pack on the planet.\nYou want ultimately moldability to contour the pack to your body.\nYou are looking for up to 40 minutes of cold (not just cool) therapy.\nYou do not have thick post-op dressing that may limit the cold or heat effects.\n\nWe Recommend the Long Duration Ice Packs if :\nYou want long-lasting cold therapy for 2-4 hrs (depending on pack size).\nYou want an ice pack that can still have flex without sacrificing deep, long-lasting cold therapy.\nYour are pre-or post- surgery and want to own a cost-effective, portable, easier alternative to a cold therapy machine.\nYou are a healthcare provider that wants to save your facility and patients money without sacrificing positive outcomes.\n\nWhat makes ActiveWrap Ultra Flex Ice Packs Different?\n\nThe ActiveWrap Ultra Flex advantage is our \"no flow/ no leak\" elastic gel pack composition.\nNo-Flow / No-Leak Gel Ice Pack \u2013 keeps cold therapy uniform and consistent, preventing bare spots or shifting.\nFlexible & Soft Design \u2013 lightweight reusable ice pack with UltraFlex non-migrating gel for comfort and contouring straight out of the freezer.\nLong-Lasting Cold with Heat Capability \u2013 retains cold longer and doubles as a hot and cold pack for injuries.\n1-Year Leak-Proof Guarantee \u2013 every pack is built to last and backed for 1 year for your peace of mind.\nModular & Reusable System \u2013 easily replace or swap UltraFlex packs of similar size between different ActiveWrap wraps.\nNon-Toxic Gel- 100% food grade gel, latex-free & FDA registered\n\nWhats Included With The ActiveWrap Ice Wrap / Ice Packs\n\nAll ActiveWrap Wraps come with everything you need for therapy. This includes:\nCompression Wrap/Support\nPack(s) - Ultra Flex Ice & Heat or Long Duration Ice\nProtective Slip-Covers to Hold Packs. *These are built into the shoulder ice wrap.\nNylon Drawstring Storage Bag\nOne Year Warranty\nThe wrap systems utilize a removable stick and secure design. This modular design is patented by ActiveWrap allowing for total customization of your hot or cold therapy.\nThe versatile wrap design allows you to purchase and recharge your ice wrap with additional ActiveWrap packs.\nAll Pack(s) sets come with:\nPack(s) - Ultra Flex Ice & Heat or Long Duration Ice\nNylon Slip-cover pouches for each pack\nDrawstring Storage Bag\n* Slip covers are designed for use only with the ActiveWrap system. These act as skin barriers for added customization and cold exposure protection.\n\nHow long do my ice packs keep cold? Warm?\n\nFOR COLD\nUltra Flex Ice & Heat Packs\n4.5\" x 6.5\" - 20 min\n7\" x 10\" - 40+ min\n10' x 10\" - 40+ min\n\nLong Duration Ice Packs\n7\" x 10\" -"
