enezuela USD $ ][254]\n* [ Vietnam VND \u20ab ][255]\n* [ Wallis & Futuna XPF Fr ][256]\n* [ Western Sahara MAD \u062f.\u0645. ][257]\n* [ Yemen YER \ufdfc ][258]\n* [ Zambia USD $ ][259]\n* [ Zimbabwe USD $ ][260]\n* [ Facebook ][261]\n* [ Instagram ][262]\n* [ TikTok ][263]\n* [ YouTube ][264]\n* [ Knee Wrap ][265]\n* [ Shoulder Wrap ][266]\n* [ Post Op Shoulder Wrap ][267]\n* [ Back Wrap ][268]\n* [ Wrist Wrap ][269]\n* [ Foot & Ankle Wrap ][270]\n* [ Hip Wrap ][271]\n* [ Neck Wrap ][272]\n* [ Ultra Flex Ice & Heat Packs ][273]\n* [ Long Duration Ice Packs ][274]\n* Connect\n* [ Contact ][275]\n* [ Detailed FAQs ][276]\n* [ How to Videos ][277]\n* [ Our Blog ][278]\n[ActiveWrap]\n][279]\n[ Login ][280][ Cart][281]\n[ Skip to product information ][282]\n* Open media 1 in modal\n* Open media 2 in modal\n* [Knee Support Wrap on Female Model, Active Wrap IceWrap, Ice Pack, ACL, MCL, Meniscus Repair\nRecovery]\nOpen media 3 in modal Play video [Knee Support Wrap on Female Model, Active Wrap IceWrap, Ice\nPack, ACL, MCL, Meniscus Repair Recovery]\n* [Easy to use reusable knee ice pack applied to a fit girls leg. Used to treat knee swelling after\nsurgery or injury by Active Wrap. Heat and Ice Therapy Wrap]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [ActiveWrap knee ice pack with a comparison chart highlighting its advantages over other knee ice\npacks. The best knee ice pack for after surgery.]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n* [Best Ankle Ice Pack, Reusable gel Heat and Ice Pack, ActiveWrap, Cold Therapy machine\nalternative, Ultra Flex Ice Pack]\nOpen media 6 in modal\n* Open media 7 in modal\n* [Best Knee Ice Wrap with 2 Heat and Ice Packs, Knee Cold Pack]\nOpen media 8 in modal\n1 / of 8\n* [Knee Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Knee Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Knee Support Wrap on Female Model, Active Wrap IceWrap, Ice Pack, ACL, MCL, Meniscus Repair\nRecovery]\n* [Easy to use reusable knee ice pack applied to a fit girls leg. Used to treat knee swelling after\nsurgery or injury by Active Wrap. Heat and Ice Therapy Wrap]\n* [ActiveWrap knee ice pack with a comparison chart highlighting its advantages over other knee ice\npacks. The best knee ice pack for after surgery.]\n* [Best Ankle Ice Pack, Reusable gel Heat and Ice Pack, ActiveWrap, Cold Therapy machine\nalternative, Ultra Flex Ice Pack]\n* [Knee Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Best Knee Ice Wrap with 2 Heat and Ice Packs, Knee Cold Pack]\n\n# Knee Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n## Knee Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n][283]\n[icon-1]\n\nPT DESIGNED\n\n[icon-2]\n\nU.S. OWNED &\nOPERATED\n\n[icon-3]\n\nCOMPRESSION\n\n[icon-4]\n\nREUSABLE\nPACKS\n\n[icon-5]\n\nFLEXIBLE\nWHEN FROZEN\n\n[icon-6]\n\nHEAT & COLD\nTHERAPY\n\n[icon-7]\n\n1-YEAR\nGUARANTEE\n\n[icon-8]\n\nEASY\nRETURNS\n\n[icon-9]\n\nFREE EXPRESS\nSHIPPING\n\nRegular price Rs. 5,400.00 INR\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price Rs. 5,400.00 INR\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][284] calculated at checkout.\nselect Size & Packs\n\n### ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACKS\n\nUniversal Fit\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Universal Fit\n(4 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\n\n### LONG DURATION ICE PACKS\n\nUniversal Fit\n(2 Duration Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Universal Fit\n(4 Duration Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity Quantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Knee Ice &amp; Heat Wrap Increase quantity for Knee Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n\nThe** ActiveWrap\u00ae Knee Ice & Heat Wrap** is the all-in-one solution for knee pain relief.\nActiveWrap\u00ae combines heat, ice, and compression therapy in an easy-to-use portable design. Unlike\ncold therapy machines or stiff ice pack alternatives ActiveWrap\u00ae allows you to move freely\npreventing stiffness and promoting better recovery. Whether you\u2019re recovering from surgery, dealing\nwith sports or work related injuries, or just looking to reduce daily aches and swelling, this\nversatile heat and ice wrap is built to deliver results. Designed by physical therapy professionals,\nthe wrap features soft, flexible gel packs that remain pliable when frozen, providing deeper, more\nconsistent coverage and staying cold longer than standard cold packs or hydrogel ice sleeves. The\nmodular ice pack design allows you to target pain exactly where you need it\u2014front, back, sides of\nthe knee, or even the calf, shin, and hamstring. Whether at home or on the go, the ActiveWrap\u00ae Knee\nIce & Heat Wrap makes continuous, natural pain relief simple and stress free.****\n\nFor those recovering from recent surgery or looking extra cold therapy, consider the **[ActiveWrap\u00ae\nLong Duration Ice Packs][285] **bundles. The long duration ice packs deliver over 4 hours of\nflexible, ice-cold pain relief and designed for use over post-surgical bandages. The long duration\nice packs only deliver cold therapy, for both hot and cold therapy select the standard packs.\n\n## SIZING\n* One size fits most (up to 32\" diameter leg).\n* Fits left or right knee and leg.\n* Holds tw"
