ease quantity for Post Op Shoulder Ice Wrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n\nThe **ActiveWrap\u00ae**** Post Op Shoulder Ice Wrap** is designed for post-rotator cuff or shoulder\nsurgery patients with limited arm mobility or those wearing a sling. The wrap, coupled with the\nlong-duration ice packs, offers a convenient, cost-effective alternative to bulky ice machines. Its\nunique design allows you to use it as an open drape for immediate post-surgery coverage of the\nshoulder, clavicle, and AC joint, or fold it into a closed sleeve for added compression and support\nas recovery progresses. The long-duration cold packs provide over two hours of continuous cold\ntherapy per freeze. While intended for only for cold use out of the box, it can be paired with\n[**ActiveWrap\u00ae Standard Ice & Heat Packs**][285] for a complete therapy solution.\n\n****\n\n## SIZING\n* One size fits most, straps fit a wide range of body sizes.\n* Fits either left or right shoulder for versatile use.\n* Designed for men and women of various body types.\n* Adjustable rotator cuff straps ensure a customized, secure fit.\n\n## How to use\n1. Insert the reusable cold packs into the pouch liners.\n2. Secure the packs and pouches to the inner of the wrap.\n3. Secure the chest strap for a snug, comfortable fit.\n4. Adjust th"
