]\n\nHEAT & COLD\nTHERAPY\n\n[icon-7]\n\n1-YEAR\nGUARANTEE\n\n[icon-8]\n\nEASY\nRETURNS\n\n[icon-9]\n\nFREE EXPRESS\nSHIPPING\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,200.00 INR\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price Rs. 3,200.00 INR\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][284] calculated at checkout.\nselect Size & Packs\n\n### ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACKS\n\nSmall-Medium\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Small-Medium\n(4 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Large-XLarge\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Large-XLarge\n(4 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity Quantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Foot and Ankle Ice &amp; Heat Wrap Increase quantity for Foot and Ankle Ice\n&amp; Heat Wrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n\nThe **ActiveWrap\u00ae Foot and Ankle & Ice & Heat Wrap** is a physical therapist\u2013designed solution for\nfast, targeted relief from ankle sprains, achilles tendonitis, plantar fasciitis, heel spurs,\npost-surgical pain, and more. Featuring two reusable ultra flex heat and ice packs and an adjustable\ncompression wrap, it delivers customizable hot or cold therapy that stays soft, pliable, and in\nplace for consistent comfort. Engineered for easy self-application, mobility, and a universal fit\nfor either foot, the wrap molds to your foot and ankle for soothing, mess-free relief\u2014making it an\nessential recovery tool for athletes, active lifestyles, and anyone managing foot or ankle pain.**\n\n## SIZING\n* Small-Medium: Women\u2019s sizes 5-11.5 | Men\u2019s: sizes 10 and under\n* Large-XLarge: Women\u2019s sizes 12 and over | Men\u2019s: sizes 10 and over\n\n## How to use\n\n[Load video: ]\n1. Insert the reusable hot or cold packs into the pouch liners.\n2. Secure the packs and pouches to the inner of the wrap.\n3. Secure around the foot and ankle for a snug, comfortable fit.\n4. Adjust the wrap as needed for increased compression.\n\n**ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACK USE**\n\nFor **cold therapy**, freeze packs for at least two hours before use. For **heat therapy**, warm\npacks in the microwave according to instructions on pack. [Click here for a quick video heating\ndemo.][285]\n\n**CARE AND CLEANING**\n\nWipe off all condensation before and after use. Do not use bleach on the product. Wrap can be\ncleaned with fresh water rinse and hang dry (no dryer).\n\n## Shipping information\n\nWe offer super fast, reliable shipping on all ActiveWrap\u00ae orders. **We provide FREE EXPRESS shipping\non U.S. orders over $50**, with tracking and real person customer service for your convenience. We\ncarefully package each wrap to ensure it arrives in perfect condition, ready to deliver effective\nhot or cold therapy right out of the box.\n\n## MEDICAL DISCLAIMER\n\nThis product is intended for hot or cold therapy use only and is not a substitute for professional\nmedical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult with a qualified healthcare provider\nregarding any medical concerns or before starting any"
