e Packs]\n* [Hip Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Total Hip Replacement, Hip Fractures, Hip Ice Wrap, Ice Machine for Hip, Snapping Hip, Hip\nBursitis, SI Joint Pain, Piriformis, Hip Dislocation]\n* [Hip Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Hip Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [The best hip ice wrap for hip surgery, active wrap, activewrap, best gifts for after hip surgery,\nhip pain relief, hip fractures, hip dislocations, hip cold wrap, cold therapy for the hip, hip\nreplacement pain, ]\n* [Best Ankle Ice Pack, Reusable gel Heat and Ice Pack, ActiveWrap, Cold Therapy machine\nalternative, Ultra Flex Ice Pack]\n* [Hip Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Hip Ice & Heat Wrap]\n\n# Hip Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n## Hip Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n][283]\n[icon-1]\n\nPT DESIGNED\n\n[icon-2]\n\nU.S. OWNED &\nOPERATED\n\n[icon-3]\n\nCOMPRESSION\n\n[icon-4]\n\nREUSABLE\nPACKS\n\n[icon-5]\n\nFLEXIBLE\nWHEN FROZEN\n\n[icon-6]\n\nHEAT & COLD\nTHERAPY\n\n[icon-7]\n\n1-YEAR\nGUARANTEE\n\n[icon-8]\n\nEASY\nRETURNS\n\n[icon-9]\n\nFREE EXPRESS\nSHIPPING\n\nRegular price Rs. 5,300.00 INR\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price Rs. 5,300.00 INR\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][284] calculated at checkout.\nselect Size & Packs\n\n### ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACKS\n\nUniversal Fit\n(1 Ultra Flex Pack) Variant sold out or unavailable Universal Fit\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\n\n### LONG DURATION ICE PACKS\n\nUniversal Fit\n(1 Duration Pack) Variant sold out or unavailable Universal Fit\n(2 Duration Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity Quantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Hip Ice &amp; Heat Wrap Increase quantity for Hip Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n\nThe **ActiveWrap\u00ae Hip Ice & Heat Wrap** is a versatile, medical-grade compress designed to deliver\nconvenient and comfortable pain relief and support for hip injuries and post-surgical recovery.\nIdeal for conditions include:\n* Total Hip Replacement\n* Partial Hip Replacement\n* Hip Arthroscopy\n* Hip Bursitis & Tendonitis\n* Hip Labrum Tears\n* Hip Fractures & Dislocations\n* Hip Pain and Soreness\n\nThis versatile hip support wrap is for left or right use and includes a large reusable hot and cold\npack, two adjustable compression straps, and a dual-pocket cover for easy temperature control. Its\nsoft, plush design ensures unsurpassed comfort and mobility, while the flat, compact ice packs save\nfreezer space compared to bulky machines or built in ice wraps. Trusted in top hospitals since 1997,\nthis cold and heat therapy solution helps reduce pain, muscle spasms, and reliance on\nmedications\u2014making it a cost-effective, portable, and professional-grade choice for anyone seeking\nhip pain relief and faster recovery.\n\nFor those recovering from recent surgery or looking extra cold therapy, consider the **[ActiveWrap\u00ae\nLong Duration Ice Packs][285] **bundles. The long duration ice packs deliver over 4+ hours of\nflexible, ice-cold pain relief and designed for use over post-surgical bandages. The long dura"
