Wrap Increase quantity for Neck Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n\nThe **ActiveWrap\u00ae Neck Ice & Heat Wrap** is an all-in-one solution for targeted neck pain relief.\nDesigned by physical therapy professionals, this reusable cervical heat and ice wrap combines hot\nand cold therapy with gentle compression to help reduce pain, inflammation, and stiffness while\nsupporting faster, more natural recovery. Unlike bulky cold therapy machines or stiff ice pack\nalternatives, ActiveWrap\u00ae allows you to stay comfortable and mobile during treatment\u2014making it ideal\nfor daily use at home, at work, or on the go.\n\nEmbedded in the wrap is ActiveWrap's **Ultra Flex gel pack** that remains soft and pliable when\nfrozen, delivering deeper, more consistent coverage while staying cold longer than standard ice\npacks or hydrogel sleeves. The wrap's **dual-sided design** gives you complete control over your\ntherapy: the **smooth ****vinyl side** provides deeper, longer-lasting cold therapy for swelling and\ninflammation, while the **soft plush side** delivers soothing comfort for heat therapy or mild\ncooling. A **stretchy, detachable adjustable strap** secures the wrap comfortably around the neck,\nensuring consistent contact and a hands-free fit for precise, effective treatment.\n\nWhether you\u2019re managing chronic neck pain, recovering from surgery, or relieving tension caused by\nposture, stress, or long hours at a desk, the **ActiveWrap\u00ae Neck Ice & Heat Wrap** delivers\nprofessional-grade relief trusted by clinics and rehab centers\u2014all in a simple, stress-free design.\n\nThe **ActiveWrap\u00ae Neck Ice & Heat Wrap **supports recovery from:\n* Cervical strain and sprains\n* Whiplash injuries\n* Herniated or bulging cervical discs\n* Tension headaches and migraines\n* Neck stiffness from poor posture or stress\n* Muscle spasms, soreness, and inflammation\n* Post-surgical neck recovery\n\n## SIZING\n* One size fits all.\n* Adjustable strap to position for any size body.\n\n## How to use\n1. Place the wrap around your neck\n2. Secure in place using the adjustable strap\n3. Place smooth, vinyl side of the wrap on skin for cold therapy\n4. Place soft, plush side of the wrap on skin for heat therapy\n\nFor **cold therapy**, freeze packs for at least two hours before use. For **heat therapy**, warm\npacks in the microwave according to instructions on pack. [Click here for a quick video heating\ndemo.][285]****\n\n**CARE AND CLEANING**\n\nWipe off all condensation before and after use. Do not use bleach on the product. Wrap can be\ncleaned with fresh water rinse and hang dry (no dryer).\n\n## Shipping information\n\nWe offer super fast, reliable shipping on all ActiveWrap\u00ae orders. **We provide FREE EXPRESS shipping\non U.S. orders over $50**, with tracking and real person customer service for your convenience. We\ncarefully package each wrap to ensure it arrives in perfect condition, ready to deliver effective\nhot or cold therapy right out of the box.\n\n## MEDICAL DISCLAIMER\n\nThis product is intended for hot or cold therapy use only and is not a substitute for professional\nmedical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult with a qualified healthcare provider\nregarding any medical concerns or before starting any new treatment.\n\n[ View full details ][286]\n[Neck"
