t-surgical cold therapy at home, in the hospital and in the PT clinic. Independently\ntested by trusted physical therapists as the longest-lasting cold pack wrap on the market,\nActiveWrap\u00ae long duration ice **stays cold and effective longer than standard packs** while still\nmaintaining flexibility. Ultimately reducing the need for expensive cryotherapy machines and\npotential side-effects of narcotic pain medications. These long lasting ice packs can be used over\npost-surgical bandages and are compatible with our ActiveWrap\u00ae wrap solutions. Each pack includes a\nprotective nylon cover to secure targeted relief in place while protecting the skin against\nover-exposure.\n\nPerfect for surgery centers, ortho hospitals, and surgery recovery at-home, this reusable long\nlasting cold pack offers an easy and affordable way to manage post-operative discomfort.\n\n## SIZING\n* Large (7\" X 10\"): knee & shoulder wraps\n* Large Square (10\" X 10\"): hip and back wraps\n* X-Large (13.5\" x 10\"): XXL back and hip wraps\n\n## How to use\n1. Place the pack in the freezer for at least two hours.\n2. Insert the frozen pack into the included nylon pouch.\n3. Attach the pack to the inside of your wrap.\n4. Use for up to 15 minutes or as directed by your medical care provider.\n5. Remove if skin becomes uncomf"
