Wrist Ice Pack,Wrist Ice Wrap, Arthritis, Hand Ice Wrap, Boxers fracture,\nHand fractures, scaphoid fracture, Wrist sprains, Activewrap Hand Heat Ice Wrap, DUPUYTRENS\nDISEASE]\n* [The best ice pack for wrist pain. Trigger Finger wrist wrap with ice & heat therapy. Arthritis\nrelief for hands]\n\n# Wrist Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n## Wrist Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n][283]\n[icon-1]\n\nEASY\nRETURNS\n\n[icon-2]\n\nFREE EXPRESS\nSHIPPING\n\n[icon-3]\n\n1-YEAR\nGUARANTEE\n\n[icon-4]\n\nHEAT & COLD\nTHERAPY\n\n[icon-5]\n\nCOMPRESSION\n\n[icon-6]\n\nFLEXIBLE\nWHEN FROZEN\n\n[icon-7]\n\nPT DESIGNED\n\n[icon-8]\n\nREUSABLE\nPACKS\n\n[icon-9]\n\nU.S. OWNED &\nOPERATED\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,900.00 INR\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price Rs. 2,900.00 INR\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][284] calculated at checkout.\nselect Packs\n\n### ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACKS\n\nUniversal Fit\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity Quantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Wrist Ice &amp; Heat Wrap Increase quantity for Wrist Ice &amp; Heat Wrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n\nThe **ActiveWrap\u00ae Wrist Ice & Heat Wrap** is a premium, all-in-one solution designed to provide\neffective relief from carpal tunnel, tendonitis, arthritis, sprains, swelling, and repetitive strain\ninjuries. Featuring a high-quality adjustable wrist wrap and two reusable hot and cold gel ice\npacks, this system allows you to easily switch between soothing heat or refreshing cold therapy\nbased on your recovery needs. Unlike traditional ice packs that shift or harden under pressure,\nActiveWrap\u2019s patented no-flow design keeps the gel evenly distributed, delivering consistent and\ntargeted therapy exactly where you need it. The soft, low-profile design makes it comfortable enough\nto wear during the day or even while sleeping, and its universal fit works for both the left and\nright hand. Developed with input from orthopedic physicians and physical therapists, and trusted by\ntop athletes, this wrist wrap is an essential tool for managing pain, reducing inflammation, and\nspeeding up recovery so you can get back to the activities you love.\n\n## SIZING\n* Designed to comfortably fit most wrist sizes.\n* Can be worn on either the left or right wrist.\n* Adjustable support and modular packs allow for custom fit.\n* Comfortable to wear during daily activities or at night while sleeping.\n\n## How to use\n\n[Load video: ]\n1. Insert the reusable hot or cold packs into the slip cover pouch liners.\n2. Secure the packs inside the wrap.\n3. Can use one or two packs at a time, depending on need.\n4. Fasten thin strap to wrap and slide hand in with thumb out.\n5. Secure thicker strap and adjust for a snug, comfortable fit.\n\n**ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACK USE**\n\nFor **cold therapy**, freeze packs for at least two hours before use. For **heat therapy**, warm\npacks in the microwave according to instructions on pack. [Click here for a quick video heating\ndemo.][285]\n"
