enezuela USD $ ][254]\n* [ Vietnam VND \u20ab ][255]\n* [ Wallis & Futuna XPF Fr ][256]\n* [ Western Sahara MAD \u062f.\u0645. ][257]\n* [ Yemen YER \ufdfc ][258]\n* [ Zambia USD $ ][259]\n* [ Zimbabwe USD $ ][260]\n* [ Facebook ][261]\n* [ Instagram ][262]\n* [ TikTok ][263]\n* [ YouTube ][264]\n* [ Knee Wrap ][265]\n* [ Shoulder Wrap ][266]\n* [ Post Op Shoulder Wrap ][267]\n* [ Back Wrap ][268]\n* [ Wrist Wrap ][269]\n* [ Foot & Ankle Wrap ][270]\n* [ Hip Wrap ][271]\n* [ Neck Wrap ][272]\n* [ Ultra Flex Ice & Heat Packs ][273]\n* [ Long Duration Ice Packs ][274]\n* Connect\n* [ Contact ][275]\n* [ Detailed FAQs ][276]\n* [ How to Videos ][277]\n* [ Our Blog ][278]\n[ActiveWrap]\n][279]\n[ Login ][280][ Cart][281]\n[ Skip to product information ][282]\n* [Best Shoulder Ice Wrap, Shoulder Ice Pack, Rotator Cuff Support, Rotator Cuff Wrap, Shoulder\nBursitis, Tendinitis, Frozen shoulder, adhesive capsulitis]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [ActiveWrap shoulder pain relief system with text and images of a woman wearing the best shoulder\nice wrap for rotator cuff injury, bursitis.tendonitis, shoulder dislocations, shoulder\nseparations..]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [Shoulder Ice Wrap, Shoulder Ice Pack,Frozen Shoulder Relief, Rotator Cuff Pain Relief, ActiveWrap\nShoulder Ice Wrap]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [Best Shoulder Ice Pack, Reusable Ice Pack, Shoulder Heating Pad, Shoulder Cold Wrap, ActiveWrap\nshoulder ice wrap on model.]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* Open media 5 in modal\n* Open media 6 in modal\n* [Best Ankle Ice Pack, Reusable gel Heat and Ice Pack, ActiveWrap, Cold Therapy machine\nalternative, Ultra Flex Ice Pack]\nOpen media 7 in modal\n* [Rotator_Cuff_Ice_Wrap-ActiveWrap]\nOpen media 8 in modal Play video [Rotator_Cuff_Ice_Wrap-ActiveWrap]\n1 / of 8\n* [Best Shoulder Ice Wrap, Shoulder Ice Pack, Rotator Cuff Support, Rotator Cuff Wrap, Shoulder\nBursitis, Tendinitis, Frozen shoulder, adhesive capsulitis]\n* [ActiveWrap shoulder pain relief system with text and images of a woman wearing the best shoulder\nice wrap for rotator cuff injury, bursitis.tendonitis, shoulder dislocations, shoulder\nseparations..]\n* [Shoulder Ice Wrap, Shoulder Ice Pack,Frozen Shoulder Relief, Rotator Cuff Pain Relief, ActiveWrap\nShoulder Ice Wrap]\n* [Best Shoulder Ice Pack, Reusable Ice Pack, Shoulder Heating Pad, Shoulder Cold Wrap, ActiveWrap\nshoulder ice wrap on model.]\n* [Shoulder Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Shoulder Ice & Heat Wrap]\n* [Best Ankle Ice Pack, Reusable gel Heat and Ice Pack, ActiveWrap, Cold Therapy machine\nalternative, Ultra Flex Ice Pack]\n* [Rotator_Cuff_Ice_Wrap-ActiveWrap]\n\n# Shoulder Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n## Shoulder Ice & Heat Wrap\n\n][283]\n\nActiveWrap Shoulder Ice Pack Wrap, with 2 Reusable Gel Packs for Shoulder Pain Relief, Rotator Cuff\nCold Therapy, Adjustable Compression Straps, Post-Surgery Must-Have\n\n[icon-1]\n\nFREE EXPRESS\nSHIPPING\n\n[icon-2]\n\nEASY\nRETURNS\n\n[icon-3]\n\n1-YEAR\nGUARANTEE\n\n[icon-4]\n\nHEAT & COLD\nTHERAPY\n\n[icon-5]\n\nCOMPRESSION\n\n[icon-6]\n\nFLEXIBLE\nWHEN FROZEN\n\n[icon-7]\n\nPT DESIGNED\n\n[icon-8]\n\nREUSABLE\nPACKS\n\n[icon-9]\n\nU.S. OWNED &\nOPERATED\n\nRegular price Rs. 5,300.00 INR\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336R\u0336s\u0336.\u0336 \u03364\u0336,\u03364\u03360\u03360\u0336.\u03360\u03360\u0336 \u0336I\u0336N\u0336R\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price Rs. 5,300.00 INR\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][284] calculated at checkout.\nselect Size & Packs\n\n### ULTRA FLEX ICE & HEAT PACKS\n\nSmall-Medium\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Large-XLarge\n(2 Ultra Flex Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\n\n### LONG DURATION ICE PACKS\n\nSmall-Medium\n(2 Duration Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable Large-XLarge\n(2 Duration Packs) Variant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity Quantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Shoulder Ice &amp; Heat Wrap Increase quantity for Shoulder Ice &amp; Heat\nWrap\nADD TO CART\n\n## Details\n* **Targeted Shoulder Compressio**n - Professionally designed by PT to support shoulder discomfort,\nrotator cuff care, and post-surgery needs. Provides focused cold compression for the shoulder\narea.\n* **Reusable Hot & Cold Gel Packs** - Includes two versatile gel packs for hot or cold applications.\nRetains flexibility when frozen, molding comfortably to the shoulder. Durable, reusable, and\nprovides long-lasting comfort for aches.\n* **Adjustable Compression Fit **- Designed with customizable straps for secure and supportive\ncompression around the shoulder. Wraps easily on the left or right side, providing hands-free\ncomfort with a snug fit that allows freedom of movement.\n* **Universal Fit for All-Day Use** - Designed to fit both men and women comfortably with all chest\nsizes. The sizes offers full shoulder coverage and secure support without restricting movement for\nextended wear throughout the day.\n* **Durable & Easy to Maintain **- Constructed with premium materials for dependable, long-lasting\nuse and simple maintenance. Lightweight design makes for hassle-free cleanup, "
          }
