Returns\n\n[Limited Lifetime Warranty]\n\nLimited Lifetime Warranty\n\n## Estimated Delivery\n\n**Free Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after discounts equals\n$100.00 or more.\n\n**$8.95 Flat Rate Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after\ndiscounts is $99.99 or less.\n\n**Estimated Arrival:** We make every effort to ship your order within 24hrs of receiving it (M-F).\nPlease allow up to 3 business days for our warehouse team to process your order plus 2-5 business\ndays for order delivery. You will receive a tracking number once your order has been fulfilled and a\nshipment label is generated. Please see our [Shipping Policy][34] for more information.\n\nSKU: 5-59105-00-0E\nDescriptionFeaturesCapacity / Dimensions\nPrevious Next\nDescription\n\nThis set of 2 high performance, reusable gel ice packs are designed to fit into our lunch bags and\ncoolers. Each ice pack is 250 grams and will extend the length of time food and drinks stay cold.\n\n**Product Disclaimer:**\n\nPlease note, the product you receive may differ slightly from the images shown. Our products are\nregularly updated and improved, and as part of this process, you may receive a newer version or\nupdated design.\n\n**Usage Warning:**\n\nDo not freeze if pack is punctured. Direct contact with the skin can result in frostbite so use a\ntemperature resistant glove or towel when handling. Discard pack if gel leaks.\n\n*Not meant for human consumption. Keep out of reach of pets. Direct skin contact with gel can cause\nskin sensitization. If contents come in contact with your skin or eyes, rinse right away with water.\n\n**The contents are a safe ice substitute but not a food product. The pack is not intended to be used\nas a therapeutic device/aid.\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Long Lasting Cold\n\u2022 Reusable\n\u2022 Non-toxic gel*\n\u2022 Puncture Resistant\nUSAGE WARNING: Do not freeze if pack is punctured. Direct contact with the skin can result in\nfrostbite so use a temperature resistant glove or towel when handling. Discard pack if if gel leaks.\n*Not meant for human consumption. Keep out of reach of pets. Direct skin contact with gel can cause\nskin sensitization. If contents come in contact with your skin or eyes, rinse right away with water.\n**The contents are a safe ice substitute but not a food product. The pack is not intended to be used\nas a therapeutic device/aid.\n\nCapacity / Dimensions\nExterior\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n6.75\" x 0.62\" x 7.00\"\n\n[pop can]\n\n**Capacity**\n\n[measuring scale]\n\n**Weight**\n\n1.17 lbs\n\n### YOU MAY ALSO LIKE\n\nBest Seller\n[ [Set of 2 High Performance Ice Packs (250g)]][35]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][36][Set of 2 High Performance Ice Packs (250g)][37]\nSale price$13.99\nBest Seller Sold out\n[ [Set of 2 High Performance Cooler Ice Packs (600g)]][38]\n[Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][39][Set of 2 High Performance Cooler Ice Packs (600g)][40]\nSale price$18.99\n\nDiscover\n* [About Us][41]\n* [Ambassadors][42]\n* [Newsroom][43]\n* [Blog][44]\n* [Shop in Canada][45]\n* [Shop in Australia][46]\n\nHelpful Resources\n* [ID.me Discounts][47]\n* [Product Testing & Claims][48]\n* [Food Safety Guide][49]\n* [Promotional Details][50]\n* [Giveaway Contest Rules][51]\n\nCustomer Support\n* [Contact Us][52]\n* [Help Center & FAQ's][53]\n* [Shipping and Handling][54]\n* [Returns and Exchanges][55]\n* [Warranty][56]\n* [Track Your Order][57]\n* [Wholesale & Bulk Inquiries][58]\n* [ International Distributor Form][59]\n* [Product Recall Information][60]\n\nFollow us\n\nStay up to date with product launches, fun content, giveaways and tutorials by following us on\nsocial!\n\nNewsletter\n\nJoin our email list and be the first to know about exclusive offers, promotions & new arrivals.\n\n[Subscribe][61]\n\n[Unsubscribe][62] from email anytime.\n\n[Notice of Financial Incentive][63]\n\n[Arctic Zone / Titan by Arctic Zone]\n\n[Accessibility][64] | [Terms