            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe're the #1 Soft Cooler Company in the U.S.*\n\n][2]\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][3]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][4]\n* [Titan PRO][5]\n* [SHOP][6]\n[ [LUNCH BAGS] LUNCH BAGS ][7]\n[ [COOLERS] COOLERS ][8]\n[ [ACCESSORIES] ACCESSORIES ][9]\n[ [SHOP ALL] SHOP ALL ][10]\n* [OUR STORY][11]\n* [BLOG][12]\nNavigation\nNewsletter[0 ][13]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][14]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][15]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][16]\n* SHOP\n* [LUNCH BAGS][17]\n* [COOLERS][18]\n* [ACCESSORIES][19]\n* [SHOP ALL][20]\n* [OUR STORY][21]\n* [BLOG][22]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][23]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][24]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][25]\n[ [SMS] ][26][Account][27]\nView all results\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\n[Start shopping][28]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler $29.99\n\nColor\n\nStripesNavy\nStripesNavy Stripes\nAdd to cart\n1. [Home][29]\n2. 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\nPrevious\nNext\n\n## [Arctic Zone\u00ae][30]\n\n# 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n\nSale price\n$29.99\n\nHonor America\u2019s 250th birthday with a limited edition cooler that\u2019s built for the way we celebrate -\noutdoors, together, and on the move.\n\n[Read more][31]\n\nColor:Stripes\nStripes [12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\nNavy [12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\nVariant\nStripes - $29.99Navy - $29.99\nSize: 12 Can\n[12 Can][32]\n[30 Can][33]\nQuantity: Decrease quantity Increase quantity\n\nRelated products\n\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][34] [\n[30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][35]\nAdd to cart\n\n[Free Shipping]\n\nFree Shipping Over $100\n\n[HOLIDAY RETURNS]\n\nEasy 30-Day Returns\n\n[Limited Lifetime Warranty]\n\nLimited Lifetime Warranty\n\n## Estimated Delivery\n\n**Free Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after discounts equals\n$100.00 or more.\n\n**$8.95 Flat Rate Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after\ndiscounts is $99.99 or less.\n\n**Estimated Arrival:** We make every effort to ship your order within 24hrs of receiving it (M-F).\nPlease allow up to 3 business days for our warehouse team to process your order plus 2-5 business\ndays for order delivery. You will receive a tracking number once your order has been fulfilled and a\nshipment label is generated. Please see our [Shipping Policy][36] for more information.\n\nSKU: 10006539\nDescriptionFeaturesCapacity / Dimensions\nPrevious Next\nDescription\n\nHonor America\u2019s 250th birthday with a cooler that\u2019s built for the way we celebrate -outdoors,\ntogether, and on the move. The Arctic Zone\u00ae 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Cooler, now available in two\nexclusive Americana prints, combines patriotic style with everyday performance for picnics, parades,\nbeach days, and backyard gatherings.\n\nThe patented Zipperless\u2122 lid makes it easy to grab what you need without fumbling with zippers. Flip\nopen the lid for quick access to food and drinks - perfect for when you\u2019re hosting or on the go.\n\nHigh density thermal insulation keeps food and drinks cold and fresh and the Ultra Safe\u00ae interior\nlining is leak proof and wipes clean easily. The interior also includes a HardBody\u00ae liner that\nprovides structure and helps protect contents.\n\nAn adjustable shoulder strap with shoulder pad makes carrying easy, whether you\u2019re heading to\nfireworks, a tailgate, or a day at the park. Lightweight and compact, it\u2019s the perfect grab\u2011and\u2011go\ncooler for any celebration.\n\nAlso available in a [30 can size.][37]\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Holds up to 12 cans\n\u2022 Zipperless\u2122 lid for quick, easy access\n\u2022 Removable HardBody\u00ae liner for added structure and protection\n\u2022 High density thermal insulation keeps items cold and fresh\n\u2022 Ultra Safe\u00ae leak proof, easy clean lining\n\u2022Adjustable shoulder strap with shoulder pad\n\u2022 Available in 2 limited edition Americana prints\n\nCapacity / Dimensions\nExterior\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n12.50\" x 7.38\" x 8.63\"\n\n[pop can]\n\n**Capacity**\n\n12 Can\n\n[measuring scale]\n\n**Weight**\n\n2.54 lbs\n\nEasy Access Without the Hassle\n\nEnjoy quick, easy access to drinks and snacks with our patented Zipperless\u2122 lid.\n\nGoodbye Soggy Sandwiches!\n\nThe SmartShelf\u2122 keeps sandwiches and snacks separate from the ice and cans below to help prevent\nsoggy food. The durable HardBody\u00ae liner removes for easy cleaning.\n\nEasy to Carry\n\nAn adjustable shoulder strap makes this insulated cooler easy to carry wherever you go\u2014perfect for\nbeach days, picnics, road trips and summer adventures.\n\nPrevious Next\n\n### YOU MAY ALSO LIKE\n\nBest Seller\n[ [Set of 2 High Performance Ice Packs (250g)]][38]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][39][Set of 2 High Performance Ice Packs (250g)][40]\nSale price$13.99\nBest Seller Sold out\n[ [Set of 2 High Performance Cooler Ice Packs (600g)]][41]\n[Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][42][Set of 2 High Performance Cooler Ice Packs (600g)][43]\nSale price$18.99\n\n# FAQ\n\nWhich cooler size should I choose?\n\nWe offer this limited edition Americana themed cooler in two sizes. The [12 can][44] capacity is\nperfect for small groups, lunches, and short excursions, while the [30 can][45] size is designed for\nday trips, tailgates, beach outings and larger gatherings. Both sizes feature our patented\nZipperless\u2122 lid for quick, easy access to drinks and snacks.\n\nWhat is the difference between the 12 can and 30 can coolers?\n\nThe primary difference is capacity and size. The [12 can][46] cooler offers a more compact design\nand is available in both solid and stripe patterns, while the [30 can][47] cooler provides extra\nstorage space. Aside from size and pattern options, both coolers share the same features.\n\nHow do I clean my cooler?\n\nMost food residues can be cleaned with mild soapy water and a damp cloth. This applies to both the\ninterior and exterior of the cooler. The durable HardBody\u00ae liner is removable for quick and easy\ncleanup. After cleaning, we recommend allowing the cooler to air dry completely.\n\nWill these coolers be restocked?\n\nThese coolers are part of our limited edition Americana collection, launching in celebration of\nAmerica's 250th. Because this is a limited edition release, make sure to grab one before they're\ngone!\n\nDo you offer warranty?\n\nYes, all of our products are covered under a limited lifetime warranty. To learn more, click\n[here][48]. To get in touch with our customer support team, click [here][49].\n\nShow product 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler Show product 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][50][12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler][51]\nSale price$29.99Quick view\nShow product 30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler Show product 30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n[30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][52][30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler][53]\nSale price$39.99\nShow product 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler Show product 12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][54][12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler][55]\nSale price$29.99Quick view\n\nDiscover\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Ambassadors][57]\n* [Newsroom][58]\n* [Blog][59]\n* [Shop in Canada][60]\n* [Shop in Australia][61]\n\nHelpful Resources\n* [ID.me Discounts][62]\n* [Product Testing & Claims][63]\n* [Food Safety Guide][64]\n* [Promotional Details][65]\n* [Giveaway Contest Rules][66]\n\nCustomer Support\n* [Contact Us][67]\n* [Help Center & FAQ's][68]\n* [Shipping and Handling][69]\n* [Returns and Exchanges][70]\n* [Warranty][71]\n* [Track Your Order][72]\n* [Wholesale & Bulk Inquiries][73]\n* [ International Distributor Form][74]\n* [Product Recall Information][75]\n\nFollow us\n\nStay up to date with product launches, fun content, giveaways and tutorials by following us on\nsocial!\n\nNewsletter\n\nJoin our email list and be the first to know about exclusive offers, promotions & new arrivals.\n\n[Subscribe][76]\n\n[Unsubscribe][77] from email anytime.\n\n[Notice of Financial Incentive][78]\n\n[Arctic Zone / Titan by Arctic Zone]\n\n[Accessibility][79] | [Terms of Service][80] | [Privacy Policy][81] | [California Privacy\nNotice][82] | [Patents][83]\n\n[ [California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon]Your Privacy Choices][84]\n\n[ Accessibility Settings][85]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 \u00b7 California Innovations Inc. \u00b7 Arctic Zone Products\n\nWe accept\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [JCB] [Maestro] [Mastercard]\n[PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Union Pay] [Venmo] [Visa]\n\nCookie policy\n\nI agree to the processing of my data in accordance with the conditions set out in the policy of\nPrivacy.\n\nAccept Decline\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog/why-we-are-the-number-one-soft-sided-cooler-company-in-the-united-state\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/titanbyarcticzone\n[5]: /pages/titanpro\n[6]: /collections/arctic-zone-all-products\n[7]: https://arcticzone.com/collections/arctic-zone-lunch-bags\n[8]: /collections/americana-coolers\n[9]: /products/set-of-2-high-performance-ice-packs\n[10]: /collections/arctic-zone-all-products\n[11]: /pages/about-us\n[12]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog\n[13]: /cart\n[14]: https://arcticzone.com/\n[15]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/where-to-shop-titan-coolers-in-canada\n[16]: https://titancoolers.com.au/\n[17]: https://arcticzone.com/collections/arctic-zone-lunch-bags\n[18]: /collections/americana-coolers\n[19]: /products/set-of-2-high-performance-ice-packs\n[20]: /collections/arctic-zone-all-products\n[21]: /pages/about-us\n[22]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog\n[23]: https://arcticzone.com/\n[24]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/where-to-shop-titan-coolers-in-canada\n[25]: https://titancoolers.com.au/\n[26]: https://arcticzone.attn.tv/p/ksH/landing-page\n[27]: /account/login\n[28]: /collections/all\n[29]: /\n[30]: /collections/vendors?q=Arctic%20Zone%C2%AE\n[31]: #az-read-more\n[32]: