            "url": "https://arcticzone.com/products/arctic-zone-chrome-lunch-box-combo",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe're the #1 Soft Cooler Company in the U.S.*\n\n][2]\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][3]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][4]\n* [Titan PRO][5]\n* [SHOP][6]\n[ [LUNCH BAGS] LUNCH BAGS ][7]\n[ [COOLERS] COOLERS ][8]\n[ [ACCESSORIES] ACCESSORIES ][9]\n[ [SHOP ALL] SHOP ALL ][10]\n* [OUR STORY][11]\n* [BLOG][12]\nNavigation\nNewsletter[0 ][13]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][14]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][15]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][16]\n* SHOP\n* [LUNCH BAGS][17]\n* [COOLERS][18]\n* [ACCESSORIES][19]\n* [SHOP ALL][20]\n* [OUR STORY][21]\n* [BLOG][22]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][23]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][24]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][25]\n[ [SMS] ][26][Account][27]\nView all results\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\n[Start shopping][28]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\nChrome Lunch Box Combo $24.99\n\nColor\n\nSilverMidnight\nSilverMidnight Silver\nAdd to cart\n1. [Home][29]\n2. Chrome Lunch Box Combo\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\n[Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\nPrevious\nNext\n\n## [Arctic Zone\u00ae][30]\n\n# Chrome Lunch Box Combo\n\nSale price\n$24.99\n\nFun, flashy, and functional\u2014this chrome lunch box has it all! Includes a food storage container and\nice pack, making it the perfect lunchtime solution for school days, camp fun and beyond.\n\n[Read more][31]\n\nColor:Silver\nSilver [Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\nMidnight [Chrome Lunch Box Combo]\nVariant\nSilver - $24.99Midnight - $24.99\nQuantity: Decrease quantity Increase quantity\n\nRelated products\n\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][32] [\n[30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][33]\nAdd to cart\n\n[Free Shipping] Free Shipping\n\nOn all orders of $100 or more.\n\n[30-Day Returns] 30-Day Returns\n\nReturns & Exchanges.\n\n## Shipping Costs & Estimated Delivery\n\n**Free Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after discounts equals\n$100.00 or more.\n\n**$8.95 Flat Rate FedEx Ground Home Delivery Service** applies to all orders where the cart value\nbefore taxes and after discounts is $99.99 or less.\n\n**Estimated Arrival:** After your order has been processed and shipped it may take 1 - 2 business\ndays* to arrive at the final destination. We make every effort to ship your order within 24hrs of\nreceiving it (M-F). A tracking number will be emailed to you as soon as your order has shipped.\n\n## 30-Day Returns & Exchanges\n\nCustomer satisfaction is extremely important to us. If you'd like to exchange your item or are\nunhappy with your purchase within the first 30 days of recieving your order, no problem! We have a\nsimple, fast, free and easy return process. Please review our [Return & Refund Policy][34] for more\ndetailed information.\n\nSKU: 10005964\nDescriptionFeaturesCapacity / Dimensions\nPrevious Next\nDescription\n\nThis chrome lunch box is as fun as it is functional. It includes a sandwich-sized food storage\ncontainer and high performance ice pack for taking meals on the go. From school to summer camp and\nbeyond, the fun iridescent exterior is sure to catch everyone\u2019s eye.\n\nThe interior of the lunch box can accommodate most bento style containers and features high density\nthermal insulation to keep contents cold and fresh as well as an Ultra Safe\u00ae leak proof*, easy clean\nlining with Microban\u00ae to help protect against odors and stains. It also includes a zippered front\npocket to hold napkins, cutlery and other essentials, as well as a padded handle for easy carrying.\n\nChoose from a silver or midnight blue chrome finish that will dazzle all!\n\n*zipper is not leak proof\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Combo includes a 650mL food container and 210g high performance ice pack\n\u2022 Can fit most bento style containers (sold separately)\n\u2022 Interior dimensions: 7.25 x 9.5 x 3.5 inches (L x W x H)\n\u2022 High density thermal insulation keeps food and drinks cold and fresh\n\u2022 Ultra Safe\u00ae leak proof*, easy clean lining with Microban\u00ae\n\u2022 Exterior zippered pocket holds cutlery, napkins and other essentials\n\u2022 Padded handle\n\u2022 Choose from silver or blue chrome finish\n\n\u2022 *zipper is not leak proof\n\nCapacity / Dimensions\nExterior Interior\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n6.89\" x 4.13\" x 9.84\"\n\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n7.25\" x 3.5\" x 9.5\"\n\n[pop can]\n\n**Capacity**\n\n194oz\n\n[measuring scale]\n\n**Weight**\n\n1.01 lbs\n\n### Grab it, Pack it, Love it\n\nIridescent Chrome Finish\n\nStand out from the lunch crowd. With its glossy chrome exterior in silver or midnight blue, this\nlunch box was made to shine.\n\nKeeps Lunches Cold\n\nHigh density thermal insulation locks in the chill to keep food and drinks cold and fresh until\nlunchtime.\n\nIncludes Accessories\n\nThis lunch box combo includes a reusable food storage container and a high performance ice pack \u2014\neverything you need to keep lunch fresh while on-the-go.\n\nEasy to Carry\n\nDesigned for real life (and little hands), the padded handle makes it easy to grab and go, whether\nyour kids are headed to school, camp or a weekend adventure.\n\nEasy to Clean\n\nSpills happen! The interior lining is leak proof*, wipes clean easily and has Microban\u00ae\nantimicrobial protection to help prevent the build-up of odors and stains.\n\nExtra Pocket\n\nLunch isn\u2019t just about food. Stash utensils, hand sanitizer, special notes or surprise treats in the\nconvenient front pocket.\n\n## Here's What People Are Saying\n\n### Product Reviews\n\nDiscover\n* [About Us][35]\n* [Ambassadors][36]\n* [Newsroom][37]\n* [Blog][38]\n* [Shop in Canada][39]\n* [Shop in Australia][40]\n\nHelpful Resources\n* [ID.me Discounts][41]\n* [Product Testing & Claims][42]\n* [Food Safety Guide][43]\n* [Promotional Details][44]\n* [Giveaway Contest Rules][45]\n\nCustomer Support\n* [Contact Us][46]\n* [Help Center & FAQ's][47]\n* [Shipping and Handling][48]\n* [Returns and Exchanges][49]\n* [Warranty][50]\n* [Track Your Order][51]\n* [Wholesale & Bulk Inquiries][52]\n* [ International Distributor Form][53]\n* [Product Recall Information][54]\n\nFollow us\n\nStay up to date with product launches, fun content, giveaways and tutorials by following us on\nsocial!\n\nNewsletter\n\nJoin our email list and be the first to know about exclusive offers, promotions & new arrivals.\n\n[Subscribe][55]\n\n[Unsubscribe][56] from email anytime.\n\n[Notice of Financial Incentive][57]\n\n[Arctic Zone / Titan by Arctic Zone]\n\n[Accessibility][58] | [Terms of Service][59] | [Privacy Policy][60] | [California Privacy\nNotice][61] | [Patents][62]\n\n[ [California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon]Your Privacy Choices][63]\n\n[ Accessibility Settings][64]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 \u00b7 California Innovations Inc. \u00b7 Arctic Zone Products\n\nWe accept\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [JCB] [Maestro] [Mastercard]\n[PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Union Pay] [Venmo] [Visa]\n\nCookie policy\n\nI agree to the processing of my data in accordance with the conditions set out i