            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe're the #1 Soft Cooler Company in the U.S.*\n\n][2]\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][3]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][4]\n* [Titan PRO][5]\n* [SHOP][6]\n[ [LUNCH BAGS] LUNCH BAGS ][7]\n[ [COOLERS] COOLERS ][8]\n[ [ACCESSORIES] ACCESSORIES ][9]\n[ [SHOP ALL] SHOP ALL ][10]\n* [OUR STORY][11]\n* [BLOG][12]\nNavigation\nNewsletter[0 ][13]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][14]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][15]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][16]\n* SHOP\n* [LUNCH BAGS][17]\n* [COOLERS][18]\n* [ACCESSORIES][19]\n* [SHOP ALL][20]\n* [OUR STORY][21]\n* [BLOG][22]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][23]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][24]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][25]\n[ [SMS] ][26][Account][27]\nView all results\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\n[Start shopping][28]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\nKids Lunch Bucket Combo $22.99\n\nColor\n\nSpace OdysseySharkUnicorn Princess\nSpace OdysseySharkUnicorn Princess Space Odyssey\nAdd to cart\n1. [Home][29]\n2. Kids Lunch Bucket Combo\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\n[Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\nPrevious\nNext\n\n## [Arctic Zone\u00ae][30]\n\n# Kids Lunch Bucket Combo\n\nSale price\n$22.99\n\nMade for kids on the go, this Arctic Zone\u00ae Lunch Box comes in 3 playful prints and features two\ncompartments, a food storage container and ice pack\u2014perfect for school, camp, and everyday\nadventures!\n\n[Read more][31]\n\nColor:Space Odyssey\nSpace Odyssey [Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\nShark [Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\nUnicorn Princess [Kids Lunch Bucket Combo]\nVariant\nSpace Odyssey - $22.99Shark - $22.99Unicorn Princess - $22.99\nQuantity: Decrease quantity Increase quantity\n\nRelated products\n\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][32] [\n[30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][33]\nAdd to cart\n\n[Free Shipping] Free Shipping\n\nOn all orders of $100 or more.\n\n[30-Day Returns] 30-Day Returns\n\nReturns & Exchanges.\n\n## Shipping Costs & Estimated Delivery\n\n**Free Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after discounts equals\n$100.00 or more.\n\n**$8.95 Flat Rate FedEx Ground Home Delivery Service** applies to all orders where the cart value\nbefore taxes and after discounts is $99.99 or less.\n\n**Estimated Arrival:** After your order has been processed and shipped it may take 1 - 2 business\ndays* to arrive at the final destination. We make every effort to ship your order within 24hrs of\nreceiving it (M-F). A tracking number will be emailed to you as soon as your order has shipped.\n\n## 30-Day Returns & Exchanges\n\nCustomer satisfaction is extremely important to us. If you'd like to exchange your item or are\nunhappy with your purchase within the first 30 days of recieving your order, no problem! We have a\nsimple, fast, free and easy return process. Please review our [Return & Refund Policy][34] for more\ndetailed information.\n\nSKU: 10005958\nDescriptionFeaturesCapacity / Dimensions\nPrevious Next\nDescription\n\nThe Arctic Zone\u00ae Lunch Bucket makes lunchtime extra fun with three playful prints to choose from!\nDesigned just for kids, it features two compartments with a zippered mesh divider, a sandwich-sized\nfood storage container, and a high performance ice pack. With a padded handle for easy carrying,\nit's perfect for school, camp and every adventure in between!\n\nThe interior of the lunch box features high density thermal insulation to keep food and drinks cold\nand fresh as well as an Ultra Safe\u00ae easy clean lining with Microban\u00ae to help protect against odors\nand stains. The bottom compartment of the lunch box is leak proof* in case of any spills. For taller\nitems such as a thermos or water bottle, you can unzip the mesh divider to create one large\ncompartment.\n\n*zipper is not leak proof\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Combo includes a 650mL food container and 210g high performance ice pack\n\u2022 Includes 2 compartments with zippered, mesh compartment divider for keeping food and drinks\nseparate\n\u2022 High density thermal insulation keeps food and drinks cold and fresh\n\u2022Ultra Safe\u00ae leak proof*, easy clean lining with Microban\u00ae\n\u2022 Leak proof* bottom compartment contains spills and messes\n\u2022Padded handle\n\u2022 Choose from 3 fun kid friendly prints\n\n*zipper is not leak proof\n\nCapacity / Dimensions\nExterior Interior\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n8.27\" x 6.02\" x 7.40\"\n\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n8.25\" x 5.5\" x 4\"\n\n[pop can]\n\n**Capacity**\n\n169oz (Lid: 34oz, Bottom: 135oz)\n\n[measuring scale]\n\n**Weight**\n\n0.93 lbs\n\n### Grab it, Pack it, Love it\n\nIncludes Accessories\n\nGrab and go! This lunch box combo includes a reusable food storage container and high performance\nice pack \u2014 everything you need to keep lunch fresh and delicious.\n\nDual Compartment Design\n\nUse the mesh divider to separate food and drinks or unzip it to create one large compartment for\ntaller bottles or thermoses.\n\nKeeps Meals Fresh\n\nHigh density thermal insulation locks in the chill to keep food and drinks cold and fresh until\nlunchtime.\n\nEasy to Pack\n\nThe bucket shaped design with wide opening makes packing easy.\n\nEasy to Carry\n\nMade for everyday adventures and small hands, the padded top handle makes carrying easy, whether\nyour kids are off to school, camp or a fun weekend outing.\n\nEasy to Clean\n\nSticky snacks and spills are no match for this lunch box. Its leak proof* interior lining with\nMicroban\u00ae helps protect against odors and stains and easily wipes clean with a damp cloth.\n\n## Here's What People Are Saying\n\n### Product Reviews\n\nDiscover\n* [About Us][35]\n* [Ambassadors][36]\n* [Newsroom][37]\n* [Blog][38]\n* [Shop in Canada][39]\n* [Shop in Australia][40]\n\nHelpful Resources\n* [ID.me Discounts][41]\n* [Product Testing & Claims][42]\n* [Food Safety Guide][43]\n* [Promotional Details][44]\n* [Giveaway Contest Rules][45]\n\nCustomer Support\n* [Contact Us][46]\n* [Help Center & FAQ's][47]\n* [Shipping and Handling][48]\n* [Returns and Exchanges][49]\n* [Warranty][50]\n* [Track Your Order][51]\n* [Wholesale & Bulk Inquiries][52]\n* [ International Distributor Form][53]\n* [Product Recall Information][54]\n\nFollow us\n\nStay up to date with product launches, fun content, giveaways and tutorials by following us on\nsocial!\n\nNewsletter\n\nJoin our email list and be the first to know about exclusive offers, promotions & new arrivals.\n\n[Subscribe][55]\n\n[Unsubscribe][56] from email anytime.\n\n[Notice of Financial Incentive][57]\n\n[Arctic Zone / Titan by Arctic Zone]\n\n[Accessibility][58] | [Terms of Service][59] | [Priv