            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe're the #1 Soft Cooler Company in the U.S.*\n\n][2]\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][3]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][4]\n* [Titan PRO][5]\n* [SHOP][6]\n[ [LUNCH BAGS] LUNCH BAGS ][7]\n[ [COOLERS] COOLERS ][8]\n[ [ACCESSORIES] ACCESSORIES ][9]\n[ [SHOP ALL] SHOP ALL ][10]\n* [OUR STORY][11]\n* [BLOG][12]\nNavigation\nNewsletter[0 ][13]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][14]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][15]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][16]\n* SHOP\n* [LUNCH BAGS][17]\n* [COOLERS][18]\n* [ACCESSORIES][19]\n* [SHOP ALL][20]\n* [OUR STORY][21]\n* [BLOG][22]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][23]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][24]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][25]\n[ [SMS] ][26][Account][27]\nView all results\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\n[Start shopping][28]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\nUrban Lunch Box Combo $30.99\n\nColor\n\nCheckeredTrue BlueTutti Frutti\nCheckeredTrue BlueTutti Frutti Checkered\nAdd to cart\n1. [Home][29]\n2. Urban Lunch Box Combo\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\n[Urban Lunch Box Combo]\nPrevious\nNext\n\n## [Arctic Zone\u00ae][30]\n\n# Urban Lunch Box Combo\n\nSale price\n$30.99\n\nJust add lunch\u2014the Urban Lunch Box comes complete with a food storage container and ice pack to keep\nmeals fresh. Perfect for school, field trips, after-school practice, summer camp and more!\n\n[Read more][31]\n\nColor:Checkered\nCheckered [Urban Lunch Box Combo]\nTrue Blue [Urban Lunch Box Combo]\nTutti Frutti [Urban Lunch Box Combo]\nVariant\nCheckered - $30.99True Blue - $30.99Tutti Frutti - $30.99\nQuantity: Decrease quantity Increase quantity\n\nRelated products\n\n[12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][32] [\n[30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]\n30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler\n][33]\nAdd to cart\n\n[Free Shipping] Free Shipping\n\nOn all orders of $100 or more.\n\n[30-Day Returns] 30-Day Returns\n\nReturns & Exchanges.\n\n## Shipping Costs & Estimated Delivery\n\n**Free Shipping** applies to all orders where the cart value before taxes and after discounts equals\n$100.00 or more.\n\n**$8.95 Flat Rate FedEx Ground Home Delivery Service** applies to all orders where the cart value\nbefore taxes and after discounts is $99.99 or less.\n\n**Estimated Arrival:** After your order has been processed and shipped it may take 1 - 2 business\ndays* to arrive at the final destination. We make every effort to ship your order within 24hrs of\nreceiving it (M-F). A tracking number will be emailed to you as soon as your order has shipped.\n\n## 30-Day Returns & Exchanges\n\nCustomer satisfaction is extremely important to us. If you'd like to exchange your item or are\nunhappy with your purchase within the first 30 days of recieving your order, no problem! We have a\nsimple, fast, free and easy return process. Please review our [Return & Refund Policy][34] for more\ndetailed information.\n\nSKU: 10005966\nDescriptionFeaturesCapacity / Dimensions\nPrevious Next\nDescription\n\nThe Arctic Zone\u00ae Urban Lunch Box includes a food storage container and reusable ice pack to keep\nmeals fresh on-the- go. It\u2019s the perfect lunchtime solution for school, summer camp and beyond with\nthree fun options: True Blue, Rainbow Checkered and Tutti Frutti.\n\nThe lunch box accommodates most bento style containers and features high density thermal insulation\nto keep contents cold and fresh as well as an Ultra Safe\u00ae leak proof*, easy clean lining with\nMicroban\u00ae to help protect against odors and stains.\n\nIt also includes a zippered accessory pocket for secret lunchtime notes, snacks or cutlery, along\nwith carry handles and a removable, adjustable shoulder strap for two easy ways to transport.\n\n*zipper is not leak proof\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Combo includes a 650mL food container and 210g high performance ice pack\n\u2022 Lunch box can fit most bento style containers (sold separately)\n\u2022 High density thermal insulation keeps food and drinks cold and fresh\n\u2022 Ultra Safe\u00ae leak proof*, easy clean lining with Microban\u00ae\n\u2022 Exterior zippered pocket holds cutlery, napkins and other essentials\n\u2022 Carry handles\n\u2022 Removable, adjustable shoulder strap\n\u2022 Interior dimensions: 7.5 x 9.5 x 3.5 inches (L x W x H)\n\u2022 Choose from 3 fun kid-friendly styles: True Blue, Rainbow Checkered and Tutti Frutti\n\n*zipper is not leak proof\n\nCapacity / Dimensions\nExterior Interior\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n7.87\" x 4.17\" x 10.24\"\n\n[dimensions]\n\n**Length x Depth x Height**\n\n7.5\" x 3.5\" x 9.5\"\n\n[pop can]\n\n**Capacity**\n\n169oz\n\n[measuring scale]\n\n**Weight**\n\n1.08 lbs\n\n### Grab it, Pack it, Love it\n\nRoomy Design\n\nFit your meals and snacks with ease\u2014perfect for bento boxes, thermoses and bottles.\n\nKeeps Meals Fresh\n\nHigh density thermal insulation locks in the chill to keep food and drinks cold and fresh until\nlunchtime.\n\nIncludes Accessories\n\nIncludes a reusable food container and high performance ice pack to make meal prep and taking lunch\non-the-go simple and easy.\n\nEasy to Clean\n\nSpills? No problem. The leak proof*, easy clean lining with Microban\u00ae helps protect against stains\nand odors.\n\nEasy to Carry\n\nYou choose \u2013 carry the lunch box by its handles or use the adjustable strap for hands-free\nconvenience.\n\nStorage Pocket\n\nA zippered front pocket provides extra space for napkins, utensils, or little extras\n\n## Here's What People Are Saying\n\n### Product Reviews\n\nDiscover\n* [About Us][35]\n* [Ambassadors][36]\n* [Newsroom][37]\n* [Blog][38]\n* [Shop in Canada][39]\n* [Shop in Australia][40]\n\nHelpful Resources\n* [ID.me Discounts][41]\n* [Product Testing & Claims][42]\n* [Food Safety Guide][43]\n* [Promotional Details][44]\n* [Giveaway Contest Rules][45]\n\nCustomer Support\n* [Contact Us][46]\n* [Help Center & FAQ's][47]\n* [Shipping and Handling][48]\n* [Returns and Exchanges][49]\n* [Warranty][50]\n* [Track Your Order][51]\n* [Wholesale & Bulk Inquiries][52]\n* [ International Distributor Form][53]\n* [Product Recall Information][54]\n\nFollow us\n\nStay up to date with product launches, fun content, giveaways and tutorials by following us on\nsocial!\n\nNewsletter\n\nJoin our email list and be the first to know about exclusive offers, promotions & new arrivals.\n\n[Subscribe][55]\n\n[Unsubscribe][56] from email anytime.\n\n[Notice of Financial Incentive][57]\n\n[Arctic Zone / Titan by Arctic Zone]\n\n[Accessibility][58] | [Terms of Service][59] | [Privacy Policy][60] | [California Privacy\nNotice][61] | [Patents][62]\n\n[ [California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon]Your Privacy Choices][63]\n\n[ Accessibility Settings][64]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 \u00b7 California Innovations Inc. \u00b7 Arctic Zone Products\n\nWe accept\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [JCB] [Maestro] [Mastercard]\n[PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Union Pay] [Venmo] [Visa]\n\nCookie policy\n\nI agree to the processing of my da