            "url": "https://arcticzone.com/about",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe're the #1 Soft Cooler Company in the U.S.*\n\n][2]\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][3]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][4]\n* [Titan PRO][5]\n* [Shop][6]\n[ [Arctic Zone\u00ae] Arctic Zone\u00ae ][7]\n[ [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae] Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae ][8]\n[ [Titan PRO Outdoor Gear\u2122] Titan PRO Outdoor Gear\u2122 ][9]\n* [Our Story][10]\n* [Blog][11]\nNavigation\nNewsletter[0 ][12]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][13]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][14]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][15]\n* Shop\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][16]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][17]\n* [Titan PRO Outdoor Gear\u2122][18]\n* [Our Story][19]\n* [Blog][20]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][21]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][22]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][23]\n[ [SMS] ][24][Account][25]\nView all results\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\n[Start shopping][26]\n\n### Our Story\n\n### Get to Know Us\n\nSince 1986, we\u2019ve been driven by one mission: build insulated gear that outperforms expectations.\nWhat began as a simple idea \u2013 to make products that people love - has grown into nearly 40 years of\ncategory defining innovation.\n\nToday, we\u2019re proud to be the #1 Soft-Sided Cooler Company in the U.S., setting the standard with\nbreakthrough features like patented Zipperless\u2122 lids, smart interior food separation, Fridge Cold\nlunch bags, and advanced high performance insulation technologies.\n\nWith the acquisition of Arctic Zone\u00ae and the launch of Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae, we brought together\nbold design, rugged durability, and real world functionality. Our latest evolution, Titan PRO\nOutdoor Gear\u2122, represents the pinnacle of that legacy - premium, high performance coolers built\ntougher, colder and smarter so you can #GoBeyond with every adventure.\n\n### Our Family of Brands\n\n[Image]\n[Logo]\n][27]\n\nGo beyond the day.\n\n[Image]\n[Logo]\n][28]\n\nGo beyond the adventure.\n\n[Image]\n[Logo]\n][29]\n\nGo beyond the limits.\n\n### Join Our Team\n\nArctic Zone is the leading designer and manufacturer of soft sided insulated products in the world.\nWe\u2019re a team of more than 100 multi-disciplined individuals excelling in areas of unique expertise \u2013\nfrom product development to design to supply chain and accounting. If you\u2019re interested in joining\nthe Arctic Zone team, send your resume to jobs@ca-innovations.com with a short note describing how\nyou think you can add to our team or visit our LinkedIn page for current openings. Arctic Zone is\ncommitted to treating all people in a way that respects their dignity and independence. Should you\nrequire any accommodation during the recruitment process, please notify us and we will work with you\nto meet your accessibility needs.\n\n[Visit Our LinkedIn][30]\n\n### Company Culture\n\nOur company is made up of very talented, smart, creative people who are passionate about what they\ndo.\n\n[Learn More][31]\n\nDiscover\n* [About Us][32]\n* [Ambassadors][33]\n* [Newsroom][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n* [Shop in Canada][36]\n* [Shop in Australia][37]\n\nHelpful Resources\n* [ID.me Discounts][38]\n* [Product Testing & Claims][39]\n* [Food Safety Guide][40]\n* [Promotional Details][41]\n* [Giveaway Contest Rules][42]\n\nCustomer Support\n* [Contact Us][43]\n* [Help Center & FAQ's][44]\n* [Shipping and Handling][45]\n* [Returns and Exchanges][46]\n* [Warranty][47]\n* [Track Your Order][48]\n* [Wholesale & Bulk Inquiries][49]\n* [ International Distributor Form][50]\n* [Product Recall Information][51]\n\nFollow us\n\nStay up to date with product launches, fun content, giveaways and tutorials by following us on\nsocial!\n\nNewsletter\n\nJoin our email list and be the first to know about exclusive offers, promotions & new arrivals.\n\n[Subscribe][52]\n\n[Unsubscribe][53] from email anytime.\n\n[Notice of Financial Incentive][54]\n\n[Arctic Zone / Titan by Arctic Zone]\n\n[Accessibility][55] | [Terms of Service][56] | [Privacy Policy][57] | [California Privacy\nNotice][58] | [Patents][59]\n\n[ [California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon]Your Privacy Choices][60]\n\n[ Accessibility Settings][61]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 \u00b7 California Innovations Inc. \u00b7 Arctic Zone Products\n\nWe accept\n[American Express] [Apple Pay] [Diners Club] [Discover] [Google Pay] [JCB] [Maestro] [Mastercard]\n[PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Union Pay] [Venmo] [Visa]\n\nCookie policy\n\nI agree to the processing of my data in accordance with the conditions set out in the policy of\nPrivacy.\n\nAccept Decline\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog/why-we-are-the-number-one-soft-sided-cooler-company-in-the-united-state\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/titanbyarcticzone\n[5]: /pages/titanpro\n[6]: /\n[7]: /\n[8]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/titanbyarcticzone\n[9]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/titanpro\n[10]: /pages/about-us\n[11]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog\n[12]: /cart\n[13]: https://arcticzone.com/\n[14]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/where-to-shop-titan-coolers-in-canada\n[15]: https://titancoolers.com.au/\n[16]: /\n[17]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/titanbyarcticzone\n[18]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/titanpro\n[19]: /pages/about-us\n[20]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog\n[21]: https://arcticzone.com/\n[22]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/where-to-shop-titan-coolers-in-canada\n[23]: https://titancoolers.com.au/\n[24]: https://arcticzone.attn.tv/p/ksH/landing-page\n[25]: /account/login\n[26]: /collections/all\n[27]: https://arcticzone.com/collections/arctic-zone\n[28]: https://arcticzone.com/collections/titan-by-arctic-zone\n[29]: https://arcticzone.com/collections/titan-pro-high-performance-roto-hard-coolers\n[30]: https://ca.linkedin.com/company/california-innovations\n[31]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/our-culture\n[32]: /pages/about-us\n[33]: /pages/ambassadors\n[34]: /pages/newsroom\n[35]: /blogs/arctic-zone-blog\n[36]: https://arcticzone.com/pages/where-to-shop-titan-coolers-in-canada\n[37]: https://titancoolers.com.au/\n[38]: /pages/idme\n[39]: /page