            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe're the #1 Soft Cooler Company in the U.S.*\n\n][2]\n* [Arctic Zone\u00ae][3]\n* [Titan by Arctic Zone\u00ae][4]\n* [Titan PRO][5]\n* [SHOP][6]\n[ [LUNCH BAGS] LUNCH BAGS ][7]\n[ [COOLERS] COOLERS ][8]\n[ [ACCESSORIES] ACCESSORIES ][9]\n[ [SHOP ALL] SHOP ALL ][10]\n* [OUR STORY][11]\n* [BLOG][12]\nNavigation\nNewsletter[0 ][13]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][14]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][15]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][16]\n* SHOP\n* [LUNCH BAGS][17]\n* [COOLERS][18]\n* [ACCESSORIES][19]\n* [SHOP ALL][20]\n* [OUR STORY][21]\n* [BLOG][22]\n[United States] US\n* [ [United States] US ][23]\n* [ [Canada] CA ][24]\n* [ [Australia] AU ][25]\n[ [SMS] ][26][Account][27]\nView all results\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\n[Start shopping][28]\n[People sitting on a beach with a picnic setup, featuring an American flag border.]\n\n## Celebrate This Moment\n\n### Shop Limited Edition Americana Prints Now!\n\n[SHOP NEW][29]\n\n## We're Serving Lunch\n\n[SHOP NOW][30]\n\n## We're the #1 Soft Cooler\n\n## Company in the U.S.*\n\n### *#1 in U.S. sales based on Circana data for 2025\n\n[LEARN MORE][31]\nGo to slide 1 Go to slide 2 Go to slide 3\n\n### Shop by Category\n\nKids Lunch\n\n][32][\n\nLunch\n\n][33][\n\nIce Packs\n\n][34][\n\nBest Sellers\n\n][35][\n\nShop All\n\n][36]\nPrevious Next\n\n## Explore our family of brands. Innovating since 1986.\n\n### Shop by Brand\n\n][37]\n\nArctic Zone\u00ae\n\n##### Go beyond the day\n\n][38]\n\nTitan by Arctic Zone\u00ae\n\n##### Go beyond The Adventure\n\n][39]\n\nTitan PRO Outdoor Gear\u2122\n\n##### Go beyond The Limits\n\nPrevious Next\n\n### Fan Favorites\n\nLimited EditionNew\n[ [12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler][12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]][40]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][41][12 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler][42]\nSale price$29.99\nStripes\nNavy\nLimited EditionNew Sold out\n[ [30 Can Zipperless\u2122 Americana Cooler]][43]\n[Arctic Zone\u00ae][44][30 Can Zippe