      "key_products": "Cold Ice Gel, EverCold Gel, TheraFlex Hot & Cold Therapy Packs, EverCold Ice Blanket, EPS Foam Insulated Shipping Containers",
      "polished_summary": "Cold Ice, Inc. has been a leading provider of gel ice refrigerants and insulated shipping containers for cold chain logistics since 1982. The company specializes in premium-grade products designed to ensure temperature-sensitive shipments, catering primarily to the pharmaceuticals, biotech, blood and tissue banks, and diagnostic laboratories industries. Their product range includes gel ice refrigerants, insulated shipping containers, and temperature indicators, all proudly made in the USA.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Cold Ice, Inc. manufactures gel ice refrigerants and related products specifically designed for cold chain logistics, which directly aligns with the target market of gel ice packs. Their product offerings include various gel ice refrigerants and hot & cold therapy packs, making them a key player in this market.",
