      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Coolpack is a leading manufacturer and supplier of adhesive tapes and cold chain products, specializing in high-quality solutions for packaging and sealing applications. Their core offerings include a variety of self-adhesive and industrial adhesive tapes made from BOPP material, designed to meet the needs of businesses across diverse industries such as electronics, engineering, automobile, food, chemical, and packaging. With a commitment to durability and performance, Coolpack provides reliable products tailored for the packaging and shipping sectors.",
