        "crawl_text": "Valor Industries GST No. 24AAHFV2953L1ZT India Australia North America Eastern Europe Western Europe Africa Central America Middle East South America Asia Gujarat, India India Pan-India [ [WhatsApp] Chat with us ][1]\n[Location]Gujarat, India\n[Working Hour]\n[[Valor Industries]][2]\n* [Home Page][3]\n* [Company Profile][4]\n* [ Our Products ][5]\n* [Garbage Bag][6]\n* [Garbage Bags][7]\n* [Biohazard Waste Collection Bag][8]\n* [Garbage Bag][9]\n* [Bio-Medical Waste Collection Bag][10]\n* [Cold Chain Products][11]\n* [coolant pack][12]\n* [Milk Delivery Bag][13]\n* [Ice Gel Packs][14]\n* [Vaccine Carrier Box][15]\n* [Small Hdpe Ice Pack][16]\n* [Cold Chain Packs][17]\n* [Transparent Puncture Proof Sharps Container 5l, Capacity: 5-8 Litre][18]\n* [Insulated Bag with gel pack and outer corrugated box][19]\n* [insulated pallet cover][20]\n* [Puf Insulated ice Box][21]\n* [Thermal Insulated bag][22]\n* [Thermocol Box][23]\n* [Styrofoam Packaging Box][24]\n* [Vaccine Carrier Box][25]\n* [Polystyrene Thermocol Box][26]\n* [Thermocol Fruit Box][27]\n* [EPS Thermocol Boxes][28]\n* [Thermocol Box][29]\n* [Insulated Shipping Boxes][30]\n* [Molded Thermocol Box][31]\n* [Thermocol Ice Box][32]\n* [Medicine Packaging Thermocol Box][33]\n* [Thermocol Fruit Box][34]\n* [Thermal Insulation Shipper Box][35]\n* [Styrofoam Packaging Box][36]\n* [Super Absorbent Polymer][37]\n* [Potassium Polyacrylate][38]\n* [Sodium Polyacrylate][39]\n* [Super Absorbent Polymer][40]\n* [Water Absorbing Powder Fluidsorb][41]\n* [Potassium Polyacrylate Absorbent Polymer][42]\n* [Packing Peanuts][43]\n* [Packing Peanuts][44]\n* [Eutectic Gel Pack][45]\n* [Pcm Gel Pack][46]\n* [Foam Brick Pack][47]\n* [Ice Gel Pack Pouches][48]\n* [Poly Gap Fillers][49]\n* [EPS Chips][50]\n* [Foam Fill For Gap Filling][51]\n* [Polystyrene Gap Fill][52]\n* [Protective Packaging][53]\n* [Air Bag Inflatable][54]\n* [Adhesives Tapes][55]\n* [Industrial Adhesives Tapes][56]\n* [Self Adhesive Tapes][57]\n* [Cling Wraps Films][58]\n* [Cling Wraps Films][59]\n* [Thermocol Beans Ball][60]\n* [Thermocol Bean Ball][61]\n* [Temperature Data Logger][62]\n* [Ice Pack][63]\n* [Reusable Ice Gel Packs][64]\n* [Reusable Ice Gel Packs][65]\n* [Freezer Gel Pack][66]\n* [Reusable Gel Cold Pack][67]\n* [Reusable Ice Gel Packs][68]\n* [Disposable Ice Gel Pack][69]\n* [Reusable Ice Pack][70]\n* [Ice Pack][71]\n* [Air Bubble Film & Roll][72]\n* [Air Bubble Film Roll 220 Gelid][73]\n* [Bubble Roll][74]\n* [Air Bubble Film Roll][75]\n* [Air Bubble Film][76]\n* [Air Bubble Roll][77]\n* [Bubble Wrap][78]\n* [Plastic Bubble Wrap Sheet][79]\n* [Inflatable Air Bag][80]\n* [Air Column Bag][81]\n* [BOPP Tapes][82]\n* [BOPP Tapes][83]\n* [Bopp Adhesive Tapes][84]\n* [Hot and Cold Pack][85]\n* [Hot And Cold Pack][86]\n* [Instant Hot Pack][87]\n* [Thermal Insulated Bag][88]\n* [Insulated Bag With 6 Coolant Pouch For Outdoors, Camping][89]\n* [Thermal Insulated Bag][90]\n* [Stretch Film Roll][91]\n* [Stretch Wrap][92]\n* [PVC Shrink Roll][93]\n* [Sharp Containers][94]\n* [Sharps Containers 3 Ltr][95]\n* [Sharps Container][96]\n* [Insulated Shipping Boxes][97]\n* [Temperature Controlled Distribution Boxes TCD Boxes][98]\n* [Acute Temperature Controller][99]\n* [Temperature Controller ][100]\n* [Portable vaccine carrier][101]\n* [medical cold box][102]\n* [temperature controlled box][103]\n* [pharmaceutical cold chain device][104]\n* [vaccine storage carrier][105]\n* [portable medical refrigerator][106]\n* [Gelid cold chain products][107]\n* [vaccine carrier with battery][108]\n* [Company Brochure][109]\n* [Contact Us][110]\n[[Send Inquiry] Send Email][111]\n* [Home][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* Adhesives Tapes\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n# Adhesives Tapes\n\nAvailable in different colors, this range of Adhesive tapes is made of environment friendly BOP\nmaterial. These tapes use water based or acrylic based adhesives on their single side. Offered in\nroll form, these tapes are 3 inches x 50 m in size. These are easy to apply and remove. Removal of\nsuch tapes from applied surface does not leave any mark. High adhesive properties, precise dimension\nand reasonable price are some of their key features. Application of such Adhesive tapes can be\nnoticed in electronics, engineering, automobile and also in other arena. These are easily available\nin the market.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Self Adhesive Tapes ]\n[Get a Price/Quote][114]\n\n## Self Adhesive Tapes\n\n#### Price: 49 INR /Roll\n\n[Request To Call Back][115]\nProduct Details:\n* Adhesive Side Single Side\n* Adhesive Type other, Acrylic Based\n* Color Brown\n* Delivery Time 2 Days\n* Elongation 120%\n* Length 65-70 meter\n* Main Domestic Market All India\n* Main Export Market(s) Australia, North America, Eastern Europe, Western Europe, Africa, Central\nAmerica, Middle East, South America, Asia\n* Material Other, BOPP (Biaxially Oriented Polypropylene)\n* Minimum Order Quantity 100\n* Payment Terms Others, Cash in Advance (CID), Cheque\n* Peeling Strength Good\n* Price 49 INR\n* Sample Available Yes\n* Sample Policy Free samples available with shipping and taxes paid by the buyer\n* Shelf Life 1 Year\n* Tape Length 65-70 meter\n* Tape Thickness 38-50 micron\n* Tape Type Single Sided\n* Tape Width 2 inch\n* Thickness 38-50 micron\n* Unit of Measure Roll/Rolls\n* Unit of Price Roll/Rolls\n* Use other, Sealing, Packaging, Carton Closure\n\n**We are a distinguished manufacturer, supplier, exporter and importer of a first-class quality\nrange of **Specialty Tapes**. The range of the tapes include double sided tapes, tissue tapes, paper\ntapes etc. The offered tapes are fabricated by expert manufacturers by using supreme quality raw\nmaterial and cutting-edge technology. Our provided tapes fulfill the various needs of diverse\nindustries like automobile, packaging, electronic, food, engineering, chemical etc. Moreover,\ncustomers can avail these **Specialty Tapes** from us in different colours and dimensions at\nnegotiable prices.**\n\n**Features**\n\n* Available in various colors\n* Strong adhesive for long lasting performance\n* Available in bulk\n* Reasonable pricing\n\n**Robust Adhesion and Water Resistance**\n\nBuilt for demanding packaging tasks, these tapes feature outstanding water resistance and strong\nacrylic adhesive, ensuring that seals remain intact even in humid or damp conditions. The\nresidue-free removal adds a clean convenience for businesses concerned with appearance and\nefficiency. Their single-sided stickiness and reliable tensile strength make them suitable for\ndiverse surfaces.\n\n**Custom Printing and Flexible MOQ**\n\nWe offer custom printing on the tape surface to enhance your brand visibility. Our flexible minimum\norder quantity (MOQ) ensures small and large businesses can easily meet their packaging needs\nwithout excessive inventory, making us an accessible partner for distributors, exporters,\nmanufacturers, and traders alike.\n\n**Versatile Surfaces and Easy Application**\n\nThese self-adhesive tapes are engineered for compatibility with paper, cardboard, and plastic\nsurfaces, ensuring a hassle-free sealing process across many packaging operations. The high\nelongation and sturdy backing material enable easy application without tearing, offering efficiency\nand reliability in every use.\n\n## FAQs of Self Adhesive Tapes:\n\n### **Q: How do I use these self-adhesive tapes for sealing and packaging?**\n\nA: To use, simply unroll the tape from the roll and apply it to the desired surfacewhether paper,\ncardboard, or plastic. The tape adheres quickly and securely with its acrylic-based adhesive,\nproviding a strong seal for cartons and packages. It can be cut to the required length, making it\nefficient for various packaging tasks.\n\n### **Q: What makes these tapes water resistant and residue free upon removal?**\n\nA: The BOPP film backing combined with a specialized acrylic-based adhesive delivers both water\nresistance and residue-free removal. This construction prevents moisture damage while ensuring the\ntape can be taken off cleanly without leaving sticky traces, preserving the appearance of your\npackages.\n\n### **Q: When is it appropriate to use these tapes considering their temperature resistance? [ [WhatsApp] Chat with us ][1]\n[Location]Gujarat, India\n[Working Hour]\n[[Valor Industries]][2]\n* [Home Page][3]\n* [Company Profile][4]\n* [ Our Products ][5]\n* [Garbage Bag][6]\n* [Garbage Bags][7]\n* [Biohazard Waste Collection Bag][8]\n* [Garbage Bag][9]\n* [Bio-Medical Waste Collection Bag][10]\n* [Cold Chain Products][11]\n* [coolant pack][12]\n* [Milk Delivery Bag][13]\n* [Ice Gel Packs][14]\n* [Vaccine Carrier Box][15]\n* [Small Hdpe Ice Pack][16]\n* [Cold Chain Packs][17]\n* [Transparent Puncture Proof Sharps Container 5l, Capacity: 5-8 Litre][18]\n* [In