f logos or messages directly onto the tape for brand\npromotion. The minimum order quantity (MOQ) can be tailored to your specific volume needs, whether\nyoure a small business or a large enterprise. Contact our team to start the process and discuss your\nrequirements.\n\n### **Q: What are the main benefits of choosing these BOPP self-adhesive tapes?**\n\nA: Key benefits include strong sealing with high tensile strength, water and temperature resistance\nup to 60C, residue-free removal, customizable printing options, compatibility with multiple\nsurfaces, and a user-friendly application process. They also last up to a year when stored\nappropriately.\n\n[Send Inquiry][116]\n[Industrial Adhesives Tapes ]\n[Get a Price/Quote][117]\n\n## Industrial Adhesives Tapes\n\n#### Price: 36 INR /Roll\n\n[Request To Call Back][118]\nProduct Details:\n* Adhesive Side Single Side\n* Adhesive Type other, Acrylic Water Based\n* Color Transparent\n* Delivery Time 2 Days\n* Elongation 140%\n* Length 20 m\n* Main Domestic Market All India\n* Main Export Market(s) Eastern Europe, Africa, Central America, Middle East, South America, Western\nEurope, Asia, North America, Australia\n* Material BOPP\n* Minimum Order Quantity 100\n* Payment Terms Others, Cash in Advance (CID), Cheque\n* Peeling Strength 15 N/25mm\n* Price 36 INR\n* Sample Available Yes\n* Sample Policy Free samples available with shipping and taxes paid by the buyer\n* Shelf Life 12 Months\n* Tape Length 20 m\n* Tape Thickness 0.12 mm\n* Tape Type Single Sided\n* Tape Width 48 mm\n* Thickness 0.12 mm\n* Unit of Measure Roll/Rolls\n* Unit of Price Roll/Rolls\n* Use other, Packaging/Carton Sealing\n\n**We are an organization that is involved in manufacturing, supplying, exporting and importing an\nextensive gamut of **Adhesives Tapes**. The offered tapes are applicable in various applications\nsuch as decorating, packaging, labeling, combine, protection and households, due to which highly\ndemanded by clients all over the worl