      "key_products": "Ice Gel Packs, Reusable Ice Gel Packs, Disposable Ice Gel Pack, Freezer Gel Pack, Hot and Cold Pack",
      "polished_summary": "Coolpack is a leading manufacturer and supplier of adhesive tapes and cold chain products, specializing in high-quality solutions for packaging and sealing applications. Their core offerings include a variety of self-adhesive and industrial adhesive tapes made from BOPP material, designed to meet the needs of businesses across diverse industries such as electronics, engineering, automobile, food, chemical, and packaging. With a commitment to durability and performance, Coolpack provides reliable products tailored for the packaging and shipping sectors.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Coolpack manufactures and supplies gel ice packs and other cold chain products, which are directly relevant to the gel ice pack market. Their offerings include various types of ice gel packs, indicating a clear focus on products that serve the needs of this market.",
