      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "Custom Cold Packs is a leading American manufacturer specializing in reusable customized ice packs, freezer packs, and cold gel packs, with over 20 years of experience in the industry. Their product range includes various gel and cold packs designed for general cooling and warming needs, catering primarily to businesses in healthcare, food and beverage, and retail e-commerce sectors. With options for custom sizes, colors, and imprints, Custom Cold Packs provides tailored solutions for companies requiring effective temperature control for shipping or events.",
