        "crawl_text": "Custom Cold Packs Manufacturing Made-to-order manufacturing process ensuring quality and durability State of the art custom machinery and equipment 315 Lincoln Ct., Fort Collins, Colorado 80524 Made in USA Reusable Custom Imprinted Cold Packs, Ice Packs, Gel Packs\n\nSkip to main content\n\nToggle menu\n\nCompare\n\nSearch\n\nSign in\n\nRegister\n\nCart\n\nSearch\n\nSearch\n\nShop Our Store\n\nAll Shop Our Store\n\nCustom Imprinted Packs\n\n&quot;Freeze-Solid&quot; Ice Packs\n\n&quot;Stay-Soft&quot; Gel Packs\n\nCloth-Backed &quot;Stay-Soft&quot; Gel Packs\n\nGel Bead Packs\n\nCloth Back Gel Bead Packs\n\nStandard &quot;Blank&quot; Packs\n\n&quot;Freeze-Solid&quot; Ice Packs\n\n&quot;Stay-Soft&quot; Gel Packs\n\nIndividual Ice/Gel Packs\n\nAbout Us\n\nFAQ\n\nContact Us\n\nRequest Samples\n\nSign in\n\nRegister\n\n\"Stay Soft\" Gel Packs\n\n(for general cooling/warming needs)\n\n(Sizes from 4.5\" x 4.5\" up to 6\" x 12\")\n\n(7 ice/gel colors and 3 standard imprint colors available)\n\n(PMS Match up to full color imprints also available)\n\n\"Freeze Solid\" Ice Packs\n\n(for keeping items chilled)\n\n(Sizes from 4.5\" x 4.5\" up to 6\" x 12\")\n\n(7 ice/gel colors and 3 standard imprint colors available)\n\n(PMS Match up to full color imprints also available)\n\nCloth-Backed \"Stay Soft\" Gel Packs\n\n(for general cooling/warming needs)\n\n(Sizes from 4.5\" x 4.5\" up to 6\" x 12\")\n\n(7 ice/gel colors and 3 standard imprint colors available)\n\n(PMS Match up to full color imprints also available)\n\nGel Bead Cold Packs\n\n(for general cooling/warming needs)\n\n(Sizes from 4.5\" x 4.5\" up to 6\" x 8\")\n\n(6 gel bead colors and 3 standard imprint colors available)\n\n(PMS Match up to full color imprints also available)\n\n\"Cloth Backed\" Gel Bead Cold Packs\n\n(for general cooling/warming needs)\n\n(Sizes from 4.5\" x 4.5\" up to 6\" x 8\")\n\n(6 gel bead colors and 3 standard imprint colors available)\n\n(PMS Match up to full color imprints also available)\n\nClose\n&#215;\n\nCancel\n\nFooter Start\n\nNavigate\n\nAbout Us\n\nFAQ\n\nContact Us\n\nRequest Samples\n\nSitemap\n\nCategories\n\nShop Our Store\n\nInfo\nCustom Cold Packs\n\n315 Lincoln Ct.\n\nFort Collins, Colorado 80524\nCall us at 800-727-0573\n\nSubscribe to our newsletter\n\nGet the latest updates on new products and upcoming sales\n\nEmail Address\n\nAmerican Express\n\nDiscover\n\nMastercard\n\nPayPal\n\nVisa\n\nAmazon Pay\n\n&copy; 2026 CustomColdPacks.com [null] [Skip to main content][1] [ Toggle menu ][2]\n* [ Compare ][3]\n* Search\n* [ Sign in ][4] or [ Register ][5]\n* [ Cart ][6]\nSearch\n[CustomColdPacks.com]\n][7]\nSearch\n* [ Shop Our Store ][8]\n* [ All Shop Our Store ][9]\n* [ Custom Imprinted Packs ][10]\n* [ \"Freeze-Solid\" Ice Packs ][11]\n* [ \"Stay-Soft\" Gel Packs ][12]\n* [ Cloth-Backed \"Stay-Soft\" Gel Packs ][13]\n* [ Gel Bead Packs ][14]\n* [ Cloth Back Gel Bead Packs ][15]\n* [ Standard \"Blank\" Packs ][16]\n* [ \"Freeze-Solid\" Ice Packs ][17]\n* [ \"Stay-Soft\" Gel Packs ][18]\n* [ Individual Ice/Gel Packs ][19]\n* [ About Us ][20]\n* [ FAQ ][21]\n* [ Contact Us ][22]\n* [ Request Samples ][23]\n* [ Sign in ][24] or [ Register ][25]\n1. [ Home ][26]\n2. [ About Us ][27]\n\n# About Us\n* [Privacy Policy][28]\n\nCustom Cold Packs is an American company that has been manufacturing a variety of reusable\ncustomized ice packs, freezer packs, and cold gel packs in the USA for over 20 years. We use state\nof the art custom machinery, equipment and materials to produce your packs quickly and consistently.\nWith Custom Cold Packs, you receive a quality, durable pack every time.\n\nYou can rely on our true made-to-order process: we do not stock blank items only to \u201cpersonalize\"\nthem with a label. Instead, we manufacture to order, so you can be assured that you\u2019re getting a\ncustom ice or cold pack every time. We do also manufacture reusable blank ice and cold packs for\nbulk sale. We hope you find working w