            "url": "https://customcoldpacks.com/about-us/",
            "text": "[null] [Skip to main content][1] [ Toggle menu ][2]\n* [ Compare ][3]\n* Search\n* [ Sign in ][4] or [ Register ][5]\n* [ Cart ][6]\nSearch\n[CustomColdPacks.com]\n][7]\nSearch\n* [ Shop Our Store ][8]\n* [ All Shop Our Store ][9]\n* [ Custom Imprinted Packs ][10]\n* [ \"Freeze-Solid\" Ice Packs ][11]\n* [ \"Stay-Soft\" Gel Packs ][12]\n* [ Cloth-Backed \"Stay-Soft\" Gel Packs ][13]\n* [ Gel Bead Packs ][14]\n* [ Cloth Back Gel Bead Packs ][15]\n* [ Standard \"Blank\" Packs ][16]\n* [ \"Freeze-Solid\" Ice Packs ][17]\n* [ \"Stay-Soft\" Gel Packs ][18]\n* [ Individual Ice/Gel Packs ][19]\n* [ About Us ][20]\n* [ FAQ ][21]\n* [ Contact Us ][22]\n* [ Request Samples ][23]\n* [ Sign in ][24] or [ Register ][25]\n1. [ Home ][26]\n2. [ About Us ][27]\n\n# About Us\n* [Privacy Policy][28]\n\nCustom Cold Packs is an American company that has been manufacturing a variety of reusable\ncustomized ice packs, freezer packs, and cold gel packs in the USA for over 20 years. We use state\nof the art custom machinery, equipment and materials to produce your packs quickly and consistently.\nWith Custom Cold Packs, you receive a quality, durable pack every time.\n\nYou can rely on our true made-to-order process: we do not stock blank items only to \u201cpersonalize\"\nthem with a label. Instead, we manufacture to order, so you can be assured that you\u2019re getting a\ncustom ice or cold pack every time. We do also manufacture reusable blank ice and cold packs for\nbulk sale. We hope you find working with Custom Cold Packs to be an enjoyable experience!\n\n**[made-in-usa-eps.png]**\n\nClose \u00d7\nOK Cancel\n\n## Footer Start\n\n### Navigate\n* [About Us][29]\n* [FAQ][30]\n* [Contact Us][31]\n* [Request Samples][32]\n* [Sitemap][33]\n\n### Categories\n* [Shop Our Store][34]\n\n### Info\n\nCustom Cold Packs\n315 Lincoln Ct.\nFort Collins, Colorado 80524 **Call us at 800-727-0573**\n\n### Subscribe to our newsletter\n\nGet the latest updates on new products and upcoming sales\n\nEmail Address\n* [American Express]\n* [Discover]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Visa]\n* [Amazon Pay]\n\n\u00a9 2026 CustomColdPacks.com\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://customcoldpacks.com/compare\n[4]: https://customcoldpacks.com/login.php\n[5]: https://customcoldpacks.com/login.php?action=create_account\n[6]: https://customcoldpacks.com/cart.php\n[7]: https://customcoldpacks.com/\n[8]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop-our-store.html\n[9]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop-our-store.html\n[10]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop-our-store/custom-imprinted-packs.html\n[11]: https://customcoldpacks.com/freeze-solid-ice-packs/\n[12]: https://customcoldpacks.com/stay-soft-gel-packs/\n[13]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop-our-store/custom-imprinted-packs/cloth-backed-stay\n-soft-gel-packs.html\n[14]: https://customcoldpacks.com/gel-bead-packs/\n[15]: https://customcoldpacks.com/cloth-back-gel-bead-packs/\n[16]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop-our-store/standard-blank-packs.html\n[17]: https://customcoldpacks.com/freeze-solid-ice-packs-1/\n[18]: https://customcoldpacks.com/stay-soft-cold-hot-gel-packs-1/\n[19]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop-our-store/individual-ice-gel-packs.html\n[20]: https://customcoldpacks.com/about-us/\n[21]: https://customcoldpacks.com/faq/\n[22]: https://customcoldpacks.com/contact-us/\n[23]: https://customcoldpacks.com/request-samples/\n[24]: https://customcoldpacks.com/login.php\n[25]: https://customcoldpacks.com/login.php?action=create_account\n[26]: https://customcoldpacks.com/\n[27]: https://customcoldpacks.com/about-us/\n[28]: https://customcoldpacks.com/privacy-policy/\n[29]: https://customcoldpacks.com/about-us/\n[30]: https://customcoldpacks.com/faq/\n[31]: https://customcoldpacks.com/contact-us/\n[32]: https://customcoldpacks.com/request-samples/\n[33]: https://customcoldpacks.com/sitemap.php\n[34]: https://customcoldpacks.com/categories/shop