      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "distributor",
      "company_summary": "Delta Packaging Products, Inc. specializes in protective packaging solutions tailored for perishable and fragile items, ensuring their safe transport and storage for over 50 years. The company offers a range of products, including EPS molded foam containers, coolers, and specialized wine shippers, along with consulting services for temperature testing, catering primarily to businesses in the food and beverage, pharmaceuticals, and logistics industries.",
