      "key_products": "Coolers, EPS Molded Foam Containers, Temperature Testing Services, Wine Shippers",
      "polished_summary": "Delta Packaging Products, Inc. specializes in protective packaging solutions tailored for perishable and fragile items, ensuring their safe transport and storage for over 50 years. The company offers a range of products, including EPS molded foam containers, coolers, and specialized wine shippers, along with consulting services for temperature testing, catering primarily to businesses in the food and beverage, pharmaceuticals, and logistics industries.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Delta Packaging specializes in protective packaging solutions for temperature-sensitive items, which includes products like coolers and EPS molded foam containers that are relevant for gel ice packs. Their focus on temperature testing services further aligns them with the needs of the gel ice pack market.",
