      "company_summary": "Dispotech is a leading Italian company specializing in the design, manufacture, and supply of high-quality disposable products for the medical, dental, sports, promotional, and mass retail sectors. Founded in 1994 by Massimo Mortarotti, Dispotech is recognized globally for its commitment to innovation and quality, ensuring that its products meet the highest standards through advanced materials and technologies. The company is dedicated to customizing solutions to meet the diverse needs of its clients, enhancing operational efficiency and patient care across various industries.",
