 to the great flexibility of our design and Research and Development teams, at Dispotech we\nare able to customise the type and dimensions of the packaging, as well as the format of nearly all\nour disposable products\n\n[ Continue ][47]\nPerfecto\nDispotech Dental Disposables - italian worldwide company\n[ View more ][48]\n[Dispotech]\n\n## Medical disposable products company\n\n\nDispotech is a leader among medical disposable products companies in Italy and worldwide. The\ncompany was created by Massimo Mortarotti in 1994: after ten years working the chemical-medical\nfield in Milan, Mortarotti decided to create a new company dedicated to designing, manufacturing and\nsupplying of medical disposable products. Dispotech was founded in Gordona, in the Valchiavenna area\nin Italy. Today Dispotech is recognised both in Italy and abroad as one of the leading companies in\nthe production of medical disposable products for various sectors: medical, dental, sports,\npromotional and mass retail.\u00a0\n\n[ Read more ][49]\n\n### Explore Dispotech world\n\nRead now all our articles!\n\nCategories\n* [ Medical line ][50]\n* [ News ][51]\n* [ Sport ][52]\n* [ Dental line ][53]\n* [ International expansion ][54]\n* [ Mass retailer ][55]\n* [ Offers ][56]\n* [ Customisation and personalisation ][57]\n* [ Elderly care products ][58]\n* [ Research and development ][59]\n[22 6] Sport\n22 June 2026\n\n## Instant ice: the rush to stock up for the sporting and tourist season in June\n\nWith the arrival of summer, **instant ice** is once again one of the most sought-after products in\nthe medical, sports and first-aid sectors.\n\n**June** marks the start of a period characterised by a sharp increase in outdoor activities,\ntourist numbers and sporting events, leading to a rise in demand for quick and effective solutions\nfor treating injuries, bruises and minor accidents.\n\nFor distributors and retailers, this is a crucial time to plan stock levels effectively and avoid\nstock shortages during the months of peak demand.\n\n[ Read the article ][60]\n[8 6 (1)] Medical line\n08 June 2026\n\n## Efficiency and hygiene: how Dispo ROLL and Dispo BAND optimise workflow in physiotherapy centres\n\nIn the hospital and outpatient sector, operational efficiency, patient comfort and [ [Logo] ][1]\n[ [Frame] ][2]\n[COMPANY][3] [SERVICES][4] [VIDEO GALLERY][5] [BLOG][6] [CONTACT US][7]\n[Medical][8] [Sport][9] [Perfecto][10] [Mass retail][11] [Your brand][12]\n\nEN\n\n[flag-language]\n[\n\nIT\n\n[flag-language]\n][13]\n[\n\nDE\n\n[flag-language]\n][14]\n[\n\nES\n\n[flag-language]\n][15]\n[\n\nFR\n\n[flag-language]\n][16]\n[\n\nPT\n\n[flag-language]\n][17]\n[\n\nPL\n\n[Pl]\n][18]\n[\n\nCZ\n\n[Cz]\n][19]\n[\n\nBG\n\n[Bg]\n][20]\n[\n\nRS\n\n[Rs]\n][21]\n[\n\nCH\n\n[Ch]\n][22]\n[ [Logo] ][23]\n[ [Frame] ][24]\n[COMPANY][25] [SERVICES][26] [VIDEO GALLERY][27] [BLOG][28] [CONTACT US][29]\n\nEN\n\n[Gb Eng]\n[\n\nIT\n\n[flag-language]\n][30]\n[\n\nDE\n\n[flag-language]\n][31]\n[\n\nES\n\n[flag-language]\n][32]\n[\n\nFR\n\n[flag-language]\n][33]\n[\n\nPT\n\n[flag-language]\n][34]\n[\n\nPL\n\n[Pl]\n][35]\n[\n\nCZ\n\n[Cz]\n][36]\n[\n\nBG\n\n[Bg]\n][37]\n[\n\nRS\n\n[Rs]\n][38]\n[\n\nCH\n\n[Ch]\n][39]\n[Medical][40] [Sport][41] [Perfecto][42] [Mass retail][43] [Your brand][44]\n\n# Design and production of top-quality disposable products for the medical, dental and sports\n# sectors\n\n[person with perfecto ice]\n[medical doctor]\n[tennis player with easy ice on the back]\n[pharmacy]\n[disposable product manufacturer]\nDispotech\nPerfecto Dental\nMedical\nSport\nMass Retail\nYour Brand\n[Icon1]\nWe design\n\n##### We design\n\nDispotech designs disposable products, developing both the materials and technologies, all under an\nunyielding quality system which guarantees the highest quality of Dispotech products all around the\nworld\n\n[ Continue ][45]\n[Icon2]\nWe produce\n\n##### We produce\n\nDispotech manufactures disposable products of the highest quality for the medical, dental, sports,\npromotional and mass retail sectors, thanks to optimisation of the high-quality made in Italy\nmaterials used and all production machinery\n\n[ Continue ][46]\n[Matitina (1)]\nWe customize\n\n##### We customize\n\nThanks to the great flexibility of our design and Research and Development teams, at Dispotech we\nare able to customise the type and dimensions of the packaging, as well as the format of nearly all\nour disposable products\n\n[ Continue ][47]\nPerfecto\nDispotech Dental Disposables - italian worldwide company\n[ View more ][48]\n[Dispotech]\n\n## Medical disposable products company\n\n\nDispotech is a leader among medical disposable products companies in Italy and worldwide. The\ncompany was created by Massimo Mortarotti in 1994: after ten years working the chemical-medical\nfield in Milan, Mortarotti decided to create a new company dedicated to designing, manufacturing and\nsupplying of medical disposable products. Dispotech was founded in Gordona, in the Valchiavenna area\nin Italy. Today Dispotech is recognised both in Italy and abroad as one of the leading companies in\nthe production of medical disposable products for various sectors: medical, dental, sports,\npromotional and mass retail.\u00a0\n\n[ Read more ][49]\n\n### Explore Dispotech world\n\nRead now all our articles!\n\nCategories\n* [ Medical line ][50]\n* [ News ][51]\n* [ Sport ][52]\n* [ Dental line ][53]\n* [ International expansion ][54]\n* [ Mass retailer ][55]\n* [ Offers ][56]\n* [ Customisation and personalisation ][57]\n* [ Elderly care products ][58]\n* [ Research and development ][59]\n[22 6] Sport\n22 June 2026\n\n## Instant ice: the rush to stock up for the sporting and tourist season in June\n\nWith the arrival of summer, **instant ice** is once again one of the most sought-after products in\nthe medical, sports and first-aid sectors.\n\n**June** marks the start of a period characterised by a sharp increase in outdoor activities,\ntourist numbers and sporting events, leading to a rise in demand for quick and effective solutions\nfor treating injuries, bruises and minor accidents.\n\nFor distributors and retailers, this is a crucial time to plan stock levels effectively and avoid\nstock shortages during the months of peak demand.\n\n[ Read the article ][60]\n[8 6 (1)] Medical line\n08 June 2026\n\n## Efficiency and hygiene: how Dispo ROLL and Dispo BAND optimise workflow in physiotherapy centres\n\nIn the hospital and outpatient sector, operational efficiency, patient comfort and hygiene\nmanagement are becoming increasingly central to day-to-day operations.\n\nParticularly during the summer months, rising temperatures make it even more important to use\nsingle-use devices designed to ensure convenience, durability and a better patient experience.\n\nEveryday products such as medical sheets and single-use devices used in blood pressure measurement\nare not merely consumables, but tools that have a direct impact on the quality of care, the speed of\npatient turnover and the optimisation of operational times.\n\nIn this context, solutions such as **Dispo ROLL** and **Dispo BAND** support clinics, medical\npractices, physiotherapy centres and pharmacies in managing high-turnover operations, helping to\nimprove efficiency and hygiene standards.\n\n[ Read the article ][61]\n[052026 D (2)] Medical line\n18 May 2026\n\n## Risk management in the medical disposables sector: why the quality of the material prevents\n## hidden costs\n\nIn the medical disposables sector, the economic evaluation of single-use medical devices is often\nbased on a unit-price approach.\u00a0\n\nHowever, this approach risks being misleading unless it is accompanied by a broader analysis that\ntakes into account quality, reliability and operational impact.\n\nA single-use device that appears to be cheaper may in fact generate significant indirect costs\nthroughout the supply chain, affecting patient safety, the efficiency of healthcare facilities and\nthe profitability of the distributor.\u00a0\n\nIn this context, **risk management** becomes a key factor in the selection of medical supplies.\n\n[ Read the article ][62]\n[052026 D] Medical line\n04 May 2026\n\n## Instant ice: why B2B demand surges in May and how to pre-empt peaks in demand\n\nIn the medical and sports equipment market, seasonality is a factor that is often underestimated but\nhas a significant impact on stock management.\u00a0\n\nOne of the products most prone to spikes in demand are **single-use instant ice packs**, an\nessential item for providing immediate relief from injuries in sporting, outpatient and\npharmaceutical settings.\n\nWith the arrival of May, demand for cryotherapy supplies surges significantly every year, putting\ndistributors\u2019 forecasting capabilities to the test.\n\nUnderstanding the dynamics of this trend and adopting more structured procurement strategies is\ntherefore essential to prevent products going out of stock, leading to missed business\nopportunities.\n\n[ Read the article ][63]\n[Aprile Primo Articolo (2)] International expansion\n20 April 2026\n\n## Why Dispotech\u2019s \u201cMade in Italy\u201d supply chain represents a true competitive advantage for\n## distributors\n\nIn the healthcare distribution sector, ensuring **continuity of supply** is as much a strategic\nfactor as offering a low price or having an extensive product range.\u00a0\n\nHaving the right products at the right time means ensuring reliability for customers and maintaining\na stable revenue stream.\n\nIn recent years, however, global supply chains have demonstrated increasing vulnerability.\u00a0\n\nDelays in transport, geopolitical instability and congestion along trade routes have made it\nincreasingly difficult to rely on supplies from distant markets.\n\nIn this context, the production of disposable medical devices in Italy is emerging as a strategic\nchoice for distributors seeking to build a more robust and predictable supply chain.\u00a0\n\nIn fact, a short supply chain is more than just a logistical choice. It's a genuine competitive\nadvantage that impacts costs, margins and service quality.\n\n[ Read the article ][64]\n[6 Aprile (1)] Medical line\n06 April 2026\n\n## Beyond healthcare: how to diversify revenue with disposable devices by Dispotech\n\nIn the healthcare distribution sector, growth depends not only on increased volumes, but also on the\nability to access new markets.\u00a0\n\nExpanding the catalogue with versatile products enables distributors to reach new customer segments.\n\nIn this context, partnering with a supplier of patented instant and dispos"
