        "website": "https://flexikold.com",
        "industries": "Healthcare; Sports Medicine; Physical Therapy",
        "products": "FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Standard Large), FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Half Size), FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Neck Contour), Circular Packs (4-Inch Flexible Gel Circles)",
