      "polished_summary": "FlexiKold specializes in premium gel ice packs designed for effective cold therapy, offering targeted relief for muscle pain, swelling, and post-workout soreness. Their product line includes versatile options such as large cold packs, compact designs for localized treatment, and uniquely shaped packs for neck and shoulder relief, catering to individuals in healthcare, sports medicine, and physical therapy. With a focus on durability and flexibility, FlexiKold aims to enhance the cold therapy experience for its customers.",
