      "key_products": "Gel Ice Pack, Super Absorbent Polymer, Sodium Polyacrylate, Potassium Polyacrylate, High Oil-Absorbable Resin",
      "polished_summary": "Gelsap is a leading manufacturer of superabsorbent polymers (SAP) that cater to diverse applications across agriculture, industrial processes, and consumer products. The company specializes in high-quality polymer solutions, including sodium polyacrylate and potassium polyacrylate, which are designed for moisture retention and absorption, as well as consumer products like gel ice packs and animal litter. Gelsap is committed to delivering innovative and eco-friendly solutions to its target markets, which include agricultural businesses, industrial manufacturers, and consumers.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Gelsap is a manufacturer of superabsorbent polymers, including gel ice packs, which directly cater to the target market of gel ice packs. Their products are specifically designed for moisture retention and absorption, making them relevant participants in this market.",
