Pre-frozen\n\nCourier boxes\n\nFreezer trays\n\nIce packs frozen\n\nEasiFreeze\n\nHydroFreeze\n\nHydroFreeze+\n\nCourier boxes\n\nFreezer trays\n\nHard shell\n\nHard blocks\n\nHard plates\n\nFreshPac food packaging\n\nEnviroCool\n\nRecycleAir\n\nReflectiveAir\n\nCool bags\n\nPolystyrene boxes\n\nThermal postal pockets\n\nPharmapac pharmaceutical\n\nGel ice packs\n\nPolystyrene boxes\n\nGenesis\n\nShop\n\nQuote request\n\nAbout us\n\nHydropac and CSR\n\nCold Chain Optimisation\n\nSite visit\n\nBlog\n\nFAQ\u2019s\n\nContact\n\nHydropac Ice Packs\n\nIce packs chilled\n\nWater\n\nGel\n\nIce sheets\n\nPre-frozen\n\nCourier boxes\n\nFreezer trays\n\nIce packs frozen\n\nEasiFreeze\n\nHydroFreeze\n\nHydroFreeze+\n\nCourier boxes\n\nFreezer trays\n\nHard shell\n\nHard blocks\n\nHard plates\n\nFreshPac food packaging\n\nEnviroCool\n\nRecycleAir\n\nReflectiveAir\n\nCool bags\n\nPolystyrene boxes\n\nThermal postal pockets\n\nPharmapac pharmaceutical\n\nGel ice packs\n\nPolystyrene boxes\n\nGenesis\n\nShop\n\nQuote request\n\nAbout us\n\nHydropac and CSR\n\nCold Chain Optimisation\n\nSite visit\n\nBlog\n\nFAQ\u2019s\n\nContact\n\nTemperature controlled\nshipping solutions\n\nProviding the ultimate solution in cold chain shipping since 2001.\n\nStart Your Cold Chain Consult\n\nDiscover our solutions\n\nExplore Limitless Custom Cooling Solutions\n\nAt Hydropac, we redefine cold chain logistics with precision and expertise. 20+ years of experience has seen us emrge as leaders in temperature controlled shipping, we deliver solutions that protect your cargo&#8217;s integrity.\nDecades of experience make us the go-to experts. Our mission: revolutionise cold chain logistics. Today, we lead the way in temperature controlled packaging solutions that exceed expectations.\nFrom retail to medical and pharmaceutical sectors, Hydropac offers a world of personalised cooling products. Our extensive portfolio caters to diverse needs, ensuring each product can be tailored to your exact specifications. Whether it&#8217;s branding, custom ice packs, or specific messaging, we deliver bespoke excellence.\nWithin our Hydropac, Freshpac &amp; Pharmapac ranges, you&#8217;ll find an expansive collection of insulated packaging and cooling solutions. Yet, our offerings go beyond the ordinary. We craft custom-made products like drink coolers, ice mats, and shaped ice packs, all designed to your specifications \u2013 and without the burden of additional tooling costs.\n\nIce packs\n\nDiscover Hydropac\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nDiscover Pharmapac\n\nFood packaging\n\nDiscover Freshpac\n\nTemperature solutions\n\nHydropac is not confined by boundaries; our temperature-controlled solutions transcend industries, meeting unique challenges and safeguarding products&#8217; integrity. With a broad spectrum of applications, we cater to diverse markets, ensuring that each sector benefits from our expertise.\n\nView all products\n\nView product\n\nHydroFreeze Ice Pack &#8211; 1 Pocket &#8211; 500g\n\n\u00a30.46\n\nView product\n\nGel Ice Pack &#8211; 1 Pocket &#8211; 500g\n\n\u00a30.40\n\nView product\n\nWater Ice Pack &#8211; 1 Pocket &#8211; 500g\n\n\u00a30.35\n\nMarkets\n\nHydropac serves a diverse range of industries, delivering temperature-controlled solutions tailored to the unique needs of each market. Our commitment to innovation and a bespoke approach ensures that every product is protected within its required temperature range, safeguarding integrity and performance across all applications. See below to learn more about how we approach the sectors we cater to.\n\nCustom solutions?\n\nFood Industry Assurance\n\nFrom frozen goods to delicate confectioneries, our temperature-controlled packaging ensures that taste, texture, and safety are preserved.\n\nRetail Innovation\n\nOur products enhance the shelf life of perishable goods, from farm to table. We offer insulated packaging that minimises temperature variations, preserving the freshness of food and produce.\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nFind solutions that preserve the efficacy and safety of medications, vaccines, and biologics. Our solutions play a crucial role in maintaining the cold chain, ensuring that life-saving products reach patients in optimal condition.\n\nMedical and Healthcare\n\nWe provide temperature-controlled solutions that contribute to the safe transportation of sensitive medical equipment, samples, and products. From blood to diagnostic materials, our solutions maintain the required temperature range.\n\nPromotional Markets\n\nFirst impressions matter. Hydropac crafts custom-designed packaging solutions that elevate your brand. Whether it's a branded ice pack or an innovative cooler, we help you make a lasting impact while ensuring your products stay fresh and enticing.\n\nSustainability Hydropac and CSR\n\nSustainability isn&#8217;t just a trend for us \u2013 it&#8217;s a promise. As we innovate, create, and lead, we keep our planet&#8217;s well-being at the forefront. With Hydropac, you&#8217;re not just preserving the quality of your cargo; you&#8217;re contributing to a healthier world.\nExperience the power of sustainable temperature assurance with Hydropac \u2013 where excellence and environmental responsibility coexist for a brighter future.\n\nMore about Hydropac and CSR\n\n25+\n\nColleagues\n\nConnecting the world and connecting people through sustainable temperature control innovation\n\nCore values\n\nIntegrity \u2013 Honesty \u2013 Can Do \u2013 Entrepreneurial \u2013 Ownership \u2013 Transparent.\n\n120+\n\nProducts\n\nWe have 120+ standard products in our range\n\nThe process\n\nFrom scale product to mass product. We help you find a suitable cooling solution.\n\nConsulation &amp; accessment\n\nOur experts dive into the specifics of your cargo, industry regulations, and delivery expectations. This assessment lays the foundation for a tailored solution.\n\n01.\n\nCustomised solution design\n\nWe craft a bespoke cold chain solution. Whether it\u2019s temperature controlled packaging, shipping, or a combination, our solution is designed to maintain product integrity and meet your exact needs.\n\n02.\n\nRigorous\nTesting\n\nOur solutions undergo rigorous testing. Simulating real-world conditions, we verify their ability to withstand temperature variations, ensuring your products remain uncompromised.\n\n03.\n\nSeamless implementation\n\nWith a meticulously prepared solution in hand, we seamlessly integrate it into your cold chain logistics. From temperature controlled packaging to shipping strategies.\n\n04.\n\nHydropac's Latest news\n\nRecycled Insulation Materials and Performance Trade-Offs\n\nJune 2, 2026\n\nEco Friendly\n\nRecycled insulation is not a shortcut. If the material changes, the cold-chain behaviour can change with it. That matters because [&hellip;]\n\nRead more\n\nReducing Carbon Impact in Temperature Controlled Transport\n\nJune 2, 2026\n\nEco Friendly\n\nReducing carbon impact in temperature controlled transport is not only a vehicle issue. It is not only a packaging material [&hellip;]\n\nRead more\n\nCategories\nTradeshows\n\nTemperature controlled packaging\n\nSafe Alternatives to Dry Ice\n\nRange Showcase\n\nProduct Showcase\n\nPharmaceutical Shipping\n\nPackaging\n\nInsights\n\nIce Packs\n\nHydropac News\n\nHydropac\n\nFood Shipping\n\nEco Friendly\n\nCold Chain\n\nWhat Some Of Our Customers Say\n\n\"Hydropac has been an integral partner for us since our relaunch in October 2023, and even during our previous iteration [ Skip to content][1]\nMain Menu\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][2]\n* [Site visit][3]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][4]\n* [Blog][5]\nSearch\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][6]\n* [ +441494530182 ][7]\n][8]\nSubtotal: \u00a30.00\n\nNo products in the cart.\n\nNo products in the cart.\n\n[Continue Shopping][9]\nMain Menu\n* [Hydropac ice packs][10]\n* [Chilled][11]\n* [Water][12]\n* [Gel][13]\n* [Sheets][14]\n* [Pre-frozen][15]\n* [Courier boxes][16]\n* [Freezer trays][17]\n* [Frozen][18]\n* [EasiFreeze][19]\n* [