[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n\n## Worldwide\n\n# About Hydropac\n\nInnovators in Temperature-Controlled Packaging Solutions.\n\n[Home][118] / About us\n\n## Why Hydropac\n\nAt Hydropac, innovation isn\u2019t just a buzzword \u2013 it\u2019s ingrained in our DNA. Established in 2001, we\nembarked on a path to redefine temperature-controlled packaging, and today, we stand as the UK\u2019s\npremier manufacturer of Ice Packs, Gel Packs, and Temperature Controlled Shipping Systems. We know\nwhat we\u2019re doing. We don\u2019t just resell products, our manufacturing tools were designed and built in\nhouse, so we know our business inside out. Our journey has been one of evolution, driven by a\npassion for excellence and a commitment to sustainability.\n\n**Our 6 Values**\n* Integrity\n* Honest\n* Transparent\n* Can Do\n* Entrepreneurial\n* Ownership\n\n[[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]][119]\n\n### [Certified][120]\n\nISO 9001\n\n### Our purpose\n\nEnsuring your customer is treated like ours; delivering certainty with innovative cold chain\nsolutions. The last thing you think about and the first thing you need.\n\n### Our vision\n\nConnecting the world and connecting people through sustainable temperature control innovations.\n\n### Our brand promise\n\nWe are the ice mat experts. Our products will hold your products at the correct temperature or we\nwill refund you and find an alternative.\n\n[All HydroPac cooling products]\n[Packing water ice packs]\n\n### Quality above all\n\nHigh quality is not an exception; it\u2019s our standard. We take pride in producing Ice Packs using our\nunique sealing system and specially developed film quality. Our commitment to precision ensures that\nyour products remain at their best.\n\n01.\n\n### Sustainability in every stitch\n\nEnvironmental responsibility is at our core. We\u2019ve taken strides to make 99% of our products 100%\nrecyclable, reflecting our dedication to reducing waste and our impact on the planet.\n\n02.\n\n### Collaboration and innovation\n\nOur team thrives on collaboration. With world-class consultants in lean manufacturing and\nengineering, we constantly push boundaries, turning ideas into realities and innovations into\nsolutions.\n\n03.\n\n### Customer-centric approach\n\nYour needs are our compass. We\u2019re here to collaborate, listen, and develop tailored solutions that\nmeet your unique requirements. Your success is our success.\n\n04.\n\n## **Join us** in shaping the future\n\nAt Hydropac, we\u2019re more than just an [ice pack][121] manufacturer \u2013 we\u2019re a partner in progress.\nWhether you seek customised ice packs, sustainable solutions, or temperature assurance that\nredefines the industry, we\u2019re here to lead the way.\n\nExperience innovation that matters. Choose Hydropac \u2013 your trusted partner in cold chain shipping\nsolutions.\n\nReach out to us and let\u2019s embark on a journey to redefine temperature control together.\n\n[ Contact us ][122]\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][123]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][124]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][125]\n[ Linkedin ][126] [ X-twitter ][127]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][128]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][129]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][130]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][131]\n* [ Chilled systems ][132]\n* [ Frozen systems ][133]\n* [ Water ice packs ][134]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][135]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][136]\n* [ Site visit ][137]\n* [ Contact us ][138]\n* [ FAQ's ][139]\n* [ Blog ][140]\n* [ Shipping ][141]\n* [ Sitemap ][142]\n* [ Privacy policy ][143]\n* [ Cookies ][144]\n* [ Terms of use ][145]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][146]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][147]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[18]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[19]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[20]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[21]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[22]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[23]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[24]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[25]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[26]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/\n[27]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/envirocool/\n[28]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/recycleair/\n[29]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/reflectiveair/\n[30]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/cool-bags/\n[31]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[32]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/wool-postal-pockets/\n[33]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/\n[34]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/gel-ice-packs/\n[35]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[36]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/genesis/\n[37]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[38]: https://hydropac.co.uk/about-us/\n[39]: https://hydropac.co.uk/hydropac-and-csr/\n[40]: https://hydropac.co.uk/contact/\n[41]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjUxMjAiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%\n3D%3D\n[42]: #\n[43]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[44]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[45]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[46]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[47]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[48]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[49]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[50]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chill