[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[Wool Thermal Postal Pockets]][118]\n[[Wool Thermal Postal Pockets - Small]][119]\n[[Wool Thermal Postal Pockets - Medium]][120]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][121]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][122]\n[Home][123] / [Temperature Controlled Packaging][124] / Wool Thermal Postal Pockets\n\n# Wool Thermal Postal Pockets\n\nFrom **\u00a31.89 **each\n\n## Wool Thermal Postal Pockets\n\nFrom \u00a31.82 each (ex. postage)\n\nWool Thermal Postal Pockets offer a natural and effective all-year-round solution for shipping meat,\nfish, dairy, and other chilled items. The multi-layered wool insulation delivers superior thermal\nperformance, while the large tamper-evident self-adhesive strip ensures a secure seal during\ntransit.\n\nConstructed using 100% natural, compostable wool and a recyclable LDPE outer bag, this pocket\nprovides a lightweight, protective, and temperature-controlled shipping system.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSize \u2502Choose an optionMedium (350 x 200 mm)Small (250 x 200 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nShipping size\u2502Choose an optionBoxPallet (16 boxes)[Clear][125]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWool Thermal Postal Pockets quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n## ** Bye Plastic, Hello Wool \u2013 A Natural Upgrade for Smarter Shipping**\n\nOut with the old\u2026 in with the wool.\n\nWe\u2019re retiring our original Thermal Postal Pockets\u2014not because they didn\u2019t perform, but because they\nno longer match our environmental values.\n\nIntroducing the **Wool Thermal Postal Pocket**:\n\n## **What Are Wool Thermal Postal Pockets?**\n\nWool Thermal Postal Pockets are the perfect solution for sending chilled, temperature-sensitive\nitems through the postal or courier network. Whether you\u2019re shipping a small product or a single\nfresh item, these natural fibre pockets help maintain the cold chain and protect against impact,\nmoisture, and temperature fluctuations.\n\nProudly made in the UK, each pocket features multi-layered wool insulation\u2014scientifically proven to\noffer superior thermal retention and cushioning. Just pop your item inside, add ice packs, seal the\ntamper-evident self-adhesive strip, and it\u2019s ready to ship. No assembly. No fuss.\n\n## **Thermal Performance You Can Trust**\n\nThe Wool Thermal Postal Pocket maintains internal temperatures of **+2\u02daC to +8\u02daC for up to 24\nhours**, when used with our Ice Packs\u2014even in extreme ambient conditions.\n\n## **Sizes & Specifications**\n\nAvailable in two sizes to suit a variety of needs:\n* **Small** \u2013 Internal dims: 200 x 250 mm\n* **Medium** \u2013 Internal dims: 350 x 250 mm\n\nNote: Box quantities and pallet configurations will be confirmed soon.\n\n## **Customised Packaging Options**\n\nWant your packaging to reflect your brand?\n* Add your logo or choose custom colours\n* Full process printing up to 5 colours\n* Minimum order quantity for bespoke branding: 5,000 units\n* Maintains the chilled supply chain\n* Superior cushioning and protective properties in its class\n* Largest tamper-evident self-seal closure in its class\n* Compact and cost-efficient postal/courier format\n* Food contact safe materials\n* 100% natural and compostable\n* Single protection level across two sizes\n* Custom branding available (MOQ from 5,000)\n* Multi-layered wool insulation provides superior thermal performance \u2013 scientifically proven\n* Soft wool fibres offer enhanced cushioning and shock absorption\n* Largest self-adhesive strip for tamper-evident security in its class\n* Unique high protection level for outstanding performance\n\nPlease find technical PDF files for our Freshpac Wool Thermal Postal Pockets.\n\nWe will from time to time keep updating this section, either with updated in-house tests or if\ncustomers allow us to use the data they have collected themselves. So keep checking back in.\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][126]\n\n## Other Temperature Controlled Packaging\n\n[ [Water Ice Pack with 8 pockets, designed for effective cooling, featuring a 1kg capacity and a\nsquare shape, isolated on a white background.] ][127]\n[ View product ][128]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 8 Pocket \u2013 1kg][129]\n\n\u00a30.87\n[ View product ][130]\n\n### [ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods][131]\n\n\u00a32.84\n[ View product ][132]\n\n### [Freshpac Insulated Cool Bags][133]\n\n\u00a31.65\n[ View product ][134]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 2 Pocket \u2013 660g][135]\n\n\u00a30.85\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][136]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][137]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][138]\n[ Linkedin ][139] [ X-twitter ][140]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][141]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][142]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][143]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][144]\n* [ Chilled systems ][145]\n* [ Frozen systems ][146]\n* [ Water ice packs ][147]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][148]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][149]\n* [ Site visit ][150]\n* [ Contact us ][151]\n* [ FAQ's ][152]\n* [ Blog ][153]\n* [ Shipping ][154]\n* [ Sitemap ][155]\n* [ Privacy policy ][156]\n* [ Cookies ][157]\n* [ Terms of use ][158]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][159]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][160]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[18]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[19]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[20]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[21]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[22]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[23]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[24]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[25]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[26]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/\n[27]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/envirocool/\n[28]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/recycleair/\n[29]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/reflectiveair/\n[30]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/cool-bags/\n[31]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[32]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/wool-postal-pockets/\n[33]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/\n[34]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/gel-ice-packs/\n[35]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[36]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/genesis/\n[37]: https:/