[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[High Performance Thermal Postal Pockets]][118]\n[[High Performance Thermal Postal Pockets - Image 2]][119]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][120]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][121]\n[Home][122] / [Temperature Controlled Packaging][123] / High Performance Thermal Postal Pockets\n\n# High Performance Thermal Postal Pockets\n\nFrom **\u00a32.80 **each\n\nFreshpac Thermal Postal Pockets\n\nFrom: \u00a31.43 each\n\nFreshpac Thermal Insulated Pockets are an effective solution to use all year round for shipments of\nmeat, fish and dairy due to their super insulated properties. They also feature a self-adhesive\nstrip to ensure tamper protection.\n\nConstructed from recyclable multi-layered LDPE insulation and a strong LDPE outer bag, the Freshpac\nThermal Pocket provides an extremely lightweight temperature controlled food shipment system with\nenhanced cushioning protective properties.\n* Completely Sealed Insulated Chamber\n* High quality cushioning protection\n* Low cost system for smaller orders\n\n**Our Freshpac Thermal Postal Pockets can also be printed with your company logo or made to a\nbespoke size to suit your needs for a minimum quantity of just 5000 units. **\n\nTry a sample of our Thermal Postal Pockets for free to help you experience the system with a one\n-time service per customer; all you pay is postage. See our [Sample Store][124] for more\ninformation.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSize-internal-dimensio\u2502Choose an optionSmall (185 x 235mm)Medium (335 x 235mm)Large (585 x 235\nns \u2502mm)[Clear][125]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHigh Performance Thermal Postal Pockets quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n#### What are Thermal Postal Pockets?\u2026\n\nThey are the perfect solution for food retailers wishing to send small or single items through the\npostal/Courier network, preventing transit damage, water damage and resisting sharp temperature\nfluctuations, whilst maintaining the cold chain.\n\nFreshpac Thermal Pockets have been uniquely developed, designed and manufactured in the UK, from\ntotally recyclable, food contact safe materials and have been meticulously designed with convenience\nand practicality in mind. They will maintain the temperature inside the envelope to a refrigerated\ntemperature range of +2\u02dac to +8\u02dac for up to 24hrs or select the High Performance Pocket to achieve a\nmore assured duration.\n\nThe Freshpac Thermal Pocket comes ready to be packed with your products, There is no assembly\nrequired and by simply adding our own unique range of ice packs, seal the large tamper-evident\nadhesive strip, you are good to go.\n\nAvailable in three sizes and uniquely, two levels of protection and insulation, to best suit your\nproducts and your comfort level.\n\n#### Customised Packaging\n\nAdditionally, you can personalise the pockets by branding with your company logo, change the size\nand colour, or print process imagery up to 5 colours.\n\nMinimum order quantity for bespoke designs from as little as 5,000 envelopes.\n\n#### The Pocket Range:\n* **Small** \u2013 Internal Dims: 285 x 235mm\n* **Medium** \u2013 Internal Dims: 335 x 235mm\n* **Large** \u2013 Internal Dims: 585 x 235mm\n\n#### Insulated Thermal Pocket:\n\nAvailable in small, medium and large, the Insulated Thermal Pocket has been designed to send\ntemperature sensitive items through the postal network system in confidence.\n\nThe Insulated pocket contains several layers of food grade recyclable insulation, in addition to\nbenefiting from Hydropac\u2019s unique internal sealing system, offering a completely sealed and unique\ninternal chamber, capable of maintaining the refrigerated temperature range of +2\u02dac to +8\u02dac\nthroughout the extremes of summer for up to 24hrs, when used with our Ice Packs.\n\n#### High Performance Thermal Pocket:\n\nAvailable in small, medium and large, the High Performance Thermal Pocket has been designed to send\ntemperature sensitive items through the postal network system in confidence.\n\nThe High Performance Thermal Pocket contains a superior level of recyclable food grade insulation;\n30% above that of the insulated envelope, to maintain the temperature within the refrigerated range\nof +2\u02dac to +8\u02dac for up to 24hrs, when used with our Ice Packs.\n\nAll of our Thermal Pockets can be printed and made to a size bespoke to your needs, for a minimum\norder quantity of 5000 Pockets.\n* Maintain the Chilled cold chain\n* Unrivalled Cushioning and Protective Properties in it\u2019s class\n* The Largest \u2018Tamper-Evident\u2019 Self Seal Closure in it\u2019s class\n* Compact, Low Cost Postal/Courier System\n* Food Contact Safe Materials\n* 100% Recyclable (LDPE)\n* 2 Protection Levels each in 3 Sizes.\n* Company Branding (MOQ from as little as 5,000)\n* Completely Sealed Internal Chamber, not exposed on any edge\n* Wound layers of Insulate rather than one thick piece, provide a superior insulate as a\nscientifically proven formula.\n* Softer insulate to provide superior cushioning protection\n* Largest self adhesive strip for \u2018tamper-evident\u2019 security in it\u2019s class.\n* Unique High protection level for superior performance.\n\nPlease find technical PDF files for our Freshpac Thermal Postal Pockets.\n\nWe will from time to time keep updating this section, either with updated in-house tests or if\ncustomers allow us to use the data they have collected themselves. So keep checking back in.\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][126]\n\n## Other Temperature Controlled Packaging\n\n[ View product ][127]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 Samples][128]\n\n\u00a30.00\n\n[ View product ][129]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 12 Pocket \u2013 450g][130]\n\n\u00a30.60\n[ View product ][131]\n\n### [Hydropac Gel Ice Packs \u2013 Samples][132]\n\n\u00a30.00\n[ View product ][133]\n\n### [Thermal Postal Pockets][134]\n\n\u00a32.09\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][135]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][136]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][137]\n[ Linkedin ][138] [ X-twitter ][139]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][140]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][141]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][142]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][143]\n* [ Chilled systems ][144]\n* [ Frozen systems ][145]\n* [ Water ice packs ][146]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][147]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][148]\n* [ Site visit ][149]\n* [ Contact us ][150]\n* [ FAQ's ][151]\n* [ Blog ][152]\n* [ Shipping ][153]\n* [ Sitemap ][154]\n* [ Privacy policy ][155]\n* [ Cookies ][156]\n* [ Terms of use ][157]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][158]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][159]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[18]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[19]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[20]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[21]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[22]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[23]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[24]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[25]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[26]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/\n[27]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/envirocool/\n[28]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/recycleair/\n[29]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/reflectiveair/\n[30]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/cool-bags/\n[31]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[32]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/wool-postal-pockets/\n[33]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/\n[34]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/gel-ice-packs/\n[35]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[36]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/genesis/\n[37]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[38]: https://hydropac.co.uk/about-us/\n[39]: https://hydropac.co.uk/hydropac-and-csr/\n[40]: https://hydropac.co.uk/contact/\n[41]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3A"
