[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods]][118]\n[[ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods - Image 2]][119]\n[[ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods - Image 3]][120]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][121]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][122]\n[Home][123] / [Temperature Controlled Packaging][124] / ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods\n\n# ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods\n\nFrom **\u00a32.84 **each\n\nA revolutionary leak resistant Temperature Controlled Packaging System for Food, Pharmaceutical,\nBiotech and Medical sectors, allowing suppliers and companies to send products through the postal\nnetwork with confidence.\n* Frozen Systems (Dependant on Ice Pack Selection) for a MINIMUM of 24hrs\n* Waterproof and leak resistant to avoid box damage\n* Cushioning and Protective Properties of the Bubble\n* Compact and high strength storage solution with up to 700 Liners per pallet\n* Low Cost Postal/Courier System\n* Reusable with a wipe clean surface\n\nTry a sample of our ReflectiveAir for free to help you experience the system with a one -time\nservice per customer; all you pay is postage. See our [Sample Store][125] for more information.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLiner-only-or-com\u2502Choose an option3D Double Layer ReflectiveAir Bag Only3D Double Layer\nplete-system \u2502ReflectiveAir Bag Complete System\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLitres \u2502Choose an optionBox 101 (6Ltr) - ID: 350 x 190 x 100mmBox 2 (17ltr) - ID: 400 x\n\u2502270 x 160mmBox 6 (28ltr) - ID: 395 x 275 x 260mm[Clear][126]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n#### What is a Reflective Air bag?\u2026\n\nThey are a revolutionary water and leak resistant product to both the Food, Pharmaceutical, Biotech\nand Medical sectors, enabling suppliers, producers, co-packers and logistics companies alike, to\nsend products via the postal network in confidence.\n\nThe Reflective Air bags are provided in a single or double layer, heavy grade LDPE sealed bubble,\nsandwiched between a foil based laminate (Inside & Out), providing an extraordinary level of\ninsulation through reflection and trapped air, at a comparatively low cost. In addition, both\nsystems have a Self Seal Adhesive \u2018Hot Melt\u2019 strip to save unsightly and fiddly taping.\n\n#### How do they Perform?\u2026\n\nThe Reflective Air bags have been extensively tested to ensure they meet with current legislations,\nyour logistical needs and maintaining the Chilled cold chain (2D or 3D) or Frozen cold chain (3D)\nover a minimum 24hr period.\n\nClimate Chamber and customer own testing has proven, that the 2D system will perform on a UK based\n\u2018extreme\u2019 peak summer temperature profile for more than 24hrs and 96hrs during winter testing (held\nbetween +2\u02dac to +8\u02da). The 3D System; using the same \u2018Extreme\u2019 summer temperature profile, performed\nto a minimum 48hrs between +2\u02dac to +8\u02da and in addition to a minimum of 24hrs below -12\u02dac, making\nthem perfect for Frozen food deliveries.\n\nSo we urge you to test the bags for yourselves using your own product, and hopefully you\u2019ll be as\namazed by the results, as we were.\n\n#### So what are the 2D & 3D Variations?\u2026\n\nWe offer this product as a 2D flat bag system in a single bubble and Single Foil laminate, which you\nsimply spread out into the bottom of your box to form a gusseted bottom. This is available in just\nthe one size (Large) as we have found this size to be the best fit into a variety of box sizes,\nsaving you the need to stock lots of different sizes.\n\nIn addition, we have also introduced a first to the UK market, in a ready formed 3D box bottom\nsystem, using either a Double or Single layer bubble Insulate and double foil laminate, which has\nbeen developed and manufactured to fit snugly in to our own standard box sizes (Box 101, 2, 5 & 6)\nbut of course, you may wish to have your own box size tailored for, which for a minimum commitment\nto 2,500 bags, we will make to order on a stock and serve basis. Both systems are provided with a\nself adhesive closure strip to seal the system.\n\n#### 2D ReflectiveAir Bag:\n* Available as standard, as a one size fits all system, fitting a maximum box size of 390 x 330 x\n330mm.\n* This bag is available with a low minimum order quantity of just 75 bags.\n* For Bespoke sizes MOQ from as little as 2,500 Bags\n\nCheck out the 2D ReflectiveAir [here][127]\n\n#### 3D ReflectiveAir Bag:\n\nAvailable as standard to fit 4 of our standard box sizes, Box 101, 2, 5 & 6.\n\nThe 3D bag system comes in one of two quality combinations:\n\n**FROZEN FOOD**\n* High Performance Double Bubble & Double Foil Layers (Below -12\u02dac) for a minimum 24hrs\n* Advice Only \u2013 Use a 50% Product Weight ratio in Hydro-Freeze or Dry Ice, to maintain the correct\nfrozen temperature.\n* Bespoke sizes from as little as 1,000 Liners\n\n#### Why throw the liner away after use! \u2013 You could simply wipe clean and re-use, or\u2026.\n\nInspired by intended market uses for the Material we use and our customers novel suggestions, just\nsome of the ideas for re-use.\n\n**Actual uses/current market use\u2026**\n* Used In lofts and outhouses as Insulating material stapled across beams\n* Used as Underlay for hardwood flooring.\n* Used as a Radiator reflector\n* Used as Pipe lagging\n* Used as a windscreen sun shield\n* Lining in Hot food bags/Pizza Bags\n* Used to line AKE containers/Cargo hold containers.\n\n**Customer inspired uses:**\n* Insulating Animal Hutches/Beds\n* Wrap around plants to focus and intensify sunlight\n* Dead wall of a greenhouse to distribute/reflect light\n* Carpet underlay\n* Improve your suntan\n* Keeping food warm\n* Lining Food Cupboards to keep heat and cold at bay.\n* Wrapping paper, Wallpaper \u2013 you might think we are being silly, but it actually happened!\n\n#### Wish to send Fresh and Frozen in one parcel Delivery?\n\nIf sending frozen as well as fresh chilled products in one system, why not try using our [Thermal\nPockets][128] inside the Reflective Air bag. Ideal for product separation, as well as an assured\ndelivery method, for sending both fresh and frozen products in one box.\n* Frozen Systems (Dependant on Ice Pack Selection) for a MINIMUM of 24hrs\n* Double Bubble / Double Foil Layers + Hot Melt Closure Strip\n* Waterproof, Leak-resistant bottom \u2013 eliminates Box Damage!\n* Cushioning and Protective Properties of the Bubble, No Assembly required.\n* Compact Storage solution, up to 700 Liners per pallet\n* Low Cost Postal/Courier System\n* Wipe clean and re-use, or see multiple novel re-use ideas for the liners below.\n* MOQ of just 50 Systems for standard sizes, 25 for liner only and Bespoke sizes available for an\nMOQ of 1,000\n* Completely water & leak resistant solution, sealed bottom.\n* Lowest order quantity.\n* 1^{st} to market with the 2D/3D Bag systems\n\nWe have tested our Reflective Air Bags extensively and are very pleased with their performance. So\nplease find a selection of technical PDF files available for your download.\n\nBut ultimately, you may feel the need to test for yourselves; in fact we would urge you to do so, as\nno two shipments are ever the same. The systems are available in small volumes, so why not buy and\ntest for yourselves.\n\nFreshpac - 3D Reflective Air System (48hr Test) +2 to +8\n[ Download now ][129]\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][130]\n\n## Other Temperature Controlled Packaging\n\n[ [Gel ice pack by Pharmapac, 750g, designed for effective cooling and safe temperature maintenance,\nshown on a white background.] ][131]\n[ View product ][132]\n\n### [Pharmapac\u00ae 750g Gel Ice Pack][133]\n\n\u00a30.51\n[ [A sealed clear plastic pouch labelled \u201cWater Ice Pack - 1 Pocket - 500g\u201d features blue text and\nsymbols. The minimalistic design includes a white background and the marking ICES054 below the\npouch.] ][134]\n[ View product ][135]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 500g][136]\n\n\u00a30.35\n[ View product ][137]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 2 Pocket \u2013 660g][138]\n\n\u00a30.85\n[ View product ][139]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 6 Pocket \u2013 750g][140]\n\n\u00a30.66\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][141]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][142]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][143]\n[ Linkedin ][144] [ X-twitter ][145]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][146]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][147]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][148]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][149]\n* [ Chilled systems ][150]\n* [ Frozen systems ][151]\n* [ Water ice packs ][152]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][153]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][154]\n* [ Site visit ][155]\n* [ Contact us ][156]\n* [ FAQ's ][157]\n* [ Blog ][158]\n* [ Shipping ][159]\n* [ Sitemap ][160]\n* [ Privacy policy ][161]\n* [ Cookies ][162]\n* [ Terms of use ][163]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][164]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing"
