ause we feel that having\nthe tightest and most robust quality control standards are so vitally important, that we decided to\ngo one step further and send quality controlled samples of every single production run to an\nindependent laboratory for microbiological testing. To that end, you should feel assured that we are\nthe only company that can provide a full cleanliness and safety certification, for every single\norder leaving our factory.\n\n#### Customised Packaging\n\nAlthough we always favour the reassuring clarity of a transparent ice pack, we can supply them in\nany colour and even printed with your company logo and information. Printed and custom sized ice\npacks are always made to order and we offer unrivalled low minimum order levels starting from just 2\npallets.\n\nPlease Also Read Our [Safe Handling Instructions For Ice Packs][128] in Our Technical Data Section,\nWe Are Very Precious About Our Little Creations At Hydropac, *So Please Play Nicely With Them*!\n* Completely food contact safe, using a 3 stage filtration process including UV light sterilisation\n* Burst strength tested to over 200kg\n* Completely recyclable after use\n* Fully printable, from relatively low minimum order quantities\n* Flexible even when frozen\n\nHydropac Water Ice Packs have 9 standard off the shelf items in differing sizes, weights and pocket\nconfigurations and the option to tailor make the size and weight to your requirements.\n* Largest standard Ice Pack range currently in the market\n* Most flexible range of ice packs available, just ask for your own configuration.\n* Strongest Ice Packs and Ice Mats on the market due to our unique material blend (Unrivalled Burst\nstrength)\n* Our own \u2018Seal through Liquid\u2019 technology produces a pack filled to capacity every time.\n* Accurate metering system delivers a pack to specification \u2013 you really do get exactly what you pay\nfor.\n* Ice sheets will not stick together when frozen, unlike traditional \u2018Soak & Freeze\u2019 packs.\n* Clear materials and clean liquid fill \u2013 you can see the purity with nothing hidden\n* Custom print options with minimum runs starting as low as 2 pallets!\n* Offered as standard in courier boxes or freezer trays\n\nAll Hydropac Ice Packs and Ice Mats have passed rigorous quality control and safety procedures.\n* 3 Stage Filtration System including:\nUV light Sterilisation\nChlorination control\n* **Every** batch sent for independent microbiological testing\n* Unique film blends with burst strengths in excess of 200kg\n\nOur competitors would love to know exactly what we do and how we do it, so we prefer to play our\ncards close to our chests! Our customers do have a right to ask for data and information regarding\ntheir purchases or future purchases, so if you need any information feel free to give us a call or\ndrop us an [email][129] and we will get right onto it.\n\nPlease Also Read Our [Safe Handling Instructions For Ice Packs][130] in Our Technical Data Section,\nWe Are Very Precious About Our Little Creations At Hydropac, *So Please Play Nicely With Them*!\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][131]\nHydropac Ice Packs - Safe Handling Instructions\n[ Download now ][132]\n\n## Other Ice Packs - Chilled\n\n[ View product ][133]\n\n### [EasiFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 2 Pocket \u2013 660g][134]\n\n\u00a30.89\n[ View product ][135]\n\n### [RecycleAir System Samples][136]\n\n\u00a30.00\n\n[ View product ][137]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 6 Pocket \u2013 750g][138]\n\n\u00a30.66\n[ View product ][139]\n\n### [EasiFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 8 Pocket \u2013 1.25kg][140]\n\n\u00a31.84\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][141]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][142]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][143]\n[ Linkedin ][144] [ X-twitter ][145]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][146]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][147]\n* [ Fre