[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[Water Ice Pack - 4 Pocket - 250g]][118]\n[[Water Ice Pack - 4 Pocket - 250g - Image 2]][119]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][120]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][121]\n[Home][122] / [Hydropac ice packs][123] / [Ice Packs - Chilled][124] / Water Ice Pack \u2013 4 Pocket \u2013\n250g\n\n# Water Ice Pack \u2013 4 Pocket \u2013 250g\n\nFrom **\u00a30.35 **each\n\nHydropac\u2019s Ice Packs are the strongest, safest and purest Ice Packs available in freezer trays or\ncourier boxes as standard. Courier Boxes are perfect for those with smaller requirements, with an\nextremely low minimum order of just 1 Box or 2 pallets if you would like your logo printing onto the\nice packs.\n* Customisable with your branding, minimum run 2 pallets (Commitment Req)\n* Next working day delivery available\n* Available in freezer trays\n\nTry a [Water Ice Pack sample][125] to help you decide if these are the right packs before you commit\nto a full order. Available in a range of sizes and weights. This is a one-time service per customer,\nwith only 1 product permitted in any size and only 3 products total per sample basket. Check out the\n[Sample Store][126] for more information.\n\nPlease take some time to read our [Safe Handling Instructions For Ice Packs][127]. We are very\nprecious about our creations at Hydropac, so please look after them!\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCourier-box-or-freeze\u2502Choose an optionFreezer Trays - Quantity of 3072 (1 Pallet)Courier Box -\nr-trays \u2502Quantity of 80 (1 Box)[Clear][128]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nWater Ice Pack - 4 Pocket - 250g quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n#### Hydropac Who?\u2026.\n\nYou may not have heard of us before \u2013 that\u2019s partly because we are one of the best kept secrets in\nour industry. But as the largest and most innovative producer of pure ice packs and ice mats in the\nUK, Hydropac will without doubt have an ice pack to meet your individual requirements. With the\nlargest range of off the shelf sizes and the ability to custom produce sizes and weights to your\nspecifications \u2013 without additional tooling costs \u2013 you will not find a manufacturer this cool\never! We even work as a silent manufacturing partner for many of our competitors and large\nretailers, so you may well already be using our ice packs and ice mats to keep your products cool.\n\n#### So how are Hydropac different?\u2026\n\nWe have designed and built our own specialised ice pack machinery that utilises an unrivalled dosing\nsystem, in addition to our own \u2018Seal through Liquid\u2019 technology, these allows us to accurately fill\nthe ice packs to capacity. We have also developed a unique material blend that enables us to produce\nthe strongest and most durable ice packs available; **withstanding over 200kg of weight without\nbursting**. This special material is fully recyclable and certified as completely food contact safe,\nunlike the traditional \u2018Soak and Freeze\u2019 products that stick together when frozen.\n\nHydropac ice packs and ice mats are produced on site at our conveniently located factory in\nBuckinghamshire UK with either water, gel or our own unique phase change solution, that has been\ndesigned to maintain food at frozen temperatures. Our large off-the-shelf range of ice packs are all\nproduced from transparent/clear materials to reassure you and your customers that there is nothing\nto hide. However, if you would prefer a coloured ice pack or ice mat, then of course we can\nmanufacture these to your taste at the advised minimum order quantity.\n\n#### Quality comes as standard!\n\nAll of our ice packs and ice mats have to pass rigorous quality control processes, including a\n3-stage filtration process, including being softened, chlorinated and UV light treated. This ensures\nyour ice packs are the purest, cleanest and safest ice packs available. Because we feel that having\nthe tightest and most robust quality control standards are so vitally important, that we decided to\ngo one step further and send quality controlled samples of every single production run to an\nindependent laboratory for microbiological testing. To that end, you should feel assured that we are\nthe only company that can provide a full cleanliness and safety certification, for every single\norder leaving our factory.\n\n#### Customised Packaging\n\nAlthough we always favour the reassuring clarity of a transparent ice pack, we can supply them in\nany colour and even printed with your company logo and information. Printed and custom sized ice\npacks are always made to order and we offer unrivalled low minimum order levels starting from just 2\npallets.\n\nPlease Also Read Our [Safe Handling Instructions For Ice Packs][129] in Our Technical Data Section,\nWe Are Very Precious About Our Little Creations At Hydropac, *So Please Play Nicely With Them*!\n* Completely food contact safe, using a 3 stage filtration process including UV light sterilisation\n* Burst strength tested to over 200kg\n* Completely recyclable after use\n* 9 standard off the shelf items in differing sizes, weights and pocket configurations and the\noption to tailor make the size and weight to your requirements\n* Fully printable, from relatively low minimum order quantities\n* Flexible even when frozen\n* Largest standard Ice Pack range currently in the market\n* Most flexible range of ice packs available, just ask for your own configuration.\n* Strongest Ice Packs and Ice Mats on the market due to our unique material blend (Unrivalled Burst\nstrength)\n* Our own \u2018Seal through Liquid\u2019 technology produces a pack filled to capacity every time.\n* Accurate metering system delivers a pack to specification \u2013 you really do get exactly what you pay\nfor.\n* Ice sheets will not stick together when frozen, unlike traditional \u2018Soak & Freeze\u2019 packs.\n* Clear materials and clean liquid fill \u2013 you can see the purity with nothing hidden\n* Custom print options with minimum runs starting as low as 2 pallets!\n* Offered as standard in Courier Boxes or Freezer Trays\n\nAll Hydropac Ice Packs and Ice Mats have passed rigorous quality control and safety procedures.\n* 3 Stage Filtration System including:\nUV light Sterilisation\nChlorination control\n* **Every** batch sent for independent microbiological testing\n* Unique film blends with burst strengths in excess of 200kg\n\nOur competitors would love to know exactly what we do and how we do it, so we prefer to play our\ncards close to our chests! Our customers do have a right to ask for data and information regarding\ntheir purchases or future purchases, so if you need any information feel free to give us a call or\ndrop us an [email][130] and we will get right onto it.\n\nPlease Also Read Our [Safe Handling Instructions For Ice Packs][131] in Our Technical Data Section,\nWe Are Very Precious About Our Little Creations At Hydropac, *So Please Play Nicely With Them*!\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][132]\nHydropac Ice Packs - Safe Handling Instructions\n[ Download now ][133]\n\n## Other Ice Packs - Chilled\n\n[ View product ][134]\n\n### [ReflectiveAir System for Chilled Goods][135]\n\n\u00a31.85\n[ View product ][136]\n\n### [ReflectiveAir Chilled & Frozen System Samples][137]\n\n\u00a30.00\n\n[ View product ][138]\n\n### [Thermal Postal Pockets][139]\n\n\u00a32.09\n[ View product ][140]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 8 Pocket \u2013 500g][141]\n\n\u00a30.47\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][142]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][143]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][144]\n[ Linkedin ][145] [ X-twitter ][146]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][147]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][148]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][149]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][150]\n* [ Chilled systems ][151]\n* [ Frozen systems ][152]\n* [ Water ice packs ][153]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][154]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][155]\n* [ Site visit ][156]\n* [ Contact us ][157]\n* [ FAQ's ][158]\n* [ Blog ][159]\n* [ Shipping ][160]\n* [ Sitemap ][161]\n* [ Privacy policy ][162]\n* [ Cookies ][163]\n* [ Terms of use ][164]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][165]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][166]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n["
