[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[Pre-Frozen Ice Packs]][118]\n[[Pre-Frozen Ice Packs - Image 2]][119]\n[[Pre-Frozen Ice Packs - Image 3]][120]\n[[Pre-Frozen Ice Packs - Image 4]][121]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][122]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][123]\n[Home][124] / [Hydropac ice packs][125] / [Ice Packs - Chilled][126] / Pre-Frozen Ice Packs\n\n# Pre-Frozen Ice Packs\n\nFrom **\u00a30.42 **each\n\nAre you short on space or are your ice packs taking too long to freeze down? Don\u2019t worry, we have\nthe answer to that! Hydropac are now making your life easier, introducing the pinnacle of\nconvenience with our pre-frozen ice packs.\n\nWe offer a national service for delivering a small selection of our standard water and gel ice packs\nto your door, frozen and ready to use. We deliver these in full pallet lots on 3-5-day service using\nfrozen transport to maintain their temperature. Simply re-pack them into your outgoing shipments and\nsend them on\u2026 it\u2019s as simple as that!\n\nPlease read our [Safe Handling Instructions for Ice Packs][127]. We are very precious about our\ncreations at Hydropac, so please look after them!\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSelect-your-si\u2502Choose an option500g-1 Pocket Gel Ice Pack ( x 40)500g-1 Pocket Water Ice Pack ( x\nze \u250240)[Clear][128]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPre-Frozen Ice Packs quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n**Ready Frozen Water and Gel Ice Packs \u2013 could we make your life much easier?!**\n\nHaving supplied a select few customers with pre-frozen Water and Gel Ice Packs for a number of\nyears, the requests for these seemed to keep on coming. We pride ourselves on listening to our\ncustomers, so here they are \u2013 available for everyone.\n\nAvailable in 2 options; the 500g 1 pocket filled with either water or gel.\n\nYou can order any time of day and to anywhere in the UK; including Northern & Southern Ireland. It\u2019s\nthat easy; place your order online, sit back and wait. Once your pre-frozen ice packs arrive,\nre-pack them and send them on. No stress, no hassle.\n\nPlease also read our [Safe Handling Instructions For Ice Packs][129] to make sure each and every ice\npack you buy lives it\u2019s life to the full![/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]\n* Eradicate lengthy freeze down times for ice packs and have them delivered on tap *(if you\u2019ll\nexcuse the pun)*\n* Free up valuable freezer space for your products, not ice packs\n* 2-3-day lead times achievable (max 3-5 days dependant on UK location)\n* Uniform freezing of ice packs before they arrive, no distortion or splits due to fast freezing.\n* Every type of our pre-frozen ice packs are certified food contact safe.\n* Totally reusable & completely recyclable\n* Available at present in 2 different options for water and gel\n* No other ice pack manufacturer makes it this easy to order ice on tap\u2026. *there\u2019s that pun again\u2026.*\n* Available in two standard ice packs; Water or Gel and delivered frozen in Freezer Trays.\n* Part of the largest standard Ice Pack range currently in the market\n* Strongest Ice Packs on the market due to our unique material blend (Unrivalled Burst strength)\n* The most flexible range of ice packs available on the market \u2013 just ask for your own\nconfiguration.\n* Our unique \u2018Seal through Liquid\u2019 technology produces a pack filled to capacity every time.\n* Accurate metering system delivers a pack to specification \u2013 you really do get exactly what you pay\nfor.\n* Ice sheets will not stick together when frozen, unlike traditional \u2018Soak & Freeze\u2019 packs\n\nAll Hydropac Ice Packs have passed rigorous quality control and safety procedures.\n* 6 Stage Filtration System\n* UV light Sterilisation\n* Chlorination control\n* Every batch sent for independent microbiological testing to The Public Health Standards\n* Unique film blends with burst strengths in excess of 200kg\n\nOur competitors would love to know exactly what we do and how we do it, so we prefer to play our\ncards close to our chests, but existing customers have a right to ask for data and information\nregarding your purchase or future purchases, so if you need any information feel free to give us a\ncall on +44 (0) 1494 530 182 or fill in our [contact form][130] and we will get right onto it.\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][131]\nHydropac Ice Packs - Safe Handling Instructions\n[ Download now ][132]\n\n## Other Ice Packs - Chilled\n\n[ View product ][133]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 2 Pocket \u2013 660g][134]\n\n\u00a30.85\n[ View product ][135]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 4 Pocket \u2013 500g][136]\n\n\u00a30.47\n[ [Water Ice Pack - 1 Pocket - 275g] ][137]\n[ View product ][138]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 275g][139]\n\n\u00a30.16\n[ [A sealed clear plastic pouch labelled \u201cWater Ice Pack - 1 Pocket - 500g\u201d features blue text and\nsymbols. The minimalistic design includes a white background and the marking ICES054 below the\npouch.] ][140]\n[ View product ][141]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 500g][142]\n\n\u00a30.35\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][143]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][144]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][145]\n[ Linkedin ][146] [ X-twitter ][147]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][148]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][149]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][150]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][151]\n* [ Chilled systems ][152]\n* [ Frozen systems ][153]\n* [ Water ice packs ][154]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][155]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][156]\n* [ Site visit ][157]\n* [ Contact us ][158]\n* [ FAQ's ][159]\n* [ Blog ][160]\n* [ Shipping ][161]\n* [ Sitemap ][162]\n* [ Privacy policy ][163]\n* [ Cookies ][164]\n* [ Terms of use ][165]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][166]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][167]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[18]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[19]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[20]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[21]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[22]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[23]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[24]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[25]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[26]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/\n[27]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/envirocool/\n[28]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/recycleair/\n[29]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/reflectiveair/\n[30]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/cool-bags/\n[31]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[32]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/wool-postal-pockets/\n[33]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/\n[34]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/gel-ice-packs/\n[35]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[36]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/genesis/\n[37]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[38]: https://hydropac.co.uk/about-us/\n[39]: https://hydropac.co.uk/hydropac-and-csr/\n[40]: https://hydropac.co.uk/contact/\n[41]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjUxMjAiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%\n3D%3D\n[42]: #\n[43]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[44]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[45]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[46]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[47]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[48]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[49]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[50]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[51]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[52]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[53]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[54]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[55]: https://hydropac.co.uk/?page_id=1091\n[56]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-pack"
