[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[Hydropac Gel Ice Packs - Samples]][118]\n[[Hydropac Gel Ice Packs - Samples - Image 2]][119]\n[[Hydropac Gel Ice Packs - Samples - Image 3]][120]\n[[Hydropac Gel Ice Packs - Samples - Image 4]][121]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][122]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][123]\n[Home][124] / [Sample Store][125] / Hydropac Gel Ice Packs \u2013 Samples\n\n# Hydropac Gel Ice Packs \u2013 Samples\n\nFrom **\u00a30.00 **each\n\nOur [Gel Ice Packs][126] use a unique passive cooling gel formula that is mixed with highly purified\nwater, resulting in an FSA & FDA approved, non-toxic solution that is certified food contact safe.\n\nThe use of the phase change gel formula allows for a more subtle and prolonged thawing process than\nwater-based ice packs. They are available in both courier packs and freezer trays when you place a\nfull order.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE**\n\nThe samples available through our [Sample store][127] have been made available for customers to \u201ctry\nbefore they buy\u201d and as such only one size is permitted per product sample ordered. There are 2 size\noptions for this product to choose from, with only 3 products permitted in total per sample basket.\n\u00a315.99 postage charge applies per order.\n* Fully recyclable\n* Customisable with your company logo\n* Sent in clear, transparent film as standard, printed with our logo for quality assurance\n* Less prone to deformation than water ice packs\n* Gentle thawing process\n* Independently microbiologically tested\n\nWant to place a full order? Head on over to the [Gel Ice Packs][128] page to place your order, with\nnext working day delivery on orders placed before 11am. Low MOQ; 1 box minimum order.\n\n[ Switch to Water Ice Packs and get 20% Off Your Order ][129]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSelect-you\u2502Choose an option500g-1 Pocket Gel Ice Pack (Sample)500g-2 Pocket Gel Ice Pack\nr-size \u2502(Sample)500g-8 Pocket Gel Ice Pack (Sample)[Clear][130]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHydropac Gel Ice Packs - Samples quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\nGel Ice Packs provide an alternative to the traditional [water ice packs][131], whilst remaining\ncompletely food safe and FSA/FDA approved and certified. The unique gel formula, when mixed with our\nhighly purified water, results in a non-toxic polymer solution that will take longer to thaw and\nprovide a gentle solution for products that need to be kept at a constant temperature in the cold\nchain. They are burst strength tested to over 200kg, avoiding risk of bursting under pressure in\ntransit.\n\nGel ice packs are suitable with a wide range of our packaging systems, including our insulated\nshippers, reflective liners and Recycle-Air. They are fully recyclable and produced on site at our\nconveniently located factory in Buckinghamshire, UK.\n\nAll of the ice packs we produce have to pass extremely rigorous QC processes before being sent to an\nindependent laboratory where every batch is microbiologically tested before we send them out to our\ncustomers. We are the only company that can provide a full cleanliness and safety certification for\nevery single order leaving our factory.\n* Fully recyclable\n* Passed vigorous QC processes including 3 stage filtration process and UV light treatment\n* Offers a gentle thaw for the products inside\n* Burst strength tested to over 200kg\n* Choose from 1, 2 or 8 pocket packs\n* FSA certified & FDA approved\n* Our \u2018Seal through Liquid\u2019 technology ensures they are filled to capacity every time\n* Purity is clear with nothing hidden\n* Our logo is present on packaging as standard to provide quality assurance\n* Customisable for a low MOQ of just 2 pallets\n* Low MOQ on standard packs\n* 12 standard \u201coff the shelf\u201d items in differing sizes, weights and pocket configurations\n* Flexible when frozen\n* Do not stick together\n\nWe do not release the technical data for our ice packs to the general web, as our competitors would\nlove to know what we do and how we do it. However, please give us a call or drop us an [email][132]\nif you would like discuss the technical data behind these products.\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][133]\n\n## Other Sample Store\n\n[ [Water Ice Pack with 16 pockets and a 1kg capacity, featuring durable construction for efficient\ncooling, isolated on a white background.] ][134]\n[ View product ][135]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 16 Pocket \u2013 1kg][136]\n\n\u00a30.90\n[ View product ][137]\n\n### [HydroFreeze+ Ice Pack \u2013 Samples][138]\n\n\u00a30.00\n\n[ [Gel ice pack with 8 pockets for effective cooling, weighing 500g, designed in a square shape,\nisolated on a white background.] ][139]\n[ View product ][140]\n\n### [Gel Ice Pack \u2013 8 Pocket \u2013 500g][141]\n\n\u00a30.51\n[ View product ][142]\n\n### [Water Ice Packs Samples][143]\n\n\u00a30.00\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][144]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][145]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][146]\n\n[ Linkedin ][147] [ X-twitter ][148]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][149]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][150]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][151]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][152]\n* [ Chilled systems ][153]\n* [ Frozen systems ][154]\n* [ Water ice packs ][155]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][156]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][157]\n* [ Site visit ][158]\n* [ Contact us ][159]\n* [ FAQ's ][160]\n* [ Blog ][161]\n* [ Shipping ][162]\n* [ Sitemap ][163]\n* [ Privacy policy ][164]\n* [ Cookies ][165]\n* [ Terms of use ][166]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][167]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][168]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[18]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[19]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[20]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[21]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[22]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[23]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[24]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[25]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[26]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/\n[27]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/envirocool/\n[28]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/recycleair/\n[29]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/reflectiveair/\n[30]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/cool-bags/\n[31]