[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[Pharmapac - Polystyrene Boxes]][118]\n[[Pharmapac - Polystyrene Boxes - Image 2]][119]\n[[Pharmapac - Polystyrene Boxes - Image 3]][120]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][121]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][122]\n[Home][123] / [Pharmapac][124] / Pharmapac \u2013 Polystyrene Boxes\n\n# Pharmapac \u2013 Polystyrene Boxes\n\nFrom **\u00a34.19 **each\n\nThe Pharmapac\u00ae Polystyrene Box range offers a unique range of wall thicknesses to cater for extended\ntransit times and extreme temperature profiles when shipping pharmaceutical products.\n\nThese boxes are part of our innovative [Pharmapac\u00ae range][125], supplying pharmaceutical and\nbiomedical companies with effective shipping solutions for delicate products, including medications\nand vaccines. We offer a comprehensive and transparent guide to transit times and passive cooling\nmedium required, according to various ASTM and WHO testing standards.\n\n**NB. Please note that these products require at least one PharmaPac\u00ae 750g Gel Ice pack. More will\nbe required for larger boxes/colder temperatures.**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInternal-c\u2502Choose an optionPHARMA-EPS-1 - 3.3LtrsPHARMA-EPS-2 - 5.1LtrsPHARMA-EPS-4 -\napacity-lt\u25029.8LtrsPHARMA-EPS-3 - 9.4LtrsPHARMA-EPS-4 DEEP - 16.5LtrsPHARMA-EPS-5 -\nrs \u250223.3LtrsPHARMA-EPS-6 - 47.8Ltrs[Clear][126]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPharmapac - Polystyrene Boxes quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n## **Why Use Pharmapac\u00ae Polystyrene Boxes?**\n\nAs you will undoubtedly be aware, in the world of pharmaceuticals it is vitally important that goods\nare transported to their exacting requirements, with no deviation outside of the desired window.\nPharmapac\u00ae\u2019s Pharma Boxes are well placed as a tried and tested solution for shipping where\nreliability and extended shipping times are required.\n\nThe extra thick insulated walls of our Pharma Boxes provide strength and protection against careless\ncouriers, in addition to providing a high rate of thermal protection. This gives the boxes the\nability to hold their goods inside at a constant temperature during transit for longer durations.\n\nOur entire range is capable of transporting goods from 1 Day right through to 5 Days, at the same\nmaintained cold temperature.\n\n## **How Do Pharmapac\u00ae Pharma Boxes Perform?**\n\nOur Pharma Boxes are designed to withstand extreme temperature profiles, rather than \u201csoft\u201d profiles\nonly.\n\nPlease see our Technical Data Section for a comprehensive guide to the volume of Passive Cooling\nmedium (Gel Packs) required per box size, dependent on duration required and the current ambient\ntemperature conditions.\n\nAlthough the data provided are not validations, they are formulated using a combination of base-line\ntesting and scientific calculations.\n\nIf you need a \u2018Pre-Qualified System\u2019 then you will need to select the \u2018Genesis\u2019 product, which is\n\u2018Pre-Qualified\u2019 using various temperature profiles, all of which available for download in the\ntechnical tab when you select Genesis.\n\n## **Can Pharmapac\u00ae Provide Validations?**\n\nAt Pharmapac**\u00ae**, we have our own testing laboratory and in collaboration with our customers we can\nprovide testing and validations of your specific requirements.\n\nWe welcome collaboration and if you need to have your products and shipping systems validated, we\nwelcome further discussion.\n\nIn addition, a number of our Pharma Poly Box sizes have already been \u2018Pre-Qualified\u2019.\n\n## **What Sizes Are Pharmapac\u00ae Pharma Boxes Available In?**\n\nWe have 7 standard sizes available for next day delivery if required or they can be delivered on a\ncheaper economy service (3-5 days).\n\n### **Standard Range**\n1. **Pharma Box 1 **\u2013 Insulation Thickness 45mm \u2013 ID: 155 x 145 x 148mm (3.3 Ltr Capacity)\n2. **Pharma Box 2 **\u2013 Insulation Thickness 60mm \u2013 ID: 167 x 167 x 185mm (5.1 Ltr Capacity)\n3. **Pharma Box 3 **\u2013 Insulation Thickness 45mm \u2013 ID: 240 x 210 x 195mm (9.8 Ltr Capacity)\n4. **Pharma Box 4** \u2013 Insulation Thickness 60mm \u2013 ID: 213 x 213 x 208mm (9.4 Ltr Capacity)\n5. **Pharma Box 4D** \u2013 Insulation Thickness 40mm \u2013 ID: 255 x 255 x 255mm (16.5 Ltr Capacity)\n6. **Pharma Box 5** \u2013 Insulation Thickness 70mm \u2013 ID: 314 x 314 x 237mm (23.3 Ltr Capacity)\n7. **Pharma Box 6** \u2013 Insulation Thickness 55mm \u2013 ID: 442 x 387 x 280mm (47.8 Ltr Capacity)\n\n## Other Pharmapac\n\n[ View product ][127]\n\n### [EnviroCool][128]\n\n\u00a33.01\n[ [Water Ice Pack - 1 Pocket - 275g] ][129]\n[ View product ][130]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 275g][131]\n\n\u00a30.16\n[ View product ][132]\n\n### [EasiFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 2 Pocket \u2013 660g][133]\n\n\u00a30.89\n[ View product ][134]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 8 Pocket \u2013 1.25kg][135]\n\n\u00a31.68\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][136]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][137]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][138]\n[ Linkedin ][139] [ X-twitter ][140]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][141]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][142]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][143]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][144]\n* [ Chilled systems ][145]\n* [ Frozen systems ][146]\n* [ Water ice packs ][147]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][148]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][149]\n* [ Site visit ][150]\n* [ Contact us ][151]\n* [ FAQ's ][152]\n* [ Blog ][153]\n* [ Shipping ][154]\n* [ Sitemap ][155]\n* [ Privacy policy ][156]\n* [ Cookies ][157]\n* [ Terms of use ][158]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][159]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][160]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[18]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[19]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[20]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[21]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[22]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[23]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[24]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[25]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[26]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/\n[27]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/envirocool/\n[28]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/recycleair/\n[29]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/reflectiveair/\n[30]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/cool-bags/\n[31]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[32]: https://hydropac.co.uk/freshpac/wool-postal-pockets/\n[33]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/\n[34]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/gel-ice-packs/\n[35]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/polystyrene-boxes/\n[36]: https://hydropac.co.uk/pharmapac/genesis/\n[37]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[38]: https://hydropac.co.uk/about-us/\n[39]: https://hydropac.co.uk/hydropac-and-csr/\n[40]: https://hydropac.co.uk/contact/\n[41]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjUxMjAiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%\n3D%3D\n[42]: #\n[43]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[44]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[45]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[46]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[47]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[48]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[49]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[50]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[51]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\n[52]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/\n[53]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/easifreeze/\n[54]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/hydrofreeze/\n[55]: https://hydropac.co.uk/?page_id=1091\n[56]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/courier-boxes/\n[57]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/frozen/freezer-trays/\n[58]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/\n[59]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-blocks/\n[60]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/hard-shell/hard-plates/\n[61]:"
