[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[Gel ice pack by Pharmapac, 750g, designed for effective cooling and safe temperature maintenance,\nshown on a white background.]][118]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][119]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][120]\n[Home][121] / [Pharmapac][122] / Pharmapac\u00ae 750g Gel Ice Pack\n\n# Pharmapac\u00ae 750g Gel Ice Pack\n\nFrom **\u00a30.51 **each\n\nProducts in our [Pharmapac\u00ae Polybox range][123] require the strict use of our Pharmapac\u00ae 750g Ice\nPacks; these are manufactured using Pure Filtered and UV Treated Water, along with a leading Gel\nFormula, and encased a Blue High-Grade Recyclable Puncture Resistant film.\n\nOur Pharmapac\u00ae 750g Gel Ice Packs are filled to capacity to maximise the duration on latent energy\ntransfer. As such, any other ice pack will not be validated for use in collaboration with the range\nof systems in our Pharmapac\u00ae Polybox range.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSize\u2502Choose an option750g-1 Pocket (28 Per\n\u2502Box)[Clear][124]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPharmapac\u00ae 750g Gel Ice Pack quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\n**Why Should You Use Our Gel Ice Packs?**\n\nWe test our [Polybox systems][125] using uniquely designed and engineered Gel Ice Packs,\nmanufactured onsite at our UK factory, where we have been producing ice packs and temperature\ncontrolled shipping systems for almost 18 years.\n\nOur PCM (passive cooling medium) Pharmapac\u00ae Gel Ice Packs are compact and filled to capacity, to\nmaximise the duration of latent energy transfer, both in release and absorption. Any other Gel Ice\nPack will simply not be suitable with our Pharmapac\u00ae Polybox range, so we must insist the use of the\ncorrect grade passive cooling medium ice packs to maintain effectiveness.\n\nWe also use a High Grade Recyclable Puncture Resistant Blue Film for added anti-burst security.\n\nNobody makes Ice Packs like Hydropac\u00ae!\n\n#### How Many Pharmapac\u00ae Ice Packs Will I Need To Use?\n\nWe have put together, based on our extensive testing, the following chart to advise how many ice\npacks will be required per box size and temperature.\n\nThis data is based on an extreme Fixed and Constant Temperature Testing Profile, so quantities may\nvary day to day. As such, we strongly advise setting a Standard Operating Procedure for Packing\nPharmapac\u00ae Ice Packs, based on the external conditions each day.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502External Temperature Conditions\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u250210\u00b0C \u250220\u00b0C \u250225\u00b0C \u250230\u00b0C\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBox 101\u25021 \u25022 \u25022 \u25023\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBox 2 \u25021 \u25022 \u25024 \u25024\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBox 6 \u25022 \u25023 \u25026 \u25026\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502No. of PharmaPac\u00ae 750g Ice Packs\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Other Pharmapac\n\n[ View product ][126]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 500g][127]\n\n\u00a30.46\n[ View product ][128]\n\n### [ReflectiveAir System for Frozen Goods][129]\n\n\u00a32.84\n[ View product ][130]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 6 Pocket \u2013 450g][131]\n\n\u00a30.46\n[ [Water Ice Pack with 8 pockets, designed for effective cooling, featuring a 1kg capacity and a\nsquare shape, isolated on a white background.] ][132]\n[ View product ][133]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 8 Pocket \u2013 1kg][134]\n\n\u00a30.87\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][135]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][136]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][137]\n[ Linkedin ][138] [ X-twitter ][139]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][140]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][141]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][142]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][143]\n* [ Chilled systems ][144]\n* [ Frozen systems ][145]\n* [ Water ice packs ][146]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][147]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][148]\n* [ Site visit ][149]\n* [ Contact us ][150]\n* [ FAQ's ][151]\n* [ Blog ][152]\n* [ Shipping ][153]\n* [ Sitemap ][154]\n* [ Privacy policy ][155]\n* [ Cookies ][156]\n* [ Terms of use ][157]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][158]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][159]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompa