[82]\n* [Water][83]\n* [Gel][84]\n* [Ice sheets][85]\n* [Pre-frozen][86]\n* [Courier boxes][87]\n* [Freezer trays][88]\n* [Ice packs frozen][89]\n* [EasiFreeze][90]\n* [HydroFreeze][91]\n* [HydroFreeze+][92]\n* [Courier boxes][93]\n* [Freezer trays][94]\n* [Hard shell][95]\n* [Hard blocks][96]\n* [Hard plates][97]\n* [FreshPac food packaging][98]\n* [EnviroCool][99]\n* [RecycleAir][100]\n* [ReflectiveAir][101]\n* [Cool bags][102]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][103]\n* [Thermal postal pockets][104]\n* [Pharmapac pharmaceutical][105]\n* [Gel ice packs][106]\n* [Polystyrene boxes][107]\n* [Genesis][108]\n* [Shop][109]\n* [Quote request][110]\n* [About us][111]\n* [Hydropac and CSR][112]\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][113]\n* [Site visit][114]\n* [Blog][115]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][116]\n* [Contact][117]\n[[RecycleAir System Samples]][118]\n[[RecycleAir System Samples - Image 2]][119]\n[[RecycleAir System Samples - Image 3]][120]\n* Large quantities?\n[ Request** quotation** ][121]\n* Request sample?\n[ Order** sample** ][122]\n[Home][123] / [Sample Store][124] / RecycleAir System Samples\n\n# RecycleAir System Samples\n\nFrom **\u00a30 **each\n\nThe Recycle-Air liner and Temperature Controlled Packaging System from the Freshpac range is\nrevolutionary & leak resistant; designed for the Food, Pharmaceutical, Biotech and Medical sectors\nto ensure items can be sent via the postal network in confidence.\n\nNo assembly required; this sample will show how compact this system is \u2013 we can fit up to 700 liners\non just one pallet.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE**\n\nThis Recycle-Air sample has been made available to help you further refine your choices in which\nshipping system to choose and can be ordered online for free as a one-time service per customer.\nOnly 1 product permitted in any size and only 3 products total per sample basket. Postage charges of\n\u00a315.99 apply per sample order.\n* Recycle-Air maintains the chilled or frozen cold chain (dependent on Ice Pack selection) for a\n**MINIMUM **of 24hrs *(ice packs not supplied with this sample)*\n* Meets all current legislation\n* Waterproof, leak-resistant bottom\n* 4 box sizes or choose the liner sample only.\n* Offers superior and cushioning protective properties\n* Self-Seal tamper evident closure\n* Compact storage solution\n* Low Cost Postal/Courier System\n* Wipe clean and re-use\n* 3 samples per order\n\nWant to order the full system? Head on over to the [Recycle Air page][125] to place your order, with\nnext working day delivery available on orders placed before 11am.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nChilled-\u2502Choose an optionChilled\nor-froze\u2502\nn \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLayers \u2502Choose an optionRecycle-Air Complete SystemRecycle-Air Liner Only (No Box)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLitres \u2502Choose an optionBox 101 (6Ltr) - ID: 350 x 190 x 100mmBox 2 (17ltr) - ID: 400 x 270 x\n\u2502160mmBox 6 (28ltr) - ID: 395 x 275 x 260mmBox 5 (42ltr) - ID: 590 x 320 x 225mm[Clear][126]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRecycleAir System Samples quantity\nAdd to cart\nDescription Benefits Differentiators Technical Data\n\nThe **Recycle-Air** system reflective white LDPE layers on both sides and a \u2018DOUBLE\u2019 hit of bubble\ninsulation layers sandwiched between the outer layers to give a real emphasis to insulation and\ncushioning. Climate Chamber and customer own testing has proven that the Recycle-Air system will\nperform on a UK based \u2018extreme\u2019 peak summer temperature profile for more than 24hrs and 96hrs during\nwinter testing (held between +2\u02dac to +8\u02da)\n\nIt is made from 100% recyclable materials with up to 15% of recycled material content within its\nmakeup.\n\nThis Sample is a full version of Recycle-Air with the option of 4 different box sizes if required,\nor just choose the liner on its own.\n* Maintain the chilled cold chain for a minimum of 24hrs\n* Recyclable LDPE Liner made from RESY 4 Symbol Material\n* \u2018Double Bubble\u2019 cushioning layers and protective properties ensure your shipment is always fully\nprotected\n* No assembly required\n* Self-seal and tamper evident closure\n* Compact, low cost storage solution\n* Recycle-Air comes with a super tough, double strength, white \u2018biodegradable \u2018, corrugated box as\nstandard\n* Complete gusseted system which is both water & leak resistant\n* Fits neatly and squarely into the box for a perfect fit\n* Completely recyclable with domestic waste as well as in supermarkets\n* Low MOQ\n\nPlease click to view the[ Technical PDF files][127] for Recycle-Air.\n\nIt is available to order in small volumes, so why not buy and test for yourselves.\n\nFSA Temperature Control Guide\n[ Download now ][128]\n\n## Other Sample Store\n\n[ View product ][129]\n\n### [EasiFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 5 Pocket \u2013 450g][130]\n\n\u00a30.55\n[ View product ][131]\n\n### [RecycleAir System for Chilled Goods][132]\n\n\u00a31.97\n[ [Water Ice Pack - 1 Pocket - 275g] ][133]\n[ View product ][134]\n\n### [Water Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 275g][135]\n\n\u00a30.16\n[ [A highly durable 2D Reflective Air System designed for optimal chilling efficiency in\ntemperature-sensitive goods.] ][136]\n[ View product ][137]\n\n### [2D ReflectiveAir System for Chilled Goods][138]\n\n\u00a32.26\n* Hydropac\n* [ Blenheim Road Unit 2\nM40 Industrial Centre High Wycombe\nBuckinghamshire HP12 3RS ][139]\n* [ +44 1494 530182 ][140]\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][141]\n[ Linkedin ][142] [ X-twitter ][143]\n[ Tailor-made advice ][144]\n\n#### Subscribe to the newsletter!\n\nBe the first to know!\n\nSubscription Form\nSubscribe\n* [ Ice packs ][145]\n* [ Freshpac solutions ][146]\n* [ Pharma solutions ][147]\n* [ Chilled systems ][148]\n* [ Frozen systems ][149]\n* [ Water ice packs ][150]\n* [ Gel ice packs ][151]\n* [ Cold Chain Optimisation ][152]\n* [ Site visit ][153]\n* [ Contact us ][154]\n* [ FAQ's ][155]\n* [ Blog ][156]\n* [ Shipping ][157]\n* [ Sitemap ][158]\n* [ Privacy policy ][159]\n* [ Cookies ][160]\n* [ Terms of use ][161]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][162]\n[The image shows a logo with three horizontal bands: dark blue at the top, white in the middle, and\ngreen at the bottom. The word BUNZL is written in bold, dark blue letters across the white band.]\na member of the Bunzl group of companies\n[Blue ISO text in front of a globe outline, with 9001:2015 written below, representing the ISO\n9001:2015 quality management certification standard.]\nCertified ISO 9001\n\nDesigned & developed by [Symblings Digital Marketing][163]\n\nScroll to Top\n\n## Quotation Request\n\n##### Receive our tailor made quotation within 1 working day.\n* Special Requests\n* Larger Volumes\n* Personalized Products\n* Expert Advice\n* Optimal Shipping Solutions\n\nQuotation Request (#4)\nFull name\nEmail address\nPhone number\nCompany name\nCompany type\nSelect your industryFoodPet FoodPharmaRetailOther\nEstimated parcels shipped (per month)\nHow can we help?\nSubmit Request\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://hydropac.co.uk/cold-chain-optimisation/\n[3]: https://hydropac.co.uk/site-visit/\n[4]: https://hydropac.co.uk/faqs/\n[5]: https://hydropac.co.uk/blog/\n[6]: mailto:sales@hydropac.co.uk\n[7]: tel:+441494530182\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://hydropac.co.uk/shop/\n[10]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/\n[11]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/\n[12]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/water/\n[13]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/gel/\n[14]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/ice-sheets/\n[15]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/pre-frozen/\n[16]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/courier-boxes/\n[17]: https://hydropac.co.uk/ice-packs/chilled/freezer-trays/\