 World (2026 Guide)\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\n### Top 10 Pet Cooling Mat Manufacturers in the World (2026 Guide)\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\n][32][\n[INTCO Medical Live at WHX Miami 2026]\n\n### INTCO Medical Live at WHX Miami 2026\n\nJun 18, 2026\n\n### INTCO Medical Live at WHX Miami 2026\n\nJun 18, 2026\n\n][33]\n[View More News][34]\n\n## Get In Touch With Us\n\nYou can contact us any way that is convenient for you.\n\n[INTCO Healthcare]\n\nOur Products\n* [\u203aInstant Cold Pack][35]\n* [\u203aReusable Hot & Cold Gel Pack][36]\n* [\u203aReusable Hot & Cold Gel Beads Pack][37]\n* [\u203aMulti-Use Heat Patch][38]\n* [\u203aInfant Heel Warmer][39]\n* [\u203aPerineal Instant Cold Pack][40]\n\nQuick Links\n* [\u203aOEM/ODM][41]\n* [\u203aSolution][42]\n* [\u203aAbout Us][43]\n* [\u203aService & Support][44]\n* [\u203aContact Us][45]\n\nFriendship Link\n* [\u203aINTCO Medical][46]\n* [\u203aINTCO Wheelchair][47]\n* [\u203aINTCO Gloves][48]\n\nContact Us\n* Add : No.298 Yandunshan Road, Zhenjiang, Jiangsu, China\n* [Email : [email\u00a0protected]][49]\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 INTCOHEALTHCARE.COM ALL RIGHTS RESERVED\n\n|[PRIVACY-POLICY][50]|[LEGAL-NOTICE][51]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products\n[3]: /solutions\n[4]: /oem-odm\n[5]: /service-support/product-catalog\n[6]: /service-support/product-catalog\n[7]: /service-support/certificate\n[8]: /service-support/faq\n[9]: /about-us\n[10]: /about-us/about\n[11]: /about-us/esg\n[12]: /about-us/founder\n[13]: /news\n[14]: /category/physical-therapy\n[15]: /solutions\n[16]: /about-us/about\n[17]: /instant-cold-pack\n[18]: /multi-use-heat-patch\n[19]: /perineal-instant-cold-pack\n[20]: /reusable-hot-cold-gel-beads-pack\n[21]: /reusable-hot-cold-gel-pack\n[22]: /infant-heel-warmer\n[23]: /instant-cold-pack\n[24]: /multi-use-heat-patch\n[25]: /perineal-instant-cold-pack\n[26]: /solution/personal-care\n[27]: /solution/sports-injuries\n[28]: /solution/outdoor-camping\n[29]: /solution/hygiene-care\n[30]: /solution/pet-care\n[31]: /news/10-summer-uses-for-instan