            "url": "https://ipcpack.com",
            "text": "Insulated Products Corporation | Cold Chain Packaging\n\nSkip to main content\n\nMenu\n\nProducts\n\nProducts\n\nOne-Piece Box Liners\n\nSustainaLiner: 24 hrs\n\nCooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs\n\nBROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE\n\nMulti-Piece Box Liners\n\nCelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+\n\nPopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+\n\nPouch/Mailer Insulation\n\nPaper Pouch: 48 hrs+\n\nPopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+\n\nCooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs\n\nAerVault Mailers: 48 hrs\n\nCryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs\n\nDelivery\n\nPaper Insulated Delivery Bag\n\nPaper Grocery Delivery Bag\n\nBubble Insulated Delivery Bag\n\nPaper Insulated Roll\n\nLarge Cargo\n\nFoil Insulation Roll\n\nInsulated Cargo Blankets\n\nInsulated Pallet Covers\n\nAir Cargo Insulation\n\nCold Gel Packs\n\nGel Packs\n\nSweat-Proof Gel Packs\n\nDrain-Friendly Gel Packs\n\nSuper-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs\n\nFoam Bricks\n\nIndustries\n\nCold Chain Packaging\n\nFood\n\nMeat\n\nPharmaceuticals\n\nVaccines\n\nDirect to Consumer\n\nCompany\n\nCompany\n\nOur Materials\n\nPerformance Testing\n\nOrdering and Distribution\n\nSustainably Engineered\n\nFAQ\n\nResources\n\nKnowledge Base\n\nFAQ\n\nGeneral FAQ\n\nShipping Regulations\n\nHow To Ship Refrigerated Products\n\nHow to Ship Frozen Products\n\nShipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance\n\nShipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice\n\nIndustry Applications\n\nHow to Ship Meat\n\nHow to Ship Chocolate\n\nHow to Ship Ice Cream\n\nProduct FAQ\n\nCustom Sized Insulated Packaging\n\nCase Studies\n\nPharmaceuticals Case Studies\n\nMaintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC\n\nMaintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines &#038; Pharmaceuticals | IPC\n\nFood Case Studies\n\nExpanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC\n\nShipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC\n\nHow to Keep Ice Cream from Melting &#8211; Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC\n\nDistributor Case Studies\n\nEliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC\n\nWhite Papers\n\nPharmaceutical White Papers\n\nEnhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC\n\nOvercoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC\n\n2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC\n\nShipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner &#8211; Insulated Products Corporation\n\nTemperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC&#8217;s PopupLiner Thermal Box Liner &#8211; Insulated Products Corporation\n\nFood White Papers\n\nInsulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC\n\nEnhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC\n\nOvercoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC\n\nBeverage White Papers\n\n48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC\n\nShipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC\n\nIndustrial White Papers\n\nFreeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint &#038; Grout | IPC\n\nInsights\n\nJobs\n\nContact\n\nRequest Quote\n\nShipping Guides\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nClose Search\n\nMass Manufacturer of High-Performance, Innovative Cold Chain Solutions\n\nSince 1999, IPC has been a leading mass manufacturer of custom insulated box liners, pouches, and ice packs, delivering data-backed thermal protection for the world\u2019s most demanding cold chain applications. As a dedicated cold chain solutions company, we are more than just a supplier\u2014we are a trusted partner, providing cost-efficient products, innovative cold-chain packaging solutions, and expert consultation that help customers reduce risk, improve operational efficiency, and outperform legacy packaging systems.\n\nMass Manufacturer of High-Performance Cold Chain Solutions\n\nSince 1999, IPC has been a leading mass manufacturer of custom insulated box liners, pouches, and ice packs, delivering data-backed thermal protection for the world\u2019s most demanding cold chain applications. As a dedicated cold chain solutions company, we are more than just a supplier\u2014we are a trusted partner, providing cost-efficient products, innovative cold-chain packaging solutions, and expert consultation that help customers reduce risk, improve operational efficiency, and outperform legacy packaging systems.\n\nWe design, customize, and manufacture all our products in the USA\n\nTrusted by Brands You Know\n\nCompanies receiving more than 3 years of quality service from IPC\n\n&#8220;\nIPC's liners provide excellent isolation, keeping the cold \u201cair\u201d inside the box during a 5-day shipment to Asia. IPC quickly produced prototypes we requested and has reliably filled small-quantity orders for these custom liners. Consistency and quality has been key to our large-quantity transport success. John Morgan Principal Engineer\n\n&#8220;\nA true partner in sustainability and quality.\n\nWe\u2019ve received multiple pallets of curbside-recyclable bags, shipping liners, and ice packs from Insulated Products Corp, and every time I\u2019m impressed by the thoughtfulness and consistency of their work. Their products are exceptionally well-made\u2014functional, clean, and clearly designed with sustainability in mind.\n\nAs a company devoted to providing honest, fresh pasta locally and nationwide, our mission depends on packaging that protects quality while respecting the environment. IPC delivers exactly that. It\u2019s rare to find a supplier so perfectly aligned with our sustainable values. Highly recommend to any business seeking eco-conscious, professional-grade shipping solutions. Mark Spiegelman Pasta Fresh\u00ae\n\n&#8220;\nWOW, all the staff is doing AWESOME job here. Pulling all the orders and getting them ready for shipping. Very clean boxes, plastic wraps and all the trucks are very clean and well maintain. Harry Irvine California Air Conditioning Systems\n\n&#8220;\nBeen a loyal customer for years. IPC's quality and value on gel ice packs are UNMATCHED, as is the service. Brad Savage\n\n&#8220;\nI Have been a customer for several years. very pleased. my order consists of single rolls Hand loaded into a full 53' Trailer. Product, Service and pricing Excellent! Daniel Owens\n\nCurbside Recyclable Insulated Packaging\n\nKeep your product cool and reduce your carbon footprint\n\nMade of 100% recyclable paper and designed to protect frozen and refrigerated shipments for up to 48 hours, our CelluLiner product line takes your hard work across the finish line.\n\nLearn More\n\nView All Products\n\nInsulated Packaging Solutions\n\nTemperature Controlled Packaging\n\nInsulated Products Corp. provides your business with cold-chain packaging solutions that are easy to assemble and use for 24-hour, 48-hour, and longer shipment durations.\n\nInsulated Packaging for Shipping\n\nCelluLiner Insulated Box Liner\n\nPopupLiner Insulated Box Liner\n\nGel packs for Shipping\n\nMulti-Faceted Industry Applications\n\nIPC produces temperature-controlled packaging using paper, foam, and reflective insulation materials meeting a variety of industry applications for shipments of any size.\n\nInsulated Box Liners\n\nInsulated Mailers\n\nInsulated Delivery Bags\n\nUnique Insulating Materials\n\nOur products boast unmatched performance, 75% space reduction, and 100% sustainability, reducing the cost for your business and the environment through our unique materials.\n\nMaterials\n\nDrain Friendly Gel Packs\n\nCustom In-House Manufacturing\n\nWe manufacture insulated shipping solutions made to your custom specifications. Save money, space, and time with our industry-recognized, quality cold chain solutions.\n\nRequest a Quote\n\nAbout the Company\n\nLatest Innovations\n\nA selection of our most revolutionary, innovative insulated packaging products.\n\nCelluLiner Insulated Box Liner\n\nA curbside recyclable box liner made of 100% paper insulation.\nExplore CelluLiner\n\nPaper Pouches\n\nThe perfect insulated packaging for sending small-sized products to consumers.\nExplore CelluLiner Paper Pouches\n\nSustainaLiner\n\nSecond-generation reflective insulated packaging.\nExplore SustainaLiner\n\nPopupLiner\n\nThe innovative insulated box liner that automatically pops up when opened.\nExplore PopupLiner\n\nAerVault Mailer\n\nLightweight, insulated, and efficient, they\u2019re ideal for small to medium shipments.\nExplore AerVault Mailer\n\nCryoVault Pouch\n\nReliable thermal protection with dual tape and easy-slide zip closure\nExplore CryoVault Pouches\n\nView All\n\nFrequenty Asked Questions\n\nHow does IPC\u2019s insulated packaging reduce total landed cost for high-volume enterprise shippers?\n\nIPC reduces total landed costs by optimizing \"cube efficiency\" and logistics overhead. Unlike rigid EPS (Styrofoam) coolers, our PopupLiner and CelluLiner solutions ship and store flat, reducing inbound freight costs and warehouse space requirements by up to 75%. Additionally, our high-performance thermal barriers often allow shippers to transition from overnight air to 2-day ground shipping without compromising product integrity, resulting in significant annual postage savings.\n\nWhat is the process and lead time for developing custom-engineered thermal packaging prototypes?\n\nIPC specializes in rapid, zero-tooling-cost prototyping. Our engineering team can typically design and ship a custom-sized thermal liner prototype within 48 to 72 hours. We utilize in-house environmental chambers to simulate real-world shipping lanes (Summer/Winter profiles), providing B2B clients with validated performance data before they commit to a full production run.\n\nHow do IPC\u2019s curbside recyclable-friendly liners compare to the competition?\n\nWhile many shipping solutions claim \"curbside recyclability,\" there is a critical difference between a material being theoretically recyclable and having actual recovery value. IPC\u2019s CelluLiner is engineered to outperform legacy materials while ensuring a 100% valid end-of-life path. Many alternative foam materials currently on the market have zero recycling value and are therefore not recycled, despite producer claims. These foams often fail to integrate into standard municipal waste streams, leading to automatic rejection at sorting facilities. Common padding materials appear eco-friendly because they contain paper. However, they are often manufactured with thermoplastic binders that make it impossible for paper fibers to separate during the hydropulping process.\n\nHow does IPC ensure supply chain continuity for large-scale, multi-site distribution networks?\n\nAs a vertically integrated North American manufacturer, IPC mitigates supply chain risk by controlling the entire production process\u2014from raw material sourcing to final assembly. With multiple manufacturing points and significant safety stock capabilities, we provide enterprise clients with reliable lead times and the ability to scale production rapidly during seasonal peaks (e.g., holiday food shipping or summer pharmaceutical surges).\n\nPackaging Quality Matters\n\nWhat makes our thermal packaging superior.\n\nSpace Efficient\n\nRevolutionary materials that allow substantial space savings during shipping.\n\nInnovative Designs\n\nOur dedication to innovation allows us to provide unrivaled levels of performance.\n\nUnique Materials\n\nOur patented designs and materials are not available to other manufacturers.\n\nEco-Friendly\n\nCommitted to designing products that reduce the impact of shipping on the environment.\n\nAre you ready to discuss your thermal packaging requirements?\n\n310-638-0900\n\nRequest a Quote Request a Custom Sample\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many years of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\nPopular Products\n\nInsulated Box Liners\n\nInsulated Delivery Bags\n\nInsulated Cargo Blankets\n\nInsulated Pallet Covers\n\nInsulated Pouches\n\nGel Packs\n\nUSEFUL LINKS\n\nProducts\n\nNew Innovations\n\nCompany\n\nPerformance Testing\n\nResources\n\nRequest a Quote\n\nJobs\n\nAccessibility\n\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\n310-638-0900\n\n[email&#160;protected]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n\ntwitter\nfacebook\nlinkedin\nyoutube\n\nClose Menu\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nProducts\n\nProducts\n\nOne-Piece Box Liners\n\nSustainaLiner: 24 hrs\n\nCooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs\n\nBROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE\n\nMulti-Piece Box Liners\n\nCelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+\n\nPopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+\n\nPouch/Mailer Insulation\n\nPaper Pouch: 48 "
