            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Insulated Packaging Solutions for Cold Chain Shipping\n\n## Browse by Category or Product Feature to Find the Right Cold Chain Shipping Solution\n\nSearch our insulated packaging by product category or [browse by product feature][96]. If you\u2019re not\nsure which of our insulated shipping supplies are most suitable for your needs, [get in touch][97]\nand our staff will be happy to guide you.\n\n[Menu][98]\n* [One-Piece Liners][99]\n* [Two-Piece Insulated Box Liners][100]\n* [Delivery][101]\n* [Pouches][102]\n* [Large Cargo][103]\n* [Gel Packs][104]\n* [PCMs][105]\n\n#### Two-Piece Box Liners for Cold Shipping\n\nOur Two-Piece Insulated Box Liners are engineered for long-duration [cold chain shipping][106].\nDesigned to maintain precise thermal conditions, these liners are use for [insulated shipping boxes\nfor frozen food][107], temperature-sensitive pharmaceuticals, meal kits, and specialty items that\nrequire extended cold retention. Insulated Products Corps manufactures premium insulated shipper\nliners as well as [recyclable insulated box liners][108].\n\nCelluLiner Box Liner\n\n48-72 Hours\n\nPaper-Based\n\nRecyclable\n\nPopupLiner Box Liner\n\n48-96 Hours\n\nFoam-Based\n\n#### One-Piece Insulated Box Liners\n\nIPC\u2019s One-Piece Box Liners offer fast, reliable insulation for 24-hour cold chain shipping.\nCooLiner\u00ae is a [foil-bubble insulated box liner][109] and widely used in [perishable food\nshipping][110], pharmaceutical transport, and last-mile delivery applications..\n[SustainaLiner][111]\u00ae delivers similar performance using a recyclable mono-material design. Both are\ncompact, easy to insert, and ideal for food, pharma, or last-mile deliveries.\n\nCooLiner\u00ae Box Liner\n\n24 Hours (Refrigerated)\n\nMetalized Foil\n\n[ [SustainaLiner Box Liner] ][112]\n\nSustainaLiner\u00ae Box Liner\n\n24 Hours (Refrigerated)\n\nMetalized Foil\n\nEco-Friendly\n\n#### Insulated Pouches and Mailers\n\n[Insulated pouches][113] and [insulated mailers][114] from Insulated Products Corp are ideal for\ncompact, temperature-sensitive shipments. Whether you\u2019re shipping pharmaceuticals, meal kits, or\nfrozen treats, our insulated pouches offer lightweight protection with minimal bulk. Available in\nfoil-bubble, high performance PopupLiner, and curbside-recyclable formats, each insulated thermal\nmailer is designed to preserve product temperature during one to two-day deliveries.\n\n[ [Insulated package for temperature controlled shipping named PopupLiner Pouch manufactured by IPC]\n][115]\n\nPopupLiner Pouch\n\n48-72 Hours (Refrigerated/Frozen)\n\nSelf expanding\n\n[ [Curbside recyclable insulated paper pouches for shipping named CelluLiner and manufactured by\nIPC] ][116]\n\nCelluLiner Paper Pouch\n\n48-72 Hours (Refrigerated/Frozen)\n\n100% Paper\n\nRecyclable\n\n[ [CooLiner Pouch Foil and poly bubble pouches for cool chain shipping named CooLiner manufactured\nby IPC] ][117]\n\nCooLiner\u00ae Pouch\n\n24 Hours\n\nMetalized Foil\n\nCryoVault Pouch\n\n48 Hours\n\nFoam-Based\n\nSelf expanding\n\n[ [product image of the AerVault Mailer, a white insulated shipping pouch standing upright against a\nsmooth blue gradient background.] ][118]\n\nAerVault Mailer\n\n48 Hours\n\nRecyclable\n\n#### Insulated Pallet Covers and Cargo Insulation\n\n[Insulated pallet covers][119] and [thermal blankets][120] from Insulated Products Corp protect bulk\nand palletized shipments from temperature spikes during transit and storage. Our insulated pallet\nblankets use foil and bubble or multi-layer film to reduce heat transfer, helping maintain product\nintegrity in both hot and cold environments.\n\n[ [Insulated Cargo Blankets] ][121]\n\nInsulated Cargo Blankets\n\n24 Hours+\n\nMetalized Foil\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Cover] ][122]\n\nInsulated Pallet Cover\n\n24 Hours+\n\nMetalized Foil\n\n[ [Insulation Roll] ][123]\n\nInsulation Roll\n\n24 Hours+\n\nMetalized Foil\n\n#### Insulated Delivery Bags and Wraps\n\nIPC\u2019s insulated delivery bags are built for last-mile cold chain performance. Designed for food,\ngrocery, and specialty shipments, these thermal delivery bags offer flexible, lightweight insulation\nthat keeps contents cold or frozen during local delivery routes. Options include curbside-recyclable\npaper bags, foil bubble bags, and wrap-style formats tailored for efficiency and thermal control.\n\n[ [Insulated bags manufactured by IPC for Ice cream shipping] ][124]\n\nThermal Insulated Paper Delivery Bag\n\n12 Hours\n\nPaper-Based\n\nRecyclable\n\n[ [Bubble Delivery Bag] ][125]\n\nFoil Bubble Insulated Delivery Bags\n\n24 Hours\n\nMetalized Foil\n\n#### Gel Packs\n\nInsulated Products Corp\u2019s [gel packs for cold chain shipping][126] provide consistent cold\ntemperatures for refrigerated deliveries. Our lineup includes cold gel packs for consumer shipments,\nindustrial gel packs for bulk transport, and [drain-friendly non-toxic gel packs][127] for easy\ndisposal. Engineered for performance and safety, IPC gel packs help protect temperature-sensitive\ngoods across food, pharmaceuticals, and biotech applications.\n\n[ [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs] ][128]\n\nDrain Friendly Gel Packs\n\nRecyclable\n\nLeak-Proof\n\n[ [Cold Packs for Shipping] ][129]\n\nConsumer Gel Packs\n\nWide Applications\n\nLeak-Proof\n\n[ [Gel Ice Packs] ][130]\n\nSweat-Proof Gel Packs\n\nRecyclable\n\nNon-Toxic\n\n[ [industrial blue gel packs] ][131]\n\nIndustrial Gel Packs\n\nRecyclable\n\nPuncture-Resistant\n\n#### Phase Change Materials and Specialty Refrigerants\n\n[Phase change materials (PCMs)][132] are engineered for shipments that require precise thermal\ncontrol beyond standard gel packs. Our PCM foam ice blocks offer extended duration cold retention,\nwhile our super absorbent polymer gel packs provide clean, efficient refrigerant performance. Ideal\nfor biotech, pharma, and specialty food logistics, these solutions help maintain exact temperature\nthresholds in demanding cold chain environments.\n\n[super absorbent polymer for gel packs]\n[View Larger][133]\n\n#### Super-Absorbent Polymer\n\n[Refrigerant Foam Bricks]\n[View Larger][134]\n\n#### Foam Bricks\n\n##### Space Efficient\n\nOur innovative materials are designed to provide substantial space savings during storage and\nshipping.\n\n##### Custom Sizes\n\nWe specialize in manufacturing custom-sized insulation products to order. We provide a solution to\nall insulated packaging requirements.\n\n##### Unique Materials\n\nOur patented designs and materials provide unparalleled performance and are exclusively available at\nIPC.\n\n##### Eco Friendly\n\nWe are committed to developing and suppling products that minimize environmental impact.\n\n## Trusted by Brands You Know\n\nCompanies receiving more than 3 years of quality service from IPC\n\n[client]\n[client]\n[client]\n[client]\n[client]\n[Thermal Shipping]\n\nTake The Stress Out of Shipping Perishables\n\n## Ready To Discuss Your Insulated Packaging Needs?\n\n[Get a Custom Quote][135]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][136]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][137]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][138]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][139]\n* [Insulated Pouches][140]\n* [Gel Packs][141]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][142]\n* [New Innovations][143]\n* [Company][144]\n* [Performance Testing][145]\n* [Resources][146]\n* [Request a Quote][147]\n* [Jobs][148]\n* [Accessibility][149]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][150]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500