            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} Insulated Box Liner\n\n### Second generation reflective insulated packaging.\n\n[Metalized insulated box liner]\n\nSustainaLiner^{\u00ae} is an innovative insulated packaging material made entirely of high-\nvalue, mono-material, recyclable LDPE, exclusively available from IPC, that protects\nrefrigerated and room-temperature shipments for up to 24 hours.\n\n[LDPE4]\n[SustainaLiner Diagram]\n\nPatent pending\n\nSustainaLiner^{\u00ae} insulated packaging materials provide the perfect solution for shipping\nrefrigerated and room-temperature products when recyclability is essential. Made entirely of\nlow-density polyethylene plastic, SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} is lightweight, compact, and provides\nhigh-performance temperature control.\n\nAvailable in a variety of formats, ranging from insulated pouches to cargo covers, SustainaLiner^{\u00ae}\nachieves a high level of thermal control through the combination of an air-bubble inner panel\nencased in a highly reflective outer sleeve.\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View Brochure][97]\n\n#### **Custom sizes and minimum order quantities**\n\nWe specialise in manufacturing packaging materials in custom sizes to fit your exact specifications,\nand our SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} materials are no exception. This results in insulated packaging that fits\nyour shipments like a glove, reinforces your professional brand image, and provides optimal\ntemperature control.\n\nIn addition, we can test shipments using your company\u2019s products in our in-house environmental\ntesting chamber to ensure that the packaging solution provides sufficient thermal protection. Get in\ntouch to discuss your requirements.\n\nThe [minimum order quantity][98] for SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} Box Liners is 1,000 sets/pieces per size.\nLearn more about our minimum order quantities here.\n\n[SustainaLiner]\n\n### Made with 100% low-density polyethylene plastic, SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} is made using a unique\n### manufacturing process and has a high recycling value.\n\n## Why SustainaLiner^{\u00ae}?\n\n#### Learn why our eco-friendly SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} material provides the perfect insulated packaging\n#### solution.\n* #### Made entirely of high-value recyclable materials\n\nSince SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} is not a mixed plastics product, it has a much higher recycling value than\nsimilar insulation products.\n* #### Effectively blocks heat transfer for 24 hours\n\nSustainaLiner^{\u00ae} has been extensively tested to ensure efficacy over transit durations of 24\nhours.\n* #### Exclusive to IPC\n\nThis patent-pending material is the result of decades of research and development, and is\nexclusively available at IPC.\n* #### Various gauges available to suit your specific shipping requirements\n\nDepending on your specific requirements, we provide a range of different SustainaLiner^{\u00ae}\nmaterial, including Light-Duty, Heavy-Duty, White and Double Bubble Layered. Our staff are on hand\nto help you decide which is most suitable and cost-effective for your needs.\n* #### Space efficient design\n\nSustainaLiner^{\u00ae} materials arrive in a folded, compact format, ready to be neatly stored before\nbeing used.\n* #### Peal-and-Seal easy closure\n\nAll SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} materials are available with an easy-to-use peal-and-seal lip closure,\nallowing you staff to seal, secure and dispatch shipments as efficiently as possible.\n\n## SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} Delivery Bags\n\n#### SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} To Go is a recyclable insulated delivery bag that\u2019s perfect for sending\n#### refrigerated and frozen deliveries to your customers.\n\nSustainaLiner^{\u00ae} is also available as an insulated delivery bag for deliveries that require the\nconvenience of a carrying handle. Perfect for shipping hot or cold goods directly to your customers\u2019\ndoors, SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} delivery bags are lightweight yet robust, and can carry a large volume of\nproducts.\n\n[SustainaLiner Insulated Delivery Bag]\n[delivery wrap with roll]\n\n### Protect Freshness with Our Insulated Delivery Wrap\n\nIntroducing the ultimate solution for temperature-sensitive deliveries - our Insulated Delivery\nWrap. It keeps perishable items such as meat, seafood, and groceries at the ideal temperature for\nextended periods. With its convenient roll design for easy storage and minimal weight addition, it\nis crafted from sustainable materials to reduce waste and support environmentally friendly\npractices. Our Insulated Delivery Wrap is ideal for grocery deliveries, meal kits, butcher shops,\nand more.\n\n[Learn More About CelluLiner Insulated Wrap][99]\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### Refrigerated Product \u2013 24-Hour Transit in Summer\n\nThe efficacy of the SustainLiner^{\u00ae} Box Liner was tested by monitoring the internal temperature\nover a 24-hour period in summer conditions. As shown in the graph, SustainaLiner^{\u00ae} insulated\npackaging effectively maintained refrigerated internal temperatures throughout the test period.\n\n[SustainaLiner-Refrigerated-Product-\u2013-24-Hour-Transit-in-Summer]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Details:** \u2502Chilled Produce\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Box Size:** \u250212\u201d x 12\u201d x 12\u201d\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Used:** \u2502Carton Lined with SustainaLiner\u00ae Box Liner\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Refrigerant Used:**\u25022 x 96 oz Gel Packs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Temp Profile:** \u2502ISTA Summer 7E\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n#### Related Products\n\n[ [Paper Insulated Box Liner] ][100]\n\n##### Paper Insulated Box Liners\n\nCelluLiner Insulated Box Liners are made entirely of curbside-recyclable materials and provide\neffective temperature control for 48 hours. With a 100% paper construction, CelluLiner box liners\nprotect shipments against even the most extreme ambient conditions.\n\n[ [PopupLiner Insulated Box Liner 1 piece] ][101]\n\n##### PopupLiner 1-Piece Insulated Box Liner\n\nPopupLiner Insulated Box Liners have an advanced space-saving design in that they are shipped\ncompressed and automatically expand to full size when opened, resulting in unparalleled space\nefficiency and cost savings.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][102]\n\n### Want to know more about our Insulated Box Liners?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][103]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][104]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][105]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][106]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][107]\n* [Insulated Pouches][108]\n* [Gel Packs][109]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][110]\n* [New Innovations][111]\n* [Company][112]\n* [Performance Testing][113]\n* [Resources][114]\n* [Request a Quote][115]\n* [Jobs][116]\n* [Accessibility][117]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][118]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][119]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25