            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# CooLiner\u00ae Insulated Box Liner\n\n[Slide] \"IPC's CooLiner provides excellent isolation\" [Slide] \"The consistency and quality has been\nkey to our large-quantity transport success\" JOHN, DUPONT CORP\n\n### Easy to use, environmentally friendly and cost effective insulated liners for shipping.\n\nCooLiner\u00ae insulated box liners are lightweight, easy-to-use, made from environmentally friendly\nmaterials, and provide effective thermal protection for containers of any size. The thermal liners\nare completely collapsible for easy shipment and efficient handling.\n\n[Open white cardboard shipping box with thick silver insulated bubble liner for temperature\ncontrolled cold chain packaging against blue background.]\n\nCooLiner\u00ae insulated shipping boxes can be used for shipping perishable food items, pharmaceuticals,\ndairy products, and any other temperature-sensitive products.\n\nMade of recyclable #7 material*, CooLiner\u00ae foil insulated bubble bags are recommended for protecting\nrefrigerated, carton-sized shipments against extreme ambient temperatures for up to 24 hours. When\nused together with a corrugated shipping box, the one-piece CooLiner\u00ae creates an effective insulated\nshipping box that arrives folded in a compact format for low-cost transport and storage.\n\nKnowing that your temperature-sensitive products are protected against extreme temperatures\nthroughout the cold-chain distribution system gives you the confidence to ship your goods in any\nseason, to any location. Shipping with the proper type of 3D insulation means \u2018product loss\u2019 is much\nless of a concern.\n\nUsing the same [innovative technology][96] found in our foil-bubble thermal blankets and [pallet\ncovers][97], our gusseted insulated box liners use passive energy reflection to insulate your\nproducts throughout the entire shipping duration.\n\n**May not be recyclable in your area*\n\n#### Custom sizes and minimum order quantities\n\nOur in-house manufacturing facility allows us to provide you with fully customizable sizes at no\nextra charge. Get in touch to discuss your bespoke requirements.\n\nThe minimum order quantity for CooLiner\u00ae thermal liners is 1000 pcs per size. Looking for fewer than\n1000 units? We have lower minimum quantities for our [PopupLiner][98] and [EcoLiner box liners][99].\nLearn more about our [minimum order quantities][100] here.\n\n[Request a Quote][101] [View Brochure][102]\n\n## Available in Various Thickness\n\nOur thermal box liners are available in various levels of thickness that are offered depending on\nyour performance requirements.\n\n#### Lite\n\nMore streamlined for reduced costs.\n\n[CooLiner Lite]\n\n#### Single Bubble\n\nSuitable for shiments lasting 24 hours.\n\n#### Double Bubble\n\nDual bubble layer provides 20% better protection.\n\n[CooLiner Double Bubble Diagram]\n\n## SustainaLiner\u00ae\n\n#### Recyclable second-generation reflective bubble insulation\n\nSustainaLiner\u00ae is an environmentally friendly insulated packaging material with a high recycling\nvalue made entirely of low-density polyethylene plastic.\n\n[Learn more][103]\n[ [Sustainable Insulated Box Liner] ][104]\n[delivery wrap with roll]\n\n### Protect Freshness with Our Insulated Delivery Wrap\n\nIntroducing the ultimate solution for temperature-sensitive deliveries\u2014our Insulated Delivery Wrap.\nKeeps perishable items like meat, seafood, and groceries at the perfect temperature for extended\nperiods. with convenient roll design for easy storage and minimal weight addition. Crafted with\nsustainable materials to reduce waste and support environmentally friendly practices our insulated\ndelivery wrap is ideal for grocery deliveries, meal kits, butcher shops, and more.\n\n[Learn More About CelluLiner Insulated Wrap][105]\n\n## Why CooLiner\u00ae?\n* #### Extreme Space Efficiency\n\nThe compact and collapsible design of CooLiner\u00ae box insulation makes it easy to transport and\nallows you to save on storage costs.\n* #### Environmentally Friendly Materials\n\nThe insulated shipping boxes are built with materials that minimize impact on the environment.\n* #### Peel-and-Seal Easy Adhesive Lip Closure\n\nEasy-to-use, one-piece design allows you to seal and insulated your shipping boxes in seconds.\n* #### Leak-Resistant\n\nFeaturing a water-tight seal, the insulated foil bubble box liners ensure your products remain dry\nduring transit.\n* #### FDA-approved\n\nThe cold shipping boxes are made from materials approved by the FDA (in case of incidental food\ncontact).\n\n[ [Insulated Box Liners] ][106]\n\n#### Watch the demonstration video below to see how easy it is to use CooLiner\u00ae foil bubble\n#### insulation.\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### Refrigerated Product \u2013 24-Hour Transit in Summer\n\nThe efficacy of the CooLiner\u00ae thermal box liner was tested by comparing it to that of a 1/2\u2033\nstyrofoam insert. Two test samples were placed under extremely high ambient temperature and the\nthermal performances were compared.\n\nAs shown in the graph below, insulating with CooLiner\u00ae box insulation resulted in a substantial\ntemperature differential over a 24-hour transit duration.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Details:** \u250212 lbs. of chilled gravy\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Box Size:** \u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**ID Size:** \u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Used:** \u2502Carton lined with CooLiner\u00ae Box Liner\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Compared to:**\u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033 with 6 pcs. 1.5\u2033 Styrofoam Inserts\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Weight Shipped:** \u250210 lbs.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Pre-Shipment Temp:** \u25022 \u00b0C (~35 \u00b0F)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Refrigerant Used:** \u25022x 28 oz. gel packs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## FAQs\n\n### [What is CooLiner\u00ae?][107]\n\nCooLiner\u00ae is a revolutionary type of insulation made from metalized films and air bubbles. The\ncombination of these materials creates a silver bubble wrap that provides high-performance\ntemperature control against extreme temperatures.\n\nThese cold shipping boxes are simple, easy-to-use, come in any custom size, and are available in\nvarious forms: bags, covers and roll stock. They are summer liners recommended for protecting\ncarton-sized shipments at refrigerated temperatures for shipments lasting 24 hours or less.\n\n### [How does CooLiner\u00ae work?][108]\n\n##### Unique Dual Layer Technology\n\n[CooLiner Insulation Material]\n\nIPC utilizes proprietary reflective materials, not available to insulated box liner manufacturers,\nthat provide the perfect combination of heat reflection and mass. Similar materials, when presented\nwith a higher relative thickness, do not necessarily provide the best heat resistance. Light (low\nthermal mass) and highly reflective insulated bubble wrap can provide better heat resistance. This\ncritical combination has a large net effect on the performance of insulated shipping boxes such as\nCooLiner\u00ae.\n\nThe foil reflective layer in CooLiner\u00ae effectively blocks radiating heat from the environment, even\nafter it has entered through the walls of a carton. This foil layer is even more effective when\nexposed to open air, such as when it is used as a pallet cover.\n\n**Our Exclusive Bubble Layer**\n\nIPC\u2019s bubble material provides a unique structure that resists conductive heat flow. Again, the\ncorrect weight (gauge) is critical in the material\u2019s performance capacity. Thicker, heavier films,\nalthough more durable, have higher thermal mass that can actually exacerbate heat flow.\n\nPerfected after 11 years of careful research, IPC\u2019s bubble technology presents time-tested, real\nworld efficacy.\n\n**CooLiner\u00ae \u2013 Insulated Carton Liner Specifications**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Description:\u25021 layer plastic bubble material.\n** \u2502Available in light, heavy, double layer and white.\n\u2502Laminated to metalized film.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Weight & \u25020.99 oz/ft2.\nWidth:** \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Thickness:**\u25023/16 in\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Usage:** \u2502Used to "
