            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Curbside Recyclable Insulated Box Liner\n\n## 48-72 hours of protection for frozen and refrigerated shipments\n\n### CelluLiner: No Greenwashing. Just Peak Performance and **True** Curbside Recyclability\n\n[insulated product corp flagship curbside recyclable insulated box liner]\n\nThe only certified curbside recyclable, biobased liner rated for 72-hour refrigerated shipping.\nUnlike cellulose liners that require special handling, CelluLiner\u2122 goes straight into your recycling\nbin\u2014nationwide. Experience true satisfaction with insulation *that actually gets recycled* and\nproven to keep your products cold. Remember, cornstarch is food waste.\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE][96] [VIEW THE BROCHURE][97]\n[celluliner insulated box liner]\n\nPatent pending\n\n## Why choose CelluLiner for your sustainable cold chain packaging mix?\n\nWe\u2019ve engineered the highest-performing recyclable insulated box liner\u2014certified curbside\nrecyclable, rated for 72-hour performance, and available in quantities that work for your\nbusiness.**Why choose us?** Because performance shouldn't require a 10-truckload commitment.\n* **True Sustainability, Curbside Recyclable\n**Competitors may boast about \u201ceco-friendly\u201d materials, but most insulated packaging suppliers\nstill rely on plastic containing fillers or no-value foam cores. Our insulated box liners? **All\npaper core. All recyclable. All proven.**\n* **Low Minimum, High Standards\n**We work with you, not against you. Whether you ship 500 boxes or 500,000, you\u2019ll get a tailored\ninsulated box liner built to match your shipping profile\n* **Handles Frozen Products Better than Cellulose Liners\n**CelluLiner box liners can widthstand the humidity and moisture that comes from frozen shipping\ndelivery unlike most cellulose-based insulated box liners.\n* **Collapsible Design\n**CelluLiner box liners and pouches can be efficiently flat-packed when not in use, resulting in\nsubstantial savings in storage and shipping costs.\n* **Custom Packouts**\nNeed to extend time-in-transit? Optimize for specific payloads? We\u2019ll engineer a liner to your\nspecs, not just our convenience.\n* **Performance You Can Trust\n**Our liners consistently hold desired temperatures through extended transit times, backed by\nlab-tested ISTA profiles.\n* **Quick Turnarounds\n**No waiting on overseas supply chains or getting stuck behind giant MOQs. We keep it lean and\nlocal.\n\nOur curbside recyclable, all-paper thermal liners deliver reliable cold-chain protection **without\nplastic films, bubble wrap, or landfill-bound puffed up foams**. That means your packaging meets\ngrowing demands for **truly fully recyclable solutions**\u2014without compromise\n\n[celluliner magnifying glass]\n\n#### Do You Know What's Inside?\n\nIf it's not paper, it probably doesn't get recycled.\n\n[Learn More][98]\n\nCelluLiner is an innovative paper-based insulated packaging material that\u2019s curbside recyclable and\nprotects shipments for up to 72 hours. Our paper material is compostable and bio-degradable.\n\nIntroducing our innovative paper insulated box liner that\u2019s made of **100% curbside recyclable\nmaterials** and designed to protect frozen and refrigerated shipments between 48-72 hours.\n\nMade of an advanced multi-layered paper material that\u2019s designed for maximum insulating performance,\nthese paper insulated packaging products can be fully collapsed to a flat format for space and cost\nsavings during transit and storage.\n\nMade with 100% biodegradable cellulose insulation panels and outer casing, CelluLiner contains\nthousands of small air pockets per cm\u00b3 that substantially slow heat transfer, while the outer shell\nis also naturally insulating. The combination of these materials results in an insulating liner that\nprovides protection against even the most extreme ambient conditions.\n\nOur high-performance paper insulated box liner comes as two separate three-sided panels that\ninterlock to form a box shape. The panels can be placed into a box shape in just a few seconds,\nafter which they are ready to be loaded with your temperature-sensitive goods.\n\nAfter use, the panels can be conveniently flattened and placed in** a curbside recycling bin or used\nfor compost.**\n\n[Request a Quote][99] [View Brochure][100]\n\n[curbside recyclable insulation for shipping cold for over 48 hours, example application like meal\nkit delivery.]\n\n*Our CelluLiner insulated box liner is very consumer oriented making it a perfect option for Meal\nKit Delivery*\n\n#### Not all paper packaging products are the same\n\nUnlike some paper packaging products that use low quality, non-recyclable material such as newsprint\nand [cornstarch][101], at IPC we only use post-consumer paper materials that are valuable to\nrecycling companies.\n\n[Recyclable Insulated Packaging Cross Section]\n\n## CelluLiner: 100% Paper Insulated Packaging\n\n#### High-performance 100% paper insulated packaging\n\nMade with a 100% paper construction, CelluLiner provides highly effective temperature control while\nbeing made from completely natural, recyclable materials. IPC offers optional performance enhancing\nreflective films that do not affect the recyclability of our [CelluLiner insulated box liners][102]\nand[ curbside recyclable insulated pouches.][103]\n\n#### Are You Shipping Frozen?\n\nWe\u2019ve got you covered. CelluLiner's paper interior absorb excess moisture and do not breakdown like\ncornstarch if they get wet from condensation.\n\n[Get a Free Quote Today][104]\n[A celluliner box liner with edited items inside]\n\n### [CelluLiner is Available with Curbside Recyclable Plastic Covering][105]\n\n#### High-performance layered paper interior and plastic outer shell\n\nEconoCell is a curbside-recyclable insulated packaging material from the same family as CelluLiner.\nAlso made with a 100% paper interior, EconoCell is cased inside a recyclable plastic outer lining.\nNot only does this provide powerful temperature control, it\u2019s waterproof and has a clean,\nprofessional appearance.\n\n[Recyclable Insulated Packaging Cross Section]\n\n### **Insulated Box Liners**\n\n### **Insulated Pouch**\n\n#### **Custom sizes and minimum order quantities**\n\nAs with most IPC packaging solutions, we can manufacture CelluLiner box liners in any custom size,\nand at no additional cost. This allows you to source [insulated packaging][106] at a size that\nperfectly fits your specific product requirements, resulting in optimal conditions for temperature\ncontrol, and giving you confidence that your products will reach their destination within the\ndesired temperature range. Additionally, we can test your custom payload in our in-house\nenvironmental testing chamber, further ensuring the packaging solution will provide sufficient\nthermal protection. Get in touch to discuss your requirements.\n\nThe minimum order quantity for CelluLiner Box Liners is 1000 sets/pcs per size. Learn more about our\n[minimum order quantities][107] here.\n\n[Paper Insulation diagram]\n\n### Made with 100% paper insulation, CelluLiner is the world\u2019s first construction paper liner\n### unlocking the sustainability benefits of compostable thermal shipping liners.\n\n[CelluLiner Paper Box Liners 1 graph]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nInsulation \u2502Box Size \u2502Payload \u2502Refrigerant \u2502Time Below\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502Target\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCelluliner Ultra 10S with Foil \u250212\u2033x12\u2033x12\u250224 Frozen Meals \u2013 3.5 oz \u2502 15lb Dry \u2502 71 hours\nMet \u2502\u2033 \u2502each \u2502Ice \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCelluliner Ultra 10S with Foil\u250212\u2033x12\u2033x10\u250216 Frozen Meals \u2013 3.5 oz \u2502 15lb Dry \u250271.3 hours\nMet \u2502\u2033 \u2502each \u2502Ice \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[CelluLiner Paper Box Liners 2 graph]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u250