            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# High-Performance Insulated Shipping Boxes\n\n## 48-72+ hours of protection for frozen and refrigerated shipments\n\n### PopupLiner\u2122 \u2013 Trusted by leading brands. Engineered to outperform\u2014and save space.\n\n[insulated product corp flagship curbside recyclable insulated box liner]\n\nPopupLiner\u2122 can keep your product frozen for up to 72 hours, outperforming all other insulated box\nliners on the market. One of the best-performing insulation materials available, PopupLiner\u2122 is\ncompact and features patented vacuum-compressed panels and a mylar shell that save warehouse space,\nreduce logistics costs, extend transit times, and deliver superior thermal performance\u2014while also\nenhancing your customer's unboxing experience. Discover the next generation of\ntemperature-controlled packaging solutions.\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View Brochure][97]\n[PopupLiner panels are similar to RNC industries rockwool insulation panels]\n\n## What makes PopupLiner\u2122 the Best Insulated Box Liner Ever Made?\n\nEngineered with patented vacuum-compressed panels and a reflective mylar shell, PopupLiner\u2122 delivers\nunmatched thermal performance\u2014and ships flat to save space and reduce freight costs.\n* **Top-Tier Thermal Performance\n**Outperforms traditional coolers and box liners in both hot and cold conditions in cold chain\ntesting. Maintains target temperature longer and more reliably.\n* **Custom Sizes\n**Standard sizes available or build your own. Add branding or custom specs to match your products\nand your message.\n* **Frozen or Refrigerated? Works for Both\n**Whether you\u2019re using insulated shipping boxes for frozen food\u2014like ice cream, seafood, or meal\nkits\u2014 or aiming to keep products chilled, such as refrigerated medications, PopupLiner\u2122 delivers\nconsistent, reliable thermal protection.\n* **Ships Vacuum Compressed\n**IPC\u2019s patented vacuum-compressed panels ship flat, saving you space and reducing freight costs.\nOpen the liner bundle\u2014panels pop up instantly, ready for use. Save warehouse space. Cut inbound\nfreight. Speed up your packing lines.\n* **Clean, Premium Presentation\n**No messy tape. No sloppy folds. PopupLiner\u2122 expands into a crisp, structured box liner that\nenhances your customer\u2019s unboxing experience.\n\n### Ditch the Foam. Skip the Coolers. Upgrade to PopupLiner\u2122\n\n#### EPS foam Coolers waste space. Foam isn\u2019t recyclable. And flat liners can be messy and hard to\n#### assemble. PopupLiner\u2122 is the smarter, cleaner, and more sustainable alternative\u2014without\n#### sacrificing performance.\n\nThe unique insulated box liners provide an alternative form of [temperature-control packaging][98].\nThey are made of a lightweight proprietary material that is both fully collapsible and compressed\nusing our [patented technology][99].\n\nPopupLiner 2-Piece thermal box liners are constructed with flexible polyurethane foam insulators\nthat are encased inside two metalized sleeves, designed to easily \u2018lock\u2019 together inside cartons of\nany size.\n\nBusinesses that previously explored rockwool insulation for temperature-controlled shipping often\nswitch to PopupLiner for its flat-pack storage, lighter weight, and comparable thermal performance \u2014\nwithout the rigid bulk or handling challenges.\n\nThe padded, thermal box panels immediately turn any cold shipping box into custom-sized,\ntemperature-control packaging that can be quickly loaded with temperature-sensitive goods and\nrefrigerant products, such as [refrigerant gel packs][100] or dry ice.\n\nThis unique and innovative technology is patented. (Patent # US 8,333,279)\n\n[Request a Quote][101] [View Brochure][102]\n\n## **Unique Compression Technology**\n\nIPC\u2019s innovative compression technology allows you to experience unparalleled cost savings on\ntransport and warehousing.\n\n[LEARN MORE][103]\n[insulated Box Liner]\nPopupLiner insulated panels encased inside compression sleeve.\nCompression sleeve keeps PopupLiner ultra-compact when in transit or storage.\n\n#### **Custom sizes and minimum order quantities**\n\nWe specialize in manufacturing fully customizable sizes to fit your exact requirements at no\nadditional cost. Get in touch to discuss your requirements.\n\nThe minimum order quantity for PopupLiner thermal liners is 1000 sets/pcs per size. Learn more about\nour [minimum order quantities][104] here.\n\n[ [PopupLiner panels are similar to RNC industries rockwool insulation panels] ][105]\n\n> \u201c\n> \"The best performing insulation we have found.\"\n\n> \u201c\n> \"Inch for inch, the performance is unmatched.\"\n\n## How Does PopupLiner Work?\n\n#### PopupLiner thermal box panels can be assembled in a matter of seconds.\n\n[Insulated Containers]\n[Insulated Box Liners]\n\n## Why PopupLiner?\n\n#### Four reasons why PopupLiner Box Liners are your perfect insulated packaging solution.\n* #### Effective for 48 to 72-hour shipments\n\nPopupLiner thermal liners provides effective protection for transit durations of up to 72 hours.\n* #### Unparalleled space efficiency\n\nPopupLiner arrives compact, and will inflate to full thickness upon opening of the seal. This\nspace-saving design, a patented feature, helps you to save on storage and warehousing costs.\n* #### Environmentally friendly materials\n\nBuilt with green, recyclable materials.\n* #### Custom sizes\n\nIPC prides itself on its ability to create custom-sized solutions, tailor made to fit the needs of\nthe client.\n* #### Increased Protection for Fragile Products\n\nProducts that are packaged using glass materials, like glass, need insulated shipping solutions\nthat also provide a cushioning effect must be utilized in order to minimize and prevent movement.\nAny amount of movement, like dropping, shock and vibration, could result in damaged products.\n\n[ [Cold Shipping Boxes] ][106]\n\n### [Read more about the PopupLiner Insulated Box Liners.][107]\n\n#### High-performance, cost-saving insulated packaging\n\nOne of the most important benefits provided by our PopupLiner insulated shipping boxes is that they\nare highly space-efficient. While traditional temp-control packaging, such as molded containers, are\nbulky, our insulated box liners are [sent to you collapsed and compressed][108]. With 75% more\nspace-efficiency than molded coolers, PopupLiner insulated boxes help you save substantially on\nwarehousing and shipping costs.\n\nThis advanced space-efficiency feature helps IPC\u2019s clients to receive industry-best pricing, made\npossible by the reduced inbound freight cost, as well as the labor savings achieved via reduced\nhandling requirements.\n\nThis makes IPC\u2019s PopupLiner insulated shipping boxes among the most cost-efficient substitutes for\nmolded containers on the market today.\n\n#### Compact and compressed form\n\nPopupLiner cold shipping boxes are unique in that they provides extraordinary performance, while\nalso arriving in a compact, easy-to-store form. The patent-pending technology provides unmatched\nefficiency of use in the packing area when compared to molded coolers. This compact storage feature\nallows more insulated box liners to be stored in a smaller area. Also, with less frequent\nreplenishment required, workflow in the pack area is much more efficient.\n\nPopupLiner panels are made of 100% recycled materials, and are themselves 100% recyclable.\n\nIPC prides itself on being able to provide custom box sizes, and PopupLiner insulated containers are\nno exception.\n\n#### Where does the high-performance come from?\n\nIt is all down to the high-performance insulating panel: Advanced Panel Filler.\n\nPopupLiner\u2019s super insulator panels are manufactured using a durable, impact-absorbing, and highly\nelastic foam that virtually stops heat flow due to its very low weight-to-volume ratio. The unique\npanels provide unmatched performance in the industry, while also extremely lightweight and flexible.\n\nMillions of tiny capsules inside each foam panel act to slow down heat flow while remaining elastic\nand providing structure to the panel. The high-performance panel provides exceptional conductive\ninsulation in addition to superb drop-testing performance.\n\n#### Super reflective panel envelope\n\nPopupLiner box insulation panels are encased in unique, completely enclosed radiant-barrier covers\nproviding additional convective insulation. The carefully crafted outer envelope is designed\nspecifically to work in combination with the foam filler. The unique structure provides the correct\namount of convective heat resistance to augment the conductive insulation already presented by the\nadvanced foam filler.\n\nThe envelope is carefully crafted to perfectly encase the panels, while allowing the necessary\nmovement to facilitate a perfect fit inside the carton.\n\n#### Shipping with dry ice\n\nPopupLiner cold shipping boxes work particu"
