            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Shop Insulated Mailers and Thermal Pouches for Reliable Cold Chain Shipping\n\nInsulated Products Corporation ([IPC][96]) offers a full line of insulated pouches and [thermal\nbubble mailers][97] engineered for compact, temperature-sensitive shipments. Whether you\u2019re\n[shipping pharmaceuticals][98], frozen desserts, or ready-to-eat meals, our pouches are lightweight,\nspace-saving, and built for performance. Choose from recyclable paper liners, foil-bubble mailers,\nor high-performance foam inserts\u2014each designed to maintain product integrity during one- to two-day\ntransit windows. For more information reach out to one of our [cold chain experts.][99]\n\n[ [Insulated package for temperature controlled shipping named PopupLiner Pouch manufactured by IPC]\n][100]\n\n### [PopupLiner Insulated Pouch][101]\n\nThe PopupLiner Insulated Pouch is our best-performing thermal mailer and is available in any custom\nsize. Similar to other expansion mailers, like the Kangaroo mailer, our foam mailer comes vacuum\ncompressed to save on storage space.\n\n[Explore our custom foam pouches][102]\n\n[ [Curbside recyclable insulated paper pouches for shipping named CelluLiner and manufactured by\nIPC] ][103]\n\n### [CelluLiner Insulated Mailers][104]\n\nCelluLiner insulated envelopes are our paper-based recyclable thermal mailer. Made from paper, our\ncustom-sized insulated envelopes are curbside recyclable eliminating waste.\n\n[Explore our recyclable paper insulated envelopes][105]\n\n[ [Two silver metallic thermal bubble mailers] ][106]\n\n### [CooLiner Thermal Bubble Mailers][107]\n\nThese thermal bubble mailers offer a cost-effective and lightweight solution for short-duration cold\nchain shipments. They are ideal for shipping chilled goods that require minimal bulk.\n\n[Explore our insulated bubble mailers][108]\n\n[ [EcoLiner Pouch] ][109]\n\n### [EcoLiner Eco Friendly Pouches][110]\n\nEcoLiner insulated pouches combine environmental consciousness with reliable thermal protection.\nThese eco-friendly thermal mailers are great for brands seeking to minimize their environmental\nimpact without compromising performance.\n\n[Explore our eco friendly pouches][111]\n\n[ [Insulated package for temperature controlled shipping named PopupLiner Pouch manufactured by IPC]\n][112]\n\n### [PopupLiner Insulated Pouch][113]\n\nThe PopupLiner Insulated Pouch is our best-performing thermal mailer and is available in any custom\nsize. Similar to other expansion mailers, like the Kangaroo mailer, our foam mailer comes vacuum\ncompressed to save on storage space.\n\n[Explore our custom foam pouches][114]\n\n[ [Curbside recyclable insulated paper pouches for shipping named CelluLiner and manufactured by\nIPC] ][115]\n\n### [CelluLiner Insulated Pouch][116]\n\nCelluLiner insulated envelopes are our paper-based recyclable thermal mailer. Made from paper, our\ncustom-sized insulated envelopes are curbside recyclable eliminating waste.\n\n[Explore our recyclable paper insulated envelopes][117]\n\n[ [Two silver metallic thermal bubble mailers] ][118]\n\n### [CooLiner Thermal Bubble Pouch][119]\n\nThese thermal bubble mailers offer a cost-effective and lightweight solution for short-duration cold\nchain shipments. They are ideal for shipping chilled goods that require minimal bulk.\n\n[Explore our insulated bubble pouches][120]\n\n[ [EcoLiner Pouch] ][121]\n\n### [EcoLiner Eco Friendly Pouch][122]\n\nEcoLiner insulated pouches combine environmental consciousness with reliable thermal protection.\nThese eco-friendly thermal mailers are great for brands seeking to minimize their environmental\nimpact without compromising performance.\n\n[Explore our eco friendly pouches][123]\n\n[ [product image of the AerVault Mailer, a white insulated shipping pouch standing upright against a\nsmooth blue gradient background.] ][124]\n\n### [AerVault Mailer][125]\n\nOur AerVault provide reliable thermal protection for small to medium cold chain shipments.\nLightweight and recyclable, they\u2019re ideal for pharmaceuticals, specialty foods, and other\ntemperature-sensitive products in transit.\n\n[Explore our recyclable AerVault mailers][126]\n\n### [CryoVault Pouch][127]\n\nOur CryoVault Pouches deliver reliable thermal protection for temperature-sensitive shipments, with\nthe added convenience of a slide and adhesive tape closure for added safety and individually\ncompressed packaging.\n\n[Explore our CryoVault insulated pouches][128]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about Thermal Mailers\n\nStarting out with insulated mailers? Have a look at some of our most frequently asked questions\nabout insulated mailers and thermal pouches.\n\n### [What are insulated mailers used for?][129]\n\nInsulated mailers are used to ship temperature-sensitive goods such as frozen foods, meal kits,\npharmaceuticals, and lab samples. Their lightweight, compact design helps protect products from heat\nexposure and temperature fluctuations during short- to mid-range transit.\n\n### [Can insulated mailers keep items frozen?][130]\n\nYes, when paired with dry ice, Insulated Product Corp\u2019s insulated mailers can help maintain frozen\ntemperatures, depending on shipment duration and climate conditions. For longer shipping durations,\nwe recommend [frozen shipping boxes][131]. Insulated pouches are a great choice for 24-48 hour\nshipping of temperature-sensitive food, like [cold shipping chocolates][132], vaccines, or biotech\nsamples.\n\n### [Are your thermal mailers recyclable?][133]\n\nIPC offers several recyclable options, including CelluLiner, a curbside-[recyclable insulated box\nliner ][134]and EcoLiner, made of [recycled denim insulation][135]. These sustainable pouches reduce\nlandfill waste and meet corporate sustainability goals without sacrificing performance.\n\n### [How long do insulated pouches maintain temperature in transit?][136]\n\nOur thermal pouches are engineered to maintain temperature ranges for up to 48 hours when used with\nappropriate refrigerants. Actual performance depends on outside temperature, product load, and\ninsulated mailer type.\n\n### [What size insulated mailers do you offer?][137]\n\nIPC manufactures a wide range of stock and custom insulated mailer sizes, from small 6\u00d76\u201d pouches to\noversized options, 9\u2033 x12\u2033, [insulated packaging for meal kits][138] and bulkier products. We also\nprovide custom sizing for [wholesale insulated packaging][139] purchases.\n\n### [What is IPC's minimum purchase quantity of insulated thermal mailers?][140]\n\nMinimum order quantities vary by product type. For most stock sizes, IPC offers pallet-based\nminimums, while custom configurations may require a higher volume.\n\n### [What are the best insulated mailers for pharmaceuticals?][141]\n\nFor pharmaceutical shipping, IPC recommends our [**PopupLiner thermal pouches**][142] or\n[**CelluLiner recyclable mailers**][143], which provide high thermal performance and compact\npackaging.\n\n## Why Choose Insulated Products Corporation?\n\nAt IPC, we design [insulated packaging solutions][144] that balance cold chain performance with\nsustainability. Whether you need [eco-friendly thermal liners][145] or [gel packs for cold\nshipping][146], our product line supports long-haul shipping, frozen fulfillment, and\nclimate-controlled deliveries.\n\n### Space Efficient\n\nOur innovative materials are designed to provide substantial space savings during storage and\nshipping.\n\n### Custom Sizes\n\nWe specialize in manufacturing custom-sized insulation products to order. We provide a solution to\nall insulated packaging requirements.\n\n### Unique Materials\n\nOur patented designs and materials provide unparalleled performance and are exclusively available at\nIPC.\n\n### Eco Friendly\n\nWe are committed to developing and suppling products that minimize environmental impact.\n\n## Trusted by Brands You Know\n\nCompanies receiving more than 3 years of quality service from IPC\n\n[client]\n[client]\n[client]\n[client]\n[client]\n[Thermal Shipping]\n\nTake The Stress Out of Shipping Perishables\n\n## Ready To Discuss Your Insulated Packaging Needs?\n\n[Get a Custom Quote][147]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][148]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][149]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][150]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][151]\n* [Insulated Pouches][152]\n* [Gel Packs][153]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][154]\n* [New Innovations][155]\n* [Company][156]\n* [Performance Testing][157]\n* [Resources][158]\n* [Request a Quote][159]\n* [Jobs][160]\n* [Accessibility][161]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"
