            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# CooLiner\u00ae Insulated Pouches\n\n[Slide] \"IPC's CooLiner provides excellent isolation\" [Slide] \"The consistency and quality has been\nkey to our large-quantity transport success\" JOHN, DUPONT CORP\n\n### Easy to use, environmentally friendly and cost effective insulated envelopes.\n\n[Silver insulated bubble mailer with reflective thermal foil exterior and bubble wrap lining for\ntemperature controlled cold chain shipping.]\n\nCooLiner\u00ae insulated pouches are lightweight thermal mailers designed for shipping flat or\nsmall-sized temperature-sensitive goods.\n\nThe thermal pouches can be quickly filled with your temperature-sensitive goods and sealed with an\nsecure adhesive strip in a matter of seconds. Our insulated pouches provide the easiest method of\nshipping your small-sized items.\n\nMade of recyclable #7* CooLiner\u00ae material, these insulated bubble mailers are made using a\ncombination of an internal bubble layer and a reflective outer layer which work together to provide\nreliable temperature control.\n\nIn the event the size of your payload exceeds the capacity of our **[thermal envelopes][96],** our\n[insulated box liners][97] fill the need to ship *\u201csmaller than a pallet *but* bigger than an\nenvelope\u201d *shipments with a guarantee that the temperature of the products being shipped remain\nlargely unchanged throughout the cold-chain distribution system.\n\n**May not be recyclable in your area*\n\n#### Custom sizes and minimum order quantities\n\nWe can provide custom sizes to suit your exact requirements at no additional cost. Get in touch to\ndiscuss your requirements.\n\nThe minimum order quantity for Insulated Pouches is 1000 sets/pcs per size. Learn more about our\n[minimum order quantities][98] here.\n\n[Request a Quote][99] [View Brochure][100]\n\n## Features\n* ##### Protection for over 24 hours\n\nThe thermal envelopes provide effective temperature control for over 24 hours.\n* ##### Leak-resistant design\n\nPrevents moisture \u2018sweating\u2019 on product.\n* ##### Easy and quick to use\n\nInstantly seal the one-piece thermal pouches with the Peel-and-Seal adhesive lip closure.\n* ##### Clean and professional presentation\n\nStay aligned with your brand image.\n* ##### Ideal for flat products\n\nPerfect for small food items, medical supplies, and other temperature-sensitive items.\n* ##### Raw materials approved by the FDA\n\nIn cases of incidental food contact.\n* ##### Use with refrigerant gel packs\n\nEnhance the performance of your insulated bubble mailers by using it in conjunction with our [cold\npacks][101].\n\n[ [Insulated Pouches] ][102]\n\n## Available in Various Thickness\n\nOur insulated mailers are available in various levels of thickness that are offered depending on\nyour performance requirements.\n\n#### Lite\n\nMore streamlined for reduced costs.\n\n[CooLiner Lite]\n\n#### Single Bubble\n\nSuitable for shiments lasting 24 hours.\n\n#### Double Bubble\n\nDual bubble layer provides 20% better protection.\n\n[CooLiner Double Bubble Diagram]\n\n#### Watch the demonstration video to find out how quick and easy it is to use CooLiner\u00ae insulated\n#### pouches.\n\n[ [Silver insulated bubble mailer with reflective thermal foil exterior and bubble wrap lining for\ntemperature controlled cold chain shipping.] ][103]\n\n### FAQs\n\n### [What is CooLiner\u00ae?][104]\n\nMade with a combination of metalized films and air bubbles, CooLiner\u00ae material is an innovative type\nof insulated packaging that effectively protects shipments against extreme ambient temperatures.\n\nLined with a silver bubble wrap, these pouches give you all the flexibility you need. They are\navailable in any custom size, and they can be filled and sealed in seconds.\n\nAlso available as a box liner, pallet cover or cargo blanket, CooLiner\u00ae is recommended for\nprotecting shipments for durations lasting 24 hours.\n\n### [How does CooLiner\u00ae work?][105]\n\nOur proprietary insulation technology, exclusively available at IPC, perfectly combines heat\nreflection and mass. In comparison to similar materials with a higher relative thickness, CooLiner\u00ae\nprovides superior temperature control. It is the dual performance of the reflective outer layer and\nlow thermal mass that allows CooLiner\u00ae to outperform other similar products.\n\nReflective Foil Layer\n\nThe foil outer layer serves to prevent heat from radiating into the shipment. This works using the\nproperties offered by this aluminized layer that allow it to receive and bounce away heat energy at\na subatomic level.\n\nAdvanced Bubble Layer\n\nWith a unique structure carefully designed to inhibit conductive heat flow, CooLiner\u00ae material can\nprovide superior thermal protection to even thicker, heavier films.\n\nThe result of 11 years of research and development, our bubble insulation technology has, time and\ntime again, proven to provide real-world efficacy.\n\n### [Why is the CooLiner\u00ae superior?][106]\n\n**Unparalleled performance**. It provides a level of temperature control unparalleled in the\nindustry.\n\n**Reduced operational costs. **CooLiner\u00ae helps you to keep your work area efficient with quick and\neasy application. Another benefit is that CooLiner\u00ae can be compactly folded away when not in use,\nproviding valuable savings in warehousing and shipping.\n\n**Durable, puncture-proof and water-tight. **CooLiner\u00ae material is safeguarded against rips during\ntransit, allowing you to rest assured your shipments will reach their destination without damage.\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### **Refrigerated Product \u2013 24-Hour Transit in Summer**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Details:** \u250212 lbs. of chilled gravy\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Box Size:** \u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**ID Size:** \u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Used:** \u2502Carton lined with CooLiner\u00ae Box Liner\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Compared to:**\u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033 with 6 pcs. 1.5\u2033 Styrofoam Inserts\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Weight Shipped:** \u250210 lbs.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Pre-Shipment Temp:** \u25022 \u00b0C (~35 \u00b0F)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Refrigerant Used:** \u25022x 28 oz. gel packs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Related Products\n\n[ [Paper Insulated Pouch] ][107]\n\n##### Paper Insulated Pouches\n\nCelluLiner Pouches are high-performance insulated pouches made entirely of curbside-recyclable\nmaterials. With a 100% paper construction, CelluLiner pouches protect shipments against even the\nmost extreme ambient conditions.\n\n[ [PopupLiner Insulated Pouch] ][108]\n\n##### PopupLiner Insulated Pouches\n\nSelf-inflating insulated pouches that arrive in patented compression sleeves and automatically\ninflate to full size when opened.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][109]\n\n### Want to know more about our Insulated Pouches?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][110]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][111]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][112]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][113]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][114]\n* [Insulated Pouches][115]\n* [Gel Packs][116]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][117]\n* [New Innovations][118]\n* [Company][119]\n* [Performance Testing][120]\n* [Resources][121]\n* [Request a Quote][122]\n* [Jobs][123]\n* [Accessibility][124]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][125]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][126]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][127]\n* [facebook][128]\n* [linkedin][129]\n* [youtube][130]\n\n[Close Menu ][131]\n\n* [Products][132]\n* [Products][133]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][134]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][135]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][136]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][137]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][138]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: "
