            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# AerVault Mailers\n\n## Lightweight mailers engineered for reliable cold chain performance\n\nOur recyclable AerVault mailers are designed to maintain consistent internal temperatures during\ntransit, ensuring that temperature-sensitive goods reach their destination safely. Each mailer\nprovides a balance of lightweight efficiency, insulation strength, and sustainability, making it\nideal for small to medium shipments such as pharmaceuticals, prepared foods, chocolates,\nsupplements, and diagnostic samples.\n\n[Request a Quote][96][View Brochure][97]\n[product image of the AerVault Mailer, a white insulated shipping pouch standing upright against a\nsmooth blue gradient background.]\n\nAerVault Mailers offer reliable cold chain protection with sustainable design.\n\nAerVault mailers deliver eco-conscious cold-chain protection you can trust. Featuring advanced\nmulti-layer insulation with microscopic air pockets, these mailers slow thermal exchange to preserve\nconsistent internal temperatures during transit.\n\nEach mailer is finished with a recyclable outer material that provides durability and a professional\nappearance. The integrated peel-and-seal adhesive strip allows quick and secure packing, improving\noperational efficiency while reducing material waste.\n\n[Request a Quote][98] [View Brochure][99]\n\n#### Not all paper packaging products are the same\n\nUnlike some paper packaging products that use low quality, non-recyclable material such as newsprint\nand [cornstarch][100], at IPC we only use post-consumer paper materials that are valuable to\nrecycling companies.\n\n## Why AerVault Mailers?\n\n#### Learn why our AerVault Mailers for cold shipping are trusted by logistics providers, food\n#### suppliers, and pharmaceutical companies for efficient and sustainable temperature control.\n\n#### Standard Sizes and Branding\n\nAerVault mailers are available in standard sizes and branding to support efficient cold-chain\nshipping, ensuring reliable thermal protection and operational efficiency.\n\n#### **Lightweight and Space-Saving**\n\nDesigned to reduce freight volume and storage space, our lightweight AerVault mailers deliver cost\nefficiency while maintaining thermal reliability for up to two-day shipments.\n\n#### Standard sizes and minimum order quantities\n\nAerVault mailers are available in standard sizes (9\u00d711 and 12\u00d714) to support consistent cold-chain\nshipping and operational efficiency. Each mailer undergoes rigorous in-house thermal testing to\nensure reliable performance across various temperature conditions.\n\nMinimum order quantities apply. Contact our team to discuss specifications, size options, and\navailable customization or learn more [here][101].\n\n[Popup Mailer with Ozempic product]\n\n## Related Products\n\n[Insulated Grocery Delivery Bag]\n\n### PopupLiner Insulated Pouch\n\nThe PopupLiner Insulated Pouch is our best-performing thermal mailer and is available in any custom\nsize. Similar to other expansion mailers, like the Kangaroo mailer, our foam mailer comes vacuum\ncompressed to save on storage space.\n\nExplore our custom foam pouches\u2192\n][102]\n[Paper Insulated Box Liners]\n\n### CelluLiner Insulated Pouch\n\nCelluLiner insulated envelopes are our paper-based recyclable thermal mailer. Made from paper, our\ncustom-sized insulated envelopes are curbside recyclable eliminating waste.\n\nExplore our recyclable paper insulated envelopes\u2192\n][103]\n[Insulated Grocery Delivery Bag]\n\n### CooLiner Thermal Bubble Pouch\n\nThese thermal bubble mailers offer a cost-effective and lightweight solution for short-duration cold\nchain shipments. They are ideal for shipping chilled goods that require minimal bulk.\n\nExplore our insulated bubble pouches\u2192\n][104]\n[Paper Insulated Box Liners]\n\n### EcoLiner Eco Friendly Pouch\n\nEcoLiner insulated pouches combine environmental consciousness with reliable thermal protection.\nThese eco-friendly thermal mailers are great for brands seeking to minimize their environmental\nimpact without compromising performance.\n\nExplore our eco friendly pouches\u2192\n][105]\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][106]\n\n### Want to know more about our popup insulated mailer?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE][107]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][108]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][109]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][110]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][111]\n* [Insulated Pouches][112]\n* [Gel Packs][113]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][114]\n* [New Innovations][115]\n* [Company][116]\n* [Performance Testing][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Request a Quote][119]\n* [Jobs][120]\n* [Accessibility][121]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][122]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][123]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][124]\n* [facebook][125]\n* [linkedin][126]\n* [youtube][127]\n\n[Close Menu ][128]\n\n* [Products][129]\n* [Products][130]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][131]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][132]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][133]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][134]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][135]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][136]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][137]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][138]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][139]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][140]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][141]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][142]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][143]\n* [Delivery][144]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][145]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][146]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][147]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][148]\n* [Large Cargo][149]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][150]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][151]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][152]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][153]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][154]\n* [Gel Packs][155]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][156]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][157]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][158]\n* [Foam Bricks][159]\n* [Industries][160]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][161]\n* [Food][162]\n* [Meat][163]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][164]\n* [Vaccines][165]\n* [Direct to Consumer][166]\n* [Company][167]\n* [Company][168]\n* [Our Materials][169]\n* [Performance Testing][170]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][171]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][172]\n* [FAQ][173]\n* [Resources][174]\n* [Knowledge Base][175]\n* [FAQ][176]\n* [General FAQ][177]\n* [Shipping Regulations][178]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][179]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][180]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][181]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][182]\n* [Industry Applications][183]\n* [How to Ship Meat][184]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][185]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][186]\n* [Product FAQ][187]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][188]\n* [Case Studies][189]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][190]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][191]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][192]\n* [Food Case Stud