            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Paper Insulated Grocery Delivery Bag\n\n### Curbside-recyclable, paper insulated bags for grocery deliveries.\n\n[insulated product corp flagship curbside recyclable insulated box liner]\n\nIPC's revolutionary insulated delivery bag provides unmatched thermal protection in a convenient\ngrocery bag format, ideal for perishable food and grocery delivery.\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View The Brochure][97]\n[paper delivery bags]\n\n## Paper insulated grocery bags provide the perfect solution for delivering perishables to your\n## customers.\n\nIntroducing our new 100% paper insulated delivery bag, the perfect solution for shipping\ntemperature-sensitive goods to your environmentally conscious customers. Exclusively manufactured by\nIPC, the CelluLiner grocery bag is the thickest all-paper bag in the world, performing reliably for\nfrozen, refrigerated, and heated goods.\n\nMade entirely with paper, these insulated delivery totes are lightweight, made of recycled\nmaterials, and can be conveniently recycled curbside after use.\n\nWhile being compact and lightweight, these paper insulated delivery bags provide effective\ntemperature control. The high level of insulation is achieve through a multi-layered paper panel\ndesign that creates thousands of tiny air pockets per cm\u00b3 that substantially reduce heat transfer.\n\n[Request a Quote][98] [View Brochure][99]\n\n[Insulated Bag for Food Delivery]\n\n#### Not all paper packaging products are the same\n\nUnlike some paper packaging products that use low quality, non-recyclable material such as newsprint\nand [cornstarch][100], at IPC we only use post-consumer paper materials that are valuable to\nrecycling companies.\n\n## Why CelluLiner?\n\n#### Learn why our paper insulated grocery delivery bags provide the perfect solution for\n#### temp-sensitive consumer deliveries.\n\n#### **Curbside Recyclable\n#### **\n\nThese paper insulated delivery bags are made entirely of paper, and can be conveniently recycled\ncurbside without requiring any separation.\n\n#### **Consumer Friendly\n#### **\n\nThe general public is increasing environmentally conscious, and prefers to purchase products\npackaged in recyclable materials.\n\n#### **Collapsible Design\n#### **\n\nCelluLiner insulated bags can be efficiently flat-packed before and after use, resulting in\nsubstantial savings in warehousing and shipping costs when compared to other types of insulated\nbags.\n\n[insulated delivery bags]\n\n## Effective Temperature Control\n\nAn advanced, multi-layered design allows these insulated grocery bags to provide effective\ntemperature protection, giving you confidence your grocery deliveries will reach their destination\nat the right temperature.\n\n## Multi-Layered Paper Insulation\n\nMake entirely of paper, this insulated food bag achieve such a high level of performance through an\nadvanced multi-layered construction. Numerous layers of paper are compressed to create thousands of\nair pockets that substantially slows heat flow.\n\nThe multi-layered interior is encased in a paper casing to ensure a clear appearance and optimal\ninsulating performance.\n\n[Paper Insulation diagram]\n[Paper Delivery Bags Pallet]\n\n## Highly Efficient Storage\n\nEach bulk shipping container contains 2400 paper insulated bags and is delivered to you in a\nspace-efficient format. This compact package allows you to benefit from optimal storage and\noperational efficiency when filling your insulated grocery bags.\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### CelluLiner maintaining below 60\u00b0F for 3 hours\n\n[ [Paper Insulation Performance Chart] ][101]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDetails: \u2502Chicken breast (16 oz), sausage links (13.3 oz), whole milk (64 oz), yogurt cup (6\n\u2502oz) and cheese (16 oz)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBag size \u250212\u2033 x 7\u2033 x 17\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBag weight \u25024.7 oz\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nProduct used \u2502Insulated grocery bag\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPre-Shipment \u250236 \u00b0F\nTemp: \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRefrigerant \u2502N/A\nUsed: \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTemp. Profile \u250275 \u00b0F for 0.5 hr / 100 \u00b0F for 2.5 hr\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTest duration \u25023 hr\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Other Paper Insulated Packaging\n\n[Paper Insulated Box Liners]\n\n### Paper Insulated Box Liners\n\nRecyclable paper insulated box liners for deliveries between 24-72 hours.\n\nExplore Paper Insulated Insulated Box Liners\u2192\n][102]\n[CelluLiner insulated paper pouches]\n\n### CelluLiner Paper Pouches\n\nThe perfect insulated packaging for sending small-sized products to consumers.\n\nLearn more about CelluLiner Paper Pouches\u2192\n][103]\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][104]\n\n### Want to know more about our paper insulated grocery bags?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE][105]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][106]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][107]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][108]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][109]\n* [Insulated Pouches][110]\n* [Gel Packs][111]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][112]\n* [New Innovations][113]\n* [Company][114]\n* [Performance Testing][115]\n* [Resources][116]\n* [Request a Quote][117]\n* [Jobs][118]\n* [Accessibility][119]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][120]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][121]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][122]\n* [facebook][123]\n* [linkedin][124]\n* [youtube][125]\n\n[Close Menu ][126]\n\n* [Products][127]\n* [Products][128]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][129]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][130]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][131]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][132]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][133]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][134]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][135]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][136]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][137]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][138]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][139]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][140]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][141]\n* [Delivery][142]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][143]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][144]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][145]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][146]\n* [Large Cargo][147]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][148]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][149]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][150]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][151]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][152]\n* [Gel Packs][153]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][154]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][155]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][156]\n* [Foam Bricks][157]\n* [Industries][158]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][159]\n* [Food][160]\n* [Meat][161]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][162]\n* [Vaccines][163]\n* [Direct to Consumer][164]\n* [Company][165]\n* [Company][166]\n* [Our Materials][167]\n* [Performance Testing][168]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][169]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][170]\n* [FAQ][171]\n* [Resources][172]\n* [Knowledge Base][173]\n* [FAQ][174]\n* [General FAQ][175]\n* [Shipping Regulations][176]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][177]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][178]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][179]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][180]\n* [Industry Applications][181]\n* [How to Ship Meat][182]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][183]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][184]\n* [Product FAQ][185]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][186]\n* [Case Studies][187]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][188]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][189]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][190]\n* [Food Case Studies][191]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][192]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside S"
