            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Insulated Delivery Bags\n\n### Single-use insulated delivery bags that are perfect for hot or cold food deliveries.\n\n[Insulated Delivery Bags]\n\nCooLiner To Go is a high-performance, single-use insulated delivery bag that requires no reverse\nlogistics and helps you deliver hot or cold goods safely to your customers.\n\n[ [Reusable insulated thermal grocery bag with foil lining holding milk, fresh vegetables, and\nproduce for cold food storage and transport.] ][96]\n\n***Patent Pending***\n\nThe new-and-improved version of the CooLiner Box Liner, CooLiner To Go is an lightweight insulated\ntote bag that comes with a convenient carrying handle and provides effective temperature control for\nover 24 hours.\n\nEach single-use, thermal bag comes with an integrated hand hole and an easy-use adhesive tape seal,\nmaking the CooLiner *To Go* the perfect bag for applications including delivery and transportation\nof hot or cold food. As well as being used as insulated food delivery bags, the *To Go* can also be\nused for transporting other temperature-sensitive products.\n\n#### Custom size availability\n\nOur insulating delivery bags can be made in any custom size to suit your exact requirements, and we\ndo this at no extra cost. Get in touch to discuss your requirements. The minimum order quantity MOQ)\nranges from 1,000 to 5,000 pieces, based on the size.\n\n[Request a Quote][97] [View Brochure][98]\n\n### Sturdy, high-capacity insulated bags\n\nThese disposable insulated food bags are designed to offer a singular, high-performance insulation\nunit, as opposed to dual-layered paper bag and liner combinations. The performance achieved using\nthe CooLiner *To Go* is superior to the combined units since the metalized outer layer is uncovered.\n\nThese #7 recyclable* insulated food bags can withstand the weight of a very large quantity of food\nproducts. Our in-house testing has indicated the bags can safely carry more than 22lbs of\ntemperature-sensitive produce. The thermal bags are made with gusseted corners, meaning they fit\nneatly inside your corrugated cartons.\n\nHot and cold food deliveries are perfect examples of uses for these Insulated Delivery Bags. Food\ncan be loaded in seconds, whether at a takeaway or a supermarket, and sealed and sent on it\u2019s way\nwhile effectively containing the inside temperature, keeping hot food hot and cold food cold.\n\n**May not be recyclable in your area*\n\n[Learn More][99]\n[ [Insulated Food Carrier] ][100]\n[Branded Insulating Delviery Bags]\n\n## Custom Branding Available\n\nMaintain a consistent brand image until your products reach your customers. We custom-print your\nbranding onto your insulated bags to help you keep a professional image throughout the delivery\nprocess.\n\n[LET'S TALK][101]\n\n## Available in Various Thickness\n\nOur Insulated Delivery Bags are available in various levels of thickness that are offered depending\non your performance requirements.\n\n#### Lite\n\nMore streamlined for reduced costs.\n\n[CooLiner Lite]\n\n#### Single Bubble\n\nSuitable for shiments lasting 24 hours.\n\n#### Double Bubble\n\nDual bubble layer provides 20% better protection.\n\n[CooLiner Double Bubble Diagram]\n[ [Insulated Food Bags] ][102]\n\n### What makes the Insulated Delivery Bags superior?\n\n**Convenient Carrying Handle**\nA super-strong, integrated handle makes it easy to carry the insulated shopping bags by hand.\n\n**Instant Peal-and-Seal Closure\n**Once the bag is full, simply pull tape to reveal adhesive strip and seal.\n\n**Effective Temperature Control\n**Our tried-and-tested, [proprietary CooLiner material][103] effectively keeps your deliveries\nwithin a specific temperature range.\n\n## Features\n* **Convenient carrying handle**\n\nIntegrated carrying handle makes it easy to hold the insulated delivery bags in your hand.\n* **24 hour protection**\n\nHigh-performance insulated cooler bags that provide effective temperature control for more than 24\nhours.\n* **Robust construction**\n\nThe disposable insulated shipping bags feature a sturdy design to prevent tears.\n* **Easy-seal adhesive lip tape**\n\nQuickly seal the insulated shopping bag with the *Peel-and-Seal* adhesive lip closure.\n* **Perfect for food shipping and deliveries**\n\nThermal bags are perfect for sending hot or cold food to your customers.\n* **FDA-approved raw materials**\n\nOur insulated grocery bags are FDA-approved in cases of incidental food contact.\n\n[ [Insulated Grocery Bags] ][104]\n\n## CooLiner Installation Demo\n\nCooLiner also comes in a box liner and pouch format. Watch the video to find out how quick and easy\nit is to use CooLiner packaging for shipping temperature-sensitive goods.\n\n[ [Insulated Food Bags] ][105]\n\n### FAQs\n\n### [What is CooLiner?][106]\n\nOur insulated food delivery bags are made from CooLiner material, an advanced, flexible insulation\nmaterial that provides effective thermal control when used as a packaging material during shipments.\nAn innovative material made using a combination of reflective metalized films and a non-conductive\nair bubble material, CooLiner protects shipments against extreme ambient temperatures.\n\nCooLiner insulated bags and pouches are flexible, sturdy, and can be filled, sealed and sent on\ntheir way within a matter of seconds.\n\nThe material, which is also available as a box liner, pallet cover, cargo blanket and insulated\npouch, provides high-performance temperature control for over 24 hours.\n\n### [How does CooLiner work?][107]\n\nEach thermal bag for food delivery is made from CooLiner material, a proprietary technology created\nover years of meticulous research and development. CooLiner combines its low mass with high heat\nreflectivity to substantially inhibit heat transferring into shipments. The effectiveness of the\nmaterial is achieved through use of two key components:\n\nAdvanced Bubble Layer. The air-bubble layer features a unique structure, made up of countless air\npockets, designed to prevent the conductive transfer of heat. This structure allows CooLiner to\nprovide even more effective performance than heavier, thicker films.\n\nReflective Foil Layer. The air-bubble layer is covered in a highly reflective metalized film that\nprevents heat from radiating inward from the ambient environment.\n\n### [What makes CooLiner superior?][108]\n\n**Performance.** CooLiner thermal delivery bags have been proven to be highly effective in keeping\nshipments within the desired temperature range throughout the transit duration. Primarily, they are\nused for refrigerated or room-temp goods.\n\n**Cost Savings.** With an efficient, space-saving design, CooLiner can be neatly folded when not in\nuse or in transit, providing invaluable savings in warehousing and shipping costs. The material is\nalso made of primarily air, and since its a low mass/high volume material, this is an indication of\nhow little resin is required for its manufacture-an additional way the cost is kept low compared to\nmore dense materials.\n\n**Durability. **CooLiner is designed with a durable material that resists tears, meaning you can\nrest assured you shipments will make it to the destination with damage or pilfering.\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### Refrigerated Product \u2013 24-Hour Transit in Summer\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Details:** \u250212 lbs. of chilled gravy\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Box Size:** \u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**ID Size:** \u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Used:** \u2502Carton lined with CooLiner Box Liner\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Container Compared to:**\u250212.5\u2033 x 10.5\u2033 x 8\u2033 with 6 pcs. 1.5\u2033 Styrofoam Inserts\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Weight Shipped:** \u250210 lbs.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Pre-Shipment Temp:** \u25022 \u00b0C (~35 \u00b0F)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Refrigerant Used:** \u25022x 28 oz. gel packs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## **New Delivery Bag Products**\n\n[Insulated Delivery Tote]\n\n### Paper Grocery Bag\n\nIntroducing our most environmentally friendly insulated delivery bag. Made entirely of paper, this\ninsulated delivery tote safely protects temperature-sensitive shipments for up to 24 hours and can\nbe conveniently placed in curbside recycling bins after use.\n* Curbside recyclable\n* 100% paper\n* Compact and lightweigh"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://ipcpack.com/products/celluliner-paper-insulated-roll-cold-shipping/",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Paper Insulated Roll for Cold Shipping\n\n## Deliver with confidence using CelluLiner Paper Insulated Rolls, offering flexible and sustainable\n## insulation solutions.\n\n[Insulated thermal wrap using paper for flexible cold shipping]\n\nCelluLiner's curbside recyclable insulating wrap is the perfect solution for protecting perishables\nof irregular sizes and creating temperature barriers for goods requiring different storage\nconditions.\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [All Products][97]\n[delivery wrap]\n\nCelluLiner Insulated Wrap is designed for maximum flexibility. Our wrap offers exceptional thermal\ninsulation while aligning with your sustainability goals.\n\n### Paper Insulated Wrap for Cold Shipping\n\nCelluLiner Paper Insulated Wrap provides unmatched versatility with its eco-friendly insulation\ntechnology. This curbside recyclable solution is engineered to help maintain or provide additional\ninsulation, ensuring the safety and quality of your shipments. Perfect for irregularly sized or\ndelicate items like groceries, fresh meats, chocolates, and other temperature-sensitive products,\nthe wrap adapts seamlessly to your needs.\n\n[Request a Quote][98]\n\n#### Not all paper packaging products are the same\n\nUnlike some paper packaging products that use low quality, non-recyclable material such as newsprint\nand [cornstarch][99], at IPC we only use post-consumer paper materials that are valuable to\nrecycling companies.\n\n## Why CelluLiner?\n\n#### Learn why our paper insulated wrap provide the perfect solution for mixed temperature consumer\n#### deliveries like groceries.\n\n#### **Curbside Recyclable\n#### **\n\nOnce received, your customers can simply flatten them and put them in their curbside recycling bin.\n\n#### **Flexible\n#### **\n\nFlexible and customizable for various packout configurations\n\n#### **Mixed Temperature\n#### **\n\nProven thermal performance for extended freshness and suitable for mixed-temperature storage needs.\n\n#### **Custom sizes and minimum order quantities**\n\nAs with most IPC packaging solutions, we can manufacture paper insulated pouches in any custom size,\nand at no additional cost. This allows you to source packaging at a size that perfectly fits your\nspecific product requirements, resulting in optimal conditions for temperature control, and giving\nyou confidence that your products will reach their destination within the desired temperature range.\nAdditionally, we can test your custom payload in our in-house environmental testing chamber, further\nensuring the packaging solution will provide sufficient thermal protection.\n\nOur CelluLiner Pouches are subject to minimum order quantities. Get in touch or learn more about our\n[minimum order quantities][100] here.\n\n[Paper Insulation diagram]\n\n## Other Paper Insulated Packaging\n\n[Insulated Grocery Delivery Bag]\n\n### Paper Insulated Delivery Bags\n\nRecyclable paper insulated bags for delivering temp-sensitive goods to consumers.\n\nExplore Paper Insulated Delivery Bag\u2192\n][101]\n[Paper Insulated Box Liners]\n\n### Paper Insulated Box Liners\n\nRecyclable paper insulated box liners for deliveries between 24-72 hours.\n\nExplore Paper Insulated Insulated Box Liners\u2192\n][102]\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][103]\n\n### Want to know more about our paper insulated pouches?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE][104]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][105]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][106]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][107]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][108]\n* [Insulated Pouches][109]\n* [Gel Packs][110]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][111]\n* [New Innovations][112]\n* [Company][113]\n* [Performance Testing][114]\n* [Resources][115]\n* [Request a Quote][116]\n* [Jobs][117]\n* [Accessibility][118]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25