            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Foil Insulation Roll\n\n[Slide] \"IPC's CooLiner provides excellent isolation\" [Slide] \"The consistency and quality has been\nkey to our large-quantity transport success\" JOHN, DUPONT CORP\n\n### Easy to use, environmentally friendly and cost-effective foil-backed bubble wrap.\n\n[insulation roll]\n[ [Roll of reflective foil bubble insulation wrap for thermal packaging, cold chain shipping, and\ntemperature controlled product protection.] ][96]\n\n#### Foil bubble rolls made of radiant barrier insulation that protects shipments against extreme\n#### ambient temperatures.\n\nCooLiner insulated bubble wrap is IPC\u2019s premier insulation line for protection of varying sizes of\ncontainers, pallets and other packages or freight.\n\nThe lightweight foil insulation is engineered using our recyclable #7* CooLiner material, which\nfeatures a dual-layered structure of air bubbles and metalized foil, fused together with an\nintelligent bond solution. The durable material is impervious to tears or rips, and provides\neffective temperature control throughout the duration of your shipment.\n\n**May not be recyclable in your area*\n\n#### Available in any custom size\n\nWe can provide insulation rolls in any custom size at no additional cost, allowing you to find\ninsulation that fits your exact requirements. Get in touch for more information.\n\n[Request a Quote][97] [View Brochure][98]\n\n## What Makes Our Insulated Bubble Wrap Superior?\n* ##### Protects Against Cold and Heat\n\nThe foil-faced insulation provides high-performance temperature protection against extreme cold\nand heat ambient temperatures.\n* ##### Easy to Use\n\nCooLiner foil backed bubble wrap makes it easy to insulate pallets in seconds.\n* ##### Efficient Use of Material\n\nEliminate waste by using only the amount of thermal roll needed to protect your cartons or\npallets.\n* ##### Light and UV Protection\n\nCooLiner thermal insulation foil roll provides high level of protection against light and UV.\n\n[ [Roll Stock] ][99]\n\n## Available in Various Thickness\n\nOur Insulated Rolls are available in various levels of thickness that are offered depending on your\nperformance requirements.\n\n#### Lite\n\nMore streamlined for reduced costs.\n\n[CooLiner Lite]\n\n#### Single Bubble\n\nSuitable for shiments lasting 24 hours.\n\n#### Double Bubble\n\nDual bubble layer provides 20% better protection.\n\n[CooLiner Double Bubble Diagram]\n\n## Performance Testing\n\nThe performance of our bubble foil insulation against both extreme heat and cold is demonstrated\nbelow.\n\n## FAQs\n\n### [What is CooLiner?][100]\n\nYears of research and development led to the creation of the CooLiner foil bubble insulation, an\nadvanced insulation liner material. The material uses a powerful fusion of encapsulated air bubbles\nand metalized films to keep your shipments safe against ambient temperatures during transit.\n\nCooLiner products, known as silver bubble wrap, come in several forms \u2013 including [box liners][101],\n[pallet covers][102], [pouches][103] and [insulated delivery bags][104] \u2013 and can be custom-made to\nfit a shipment of any size. The material could not be simpler to use, and is recommended for\nprotecting shipments lasting 24 hours at refrigerated temperatures.\n\n### [How does CooLiner work?][105]\n\nThe high performance of CooLiner thermal insulation rolls is achieved through their unique,\ndual-layered structure.\n\n##### Reflective Outer Layer\n\nCooLiner material uses a reflective outer material that provides the perfect combination of heat\nreflection and mass. Highly reflective and light materials (those with low thermal mass) are ideal\nfor heat resistance. This critical combination used by CooLiner has a significant net-effect on its\nimpressive degree of performance.\n\nThe metalized, reflective layer serves to prevent heat from radiating into the shipment from the\nsurrounding environment. It functions even more effectively when exposed to open air, as when it is\nused as a pallet cover.\n\n##### Internal Bubbler Layer\n\nThe bubble material used within CooLiner has a unique structure that provides substantial resistance\nagainst heat flow.\n\nPerfected through more than a decade of ongoing research, this bubble technology provides real-world\nefficiency that generates savings for businesses.\n\n### [Why is the CooLiner superior?][106]\n\n**Excellent performance**. Using CooLiner foil bubble wrap allows you to rest assured your goods\nwill arrive at their destination within the required temperature range.\n\n**Space-saving design**. The foldable design of the insulation allows for space-efficiency savings\nin warehousing and shipping.\n\n**Durable material**. The unique material is made to resist punctures and tears.\n\n**Easy disposal.** There is no need for reverse logistics.\n\n### [How does CooLiner save me money?][107]\n\n**Warehousing and shipping costs.** The compact design of these thermal insulation rolls makes it\nquick and easy to store and apply to shipments, especially when compared to bulky insulation\nproducts.\n\n**Pack-area efficiency**. With lower space requirements, CooLiner products provide more pack-area\nefficiency.\n\n**Ease of use**. CooLiner products can be applied in a matter of seconds.\n\n## Related Products\n\n[ [FabriCool Insulated Cargo Covers] ][108]\n\n##### FabriCool Insulated Cargo Covers\n\nHigh-performance insulated cargo covers made using a robust insulation material that combines a\ntough, metalized outer layer with a breathable fabric internal layer.\n\n##### CooLiner Insulated Pallet Covers\n\nOur innovative pallet covers are constructed with proprietary foil bubble material to provide\nprotection against temperature extremes. We assist our clients in keeping bulk shipments at\nconsistent temperatures.\n\n### Protect Freshness with Our Insulated Delivery Wrap\n\nIntroducing the ultimate solution for temperature-sensitive deliveries\u2014our Insulated Delivery Wrap.\nKeeps perishable items like meat, seafood, and groceries at the perfect temperature for extended\nperiods. with convenient roll design for easy storage and minimal weight addition. Crafted with\nsustainable materials to reduce waste and support environmentally friendly practices our insulated\ndelivery wrap is ideal for grocery deliveries, meal kits, butcher shops, and more.\n\n[Learn More About CelluLiner Insulated Wrap][109]\n[delivery wrap with roll]\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][110]\n\n### Want to know more about our Insulation Roll?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][111]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][112]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][113]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][114]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][115]\n* [Insulated Pouches][116]\n* [Gel Packs][117]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][118]\n* [New Innovations][119]\n* [Company][120]\n* [Performance Testing][121]\n* [Resources][122]\n* [Request a Quote][123]\n* [Jobs][124]\n* [Accessibility][125]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][126]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][127]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500