            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Air Cargo Insulation\n\n[Slide] \"IPC's CooLiner provides excellent isolation\" [Slide] \"The consistency and quality has been\nkey to our large-quantity transport success\" JOHN, DUPONT CORP\n\n### The perfect insulated shipping solution for airplane cargo.\n\nOur line of air cargo insulation products is ideal for the perishable freight-forwarding industry.\n\n[Air Cargo Covers]\n\nCooLiner cargo blankets provide a highly effective method of insulating bulk quantities of goods\nshipped via air cargo.\n\nA proprietary combination of lightweight reflective foils and thermoplastics allows CooLiner air\ncargo covers to produce extreme temperature differentials when placed over temperature-sensitive\ncargo. This performance is achieved through utilization of unique film technology, making them\nappropriate for a variety of applications.\n\nWe provide the following products:\n* [Insulated Bubble Wrap][96]: 30\u2033 tall to 125\u2033 or custom\n* E, EH , EO air cargo containers\n* Custom insulated freight covers (LD3, LD8 & M1)\n* [Cold packs for shipping][97]\u2013 Regular and Pre-frozen\n* LD3 foam wedges for packing\n* Single-side corrugated rolls\n* 20\u2032 4.0 mill plastic sheeting\n* Vboard/Edgeboard\n\n[Cargo Blankets Dimensions]\n\n#### Custom sizes\n\nWe can manufacture your cargo insulation to any custom size. Get in touch to discuss your\nrequirements.\n\n[Request a Quote][98] [View Brochure][99]\n\n## Features\n* #### Perfect for bulk shipping\n\nThe insulated cargo blankets provide effective thermal protection of bulk quantities of goods\nshipped via air cargo.\n* #### Highly effective temperature control\n\nOur perishable freight products deliver outstanding temperature-control performance against both\ncold and heat.\n* #### Applicable for numerous industries\n\nCooLiner insulated cargo containers are ideal for agricultural products, fruits and vegetables,\nmedical fluids, pharmaceuticals, seafood, meat, temperature-sensitive industrial materials, and\nwater-based paints.\n\n* #### High-performance temperature control\n\nUsing a proprietary combination of reflective foils and thermoplastics, CooLiner thermal cargo\nblankets produce extreme temperature differentials when placed over temperature-sensitive cargo.\n* #### Protection for extended durations\n\nThe insulated cargo blankets provide an effective temperature barrier for more than six days and\nguarantee protection against freezing.\n* #### Available for various cargo containers\n\nIn addition to temp shield temperature control shipping materials like the CooLiner thermal\nblankets for cargo, IPC also manufactures kits to protect Air Cargo LD3, LD8 and LD 10 containers.\n\n## Single vs. Double Bubble\n\nOur Air Cargo Insulation is available in Single Bubble or Double Bubble form, depending on your\nperformance requirements. Click and drag the slider below to compare the two versions.\n\n#### Single Bubble\n\nSuitable for shiments lasting 24 hours.\n\n[CooLiner Double Bubble Diagram]\n\n#### Double Bubble\n\nDual bubble layer provides 20% better protection.\n\n#### Watch the video below to see how to insulate your air cargo using CooLiner Air Cargo\n#### Insulation.\n\n## What Makes Our Air Cargo Insulation Superior?\n* #### Durable Design\n\nOur Air Cargo Insulation material is designed to be sturdy, tear-proof, and puncture-resistant,\nensuring your products make it through transit intact.\n* #### Space-Saving Design\n\nOur products arrive compressed and folded, allowing you to minimize warehousing and\ntransportation costs.\n* #### Easy to Use\n\nOur insualtion products could not be easier to apply, and fit perfectly every time.\n* #### Collapsible\n\nThe space-efficient design allows you to immediately collapse the insulation after use, making\ndisposal and transportion easy.\n* #### Protection Against Light and UV\n\nOur air cargo insulation provides a high level of protection against light, solar radiation and\nUV.\n\n[Insulated Cargo Blankets]\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### Protection Against Extreme Cold\n\n#### Protection Against Extreme Heat\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Containers] ][100]\n[ [Thermal Blankets for Cargo] ][101]\n\n### CooLiner F.A.Q\n\n### [What is CooLiner?][102]\n\nCooLiner is an innovative type of insulating material composed of an air-bubble layer encased in\nmetalized films. The material provides highly effective temperature control, protecting your air\nfreight against extremely hot or cold ambient temperatures.\n\nThe CooLiner range consists of LD3 kits, LD7 and LD8 kits, [box liners][103], [pallet covers][104],\n[pouches][105], [insulation roll][106], and [cargo blankets][107]. Each product is quick and\neasy-to-use, and can be custom-manufactured to perfectly fit a shipment of any size.\n\nThe material also features a space-saving design, allowing it to be folded away compactly for\nreduced warehousing and shipping costs.\n\n### [What makes CooLiner so effective?][108]\n\nIt all comes down to the unique manufacturing processes used.\n\n##### [Cargo Insulation Covers]Unique Dual Layer Technology\n\nOur proprietary reflective insulation material, which is not available to others in the industry,\nprovides the optimal fusion of heat reflection and mass. It is the combination of low thermal mass\nand reflective insulators that provides heat resistance superior to other available products.\n\nThe reflective foil layer prevents the radiation of heat from the local environment, even once it\nhas entered the walls of the carton.\n\n##### Our Proprietary Bubble Layer\n\nOur bubble later is designed with a unique structure that effectively resists conductive heat flow.\nUsing the correct weight (gauge) is essential to ensure the material\u2019s optimal performance capacity.\n\nHeavier films, while more durable, have a higher level of thermal mass. This can result in enhanced\nheat flow, which is undesirable.\n\nPerfected through 11 years of meticulous research and development, IPC\u2019s unique bubble technology\nprovides time-tested, real-world efficacy.\n\n##### CooLiner \u2013 Insulated Box Liner Specifications\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Descriptio\u25021 layer plastic bubble material.\nn:** \u2502Available in light, heavy, double layer and white.\n\u2502Laminated to metalized film.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Weight & \u25020.99 oz/ft2.\nWidth:** \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Thickness:\u25023/16 in\n** \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Usage:** \u2502Used to cover or encase perishables or temperature-sensitive products.\n\u2502Raw materials approved by the FDA for incidental contact.\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### [Why is the CooLiner superior?][109]\n\nThe benefits provided by CooLiner are numerous and wide-ranging.\n* **Superior temperature-control**. CooLiner insulation products provide a level of thermal\nprotection beyond the capacities of similar products.\n* **Space-saving design. ** The insulation can be compactly folded away, allowing you to optimize\noperation efficiency while saving on warehousing and shipping.\n* **Robust material.** The dual-layer construction is impervious to being torn during transit.\n* **Water-tight exterior**. The reflective outer layer prevents leakage during transport.\n* **Easy disposal.** Single-use liners eliminate the cost of reverse logistics.\n\n### [How does CooLiner save me money?][110]\n\nCooLiner provides numerous cost-saving advantages over foam-type insulation products.\n\n**Reduced operational costs. **CooLiner is quick and easy to use.\n\n**Pack-area efficiency**. Because they require little space when folded, less work is required when\nmoving them through the packaging process.\n\n**Savings on reverse logistics**. CooLiner are single-use products that require no reverse\nlogistics.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n[ [FabriCool Insulated Cargo Covers] ][111]\n\n##### FabriCool Insulated Cargo Covers\n\nHigh-performance insulated cargo covers made using a robust insulation material that combines a\ntough, metalized outer layer with a breathable fabric internal layer.\n\n[ [Insulated Cargo Covers] ][112]\n\n##### CooLiner Insulated Cargo Blankets\n\nSturdy, tear-proof insulated cargo blankets that provide high-performance temperature control\nthroughout the entire transit duration.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][113]\n\n### Want to know more about our air cargo insulati"
