            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Gel Packs for Shipping\n\n## High Performance Cold Packs for Every Use\n\nLooking for gel packs for shipping? Our high performance gel packs come in various sizes and styles.\n\n[Get a Quote Today][96][View Brochure][97]\n[gel packs for shipping products cold]\n\n## Different Types of Gel Packs for Shipping\n\nLooking for reliable ice packs for shipping? Whether you're delivering chocolate, pharmaceuticals,\nor seafood, our ice packs for shipping are engineered to maintain cold temperatures throughout\ntransit. As a trusted supplier of **wholesale ice packs for shipping** for over 20 years, we\u2019ve\ndeveloped proven solutions for a wide range of cold chain needs.****\n\n**** ****\n**** ****\n**** ****\n****\n[gel packs]\n\n#### **Drain-Friendly**\n\nPerfect for consumer deliveries, non-toxic and easy to dispose of in running water.\n\n[learn more about our non toxic ice packs][98]\n\n[standard gel packs for shipping]\n\n#### **Consumer**\n\nOur consumer-grade cold packs are printed with safety labelling to ensure safe use.\n\n[learn about our bulk ice packs][99]\n\n[sweat proof gel packs 2]\n\n#### **Sweat-Proof**\n\nBuilt with an advanced, layered exterior that minimizes condensation.\n\n[learn about our no sweat ice packs][100]\n\n[wholesale gel packs for shipping]\n\n#### **Blue Industrial**\n\nMade with a tough, recyclable polyethylene plastic that is proven to be puncture-resistant and\nresist tears.\n\n[learn more about our blue ice gel packs][101]\n\n#### **Custom Printed**\n\nHave your logo custom-printed onto your gel packs, ensuring complete consistency with your branding.\n\n[talk to someone about custom printed gel packs][102]\n\n****\n**** ****\n**** ****\n**** ****\n****\n\n## Leaders in Gel Pack Manufacture\n\n### Twenty years in cold chain packaging and we\u2019re still one of the leading gel pack manufactures in\n### the United States.\n* ### Suitable for many applications\n\nYou can use our gel ice packs for shipping food, pharmaceuticals, industrial products, and many\nother temperature-sensitive items.\n* ### Robust leak-proof design\n\nTough, durable and recyclable polyethylene plastic material is used with heat-sealed seams to\nensure puncture-resistance and to prevent tears and splitting. The gel ice packs will not leak or\nspill to contaminate your product or packaging.\n* ### Our cold packs stay colder for longer\n\nOur shipping ice packs are built using materials engineered to stay colder for longer.\n* ### Reusable Gel Packs\n\nThe reusable ice packs can be frozen again after use, ready for your next shipment.\n* ### Private label gel packs for shipping available\n\nWe provide private-label ice packs for shipping, meaning you can sell our products under your own\nbrand.\n* ### Custom size cold packs available\n\nOur cooling gel packs for shipping are available in numerous different sizes, making them suitable\nfor various packaging applications.\n\n[explore sizes][103]\n* ### Pre-frozen ice packs available\n\nPre-frozen gel packs are also available, in stock 24/7.\n\n## **Talk to one of our experts and experience the IPC Difference. **\n\n[Get a Quote for Wholesale Gel Packs Today][104]\n\n## Gel Pack Solutions\n\n### Twenty years in cold chain packaging and we\u2019re still one of the leading gel pack manufactures in\n### the United States.\n\n[standard gel packs for shipping]\n\n### Consumer Grade Gel Packs\n\nOur consumer-grade cold packs are printed with safety labelling to ensure safe use. It's consumer\nfacing applications makes it one of the most widely used gel packs in cold chain logistics. Made of\nrefrigerant, thermoplastic materials, our gel ice packs provide a cost-effective way of keeping your\nshipments cold throughout the entire shipping duration. With a durable, leak-proof plastic design,\nour lightweight gel packs are perfect for shipping a large variety of goods. You can use our ice gel\npacks for shipping all types of temperature-sensitive goods, such as medicines and pharmaceuticals,\nand food items such as meat, cheese and groceries.\n\n[get a free quote today][105]\n[gel packs]\n\n### Drain Friendly Non Toxic Gel Packs\n\n][106]\n\n#### Perfect for consumer deliveries, non-toxic, disposable and recyclable gel packs for shipping\n#### that can be conveniently disposed of down the drain.\n\nOur [drain-friendly gel packs][107] were created in response to the need for gel packs requiring\neasy disposal. The challenge that existed previously was that, despite the outer plastic portion of\nthe gel packs being recyclable, there was no easy way to dispose of the gel material contents. This\nresulted in many used gel packs ending up in a landfill.\n\nThese drain-friendly ice packs provide a solution to this issue. In an increasing environmentally\nfriendly society, these are the perfect ice packs for shipping to consumers.\n\n#### **Key Features:**\n* Recyclable or disposable\n* Robust leak-proof design\n* Protects frozen and refrigerated shipments\n\n[learn more about our drain friendly non toxic ice packs][108]\n[sweat proof gel packs 2]\n\n### Sweat Proof Gel Packs\n\n][109]\n\nOur sweat proof refrigerant gel packs are designed to keep shipments cold longer while preventing\ncondensation with a sweat-proof exterior. Made from durable, lightweight, and puncture-resistant\nthermoplastic materials, these reusable gel packs are perfect for shipping food, pharmaceuticals,\nand other temperature-sensitive goods. The fabric-covered exterior prevents freezer burn, and the\nrugged polyethylene construction ensures that the packs won\u2019t leak, protecting shipments from\ncontamination. Available in various sizes, GelTech\u2122 packs can be customized to meet specific\nrequirements.\n\n[learn more about our no sweat ice packs][110]\n[wholesale gel packs for shipping]\n\n### Blue Industrial Gel Packs\n\nOur blue industrial gel packs are made with a tough, recyclable polyethylene plastic that is proven\nto be puncture-resistant and resist tears during rigorous handling. They are perfect for B2B\napplications and are a value driven offering in our cold chain offering.\n\n[get a free quote on blue ice gel packs today][111]\n\n## Trusted Gel Pack Solutions Designed to Protect and Preserve Every Shipment, Every Time\n\n### Backed by 20 years of cold chain expertise, we deliver durable, high-performing gel packs and\n### customized solutions to meet the unique needs of your temperature-sensitive needs. From\n### pharmaceuticals to fresh food and industrial products, our solutions are crafted to ensure\n### temperature-sensitive items arrive in perfect condition.\n\n#### **Gel packs that keep your shipments colder for longer.**\n\nMade of refrigerant, thermoplastic materials, our gel ice packs provide a cost-effective way of\nkeeping your shipments cold throughout the entire shipping duration. With a durable, leak-proof\nplastic design, our lightweight gel packs are perfect for shipping a large variety of goods. You can\nuse our ice gel packs for shipping all types of temperature-sensitive goods, such as medicines and\npharmaceuticals, and food items such as meat, cheese and groceries.\n\n#### **Custom sizes and minimum order quantities**\n\nAs with most IPC packaging solutions, we can manufacture paper insulated delivery bags in any custom\nsize, and at no additional cost. This allows you to source packaging at a size that perfectly fits\nyour specific product requirements, resulting in optimal conditions for temperature control, and\ngiving you confidence that your products will reach their destination within the desired temperature\nrange. Additionally, we can test your custom payload in our in-house environmental testing chamber,\nfurther ensuring the packaging solution will provide sufficient thermal protection.\n\nOur CelluLiner Delivery Bags are subject to minimum order quantities. Get in touch or learn more\nabout our [minimum order quantities][112] here.\n\n## **Talk to one of our experts and experience the IPC Difference. **\n\n[Get a Quote Today][113]\n[Thermal Packaging]\n[Insulated Packaging]\n[Cold Chain Packaging]\n[Insulated Shipping Containers]\n[Insulation Packaging]\n[Thermal Shipping Insulation]\n[Beckman Coulter]\n[DHL]\n\n## Available Gel Pack Sizes\n\n### Find the perfect gel pack size for your shipping needs.\n\n[Get a Quote Today][114]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Weight**\u2502**Dimensions***\u2502**Item Code**\u2502**Quantity / Case**\u2502**Weight / Case**\u2502**Cases / Pallet**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n6 oz \u25024.5\u2033 x 5.5\u2033 \u2502GT-6 \u250296 \u250236 \u250250\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n6 oz \u25024.5\u2033 x 5.5\u2033 \u2502GT-6 \u250296 \u250236 \u250250\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\