es & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Drain-Friendly Gel Packs\n\n### Recyclable refrigerant gel packs with contents that can be conveniently rinsed down the drain.\n\n[2 white gel packs]\n\n#### Non-toxic, disposable and recyclable gel packs that can be conveniently disposed of down the\n#### drain.\n\nOur Drain-Friendly Gel Packs were created in response to the need for gel packs requiring easy\ndisposal. The challenge that existed previously was that, despite the outer plastic portion of the\ngel packs being recyclable, there was no easy way to dispose of the gel material contents. This\nresulted in many used gel packs ending up in a landfill.\n\nOur drain-friendly cold packs provide the perfect solution for keeping your products cold while in\ntransit to your customer. Made of a durable, recyclable outer casing and drain-friendly gel\ncontents, these gel packs provide a cost-effective methods of prolonging the duration that your\ngoods remain cold, resulting in happier customers and less wastage.\n\n**Key Features:**\n* Recyclable or disposable\n* Robust leak-proof design\n* Protects frozen and refrigerated shipments\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View Brochure][97]\n\n#### **Recyclable\n#### **\n\nOur drain-friendly packs can be conveniently rinsed down the drain and recycled after use.\n\n#### **Robust leak-proof design\n#### **\n\nBe confidenct cold packs won\u2019t leak into your shipments.\n\n#### **Protects frozen and refrigerated shipments**\n\nProtects frozen or refrigerated products during shipment.\n\n## Recyclability\n\n#### Our drain-friendly cold packs can be quickly and easily recycled after use.\n\n1. Cut open cold pack\n\n2. Pour contents down drain with running water\n\n3. Recycle empty outer casing\n\n## All Gel Pack Solutions\n\nWhether you're shipping chocolate, pharmaceuticals or seafood, we have a variety of stock or custom\n[ice packs for shipping][98] solutions that will fit your needs.\n\n[standard gel packs for shipping]\n\n#### **Consumer**\n\nOur consumer-grade cold packs are printed with safety labelling to ensure safe use.\n\n[all custom gel packs][99]\n\n[sweat proof gel packs 2]\n\n#### **Sweat-Proof**\n\nBuilt with an advanced, layered exterior that minimizes condensation.\n\n[learn more][100]\n\n[wholesale gel packs for shipping]\n\n#### **Blue Industrial**\n\nMade with a tough, recyclable polyethylene plastic that is proven to be puncture-resistant and\nresist tears.\n\n[learn more][101]\n\n#### **Custom Printed**\n\nHave your logo custom-printed onto your gel packs, ensuring complete consistency with your branding.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][102]\n\n### Want to know more about our drain-friendly gel packs?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][103]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][104]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][105]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][106]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][107]\n* [Insulated Pouches][108]\n* [Gel Packs][109]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][110]\n* [New Innovations][111]\n* [Company][112]\n* [Performance Testing][113]\n* [Resources][114]\n* [Request a Quote][115]\n* [Jobs][116]\n* [Accessibility][117]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][118]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][119]\n\u2500