es & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Foam Bricks\n\n#### Custom-sized foam bricks that offer unparalelled cost-efficiency for temperature control.\n\n[Refrigerant Foam Bricks]\n\nRefrigerant ice bricks offer custom shapes with safe, multi-use, cost-effective cooling capacity for\ntemperature-control applications to reward customers for shipping in just the right-sized box using\nrefrigerants that minimize box weight and dunnage.\n\nRefrigerant foam bricks provide a cost effective alternative to:\n* Gel packs that are low-cost but use significant payload capacity and have the potential to leak.\n* Rigid plastic bottles that are costly and require a high intial carbon footprint, and while\npromising reusability, often don\u2019t offer a return program.\n* Dry ice which requires a shipper and must be handled using personal protective equipment (PPE)\n\n#### Benefits:\n* Offers cost-effective cooling capacity\n* Available in any dimension to eliminate dunnage\n* Maintains stackability\n* Most efficiently optimizes the contents of a container to minimize box weight\n* The foam absorbency actively masks most leaks and punctures\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [Download Brochure][97]\n\n#### Other PCM Products\n\n[ [PCM Packs -20] ][98]\n\n##### 2-8\u00b0C PCM Packs\n\nOur 2-8\u00b0C PCM packs are perfect for helping to maintain refrigerated temperatures during transit.\n\n[ [55C PCM Packs] ][99]\n\n##### 55\u00b0 PCM Packs\n\n55\u00b0 PCM packs are perfect for helping to maintain hot temperatures during transit.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nView Safety Data Sheet\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][100]\n\n### Want to know more about our foam bricks?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][101]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][102]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][103]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][104]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][105]\n* [Insulated Pouches][106]\n* [Gel Packs][107]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][108]\n* [New Innovations][109]\n* [Company][110]\n* [Performance Testing][111]\n* [Resources][112]\n* [Request a Quote][113]\n* [Jobs][114]\n* 