            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n## About IPC\n\nFind out why we can offer an unparalleled experience.\n\n## Proprietary Insulating Technology for Superior Cold Chain Packaging.\n\n### IPC manufactures and designs high-performance, temperature-control materials for a wide variety\n### of companies around the world.\n\n[Insulated Products Corporation]\n\nSince 1999, we have focused on studying, perfecting, producing and delivering effective\ntemperature-control packaging to companies shipping medicines, foods and industrial goods worldwide.\n\nStarting as a family business in Los Angeles in 1999, IPC started supplying the produce industry in\nsouthern California with the containers, insulation and refrigerant materials required to ship their\ngoods around the world. The company founder quickly recognized the national and global demand for\nsuch products, and IPC began to reach out, via trade shows and the internet, to the many industries\nthat require temperature-control packaging around the world. IPC began to grow its extensive\nmanufacturing plant which produces proprietary temperature-control materials reliably year-round,\nday in and day out.\n\n### Serving a wide variety of industries\n\nMore than two decades later, IPC operates a modern, self-sustained manufacturing plant in Los\nAngeles, California. In the factory, IPC produces numerous [temperature-control packaging][96]\nmaterials used by a variety of industries. IPC has established hundreds of major accounts nationwide\nthat purchase weekly supplies of the packaging goods they require to operate. IPC reliably\nmanufactures, stocks and distributes these goods daily, all around the country.\n\nThe company has faithfully provided Fortune 500 companies with high-performance temperature-control\nproducts for several years. [Accuracy and timeliness][97] are essential elements of our business.\nOur reliable staff strive to produce the right products and deliver on time, every time.\n\n[IPC Locations Map]\n\n## Why IPC?\n\nThere are many reasons why our clients love working with us.\n* #### Reliability\n\nWith nearly two decades of experience in the industry, we\u2019ve perfected our proprietary methods for\nmanufacturing and delivering quality insulation products on time. Our large manufacturing plant\nruns all year round, making sure you receive your products on time.\n* #### High-Performance Products\n\nAll our insulation products are designed with one key focus: High performance. Each product is\ntested rigorously in our in-house environmental temperature chambers to ensure it provides\neffective temperature control.\n* #### Innovative Materials\n\nThrough years of experience, IPC has developed superior, proprietary insulation materials that\nprovide numerous benefits over other products. We\u2019re dedicated to innovation, and are always on\nthe lookout for new-and-improved methods of insulating temperature-sensitive goods during\nlast-mile transport.\n* #### Serving Numerous Industries\n\nWe have been fortunate to supply insulated packaging materials to successful companies operating\nacross a diverse spread of industries. Most of our clients operate in the medicines, foods and\nindustrial goods industries.\n* #### Custom Manufacturing\n\nMany of our products can be manufactured to your exact requirements at our extensive plant in Los\nAngeles. We specialize in providing flexible solutions to your custom requirements.\n* #### Broad Range of Insulated Packaging Products\n\nIPC offers a wide range of insulated packaging products, from box liners to gel packs. This allows\nus to provide an effective solution for any requirement you may have. Some of our most popular\nproducts are insulated box liners, insulated pallet covers, insulated pouches, refrigerant gel\npacks and pre-qualified insulated shippers.\n* #### Solutions Development and Testing\n\nIPC\u2019s design and testing services deliver individualized and novel packaging solutions along with\nqualification and validation services to meet regulatory requirements. IPC is capable of\ndeveloping industry-leading, customized packaging solutions that safely protect and preserve the\nintegrity of your most valuable products.\n* #### Shipping Guidance and Support\n\nAt the request of clients, we can provide manuals that properly illustrate the correct principles\nand guidelines for shipping temperature-controlled goods. We can name the pitfalls and explain the\nbasics. We can teach you how the materials work and how to use them optimally to ensure your\nproducts reach their destination at the right temperature.\n\n[EcoLiner Box Liner Cross Section]\n\n### Subcontractor Vendor Qualification Process\n\nIPC works with quality ISO 9001 and Fortune 500 companies for a multitude of the materials we\npurchase. Such companies are evaluated on their reliability, quality, procurement capability and,\nmost of all; their performance history. IPC\u2019s history of providing quality packaging solutions has\nprovided us with a real-world, tested, rigorous performance capability.\n\nIPC qualifies its vendors using the following criteria: financial stability, history of service,\nclient references and financial competitiveness. IPC regularly sources its purchased goods in order\nto consistently maintain the best materials while remaining financially sound.\n\n## Mission Statement\n\nEnabling companies to transport life-sustaining products safely, in any weather, Insulated Products\nCorp delivers high-performance insulation solutions that protect temperature-sensitive shipments.\n\nAs a leading manufacturer of thermal shipping products such as reflective radiant barrier liners,\npallet covers, blankets, and wraps, we offer custom sizes, pre-packaged ready-to-use solutions, and\nsingle-use disposable options to move critical goods securely and efficiently.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in California.**\n\n### Unique Materials\n\nView our proprietary materials and technology.\n\n### In-House Testing\n\nGuaranteed temperature control.\n\n### Full Product Range\n\nBox liners, pouches, pallet covers, cold packs, and much more.\n\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][98]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][99]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][100]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][101]\n* [Insulated Pouches][102]\n* [Gel Packs][103]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][104]\n* [New Innovations][105]\n* [Company][106]\n* [Performance Testing][107]\n* [Resources][108]\n* [Request a Quote][109]\n* [Jobs][110]\n* [Accessibility][111]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][112]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][113]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][114]\n* [facebook][115]\n* [linkedin][116]\n* [youtube][117]\n\n[Close Menu ][118]\n\n* [Products][119]\n* [Products][120]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][121]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][122]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][123]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][124]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][125]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][126]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][127]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][128]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][129]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][130]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][131]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][132]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][133]\n* [Delivery][134]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][135]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][136]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][137]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][138]\n* [Large Cargo][139]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][140]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][141]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][142]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][143]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][144]\n* [Gel Packs][145]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][146]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][147]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][148]\n* [Foam Bricks][149]\n* [Industries][150]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][151]\n* [Food][152]\n* [Meat][153]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][154]\n* [Vaccines][155]\n* [Direct to Consumer][156]\n* [Company][157]\n* [Company][158]\n* [Our Materials][159]\n* [Performance Testing][160]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][161]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][162]\n* [FAQ][163]\n* [Resources][164]\n* [Knowledge Base][165]\n* [FAQ][166]\n* [General FAQ][167]\n* [Shipping Regulations][168]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][169]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][170]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][171]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][172]\n* [Industry Applications][173]"
