            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# New Innovations\n\nOur ongoing commitment to research and development allows us to continually improve our product\nrange to create the most high-performance and cost-effective solutions to your cold-chain packaging\nrequirements. Here are some of our latest innovations.\n\n## PopUp Liner\n\nPopUp Liner is one of our latest additions to the IPC insulated packaging product range. It is a\nnew, one-piece box liner that is suitable for summer shipments, frozen or room temperature, lasting\nlonger than 48 hours.\n* Arrives compressed in a space-efficient format\n* No assembly required\n* Leak-proof construction\n* Patent pending\n\n[Learn More Here][96]\n\nPatent pending\n\n#### **Space-Efficient Design**\n\nPopUp Liner arrives compressed to minimize shipping costs.\n\n#### **Quick and Easy Use**\n\nThe box liners instantly pop up to full size upon release from the compressed case.\n\n## SustainaLiner^{\u2122}\n\nThe only reflective bubble material that can be recycled nationwide.\n\n#### **High Recycling Value**\n\nMade of 100% mono-material plastic, this innovative material has a high recycling value.\n\n#### **Highly Customizable**\n\nCustomizable to suit your exact packaging requirements.\n\nSustainaLiner^{TM} is a revolutionary new type of insulation material engineered using a unique\nmanufacturing process. SustainaLiner^{TM} is not a mixed plastics product. It is made of 100%\nmono-material plastic film, and has a high recycling value. It can be recycled at locations\nnationwide. [Click here to find the recycling locations near you][97].\n\nThis innovative summer liner comes in various forms to suit the products you\u2019re shipping: a box\nliner, pouch, pallet cover, or as insulation roll. So whether you\u2019re shipping small, envelope-sized\nitems or large pallets of products, SustainaLiner^{TM} allows you to do it cost-effectively and with\nminimal negative impact on the environment.\n\nSustainaLiner^{TM} is the only reflective bubble material that can be recycled nationwide. [Click\nhere][98] to find out where SustainaLiner^{TM} products can be recycled.\n\n[Learn more here][99]\n\nPatent pending\n\n## Do you want to know more details about these new products?\n\nGet in touch with our team for more specific information.\n\n[Contact Us][100]\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nTake The Stress Out of Shipping\n\n## Ready To Discuss Your Insulated Packaging Needs?\n\n[Get a Custom Quote][101]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][102]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][103]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][104]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][105]\n* [Insulated Pouches][106]\n* [Gel Packs][107]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][108]\n* [New Innovations][109]\n* [Company][110]\n* [Performance Testing][111]\n* [Resources][112]\n* [Request a Quote][113]\n* [Jobs][114]\n* [Accessibility][115]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][116]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][117]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][118]\n* [facebook][119]\n* [linkedin][120]\n* [youtube][121]\n\n[Close Menu ][122]\n\