            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# 2-8\u00b0C PCM Packs\n\n#### PCM gel packs that help maintain refrigerated temperatures for longer.\n\n[2-8\u00b0C PCM Packs]\n\nOur 2-8\u00b0C PCM Packs are made using phase change materials that maintain a consistent temperature\nover time. Phase change materials (PCM) work by storing and subsequently releasing substantial\namounts of thermal energy, making them extremely helpful for regulating the temperature of shipments\nwhile in transit.\n\nThese 2-8\u00b0C PCM packs are the perfect solution for ensuring your shipments remain at refrigerated\ntemperatures while being delivered to your customers. This helps you to ensure the safe delivery of\nproducts such as groceries and pharmaceuticals.\n\n#### Key Features:\n* Maintains temperatures of between 2-8\u00b0C throughout transit duration\n* Suitable for protection against freezing and overheating\n* Encased in a tough and puncture-resistant polyethylene plastic casing\n* Perfect for shipment of pharmaceuticals and groceries\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View Brochure][97]\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### PCM pack maintaining 2 \u2013 8\u00b0C for 12 hours.\n\n[ [2-8C PCM Pack Performance Testing] ][98]\n\n#### Other PCM Pack Products\n\n[ [PCM Packs -20] ][99]\n\n##### [-20\u00b0C PCM Packs][100]\n\nOur -20\u00b0C PCM packs are perfect for helping to maintain frozen temperatures during transit.\n\n[ [55C PCM Packs] ][101]\n\n##### [55\u00b0C (131\u00b0F) PCM Packs][102]\n\nOur 55\u00b0C PCM packs are perfect for when you need to maintain hot temperatures during transit.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][103]\n\n### Want to know more about our PCM packs?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][104]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][105]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][106]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][107]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][108]\n* [Insulated Pouches][109]\n* [Gel Packs][110]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][111]\n* [New Innovations][112]\n* [Company][113]\n* [Performance Testing][114]\n* [Resources][115]\n* [Request a Quote][116]\n* [Jobs][117]\n* [Accessibility][118]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][119]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][120]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][121]\n* [facebook][122]\n* [linkedin][123]\n* [youtube][124]\n\n[Close Menu ][125]\n\n* [Products][126]\n* [Products][127]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][128]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][129]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][130]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][131]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][132]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][133]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][134]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][135]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][136]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][137]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][138]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][139]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][140]\n* [Delivery][141]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][142]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][143]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][144]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][145]\n* [Large Cargo][146]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][147]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][148]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][149]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][150]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][151]\n* [Gel Packs][152]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][153]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][154]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][155]\n* [Foam Bricks][156]\n* [Industries][157]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][158]\n* [Food][159]\n* [Meat][160]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][161]\n* [Vaccines][162]\n* [Direct to Consumer][163]\n* [Company][164]\n* [Company][165]\n* [Our Materials][166]\n* [Performance Testing][167]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][168]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][169]\n* [FAQ][170]\n* [Resources][171]\n* [Knowledge Base][172]\n* [FAQ][173]\n* [General FAQ][174]\n* [Shipping Regulations][175]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][176]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][177]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][178]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][179]\n* [Industry Applications][180]\n* [How to Ship Meat][181]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][182]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][183]\n* [Product FAQ][184]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][185]\n* [Case Studies][186]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][187]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][188]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][189]\n* [Food Case Studies][190]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][191]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][192]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][193]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][194]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][195]\n* [White Papers][196]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][197]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][198]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][199]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][200]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][201]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][202]\n* [Food White Papers][203]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][204]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][205]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][206]\n* [Beverage White Papers][207]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][208]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][209]\n* [Industrial White Papers][210]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][211]\n* [Insights][212]\n* [Jobs][213]\n* [Contact][214]\n* [Request Quote][215]\n* [Shipping Guides][216]\n\n[1]: #ajax-content-wrap\n[2]: https://ipcpack.com\n[3]: #sidewidgetarea\n[4]: https://ipcpack.com/products/\n[5]: https://ipcpack.com/products/\n[6]: #\n[7]: https://ipcpack.com/products/sustainaliner/\n[8]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-box-liners/\n[9]: https://ipcpack.com/product-feature-tool-old/\n[10]: #\n[11]: https://ipcpack.com/products/paper-insulated-box-liner/\n[12]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-box-liner-popupliner-2-piece/\n[13]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-mailers/\n[14]: https://ipcpack.com/products/paper-insulated-pouch/\n[15]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-pouches-popupliner/\n[16]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-pouches/\n[17]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-pouches-mailers/\n[18]: https://ipcpack.com/products/cryovault-pouch/\n[19]: #\n[20]: https://ipcpack.com/products/paper-insulated-delivery-bag/\n[21]: https://ipcpack.com/products/paper-grocery-delivery-bag/\n[22]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-delivery-bags/\n[23]: https://ipcpack.com/products/celluliner-paper-insulated-roll-cold-shipping/\n[24]: #\n[25]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-bubble-wrap/\n[26]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-cargo-blankets/\n[27]: https://ipcpack.com/products/insulated-pallet-covers/\n[28]: https://ipcpack.com/products/air-cargo-insulation/\n[29]: #\n[30]: https://ipcpack.com/products/gel-packs/\n[31]: https://ipcpack.com/products/sweat-proof-gel-packs/\n[32]: https://ipcpack.com/products/gel-packs/drain-friendly-gel-packs/\n[33]: https://ipcpack.com/products/super-absorbent-polymer-gel-packs/\n[34]: https://ipcpack.com/products/foam-bricks/\n[35]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/\n[36]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/cold-chain-packaging-solutions/\n[37]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/food/\n[38]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/meat/\n[39]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/pharmaceuticals/\n[40]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/frozen-vaccine-shipper/\n[41]: https://ipcpack.com/industries/direct-to-consumer-insulated-packaging/\n[42]: https://ipcpack.com/company/\n[43]: https://ipcpack.com/company/\n[44]: https://ipcpack.com/materials/\n[45]: https://ipcpack.com/testing/\n[46]: https://ipcpack.com/distribution/\n[47]: https://ipcpack.com/green-packaging/\n[48]: https://ipcpack.com/resources/faq/\n[49]: https://ipcpack.com/resources/\n[50]: https://ipcpack.com/resources/\n[51]: /resources/#FAQ\n[52]: /resources/#FAQ\n[53]: https://ipcpack.com/resources/regulatory-bodies/\n[54]: https://ip"
