            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# Insulated Pallet Shipper\n\n### Lightweight, all-in-one insulated shipping solution that protects shipments against extreme heat\n### or cold for more than 48 hours.\n\n[Insulated Pallet Shipper]\n\nPerfect for shipping frozen goods, the Insulated Pallet Shipper provides extreme temperature control\nfor more than 48 hours. Package your bulk shipments inside our pallet shippers for guaranteed\nprotection against both extreme heat or cold.\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Boxes] ][96]\n\nAmbient temperature fluctuations throughout the shipping and distribution process are unavoidable.\nWhether you ship in the cold winter or hot summer months, your shipments must be effectively\nprotected against temperature extremes to prevent spoilage.\n\nThe PopupLiner pallet box is built with lightweight [insulated panels][97] that ensure the products\ninside remain at a controlled refrigerated or frozen temperature throughout the cold-chain shipping\nprocess.\n\nEach Insulated Pallet Shipper is [tested for performance][98] using your own products to ensure that\nadequate temperature control is provided. [View more performance data below][99].\n\n#### Custom size availability\n\nWe provide our pallet shippers at completely customizable sizes to suit your exact needs, and we do\nthis at no additional cost. Get in touch to discuss your requirements.\n\n[Get a Quote][100] [View Brochure][101]\n\n### Cost-Effective Pricing\n\nAs well as the exception performance provided by our cold shipping boxes, you can also benefit from\nthe cost-effective pricing available.\n\nThe thing that our clients like most about the Pallet Shippers is that it allows them to eliminate\nthe use of expensive reefers from the cold-chain shipping process. Using a single-use, disposable\nPopupLiner insulated shipper allows you to benefit from both convenience and cost-efficiency.\n\n### [Read more about the Insulated Pallet Shipper][102]\n\n**What are they made of?**\n\nThe insulated shipping boxes are made of 2\u201d thick Polyurethane foam, encased inside protective Mylar\nsleeves. By utilizing our proprietary PopupLiner insulation technology, the Insulated Pallet\nShippers are able to provide unmatched thermal performance.\n\nEach pallet shipper is composed of one tri-fold PopupLiner panel, as well as three individual panels\nto make up the six sides of a cardboard pallet shipper.\n\n**What is included in each set?**\n* Outer shell\n* Wrapping sleeve\n* Front panel and cap\n\n**Related Products**\n\n[PopupLiner Box Liner][103]\n[CooLiner Pallet Cover][104]\n[2-8\u00b0C Pre-Qualified Shipper][105]\n\n[Click Here][106] to read about why PopupLiner Box Liners are better for the environment than\npolystyrene coolers.\n\n][107] [\n][108]\n\n## Why PopupLiner?\n* #### Extreme Temperature Control\n\nThe insulated shipping boxes provide high-performance temperature control when shipping in extreme\nhot or cold temperatures.\n* #### 72-hour Protection\n\nPopupLiner insulated boxes protect your shipments for transit durations exceeding 72 hours.\n* #### Space-Efficient Design\n\nUnique, patented feature: Each pallet shipper arrives compact, and expands to full size upon\nopening.\n* #### Environmentally Friendly Materials\n\nMade with recyclable materials, PopupLiner insulated shipping boxes allow you to rest assured you\nare minimizine your environmental impact.\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Shipper] ][109]\n\n### Learn more about our innovative material\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### Room Temperature Product Protection Against Heat\n\n[ [Pallet Shipping Insulated] ][110]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Box Size:** \u250246\u2033 x 40\u2033 x 40\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Insulator:**\u25022\u2033 PopupLiner inside of Gaylord Box\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Commodity:**\u2502Solid-Oral Dose Rx\n\u2502QTY 24 Cases \u2013 23 lbs ea\n\u250210 oz bottles \u2013 QTY 36/cs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n#### Extreme Cold Freeze Protection Pallet Shipper\n\n[ [Cold Shipping Boxes] ][111]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Box Size:** \u250221\u2033 x 16\u2033 x 27\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Insulator:** \u25022\u2033 PopupLiner Pallet Shipper\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Commodity: **\u2502144 x 500 ml bottles Electrolytic Water\n\u2502Total weight: 152 lbs\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### How to Use the PopupLiner Pallet Shipper\n\n[Insulated Shipping Boxes]\n\n#### Related Products\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Covers] ][112]\n\n##### CooLiner Insulated Pallet Covers\n\nOur innovative pallet covers are constructed with proprietary foil bubble material to provide\nprotection against temperature extremes. We assist our clients in keeping bulk shipments at\nconsistent temperatures.\n\n##### CooLiner Roll Stock\n\nCooLiner Roll Stock is IPC\u2019s premier insulation line for protection of varying size of containers,\npallets and other packages against damage and extreme temperatures.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][113]\n\n### Want to know more about our insulated pallet shippers?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][114]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][115]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][116]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][117]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][118]\n* [Insulated Pouches][119]\n* [Gel Packs][120]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][121]\n* [New Innovations][122]\n* [Company][123]\n* [Performance Testing][124]\n* [Resources][125]\n* [Request a Quote][126]\n* [Jobs][127]\n* [Accessibility][128]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][129]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25