            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# **Reflective Foil Bubble ****Construction-Grade Insulation**\n\n#### FoilBuild II\n\n[ [Foil Faced Insulation] ][96]\n\n#### FoilBuild is a radiant barrier insulation that provides effective control against extremely hot\n#### or cold temperatures during shipment.\n\nThe high-performance material is made up of an advanced air-bubble layer, encased inside a metalized\nsleeve. The lightweight combination of the bubble interior and the outer reflective insulation layer\nhelps to keep shipments within a specified temperature range throughout the entire transit duration.\n\nManufactured in California, all of IPC\u2019s foil insulation products are made using proprietary\nmaterials that are not available to others in the industry. The advanced [CooLiner material][97]\nfeatures the perfect blend of low mass and high reflectivity to form a highly effective insulation\nliner.\n\n**How It Works**\n\nThe foil-faced insulated bubble wrap works by blocking heat from radiating from the local\nenvironment, while the bubble layer resists conductive heat transfer. It is the combination of the\ninner bubble and reflective outer layers that provides such effective temperature control.\n\n**Hydroponics Applications**\n\nReflective insulation makes it easier for gardeners to manage heating issues that arise with indoor\ngardening and hydroponics. Using foil-faced insulation allows the conservation of energy by\nreflecting radiant heat, while also inhibiting the growth of fungi and bacteria.\n\n#### FoilBuild II\n* 1 layer heavy-duty bubble\n* Aluminum on both sides\n* 48\u2033x125\u2032 \u2013 500 sq ft/roll\n* $118.00/roll\n\n#### FoilBuild II \u2013 1SP\n* One layer heavy-duty bubble\n* Aluminum on one side\n* 48\u2033x125\u2032 \u2013 500 sq ft/roll\n* $108.00 /roll\n\n#### FoilBuild II \u2013 Double Bubble\n* 2 layers heavy-duty bubbles\n* Aluminum on both sides\n* 48\u2033x100\u2032 \u2013 400 sq ft/roll\n* $129.00/roll\n\n#### Two-Car Garage Door Insulation Kit\n* 4 rolls 24\u201d x 20\u2019 Foil Single Bubble, foil 2 sides\n* 1 Roll 185\u201d of double sided Foam tape\n* 1 Disposable razor knife\n* Price $58.00/kit\n\n#### Foil Adhesive Tape\n* 2\u2033 x 150\u2032 Pure Aluminum Tape\n* $9.00/roll\n\n[Request a Quote][98] [View Brochure][99]\n\nLearn more about construction insulation here.\n\n## Features of FoilBuild Insulation\n\n**Unrivalled temperature control.**\nOur CooLiner foil-backed insulation features a combination of materials that provide superior\ntemperature control.\n**Space-saving design.**\nThe bubble foil insulation is built using a space-saving design that allows efficient storage and\nuse throughout the packaging and shipping process.\n**Robust materials.**\nThis foil-faced rigid insulation is designed to resist tears, rips, and water damage during transit.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n[Roll Insulation]\n\n##### CooLiner Roll Stock\n\nCooLiner Roll Stock is IPC\u2019s premier insulation line for protection of varying size of containers,\npallets and other packages against damage and extreme temperatures.\n\n[Insulated Pallet Cover]\n\n##### CooLiner Insulated Pallet Covers\n\nOur innovative pallet covers are constructed with proprietary foil bubble material to provide\nprotection against temperature extremes. We assist our clients in keeping bulk shipments at\nconsistent temperatures.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n### Want to know more about our construction insulation?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][100]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][101]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][102]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][103]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][104]\n* [Insulated Pouches][105]\n* [Gel Packs][106]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][107]\n* [New Innovations][108]\n* [Company][109]\n* [Performance Testing][110]\n* [Resources][111]\n* [Request a Quote][112]\n* [Jobs][113]\n* [Accessibility][114]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2