es & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# CelluLiner Square Bottom Bag\n\n### Curbside-recyclable, paper insulated delivery bags for consumer shipments.\n\n[CelluLiner Square Bottom Insulated Bag]\n\nCelluLiner square-bottom insulated bags provide the perfect solution for sending temp-sensitive\nproducts to your customers.\n\nIntroducing our new 100% paper square-bottom bag, a curbside-recyclable solution for insulating\nproducts while in transit to your customers.\n\nCelluLiner square-bottom bags are extremely easy and efficient to use. Simply open the bag, place it\ninside your shipping box, and load with your products.\n\nThe square-bottom bags are made using our high-performance CelluLiner insulation material. Made\nentirely with paper, this insulation material achieves such a high level of insulation thank to it\u2019s\nadvanced, multi-layered construction. Numerous layers of paper are combined to create thousands of\ntiny air pockets that substantially reduce airflow and heat transfer.\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View Brochure][97]\n\n#### Not all paper packaging products are the same\n\nUnlike some paper packaging products that use low quality, non-recyclable material such as newsprint\nand [cornstarch][98], at IPC we only use post-consumer paper materials that are valuable to\nrecycling companies.\n\n## Why CelluLiner?\n\n#### Learn why our paper insulated delivery bags provide the perfect solution for temp-sensitive\n#### consumer deliveries.\n\n#### **Curbside Recyclable\n#### **\n\nThese paper insulated delivery bags are made entirely of paper, and can be conveniently recycled\ncurbside without requiring any separation.\n\n#### **Custom Sizes\n#### **\n\nThanks to our in-house custom manufacturing capabilities, we can delivery paper insulated delivery\nbags in any custom size to match your exact requirements.\n\n#### **Collapsible Design\n#### **\n\nCelluLiner insulated bags can be efficiently flat-packed before and after use, resulting in\nsubstantial savings in warehousing and shipping costs when compared to other types of insulated\nbags.\n\n#### **Custom sizes and minimum order quantities**\n\nAs with most IPC packaging solutions, we can manufacture paper insulated delivery bags in any custom\nsize, and at no additional cost. This allows you to source packaging at a size that perfectly fits\nyour specific product requirements, resulting in optimal conditions for temperature control, and\ngiving you confidence that your products will reach their destination within the desired temperature\nrange. Additionally, we can test your custom payload in our in-house environmental testing chamber,\nfurther ensuring the packaging solution will provide sufficient thermal protection.\n\nOur CelluLiner Delivery Bags are subject to minimum order quantities. Get in touch or learn more\nabout our [minimum order quantities][99] here.\n\n[Paper Insulation diagram]\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n#### CelluLiner maintaining below 41\u00b0F for 21 hours\n\n[ [CelluLiner Bag 24 Hour Performance Chart] ][100]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nDetails: \u2502Raw Chicken (1.45 lb)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBag size \u250212\u2033 x 7\u2033 x 17\u2033\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBag weight \u25024.7 oz\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nProduct used \u2502Paper square-bottom bag\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPre-shipment temp:\u250236 \u00b0F\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRefrigerant Used: \u2502N/A\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTemp. profile \u250290 \u00b0F\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTest duration \u250224 hr\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Other Paper Insulated Packaging\n\n[Paper Insulated Delivery Bag]\n\n#### Insulated Delivery Bag\n\n[Paper Insulated Pouch]\n\n#### Insulated Pouch\n\n[CelluLiner Square Bottom Insulated Bag]\n\n#### Insulated Box Liner\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][101]\n\n### Want to know more about our paper square-bottom bags?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE][102]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][103]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][104]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][105]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][106]\n* [Insulated Pouches][107]\n* [Gel Packs][108]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][109]\n* [New Innovations][110]\n* [Company][111]\n* [Performance Testing][112]\n* [Resources][113]\n* [Request a Quote][114]\n* [Jobs][115]\n* [Accessibility][116]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][117]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][118]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][119]\n* [facebook][120]\n* [linkedin][121]\n* [youtube][122]\n\n[Close Menu ][123]\n\n* [Products][124]\n* [Products][125]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][126]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][127]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][128]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][129]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][130]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][131]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][132]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][133]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][134]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][135]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][136]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][137]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][138]\n* [Delivery][139]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][140]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][141]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][142]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][143]\n* [Large Cargo][144]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][145]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][146]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][147]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][148]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][149]\n* [Gel Packs][150]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][151]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][152]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][153]\n* [Foam Bricks][154]\n* [Industries][155]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][156]\n* [Food][157]\n* [Meat][158]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][159]\n* [Vaccines][160]\n* [Direct to Consumer][161]\n* [Company][162]\n* [Company][163]\n* [Our Materials][164]\n* [Performance Testing][165]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][166]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][167]\n* [FAQ][168]\n* [Resources][169]\n* [Knowledge Base][170]\n* [FAQ][171]\n* [General FAQ][172]\n* [Shipping Regulations][173]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][174]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][175]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][176]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][177]\n* [Industry Applications][178]\n* [How to Ship Meat][179]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][180]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][181]\n* [Product FAQ][182]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][183]\n* [Case Studies][184]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][185]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][186]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][187]\n* [Food Case Studies][188]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][189]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][190]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][191]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][192]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][193]\n* [White Papers][194]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][195]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][196]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][197]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][198]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][199]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][200]\n* [Food White Papers][201]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][202]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][203]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][204]\n* [Beverage White Papers][205]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][206]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][207]\n* [Industrial White Papers][208]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][209]\n* [Insights][210]\n* [Jobs][211]\n* [Contact][212]\n* [Request Quote][213]\n* [Shipping Guides][214]\n\n[1]: #ajax-content-wrap\n[2]: https://ipcpack.com\n[3]: #sidewidgetarea\n[4]: https://ipcpack.com/products/\n[5]: https://ipcpack.com/products/\n[6]: #\n[7]: ht"
