            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# FabriCool Air Cargo Covers\n\n### The perfect insulated shipping solution for airplane cargo.\n\n[air cargo insulation covers]\n\nInsulated cargo covers built to protect pharmaceuticals, biomaterials and other\ntemperature-sensitive products during air transit.\n\n[Air Cargo Covers]\n\nFabricool is an advanced insulated packaging material, available exclusively at IPC, specially\ndesigned to protect air cargo shipments against extreme ambient conditions. Made using a recyclable\n#7* combination of a tough metalized outer layer and an internal fabric layer, FabriCool provides\neffective temperature control, while also allowing the contents to breathe to avoid build-up of\ncondensation.\n\nFabriCool Air Cargo Covers provide the perfect solution for any airlines, perishables distributors\nor 3PLs seeking a reliable method to protect their products during air transit.\n\n**May not be recyclable in your area*\n\n#### Custom sizes\n\nAll of our air cargo packaging materials can be manufactured in any custom size, allowing you to\nfind a packaging solution that perfectly fits your requirements. Get in touch to discuss your\nspecific needs.\n\n[Request a Quote][96] [View FabriCool Brochure][97]\n\nDemonstration Video\n\n## Quick and Easy Application\n\nFabriCool air cargo covers can be applied to your cargo in a matter of seconds. Simply place the\ncover over your cargo, and pull down the cover over the corners of your cargo.\n\n## FabriCool Features\n* #### Proven protection\n\nProven to protect against extreme ambient temperatures during loading and in transit\n* #### Breathable fabric material\n\nLined with a breathable fabric material that provides cushioning and minimizes build-up of\ncondensation\n* #### Robust metalized outer layer\n\nBuilt with a robust metalized outer layer to protect against tears and inclement weather\nconditions.\n* #### Protection for extended durations\n\nFabriCool air freight packaging covers provide an effective temperature barrier for **more than\nsix days** and guarantee protection against freezing.\n* #### User-friendly design\n\nUser-friendly design allows packaging to be applied to shipments in seconds, and fit perfectly\nevery time.\n* #### Highly compact design\n\nHighly compact design allows for efficient storage and shipment\n\n## Performance Testing\n\nThe efficacy of the FabriCool air cargo covers was tested by comparing the temperatures inside\npallets containing boxes of salt tablets with and without a FabriCool cover when subjected to\nextreme temperatures. As can be seen in the below graph, the FabriCool cargo covers significantly\nminimized internal temperature fluctuations when exposed to extreme, fluctuating ambient\ntemperatures.\n\n[FabriCool Air Cargo Covers Performance Testing]\n\n#### Related Products\n\n[ [Insulated Cargo Covers] ][98]\n\n##### CooLiner Insulated Cargo Blankets\n\nSturdy, tear-proof insulated cargo blankets that provide high-performance temperature control\nthroughout the entire transit duration.\n\n##### CooLiner Roll Stock\n\nCooLiner Roll Stock is IPC\u2019s premier insulation line for protection of varying size of containers,\npallets and other packages against damage and extreme temperatures.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nDownload Brochure\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n[View plain text version of our spec sheet here.][99]\n\n### Want to know more about our FabriCool Air Cargo Covers?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][100]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][101]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][102]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][103]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][104]\n* [Insulated Pouches][105]\n* [Gel Packs][106]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][107]\n* [New Innovations][108]\n* [Company][109]\n* [Performance Testing][110]\n* [Resources][111]\n* [Request a Quote][112]\n* [Jobs][113]\n* [Accessibility][114]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][115]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][116]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][117]\n* [facebook][118]\n* [linkedin][119]\n* [youtube][120]\n\n[Close Menu ][121]\n\n* [Products][122]\n* [Products][123]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][124]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][125]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][126]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][127]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][128]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][129]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][130]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][131]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][132]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][133]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][134]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][135]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][136]\n* [Delivery][137]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][138]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][139]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][140]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][141]\n* [Large Cargo][142]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][143]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][144]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][145]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][146]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][147]\n* [Gel Packs][148]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][149]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][150]\