            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Insulated Products Corporation] ][2]\n[ Menu ][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][6]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][7]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][8]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][9]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][10]\n* [CelluLiner Paper Box Liner: 48 hrs+][11]\n* [PopupLiner 2-Piece: 48 hrs+][12]\n* [Pouch/Mailer Insulation][13]\n* [Paper Pouch: 48 hrs+][14]\n* [PopupLiner Pouch: 48 hrs+][15]\n* [CooLiner Pouch: 24 hrs][16]\n* [AerVault Mailers: 48 hrs][17]\n* [CryoVault Pouch: 48 hrs][18]\n* [Delivery][19]\n* [Paper Insulated Delivery Bag][20]\n* [Paper Grocery Delivery Bag][21]\n* [Bubble Insulated Delivery Bag][22]\n* [Paper Insulated Roll][23]\n* [Large Cargo][24]\n* [Foil Insulation Roll][25]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][26]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][27]\n* [Air Cargo Insulation][28]\n* [Cold Gel Packs][29]\n* [Gel Packs][30]\n* [Sweat-Proof Gel Packs][31]\n* [Drain-Friendly Gel Packs][32]\n* [Super-Absorbent Polymer for Gel Packs][33]\n* [Foam Bricks][34]\n* [Industries][35]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][36]\n* [Food][37]\n* [Meat][38]\n* [Pharmaceuticals][39]\n* [Vaccines][40]\n* [Direct to Consumer][41]\n* [Company][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [Our Materials][44]\n* [Performance Testing][45]\n* [Ordering and Distribution][46]\n* [Sustainably Engineered][47]\n* [FAQ][48]\n* [Resources][49]\n* [Knowledge Base][50]\n* [FAQ][51]\n* [General FAQ][52]\n* [Shipping Regulations][53]\n* [How To Ship Refrigerated Products][54]\n* [How to Ship Frozen Products][55]\n* [Shipping Perishables: Tips and Guidance][56]\n* [Shipping With Cold Packs vs. Dry Ice][57]\n* [Industry Applications][58]\n* [How to Ship Meat][59]\n* [How to Ship Chocolate][60]\n* [How to Ship Ice Cream][61]\n* [Product FAQ][62]\n* [Custom Sized Insulated Packaging][63]\n* [Case Studies][64]\n* [Pharmaceuticals Case Studies][65]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Pharmaceuticals | IPC][66]\n* [Maintaining CRT for Shipping Medicines & Pharmaceuticals | IPC][67]\n* [Food Case Studies][68]\n* [Expanding Reach for Mail-Order Beef with Insulated Shipping | IPC][69]\n* [Shipping Multiple Product Types Inside Single Container | IPC][70]\n* [How to Keep Ice Cream from Melting \u2013 Eco Insulated Pouch | IPC][71]\n* [Distributor Case Studies][72]\n* [Eliminating the Need for Refrigerated Trucking | IPC][73]\n* [White Papers][74]\n* [Pharmaceutical White Papers][75]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][76]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][77]\n* [2-8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection During Shipping | IPC][78]\n* [Shipment of Refrigerated Medical Vials Using PCM and PopupLiner Box Liner \u2013 Insulated\nProducts Corporation][79]\n* [Temperature-Controlled Packaging for Reusable Containers Using IPC\u2019s PopupLiner Thermal Box\nLiner \u2013 Insulated Products Corporation][80]\n* [Food White Papers][81]\n* [Insulation Solutions for Frozen Food Shipping | IPC][82]\n* [Enhanced Efficacy of Removable Thermal Box Liners | IPC][83]\n* [Overcoming the Problems of Shipping with EPS Coolers | IPC][84]\n* [Beverage White Papers][85]\n* [48-hour Thermal Protection for Shipping Wine | IPC][86]\n* [Shipping Frozen Human Milk Using Insulated Containers | IPC][87]\n* [Industrial White Papers][88]\n* [Freeze Protection when Shipping Water-based Paint & Grout | IPC][89]\n* [Insights][90]\n* [Jobs][91]\n* [Contact][92]\n* [Request Quote][93]\n* [Shipping Guides][94]\n[Close Search ][95]\n\n# 2-8\u00b0C Pre-Qualified Insulated Shipper\n\n### The perfect solution for biopharmaceutical samples that need to be kept within the 2-8 \u00baC\n### temperature range.\n\nCompact 2-8\u00baC pre-qualified insulated shipper that uses our patented technology to provide highly\neffective temperature control.\n\n[ [PopupLiner panels are similar to RNC industries rockwool insulation panels] ][96]\n\n##### Our Pre-Qualified Insulated Shippers are lightweight and provide effective thermal protection\n##### for refrigerated biopharmaceutical samples that need to be kept within the 2-8 \u00baC temperature\n##### range.\n\nOur pre-qualified shippers are built with our proprietary PopupLiner insulation (as used in our\n[insulated box liners][97]).\n\n#### **Custom size availablility**\n\nWe specialize at manufacturing custom sizes to fit your exact requirements at no extra costs. Get in\ntouch to discuss your requirements.\n\n[Request a Quote][98] [View Brochure][99]\n\nAll the necessary components will be provided in your insulated shipper kit upon delivery; that\nincludes phase change materials, PopupLiner insulated panels, payload cartons, and conditioning and\npack-out instructions. PopupLiner insulated box liners are made from flexible polyurethane foam\ninsulators that are encased in metalized sleeves. The liners are shipped vacuum-compressed, using\nIPC\u2019s patented technology, leading to a 75% saving in space and storage.\n\n### [Read more about our in-house testing.][100]\n\n**In-house testing.** Our thermal packaging engineers pre-qualify all our insulated shipping boxes\nwith the certainty that the payload temperature will remain within the 2-8 \u00b0C range throughout the\nspecified duration. Before assurance of our pre-qualified shipper for any specific application, we\noffer testing in our in-house environmental chamber to assess the shipper\u2019s integrity.\n\nIf any of the proposed solutions listed in the table does not meet your needs, contact us to\ndetermine and design the best solution for your 2-8 \u00b0C application. We pride ourselves in providing\ncustom solutions to any customer\u2019s cold chain needs.\n\n[Learn more about our in-house performance testing.][101]\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Shipper] ][102]\n\n## Features\n* ##### Effective 2 \u2013 8 \u00b0C Temperature Protection\n\nThe highly compact insulated container effectively keeps the payload temperature between 2 and\n8\u00baC.\n* ##### Space-Efficient Design\n\nInsulated liners arrive compressed, using our patented technology, and inflate to full thickness\nupon opening. This design feature helps you to make large savings on freight costs.\n* ##### Easy to Assemble\n\nThe insulated shipping container can be assembled in seconds. Just follow the simple packing\nsteps.\n* ##### Custom sizes availability\n\nAvailable in bespoke sizes to suit your specific needs.\n* ##### Seasonal and universal pack-outs\n\n[Insulated Shipping Conainers]\n\n## Performance Testing\n\n##### Temperature profiles of payload (air) and oven under ISTA 7D summer profile for 481L model\n\n[ [Insulated Shipping Boxes] ][103]\n\n##### Temperature profiles of payload (air) and oven under ISTA 7D winter profile for 481L model\n\n### Research on the Pre-Qualified Insulated Shipper\n\n[Pre-Qualified Universal Shipper for 2-8 \u00baC Temperature Protection][104] [White Paper]\n\n#### Related Products\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Shipper] ][105]\n\n##### Insulated Pallet Shipper\n\nIPC\u2019s PopupLiner insulated pallet shippers are your answer to shipping bulk quantities of products\nat highly controlled refrigerated or frozen temperatures, while providing an extreme temperature\nbarrier via its thick insulated panels.\n\n[ [Insulated Pallet Covers] ][106]\n\n##### Insulated Pallet Cover\n\nOur innovative pallet covers are constructed with proprietary foil bubble material to provide\nprotection against temperature extremes. We assist our clients in keeping bulk shipments at\nconsistent temperatures.\n\n**All our products are developed and manufactured from our factory in the USA.**\n\nRequest a Quote\nRequest A Custom Sample\n\n### Want to know more about our Pre-Qualified Insulated Shippers?\n\nCall us, we are here to help:\n\n# 310 638 0900\n\n[Request a Quote][107]\n[Insulated Products Corp]\n\nIPC provides advanced temperature-sensitive packaging solutions for shipping, crafted using many\nyears of industry experience.\n\nCustom-sized manufacturing and proprietary technology are what make IPC different.\n\n[PMMI]\n\n#### Popular Products\n* [Insulated Box Liners][108]\n* [Insulated Delivery Bags][109]\n* [Insulated Cargo Blankets][110]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][111]\n* [Insulated Pouches][112]\n* [Gel Packs][113]\n\n#### USEFUL LINKS\n* [Products][114]\n* [New Innovations][115]\n* [Company][116]\n* [Performance Testing][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Request a Quote][119]\n* [Jobs][120]\n* [Accessibility][121]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n250 W. Artesia Blvd\nRancho Dominguez CA 90220\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[310-638-0900][122]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[[email protected]][123]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u00a9 2026 Insulated Products Corporation\n* [twitter][124]\n* [facebook][125]\n* [linkedin][126]\n* [youtube][127]\n\n[Close Menu ][128]\n\n* [Products][129]\n* [Products][130]\n* [One-Piece Box Liners][131]\n* [SustainaLiner: 24 hrs ][132]\n* [CooLiner Box Liner: 24 hrs][133]\n* [BROWSE PRODUCTS BY FEATURE][134]\n* [Multi-Piece Box Liners][135]\n* 