      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Newgoicepack is a brand dedicated to enhancing recovery and comfort through a diverse range of effective hot and cold therapy products. Their offerings, which include reusable gel packs and wraps designed for various body parts, cater to individuals seeking relief from injuries, athletes, and medical patients. With a strong emphasis on quality, safety, and sustainability, Newgoicepack aims to provide simple therapy solutions that promote better recovery and everyday confidence.",
