        "crawl_text": "Durable and effective product design Non-toxic materials Sustainable practices NEWGO Website | Ice Pack for Shoulder, Knee &amp; Ankle\n\nSkip to content\n\nMenu\n\nMenu\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nProducts\n\nChoose Us\n\nReviews\n\nFAQ\n\nContact\n\nShop Now\n\nNEWGO Ice Pack \u2014 Hot and Cold Therapeutic Packs for Shoulder, Knee and Ankle\n\nReusable gel packs for recovery, swelling and restful sleep \u2014 shop now for smarter relief.\n\nVIEW CATALOG\n\nAbout Us\n\nNEWGO started as a small team of healthcare product designers and physical therapists focused on making durable, effective cold and heat therapy accessible to everyday people. Over the last decade we&#8217;ve grown into a trusted brand that blends clinical insight with practical design. Our products \u2014 from the NEWGO ice pack and NEWGO shoulder ice pack to targeted solutions like the NEWGO knee ice pack, ankle wraps and a cooling NEWGO eye mask \u2014 are engineered for consistent performance and comfortable wear. We source non-toxic gel formulas and flexible, puncture-resistant laminates, then test longevity and thermal retention in real-world use. Product quality is verified through manufacturing audits and routine lab checks to meet high safety and durability expectations. We prioritize materials that reduce waste and extend product life, and our packaging is designed to be compact and largely recyclable. NEWGO\u2019s customer-first approach means clear product labeling, clinically informed usage guides, and product variants tailored to recovery, sports, post-surgery care, and everyday comfort. We combine practical expertise with transparent manufacturing practices so customers can trust the performance they bring into recovery routines. Our experience, reliability and product stewardship reflect a long-term commitment to safe, effective therapy and responsible production.\n\nVIEW CATALOG\n\nBest products\n\nTop-rated reusable gel packs and wraps for eyes, shoulders, knees, ankles and more. Each product is tested for thermal retention, comfort and durability so customers can trust consistent relief at home and on the go.\n\nCooling Eye Mask for Puffy Eyes, Cold Eye Mask Eye Ice Pack for After Eyes Surgery, Tension Stress Relief, Itchy Eyes, Headaches, Dark Circles &#8211; Blue (Blue-2Pack)\n\nThis cooling eye mask soothes puffiness and reduces discomfort after surgery or long screen sessions. The soft fabric and even-weight gel provide gentle compression and temperature control for headaches and itchy eyes. Ideal as a reusable eye mask for daily relief and post-procedure care.\n\nCheck Price\n\nShoulder Ice Pack Wrap for Rotator Cuff Cold Therapy, FSA Eligible Gel Ice Pack for Injuries Reusable Cold Pack for Shoulder Swelling Discomfort after Surgery, Medium\n\nA contoured shoulder wrap that targets rotator cuff pain and post-surgery swelling with even cold coverage. Adjustable straps and a reusable gel insert make it easy to secure and comfortable for longer wear. A dependable shoulder ice pack for recovery and activity-related soreness.\n\nCheck Price\n\nIce Pack Face Ice Mask for Puffy Eyes, Cooling Face Mask Reusable with Thick Gel Pad in Forehead &amp; Eye Zones for Migraines, Post-Surgery, Redness, Allergy Swelling Pain Relief\n\nThis face ice mask combines forehead and eye-zone cooling in one comfortable design to ease migraines, redness and swelling after procedures. Thick gel pads deliver targeted cooling with a soft backing for skin comfort. Use chilled or warmed for versatile facial therapy.\n\nCheck Price\n\nWine Cooler Sleeve Reusable Wine Bottle Cooler Flexible Wine Ice Pack Sleeve Keep Wine Cool and Refreshing for Standard Size Bottles for Red Wine, White Wine &amp; Champagne &#8211; Black\n\nA flexible wine cooler sleeve that contours to bottles for faster, more even chilling. Reusable gel construction stays cold longer and slips on easily to fit standard bottles of red, white or champagne. Great for picnics, parties and outdoor dining.\n\nCheck Price\n\nHorse Ice Pack Reusable Horse Leg Wrap for Injury, Cooling Horse Knee Wrap Full Coverage Leg Ice Boot Cold Pack 2 Wrap with 4 Gel Packs for Knee, Legs, Boots, and Hooves\n\nDesigned for equine care, this horse leg wrap combines thin gel packs with adjustable straps to cool legs comfortably after exercise. Packs slide into pockets for a secure fit and even contact. Durable materials and soft lining protect sensitive areas while speeding recovery.\n\nCheck Price\n\nBreast Ice Pack 2 Pack Gel Ice Pack for Breast Surgery, Reusable Nursing Ice Pack Hot or Cold Therapy Breast Pad for Breastfeeding, Engorgement Relief (Purple)\n\nThis two-pack of breast ice pads is sized for post-surgical comfort and breastfeeding relief, offering gentle, even cooling and reusable hot/cold therapy. Soft-backed pads fit discreetly in a bra or compression garment for convenient wear and recovery support.\n\nCheck Price\n\nShoulder Ice Pack Rotator Cuff Cold Therapy Reusable Cold Pack Shoulder Ice Wrap for Pain Relief, Recovery After Surgery, Swelling &#8211; Extra Large Size (Dark Blue)\n\nAn extra-large shoulder wrap offering broader coverage for significant swelling or post-op recovery. The reusable gel insert and wide attachment straps help distribute cooling evenly across the shoulder and upper arm. Built for comfort during extended wear.\n\nCheck Price\n\nSmall Ice Packs for Injuries, 14 Pack Round Ice Packs for Face, Hot and Cold Gel Ice Pack Circular Cold Compress with Cloth Backing &amp; Sleeve for Pain Relief, Toothaches, Breast Surgery\n\nA convenient set of small round gel packs for targeted relief of facial swelling, toothaches or localized post-surgery spots. Cloth-backed design sits comfortably on skin and fits into sleeves or dressings for flexible use. Handy for travel and first-aid kits.\n\nCheck Price\n\nCooling Gel Eye Mask 3D Soft Cold Eye Mask, Eye Ice Pack with Zero Eye Pressure Hot Cold Therapy Blackout Sleep Mask for Puffiness, Dark Circles, Dry Eyes, Headaches and Stress Relief\n\nThis 3D cooling gel eye mask is shaped to avoid pressure on the eyelids while providing blackout comfort for rest and therapy. Use chilled for puffiness and headaches or warmed for soothing dry-eye relief. Soft materials and balanced weight support relaxation.\n\nCheck Price\n\nOur Mission\n\nNEWGO\u2019s mission is to deliver reliable, evidence-informed hot and cold therapy that helps people recover faster, reduce pain, and regain comfort in daily life. We believe therapeutic products should be simple to use, thoughtfully designed, and built to last. By integrating clinical feedback into every development cycle, NEWGO ice pack solutions \u2014 including our shoulder cold wraps, knee and ankle options, and eye mask designs \u2014 are made to meet real recovery needs. We emphasize clear instructions, safe materials, and robust manufacturing processes so customers feel confident using cold and warm therapy at home, in clinics, or on the go. Sustainability is part of our vision: longer-lasting products, recyclable packaging, and sourcing practices that reduce environmental impact. We invest in education, supporting guides, and responsive support so each purchase becomes a trusted tool in long-term wellness. Our aim is to be recognized for consistent quality, transparent practices, and products that prioritize user safety and satisfaction \u2014 creating healthier routines for families, athletes, and medical recovery patients.\n\nVIEW CATALOG\n\nOur Motto\n\nSimple therapy, better recovery, everyday confidence.\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nQuality is our baseline. We design and test each gel pack and fabric wrap for puncture resistance, thermal retention, and long-term durability so you get dependable performance day after day. Try one risk-free and feel the difference.\n\nVariety that fits real life \u2014 from targeted eye masks and shoulder wraps to knee, ankle and nursing pads. Our range covers post-surgery recovery, sport care and everyday aches. Find the size and style that works for you.\n\nWe stand behind every product with helpful guides and friendly customer support. If you need usage tips or warranty help, our team responds quickly to ensure a smooth after-sale experience. Reac newgoicepack.com NEWGO Website | Ice Pack for Shoulder, Knee &amp; Ankle\n\nSkip to content\n\nMenu\n\nMenu\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nProducts\n\nChoose Us\n\nReviews\n\nFAQ\n\nContact\n\nShop Now\n\nNEWGO Ice Pack \u2014 Hot and Cold Therapeutic Packs for Shoulder, Knee and Ankle\n\nReusable gel packs for recovery, swelling and restful sleep \u2014 shop now for smarter relief.\n\nVIEW CATALOG\n\nAbout Us\n\nNEWGO started as a small team of healthcare product designers and physical therapists focused on making durable, effective cold and heat therapy accessible to everyday people. Over the last decade we&#8217;ve grown into a trusted brand that blends clinical insight with practical design. Our products \u2014 from the NEWGO ice pack and NEWGO shoulder ice pack to targeted solutions like the NEWGO knee ice pack, ankle wraps and a cooling NEWGO eye mask \u2014 are engineered for consistent performance and comfortable wear. We source non-toxic gel formulas and flexible, puncture-resistant laminates, then test longevity and thermal retention in real-world use. Product quality is verified through manufacturing audits and routine lab checks to meet high safety and durability expectations. We prioritize materials that reduce waste and extend product life, and our packaging is designed to be compact and largely recyclable. NEWGO\u2019s customer-first approach means clear product labeling, clinically informed usage guides, and product variants tailored to recovery, sports, post-surgery care, and everyday comfort. We combine practical expertise with transparent manufacturing practices so customers can trust the performance they bring into recovery routines. Our experience, reliability and product stewardship reflect a long