r faster, more even chilling. Reusable gel construction stays cold longer and slips on easily to fit standard bottles of red, white or champagne. Great for picnics, parties and outdoor dining.\n\nCheck Price\n\nHorse Ice Pack Reusable Horse Leg Wrap for Injury, Cooling Ho"
