      "polished_summary": "Nidhi DG Packaging, established in 2014 and based in Mumbai, Maharashtra, specializes in providing high-quality packaging solutions for hazardous materials and chemicals. The company offers a comprehensive range of services, including dangerous goods packaging, freight forwarding, and chemical packaging, catering to industries that require safe and compliant handling of hazardous materials. With a commitment to quality and safety, Nidhi DG Packaging serves a diverse clientele, ensuring reliable logistics and packaging services tailored to their specific needs.",
