        "crawl_text": "Nortech Laboratories, Inc. Compliant with industry standards Innovative product development Environmentally friendly manufacturing Strong industry reputation Customizable solutions Environmentally friendly products ANSI Z308 FDA compliant Manufactured in compliance with US regulations 125 Sherwood Ave, Farmingdale, NY 11735 USA Cold Shipping, Reusable Hot Cold Gel Packs, Instant Ice Packs | Nortech Labs Inc\n\n1-888-COLDPAK\n\nsales@nortechlabs.com\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\nHelp Center\n\nBUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>\n\nHome\n\nCold Shipping\n\nGel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes\n\nStructured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs\n\nTag T1 Temperature Data Logger\n\n3/16&#8243; Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers\n\nTherapy &#038; First Aid\n\nThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack\n\nInstaKool Instant Cold Pack\n\nCool Instant Cold Pack\n\nGel Blox Cold Shipping Packs\n\nDental Pack Cold Pack\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes\n\nBlue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers\n\nFreedom Wrap Reusable Covers\n\nFoil Bubble Mailers\n\nCool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls\n\nCool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners\n\nComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy\n\nTecniclene Cleaning Solution\n\nExam Disposables\n\nThermal Hot or Cold Pack\n\nLab Plastics &#038; Scientific Equipment\n\nAbout Us\n\nForms &#038; Data\n\nContact\n\nSelect Page\n\nCold Shipping Supplies\nNortech Labs carries a full line of Cold Shipping Products ideal for the shipping of Pharmaceuticals, Vaccines, Medicines, Meats &amp; all types of perishables.\n\nMore Info\n\nInstaKool Instant Cold Pack\nThe World&#8217;s Coldest Ammonium Nitrate Free Instant Cold Pack! Delivers immediate cold therapy with instant activation.\n\nMore Info\n\nThermaKool Hot Cold Pack\nThermaKool provides comfortable pain relief when hot or cold therapy is required. Doctor Recommended, Hospital Proven &amp; Latex Free.\n\nMore Info\n\nAbout Us\n\nNortech Labs strives to provide&nbsp; green, environmentally friendly &nbsp;and innovative quality products to the Medical, First Aid, Therapy, Healthcare, &amp; Cold Chain Shipping Industry.\n\nAs the original developer of the Therma-Kool&nbsp;Hot&nbsp;Cold Gel Therapy Pack we are continuously striving to supply the marketplace with safe, cutting edge products.\n\nOrder Nortech Labs Products Online!\n\nFor Retail Customers &#8211; To order the full line of Nortech Labs products, visit our brand new E-commerce site at www.nortechlabsonline.com and Save 10% + FREE SHIPPING on orders of $100 or more by using Coupon Code NTL344\nClick Here\n\nNortech Labs Featured Products\n\nNortech Labs, Inc. is a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing &amp; cold shipping. All of our products are proudly manufactured in the USA.\n\nFoil Insulated Bubble Box Liners\n\nCOOL BLUE\u2122 Foil Insulated Box Liners feature 1/4&#8243; thick foil laminated, metalized bubble cushions for protection and insulation during cold shipping.\n\nThermaKool Hot Cold Gel Pack\n\nTherma-Kool\u00ae&nbsp;is a reusable gel pack designed to provide comfortable pain relief when cold or hot therapy is required. Non-toxic &amp; Latex Free.\n\nInstaKool Instant Cold Pack\n\nInstaKool\u2122 Instant Cold Pack &nbsp;delivers immediate cold therapy for first aid, providing comfort and reducing swelling after an injury.\n\nKodiak Pack Envelopes\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes cold chain system ensures that your valuable temperature sensitive payloads arrive in optimum condition.\n\nGel Blox Cold Shipping Packs\n\nGel Blox\u2122 Cooler &amp; Shipping Pack &nbsp;is a non toxic water-based gel refrigerant shipping pack specifically designed and engineered for COLD transport.\n\nFoil Insulated Bubble Mailers\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers are bubble laminated for durability &amp; protective cushioning and feature heavy duty self-adhesive tape.\n\nA Leader in the Industry\nAs a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing, Nortech Labs is constantly striving to develop new and innovative ways of incorporating our gel into different products.\n\nMore About Us\n\nReach Us\n\nNortech Labs Inc customer service hours of operation are Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM &#8211; 5:00 PM EST (4:00 PM Friday).\n\n&#xe081;\n\nAddress\n\n125 Sherwood Ave\n\nFarmingdale, NY 11735\n\n&#xe00b;\n\nPhone\n\n1-888-COLDPAK\n\n(631) 501-1452\n\n&#xe076;\n\nEmail\n\nsales@nortechlabs.com\n\nContact Form\n\nNortech Labs Inc\n\nCustomer Service\n\nForms &amp; Data\n\nHelp Center\n\nPayment Options\n\nArticles &amp; Press Releases\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nStore Policies\n\nShipping Policy\n\nReturn Policy\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms &amp; Conditions\n\nCompany Info\n\nNortech History\n\nContact Us\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nPrivate Labeling\n\nOrder Online\n\nLocate a Distributor\n\nAbout Us\n\nNORTECH LABS INC\n\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.\n\nHome\n\nForms &#038; Data (SDS)\n\nCold Shipping Products\n\nTherapy and First Aid Products\n\nSite Map\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\nClick Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:\n\nBuy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n\nLimited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: NTL344\n\nClick Here to Order Online!\n\nBuy Nortech Products Online Here 1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n\n# Therapy & First Aid Products\n\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Packs]][45]\n[**ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Packs**][46]\n\nReusable Gel Pack designed to provide comfortable pain relief when cold or hot therapy is required.\nThermaKool\u00ae remains flexible when frozen and is safe for microwavable use.\n\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Packs]][47]\n[**InstaKool Instant Cold Packs**][48]\n\nInstaKool\u2122 Instant Cold Packs deliver immediate cold therapy for first aid. InstaKool\u2122 is Ammonium\nNitrate-Free and rivals the temperature ranges of previous cold packs.\n\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][49]\n[**COOL Instant Cold Packs**][50]\n\nCOOL Instant Cold Packs deliver immediate cold therapy for first aid. COOL Instant Cold Packs\nfeature instant activation and is a safer, cost effective first aid.\n\n[[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]][51]\n[**Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers**][52]\n\nFreedom Wrap\u00ae Reusable Covers provide hands free comfort during hot or cold gel therapy. Elastic\ntouch fastener secures Freedom Wrap\u00ae to any part of the body.\n\n[[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]][53]\n[**Blue Easy Sleeves**][54]\n\nBlue Easy Sleeves\u2122 are disposable yet durable non-woven covers manufactured for gel therapy. Blue\nEasy Sleeves\u2122 act as a protective barrier between the skin and gel therapy pack.\n\n[[Dental Pack Reusable Cold Pack]][55]\n[**Dental Pack Reusable Cold Pack**][56]\n\nDental Pack\u2122 Cold Pack is dentist recommended and provides hospital proven relief. Dental Pack\u2122\nreduces swelling and discomfort from extractions, root canals, and more.\n\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][57]\n[**Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs**][58]\n\nGEL BLOX Cold Shipping Pack is a water-based gel refrigerant pack that is specifically designed and\nengineered for COLD transport and shipping heat sensitive products.\n\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][59]\n[**Cool Blue Insulated Foil Box Liners**][60]\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners by Nortech Labs feature heat reflecting technology that\nacts as a shield against the three types of heat transfer: conduction, convection and radiant.\n\n[[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Mailers]][61]\n[**Cool Blue Foil Bubble Mailers**][62]\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers cost less than traditional foam and are ideal for cold shipping.\nReflects 97% of radiant heat and bubble laminated for durability and protective cushioning.\n\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Bubble Rolls]][63]\n[**Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls**][64]\n\nCool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls are available in multiple sizes and can be cut down to fill different\napplications. Great for lining 48\u2032 or 53\u2032 trailer gaylords, pallets and more!\n\n[[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]][65]\n[**Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes**][66]\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes are a cost effective cold chain system that ensures that\nyour valuable temperature sensitive payloads arrive in optimum condition.\n\n[[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]][67]\n\n[**Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution**][68]\n\nTecniclene\u2122 combines a powerful detergent, scrubbing agent, blood solvent, deodorizer and wetting\nagent to achieve a new standard of cleaning power.\n\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]][69]\n[**ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy**][70]\n\nComfaGel\u2122 pressure reducing gel therapy prodcust are ideal for stress and pressure management,\nreducing pressure and providing an extremely stable and comfortable seating surface.\n\n# More Nortech Products\n\n## [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][71]\n## [[Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][72]\n## [[Instant Cold Packs]Instant Cold Packs][73]\n\n[Nortech Labs Inc][74] > [Therapy and First Aid Products][75]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][76]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][77]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][78]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][79]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][80]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][81]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][82]\n* [Help Center][83]\n* [Payment Options][84]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][85]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][86]\n* [Request A Quote][87]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Pol