            "text": "Cold Shipping, Reusable Hot Cold Gel Packs, Instant Ice Packs | Nortech Labs Inc\n\n1-888-COLDPAK\n\nsales@nortechlabs.com\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\nHelp Center\n\nBUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>\n\nHome\n\nCold Shipping\n\nGel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes\n\nStructured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs\n\nTag T1 Temperature Data Logger\n\n3/16&#8243; Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers\n\nTherapy &#038; First Aid\n\nThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack\n\nInstaKool Instant Cold Pack\n\nCool Instant Cold Pack\n\nGel Blox Cold Shipping Packs\n\nDental Pack Cold Pack\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes\n\nBlue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers\n\nFreedom Wrap Reusable Covers\n\nFoil Bubble Mailers\n\nCool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls\n\nCool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners\n\nComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy\n\nTecniclene Cleaning Solution\n\nExam Disposables\n\nThermal Hot or Cold Pack\n\nLab Plastics &#038; Scientific Equipment\n\nAbout Us\n\nForms &#038; Data\n\nContact\n\nSelect Page\n\nCold Shipping Supplies\nNortech Labs carries a full line of Cold Shipping Products ideal for the shipping of Pharmaceuticals, Vaccines, Medicines, Meats &amp; all types of perishables.\n\nMore Info\n\nInstaKool Instant Cold Pack\nThe World&#8217;s Coldest Ammonium Nitrate Free Instant Cold Pack! Delivers immediate cold therapy with instant activation.\n\nMore Info\n\nThermaKool Hot Cold Pack\nThermaKool provides comfortable pain relief when hot or cold therapy is required. Doctor Recommended, Hospital Proven &amp; Latex Free.\n\nMore Info\n\nAbout Us\n\nNortech Labs strives to provide&nbsp; green, environmentally friendly &nbsp;and innovative quality products to the Medical, First Aid, Therapy, Healthcare, &amp; Cold Chain Shipping Industry.\n\nAs the original developer of the Therma-Kool&nbsp;Hot&nbsp;Cold Gel Therapy Pack we are continuously striving to supply the marketplace with safe, cutting edge products.\n\nOrder Nortech Labs Products Online!\n\nFor Retail Customers &#8211; To order the full line of Nortech Labs products, visit our brand new E-commerce site at www.nortechlabsonline.com and Save 10% + FREE SHIPPING on orders of $100 or more by using Coupon Code NTL344\nClick Here\n\nNortech Labs Featured Products\n\nNortech Labs, Inc. is a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing &amp; cold shipping. All of our products are proudly manufactured in the USA.\n\nFoil Insulated Bubble Box Liners\n\nCOOL BLUE\u2122 Foil Insulated Box Liners feature 1/4&#8243; thick foil laminated, metalized bubble cushions for protection and insulation during cold shipping.\n\nThermaKool Hot Cold Gel Pack\n\nTherma-Kool\u00ae&nbsp;is a reusable gel pack designed to provide comfortable pain relief when cold or hot therapy is required. Non-toxic &amp; Latex Free.\n\nInstaKool Instant Cold Pack\n\nInstaKool\u2122 Instant Cold Pack &nbsp;delivers immediate cold therapy for first aid, providing comfort and reducing swelling after an injury.\n\nKodiak Pack Envelopes\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes cold chain system ensures that your valuable temperature sensitive payloads arrive in optimum condition.\n\nGel Blox Cold Shipping Packs\n\nGel Blox\u2122 Cooler &amp; Shipping Pack &nbsp;is a non toxic water-based gel refrigerant shipping pack specifically designed and engineered for COLD transport.\n\nFoil Insulated Bubble Mailers\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers are bubble laminated for durability &amp; protective cushioning and feature heavy duty self-adhesive tape.\n\nA Leader in the Industry\nAs a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing, Nortech Labs is constantly striving to develop new and innovative ways of incorporating our gel into different products.\n\nMore About Us\n\nReach Us\n\nNortech Labs Inc customer service hours of operation are Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM &#8211; 5:00 PM EST (4:00 PM Friday).\n\n&#xe081;\n\nAddress\n\n125 Sherwood Ave\n\nFarmingdale, NY 11735\n\n&#xe00b;\n\nPhone\n\n1-888-COLDPAK\n\n(631) 501-1452\n\n&#xe076;\n\nEmail\n\nsales@nortechlabs.com\n\nContact Form\n\nNortech Labs Inc\n\nCustomer Service\n\nForms &amp; Data\n\nHelp Center\n\nPayment Options\n\nArticles &amp; Press Releases\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nStore Policies\n\nShipping Policy\n\nReturn Policy\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms &amp; Conditions\n\nCompany Info\n\nNortech History\n\nContact Us\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nPrivate Labeling\n\nOrder Online\n\nLocate a Distributor\n\nAbout Us\n\nNORTECH LABS INC\n\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.\n\nHome\n\nForms &#038; Data (SDS)\n\nCold Shipping Products\n\nTherapy and First Aid Products\n\nSite Map\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\nClick Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:\n\nBuy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n\nLimited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: NTL344\n\nClick Here to Order Online!\n\nBuy Nortech Products Online Here"
