            "url": "https://nortechlabs.com/products/therma-kool-reusable-hot-cold-pack/",
            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n[Home][45] > [Products][46] > ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Packs\n[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Gel Pack]\n[ [ThermaKool Hot Cold Compress with Blue Easy Sleeve] ][47]\n[ [Therma-Kool Hot Cold Pack Collage] ][48]\n[ [Therma-Kool Hot Cold Pack with Freedom Wrap] ][49]\n[ [Therma-Kool Reusable Hot Cold Pack] ][50]\n[ [Therma-Kool Hot Cold Pack Group] ][51]\n[ [Therma-Kool Hot Cold Pack Retail Boxes] ][52]\n\n# ThermaKool\u00ae Reusable Hot Cold Gel Pack\n\n## Doctor Recommended \u2022 Hospital Proven \u2022 Latex Free\n\n### Preferred Choice of School Nurses and Athletic Trainers\n\n#### Therma-Kool Features & Benefits:\n* Easy to Use: Freeze for Cold Therapy, Microwave for Hot Therapy. The different styles and sizes\nmakes application easy.\n* Non-toxic and environmentally friendly.\n* Effective hot/cold therapy is a proven pain reliever. Used everyday in clinics, hospitals, and\ndoctor\u2019s offices to relieve arthritis and joint pain, muscle strains and stiffness.\n* Can be washed easily and remains odor and bacteria free.\n* Remains soft and flexible when frozen!\n* Contours readily to all parts of the body.\n* Reusable & Latex Free.\n* Natural Pain Management & Pain Reliever.\n* Safe for Children with Adult Supervision.\n* Hospital Proven / Recommended by Doctors.\n* Great Replacement for Ice Bags and Hot Water Bottles.\n* Made of USP Food Grade ingredients.\n* Available in [Retail Boxes with Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers.][53]\n\n## Therma-Kool Reusable Hot Cold Gel Packs\n\nTherma-Kool\u00ae is a reusable gel pack designed to provide comfortable pain relief when cold or hot\ntherapy is required. Moreover, as a 2-way compress, ThermaKool is both safe for use in the\nmicrowave, and stays soft and conforming after being frozen. Convenient to use and ready in minutes\nwith no mess or dripping. Ideal for all care facilities. ThermaKool is the original hot / cold\ntherapy gel pack (Patent No. 3,780,537).\n\n[Use Cold]\n**Use cold for effective first aid & therapy of sprains, strains, headaches, contusions, migraines,\nTMJ, bruises, minor bleeding/burns & more!**\n[Use Hot]\n**Use hot for effective relief of muscle stiffness, body aches, sore muscles, arthritis, stiff\njoints, sinus pressure, spasms, pains & more!**\n\nThermaKool\u00ae Hot Cold Packaging Options\n\n[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack, Size: 3\" x 5\"]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Item Code**\u2502**Size** \u2502**Qty**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTK35 \u25023.5\u2033 x 5\u2033\u25021 Piece\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTK3525 \u25023.5\u2033 x 5\u2033\u250225/Case\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTK3550 \u25023.5\u2033 x 5\u2033\u250250/Case\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTK35125 \u25023.5\u2033 x 5\u2033\u2502125/Case\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack, Size: 4\" x 6\"]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\