            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n\n[Home][45] > [Products][46] > Freedom Wrap\u00ae Reusable Covers\n\n[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]\n[ [Freedom Wrap with Touch Fastener Strap] ][47]\n[ [Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover on Neck / Cervical Area] ][48]\n[ [Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover on Knee] ][49]\n[ [Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover on Face] ][50]\n[ [Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover on Lower Back] ][51]\n[ [Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover on Shoulder] ][52]\n[ [Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover on Elbow] ][53]\n\n# Freedom Wrap\u00ae Reusable Covers\n\n## Hands Free Comfort during Hot / Cold Therapy\n\n#### Freedom Wrap\u00ae Features & Benefits:\n* Elastic touch fastener secures gel therapy pack to any part of the body.\n* Can be used in the microwave with hot cold gel pack inside.\n* **Hands free use provides comfort during hot or cold therapy.**\n* Acts as a protective barrier between gel pack and skin.\n* Will not interfere with healing process.\n* Touch fastener strap can be placed anywhere on laminated foam side.\n* Various sizes for different applications.\n* Freedom Wrap\u00ae is also available in retail boxes with [Therma-Kool Reusable Hot Cold Packs.][54]\n* Proudly manufactured in the USA.\n\n## Freedom Wrap\u00ae Reusable Covers\n\nConstructed of a revolutionary blend of poly-cotton and laminated foam, the **Freedom Wrap\u00ae** with\nelastic touch fastener strap secures the gel therapy pack to any part of the body for hands-free\ncomfort during therapy. These reusable wraps act as a protective barrier between the skin and the\npack, yet won\u2019t interfere with the healing process.\n\nTouch fastener strap can be placed anywhere on laminated adhesive foam side and then secured to any\npart of the body.\n\nInstructions: Place Hot / Cold Pack inside Freedom Wrap and apply to affected area.\n\nFreedom Wrap\u00ae Reusable Covers Packaging Options\n\n[Freedom Wrap Reusable Cover - 4\" x 6\"]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25