            "url": "https://nortechlabs.com/products/comfagel-pressure-reducing-gel-therapy/",
            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n\n[Home][45] > [Products][46] > ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy\n\n[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]\n[ [ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Bladder] ][47]\n[ [ComfaGel Wheelchair Cushion with Strap] ][48]\n[ [ComfaGel Gel Cushion] ][49]\n[ [ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Wheelchair Cushion] ][50]\n[ [ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Mattress] ][51]\n[ [ComfaGel Egg Crate Foam Mattress] ][52]\n\n# ComfaGel\u2122 Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy\n\n## Ideal for Stress and Pressure Management\n\n#### ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Features & Benefits:\n* Reduces pressure and provides an extremely stable and comfortable seating surface.\n* Accommodates a wide range of body shapes, sizes, and weights.\n* Self leveling and self adjusting.\n* Tear-resistant vinyl cover is **Fluid-Proof, Easy to Clean, Antibacterial, and Fire-Retardant.**\n* Convenient strap (optional) for carrying and securing cushion to chair.\n* Great for sporting events or sitting on hard surfaces for long periods of time.\n\nComfaGel\u2122 Pressure Reducing Gel Packaging Options\n\n**Comfa-Gel\u2122 Wheelchair Cushions** are designed for use by those with a temporary or chronic\ncondition that requires prolonged seating and increased risk of pressure ulcers or by those who\nexperience discomfort when seated due to arthritis, lower back pain, or other conditions. This\nself-leveling, self-adjusting cushion\u2019s design minimizes bottoming out, reduces pressure, and\nprovides an extremely stable and comfortable seating surface.\n\n[ComfaGel Wheelchair Cushion]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Item Code**\u2502**Size** \u2502**Qty**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCG16182NSB \u250218\u2033 x 16\u2033 x 2\u2033\u25021 Cushion\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCG16163NSB \u250216\u2033 x 16\u2033 x 3\u2033\u25021 Cushion\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCG18163NSB \u250218\u2033 x 16\u2033 x 3\u2033\u25021 Cushion\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**Comfa-Gel\u2122 Gel Mattress Overlay** incorporates a series of gel bladders encapsulated between\nhigh-density polyurethane sculptured foam and support base. This combination creates a\ntherapeutically advanced yet cost effective support surface. Fluid-proof polyurethane-coated nylon\ncover is durable, antibacterial, antifungal, and fully unzips for easy cleaning. ComfaGel Overlay\nMattress features a seal down the middle of each bladder that prevents gel pooling and gel migration\nso that the patient will not bottom out. Lightweight gel formula reduces overall product weight.\nFour elastic straps secure the corners snugly to the mattress. Conforms to any adjustable bed.\nWeight capacity: 300 lbs. Size: 35\u2033 x 78\u2033 x 3\u2033.\n\n[ComfaGel Gel Mattress Overlay]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Item Code**\u2502**Size** \u2502**Qty**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCG35783 \u250235\u2033 x 78\u2033 x 3\u2033\u25021 Mattress\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Buy from our new E-Commerce website!\n\nComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy products are available for purchase on our e-commerce website\nat NortechLabsOnline.com\n\n[Click Here to Order Online][53]\n[Nortech Labs Inc][54] > [Therapy and First Aid Products][55] > [ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel\nTherapy][56]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][57]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][58]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][59]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][60]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][61]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][62]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][63]\n* [Help Center][64]\n* [Payment Options][65]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][66]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][67]\n* [Request A Quote][68]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Policy][69]\n* [Return Policy][70]\n* [Privacy Policy][71]\n* [Terms & Conditions][72]\n\n#### Company Info\n* [Nortech History][73]\n* [Contact Us][74]\n* [Request A Quote][75]\n* [Private Labeling][76]\n* [**Order Online** [Order Online]][77]\n* [Locate a Distributor][78]\n* [About Us][79]\n\n[[Nortech Labs 60th Anniversary]][80]\n\n**NORTECH LABS INC***\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.*\n* [Home][81]\n* [Forms & Data (SDS)][82]\n* [Cold Shipping Products][83]\n* [Therapy and First Aid Products][84]\n* [Site Map][85]\n* [ Facebook ][86]\n* [ Twitter ][87]\n* [ Instagram ][88]\n* [ Yo