            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n\n[Home][45] > [Products][46] > Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution\n\n[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]\n[ [Tecniclene Cleaning Liquid Concentrate] ][47]\n[ [Tecniclene Concentrate Powder Packets] ][48]\n[ [Tecniclene Concentrate Powder Ultra-Sonic Cleanser] ][49]\n[ [Tecniclene Ultra-Sonic Cleanser Cleaning Solution] ][50]\n[ [Tecniclene Concentrate Powder Label] ][51]\n[ [Tecniclene Cleaning Solution Case] ][52]\n\n# Tecniclene\u2122 Concentrated Cleaning Solution\n\n## Ultra Sonic Cleanser in a Concentrated Powder & Liquid\n\n#### Tecniclene Cleaning Solution Features & Benefits:\n* Great for Dental Offices, Hospitals and Industrial Safety.\n* Non-ionic, concentrated cleaning compound.\n* Combines a powerful detergent, scrubbing agent, blood solvent, deodorizer and wetting agent to\nachieve a **new standard of cleaning power.**\n* Various sizes for different applications.\n* Non caustic or harmful to hands.\n* No Foaming (Contains Anti-Foaming Agent).\n* Biodegradable.\n* Proudly manufactured in the USA.\n\n## A New Standard of Cleaning Power\n\nTecniclene\u2122 is a non-ionic, concentrated cleaning compound. Tecniclene\u2122 combines a powerful\ndetergent, scrubbing agent, blood solvent, deodorizer and wetting agent to achieve a new standard of\ncleaning power. Tecniclene\u2122 removes blood, organic debris, buffing compounds, soils, oxides, rouges,\nand Tripoli from instruments, burs, orthodontic appliances, gold, porcelain and general equipment.\nGreat for Dental offices, hospitals and industrial safety.\n\n### Tecniclene Advantages:\n\n**Economical:** Costs may be as low as pennies per gallon\n**Time & Labor Savings:** No scrubbing required\n**Safety:** Non caustic or harmful to hands\n**Non-Ionic:** Easy identification\n**No Foaming:** Contains anti-foaming ingredient\n**Biodegradable:** Environmentally Safe\n\nTecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution Packaging Options\n\n[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution - Liquid]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Item Code**\u2502**Size**\u2502**Qty**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nN1025L-1 \u25021 Gallon\u25021 Each\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nN1025L-4 \u25021 Gallon\u25024/Case\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[Tecniclene Concentrate Powder]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Item Code**\u2502**Size** \u2502**Qty**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nN1025P-1 \u25022 LB Container\u25021 Each\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nN1025P-12 \u25022 LB Container\u250212/Case\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Forms & Data\n\n[PDF][MSDS Sheet \u2013 Tecniclene **LIQUID** Concentrated Cleaning Solution][53]\n[PDF][MSDS Sheet \u2013 Tecniclene **POWDER** Concentrated Cleaning Solution][54]\n\n## Directions for Use:\n\n## Powder:\n\nEach 2 lb tub makes 32 gallons of cleaning solution. 1 oz. makes 1 gallon of cleaning solution.\n\n**Usage of Tecniclene\u2122:**\nMix 1 level scoop of Tecniclene powder ( 1 oz ) with 1 gallon of warm water.\n\n### Liquid:\n\nEach 1 Gallon bottle provides 128 gallons of powerful cleaning solutions.\n\n**Usage of Tecniclene\u2122:**\nMix 1 oz. of Tecniclene liquid ( 1 oz ) with 1 gallon of warm water.\n\n## **As an Ultrasound Cleaner**\n\nFill ultrasound chamber to level line with cleaning solution\n\n## **As an Instrument Presoak**\n\nFully immerse in solution for at least 30 minutes, longer for more heavily soiled instruments.\n\n## **As an Evacuation System Cleaner**\n\nFollow manufacturers flushing and maintenance directions.\n\n## Buy from our new E-Commerce website!\n\nTecniclene\u2122 Concentrated Solution is available for purchase on our e-commerce website at\nNortechLabsOnline.com\n\n[Click Here To Order Online][55]\n[Nortech Labs Inc][56] > [Therapy and First Aid Products][57] > [Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning\nSolution][58]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][59]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][60]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][61]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][62]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][63]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][64]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][65]\n* [Help Center][66]\n* [Payment Options][67]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][68]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][69]\n* [Request A Quote][70]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Policy][71]\n* [Return Policy][72]\n* [Privacy Policy][73]\n* [Terms & Conditions][74]\n\n#### Company Info\n* [Nortech History][75]\n* [Contact Us][76]\n* [Request A Quote][77]\n* [Private Labeling][78]\n* [**Order Online** [Order Online]][79]\n* [Locate a Distributor][80]\n* [About Us][81]\n\n[[Nortech Labs 60th Anniversary]][82]\n\n**NORTECH LABS INC***\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.*\n* [Home][83]\n* [Forms & Data (SDS)][84]\n* [Cold Shipping Products][85]\n* [Therapy and First Aid Products][86]\n* [Site Map][87]\n* [ Facebook ][88]\n* [ Twitter ][89]\n* [ Instagram ][90]\n* [ YouTube ][91]\n* [ Instagram ][92]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\n**Click Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:**\n\n[[Buy Nortech Products Online]][93]\n\n##### Buy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n* Limited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: **NTL344**\n\n**[Click Here to Order Online!][94]**\n\n**Buy Nortech Products Online Here** <\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@nortechlabs.com\n[2]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[3]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[4]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[5]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[6]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[7]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[8]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[9]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[10]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[11]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[12]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/help-center/\n[13]: /redirecting-to-e-commerce-site/\n[14]: https://nortechlabs.com/\n[15]: https://nortechlabs.com\n[16]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/\n[17]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/gel-blox-cold-shipping-packs/\n[18]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-insulated-foil-bubble-box-liners/\n[19]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-mailers/\n[20]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-rolls/\n[21]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/kodiak-pack-insulated-metalized-envelopes/\n[22]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/structured-gel-plant-based-cold-packs/\n[23]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold