            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n[Home][45] > [Products][46] > Thermal Hot or Cold Pack\n[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]\n\n# Thermal Hot or Cold Pack\n\n## A lightweight gel formula that is reusable & non-toxic\n\n#### Thermal Hot or Cold Pack / Gel Bladder Features & Benefits:\n* **As a Thermal Hot or Cold Pack**\u2013 Great for Catering, Food Delivery Services & Transferring Food\nand other perishable items.\n* Convenient and Easy to Use, this pack will maintain temperatures of cold food, or help hot food\nstay hot!\n* Boil or microwave for hot use, or simply toss in the freezer for cold use.\n* Versatile & Convenient, the Thermal Pack will help maintain temperatures for your popular foods.\n* **As a Gel Bladder**\u2013 Effective for the prevention and treatment of pressure ulcers and designed\nto meet the requirements of HCPCS Code E0185.\n* Lightweight gel formula reduces overall product weight.\n* Features a 300 lb maximum weight capacity.\n* Seal down middle of bladder prevents gel pooling and gel migration so that the patient will not\nbottom out.\n\n[Made in the USA] *Proudly Manufactured in the USA*\n\n## Nortech Labs Gel Products\n\nAs a Thermal Hot or Cold Pack, our gel bladders are convenient and easy to use. This pack will\nmaintain temperatures of cold foods, or help hot foods stay hot! Boil or microwave this pack for hot\nuse, or simply toss in the freezer before cold use. Reusable and non-toxic, this pack is perfect for\ndaily use at your pizza shop, deli, food delivery service, and much more!\n\nA versatile and convenient product, this thermal hot or cold pack is a smart addition to any\nbusiness. You\u2019ll find plenty of uses for this flexible pack, and it will help maintain safe serving\ntemperatures for your popular foods. After 3-4 minutes in the microwave, the pack will be\napproximately 200 degrees Fahrenheit. It will stay hot in room temperature for about an hour.\n\n### Heating Options for Multiple units of Gel Packs:\n\n**OPTION 1:**\n1. Fill a large pot with water and bring to a rapid boil\n2. Turn off flame\n3. Carefully place the Gel Packs (at room temperature) into large pot and let sit for 10 minutes\n4. Using tongues, fish net or other apparatus, carefully remove 1 pack and check for desired\ntemperature\n5. If hotter temperature is desired, repeat procedure\n\n**OPTION 2:**\n1. Fill a large pot with water and bring to a rapid boil\n2. Turn off flame\n3. Carefully pour boiling water over the Gel Packs and let sit for 10 minutes\n4. Using tongues, fish net or other apparatus, carefully remove 1 pack and check for desired\ntemperature\n5. If hotter temperature is desired, repeat procedure\n\n[Nortech Labs Inc][47] > [Therapy and First Aid Products][48] > [Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][49]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][50]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][51]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][52]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][53]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][54]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][55]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][56]\n* [Help Center][57]\n* [Payment Options][58]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][59]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][60]\n* [Request A Quote][61]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Policy][62]\n* [Return Policy][63]\n* [Privacy Policy][64]\n* [Terms & Conditions][65]\n\n#### Company Info\n* [Nortech History][66]\n* [Contact Us][67]\n* [Request A Quote][68]\n* [Private Labeling][69]\n* [**Order Online** [Order Online]][70]\n* [Locate a Distributor][71]\n* [About Us][72]\n\n[[Nortech Labs 60th Anniversary]][73]\n\n**NORTECH LABS INC***\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.*\n* [Home][74]\n* [Forms & Data (SDS)][75]\n* [Cold Shipping Products][76]\n* [Therapy and First Aid Products][77]\n* [Site Map][78]\n* [ Facebook ][79]\n* [ Twitter ][80]\n* [ Instagram ][81]\n* [ YouTube ][82]\n* [ Instagram ][83]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\n**Click Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:**\n\n[[Buy Nortech Products Online]][84]\n\n##### Buy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n* Limited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: **NTL344**\n\n**[Click Here to Order Online!][85]**\n\n**Buy Nortech Products Online Here** <\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@nortechlabs.com\n[2]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[3]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[4]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[5]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[6]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[7]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[8]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[9]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[10]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[11]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[12]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/help-center/\n[13]: /redirecting-to-e-commerce-site/\n[14]: https://nortechlabs.com/\n[15]: https://nortechlabs.com\n[16]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/\n[17]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/gel-blox-cold-shipping-packs/\n[18]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-insulated-foil-bubble-box-liners/\n[19]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-mailers/\n[20]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-rolls/\n[21]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/kodiak-pack-insulated-metalized-envelopes/\n[22]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/structured-gel-plant-based-cold-packs/\n[23]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/tag-t1-temperature-data-logger/\n[24]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/foil-insulated-thermal-mailers/\n[25]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/\n[26]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/therma-kool-reusable-hot-cold-pack/\n[27]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/instakool-instant-cold-pack/\n[28]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/cool-instant-cold-packs/\n[29]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/gel-blox-cold-shipping-packs/\n[30]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/dental-pack-cold-pack/\n[31]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/kodiak-pack-insulated-metalized-envelopes/\n[32]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/blue-easy-sleeves-disposable-covers/\n[33]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/freedom-wrap-reusable-covers/\n[34]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-mailers/\n[35]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-rolls/\n[36]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-insulated-foil-bubble-box-liners/\n[37]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/comfagel-pressure-reducing-gel-therapy/\n[38]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/tecniclene-concentrated-cleaning-solution/\n[39]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/exam-disposables/\n[40]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/customized-gel-products-gel-bladders/\n[41]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/laboratory-plastics-scientific-equipment/\n[42]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/about-us/\n[43]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/forms-data/\n[44]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/contact/\n[45]: https://www.nortechlabs.com\n[46]: /products/\n[47]: https://nortechlabs.com\n[48]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/\n[49]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/customized-gel-products-gel-bladders/\n[50]: /products/instakool-instant-cold-pack/\n[51]: /products/cool-instant-cold-packs/\n[52]: /cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-insulated-foil-bubble-box-liners/\n[53]: /products/therma-kool-reusable-hot-cold-pack/\n[54]: /cold-shipping-supplies/gel-blox-cold-shipping-packs/\n[55]: /products/comfagel-pressure-reducing-gel-therapy/\n[56]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/forms-data/\n[57]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/help-center/\n[58]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/payment-options/\n[59]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/articles-press-releases/\n[60]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/frequently-asked-questions/\n[61]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/request-a-quote/\n[62]: https://nortechlabs.com/store-policies/shipping-policy/\n[63]: https://nortechlabs.com/store-policies/return-policy/\n[64]: https://nortechlabs.com/store-policies/privacy-policy/\n[65]: https://nortechlabs.com/store-policies/terms-conditions/\n[66]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/nortech-history/\n[67]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/contact/\n[68]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/request-a-quote/\n[69]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/private-labeling/\n[70]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/buy-online/\n[71]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/locate-a-distributor/\n[72]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/about-us/\n[73]: https://nortechlabs.com/company-info/nortech-history/\n[74]: https://nortechlabs.com\n[75]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/forms-data/\n[76]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/\n[77]: https://nortechlabs.com/products/\n[78]: https://nortechlabs.com/site-map/\n[79]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[80]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[81]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[82]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[83]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[84]: https://www.nortechlabsonline.com\n[85]: https://www.nortechlabsonline.com"
