            "url": "https://nortechlabs.com/products/laboratory-plastics-scientific-equipment/",
            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n\n[Home][45] > [Products][46] > Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment\n\n# Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment\n\n## [CLICK HERE for our full catalog of Laboratory Plastics and Scientific Equipment][47]\n\n## Pipet Tips & Packaging\n\n[ART Aerosol Resistant Tips]\n\n**ART\u00ae Aerosol Resistant Tips**\nThe ART\u00ae self-sealing barrier is trusted as the foremost defense against cross contamination.\n\n[Robotix Tips]\n\n**Robotix Tips**\nIntroducing the most extensive line of quality tips for automated workstations on the market today \u2013\nthe BioRobotix\u2122 line of tips. Here you will find the perfect tip for your high throughput screening\nneeds.\n\n[Pipet Tips]\n\n**Pipet Tips (Standard & Gel loading)**\nMBP and MBP Pure \u2013 high quality pipet tips that are manufactured under the most stringent quality\ncontrol standards.\n\n[Filter Tips]\n\n**Filter Tips**\nProtect your pipettor with tips that feature a unique carbon filter to block corrosive vapors.\n\n[Universal Tips]\n\n**Universal Tips**\nBeveled tip for precise and accurate sample discharge.\n\n[Agarose]\n\n**Agarose**\nAgarose is a polysaccharide obtained from agar that is used for a variety of life science\napplications especially in gel electrophoresis.\n\n## Tubes & Related Products\n\n[PCR Tubes & Accessories]\n\n**PCR Tubes & Accessories**\nState-of-the-art manufacturing equipment and 100% premium-grade polypropylene give you a\nconsistently superior line of tubes. All tubes feature our exclusive PurePak packaging.\n\n[ Microcentrifuge Tubes & Accessories]\n\n**Microcentrifuge Tubes & Accessories**\nPremium microtubes with extra features to meet your everyday needs.\n\n[Micro Titertubes & Accessories]\n\n**Micro Titertubes & Accessories**\nOur versatile, space-saving designs are the perfect way to organize your bench top.\n\n[Culture Tubes]\n\n**Culture Tubes**\nThese sterile tubes come with 2-position caps for aerobic or anaerobic closing, and are\nprecision-molded from premium grade polystyrene or polypropylene\n\n[Test Tubes]\n\n**Tests Tubes**\nPrecision-Molded from premium grade polystyrene or polypropylene, these general purpose tubes are\nideal for a wide range of applications.\n\n[Transport Vials & Tubes]\n\n**Transport Vials & Tubes**\nIdeal for sample collection, storage, and safety. Made from virgin polypropylene, they are available\nin three sizes, sterile or non-sterile.\n\n[Tube Caps]\n\n**Caps**\nProtects samples from accidental spillage, evaporation, and contamination.\n\n[Unique Black Tubes]\n\n**Unique Black Tubes**\nUnique black polypropylene tubes are completely opaque, protecting even the most light sensitive\ncompounds.\n\n## Transfer Pipets\n\n[Transfer Pipets]\n\n**Graduated and Non-Graduated Transfer Pipets**\nGeneral purpose Transfer Pipers available in a variety of sizes and capacities. Disposable.\n\n## Other Quality Laboratory Products\n\n**[Scintillation Vials]**\n\n**Scintillation Vials**\nVials are made from a special grade of polypropylene which produces a product of optimum clarity.\nUnique design offers users a leakproof fit with only one-half turn of a cap.\n\n**[Spectrophotometer Cuvettes ]**\n\n**Spectrophotometer Cuvettes**\nMacro and Semi-Micro cuvettes are specially packaged to reach you scratch- free. Manufactured from\npolystyrene formulated for superior clarity and transmission.\n\n> ## We carry a full line of Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment. If you don\u2019t see the size you are\n> ## looking for, or are inquiring about bulk discounting, [please use our Contact Form or call us\n> ## at 1-888-COLDPAK (1-888-265-3725).][48]\n\n[Nortech Labs Inc][49] > [Therapy and First Aid Products][50] > [Laboratory Plastics & Scientific\nEquipment][51]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][52]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][53]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][54]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][55]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][56]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][57]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][58]\n* [Help Center][59]\n* [Payment Options][60]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][61]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Policy][64]\n* [Return Policy][65]\n* [Privacy Policy][66]\n* [Terms & Conditions][67]\n\n#### Company Info\n* [Nortech History][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n* [Request A Quote][70]\n* [Private Labeling][71]\n* [**Order Online** [Order Online]][72]\n* [Locate a Distributor][73]\n* [About Us][74]\n\n[[Nortech Labs 60th Anniversary]][75]\n\n**NORTECH LABS INC***\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.*\n* [Home][76]\n* [Forms & Data (SDS)][77]\n* [Cold Shipping Products][78]\n* [Therapy and First Aid Products][79]\n* [Site Map][80]\n* [ Facebook ][81]\n* [ Twitter ][82]\n* [ Instagram ][83]\n* [ YouTube ][84]\n* [ Instagram ][85]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\n**Click Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:**\n\n[[Buy Nortech Products Online]][86]\n\n##### Buy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n* Limited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: **NTL344**\n\n**[Click Here to Order Online!][87]**\n\n**Buy Nortech Products Online Here** <\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@nortechlabs.com\n[2]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[3]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[4]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[5]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[6]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[7]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[8]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[9]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[10]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[11]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[12]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/help-center/\n[13]: /redirecting-to-e-commerce-site/\n[14]: https://nortechlabs.com/\n[15]: https://nortechlabs.com\n[16]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-su