            "url": "https://nortechlabs.com/about-us",
            "text": "1-888-COLDPAK [sales@nortechlabs.com][1]\n* [ Facebook ][2]\n* [ Twitter ][3]\n* [ Instagram ][4]\n* [ YouTube ][5]\n* [ Instagram ][6]\n* [ Facebook ][7]\n* [ Twitter ][8]\n* [ Instagram ][9]\n* [ YouTube ][10]\n* [ Instagram ][11]\n* [Help Center][12]\n* [\n[Buy Our Products Online] **BUY OUR PRODUCTS ONLINE >>**\n][13]\n[ [Nortech Labs Inc] ][14]\n* [[Home] Home][15]\n* [Cold Shipping][16]\n* [Gel Blox\u2122 Cold Shipping Packs][17]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][18]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers][19]\n* [Cool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Rolls][20]\n* [Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][21]\n* [Structured Gel Plant-based Cold Packs][22]\n* [Tag T1 Temperature Data Logger][23]\n* [3/16\u2033 Foil Insulated Thermal Mailers][24]\n* [Therapy & First Aid][25]\n* [[ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack]ThermaKool Reusable Hot / Cold Pack][26]\n* [[InstaKool Instant Cold Ice Pack]InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][27]\n* [[Cool Instant Cold Pack]Cool Instant Cold Pack][28]\n* [[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][29]\n* [[Dental Pack Cold Pack]Dental Pack Cold Pack][30]\n* [[Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes]Kodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes][31]\n* [[Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers]Blue Easy Sleeves Disposable Covers][32]\n* [[Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers]Freedom Wrap Reusable Covers][33]\n* [[Foil Bubble Mailers]Foil Bubble Mailers][34]\n* [[Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls]Cool Blue Foil Bubble Rolls][35]\n* [[Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners]Cool Blue Insulated Foil Bubble Box Liners][36]\n* [[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy]ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel Therapy][37]\n* [[Tecniclene Concentrated Cleaning Solution]Tecniclene Cleaning Solution][38]\n* [[Exam Disposables]Exam Disposables][39]\n* [[Thermal Hot or Cold Pack]Thermal Hot or Cold Pack][40]\n* [[Laboratory Plastics & Scientific Equipment]Lab Plastics & Scientific Equipment][41]\n* [About Us][42]\n* [Forms & Data][43]\n* [Contact][44]\nSelect Page\n\n# About Nortech Labs Inc\n\n[Nortech Labs]Nortech Labs, Inc. is a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing & cold shipping\nproducts. As the original inventor of the [Therma-Kool\u00ae Hot / Cold Gel Therapy Pack][45] (Patent #\n3,780,537), we are constantly striving to develop new and innovative ways of incorporating our gel\ninto different products.\n\nOver the past 60 years we have expanded our capabilities and are now servicing our products all over\nthe world. As of 2024, our product line reaches over fifty markets including health professionals,\ndentists, surgical dealers, wholesale/distributors, government agencies, hospitals, rehabilitation\ncenters and much more.\n\nWhen faced with adversity, Nortech strives to think outside the box and implement safer products for\nan ever growing healthcare / first aid market & cold chain shipping industries. In 2005, Nortech\nLabs developed InstaKool Instant Cold Pack, an Ammonium Nitrate Free product with the use of a\nproprietary formula, CarbamaKool\u2122.\n\nNortech Labs is also a distributor of first aid, cold temperature / temperature sensitive transport,\npositioning, home healthcare, and emergency disposable products.\n\n*[Made in the USA] All Nortech products are proudly manufactured in America.*\n\n**Product Development & Consulting Services**\n\nLet Nortech help you develop and customize your products. We understand that branding and packaging\nare key components for the optimization of any business. Nortech offers consulting for a wide range\nof customized products in the first aid, gel therapy and positioning markets.\n\nWe specialize in private labeling instant cold packs and reusable hot cold gel packs that are\nenvironmentally friendly and hazmat free! All our products are non-toxic and ammonium nitrate free.\n*[(Click here to learn more about the HAZARDS of Ammonium Nitrate).][46]*\n\nNortech\u2019s lightweight gel is used in a variety of applications that include, but are not limited to,\ngel positioning aids in the neonatal and perineal markets, gel packs, gel bladders, gel pillows for\npositioning or pressure relief, and cold or hot gel packs used in a variety of applications in the\ntherapy market.\n\nRather than hiring a high priced consultant who may be unfamiliar with most manufacturing processes,\nNortech offers product development and consulting services for a nominal fee. We work closely with\nyou to develop a product customized to your specifications.\n\n**Please Call or [contact us online][47] for Consulting Rates & Further Information.**\n\n**Private Label Opportunities**\n\u2022 [Ice / Cold & Hot Gel Therapy Packs][48]\n\u2022 [Gel Refrigerant Shipping Packs][49]\n\u2022 [Disposable Instant Cold (Ammonium Nitrate Free) Packs][50]\n\u2022 [Pressure Alleviating Positioning Aids for a variety of markets][51]\n\u2022 [Gel Pillows & Bladders][52]\n\n**Exclusive Packaging**\nNortech\u2019s private label sector provides a strategic advantage for clients in a highly competitive\nmarket. We work closely with our clients to develop customized packaging to meet all specifications.\nNortech\u2019s fundamental goal is to add value and differentiation to your product.\n\n[Nortech Labs Inc]\n\n[http://www.nortechlabs.com][53]\n125 Sherwood Avenue\nFarmingdale, NY 11735\nUSA\ninfo@nortechlabs.com\n[1-888-COLD-PAK (265-3725)][54]\n\n[Nortech Labs Inc][55] > [Company Info][56] > [About Us][57]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][58]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][59]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][60]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][61]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][62]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][63]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][64]\n* [Help Center][65]\n* [Payment Options][66]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][67]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][68]\n* [Request A Quote][69]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Policy][70]\n* [Return Policy][71]\n* [Privacy Policy][72]\n* [Terms & Conditions][73]\n\n#### Company Info\n* [Nortech History][74]\n* [Contact Us][75]\n* [Request A Quote][76]\n* [Private Labeling][77]\n* [**Order Online** [Order Online]][78]\n* [Locate a Distributor][79]\n* [About Us][80]\n\n[[Nortech Labs 60th Anniversary]][81]\n\n**NORTECH LABS INC***\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.*\n* [Home][82]\n* [Forms & Data (SDS)][83]\n* [Cold Shipping Products][84]\n* [Therapy and First Aid Products][85]\n* [Site Map][86]\n* [ Facebook ][87]\n* [ Twitter ][88]\n* [ Instagram ][89]\n* [ YouTube ][90]\n* [ Instagram ][91]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\n**Click Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:**\n\n[[Buy Nortech Products Online]][92]\n\n##### Buy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n* Limited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: **NTL344**\n\n**[Click Here to Order Online!][93]**\n\n**Buy Nortech Products Online Here** <\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@nortechlabs.com\n[2]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[3]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[4]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[5]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[6]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[7]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[8]: http://www.twitter.com/nortechlabs\n[9]: http://www.linkedin.com/in/nortechlabs\n[10]: http://www.youtube.com/user/NortechLabs\n[11]: https://www.instagram.com/nortechlabs/\n[12]: https://nortechlabs.com/customer-service/help-center/\n[13]: /redirecting-to-e-commerce-site/\n[14]: https://nortechlabs.com/\n[15]: https://nortechlabs.com\n[16]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/\n[17]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/gel-blox-cold-shipping-packs/\n[18]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-insulated-foil-bubble-box-liners/\n[19]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shipping-supplies/cool-blue-foil-bubble-mailers/\n[20]: https://nortechlabs.com/cold-shippi