      "polished_summary": "Nortech Labs Inc is a leading innovator in gel manufacturing and cold shipping, specializing in environmentally friendly products for the Medical, First Aid, Therapy, Healthcare, and Cold Chain Shipping industries. With over 60 years of experience, the company offers a diverse range of products, including cold shipping packs, reusable hot/cold packs, and medical supplies, catering to the needs of pharmaceutical, healthcare, dental, and food delivery sectors.",
