        "crawl_text": "Pelton Shepherd Industries Compliant with industry standards for cold chain shipping. United States GMP certified 70 years of industry experience Innovative cold chain solutions Focus on sustainability Decades of experience in cold chain solutions Customizable gel pack designs Strong commitment to sustainability 70 years of experience in cold chain logistics Innovative and sustainable gel pack solutions CDC guidelines for vaccine shipping FDA regulations for pharmaceuticals GMP compliance 3120 W. March Lane, Stockton, CA 95219 United States United States [COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Shapeable Foam Designed for Tight Pack-Outs\n\n# Shapeable Foam Designed for Tight Pack-Outs\n\n## **GLACIER FOAM BRICK**\n\nShipping perishable items has many challenges, from maintaining temperature control to minimizing\nshipping costs. When you need tight pack-outs to maximize space efficiency, increase insulation and\nprotect perishables from in-transit damage, choose Glacier Foam Bricks.\n\n### Features of Glacier Foam Bricks\n* Glacier Foam Bricks are rigid foam-filled refrigerant blocks designed to optimize cold chain\npackaging\n* Available in different sizes to fit your packaging needs, Glacier Foam Bricks are available from\n7.5 to 60 ounces\n* Retain their shape throughout transit, regardless of whether they\u2019re frozen or thawed\n\nMake the most of your packaging space and keep your cold chain intact. [Request ordering\ninformation][131] for Glacier Foam Bricks today.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][132]\n\n# Shapeable Foam Designed for Tight Pack-Outs\n\n## **GLACIER FOAM BRICK**\n\n## **GLACIER FOAM BRICK**\n\nDescription\n\nShipping perishable items has many challenges, from maintaining temperature control to minimizing\nshipping costs. When you need tight pack-outs to maximize space efficiency, increase insulation and\nprotect perishables from in-transit damage, choose Glacier Foam Bricks.\n\n### Features of Glacier Foam Bricks\n* Glacier Foam Bricks are rigid foam-filled refrigerant blocks designed to optimize cold chain\npackaging\n* Available in different sizes to fit your packaging needs, Glacier Foam Bricks are available from\n7.5 to 60 ounces\n* Retain their shape throughout transit, regardless of whether they\u2019re frozen or thawed\n\nMake the most of your packaging space and keep your cold chain intact. [Request ordering\ninformation][133] for Glacier Foam Bricks today.\n\nSizes\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u