0\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBenefits & Use Cases\n\n### Benefits\n\nSelect Glacier Foam Bricks as your shipping refrigerant for the following advantages:\n* **Limit movement: **Glacier Foam Bricks feature precise shape tolerances, allowing tight pack-outs\nto keep products securely in place. You can reduce the risk of damage and ensure packages arrive\nin optimal condition.\n* **Reduce shipping costs: **With the ability to make maximum use of space, you can eliminate the\nneed for excess containers and packaging materials and fit more cargo into a single trip \u2014\nreducing shipping costs overall.\n* **Efficiently control temperature: **Our Glacier Foam Bricks offer a superior energy absorption\nrate for long-lasting cold. You can count on Glacier Foam Bricks to quickly absorb heat and\nmaintain a consistent temperature, decreasing fluctuation risk and protecting product quality.\n\n### Use Cases\n\nUse Glacier Foam Bricks to ship any items requiring tight pack-outs, such as:\n* Vaccines, medications and other pharmaceuticals\n* Fresh produce, dairy products, and various food and beverage items\n* Fresh-cut plants and flowers, floral arrangements and agricultural products\n\nSizes\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT \u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) L X W X H\u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502POUNDS PER CASE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u250