-1/4\u2033 X 9-1/4\u2033 X 1\u2033 \u250210 \u250236\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFB-60B-8 \u250260 OZ. \u25029\u2033 X 8\u2033 X 1-1/2\u2033 \u25028 \u250231\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBenefits & Use Cases\n\n### Benefits\n\nSelect Glacier Foam Bricks as your shipping refrigerant for the following advantages:\n* **Limit movement: **Glacier Foam Bricks feature precise shape tolerances, allowing tight pack-outs\nto keep products securely in place. You can reduce the risk of damage and ensure packages arrive\nin optimal condition.\n* **Reduce shipping costs: **With the ability to make maximum use of space, you can eliminate the\nneed for excess containers and packaging materials and fit more cargo into a single trip \u2014\nreducing shipping costs overall.\n* **Efficiently control temperature: **Our Glacier Foam Bricks offer a superior energy absorption\nrate for long-lasting cold. You can count on Glacier Foam Bricks to quickly absorb heat and\nmaintain a consistent temperature, decreasing fluctuation risk and protecting product quality.\n\n### Use Cases\n\nUse Glacier Foam Bricks to ship any items requiring tight pack-outs, such as:\n* Vaccines, medications and other pharmaceuticals\n* Fresh produce, dairy products, and various food and beverage items\n* Fresh-cut plants and flowers, floral arrangements and agricultural products\n\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][134]\n* [Perishables][135]\n* [Specialty][136]\n* [Life Sciences][137]\n* [Perishables][138]\n* [Specialty][139]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][140]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][141]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][142]\n* [Physical Therapy][143]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][144]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][145]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][146]\n* [Physical Therapy][147]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][148]\n* [Consumer FAQ][149]\n* [Disposal Instructions][150]\n* [Blog][151]\n* [Business FAQ][152]\n* [Consumer FAQ][153]\n* [Disposal Instructions][154]\n* [Blog][155]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][156]\n* [Location][157]\n* [Success Stories][158]\n* [Join our Team][159]\n* [About Us][160]\n* [Location][161]\n* [Success Stories][162]\n* [Join our Team][163]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][164]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][165]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][166]\n[Terms & Conditions][167]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][168]\n* [Perishables][169]\n* [Specialty][170]\n* [Life Sciences][171]\n* [Perishables][172]\n* [Specialty][173]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][174]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][175]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][176]\n* [Physical Therapy][177]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][178]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][179]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][180]\n* [Physical Therapy][181]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][182]\n* [Consumer FAQ][183]\n