od & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Premium Gel Ice Refrigerant\n\n# Premium Gel Ice Refrigerant\n\n## **Cura Temp Pro**\n\nWhether you ship direct-to-consumer medications or distribute food products to local retailers, you\nneed reliable and accurate temperature control to maintain the cold chain.\n\n### Features of CuraTemp Pro\n* Cost-effective shipping solution for reducing temperature excursions throughout transit and\nprotecting product integrity\n* Our premium gel ice refrigerant for smooth cold-chain shipping\n* Feature a unique, self-insulating design, ensuring dependable temperature control at multiple\neutectic points\n* Come in -10 F, -4 F, +10 F and +32 F eutectic points to ship a range of perishables with different\ntemperature requirements.\n\nWhen you need steady and precise temperature control, you can rely on CuraTemp Pro \u2014 the innovation\nthat launched it all. [Contact our team][131] to order CuraTemp Pro ice packs today.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][132]\n\n# Premium Gel Ice Refrigerant\n\n## **Cura Temp Pro**\n\n## **Cura Temp Pro**\n\nDescription\n\nWhether you ship direct-to-consumer medications or distribute food products to local retailers, you\nneed reliable and accurate temperature control to maintain the cold chain.\n\n### Features of CuraTemp Pro\n* Cost-effective shipping solution for reducing temperature excursions throughout transit and\nprotecting product integrity\n* Our premium gel ice refrigerant for smooth cold-chain shipping\n* Feature a unique, self-insulating design, ensuring dependable temperature control at multiple\neutectic points\n* Come in -10 F, -4 F, +10 F and +32 F eutectic points to ship a range of perishables with different\ntemperature requirements.\n\nWhen you need steady and precise temperature control, you can rely on CuraTemp Pro \u2014 the innovation\nthat launched it all. [Contact our team][133] to order CuraTemp Pro ice packs today.\n\nSizes\nx-cold brick one-use 30\u00b0 formula\nuse once and discard\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT\u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) \u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502POUNDS PER CASE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u25