            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Life Sciences][131] \u203a Clinical Trial Shipping Made Easy With Gel\nPacks\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Life Sciences][134] \u203a Clinical Trial Shipping Made Easy With Gel\nPacks\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Clinical Trials\n\n## Clinical Trial Shipping Made Easy With Gel Packs\n\nReliable cold chain logistics are integral to successful clinical trials involving biomedical\nstudies. The integrity of biological samples, drugs, and vaccines used during the process must\nremain uncompromised to avoid health risks, invalid data, financial losses, and strict compliance\nwith clinical trial protocols. Pelton Shepherd provides gel packs of various sizes and eutectic\npoints to meet the specific temperature requirements of the multistage clinical trial process.\n\nOur comprehensive clinical trial logistics can be set up to include end-to-end support to ensure a\nsteady supply of ready-to-use gel packs and other materials exactly when required through each phase\nof trials. Our COLD program incorporates Conditioning Operations, Logistics, and refrigerant\nDelivery so you can focus on your research results. Ensure complete peace of mind and convenience\nfor your clinical trials with cost-effective gel packs from Pelton Shepherd.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## The Benefits Of Working With Pelton Shepherd\n\nGel packs provide safety and convenience when clinical trial shipping solutions are required. They\nare easier and safer to handle than dry ice, and being reusable keeps costs down, which is\nparticularly beneficial during extended studies.\n\nPelton Shepherd\u2019s line of gel packs provide the following benefits:\n\nEco-Friendly\n\nOur TerraTemp line, made from eco-friendly materials, contributes to sustainability efforts by\nreducing environmental impact.\n\nAccurate Temperatures\n\nPelton Shepherd gel packs enable researchers to maintain accurate temperature parameters during\nshipping, ensuring that products and materials reach their destination in optimal condition.\n\nCustom Solutions\n\n[Custom solutions are available][136] on large orders to incorporate specific gel pack designs or\nprecise temperature control requirements.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][137]\n\n## Our Gel Packs for Clinical Trials\n\n[Regular thermal testing][138] to ensure product integrity is often a requirement of cold chain\nshipping for clinical trials. Pelton Shepherd offers a range of [innovative shipping\nsolutions][139] to avoid temperature excursions and ensure materials and samples remain within\nstrict thermal ranges.\n\nOur innovative options for shipping sensitive pharmaceuticals and [life science\nproducts][140] commonly used in clinical trials include:\n* **TerraTemp: **Sustainable gel packs featuring biodegradable formulas that offer accurate\ntemperature controls for multiple uses. Each line [of the TerraTemp range][141] is suitable for\ndifferent applications \u2014 Terra Ice\u2122 is a compostible solution, while Vortec Ice\u2122 is reusable.\n* **GlacierTemp:** Versatile, cost-effective temperature control solutions. Find the properties\nrequired for your clinical trials among our [popular Glacier Temp line][142]. Glacier Ice\u2122\nprovides reliable affordability, the double layer of EcoGel\u2122 protects against leaks when\ntransporting materials with irregular shapes or sharp corners, and Glacier Foam Bricks provide\nlong-lasting, space-saving solutions that limit movement during transit.\n\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nVersatile, cost-effective temperature control solutions. Find the properties required for your\nclinical trials among our [popular Glacier Temp line][143]. Glacier Ice\u2122 provides reliable\naffordability, the double layer of EcoGel\u2122 protects against leaks when transporting materials with\nirregular shapes or sharp corners, and Glacier Foam Bricks provide long-lasting, space-saving\nsolutions that limit movement during transit.\n\n[ Learn More ][144]\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nSustainable gel packs featuring biodegradable formulas that offer accurate temperature controls for\nmultiple uses. Each line [of the TerraTemp range][145] is suitable for different applications \u2014\nTerra Ice\u2122 is a compostible solution, while Vortec Ice\u2122 is reusable.\n\n[ Learn More ][146]\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Pelton Shepherd: Your Reliable Clinical Trial Logistics Partner\n\nPartner with us for consistent, reliable clinical trial shipping solutions tailored to meet the\nrequirements of specific studies. Pelton Shepherd has been a leader in cold chain product\ndevelopment for over 70 years, and we continue to innovate and create products that comply with\nstrict shipping regulations. Robust cold management during shipping and last-leg deliveries is\npossible with our quality gel packs that deliver superior performance.\n\nWhen only the best will do, trust Pelton Shepherd for clinical trial shipping solutions and reliable\nservice to ensure your data is beyond reproach. Ship affordably and confidently with reusable gel\ntechnology that meets the requirements of life sciences industries. Browse [our product\ncatalog][147] or request [a quote for your clinical trial][148] today!\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Comments\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][149]\n* [Perishables][150]\n* [Specialty][151]\n* [Life Sciences][152]\n* [Perishables][153]\n* [Specialty][154]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][155]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][156]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][157]\n* [Physical Therapy][158]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][159]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][160]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][161]\n* [Physical Therapy][162]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][163]\n* [Consumer FAQ][164]\n* [Disposal Instructions][165]\n* [Blog][166]\n* [Business FAQ][167]\n* [Consumer FAQ][168]\n* [Disposal Instructions][169]\n* [Blog][170]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][171]\n* [Location][172]\n* [Success Stories][173]\n* [Join our Team][174]\n* [About Us][175]\n* [Location][176]\n* [Success Stories][177]\n* [Join our Team][178]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][179]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][180]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][181]\n[Terms & Conditions][182]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][183]\n* [Perishables][184]\n* [Specialty][185]\n* [Life Sciences][186]\n* [Perishables][187]\n* [Specialty][188]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][189]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][190]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][191]\n* [Physical Therapy][192]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][193]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][194]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][195]\n* [Physical Therapy][196]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][197]\n* [Consumer FAQ][198]\n* [Disposal Instructions][199]\n* [Blog][200]\n* [Business FAQ][201]\n* [Consumer FAQ][202]\n* [Disposal Instructions][203]\n* [Blog][204]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][205]\n* [Location][206]\n* [Success Stories][207]\n* [Join our Team][208]\n* [About Us][209]\n* [Location][210]\n* [Success Stories][211]\n* [Join our Team][212]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly"
