            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Perishables][131] \u203a Frozen Food\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Perishables][134] \u203a Frozen Food\n\n## Gel Packs for Shipping Frozen Food\n\nPelton Shepherd simplifies the complex process of shipping frozen food with a range of gel packs\nthat maintain tight thermal ranges. Developed to prevent spoilage and maintain food quality, our\npuncture-resistant, user-friendly ice packs simplify cold chain shipping logistics. Our cutting-edge\ngel pack technology keeps frozen food shipments in optimal condition from pickup to final delivery.\n\n[ Contact Us ][135]\n[What Type of Ice Pack Do I Need][What Type of Ice Pack Do I Need]\n\n## Why Choose Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs?\n\nEnsure precise temperature control on frozen food shipments with cold pack solutions trusted by the\nfood industry for decades. Pelton Shepherd gel packs are available with various eutectic points,\nmaking them a dependable, valuable resource to maintain accurate temperatures.\n\nOur gel packs deliver:\n* **Reliable performance: **Our cold packs [have proven themselves][136] in temperature-sensitive\nfood industries.\n* **Accurate temperature control:** Our gel packs are the tools needed to keep frozen food shipments\nat the required temperature.\n* **Cost-effectiveness: **We understand shipping budget constraints and have developed [economical\nand reusable options][137] that can withstand multiple freeze-thaw cycles.\n* **Tailored solutions:** Our staff specialists can partner with you on large orders to [customize\ngel pack solutions][138] for unique shipping requirements.\n* **Peace of mind:** We continue to innovate to ensure our cold packs meet or exceed changing\nexpectations.\n\n[a picture of a custom branded gel pack in a food delivery box][a picture of a custom branded gel\npack in a food delivery box]\n\n## Find the Best Ice Packs for Shipping Frozen Food\n\nPreventing spoilage when shipping frozen food requires meticulous attention to detail. From\nready-made frozen meals to poultry and ice cream, temperature excursions during shipping impact the\nquality and safety of frozen goods. Avoid losses and reputational damage using Pelton Shepherd\u2019s\nadvanced gel pack technology in every shipment.\n\nExplore our premium gel pack lines:\n* **TerraTemp:** Minimize temperature fluctuations and address sustainability goals with this\nstate-of-the-art line of [eco-friendly gel packs][139]. Vortec Ice\u2122 is [both cost-effective and\nsustainable][140], and it offers a eutectic point of 32 degrees Fahrenheit.\n* **Glacier Temp:** Protect perishables from spoilage with our line of [everyday shipping gel\npacks][141]. This popular, cost-effective line is especially useful for maintaining robust\ntemperature control in last-mile deliveries. [Glacier Ice\u2122][142] is the number-one gel pack\ntrusted by shippers across the United States.\n\n## How to Ship Frozen Food\n\nThe logistics of shipping frozen food include many variables. Factors including the unique product\nrequirements, shipping duration and careful consideration of the weather conditions impact the\npreparations required. [Shipping frozen meat][143] to Montana in January requires an entirely\ndifferent game plan than [transporting ice cream][144] to Florida in July.\n\nPreparations for maintaining strict temperature ranges when shipping temperature-sensitive food\ninclude the following:\n* **Quality packaging solutions:** [Create thermal barriers][145] between the frozen food and\noutside temperatures.\n* **Include insulation: **Fill all gaps inside insulated boxes to enhance temperature stability.\n* **Top quality, reliable cold packs: **Use Pelton Shepherd gel packs to keep your frozen shipments\nwithin strict temperature ranges.\n\n[Enviro Ice, a plant food gel pack being diluted in watering can][Enviro Ice, a plant food gel pack\nbeing diluted in watering can]\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Flexibility is important for me, and you can depend on Pelton Shepherd for that. ** I forgot to\nplace my order once, and my sales rep worked with me to get them there that same day.\nPharmaceuticals Customer\n\n## Keep Frozen Food Shipments Frozen With Gel Packs From Pelton Shepherd\n\nWith over 70 years of providing top-tier refrigerant solutions, rely on us to deliver\npremium-quality ice packs for shipping frozen food. Our comprehensive services to the food industry\ninclude our COLD program, which [supports complex logistical requirements][146] by providing\nready-to-use gel packs on demand. Add reliability to your frozen food logistics \u2014 [contact Pelton\nShepherd][147] today.\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Instagram\nThis fiel