rishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Plant Food Gel That\u2019s Also Drain Safe\n\n# A Plant Food Gel That\u2019s Also Drain Safe\n\n## **ENVIRO ICE**\n\nImprove the user experience and highlight your dedication to sustainability with Enviro Ice gel\npacks. Enviro Ice is the market\u2019s first gel pack that doubles as \u201cplant food.\u201d\n\n### Features of Enviro Ice\n* Users can dispose of Enviro Ice packs by feeding indoor or outdoor plants with their\nnitrogen-based refrigerant gel after diluting it with water. They can then toss the emptied pouch\ninto the trash or recycle it where plastic bags are recycled.\n* Your customers will appreciate being able to reduce the packaging waste they send to the landfill\nwhile helping their plants flourish.\n* Enviro Ice cold packs are available ambient or frozen in sizes ranging from 12 to 80 ounces.\n\nView more details by downloading our [product data][131] and [safety data][132] sheets, or request\nto [order Enviro Ice here][133].\n\n[ Request A Quote ][134]\n\n# A Plant Food Gel That\u2019s Also Drain Safe\n\n## **ENVIRO ICE**\n\n## **ENVIRO ICE**\n\nDescription\n\nImprove the user experience and highlight your dedication to sustainability with Enviro Ice gel\npacks. Enviro Ice is the market\u2019s first gel pack that doubles as \u201cplant food.\u201d\n\n### Features of Enviro Ice\n* Users can dispose of Enviro Ice packs by feeding indoor or outdoor plants with their\nnitrogen-based refrigerant gel after diluting it with water. They can then toss the emptied pouch\ninto the trash or recycle it where plastic bags are recycled.\n* Your customers will appreciate being able to reduce the packaging waste they send to the landfill\nwhile helping their plants flourish.\n* Enviro Ice cold packs are available ambient or frozen in sizes ranging from 12 to 80 ounces.\n\nView more details by downloading our [product data][135] and [safety data][136] sheets, or request\nto [order Enviro Ice here][137].\n\nSizes\nMOQ: 4 Pallets\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT\u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) L X W X H\u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502POUNDS PER CASE\u2502CASES PER PALLET\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25