            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Life Sciences][131] \u203a Cold Chain Shipping for Vaccines\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Life Sciences][134] \u203a Cold Chain Shipping for Vaccines\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Vaccines\n\n## Cold Chain Shipping for Vaccines\n\nPelton Shepherd is a trusted resource in the dynamic field of providing vaccine shipping solutions\nfor temperature control. Developed to facilitate the unique demands of vaccine handling, our range\nof gel packs for shipping pharmaceuticals provides top-tier temperature control solutions.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Compliance and Efficacy as Key Variables in Vaccine Shipping\n\nThe Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) requires refrigerated vaccines to be\nkept [between 36 and 46 degrees Fahrenheit][136] (2 to 8 degrees Celsius). Live vaccines, such as\nthose for chickenpox and shingles, must be stored frozen and are considered extremely\ntemperature-sensitive. Specific product protocols must be followed to ensure strict\ncompliance. Best [pharma shipping practices provide clear guidelines][137] and regulations regarding\nthe packaging requirements and optimal temperatures.\n\nMaintaining full compliance requires careful monitoring and attention to detail during each part of\nthe cold chain shipping process. While avoiding temperature rises is often top of mind when shipping\nvaccines, [cold-weather shipping][138] brings its own challenges.\n\nWith planning and state-of-the-art modern packaging solutions from Pelton Shepherd, successful\nvaccine shipping becomes a reliable process. We meet or exceed industry standards for cold chain\npackaging, including those that apply to vaccine shipping. Our team can provide documentation at\nyour request.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][139]\n\n## Offering Wholesale Cold Chain Supplies\n\nThe inclusion of refrigerants in containers containing vaccines is standard to ensure uniform\ncooling and prevent temperature excursions. Pelton Shepherd gel packs for shipping pharmaceuticals\ngo beyond conventional methods to deliver reliable, cost-effective solutions. Our innovative range\nof gel packs includes products created to facilitate the [regulations of specific pharma\nproducts,][140] such as vaccines, and provide consistent, stable temperature control.\n\nShipping frozen vaccines with gel packs is possible when close attention is given to each aspect of\nthe packaging and shipping process. Augment gel pack efficacy by using [quality insulated\npackaging][141] and fillers, which provide additional thermal barriers so vaccines stay within tight\nthermal ranges. We offer gel packs in various dimensions and weight specifications to suit your\nshipment. Our production process includes batch testing for temperature consistency and puncture\nresistance. This statistical process control ensures our production continuously meets stringent\nquality requirements before customers use the product.\n\nOur range of reusable cold packs suitable for cold chain shipping of vaccines includes the\nfollowing:\n* **Glacier Temp:** Incorporating Glacier Ice\u2122, EcoGel\u2122, Glacier Moisture Guard and Glacier Foam\nBricks, Pelton Shepherd [Glacier Temp cold chain solutions][142] include cost-effective shipping\noptions that can be tailored to meet the requirements of specific products. Glacier Ice\u2122 gel\npacks, which have a long record in the pharmaceutical industry, are now supported with designs\nfeaturing attributes such as puncture-resistant material and moisture-wicking properties.\n* **TerraTemp: **Delivering reliable temperature control solutions, [Pelton Shepherd TerraTemp gel\npacks][143] combine user-friendly design with eco-friendly practices. Terra Ice\u2122 and Vortec Ice\u2122\ngel packs offer modern, accurate options for ensuring the cold chain when shipping vaccines.\n\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nIncorporating Glacier Ice\u2122, EcoGel\u2122, Glacier Moisture Guard and Glacier Foam Bricks, Pelton\nShepherd [Glacier Temp cold chain solutions][144] include cost-effective shipping options that can\nbe tailored to meet the requirements of specific products.\n\nGlacier Ice\u2122 gel packs, which have a long record in the pharmaceutical industry, are now supported\nwith designs featuring attributes such as puncture-resistant solutions and moisture-wicking\nproperties. Certain designs, like Glacier Foam Bricks, also save space and minimize in-transit\nmovement.\n\n[ Learn More ][145]\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nDelivering reliable temperature control solutions, [Pelton Shepherd TerraTemp gel\npacks][146] combine user-friendly design with eco-friendly practices. Terra Ice\u2122 and Vortec Ice\u2122 gel\npacks offer modern, accurate options for ensuring the cold chain when shipping vaccines. They\nmaintain effective performance while offering environmental benefits. Both maintain a eutectic point\nof 32 degrees Fahrenheit.\n\nThe packs are nontoxic, compostable and recyclable. Some designs enable safe gel disposal down the\ndrain, while others can be sent to the landfill whole and will break down over time.\n\n[ Learn More ][147]\n\n## Custom Solutions\n\nSome applications are more demanding than others. If yours needs particular characteristics besides\nthose required by our gel packs, we may be able to develop a custom solution. We can collaborate\nwith you to learn your needs and determine the ideal design.\n\n### Reliable Access for Scaling Operations\n\nDemand surges, such as those driven by new vaccine rollouts, require reliability and flexibility.\nPelton Shepherd maintains a robust manufacturing capacity and flexible production to ensure you\nreceive a consistent supply. We strategically monitor our inventory and plan for risks so you always\nhave the cold chain shipping solutions you need, even during demand spikes.\n\n### High-Quality Gel Packs Optimize Costs\n\nWe invest in testing to ensure our gel packs withstand the shipping process \u2014 this commitment to\nresearch and development results in a high-quality, reliable product. Vaccine producers and shippers\nthat partner with us gain the peace of mind that their products will arrive protected from\ntemperature variations and punctures.\n\nAs a pharmaceutical packaging supplier, we prioritize quality to help ensure shipments arrive in the\nneeded condition. You gain a reliable, long-term investment when you choose us for cold chain\nsolutions.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Offers Comprehensive Vaccine Shipping Solutions\n\nPelton Shepherd Industries has been a leader in developing innovative products to maintain the cold\nchain [for over seven decades][148]. Our comprehensive [range of gel pack solutions][149] includes\ncost-effective and sustainable options that prevent temperature fluctuations. They are ideally\nsuited for temperature-sensitive products such as vaccines during last-mile deliveries.\n\n## Why Trust Us as Your Vaccine Gel Pack Manufacturer?\n\nWe [specialize in solutions][150] for applications like the life sciences industry. Our knowledge of\napplicable industry standards, such as the strict vaccine storage and handling requirements, enables\nus to deliver compliant solutions.\n\nOur team understands that health and well-being depend on our products, so we work hard to develop\neffective solutions for these sensitive shipments. We\u2019re committed to continuous improveme"
