            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Sustainable yet cost effective!\n\n# Sustainable And Cost Effective\n\n## **Vortec Ice\u2122**\n\nIncorporate sustainability into your cold chain without straining your budget with Vortec Ice\u2122\ndrain-safe gel packs.\n\n### Features of Vortec Ice\u2122\n* Vortec Ice\u2122 is our most cost-effective, eco-friendly refrigerant gel.\n* Choose sizes ranging from 12 to 80 ounces, ambient or frozen, to meet your packaging requirements.\n* Offer a cost-effective way to reduce the impact on greenhouse gas emissions.\n* Vortec Ice\u2122 are recyclable gel packs that are cost-effective and sustainable.\n* Drain and septic safe\n* Have a eutectic point of 32 F\n\nBy our estimates, garbage trucks transporting the weight of one pallet\u2019s worth of gel packs to the\nlandfill generate 56 lbs. of CO2 emissions. Drain-safe gel packs divert the gel away from landfills\nand offer a cost-effective way to reduce the impact on greenhouse gas emissions.\n\nOur Vortec Ice\u2122 gel packs contain a drain-safe gel, meaning you can cut the pouch corner and safely\n[pour the gel down the drain][131]. You can then recycle the pouch in the same way you recycle your\nplastic bags. Vortec Ice\u2122 packs are also septic-safe, allowing for multiple uses.\n\nFor the most cost-effective and sustainable option, choose Vortec Ice\u2122. Download our [product\ndata][132] and [safety data][133] sheets for details, or [order Vortec Ice\u2122 packs][134] today.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n\n# Sustainable And Cost Effective\n\n## **Vortec Ice\u2122**\n\n## **Vortec Ice\u2122**\n\nDescription\n\nIncorporate sustainability into your cold chain without straining your budget with Vortec Ice\u2122\ndrain-safe gel packs.\n\n### Features of Vortec Ice\u2122\n* Vortec Ice\u2122 is our most cost-effective, eco-friendly refrigerant gel.\n* Choose sizes ranging from 12 to 80 ounces, ambient or frozen, to meet your packaging requirements.\n* Offer a cost-effective way to reduce the impact on greenhouse gas emissions.\n* Vortec Ice\u2122 are recyclable gel packs that are cost-effective and sustainable.\n* Drain and septic safe\n* Have a eutectic point of 32 F\n\nBy our estimates, garbage trucks transporting the weight of one pallet\u2019s worth of gel packs to the\nlandfill generate 56 lbs. of CO2 emissions. Drain-safe gel packs divert the gel away from landfills\nand offer a cost-effective way to reduce the impact on greenhouse gas emissions.\n\nOur Vortec Ice\u2122 gel packs contain a drain-safe gel, meaning you can cut the pouch corner and safely\n[pour the gel down the drain][136]. You can then recycle the pouch in the same way you recycle your\nplastic bags. Vortec Ice\u2122 packs are also septic-safe, allowing for multiple uses.\n\nFor the most cost-effective and sustainable option, choose Vortec Ice\u2122. Download our [product\ndata][137] and [safety data][138] sheets for details, or [order Vortec Ice\u2122 packs][139] today.\n\nSizes\nNEW!\nMOQ: 4 Pallets\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT\u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) L X W X H\u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502POUNDS PER CASE\u2502CASES PER PALLET\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nVI-12B-48 \u250212 OZ.\u25026\u201d X 6\u201d X 3/4\u201d \u250248 \u250237 \u250250\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\