u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFAQ\n\n### What Are The Benefits Of Vortec Ice\u2122?\n\nFeatures and advantages of Vortec Ice\u2122 include:\n* **Drain-safe: **During disposal, users can pour the water-based gel directly down the drain\nwithout impacting PVC pipes or septic systems. They can then recycle the film with their plastic\nbags.\n* **Puncture-resistant: **The film is made from a strong, puncture-resistant #4 recyclable plastic.\nThe durable exterior promotes longevity and decreases leakage risk to guard products against\nmoisture.\n* **Septic-safe: **The specially formulated gel in Vortec Ice\u2122 will not cause clogs or degrade\nseptic systems. Users can safely and conveniently dispose of the gel using any wastewater removal\nsystem in your facility \u2014 whether by flushing the gel down the toilet or pouring it down a sink or\nfloor drain.\n* **Reusable:** With their nontoxic gel and puncture-resistant, easy-to-clean pouch, Vortec Ice\u2122\npacks allow virtually endless reuses by end users or through a send-back program.\n* **Reliable: **Vortec Ice\u2122 is backed by over 70 years of industry experience. We design and\nmanufacture all of our gel packs to provide superior performance and temperature control you can\ntrust.\n\n### How Can I Get Samples of Vortec Ice\u2122?\n\n[Contact Us!][140]\n\n### What Is Meant by \"It's Like Saving 12,000 Trees?\u201d\n\nWe calculated the carbon footprint generated by transporting 5 pounds of discarded gel on a typical\nroute to the landfill. We multiplied that by the number of gel packs we expect to sell at scale over\nthe next several years.\n\nThat yearly CO2 mitigation created by avoiding sending this gel weight to landfills equals that\nof 12,000 live trees. Said differently, 12,000 adult trees remove the same amount of CO2 from the\natmosphere that we will avoid generating from transporting gels to landfills.\n\n### How Do I Dispose of Vortec Ice\u2122?\n\nYou can find the complete instructions in this [VIDEO][141]\n\nYou can recycle the pouch and dispose of the gel by cutting a corner of the pouch and then\npouring the gel down a drain \u2014 ideally with running water \u2014 or flushing it down a toilet. Rinse the\nplastic pouch and recycle it at a facility accepting #4 plastic films or bags.\n\nAlternatively, you can dispose of whole gel packs by tossing them in a waste bin.\n\n### Where Can I Find the Safety Data Sheet (SDS) or Material Safety Data Sheet for Vortec Ice\u2122?\n\nTo download the Vortec Ice\u2122 SDS, [click here][142].\n\n### What Is the Minimum Order Quantity for Vortec Ice\u2122?\n\nFour pallets.\n\n### I Have More Questions. Where Should I Look?\n\nThere are answers in our [Business FAQs][143] and [Consumer FAQs][144] sections. Alternatively\n[contact us][145].\n\nSizes\nNEW!\nMOQ: 4 Pallets\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT\u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) L X W X H\u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502POUNDS PER CASE\u2502CASES PER PALLET\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2