rishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a \u201cSweat Proof\u201d to Reduce Risk of Moisture Damage\n\n# \u201cSweat Proof\u201d to Reduce Risk of Moisture Damage\n\n## **GLACIER MOISTURE GUARD**\n\nPrevent costly moisture damage and preserve product quality with Glacier Moisture Guard sweat-proof\ngel packs.\n\n### Features of Glacier Moisture Guard Sweat-Proof Gel Packs.\n* Designed with a unique, moisture-wicking exterior to protect products and packaging materials from\nwater droplets caused by the normal condensation of humidity on the cold gel pack surface.\n* Prevents moisture which can lead to mold and bacteria growth, degrade the taste and texture of\nfood products, and decrease product quality and efficacy.\n* Ensure you and your customers can feel assured that products meet high safety and quality\nstandards upon arrival.\n* Sizes span from 8 to 48 ounces to match your packaging needs.\n\nWith Glacier Moisture Guard ice packs, cold chain shipping is no sweat. [Reach out to order your\nsupply][131] of moisture-resistant ice packs and ship perishables with confidence.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][132]\n\n# \u201cSweat Proof\u201d to Reduce Risk of Moisture Damage\n\n## **GLACIER MOISTURE GUARD**\n\n## **GLACIER MOISTURE GUARD**\n\nDescription\n\nPrevent costly moisture damage and preserve product quality with Glacier Moisture Guard sweat-proof\ngel packs.\n\n### Features of Glacier Moisture Guard Sweat-Proof Gel Packs.\n* Designed with a unique, moisture-wicking exterior to protect products and packaging materials from\nwater droplets caused by the normal condensation of humidity on the cold gel pack surface.\n* Prevents moisture which can lead to mold and bacteria growth, degrade the taste and texture of\nfood products, and decrease product quality and efficacy.\n* Ensure you and your customers can feel assured that products meet high safety and quality\nstandards upon arrival.\n* Sizes span from 8 to 48 ounces to match your packaging needs.\n\nWith Glacier Moisture Guard ice packs, cold chain shipping is no sweat. [Reach out to order your\nsupply][133] of moisture-resistant ice packs and ship perishables with confidence.\n\nSizes\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT\u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) L X W X H\u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502PO