to maximize robustness and reduce cost.\n* **Safe****: **Glacier Moisture Guard packs contain a non-toxic, water-based gel for safety during\nhandling.\n\n### What Are Some Use Cases For Glacier Moisture Guard?\n\nUse Glacier Moisture Guard sweat-proof ice packs as a packaging solution to transport any\nperishable, moisture-sensitive cargo, including:\n* Pharmaceuticals and life science products\n* Foods (especially confections) and beverages\n* Dairy and agricultural products\n* Fresh-cut flowers and floral arrangements\n\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][134]\n* [Perishables][135]\n* [Specialty][136]\n* [Life Sciences][137]\n* [Perishables][138]\n* [Specialty][139]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][140]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][141]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][142]\n* [Physical Therapy][143]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][144]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][145]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][146]\n* [Physical Therapy][147]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][148]\n* [Consumer FAQ][149]\n* [Disposal Instructions][150]\n* [Blog][151]\n* [Business FAQ][152]\n* [Consumer FAQ][153]\n* [Disposal Instructions][154]\n* [Blog][155]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][156]\n* [Location][157]\n* [Success Stories][158]\n* [Join our Team][159]\n* [About Us][160]\n* [Location][161]\n* [Success Stories][162]\n* [Join our Team][163]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][164]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][165]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][166]\n[Terms & Conditions][167]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][168]\n* [Perishables][169]\n* [Specialty][170]\n* [Life Sciences][171]\n* [Perishables][172]\n* [Specialty][173]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][174]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][175]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][176]\n* [Physical Therapy][177]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][178]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][179]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][180]\n* [Physical Therapy][181]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][182]\n* [Consumer FAQ][183]\n* [Disposal Instructions][184]\n* [Blog][185]\n* [Business FAQ][186]\n* [Consumer FAQ][187]\n* [Disposal Instructions][188]\n* [Blog][189]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][190]\n* [Location][191]\n* [Success Stories][192]\n* [Join our Team][193]\n* [About Us][194]\n* [Location][195]\n* [Success Stories][196]\n* [Join our Team][197]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][198]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][199]\n[Terms & Conditions][200]\n[ Request A Quote ][201]\n\n[1]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/covid-19-update/\n[2]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com\n[3]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/\n[4]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/vaccines/\n[5]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/blood-tissue/\n[6]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/clinical-trials/\n[7]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/\n[8"
