            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Glacier Temp\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][132] \u203a Glacier Temp\n\n###### Reliable, Cost-Effective Ice Packs for Shipping\n\n# Glacier Temp\n\nFrom fluctuating ambient temperatures to improper packaging practices, a lot can happen to break the\ncold chain. According to a 2021 survey of shippers, proper last-mile handling and product packaging\nare among the top 10 cold chain challenges worldwide. Keeping shipping costs low while preventing\ntemperature excursions presents yet another challenge.\n\nAt Pelton Shepherd, we understand the obstacles cold chain shippers face. Using over 70 years of\nindustry experience, we\u2019ve designed Glacier Temp gel packs to stand up to these challenges. You can\ncount on Glacier Temp as a cost-effective solution that delivers the temperature control you need.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][133]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs ]\n[ Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs]\n\n### Glacier Ice\u2122\n\n## Ideal Refrigerant for Your Everyday Shipping Needs\n\nWhen you require an everyday refrigerant to manage cold chain shipping costs, choose Glacier Ice\u2122.\n\n### Features of Glacier Ice\u2122\n* Glacier Ice\u2122 is the top gel pack in the United States\n* Trusted by pharmaceutical and meal kit delivery companies for decades\n* Our most economical option and ideal for shipping products one way\n* Features a tough puncture-resistant film, a slow-to-thaw water-based gel and a 30 F eutectic point\n\nGlacier Ice\u2122 gel packs are a highly reliable method for keeping shipments cold during transit.\n\n[LEARN MORE][134][ Request A Quote ][135]\n[EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack ][EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack ]\n[ EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack]\n\n### EcoGel\u2122\n\n## Uniquely Designed Leak-Proof Solution\n\nOur leak-proof EcoGel\u2122 ice packs solve the problem of shipping products with sharp corners.\n\n### Features of EcoGel\u2122\n* EcoGel\u2122 features two layers of protection against leaks \u2014 a robust, puncture-resistant exterior\nand a specially formulated, dough-like gel\n* The gel\u2019s unique consistency keeps it from leaking if a small puncture occurs\n* Enables tight pack-outs and maximizes space efficiency\n\n[LEARN MORE][136][ Request A Quote ][137]\n[GlacierTemp Moisture Guard - Ice Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage ][GlacierTemp Moisture Guard -\nIce Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage ]\n[ GlacierTemp Moisture Guard - Ice Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage]\n\n### Glacier Moisture Guard\n\n## Built to Prevent Moisture Damage\n\nGlacier Moisture Guard is our sweat-proof gel pack.\n\n### Features of Glacier Moisture Guard\n* Sweat-proof\n* Features an innovative, moisture-wicking exterior\n* Absorbs the normal condensation that can form on a gel pack\u2019s surface, protecting packaging\nmaterials from moisture incursion.\n\nOur Glacier Moisture Guard gel packs offer the ideal solution for shipping moisture-sensitive\nproducts like confections and fresh produce. They contain the same gel formulation as Glacier Ice\u2122\ngel packs, so you can count on them for reliable temperature control.\n\n[LEARN MORE][138][ Request A Quote ][139]\n[Glacier Ice Foam Bricks ][Glacier Ice Foam Bricks ]\n[ Glacier Ice Foam Bricks]\n\n### glacier foam brick\n\n## Precisely Shaped for Tight Pack-Outs\n\nIf you require a packaging solution that limits in-transit movement, saves space and provides\nlong-lasting cold, choose Glacier Foam Bricks \u2014 our foam-filled refrigerant blocks.\n\n### Features of Glacier Foam Bricks\n* Offer precise shape tolerances to meet your exact packaging needs\n* Retain their shape throughout the freeze-thaw cycle, enabling optimum space efficiency and tighter\npack-outs\n* An exceptional energy absorption rate that efficiently dissipates heat, protecting perishables\nfrom temperature fluctuations\n\n[LEARN MORE][140][ Request A Quote ][141]\n\n## Contact Us for a Quote\n\nWhen you need reliable and economical gel packs for shipping cold chain products, trust our Glacier\nTemp line. [Reach out to our team for a quote][142] or to learn more about our innovative cold\npacks.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\ntrusted when\nCOLD\nSustainability\nAccuracy\nmatters\n\n## Discover our products\n\nWhatever your priority, our extensive catalog has reliable options to match.\n\n[a picture of two moisture guard gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two\nmoisture guard gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Cura Temp Logo][Cura Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Accuracy Matters\n\nSpecially formulated to maintain precise eutectic points, CuraTemp packs ensure accurate control for\nproducts that require specific temperature excursions.\n\n[ Learn More ][143]\n[Enviro Ice Plant Food][Enviro Ice Plant Food]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nLeading the industry in energy efficiency, environmental safety and recyclability, TerraTemp packs\noffer a sustainable choice with no compromises.\n\n[ Learn More ][144]\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Phone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][145]\n* [Perishables][146]\n* [Specialty][147]\n* [Life Sciences][148]\n* [Perishables][149]\n* [Specialty][150]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][151]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][152]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][153]\n* [Physical Therapy][154]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][155]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][156]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][157]\n* [Physical Therapy][158]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][159]\n* [Consumer FAQ][160]\n* [Disposal Instructions][161]\n* [Blog][162]\n* [Business FAQ][163]\n* [Consumer FAQ][164]\n* [Disposal Instructions][165]\n* [Blog][166]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][167]\n* [Location][168]\n* [Success Stories][169]\n* [Join our Team][170]\n* [About Us][171]\n* [Location][172]\n* [Success Stories][173]\n* [Join our Team][174]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][175]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][176]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][177]\n[Terms & Conditions][178]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][179]\n* [Perishables][180]\n* [Specialty][181]\n* [Life Sciences][182]\n* [Perishables][183]\n* [Specialty][184]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][185]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][186]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][187]\n* [Physical Therapy][188]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][189]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][190]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][191]\n* [Physical Therapy][192]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][193]\n* [Consumer FAQ][194]\n* [Disposal Instructions][195]\n* [Blog][196]\n* [Business FAQ][197]\n* [Consumer FAQ][198]\n* [Disposal Instructions][199]\n* [Blog][200]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][201]\n* [Location][202]\n* [Success Stories][203]\n* [Join our Team][204]\n* [About Us][205]\n* [Location][206]\n* [Success Stories][207]\n* [Join our Team][208]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][209]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][210]\n[Terms & Conditions][211]\n[ Request A Quote ][212]\n\n[1]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/covid-19-update/\n[2]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com\n[3]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/\n[4]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/vaccines/\n[5]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/"
