            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a CryoTemp Gel Packs\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][132] \u203a CryoTemp Gel Packs\n\n# Dry Ice Alternatives\n\n## CryoTemp Gel Packs\n\nAfter extensive in-house testing* of frozen shipments, Pelton Shepherd designed CryoTemp, a family\nof reliable gel packs for the shipment of frozen items and the best alternative to dry ice.\n\nCryoTemp Gel Packs have been designed to maintain a temperature below 25F during their thawing\nphase. They can be frozen** and handled like traditional packs.\n\nUnlike dry ice, CryoTemp gel packs do not sublimate, are not hazardous nor subject to shipping fees\nand seasonal price fluctuations.\n\n(*)Prepared or raw meat, prepared or raw vegetables, prepared meals and most deserts thaw from\nfrozen around 28F, a higher temperature than Cryo Temp product eutectic setting.\n\n(**) We recommend that CryoTemp gel packs be conditioned at temperatures close to 0 to 5F like\ntraditional gel packs.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][133]\n[Cryo Ice below 25F ][Cryo Ice below 25F ]\n[ Cryo Ice below 25F][ Cryo Ice below 25F]\n\n### Cryo Ice\u2122\n\n## The Best Alternative to Dry Ice\n\nA no-nonsense alternative to dry ice to keep your payload frozen.\n\n### Features of Cryo Ice\u2122 Gel Packs\n* Made from a specially formulated water-based gel that maintains a temperature **lower than\n25F** during thawing\n* Ideal everyday refrigerant solution for transporting pharmaceuticals and perishables that need to\nremain frozen\n* Cryo Ice\u2122 is our **most cost-effective dry ice alternative**\n* Simple and much safer than dry ice\n\n[LEARN MORE][134][ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Cryo Ice below 25F ][Cryo Ice below 25F ]\n[ Cryo Ice below 25F][ Cryo Ice below 25F]\n\n### Tundra Ice\u2122\n\n## The Most Eco-Friendly Alternative to Dry Ice\n\nCOMING SOON\n\n[Contact us][136][ Request A Quote ][137]\n\n## Contact Us for a Quote\n\nPelton Shepherd has been the industry leader in refrigerant solutions for over 70 years. While a lot\nhas changed, our commitment to innovation and pushing the limits of existing cold chain materials\nhas remained the same.\n\nWe understand that every degree matters when handling temperature-sensitive perishable products. We\nalso value sustainability and helping businesses incorporate eco-friendly gel packs into their cold\nchain systems. That\u2019s why we\u2019ve constantly innovated to uncover new solutions to meet the needs of\nmodern organizations.\n\nOur ice packs for shipping are manufactured to the highest standards to prevent rips, tears and\nmoisture damage. They are also produced in our U.S.-based factories, and we partner with local cold\nstorage facilities to protect the integrity of our products.\n\nConnect with [our team for a quote][138] or to learn more about our wholesale gel ice packs and\nreusable, recyclable and biodegradable designs.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\ntrusted when\nCOLD\nSustainability\nAccuracy\nmatters\n\n## Discover our products\n\nWhatever your priority, our extensive catalog has reliable options to match.\n\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Ice Refrigerant for Perishables][Glacier Ice - Gel Ice Refrigerant for\nPerishables]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nBacked by decades of performance, our GlacierTemp cold packs and foam bricks offer a range of price\npoints and features for shipping needs that require +30\u00b0F formulations.\n\n[ Learn More ][139]\n[a picture of two moisture guard gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two\nmoisture guard gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Cura Temp Logo][Cura Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Accuracy Matters\n\nSpecially formulated to maintain precise eutectic points, CuraTemp packs ensure accurate control for\nproducts that require specific temperature excursions.\n\n[ Learn More ][140]\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* LinkedIn\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][141]\n* [Perishables][142]\n* [Specialty][143]\n* [Life Sciences][144]\n* [Perishables][145]\n* [Specialty][146]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][147]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][148]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][149]\n* [Physical Therapy][150]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][151]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][152]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][153]\n* [Physical Therapy][154]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][155]\n* [Consumer FAQ][156]\n* [Disposal Instructions][157]\n* [Blog][158]\n* [Business FAQ][159]\n* [Consumer FAQ][160]\n* [Disposal Instructions][161]\n* [Blog][162]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][163]\n* [Location][164]\n* [Success Stories][165]\n* [Join our Team][166]\n* [About Us][167]\n* [Location][168]\n* [Success Stories][169]\n* [Join our Team][170]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][171]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][172]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][173]\n[Terms & Conditions][174]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][175]\n* [Perishables][176]\n* [Specialty][177]\n* [Life Sciences][178]\n* [Perishables][179]\n* [Specialty][180]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][181]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][182]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][183]\n* [Physical Therapy][184]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][185]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][186]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][187]\n* [Physical Therapy][188]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][189]\n* [Consumer FAQ][190]\n* [Disposal Instructions][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [Business FAQ][193]\n* [Consumer FAQ][194]\n* [Disposal Instructions][195]\n* [Blog][196]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][197]\n* [Location][198]\n* [Success Stories][199]\n* [Join our Team][200]\n* [About Us][201]\n* [Location][202]\n* [Success Stories][203]\n* [Join our Team][204]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][205]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][206]\n[Terms & Conditions][207]\n[ Request A Quote ][208]\n\n[1]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/covid-19-update/\n[2]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com\n[3]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/\n[4]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/vaccines/\n[5]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/blood-tissue/\n[6]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/clinical-trials/\n[7]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/\n[8]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/dairy/\n[9]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/fresh-food/\n[10]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/meal-kits/\n[11]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/meat/\n[12]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/physical-therapy/\n[13]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/specialty/\n[14]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/delivery-program/\n[15]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/cold-chain-packaging/\n[16]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/\n[17]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/terra-temp/\n[18]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/glacier-temp/\n[19]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/cryo-temp/\n[20]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/cura-temp/\n[21]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/business-faq/\n[22]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/consumer-faq/\n[23]: https://gelpack.info/\n[24]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/blog/\n[25]: "
