            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Cura Temp\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][132] \u203a Cura Temp\n\n###### Gel Packs for Precise Temperature Control\n\n# CuraTemp Gel Packs\n\nMany factors can impact consistent, accurate temperature control throughout the cold chain, from\nunforeseen traffic delays to improper package handling. These factors make it challenging to prevent\ntemperature deviations, potentially impacting the quality of perishables and leading to product\nloss.\n\nConsider that pharmaceutical companies lose $35 billion annually due to temperature-control\nmalfunctions \u2014 a number that can be prevented. Gel packs that enable precise temperature control\noffer a cost-effective way to mitigate product spoilage and loss.\n\nSpecially formulated to maintain precise eutectic points, you can count on CuraTemp gel packs to\nensure accurate control for shipping temperature-sensitive products like pharmaceuticals, foods,\nbeverages and other perishables.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][133]\n[a picture of 4 different sizes of mat white gel packs on a dark blue background ]\n[ a picture of 4 different sizes of mat white gel packs on a dark blue background]\n\n### CuraTemp Pro\n\n## Premium Gel Ice Refrigerant\n\nCuraTemp Pro is our premium gel ice pack, crafted to prevent temperature excursions when it matters\nmost.\n\n### Features of CuraTemp Pro\n* Self-insulating composition designed to maintain a consistent temperature throughout transit by\nreducing heat transfer from the environment to the refrigerant\n* Available in eutectic points ranging from -10 F to +30 F. The +10 F formulation keeps shipments\nfrozen during transport\n* CuraTemp is ideal for shipping perishables with strict temperature requirements, including\nvaccines, insulin, dairy products and seafood\n* Expand minimally during freezing, meaning they retain shape and remain mostly unchanged as they\nthaw\n* You can effectively use CureTemp Pro for tight pack-outs and maximizing container space\n* Sizes range from 8 to 68 ounces to meet your packaging needs and are available at various price\npoints\n* Choose from reusable or disposable CuraTemp Pro packs to suit your preferences\n\n[LEARN MORE][134][ Request A Quote ][135]\n\n## Contact Our Team for a Quote\n\nWhen precise and consistent temperature control is a concern, CuraTemp gel packs provide peace of\nmind. To order CuraTemp packs, [contact our team][136] for a quote. We\u2019re also happy to answer any\nquestions you have about CuraTemp or recommend the best refrigerant solution for your needs.\n\nWhether you need to prevent temperature deviations throughout inventory transfer or during last-mile\ndelivery, you can count on our CuraTemp gel packs to perform.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\ntrusted when\nCOLD\nSustainability\nAccuracy\nmatters\n\n## Discover our products\n\nWhatever your priority, our extensive catalog has reliable options to match.\n\n[a picture of a moisture guard gel pack in a chilled food delivery box][a picture of a moisture\nguard gel pack in a chilled food delivery box]\n[New GlacierTemp Logo][New GlacierTemp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nBacked by decades of performance, our GlacierTemp cold packs and foam bricks offer a range of price\npoints and features for shipping needs that require +30\u00b0F formulations.\n\n[ Learn More ][137]\n[a picture of a Enviro Ice -12C gel pack with a frozen food delivery box][a picture of a Enviro Ice\n-12C gel pack with a frozen food delivery box]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nLeading the industry in energy efficiency, environmental safety and recyclability, TerraTemp packs\noffer a sustainable choice with no compromises.\n\n[New TerraTemp Logo][New TerraTemp Logo]\n[ Learn More ][138]\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Instagram\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][139]\n* [Perishables][140]\n* [Specialty][141]\n* [Life Sciences][142]\n* [Perishables][143]\n* [Specialty][144]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][145]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][146]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][147]\n* [Physical Therapy][148]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][149]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][150]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][151]\n* [Physical Therapy][152]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][153]\n* [Consumer FAQ][154]\n* [Disposal Instructions][155]\n* [Blog][156]\n* [Business FAQ][157]\n* [Consumer FAQ][158]\n* [Disposal Instructions][159]\n* [Blog][160]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][161]\n* [Location][162]\n* [Success Stories][163]\n* [Join our Team][164]\n* [About Us][165]\n* [Location][166]\n* [Success Stories][167]\n* [Join our Team][168]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][169]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][170]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][171]\n[Terms & Conditions][172]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][173]\n* [Perishables][174]\n* [Specialty][175]\n* [Life Sciences][176]\n* [Perishables][177]\n* [Specialty][178]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][179]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][180]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][181]\n* [Physical Therapy][182]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][183]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][184]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][185]\n* [Physical Therapy][186]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][187]\n* [Consumer FAQ][188]\n* [Disposal Instructions][189]\n* [Blog][190]\n* [Business FAQ][191]\n* [Consumer FAQ][192]\n* [Disposal Instructions][193]\n* [Blog][194]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][195]\n* [Location][196]\n* [Success Stories][197]\n* [Join our Team][198]\n* [About Us][199]\n* [Location][200]\n* [Success Stories][201]\n* [Join our Team][202]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][203]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][204]\n[Terms & Conditions][205]\n[ Request A Quote ][206]\n\n[1]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/covid-19-update/\n[2]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com\n[3]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/\n[4]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/vaccines/\n[5]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/blood-tissue/\n[6]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/clinical-trials/\n[7]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/\n[8]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/dairy/\n[9]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/fresh-food/\n[10]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/meal-kits/\n[11]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/meat/\n[12]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/physical-therapy/\n[13]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/specialty/\n[14]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/delivery-program/\n[15]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/cold-chain-packaging/\n[16]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/\n[17]: h