            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Perishables][131] \u203a Cutting-Edge Ice and Gel Packs for Shipping\nDairy\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Perishables][134] \u203a Cutting-Edge Ice and Gel Packs for Shipping\nDairy\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Dairy\n\n## Cutting-Edge Ice and Gel Packs for Shipping Dairy\n\nIn an industry where time and temperature are always of the essence, the dairy industry relies on\ndependable cold chain shipping for distribution. Ensure your temperature-sensitive dairy shipments\nare delivered fresh with gel pack solutions from Pelton Shepherd. Our comprehensive range of\nrefrigerants includes products that provide accurate and sustained temperature control for shipping\neverything from fresh milk and cream to ice cream and cheese.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Why Choose Pelton Shepherd Cold Chain Solutions?\n\nWith demand for dairy products increasing and a high risk of spoilage during shipping, it makes\nsense to use top-tier cooling products you can rely on. Pelton Shepherd makes innovative and\nsustainable gel pack technologies available to the dairy industry. Our unrivaled commitment to\ndeveloping cutting-edge products to meet the unique shipping challenges sets us apart.\n\nOur cold pack solutions provide convenience and safety over conventional cooling solutions such as\ndry ice. Benefits of Pelton Shepherd gel packs for the dairy industry include:\n\nTrusted Supply Chains\n\nOur [industry-leading customer service][136] paired with 8 manufacturing locations in the US insure\na reliable, steady flow of gel packs for your operations with minimal shipping costs\n\nAccurate Temperature Parameters\n\nOur gel packs enable shippers to avoid temperature excursions and maintain product freshness.\n\nCustom Product Solutions\n\nWe can provide [customized gel pack designs ][137]on large orders when specific temperature control\nrequirements or sizes are needed.\n\nSafe and Sustainable Features\n\nOur [eco-friendly TerraTemp line][138] offers many options to reduce the environmental impact\ntypically associated with the disposal of cold chain shipping materials.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][139]\n\n## Our Gel Packs for Shipping Dairy\n\nOptimal temperature ranges for maintaining the safety and integrity of dairy products vary\ngreatly. Whether you need to ship fresh [milk during a heatwave][140] or keep fresh cream shipments\nfrom freezing in winter, Pelton Shepherd has what you need to maintain strict temperature control.\n\nShip dairy products confidently with the following gel pack lines:\n* **Glacier Temp:** This range is dependable and budget-friendly. The [Glacier Temp line][141] has\nbeen trusted by the food and pharmaceutical industry for decades to provide reliable temperature\ncontrol. Dairy in breakable or flimsy packaging will benefit from our [Glacier Foam Bricks][142],\nwhich protect products from in-transit damage.\n* **TerraTemp:** This line is ideal when reliable temperature control and eco-friendly practices are\ntop of mind. With a eutectic point of 32\u00b0F, [Terra Ice\u2122 gel packs][143] are ideal for keeping\ndairy shipments cool and are the only gel packs designed to be tossed whole into the compost bin.\n\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nThis range is dependable and budget-friendly. The [Glacier Temp line][144] has been trusted by the\nfood and pharmaceutical industry for decades to provide reliable temperature control. Dairy in\nbreakable or flimsy packaging will benefit from our [Glacier Foam Bricks][145], which protect\nproducts from in-transit damage.\n\n[ Learn More ][146]\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nThis line is ideal when reliable temperature control and eco-friendly practices are top of mind.\nWith a eutectic point of 32\u00b0F, [Terra Ice\u2122 gel packs][147] are ideal for keeping dairy shipments\ncool and are the only gel packs designed to be tossed whole into the compost bin.\n\n[ Learn More ][148]\n\n## How to Ship Dairy Products\n\nTemperature is the [most critical factor][149] affecting the quality of dairy products, especially\nmilk. Harmful bacteria quickly proliferate in milk when the temperature rises above 40 degrees\nFahrenheit, making it essential that the cold chain is preserved from producer to end user. Pelton\nShepherd has [refrigerants for perishables][150] that facilitate smooth, reliable shipping.\n\nSteps to ensure quality and freshness:\n* Thoroughly plan transit logistics\n* Pack products in [insulated shipping boxes][151] that also block out light\n* Choose top-quality ice packs for shipping dairy\n* Include [temperature monitoring processes][152]\n* Avoid temperature excursions during last-mile deliveries by including additional coolants.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Safeguard Your Dairy Shipments With Gel Packs From Pelton Shepherd\n\nPelton Shepherd has produced cutting-edge cooling solutions for shipping perishables for over 70\nyears. Our gel packs are trusted to deliver dependable temperature control to maintain product\nfreshness. To learn more about our cooling solutions for the dairy industry, [contact us\ntoday][153]!\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* LinkedIn\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][154]\n* [Perishables][155]\n* [Specialty][156]\n* [Life Sciences][157]\n* [Perishables][158]\n* [Specialty][159]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][160]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][161]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][162]\n* [Physical Therapy][163]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][164]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][165]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][166]\n* [Physical Therapy][167]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][168]\n* [Consumer FAQ][169]\n* [Disposal Instructions][170]\n* [Blog][171]\n* [Business FAQ][172]\n* [Consumer FAQ][173]\n* [Disposal Instructions][174]\n* [Blog][175]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][176]\n* [Location][177]\n* [Success Stories][178]\n* [Join our Team][179]\n* [About Us][180]\n* [Location][181]\n* [Success Stories][182]\n* [Join our Team][183]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][184]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][185]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][186]\n[Terms & Conditions][187]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][188]\n* [Perishables][189]\n* [Specialty][190]\n* [Life Sciences][191]\n* [Perishables][192]\n* [Specialty][193]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][194]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][195]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][196]\n* [Physical Therapy][197]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][198]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][199]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][200]\n* [Physical Therapy][201]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][202]\n* [Consumer FAQ][203]\n* [Disposal Instructions][204]\n* [Blog][205]\n* [Business FAQ][206]\n* [Consumer FAQ][207]\n* [Disposal Instructions][208]\n* [Blog][209]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][210]\n* [Location][211]\n* [Success Stories][212]\n* [Join our Team][213]\n* [About Us][214]\n* [Location][215]\n* [Success Stories][216]\n* [Join our Team][217]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][218]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk for"
