            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Life Sciences][131] \u203a Gel Packs for Shipping Blood and Tissue\nSamples\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Life Sciences][134] \u203a Gel Packs for Shipping Blood and Tissue\nSamples\n\n## Gel Packs for Shipping Blood and Tissue Samples\n\nIn the dynamic fields of science and medicine, rely on specialized products from Pelton Shepherd to\nship pharmaceuticals and biologicals confidently. Our comprehensive range of gel packs offers\nconvenience, compliance and reliability in ensuring complete integrity when shipping blood and\ntissue samples. Our focus on development means we keep up with changing requirements and continue to\noffer cutting-edge, cost-effective cold packs that help keep transport costs down.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Why Choose Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs?\n\nPelton Shepherd offers tissue and blood sample shipping supplies and services to ensure precise\ntemperature control and stability throughout transit. Our gel packs are [trusted in medical and\nscientific settings][136], such as hospitals, laboratories and clinics, to deliver:\n\nVersatile Temperature Control\n\nOur wide range of gel packs allows customization for blood and tissue samples to prevent degradation\nand ensure integrity.\n\nOutstanding Performance\n\nOur gel packs [consistently meet the requirements][137] of specialized industries.\n\nCost-Effective Products\n\nMany of our gel packs are reusable and designed to withstand multiple freeze-thaw cycles, making\nthem an economical choice.\n\nTailored Solutions\n\nOur experienced team can work with you to meet your unique business needs.\n\nSustainable Options\n\nOur TerraTemp line addresses concerns about environmental impact and aligns with sustainability\ngoals while delivering outstanding performance.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][138]\n\n## Explore Our Gel Packs for Blood and Tissue Samples\n\nBlood and tissue sample shipping is considerably nuanced in terms of size and material, often\nrequiring innovative packaging solutions to facilitate transportation. Pelton Shepherd offers gel\npacks in a range of varieties, sizes and eutectic points to provide peace of mind that your\nbiological samples are stored correctly. We can even create customized cold packs if specific sizes\nor properties are required.\n\nGel packs provide versatile cold storage options and are ideal for refrigerating and [shipping\ntemperature-sensitive materials][139] and products such as blood and tissue samples. Specifically\ndesigned to prevent temperature excursions, our water-based gel packs can be frozen or refrigerated\nbased on temperature shipping requirements. Some packs we offer are reusable, enabling you to\nmaintain effective cost control.\n\nExplore our two most popular gel pack ranges to find the refrigerant that suits your\nunique requirements.\n* **Glacier Temp: **Keep costs down without compromising on quality. Pelton Shepherd [Glacier Temp\nshipping gel packs][140] incorporate puncture-resistant EcoGel\u2122 and moisture-wicking Glacier\nMoisture Guard gel pack solutions that mold around samples and protect moisture-sensitive\nproducts.\n* **TerraTemp:** Our eco-friendly [TerraTemp ice pack range][141] combines accurate temperature\ncontrol with sustainable practices. Terra Ice\u2122 provides the same performance as regular ice packs\nin a compostable design.\n\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nKeep costs down without compromising on quality. Pelton Shepherd [Glacier Temp shipping gel\npacks][142] incorporate puncture-resistant EcoGel\u2122, which offers two layers of protection \u2014 the\nresistant exterior and a specially formulated gel. Even in the event of a small puncture, the\ndough-like gel will remain inside the ice pack.\n\nThe moisture-wicking Glacier Moisture Guard gel pack solutions mold around samples and protect\nmoisture-sensitive products with a sweat-proof exterior. The design absorbs the normal condensation\nthat forms on a gel pack surface to preserve the samples\u2019 integrity and diagnostic value.\n\n[ Learn More ][143]\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nOur eco-friendly [TerraTemp ice pack range][144] combines accurate temperature control with\nsustainable practices. Terra Ice\u2122 provides the same performance as regular ice packs in a\ncompostable design. The formula is completely biodegradable, and end users can simply toss it into\nthe trash or compost, where it will break down.\n\n[ Learn More ][145]\n\n### The Trusted Solution for Safe and Stable Specimen Transport\n\nGel ice packs are the superior choice for shipping blood and tissue samples. Compared to dry ice,\nthey are safer for handlers and recipients. They are also more cost-effective and easier to store\nand handle. Their stable, controlled temperatures make them ideal for preserving sample integrity\nwithout the risk of freezing. Here are a few reasons our solutions stand out for this application:\n* **Nontoxic:** Gel packs use a water-based gel, which won\u2019t compromise samples, even in the rare\nevent that a breach occurs. They are also safe for handlers.\n* **Puncture-resistant:** We\u2019ve developed a strong exterior that holds up to the demands of transit\nto prevent leaks.\n* **Temperature stable:** Our solutions prioritize sample integrity by maintaining the required\ntemperature throughout shipping with specially formulated gels and durable exteriors.\n\n### Common Applications of Gel Packs for Blood and Tissue Samples\n\nWe offer solutions to support numerous facilities responsible for handling biological samples, such\nas:\n* **Diagnostic labs:** Transport between collection sites and central testing facilities requires\neffective gel packs to ensure accurate analysis.\n* **Clinical trials:** Pharmaceutical businesses and contract research organizations may need\nclinical trial shipping supplies for patient blood and tissue transport.\n* **Hospitals and clinics:** Send blood, biopsy and pathology samples to labs for diagnosis and\npatient care.\n* **Bio-banks:** Research centers may need to transport and store biological specimens used in their\nstudies.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Why Trust Us for Cold Shipping Packs for Blood and Tissue?\n\nTrust your cold chain shipping to us in an industry where reliability matters. Here are a few\nreasons why:\n* **Experience:** Store and transport your temperature-sensitive biological material [with an\nexperienced partner][146] who has been leading the cold chain shipping industry for over 70 years.\n* **Rigorous product testing:** We [test our cold packs][147] to ensure effective performance, from\nmaintaining the necessary temperatures to resisting punctures and leakage.\n* **Compliance:** Our team knows the relevant Food and Drug Administration (FDA) and Centers for\nDisease Control and Prevention (CDC) requirements. We engineer products to meet the regulatory\nrequirements for medical sample transport gel packs.\n* **Support:** We do more than supply products \u2014 our team is a reliable service partner, offering\nsupport in selecting the ideal solution for your unique situation and challenges.\n* **Proven results:** Past [success stories demonstrate the results][148] we have achieved for\nclients across industries, including life sciences.\n\n## Learn More About Our Gel Packs and Products for Blood and Tissue Samples\n\nGel packs are effective for cold storage and ensure b"
