            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Perishables][131] \u203a Shipping Fresh Food With Reliable Gel Pack\nTechnology\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Perishables][134] \u203a Shipping Fresh Food With Reliable Gel Pack\nTechnology\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Fresh Food\n\n## Shipping Fresh Food With Reliable Gel Pack Technology\n\nPelton Shepherd\u2019s gel pack solutions mitigate temperature fluctuations during fresh food shipping\nprocesses. The fast-paced industry relies on adherence to strict temperature parameters to preserve\nproduct quality. Demand and end-user satisfaction in the fresh food industry are tied to freshness.\nShipping perishable products requires robust shipping logistics tailored to maintain quality from\nmanufacturer to last-mile delivery.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Why Choose Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs for Shipping Fresh Food?\n\nPelton Shepherd\u2019s comprehensive line of gel packs has been the mainstay of perishable food shipping\nfor over 70 years. We understand that temperature excursions from optimal zones can negatively\nimpact fresh food desirability and result in significant losses. Our range of gel pack solutions was\ndeveloped to support tight thermal control and preserve the quality of temperature-sensitive foods.\n\nBenefits of our ice packs for shipping fresh food include:\n\nReliable Thermal Control\n\nOur gel packs maintain a precise temperature for days and are perfect to maintain the quality of\nvarious fresh foods, from tomatoes to salmon.\n\nCost-Effectiveness\n\nBeing the leader of gel pack manufacturing since the 1950\u2019s with [8 facilities across the US][136],\nwe have developed a large network of top suppliers and cold chain partners to reduce our materials,\nfreezing and shipping costs.\n\nProven Track Record\n\nOur temperature control solutions for shipping [have been trusted][137] by the perishable food\nindustry for decades.\n\nCustomized Solutions\n\nWe can customize gel pack solutions for large orders to meet the specific requirements of unique\nshipments.\n\nSustainability\n\nWe have the largest offering of [eco-friendly gel packs][138] in the industry.\n\nIn addition to providing exceptional gel packs, our logistical support processes can include\nend-to-end services to ensure pre-prepared ice packs are always available when needed. The [COLD\ndelivery program][139] incorporates Conditioning Operations, Logistics and refrigerant Delivery,\naccelerating preparations required by shippers to transport fresh foods.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][140]\n\n## Explore Our Cold Pack Solutions\n\nThere is no uniformity in shipping different fresh food types with a limited shelf life. Each\nproduct has specific handling and optimal thermal requirements. Pelton Shepherd provides a wide\nrange of choices, so gel packs can be matched to meet the unique shipping parameters. All our gel\npacks are puncture-resistant and convenient to use.\n\nOur gel pack offerings for fresh food shipping include:\n* **TerraTemp:** Transform your cold chain with earth-friendly gel packs with eutectic points\nranging from 32\u00b0F to 10\u00b0F. Reduce shipping waste and keep fresh food in top condition with\n[TerraTemp gel packs][141].\n* **Glacier Temp:** Keep shipping costs down without risking temperature fluctuations with [Glacier\nTemp gel packs][142]. Our [Glacier Ice\u2122 cold packs][143] are the top performers in the United\nStates and continue to deliver dependable thermal parameters shippers rely on.\n\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nTransform your cold chain with earth-friendly gel packs with eutectic points ranging from 32\u00b0F to\n10\u00b0F. Reduce shipping waste and keep fresh food in top condition with [TerraTemp gel packs][144].\n\n[ Learn More ][145]\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nKeep shipping costs down without risking temperature fluctuations with [Glacier Temp gel\npacks][146]. Our [Glacier Ice\u2122 cold packs][147] are the top performers in the United States and\ncontinue to deliver dependable thermal parameters shippers rely on.\n\n[ Learn More ][148]\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Ship Fresh Food Confidently With Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs\n\nDon\u2019t risk losses from temperature excursions when shipping fresh food. Partner with the experienced\nteam at Pelton Shepherd and transport perishables confidently. Our state-of-the-art cooling\nsolutions provide the tools needed to keep temperature-sensitive items in optimal condition from\npickup to final delivery. We continue to advance gel pack technology to adjust to evolving markets\nand simplify accurate temperature control during shipping.\n\nContact us to learn more about how to ship fresh food with our ice packs. Alternatively, [browse our\nproducts][149] or [request a quote][150] for gel packs to keep all your fresh food shipments at\noptimal temperatures.\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Instagram\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][151]\n* [Perishables][152]\n* [Specialty][153]\n* [Life Sciences][154]\n* [Perishables][155]\n* [Specialty][156]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][157]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][158]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][159]\n* [Physical Therapy][160]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][161]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][162]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][163]\n* [Physical Therapy][164]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][165]\n* [Consumer FAQ][166]\n* [Disposal Instructions][167]\n* [Blog][168]\n* [Business FAQ][169]\n* [Consumer FAQ][170]\n* [Disposal Instructions][171]\n* [Blog][172]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][173]\n* [Location][174]\n* [Success Stories][175]\n* [Join our Team][176]\n* [About Us][177]\n* [Location][178]\n* [Success Stories][179]\n* [Join our Team][180]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][181]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][182]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][183]\n[Terms & Conditions][184]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][185]\n* [Perishables][186]\n* [Specialty][187]\n* [Life Sciences][188]\n* [Perishables][189]\n* [Specialty][190]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][191]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][192]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][193]\n* [Physical Therapy][194]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][195]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][196]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][197]\n* [Physical Therapy][198]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][199]\n* [Consumer FAQ][200]\n* [Disposal Instructions][201]\n* [Blog][202]\n* [Business FAQ][203]\n* [Consumer FAQ][204]\n* [Disposal Instructions][205]\n* [Blog][206]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][207]\n* [Location][208]\n* [Success Stories][209]\n* [Join our Team][210]\n* [About Us][211]\n* [Location][212]\n* [Success Stories][213]\n* [Join our Team][214]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][215]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][216]\n[Terms & Conditions][2"
