            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Perishables][131] \u203a How to Ship Meal Kits With Gel Packs From\nPelton Shepherd\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Perishables][134] \u203a How to Ship Meal Kits With Gel Packs From\nPelton Shepherd\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Meal Kits\n\n## How to Ship Meal Kits With Gel Packs From Pelton Shepherd\n\nPelton Shepherd provides state-of-the-art cooling technology to maintain optimal temperature\nparameters when shipping meal kits. Our non-toxic formulations ensure reliability and safety\nthroughout the cold food chain. Our range of gel packs for meal kits includes features such as\nmoisture-wicking exteriors and reusability, adding cost-effectiveness to shipping logistics.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Why Choose Gel Packs From Pelton Shepherd?\n\nOnline meal kits are one of the [fastest-growing niche food segments][136] in the United States. The\nchallenge during transportation is to ensure all meal kit ingredients reach end users looking fresh\nand crisp. Eradicate soggy boxes and quality issues caused by temperature excursions with\nconvenient, effective gel packs from the leader in the industry.\n\nPelton Shepherd\u2019s comprehensive range of gel packs provide the following benefits:\n\nAccurate Thermal Regulation\n\nShip confidently with [cold packs that deliver precise][137] temperature control.\n\nEco-friendliness\n\nSafeguard your reputation using gel packs that don\u2019t compromise meal kit safety. Our [TerraTemp\nline][138] also contributes to sustainability efforts and reduces the environmental impact of waste\noften associated with cold chain shipping.\n\nProven Reliability\n\nMaintain temperature compliance and protect your reputation with durable gel packs that consistently\n[meet or exceed expectations][139].\n\nCustomized Gel Pack Solutions\n\nPartner with us for large orders and let us [tailor-make solutions][140] that incorporate specific\ndesign detailing or thermal requirements.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][141]\n\n## Explore Our Gel Pack Solutions for Shipping Meal Kits\n\nPelton Shepherd offers a range of meal kit ice packs to suit diverse temperature requirements for\nshipping. We understand the complex logistical requirements required when [cold chain shipping][142]\nand the attention to detail needed every step of the way. Whether [shipping in warm weather][143] or\nnavigating compliance in the food industry, our solutions help maintain accurate temperature\nthresholds.\n\nOur water-based gel packs are easy to store and can be frozen or refrigerated depending on the\ntemperature requirements for shipping. Two ranges that offer versatile temperature control solutions\nfor the meal kit industry include:\n* **TerraTemp:** This [eco-friendly product line][144] provides a sustainable, modern alternative to\nconventional gel pack technology. With eutectic points of 32 degrees Fahrenheit, this line offers\nprecise temperature control options.\n* **Glacier Temp: **The convenience and cost-effectiveness of [Glacier Temp gel packs][145] make\nthem a valuable addition when maintaining tight temperature tolerances in cold-chain shipping.\n[Glacier Ice\u2122][146] is the #1 gel pack in the United States and has been trusted by meal kit\ndelivery companies for decades to maintain temperature reliability during last-mile deliveries.\n[Glacier Moisture Guard][147] absorbs condensation that may be associated with fresh produce\nincluded in meal kits.\n\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nThis [eco-friendly product line][148] provides a sustainable, modern alternative to conventional gel\npack technology. With eutectic points of 32 degrees Fahrenheit, this line offers precise temperature\ncontrol options.\n\n[ Learn More ][149]\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nThe convenience and cost-effectiveness of [Glacier Temp gel packs][150] make them a valuable\naddition when maintaining tight temperature tolerances in cold-chain shipping. [Glacier Ice\u2122][151]\nis the #1 gel pack in the United States and has been trusted by meal kit delivery companies for\ndecades to maintain temperature reliability during last-mile deliveries. [Glacier Moisture\nGuard][152] absorbs condensation that may be associated with fresh produce included in meal kits.\n\n[ Learn More ][153]\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Add Reliable Temperature Control to Meal Kit Shipping With Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs\n\nEver since Jack Shepherd invented the gel ice refrigerant in 1950, Pelton Shepherd has been a\ntrusted name, delivering dependable temperature control solutions to the shipping industry. We\ncontinue to innovate to meet the needs of developing niches, and our gel packs excel wherever they\nare used. Browse our product [catalog to find gel packs][154] to meet your unique requirements, or\n[request a quote today][155]!\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* X/Twitter\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][156]\n* [Perishables][157]\n* [Specialty][158]\n* [Life Sciences][159]\n* [Perishables][160]\n* [Specialty][161]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][162]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][163]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][164]\n* [Physical Therapy][165]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][166]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][167]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][168]\n* [Physical Therapy][169]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][170]\n* [Consumer FAQ][171]\n* [Disposal Instructions][172]\n* [Blog][173]\n* [Business FAQ][174]\n* [Consumer FAQ][175]\n* [Disposal Instructions][176]\n* [Blog][177]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][178]\n* [Location][179]\n* [Success Stories][180]\n* [Join our Team][181]\n* [About Us][182]\n* [Location][183]\n* [Success Stories][184]\n* [Join our Team][185]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][186]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][187]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][188]\n[Terms & Conditions][189]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][190]\n* [Perishables][191]\n* [Specialty][192]\n* [Life Sciences][193]\n* [Perishables][194]\n* [Specialty][195]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][196]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][197]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][198]\n* [Physical Therapy][199]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][200]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][201]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][202]\n* [Physical Therapy][203]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][204]\n* [Consumer FAQ][205]\n* [Disposal Instructions][206]\n* [Blog][207]\n* [Business FAQ][208]\n* [Consumer FAQ][209]\n* [Disposal Instructions][210]\n* [Blog][211]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][212]\n* [Location][213]\n* [Success Stories][214]\n* [Join our Team][215]\n* [About Us][216]\n* [Locatio