od & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Perishables][131] \u203a Reliable Gel Pack Shipping Solutions for the\nMeat Industry\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Perishables][134] \u203a Reliable Gel Pack Shipping Solutions for the\nMeat Industry\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Meat\n\n## Reliable Gel Pack Shipping Solutions for the Meat Industry\n\nPelton Shepherd\u2019s robust cold pack solutions prevent spoilage and ensure product safety in the meat\nindustry. With over 70 years of developing innovative cooling products, our gel packs for shipping\nmeat combine state-of-the-art technology with sustainable practices. Enjoy peace of mind with\ncost-effective cold packs you can rely on to maintain the temperature parameters of your meat\nshipments.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Simplify Shipping With Our Innovative Ice Packs for Meat\n\nTo prevent bacterial growth and ensure food safety, raw meat [must be 40 degrees Fahrenheit or\nbelow][136] throughout its journey from the processing plant to the end users. Staying within this\nsafe temperature zone can be challenging without adequate preparation and reliable coolants.\nUnanticipated complications such as warm ambient temperatures or shipping delays can compound this\nand result in significant losses.\n\nPrevent temperature excursions and keep your meat shipments within strict thermal ranges with the\nfollowing Pelton Shepherd ice pack solutions:\n* **TerraTemp:** Keep sustainability goals on track without compromising reliability. [TerraTemp\neco-friendly gel packs][137] provide accurate temperature control. The range includes Terra Ice\u2122,\na fully compostable option, and cost-effective Vortec Ice\u2122 gel packs. Both product lines offer a\neutectic point of 32 degrees Fahrenheit.\n* **Glacier Temp: **Manage cold chain costs with our popular [Glacier Temp line][138]. [Glacier\nIce\u2122][139] is a trusted, economical option with a eutectic point of 32 degrees Fahrenheit. It is\nan excellent option for last-mile meat shipping.\n\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nKeep sustainability goals on track without compromising reliability. [TerraTemp eco-friendly gel\npacks][140] provide accurate temperature control. The range includes Terra Ice\u2122, a fully compostable\noption, and cost-effective Vortec Ice\u2122 gel packs. Both product lines offer a eutectic point of 32\ndegrees Fahrenheit.\n\n[ Learn More ][141]\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nManage cold chain costs with our popular [Glacier Temp line][142]. [Glacier Ice\u2122][143] is a trusted,\neconomical option with a eutectic point of 32 degrees Fahrenheit. It is an excellent option for\nlast-mile meat shipping.\n\n[ Learn More ][144]\n\n## How to Ship Frozen Meat: Best Practices to Maintain Temperature Control\n\nKeeping meat frozen during shipping requires [insulated packing boxes][145] and enough dependable\nrefrigerants to maintain the low temperatures required. It also involves careful consideration of\nthe entire [cold chain shipping process][146], from regulatory compliance to handling procedures\nthat could cause unexpected temperature excursions.\n\nFollow these best practices when shipping meat:\n\nUnderstand The Transit Logistics\n\nConsider factors such as the transit duration and[ weather that significantly impact][147] the type\nand number of coolants required.\n\nChoose The Best Refrigerant Solution\n\nChoose [reliable cold packs][148] that keep meat frozen during shipping.\n\nInclude Insulation\n\nExtend the temperature stability of the gel packs by filling all [spaces inside the boxes][149] to\nenhance the efficiency of insulated boxes.\n\nMake Temperature Monitoring a Priority\n\nAvoid temperature excursions by incorporating [temperature monitoring processes][150] into your cold\nchain shipping logistics plan.\n\nPay Close Attention to Last-Mile Deliveries\n\nIncorporate additional gel packs in non-refrigerated trucks and eliminate any possibility of\ntemperature hikes during the last-mile run.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][151]\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Trust Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs for Shipping Meat\n\nMaintain your cold chain and ship meat confidently with experienced partners trusted by companies in\nthe food industry \u2014 Pelton Shepherd provides dependable, cost-effective gel pack solutions for\nshipping temperature-sensitive products. For additional convenience, our [COLD program supports\ncomplex][152] cold chain logistics by ensuring ready-to-use cooling solutions are always ready when\nneeded.\n\nPelton Shepherd has the expertise and industry experience to create customized solutions for all\nyour meat delivery requirements. We understand the challenges of transporting temperature-sensitive\ngoods. To learn more about our innovative refrigerant solutions for shipping meat, [complete a\ncontact form today][153].\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Phone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][154]\n* [Perishables][155]\n* [Specialty][156]\n* [Life Sciences][157]\n* [Perishables][158]\n* [Specialty][159]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][160]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][161]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][162]\n* [Physical Therapy][163]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][164]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][165]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][166]\n* [Physical Therapy][167]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][168]\n* [Consumer FAQ][169]\n* [Disposal Instructions][170]\n* [Blog][171]\n* [Business FAQ][172]\n* [Consumer FAQ][173]\n* [Disposal Instructions][174]\n* [Blog][175]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][176]\n* [Location][177]\n* [Success Stories][178]\n* [Join our Team][179]\n* [About Us][180]\n* [Location][181]\n* [Success Stories][182]\n* [Join our Team][183]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][184]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][185]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][186]\n[Terms & Conditions][187]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][188]\n* [Perishables][189]\n* [Specialty][190]\n* [Life Sciences][191]\n* [Perishables][192]\n* [Specialty][193]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][194]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][195]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][196]\n* [Physical Therapy][197]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][198]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][199]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][200]\n* [Physical Therapy][201]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][202]\n* [Consumer FAQ][203]\n* [Disposal Instructions][204]\n* [Blog][205]\n* [Business FAQ][206]\n* [Consumer FAQ][207]\n* [Disposal Instructions][208]\n* [Blog][209]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][210]\n* [Location][211]\n* [Success Stories][212]\n* [Join our Team][213]\n* [About Us][214]\n* [