            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a [Perishables][131] \u203a Ice Packs for Charcuterie Board Shipping\n\n[Home][132] \u203a [Solutions][133] \u203a [Perishables][134] \u203a Ice Packs for Charcuterie Board Shipping\n\n# Ice Packs for Charcuterie Board Shipping\n\nAt Pelton Shepherd, we understand that shipping gourmet products such as charcuterie boards goes\nbeyond cold retention. Packages must balance humidity and structure to deliver each item in pristine\ncondition. We provide specialized cold chain solutions that maintain strict temperature control\nwhile protecting the texture and visual appeal of artisanal products.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][135]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Specialized Gel Packs for Charcuterie Boards\n\nEach item on a charcuterie board has different shipping requirements. Cured meats and soft cheeses\nmust remain below 40\u00b0 F to prevent bacterial growth and oil separation, while crackers are sensitive\nto moisture and condensation. Reliable shipping significantly reduces refund requests due to\nspoilage or damaged packaging. Our ice packs help ensure your curated selections arrive as fresh as\nthey left your facility, keeping the contents stationary and dry.\n\nGlacier Moisture Guard\n\nThe [Glacier Moisture Guard][136] is designed to absorb condensation while maintaining a controlled\nlow temperature. This product features a specialized film that wicks condensation away from the\nsurface and is available in sizes from 8 to 48 ounces. Prevent water damage to cardboard packaging\nwhile keeping dry elements like crackers, nuts and dried fruit from becoming soggy. Textures remain\ndistinct, and the labels on artisanal cheeses or other products don\u2019t peel off.\n\nGlacier Foam Bricks\n\nOur [Glacier Foam Bricks][137] maintain their shape even when thawed. These rigid foam-filled\nrefrigerant blocks are available in precise shape tolerances and range from 7.5 to 60 ounces to fit\nyour packaging needs. They act as internal structural support within the shipping box and can be\nstacked against heavy items such as jam jars and cheese wheels to protect delicate items.\n\nIn addition to providing exceptional gel packs, our logistical support processes can include\nend-to-end services to ensure pre-prepared ice packs are always available when needed. The [COLD\ndelivery program][138] incorporates Conditioning Operations, Logistics and refrigerant Delivery,\naccelerating preparations required by shippers to transport fresh foods.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][139]\n\n## How to Use Our Ice Packs to Ship Charcuterie Boards\n\nOur cooling technology can be used in tandem to maintain optimal temperature parameters and protect\nthe unboxing experience. Some best practices to ship charcuterie boards with our advanced products\ninclude:\n* **Pre-conditioning:** Freeze packs flat for at least 24 to 48 hours before packing to ensure\nmaximum thermal energy storage.\n* **Layering strategy:** Place charcuterie board gel packs at both the bottom and top of the\ninsulated container to create a cold sandwich effect.\n* **Moisture barriers:** Use a barrier between the coolant and the food to prevent direct contact\nfreezing on delicate herbs or soft cheeses.\n* **Tight pack-out:** Fill all void space to minimize air circulation, which would accelerate\nthawing.\n* **TerraTemp:** Transform your cold chain with earth-friendly gel packs with eutectic points\nranging from 32\u00b0F to 10\u00b0F. Reduce shipping waste and keep fresh food in top condition with\n[TerraTemp gel packs][140].\n* **Glacier Temp:** Keep shipping costs down without risking temperature fluctuations with [Glacier\nTemp gel packs][141]. Our [Glacier Ice\u2122 cold packs][142] are the top performers in the United\nStates and continue to deliver dependable thermal parameters shippers rely on.\n\n[a picture of two ecogel gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two ecogel gel\npacks with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nTransform your cold chain with earth-friendly gel packs with eutectic points ranging from 32\u00b0F to\n10\u00b0F. Reduce shipping waste and keep fresh food in top condition with [TerraTemp gel packs][143].\n\n[ Learn More ][144]\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nKeep shipping costs down without risking temperature fluctuations with [Glacier Temp gel\npacks][145]. Our [Glacier Ice\u2122 cold packs][146] are the top performers in the United States and\ncontinue to deliver dependable thermal parameters shippers rely on.\n\n[ Learn More ][147]\n\n## How to Use Our Ice Packs to Ship Charcuterie Boards\n\nOur cooling technology can be used in tandem to maintain optimal temperature parameters and protect\nthe unboxing experience. Some best practices to ship charcuterie boards with our advanced products\ninclude:\n* **Pre-conditioning:** Freeze packs flat for at least 24 to 48 hours before packing to ensure\nmaximum thermal energy storage.\n* **Layering strategy:** Place charcuterie board gel packs at both the bottom and top of the\ninsulated container to create a cold sandwich effect.\n* **Moisture barriers:** Use a barrier between the coolant and the food to prevent direct contact\nfreezing on delicate herbs or soft cheeses.\n* **Tight pack-out:** Fill all void space to minimize air circulation, which would accelerate\nthawing.\n\n## Why Choose Pelton Shepherd?\n\nWith over 70 years of experience, we understand the specific nuances of shipping perishables versus\nstandard freight. From small artisanal shops to large-scale gift distributors, our high-volume\nmanufacturing ensures a consistent supply during peak holiday seasons. We offer custom sizes and\nweights to fit your specific box dimensions, optimizing both shipping costs and thermal performance.\n\n## Request a Quote to Perfect Your Charcuterie Board Shipping\n\nPelton Shepherd is your complete solutions provider to keep products cold throughout the whole cold\nchain. [Contact our cold chain experts][148] to calculate the exact coolant weight needed for your\nspecific shipping zones and durations. Request a quote or call us at 888-477-3570 to discuss your\nshipping strategy.\n\n###\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## Ship Fresh Food Confidently With Pelton Shepherd Gel Packs\n\nDon\u2019t risk losses from temperature excursions when shipping fresh food. Partner with the experienced\nteam at Pelton Shepherd and transport perishables confidently. Our state-of-the-art cooling\nsolutions provide the tools needed to keep temperature-sensitive items in optimal condition from\npickup to final delivery. We continue to advance gel pack technology to adjust to evolving markets\nand simplify accurate temperature control during shipping.\n\nContact us to learn more about how to ship fresh food with our ice packs. Alternatively, [browse our\nproducts][149] or [request a quote][150] for gel packs to keep all your fresh food shipments at\noptimal temperatures.\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Name\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][151]\n* [Perishables][152]\n* [Specialty][153]\n* [Life Sciences][154]\n* [Perishables][155]\n* [Specialty][156]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][157]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][158]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][159]\n* [Physical Therapy][160]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][161]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][162]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][163]\n* [Physical Therapy][164]\n\n## Resources\n* [Busine"
