            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a Specialty\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Solutions][132] \u203a Specialty\n\n# Custom Cold Chain Solutions & Gel Packs\n\n## Solutions to Fit Your Unique Needs\n\n**We know that one size doesn\u2019t always fit all.** That\u2019s why we work with you to ensure you have the\ngel packs you need to ship temperature-sensitive products when you need them. Get a quote for custom\ngel ice packs today!\n\n[ Request A Quote ][133]\n[Custom Ice Packs]\n\n## Custom Cold Packs for Shipping\n\nOur team is standing by for larger-scale operations to design fully custom solutions. While\ncustom options are not always available for smaller orders, we\u2019re happy to lend our expertise to\nhelp you make the most of [our extensive standard product line][134].\n\n### Custom Gel Packs Sized to Your Specifications\n\nIf you have unique packaging requirements, we\u2019ll work with you to craft products in the precise\ndimensions you need. Benefits of custom-sized gel packs include:\n* **Optimal use of space:** Whether you need to ship fresh produce, medications, floral arrangements\nor other perishable items of various shapes or sizes, we can design gel packs that suit your\nproducts\u2019 dimensions. With custom-sized gel packs, you\u2019ll make the most efficient use of your\npackaging materials.\n* **Reduced shipping costs:** Gel packs that match your products and maximize space efficiency allow\nyou to skip oversized boxes or extra packaging materials to reduce shipping expenses.\n* **Decreased waste: **Your customers will have fewer packaging materials to dispose of with\ncustom-sized solutions.\n* **Precise temperature control: **Custom-fit gel packs offer maximum product coverage, helping to\nensure precise temperature control.\n\n### Specialty Gel Ice Packs With Branded Designs\n\nEvery interaction with your customers is an opportunity to highlight your brand \u2014 including the\nmoment they see your gel packs. We can design special ice pack exteriors to include your logo,\ncontact information, thank-you message, or anything else you\u2019d like to add to promote your brand and\nkeep customers engaged.\n\nWe can also color-code your gel packs to aid warehouse efficiency and streamline inventory\nmanagement. Whatever your design needs, we look forward to collaborating with you to craft\nfunctional and appealing cold packs.\n\n### Custom Logistics\n\nRefrigerant logistics can be complex and costly, especially if your company has multiple locations\nor diverse packaging needs. Storing and managing gel packs on-site may not be the most practical\noption for your company, but you need to have them ready for deployment nonetheless.\n\nOur Conditioning Operations, Logistics and Delivery (COLD) program solves the problem of intricate\nend-to-end supply planning. When you join [our COLD program][135], we\u2019ll partner with you to\nforecast your gel pack demand and plan timelines accordingly. We\u2019ll then utilize our vast network of\ncold storage partners to condition your gel packs, avoiding long-distance transport of frozen ice\npacks, and deliver them when you need them.\n\n## Let\u2019s Start a Conversation\n\nIf you need high-performing custom gel packs or a logistics company with reliable fulfillment times,\nyou can count on us. We\u2019re ready to do what it takes to make your cold chain operations seamless,\nefficient and successful. [Contact us today][136] to learn more about our custom cold chain\nsolutions.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* LinkedIn\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][137]\n* [Perishables][138]\n* [Specialty][139]\n* [Life Sciences][140]\n* [Perishables][141]\n* [Specialty][142]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][143]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][144]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][145]\n* [Physical Therapy][146]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][147]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][148]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][149]\n* [Physical Therapy][150]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][151]\n* [Consumer FAQ][152]\n* [Disposal Instructions][153]\n* [Blog][154]\n* [Business FAQ][155]\n* [Consumer FAQ][156]\n* [Disposal Instructions][157]\n* [Blog][158]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][159]\n* [Location][160]\n* [Success Stories][161]\n* [Join our Team][162]\n* [About Us][163]\n* [Location][164]\n* [Success Stories][165]\n* [Join our Team][166]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][167]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][168]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][169]\n[Terms & Conditions][170]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][171]\n* [Perishables][172]\n* [Specialty][173]\n* [Life Sciences][174]\n* [Perishables][175]\n* [Specialty][176]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][177]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][178]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][179]\n* [Physical Therapy][180]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][181]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][182]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][183]\n* [Physical Therapy][184]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][185]\n* [Consumer FAQ][186]\n* [Disposal Instructions][187]\n* [Blog][188]\n* [Business FAQ][189]\n* [Consumer FAQ][190]\n* [Disposal Instructions][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n\n#