.com/resources/business-faq/\n[22]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/consumer-faq/\n[23]: https://gelpack.info/\n[24]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/blog/\n[25]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/pelton-shepherd-about/\n[26]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/manufacturing-process/\n[27]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/frozen-food/\n[28]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/success-stories/\n[29]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/locations/\n[30]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/join-our-team/\n[31]:"
