            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a Cold Chain Packaging\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Solutions][132] \u203a Cold Chain Packaging\n\n# Custom Cold Chain Packaging Solutions & Gel Packs\n\n## Cold Chain Packaging to Fit Your Unique Needs\n\nEvery business has different shipping needs, which is why we partner closely with you to design the\nideal gel pack solution for your temperature-sensitive products and cold chain packaging, available\nexactly when you need them. Request a custom gel ice pack quote today.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][133]\n[Custom Ice Packs]\n\n## Cold Chain Packaging Solutions\n\nAdvanced insulated containers rely on a dependable thermal energy source to ensure product\nintegrity. Pelton Shepherd manufactures high-performance gel packs that transform standard shippers\ninto reliable cold chain packaging solutions. Logistics managers in life sciences, food service and\nspecialty industries rely on our precision-engineered refrigerants to safeguard products through the\nlast mile.\n\n## We Augment Your Cold Chain Technology\n\nPelton Shepherd gel packs deliver the consistent cooling power needed to protect your products. We\nengineer cold packaging solutions to meet the unique thermal needs of your supply chain. Our [line\nof shipping gel packs][134] offers:\n* **Precise temperature control:** Achieve exact product thermal targets. Use [durable Glacier Ice\u2122\ngel packs][135] for refrigerated goods (32\u00b0F/0\u00b0C) or [Cryo Ice\u2122 gel packs][136] as a safe,\neffective alternative to dry ice.\n* **Uncompromising durability:** Protect payloads with superior containment. We manufacture packs\nusing puncture-resistant films and robust seals to reduce the risk of leaks during transit.\n* **Market-leading sustainability:** Elevate your brand\u2019s environmental profile with [Terra Ice\u2122\npacks][137], the industry\u2019s only certified compostable gel pack meeting ASTM D6400 standards.\n\n## How to Use Our Gel Packs With Your Packaging\n\nPelton Shepherd refrigerants offer universal compatibility, seamlessly integrating with any cold\nstorage packaging setup you currently use. Whether you ship in standard coolers or eco-friendly\nliners, our off-the-shelf solutions augment existing pack-out options, including:\n* **EPS (Styrofoam) coolers:** Maximize surface contact in foam coolers by draping flexible shipping\ngel packs over your products for efficient cooling.\n* **Corrugated box liners:** Pair [moisture-wicking Glacier Moisture Guard gel packs][138] with\npaper liners to maintain cardboard integrity.\n* **Sustainable insulation:** Combine cotton or starch-based packaging with [drain-safe Vortec Ice\u2122\nrefrigerants][139] for a fully eco-friendly solution.\n* **Custom packaging: **Collaborate with us to design tailor-made gel packs for specific packaging\ndimensions and opt for custom-printed films to turn refrigerants into branded assets.\n\n## Why Choose Pelton Shepherd?\n\nThree generations of innovation established Pelton Shepherd as the premier supplier for cold chain\npackaging components. From meal kit brands to pharmaceutical distributors, a [wide range of\ncustomers][140] rely on our:\n* **Proven expertise:** Leverage our more than 70 years of experience to select the exact\nrefrigerant mass and formulation for your temperature requirements.\n* **Nationwide reach:** Reduce freight costs and lead times by accessing our network\nof [manufacturing facilities and cold storage partners][141] near your distribution centers.\n* **The COLD program:** Streamline your logistics with [our COLD Delivery Program][142], which\nhandles the freezing, storage and just-in-time delivery of your refrigerants.\n\n## Request a Quote to Perfect Your Cold Chain Package\n\n[Contact Pelton Shepherd today][143] to discuss your cold chain packaging needs and request a quote.\nLet our team help you find or customize the ideal refrigerant for your shipping containers.\n\n###\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* LinkedIn\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][144]\n* [Perishables][145]\n* [Specialty][146]\n* [Life Sciences][147]\n* [Perishables][148]\n* [Specialty][149]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][150]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][151]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][152]\n* [Physical Therapy][153]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][154]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][155]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][156]\n* [Physical Therapy][157]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][158]\n* [Consumer FAQ][159]\n* [Disposal Instructions][160]\n* [Blog][161]\n* [Business FAQ][162]\n* [Consumer FAQ][163]\n* [Disposal Instructions][164]\n* [Blog][165]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][166]\n* [Location][167]\n* [Success Stories][168]\n* [Join our Team][169]\n* [About Us][170]\n* [Location][171]\n* [Success Stories][172]\n* [Join our Team][173]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][174]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][175]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][176]\n[Terms & Conditions][177]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][178]\n* [Perishables][179]\n* [Specialty][180]\n* [Life Sciences][181]\n* [Perishables][182]\n* [Specialty][183]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][184]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][185]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][186]\n* [Physical Therapy][187]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][188]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][189]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][190]\n* [Physical Therapy][191]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][192]\n* [Consumer FAQ][193]\n* [Disposal Instructions][194]\n* [Blog][195]\n* [Business FAQ][196]\n* [Consumer FAQ][197]\n* [Disposal Instructions][198]\n* [Blog][199]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][200]\n* [Location][201]\n* [Success Stories][202]\n* [Join our Team][203]\n* [About Us][204]\n* [Location][205]\n* [Success Stories][206]\n* [Join our Team][207]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][208]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][209]\n[Terms & Conditions][210]\n[ Request A Quote ][211]\n\n[1]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/covid-19-update/\n[2]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com\n[3]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/\n[4]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/vaccines/\n[5]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/blood-tissue/\n[6]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/life-sciences/clinical-trials/\n[7]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/\n[8]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/dairy/\n[9]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/fresh-food/\n[10]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/meal-kits/\n[11]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/perishables/meat/\n[12]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/physical-therapy/\n[13]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/specialty/\n[14]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/delivery-program/\n[15]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/solutions/cold-chain-packaging/\n[16]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/\n[17]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/terra-temp/\n[18]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/glacier-temp/\n[19]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/cryo-temp/\n[20]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/products/cura-temp/\n[21]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/business-faq/\n[22]: https://www.pelt"
