            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a Shipping Gel Packs\n\n[Home][130] \u203a Shipping Gel Packs\n\n# Durable Ice & Gel Packs For Shipping\n\n## Our Products\n\nPelton Shepherd Industries provides comprehensive gel pack solutions for shipping\ntemperature-sensitive products across the United States. We leverage over 70 years of experience and\nour product portfolio includes innovative ice pack technologies designed for pharmaceutical\ncompanies, meal kit services, and food manufacturers who require reliable cold chain logistics.\n\nFrom minimizing temperature fluctuations to addressing sustainability pressures, the challenges of\ncold chain shipping are ever-present. At Pelton Shepherd, we understand the problems that can arise\nwith shipping perishables.\n\nWe are an industry leader in manufacturing innovative and sustainable ice & gel packs for shipping\nin the cold chain industry. We\u2019ve applied our decades of experience to produce resilient and\nreusable gel packs that consistently bring you the temperature control you need.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][131]\n\n**Offering industry-leading innovations in energy efficiency,\nenvironmental safety and recyclability,** TerraTemp packs are\nthe sustainable choice with no compromises.\n\n[a picture showing a terra ice gel pack in a compost bin ][a picture showing a terra ice gel pack in\na compost bin ]\n[a picture showing a terra ice gel pack in a compost bin ][a picture showing a terra ice gel pack in\na compost bin ]\n\n### Terra Ice\u2122 Wholesale Gel Packs\n\n## The First, Only, Truly Compostable Gel Pack\n\nTerra Ice\u2122 is the only truly compostable gel pack. It consists of certified compostable materials\nper the American Society for Testing and Materials [standard D6400][132].\n\n### Features of Terra Ice\u2122 Wholesale Ice Packs\n* Offers the same performance as a regular gel pack\n* [Eutectic point of 32 F][133]\n* 100% biodegradable gel formula\n* It can turn into usable soil when composted or decompose fast when landfilled, leading to\nconvenient and low-impact disposal.\n* No need to open the pouch or recycle Terra Ice\u2122 gel packs. You and your customers can simply toss\nthe gel pack into the trash, where it will gradually break down into organic components\n\n[Learn More][134][ Request A Quote ][135]\n[balanced fertilizer gel ][balanced fertilizer gel ]\n[balanced fertilizer gel ][balanced fertilizer gel ]\n\n### Nutri Ice\u2122\n\n## Balanced Plant Food and Drain-Safe\n\nAfter years of customer feedback on our original plant food gel pack, we created Nutri Ice, the best\nplant food gel pack on the market that continue to raise the bar of sustainable and user-friendly\ngel packs. Designed for weekly fertilizing of plants, it has the a similar NPK ratio as\nMiracle-Gro(r) Pour&Feed(r).\n\nThe non-toxic, water-based gel can be poured directly on plant soil. Too much gel? Pour it down the\ndrain for simpler disposal and reduced environmental impact.\n\nThe sustainable film is made from a strong, puncture-resistant #4 plastic that contains 30%\npost-consumer recycled material and can be recycled again.\n* Available ambient or frozen in sizes ranging from 12 to 80oz\n* Eutectic point: 32F\n* Reusable\n\n[LEARN MORE][136][ Request A Quote ][137]\n[Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink ][Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink ]\n[Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink ][Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink ]\n\n### Vortec Ice\u2122\n\n## Sustainable AND Cost Effective\n\nBy our estimates, garbage trucks transporting the weight of one pallet\u2019s worth of gel packs to the\nlandfill generate 56 lbs. of CO2 emissions. Drain-safe gel packs divert the gel away from landfills\nand offer a cost-effective way to reduce the impact on greenhouse gas emissions.\n\n### Features of Vortec Ice\u2122\n* Cost-effective and sustainable\n* Contain a drain-safe gel, meaning you can cut the pouch corner and safely [pour the gel down the\ndrain][138]. You can then recycle the pouch in the same way you recycle your plastic bags.\n* Vortec Ice\u2122 packs are also septic-safe, allow for multiple uses\n* Have [a eutectic point of 32 F][139].\n\nFor the most cost-effective and sustainable option, choose Vortec Ice\u2122.\n\n[Learn More][140][ Request A Quote ][141]\n[Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement ][Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement ]\n[Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement ][Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement ]\n\n### Enviro Ice\u2122\n\n## Plant Food That\u2019s Also Drain- and Septic-Safe\n\nAugment the sustainability benefits of drain safe gel packs by offering your customers a useful,\nup-cyclable gel that they can use to fertilize plants and grass.\n\nFor disposal instructions, visit this page: [Disposal Instructions][142]\n\n[What\u2019s next?][143][ Request A Quote ][144]\n[Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement][Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement]\n\nThe best dry ice alternatives\n\n[Cryo Ice below 25F ][Cryo Ice below 25F ]\n[Cryo Ice below 25F ][Cryo Ice below 25F ]\n\n### Cryo Ice\u2122\n\n## The Best Alternative to Dry Ice\n\nA no-nonsense alternative to dry ice to keep your payload frozen.\n\n### Features of Cryo Ice\u2122 Gel Packs\n* Made from a specially formulated water-based gel that maintains a temperature **lower than\n25F** during thawing\n* Ideal everyday refrigerant solution for transporting pharmaceuticals and perishables that need to\nremain frozen\n* Cryo Ice\u2122 is our **most cost-effective dry ice alternative**\n* Simple and much safer than dry ice\n\n[LEARN MORE][145][ Request A Quote ][146]\n[Cryo Ice below 25F ][Cryo Ice below 25F ]\n[Cryo Ice below 25F ][Cryo Ice below 25F ]\n\n### Tundra Ice\u2122\n\n## The Most Eco-Friendly Alternative to Dry Ice\n\nCOMING SOON\n\n[Contact us][147][ Request A Quote ][148]\n[Cryo Ice below 25F][Cryo Ice below 25F]\n\n**Backed by decades of high performance and trusted service,** our\nGlacierTemp line of cold packs and foam bricks offers a range of price points and specialty features\nfor cold chain shipping needs that require +30\u00b0F formulations.\n\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs ][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs ]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs ][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs ]\n\n### Glacier Ice\u2122\n\n## Ideal Refrigerant for Your Everyday Shipping Needs\n\nWhen you require an everyday refrigerant to manage cold chain shipping costs, choose Glacier Ice\u2122.\n\n### Features of Glacier Ice\u2122\n* Glacier Ice\u2122 is the top gel pack in the United States\n* Trusted by pharmaceutical and meal kit delivery companies for decades\n* Our most economical option and ideal for shipping products one way\n* Features a tough puncture-resistant film, a slow-to-thaw water-based gel and a 30 F eutectic point\n\nGlacier Ice\u2122 gel packs are a highly reliable method for keeping shipments cold during transit.\n\n[LEARN MORE][149][ Request A Quote ][150]\n[EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack ][EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack ]\n[EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack ][EcoGel - Sustainable Gel Refrigerant Ice Pack ]\n\n### EcoGel\u2122\n\n## Uniquely Designed Leak-Proof Solution\n\nOur leak-proof EcoGel\u2122 ice packs solve the problem of shipping products with sharp corners.\n\n### Features of EcoGel\u2122\n* EcoGel\u2122 features two layers of protection against leaks \u2014 a robust, puncture-resistant exterior\nand a specially formulated, dough-like gel\n* The gel\u2019s unique consistency keeps it from leaking if a small puncture occurs\n* Enables tight pack-outs and maximizes space efficiency\n\n[LEARN MORE][151][ Request A Quote ][152]\n[GlacierTemp Moisture Guard - Ice Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage ][GlacierTemp Moisture Guard -\nIce Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage ]\n[GlacierTemp Moisture Guard - Ice Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage ][GlacierTemp Moisture Guard -\nIce Packs that Prevent Moisture Damage ]\n\n### Glacier Moisture Guard\n\n## Built to Prevent Moisture Damage\n\nGlacier Moisture Guard is our sweat-proof gel pack.\n\n### Features of Glacier Moisture Guard\n* Sweat-proof\n* Features an innovative, moisture-wicking exterior\n* Absorbs the normal condensation that can form on a gel pack\u2019s surface, protecting packaging\nmaterials from moisture incursion.\n\nOur Glacier Moisture Guard gel packs offer the ideal solution for shipping moisture-sensitive\nproducts like confections and fresh produce. They contain the same gel formulation as Glacier Ice\u2122\ngel packs, so you can count on them for reliable temperature control.\n\n[LEARN MORE][153][ Request A Quote ][154]\n[Glacier Ice Foam Bricks ][Glacier Ice Foam Bricks ]\n[Glacier Ice Foam Bricks ][Glacier Ice Foam Bricks ]\n\n### glacier foam brick\n\n## Precisely Shaped for Tight Pack-Outs\n\nIf you require a packaging solution that limits in-transit movement, saves space and provides\nlong-lasting cold, choose Glacier Foam Bricks \u2014 our foam-filled refrigerant blocks.\n\n### Features of Glacier Foam Bricks\n* Offer precise shape tolerances to meet your exact packaging needs\n* Retain their shape throughout the freeze-thaw cycle, enabling optimum space efficiency and tighter\npack-outs\n* An exceptional energy absorption rate that efficiently dissipates heat, protecting perishables\nfrom temperature"
          },
