od & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a Perishables\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Solutions][132] \u203a Perishables\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Food & Perishables\n\n## Trusted to Protect Freshness & Quality\n\n**We take quality & safety as seriously as you do.**\n\nPelton Shepherd Industries provides reliable gel packs for shipping perishable foods to\nmanufacturers, distributors, meal kit companies, and direct-to-consumer sellers across the United\nStates, ensuring food quality and safety during transit. With 70 years of industry expertise and GMP\ncertification, we\u2019re the trusted partner when temperature matters.\n\n[ Request Quote ][133]\n[Earth Friendly Gel Ice Packs for Meal Kits][Earth Friendly Gel Ice Packs for Meal Kits]\n\n## Gel Packs For Perishables\n\nCompanies that manufacture or transport perishables [face an unprecedented demand][134] for their\nproducts \u2014 and the challenges that coincide with maintaining the cold chain while keeping up with a\nsurge in orders. For example, the number of consumers purchasing groceries online [has skyrocketed\nover the past few years][135], and e-commerce sales of food and beverages [are not expected to slow\ndown][136].\n\nBusinesses must find ways to ensure [accurate temperature control][137] during product transport\nwhile minimizing shipping costs and keeping up with increased order volume. Additionally, food and\nbeverage organizations are under pressure to adopt sustainable practices to stay competitive.\nToday\u2019s customers [want to see companies incorporating sustainability][138] into their processes,\nincluding utilizing eco-friendly packaging.\n\nWhether your company transports groceries, meal kits, agricultural goods, or processed foods and\nbeverages, uniquely designed gel packs can help you keep products at safe, compliant and consistent\ntemperature levels while keeping shipping costs low and showcasing your sustainability efforts.\n\n## Our Gel Packs for Shipping Food and Other Perishables\n\nWater-based cold packs are an ideal packaging coolant for shipping foods and other perishable\nproducts requiring refrigeration. Unlike dry ice, which [is dangerous to handle][139] and requires\nadherence to stricter shipping regulations, [our gel packs][140] are non-toxic and food-safe. They\nare constructed with [puncture-resistant][141] material to prevent leakage and keep moisture from\ncontaminating and degrading perishables.\n\nWe design every gel pack to offer effective packaging solutions that address our customers\u2019 specific\nshipping requirements. Our gel pack lines include:\n\n[a picture of a moisture guard gel pack in a chilled food delivery box][a picture of a moisture\nguard gel pack in a chilled food delivery box]\n[New GlacierTemp Logo][New GlacierTemp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nOur cost-effective [GlacierTemp gel packs][142] suit perishables requiring a +30 F eutectic point.\nLeak-proof EcoGel and Glacier Moisture Guard packs were specially designed to address moisture\nconcerns with shipping perishables.\n\n[ Learn More ][143]\n[a picture of two enviro ice gel packs with a seafood delivery box][a picture of two enviro ice gel\npacks with a seafood delivery box]\n[New TerraTemp Logo][New TerraTemp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\n** **If you\u2019re seeking ways to incorporate sustainability into your organization\u2019s workflow,\nconsider our [eco-friendly TerraTemp line][144]. Our Terra Ice pack, for example, is a compostable\ngel pack that you and your customers can dispose of without negative environmental impact. In\naddition, our patented Enviro Ice pack can be recycled as plant food.\n\n[ Learn More ][145]\n[Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs for Meal Kits][Gel Refrigerant Freezer Packs for Meal Kits]\n[New CuraTemp Logo][New CuraTemp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Accuracy Matters\n\nComposed of food-grade, organic materials, our self-insulating [CuraTemp gel packs][146] help you\nmaintain consistent temperatures and are available with various eutectic points. Whether you need to\nkeep food at -10 F or +30 F, CuraTemp is a dependable option.\n\n[ Learn More ][147]\n\n## Food Industry Solutions\n\nBacked by decades of customer satisfaction, our cold packs preserve every ounce of goodness and\ngreat taste.\n\nIf you need a [storage solution for gel packs][148] and quick fulfillment times, consider our\nConditioning Operations, Logistics and Delivery program.\n\nFrom programs and services to product innovations, we\u2019re working to keep your business on the\ncutting edge.\n\n### [End-to-End Logistics][149]\n\nOur Conditioning Operations, Logistics and Delivery Program (\u201cCOLD\u201d) takes the stress out of cold\nchain supply planning so you can focus on your core business.\n\n### [Dry Ice Alternatives][150]\n\nProtect your food and perishable shipments from dry ice shortages with our proven high-performance,\nenvironmentally friendly alternative, [Enviro Ice\u2122][151] -12\u00b0C.\n\n### [Custom Solutions][152]\n\nOur representatives are well versed in the specific requirements of food-safe shipping. We\u2019re ready\nto work with you to meet your business needs.\n\n## Browse Our Cutting-Edge Food Shipping Solutions\n\nFood quality doesn\u2019t tolerate compromise. Whether you\u2019re a fresh food manufacturer shipping products\nnationwide or a meal kit or direct-to-consumer company protecting customer satisfaction, temperature\ncontrol is essential to success. Pelton Shepherd\u2019s engineered gel pack solutions augment your cold\nchain capabilities, preserving food freshness and safety.\n\nAt Pelton Shepherd, we\u2019re proud to deliver innovative and sustainable gel packs that help our\ncustomers reduce their carbon footprints while maintaining their cold chains. Browse [our product\ncatalog][153] or [contact us to learn more][154].\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Company\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][155]\n* [Perishables][156]\n* [Specialty][157]\n* [Life Sciences][158]\n* [Perishables][159]\n* [Specialty][160]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][161]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][162]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][163]\n* [Physical Therapy][164]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][165]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][166]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][167]\n* [Physical Therapy][168]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][169]\n* [Consumer FAQ][170]\n* [Disposal Instructions][171]\n* [Blog][172]\n* [Business FAQ][173]\n* [Consumer FAQ][174]\n* [Disposal Instructions][175]\n* [Blog][176]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][177]\n* [Location][178]\n* [Success Stories][179]\n* [Join our Team][180]\n* [About Us][181]\n* [Location][182]\n* [Success Stories][183]\n* [Join our Team][184]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][185]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][186]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][187]\n[Terms & Conditions][188]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][189]\n* [Perishables][190]\n* [Specialty][191]\n* [Life Sciences][192]\n* [Perishables][193]\n* [Specialty][194]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][195]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][196]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][197]\n* [Physical Therapy][198]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][199]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][200]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][201]\n* [Physical Therapy][202]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][203]\n* [Consumer FAQ][204]\n* [Disposal Instructions][205]\n* [Blog][206]\n* [Business FAQ][207]\n* [Consumer FAQ][208]\n* [Disposal Instructions][209]\n* [Blog][210]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][211]\n* [Location][212]\n* [Success Stories][213]\n* [Join our Team][21"
