            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Eco-Friendly Ice Packs for Shipping\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][132] \u203a Eco-Friendly Ice Packs for Shipping\n\n# Eco-Friendly Ice Packs For Shipping\n\n## TerraTemp Packs\n\nIn its [2020 Packaging Survey][133], McKinsey found that waste production ranks number two among\nU.S. consumers as the most concerning environmental impact of packaging. Choosing eco-friendly\nshipping solutions will move your business forward on sustainability goals and strengthen your brand\nin an increasingly environmentally conscious consumer landscape. TerraTemp packs from Pelton\nShepherd can be a starting point.\n\nTerraTemp packs are non-toxic, compostable and recyclable ice packs for shipping that help\nbusinesses depart from environmentally destructive packaging and hazardous dry ice. They consist of\npouches that can be recycled or composted and a water-based gel that can be poured down the drain.\nSelect gel formulas even contain compounds that promote plant growth.\n\nWhether you need to transport food, [pharmaceuticals][134] or [any other perishable\nproduct][135] requiring accurate temperature control, consider our TerraTemp packs and transform\nyour cold chain.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][136]\n[a picture showing a terra ice gel pack in a compost bin ]\n[ a picture showing a terra ice gel pack in a compost bin]\n\n### Terra Ice\u2122 Wholesale Gel Packs\n\n## The First, Only, Truly Compostable Gel Pack\n\nTerra Ice\u2122 is the only truly compostable gel pack. It consists of certified compostable materials\nper the American Society for Testing and Materials [standard D6400][137].\n\n### Features of Terra Ice\u2122 Wholesale Ice Packs\n* Offers the same performance as a regular gel pack\n* [Eutectic point of 32 F][138]\n* 100% biodegradable gel formula\n* It can turn into usable soil when composted or decompose fast when landfilled, leading to\nconvenient and low-impact disposal.\n* No need to open the pouch or recycle Terra Ice\u2122 gel packs. You and your customers can simply toss\nthe gel pack into the trash, where it will gradually break down into organic components\n\n[Learn More][139][ Request A Quote ][140]\n[balanced fertilizer gel ][balanced fertilizer gel ]\n[ balanced fertilizer gel]\n\n### Nutri Ice\u2122\n\n## Balanced Plant Food and Drain-Safe\n\nAfter years of customer feedback on our original plant food gel pack, we created Nutri Ice, the best\nplant food gel pack on the market that continue to raise the bar of sustainable and user-friendly\ngel packs. Designed for weekly fertilizing of plants, it has the a similar NPK ratio as\nMiracle-Gro(r) Pour&Feed(r).\n\nThe non-toxic, water-based gel can be poured directly on plant soil. Too much gel? Pour it down the\ndrain for simpler disposal and reduced environmental impact.\n\nThe sustainable film is made from a strong, puncture-resistant #4 plastic that contains 30%\npost-consumer recycled material and can be recycled again.\n* Available ambient or frozen in sizes ranging from 12 to 80oz\n* Eutectic point: 32F\n* Reusable\n\n[LEARN MORE][141][ Request A Quote ][142]\n[Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink ][Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink ]\n[ Vortec Ice Getting Poured Into The Sink]\n\n### Vortec Ice\u2122\n\n## Sustainable AND Cost Effective\n\nBy our estimates, garbage trucks transporting the weight of one pallet\u2019s worth of gel packs to the\nlandfill generate 56 lbs. of CO2 emissions. Drain-safe gel packs divert the gel away from landfills\nand offer a cost-effective way to reduce the impact on greenhouse gas emissions.\n\n### Features of Vortec Ice\u2122\n* Cost-effective and sustainable\n* Contain a drain-safe gel, meaning you can cut the pouch corner and safely [pour the gel down the\ndrain][143]. You can then recycle the pouch in the same way you recycle your plastic bags.\n* Vortec Ice\u2122 packs are also septic-safe, allow for multiple uses\n* Have [a eutectic point of 32 F][144].\n\nFor the most cost-effective and sustainable option, choose Vortec Ice\u2122.\n\n[Learn More][145][ Request A Quote ][146]\n[Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement ][Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement ]\n[ Enviro Ice - Dry Ice Replacement]\n\n### Enviro Ice\u2122\n\n## Plant Food That\u2019s Also Drain- and Septic-Safe\n\nAugment the sustainability benefits of drain safe gel packs by offering your customers a useful,\nup-cyclable gel that they can use to fertilize plants and grass.\n\nFor disposal instructions, visit this page: [Disposal Instructions][147]\n\n[What\u2019s next?][148][ Request A Quote ][149]\n\n## Request a Quote for Wholesale Ice Packs for Shipping\n\nPelton Shepherd has been the industry leader in refrigerant solutions for over 70 years. While a lot\nhas changed, our commitment to innovation and pushing the limits of existing cold chain materials\nhas remained the same.\n\nWe understand that every degree matters when handling temperature-sensitive perishable products. We\nalso value sustainability performance and helping businesses incorporate eco-friendly cold packaging\ninto their cold chain systems to reduce their carbon footprints. That\u2019s why we\u2019ve constantly\ninnovated to uncover new solutions to meet the needs of modern organizations.\n\nOur ice packs for shipping are manufactured to the highest standards to prevent rips, tears and\nmoisture damage. They are also produced in our U.S.-based factories, and we partner with local cold\nstorage facilities to protect the integrity of our gel refrigerant products.\n\nConnect with [our team for a quote][150] or to learn more about our wholesale gel ice packs and\nreusable, recyclable and biodegradable designs.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\ntrusted when\nCOLD\nSustainability\nAccuracy\nmatters\n\n## Discover our products\n\nWhatever your priority, our extensive catalog has reliable options to match.\n\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Ice Refrigerant for Perishables][Glacier Ice - Gel Ice Refrigerant for\nPerishables]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nBacked by decades of performance, our GlacierTemp cold packs and foam bricks offer a range of price\npoints and features for shipping needs that require +30\u00b0F formulations.\n\n[ Learn More ][151]\n[a picture of two moisture guard gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two\nmoisture guard gel packs with a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Cura Temp Logo][Cura Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Accuracy Matters\n\nSpecially formulated to maintain precise eutectic points, CuraTemp packs ensure accurate control for\nproducts that require specific temperature excursions.\n\n[ Learn More ][152]\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* URL\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][153]\n* [Perishables][154]\n* [Specialty][155]\n* [Life Sciences][156]\n* [Perishables][157]\n* [Specialty][158]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][159]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][160]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][161]\n* [Physical Therapy][162]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][163]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][164]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][165]\n* [Physical Therapy][166]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][167]\n* [Consumer FAQ][168]\n* [Disposal Instructions][169]\n* [Blog][170]\n* [Business FAQ][171]\n* [Consumer FAQ][172]\n* [Disposal Instructions][173]\n* [Blog][174]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][175]\n* [Location][176]\n* [Success Stories][177]\n* [Join our Team][178]\n* [About Us][179]\n* [Location][180]\n* [Success Stories][181]\n* [Join our Team][182]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][183]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][184]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][185]\n[Terms & Conditions][186]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shephe"
