od & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Shipping Gel Packs][130] \u203a Glacier Ice\n\n# Ideal Everyday Refrigerant Gel Pack Solution\n\n## **Glacier Ice**\n\nLeading meal kit delivery brands and pharmaceutical multinationals have relied on Glacier Ice\u2122 gel\nice packs for decades to meet their temperature-sensitive shipment needs.\n\n### Features of Glacier Ice\u2122 Gel Packs\n* Made from a specially formulated water-based gel that freezes fast but thaws slowly\n* With a 32 F eutectic point, Glacier Ice\u2122 is the ideal everyday refrigerant solution for\ntransporting pharmaceuticals and perishables\n* Glacier Ice\u2122 is our most cost-effective gel pack\n* Help to reduce last-mile delivery and cold chain shipping costs\n\nView details about Glacier Ice\u2122 gel packs by downloading our [product data][131] and [safety\ndata][132] sheets. If you\u2019re ready to purchase the leading cold chain gel pack in the United States,\n[place your order today][133].\n\n[ Request A Quote ][134]\n\n# Ideal Everyday Refrigerant Gel Pack Solution\n\n## **Glacier Ice**\n\n## **Glacier Ice**\n\nDescription\n\nLeading meal kit delivery brands and pharmaceutical multinationals have relied on Glacier Ice\u2122 gel\nice packs for decades to meet their temperature-sensitive shipment needs.\n\n### Features of Glacier Ice\u2122 Gel Packs\n* Made from a specially formulated water-based gel that freezes fast but thaws slowly\n* With a 32 F eutectic point, Glacier Ice\u2122 is the ideal everyday refrigerant solution for\ntransporting pharmaceuticals and perishables\n* Glacier Ice\u2122 is our most cost-effective gel pack\n* Help to reduce last-mile delivery and cold chain shipping costs\n\nView details about Glacier Ice\u2122 gel packs by downloading our [product data][135] and [safety\ndata][136] sheets. If you\u2019re ready to purchase the leading cold chain gel pack in the United States,\n[place your order today][137].\n\nSizes\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPRODUCT NUMBER\u2502WEIGHT\u2502DIMENSIONS (INCHES) L X W X H\u2502PACKS PER CASE\u2502POUNDS PER CASE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500