            "text": "[COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][3]\n* [Vaccines][4]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n* [Clinical Trials][6]\n* [Perishables][7]\n* [Dairy][8]\n* [Fresh Food][9]\n* [Meal Kits][10]\n* [Meat Industry][11]\n* [Physical Therapy][12]\n* [Specialty][13]\n* [Delivered COLD][14]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][21]\n* [Consumer FAQ][22]\n* [Disposal Instructions][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n* About\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][26]\n* [Our Benefits][27]\n* [Success Stories][28]\n* [Locations][29]\n* [Join our Team][30]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][31]\n* [Request A Quote][32]\n* [Ask Us A Question][33]\n* Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][34]\n* [Vaccines][35]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][36]\n* [Clinical Trials][37]\n* [Perishables][38]\n* [Dairy][39]\n* [Fresh Food][40]\n* [Meal Kits][41]\n* [Meat Industry][42]\n* [Physical Therapy][43]\n* [Specialty][44]\n* [Delivered COLD][45]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][48]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][49]\n* [Dry Ice Alternatives][50]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][51]\n* Resources\n* [Business FAQ][52]\n* [Consumer FAQ][53]\n* [Disposal Instructions][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* About\n* [About Us][56]\n* [Our Manufacturing Process][57]\n* [Our Benefits][58]\n* [Success Stories][59]\n* [Locations][60]\n* [Join our Team][61]\n* [Company News & Case Studies][62]\n* [Request A Quote][63]\n* [Ask Us A Question][64]\n[ Request A Quote ][65]\n[ 800-258-3423 ][66]\nSearch Search\n[ COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* [Life Sciences][70]\n* [Vaccines][71]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n* [Clinical Trials][73]\n* [Perishables][74]\n* [Dairy][75]\n* [Fresh Food][76]\n* [Meal Kits][77]\n* [Meat Industry][78]\n* [Physical Therapy][79]\n* [Specialty][80]\n* [Delivered COLD][81]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n* [Shipping Packs][85]\n* [Precision Packs][86]\n* [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n* [Business FAQ][89]\n* [Consumer FAQ][90]\n* [Disposable Instructions][91]\n* [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n* [About Us][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [Success Stories][96]\n* [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Vaccines][101]\n* [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n* [Clinical Trials][103]\n* [Perishables][104]\n* [Dairy][105]\n* [Fresh Food][106]\n* [Meal Kits][107]\n* [Meat Industry][108]\n* [Physical Therapy][109]\n* [Specialty][110]\n* [Delivered COLD][111]\n* [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n* [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n* [Shipping Packs][115]\n* [Precision Packs][116]\n* [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n* [Business FAQ][119]\n* [Consumer FAQ][120]\n* [Disposable Instructions][121]\n* [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n* [About Us][124]\n* [Locations][125]\n* [Success Stories][126]\n* [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n\n[Home][129] \u203a [Solutions][130] \u203a Life Sciences\n\n[Home][131] \u203a [Solutions][132] \u203a Life Sciences\n\n# Gel Packs For Shipping Pharmaceuticals\n\n## Trusted by Professionals for Safe, Reliable Transit\n\nPelton Shepherd Industries provides pharmaceutical manufacturers and distributors across the United\nStates with reliable gel packs designed to solve complex cold chain challenges. Backed by 70 years\nof industry expertise and GMP certification, we deliver solutions you can trust.\n\nThe pharmaceutical cold chain demands precision, reliability, and innovation. Life science companies\ntoday navigate mounting pressure to maintain strict temperature control, reduce environmental\nimpact, and manage shipping costs simultaneously. Standard refrigerants fall short. Pelton\nShepherd\u2019s engineered gel pack solutions augment your cold chain capabilities, delivering precise\ntemperature management.\n\n[ Request Quote ][133]\n[Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs][Glacier Ice - Gel Refrigerant Ice Packs]\n\n## Our Gel Packs for Shipping Pharmaceuticals\n\nGel packs often serve as a necessary refrigerant in hybrid and passive temperature-controlled\npackaging in the pharmaceutical cold chain. They are [easier and safer to handle and ship][134] than\nalternatives such as dry ice. Gel packs are also typically available in various sizes, shapes and\neutectic points to meet temperature control needs.\n\nWe offer several innovative gel pack options to help you maintain the required temperatures and\nprevent product degradation while transporting pharmaceuticals. Our gel packs are reusable, making\nthem a cost-effective option, and designed to solve pain points related to shipping\ntemperature-sensitive products.\n\n[a picture of two glacier ice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box][a picture of two glacier\nice gel packs in a pharmaceuticals delivery box]\n[Glacier Temp Logo][Glacier Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Cold Matters\n\nIf you\u2019re seeking cost-effective, durable refrigerants for +30 F shipping needs, consider [our\nGlacierTemp line][135] of ice packs.\n\n[ Learn More ][136]\n[Terra Temp Logo][Terra Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Sustainability Matters\n\nOur uniquely sustainable [TerraTemp packs are ideal][137] if your organization is interested in\nsustainability and reducing carbon footprint while maintaining accurate temperatures. They have a\neutectic point of 32 F and are available in a range of sizes.\n\n[ Learn More ][138]\n[a picture showing gel pack cooling life science products][a picture showing gel pack cooling life\nscience products]\n[Cura Temp Logo][Cura Temp Logo]\n\n### Trusted When Accuracy Matters\n\nOur [CuraTemp gel ice refrigerant][139] is carefully formulated to provide accurate temperature\ncontrols and minimal expansion when frozen. Consisting of organic materials and semi-solid,\nnon-toxic gel, CuraTemp packs are available in various eutectic points ranging from -10 F to +30 F.\n\n[ Learn More ][140]\n\n## Life Sciences Solutions\n\nIf our products do not meet your sizing needs, we [can customize our gel packs][141] to your\nspecifications. We can also [store our gel packs for you][142] with our Conditioning Operations,\nLogistics and Delivery program, saving you the cost of keeping cold packs on site and ensuring your\nrefrigerant orders are ready on time. From programs and services to product innovations, we\u2019re\nworking to keep your business on the cutting edge.\n\n### [End-to-End Logistics][143]\n\nOur Conditioning Operations, Logistics and Delivery Program (\u201cCOLD\u201d) takes the stress out of cold\nchain supply planning so you can focus on your core business.\n\n### [Dry Ice Alternatives][144]\n\nProtect your operations from dry ice shortages with our proven high-performance, environmentally\nfriendly alternative, [Enviro Ice\u2122][145] -12\u00b0C.\n\n### Custom Solutions\n\nOur representatives are well versed in the specific shipping requirements of the life sciences\nindustries. We\u2019re ready to work with you to meet your business needs.\n\n## Learn More About Our Gel Packs for Shipping Life Science Products\n\nToday\u2019s life science companies, such as pharmaceutical manufacturers and distributors, face unique\ncold chain challenges, from maintaining precise temperature settings to ship medications to adopting\nmore sustainable direct-to-consumer shipping practices. Additionally, with rising shipping costs,\nbusinesses seek compact and cost-effective refrigerants to help keep delivery expenses down while\nmeeting an increased demand for direct-to-consumer shipping.\n\nIf you distribute temperature-sensitive life science products such as medicine, gel ice packs offer\na cost-effective, sustainable packaging solution that enables accurate temperature control.\n\nWhen health and well-being are on the line, every degree matters. You can count on us for the\nperformance and reliability you need to ship temperature-sensitive products confidently.\n\nBrowse [our product catalog][146] or [contact us to learn more][147] about our cold chain solutions.\n\n## Success Stories\n\n**Deliveries are consistent and on time but if an issue arises, we are always notified\nimmediately.** If you\u2019re looking for a vendor that values their customers, then you\u2019ve come to the\nright place!\nDISTRIBUTOR PARTNER\n**Pelton Shepherd has proven themselves an exceptional partner time and time again.** Their products\ncoupled with their operational agility and outstanding customer service are truly the gold standard\nacross the industry.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nAny issues or questions I have, being with product, deliveries or my own fault, Ali and her team\nhave worked extremely past any customer bar of excellence. **They are truly a company that cares\nabout their customers and I am blessed to be a part of it.**\nPHARMACY CARE SERVICES COMPANY\n**The team at Pelton Shepherd has been great to work with**, they are extremely attentive to helping\nwith any issues that may come up. They also offer many solutions to questions or changes that we\nhave brought to the table.\nMEAL KIT CUSTOMER\nI\u2019ve worked with Pelton-Shepherd for several years. Their sales team has always been a pleasant\nexperience. **When ordering gel packs the product is always on time and ready for pick up.**\nSEAFOOD RETAILER\n\n## We Want to\n## Hear From You\n* Comments\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Your name **\nFirst\n* Your email **\n* Message\n\nlet\u2019s talk\n[PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][148]\n* [Perishables][149]\n* [Specialty][150]\n* [Life Sciences][151]\n* [Perishables][152]\n* [Specialty][153]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][154]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][155]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][156]\n* [Physical Therapy][157]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][158]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][159]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][160]\n* [Physical Therapy][161]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][162]\n* [Consumer FAQ][163]\n* [Disposal Instructions][164]\n* [Blog][165]\n* [Business FAQ][166]\n* [Consumer FAQ][167]\n* [Disposal Instructions][168]\n* [Blog][169]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][170]\n* [Location][171]\n* [Success Stories][172]\n* [Join our Team][173]\n* [About Us][174]\n* [Location][175]\n* [Success Stories][176]\n* [Join our Team][177]\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n## 1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA 95219\n\n## Follow Us\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][178]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][179]\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][180]\n[Terms & Conditions][181]\n[Pelton Shepherd White Logo][Pelton Shepherd White Logo]\n\n## Solutions\n* [Life Sciences][182]\n* [Perishables][183]\n* [Specialty][184]\n* [Life Sciences][185]\n* [Perishables][186]\n* [Specialty][187]\n\n## Products\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][188]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][189]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][190]\n* [Physical Therapy][191]\n* [Shipping Ice Packs][192]\n* [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][193]\n* [Precision Ice Packs][194]\n* [Physical Therapy][195]\n\n## Resources\n* [Business FAQ][196]\n* [Consumer FAQ][197]\n* [Disposal Instructions][198]\n* [Blog][199]\n* [Business FAQ][200]\n* [Consumer FAQ][201]\n* [Disposal Instructions][202]\n* [Blog][203]\n\n## About\n* [About Us][204]\n* [Location][205]\n* [Success Stories][206]\n* [Join our Team][207]\n* [About Us][208]\n* [Location][209]\n* [Success Stories][210]\n* [Join our Team][211]\n\n**Cold Chain Shipping Insights & News** Directly to Your Inbox\n\nEmail Address *\n\n[[Intuit Mailchimp][Intuit Mailchimp]][212]\n\n/* real people should not fill this in and expect good things - do not remove this or risk form bot\nsignups */\n\n## Pelton Shepherd Industries\n\n1-800-BLUE-ICE\n\n3120 W. March Lane\nStockton, CA95219\n\n2023 \u00a9 Pelton Shepherd Industries. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[Privacy Policy][213]\n[Terms & Conditions][214]\n[ Request A Quote ][215]\n\n[1]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/resources/industry-updates/covid-19-update/\n[2]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com\n[3]: https://www.peltonshepherd.com/sol"
