      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "Rapidaid is a global leader in developing and manufacturing innovative temperature-based solutions tailored for the healthcare and retail sectors. The company offers a diverse range of products, including gel strips, heat bands, and medicated patches, designed for injury recovery, post-surgical care, and everyday wellness. With a focus on comfort and care, Rapidaid serves both healthcare providers and retail consumers, ensuring effective pain relief and therapeutic support.",
