        "crawl_text": "Rapid Aid Corporation FDA, Health Canada, CE, ISO 13485 certified North America Global FDA Health Canada ISO 13485 Class 1 FDA registered ISO 13485 certified UK and MHRA Registered Global manufacturing capabilities Over 50 million units produced monthly Wide range of temperature-based therapy products Over 400 private label and branded SKUs Long history of innovation FDA Health Canada ISO 13485 FDA regulations ISO standards 4120A Sladeview Crescent, Mississauga, Ontario, Canada Danyang, Jiangsu, China Hai Phong City, Vietnam Cau Ha a Hamlet, An Quang Commune, Hai Phong City, Vietnam Glasses Industrial Park, Danfu Road, Danyang, Jiangsu, China Canada United States China Vietnam Canada United States China Vietnam Global Rapid Aid has been a leader in temperature-based solutions since 1975, producing over 50 million units monthly. The company offers over 500 SKUs under its Rapid Relief\u2122 brand and private label options. Manufacturing facilities are strategically located in Canada, the U.S., China, and Vietnam. Rapid Aid has been a leader in hot and cold pain relief for over 50 years. The company has a strong focus on innovation and customer satisfaction. Expanding global reach through private label solutions. Innovating new products to meet emerging market demands. Expanding global distribution capabilities Enhancing product offerings in the healthcare sector Competition from other medical device manufacturers Regulatory changes affecting product compliance Growing demand for pain relief products in healthcare and retail sectors Expansion into emerging markets Leader in temperature-based therapy products for healthcare and retail sectors. Increasing demand for pain relief and recovery products in healthcare and retail sectors. Increasing awareness of non-drug pain management solutions Expansion of product lines to meet diverse customer needs [Skip to content][1]\n[ ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Our History][5]\n* [Manufacturing And D