n* [News & Articles][88]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][89]\n* [Literature][90]\n* [Customer Service][91]\n* [Contact Us][92]\n* [English][93]\n* [French][94]\n* [Home][95]\n* [About Us][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Our History][98]\n* [Manufacturing & Distribution][99]\n* [Research & Innovation][100]\n* [Safety and Compliance][101]\n* [Careers][102]\n* [Global Manufacturing Locations][103]\n* [Menu Item mobile-none][104]\n* [Rapid Aid Corporate Headquarters and North American Production][105]\n* [North American Warehouse][106]\n* [About image][107]\n* [Vietnam Manufacturing and QA][108]\n* [China Office and Production][109]\n* [Products][110]\n* * [View All Products][111]\n* Body Area\n* [Back & Neck][112]\n* [Head & Face][113]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][114]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][115]\n* [Sensitive Areas][116]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][117]\n* * Product Category\n* [Gel Strips][118]\n* [Heat Bands][119]\n* [Refillable Packs][120]\n* [Instant Packs][121]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][122]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][123]\n* [Medicated Patches][124]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][125]\n* * Segment-Department\n* [Children\u2019s Care][126]\n* [Eye Care][127]\n* [Feminine Care][128]\n* [First Aid][129]\n* [Mom & Baby][130]\n* [Pain Relief][131]\n* [Sports Recovery][132]\n* * [Temperature][133]\n* [Hot Treatment][134]\n* [Cold Treatment][135]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][136]\n* [Private Label][137]\n* [Resources][138]\n* * [Resources][139]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][140]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][141]\n* [News & Articles][142]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][143]\n* [Literature][144]\n* [Customer Service Resources][145]\n* * [The Latest Tips & News][146]\n* * [How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend][147]\n* * [Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief?][148]\n* * [[Everything You Need to Know About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs]Everything You Need to\nKnow About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs][149]\n* [Contact Us][150]\n* [English][151]\n* [French][152]\n[ Linkedin-in ][153] [ Youtube ][154]\n\n# About Rapid Aid\n\nSince 1975, Rapid Aid has been a global leader in developing and manufacturing temperature-based\nsolutions for the healthcare and retail sectors. Now celebrating 50 years of innovation, we offer\nthe industry\u2019s widest range of temperature-based therapy products\u2014designed for injury recovery,\npost-surgical care, and everyday wellness.\n\nOur products are available under our trusted Rapid Relief\u2122 brand or can be customized under your\nprivate label to meet specific market needs. With over 500 SKUs, we proudly partner with many of the\nworld\u2019s leading retailers, brands, and medical suppliers.\n\nHeadquartered in North America, we operate manufacturing facilities in Canada, the U.S., China, and\nVietnam\u2014producing over 50 million units monthly with full global distribution capabilities.\n\nBacked by patented designs and regulatory excellence, Rapid Aid sets the standard for\ntemperature-controlled solutions that promote well-being, reduce costs, and deliver lasting value.\n\n[Image 2025 08 13 092429 869 e1758236358366]\n[Group 8851]\n\n### Founded\n\n1975\n\n[Group 8861]\n\n### Headquarters\n\nMississauga, Ontario, Canada\n\n[Group 887]\n\n### Global Presence\n\nManufacturing in Canada, United States, China, and Vietnam\n\n[Group 530]\n\n### Product Portfolio\n\n[Over 500 Product Skus][155]\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### Industries Served\n\nHealthcare and Retail\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### 50+ Million Units\n\nMonthly Capacity\n\n## What Sets Us Apart\n\nOur mission is to provide innovative, high-quality temperature-related solutions that enhance\ncomfort and care. We are dedicated to delivering products that are safe, effective, and tailored to\nmeet the unique needs of our clients.\n\nGlobally Diversified\nWe\u2019re Experts\nGlobally Diversified\n\nFor five decades, Rapid Aid has been the only company exclusively dedicated to hot and cold therapy\nsolutions\u2014growing from a small entrepreneurial venture into the global leader in our category.\nBacked by decades of innovation and a leadership team deeply rooted in this market, we continue to\nset the standard for safe, effective, and trusted therapeutic care.\n\nSafety and quality are our foundation. Our in-house regulatory experts conduct regular audits, and\nour products are certified across FDA, Health Canada, CE, and ISO 13485. Every item is ammonium\nnitrate-free and RCR-compliant, ensuring reliable performance. With four state-of-the-art facilities\nstrategically located across North America and Asia, we deliver millions of units each month with\nspeed and consistency. This diversified footprint gives our partners unmatched supply chain\nflexibility, regional redundancy, and cost efficiency\u2014while helping them mitigate tariff challenges\nin an evolving global market.\n\nWe\u2019re Experts\nOur expert team brings decades of industry experience to every resource we create, so you get the\ninsights you need to make informed decisions. From in-depth knowledge base articles, to timely blogs\nand tools, to guidance from our executive leadership, everything is written or reviewed by\nprofessionals who know the industry inside and out. We\u2019ve earned our reputation as a trusted source\nby evolving with the needs of our clients, delivering clarity in a constantly changing market.\n[[Shutterstock 2343004303]][156] Rapid Aid, Mississauga, Canada\n\n## How We Help Customers\n\nWe don\u2019t just manufacture products\u2014we solve problems, remove complexity, and empower our partners to\ngrow.\n\n[Rapid aid vietnam]\n[ View Our Products ][157]\n\n### Here\u2019s how we support our clients every step of the way:\n\n### Global Brand & Private Label Solutions\n\nWhether under our trusted Rapid Relief\u2122 brand or your own private label, we help expand your global\nreach with proven, ready-to-market temperature-based therapy products.\n\n### Innovation That Keeps You Ahead\n\nWe stay on the cutting edge of industry needs, developing new products that respond to emerging\nmarket demands, regulatory changes, and consumer expectations.\n\n### End-to-End Customization\n\nFrom product design and packaging to regulatory com [Skip to content][1]\n[ ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Our History][5]\n* [Manufacturing And Distribution][6]\n* [Research and Innovation][7]\n* [Safety and Compliance][8]\n* [Careers][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Body Area][11]\n* [Back & Neck][12]\n* [Head & Face][13]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][14]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][15]\n* [Sensitive Areas][16]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][17]\n* [Product Category][18]\n* [Gel Strips][19]\n* [Heat Bands][20]\n* [Refillable Packs][21]\n* [Instant Packs][22]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][23]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][24]\n* [Medicated Patches][25]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][26]\n* [Segment-Department][27]\n* [Children\u2019s Care][28]\n* [Eye Care][29]\n* [Feminine Care][30]\n* [First Aid][31]\n* [Mom & Baby][32]\n* [Pain Relief][33]\n* [Sports Recovery][34]\n* [Temperature][35]\n* [Hot Treatment][36]\n* [Cold Treatment][37]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][38]\n* [Private Label][39]\n* [Resources][40]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][41]\n* [News & Articles][42]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][43]\n* [Literature][44]\n* [Customer Service][45]\n* [Contact Us][46]\n* [English][47]\n* [French][48]\n* [Home][49]\n* [About Us][50]\n* [Our History][51]\n* [Manufacturing And Distribution][52]\n* [Research and Innovation][53]\n* [Safety and Compliance][54]\n* [Careers][55]\n* [Products][56]\n* [Body Area][57]\n* [Back & Neck][58]\n* [Head & Face][59]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][60]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][61]\n* [Sensitive Areas][62]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][63]\n* [Product Category][64]\n* [Gel Strips][65]\n* [Heat Bands][66]\n* [Refillable Packs][67]\n* [Instant Packs][68]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][69]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][70]\n* [Medicated Patches][71]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][7