out Reusable Hot and Cold Packs]Everything You Need to\nKnow About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs][149]\n* [Contact Us][150]\n* [English][151]\n* [French][152]\n[ Linkedin-in ][153] [ Youtube ][154]\n\n# Our Products\n\n# Back & Neck\n\n# Head & Face\n\n# Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot\n\n# Multiple Body Parts\n\n# Sensitive Areas\n\n# Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger\n\n# Gel Strips\n\n# Heat Bands\n\n# Refillable Packs\n\n# Instant Packs\n\n# Moist Heat Packs\n\n# Reusable Gel Packs\n\n# Medicated Patches\n\n# Compression Gel Sleeves\n\n# Children\u2019s Care\n\n# Eye Care\n\n# Feminine Care\n\n# First Aid\n\n# Mom & Baby\n\n# Pain Relief\n\n# Sports Recovery\n\n# Hot Treatment\n\n# Cold Treatment\n\n# Hot-or-Cold Treatment\n\n[ Filters][155]\nFilters\nSearch\nSearch[\u00d7][156]\nType\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][157]\n* [Heat Bands][158]\n* [Refillable Packs][159]\n* [Gel Strips][160]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][161]\n* [Instant Packs][162]\n* [Medicated Patches][163]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][164]\nDepartment/Segment\n* [Pain Relief][165]\n* [Sports Recovery][166]\n* [First Aid][167]\n* [Feminine Care][168]\n* [Children\u2019s Care][169]\n* [Mom & Baby][170]\n* [Eye Care][171]\nBody Part\n* [Head & Face][172]\n* [Back & Neck][173]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][174]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][175]\n* [Sensitive Areas][176]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][177]\nHot/Cold\n* [Hot Treatment][178]\n* [Cold Treatment][179]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][180]\n[Show (47)][181]\n[Cancel ][182]\n* [[Reusable hot or cold neck & shoulder gel wrap]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Neck & Shoulder Gel Wrap\n\n][183]\n[Read more][184]\n* [[Reusable hot or cold joint wraps]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Joint Wraps\n\n][185]\n[Read More][186]\nThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\n* [[Reusable hot or cold gel slippers]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Gel Slippers\n\n][187]\n[Read more][188]\n* [[Reusable hot or cold gel compress with strap]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Gel Compress with Strap\n\n][189]\n[Read More][190]\nThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\n* [[Reusable hot or cold gel compress]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Gel Compress\n\n][191]\n[Read More][192]\nThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\n* [[Reusable hot or cold gel bead wraps]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Gel Bead Wraps\n\n][193]\n[Read More][194]\nThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\n* [[Reusable hot or cold compression gel/hydrogel sleeves]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Compression Gel/Hydrogel Sleeves\n\n][195]\n[Read More][196]\nThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\n* [[Reusable hot or cold compression gel shoulder wrap]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Compression Gel Shoulder Wrap\n\n][197]\n[Read more][198]\n* [[Migraine mask for eyes and head pain relief]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Compression Gel Migraine Mask\n\n][199]\n[Read more][200]\n* [[Reusable hot or cold compression gel jaw & eye wrap]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Compression Gel Jaw & Eye Wrap\n\n][201]\n[Read more][202]\n* [[Reusable hot or cold clay compress]\n\n## Reusable Hot or Cold Clay Compress\n\n][203]\n[Read More][204]\nThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\n* [[Reusable hot menstrual pain relief compress with strap]\n\n## Reusable Hot Menstrual Pain Relief Compress with Strap\n\n][205]\n[Read more][206]\n* 1\n* [2][207]\n* [3][208]\n* [4][209]\n* [\u2192][210]\n[ ][211]\n\n**Corporate HQ & North American Operations**\n\n[4120A Sladeview Crescent\nMississauga, ON Canada L5L 5Z3][212]\n\nPhone: [905-820-4788][213]\n\n**Vietnam Office**\n\n[Cau Ha a Hamlet][214]\n[An Quang Commune][215]\n[Hai Phong City, Vietnam][216]\n\n**China Office**\n\nGlasses Industrial Park\nDanfu Road Danyang\nJiangsu, China, 212300905-820-4788\n\n### Quick Links\n* [ About Us ][217]\n* [ Products ][218]\n* [ Resource Center ][219]\n* [ Contact Us ][220]\n\n### Follow Us\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][221] [ Youtube ][222] [ Facebook ][223]\n\n### Latest Updates\n\n][224]\n\n#### [ How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend ][225]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][226]\n][227]\n\n#### [ Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief? ][228]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][229]\n\n### Get the Latest in Your Inbox\n\nYour Email\nSubscribe\n\u00a9 2026 Rapid Aid. All Rights Reserved.\n\n**[Bribery, Fraud, and Corruption Policy][230]**\n\n[**Labour & Human Rights Policy **][231]\n\n**[Privacy Policy][232]**\n\n**[Quality Policy][233]**\n* [ English][234]\n* [ Fran\u00e7ais (French)][235]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://rapidaid.com\n[3]: https://rapidaid.com/\n[4]: https://rapidaid.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://rapidaid.com/our-history/\n[6]: https://rapidaid.com/manufacturing-and-distribution/\n[7]: https://rapidaid.com/research-and-innovation/\n[8]: https://rapidaid.com/safety-and-compliance/\n[9]: https://rapidaid.com/careers/\n[10]: https://rapidaid.com/products/\n[11]: #\n[12]: /products/body_arears_filter-back-neck/\n[13]: /products/body_arears_filter-head-face/\n[14]: /products/body_arears_filter-leg-knee-ankle-foot/\n[15]: /products/body_arears_filter-multiple-body-parts/\n[16]: /products/body_arears_filter-sensitive-areas/\n[17]: /products/body_arears_filter-shoulder-arm-hand-finger/\n[18]: #\n[19]: /products/product_categories_filter-gel-strips/\n[20]: /products/product_categories_filter-heat-bands/\n[21]: /products/product_categories_filter-refillable-packs/\n[22]: /products/product_categories_filter-instant-packs/\n[23]: /products/product_categories_filter-moist-heat-packs/\n[24]: /products/product_categories_filter-reusable-gel-packs/\n[25]: /products/product_categories_filter-medicated-patches/\n[26]: /products/product_categories_filter-gel-sleeves/\n[27]: #\n[28]: /products/segment_department_filter-childrens-care/\n[29]: /products/segment_department_filter-eye-care/\n[30]: /products/segment_department_filter-feminine-care/\n[31]: /products/segment_department_filter-first-aid/\n[32]: /products/segment_department_filter-mom-baby/\n[33]: /products/segment_department_filter-pain-relief/\n[34]: /products/segment_department_filter-sports-recovery/\n[35]: #\n[36]: /products/temperature_filter-hot/\n[37]: /products/temperature_filter-cold/\n[38]: /products/temperature_filter-hot-or-cold/\n[39]: https://rapidaid.com/private-label-solutions/\n[40]: https://rapidaid.com/resources/\n[41]: https://rapidaid.com/safety-data-sheets/\n[42]: https://rapidaid.com/blog/\n[43]: https://rapidaid.com/faqs/\n[44]: https://rapidaid.com/literature/\n[45]: https://rapidaid.com/resources/customer-service/\n[46]: https://rapidaid.com/contact-us/\n[47]: https://rapidaid.com/products/\n[48]: https://rapidaid.com/fr/produits/\n[49]: https://rapidaid.com/\n[50]: https://rapidaid.com/about-us/\n[51]: https://rapidaid.com/our-history/\n[52]: https://rapidaid.com/manufacturing-and-distribution/\n[53]: https://rapidaid.com/research-and-innovation/\n[54]: https://rapidaid.com/safety-and-compliance/\n[55]: https://rapidaid.com/careers/\n[56]: https://rapidaid.com/products/\n[57]: #\n[58]: /products/body_arears_filter-back-neck/\n[59]: /products/body_arears_filter-head-face/\n[60]: /products/body_arears_filter-leg-knee-ankle-foot/\n[61]: /products/body_arears_filter-multiple-body-parts/\n[62]: /products/body_arears_filter-sensitive-areas/\n[63]: /products/body_arears_filter-shoulder-arm-hand-finger/\n[64]: #\n[65]: /products/product_categories_filter-gel-strips/\n[66]: /products/product_categories_filter-heat-bands/\n[67]: /products/product_categories_filter-refillable-packs/\n[68]: /products/product_categories_filter-instant-packs/\n[69]: /products/product_categories_filter-moist-heat-packs/\n[70]: /products/product_categories_filter-reusable-gel-packs/\n[71]: /products/product_categories_filter-medicated-patches/\n[72]: /products/product_categories_filter-gel-sleeves/\n[73]: #\n[74]: /products/segment_department_filter-childrens-care/\n[75]: /products/segment_department_filter-eye-care/\n[76]: /products/segment_department_filter-feminine-care/\n[77]: /products/segment_department_filter-first-aid/\n[78]: /products/segment_department_filter-mom-baby/\n[79]: /products/segment_department_filter-pain-relief/\n[80]: /products/segment_department_filter-sports-recovery/\n[81]: #\n[82]: /products/temperature_filter-hot/\n[83]: /products/temperature_filter-cold/\n[84]: /products/temperature_"
