            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Our History][5]\n* [Manufacturing And Distribution][6]\n* [Research and Innovation][7]\n* [Safety and Compliance][8]\n* [Careers][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Body Area][11]\n* [Back & Neck][12]\n* [Head & Face][13]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][14]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][15]\n* [Sensitive Areas][16]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][17]\n* [Product Category][18]\n* [Gel Strips][19]\n* [Heat Bands][20]\n* [Refillable Packs][21]\n* [Instant Packs][22]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][23]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][24]\n* [Medicated Patches][25]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][26]\n* [Segment-Department][27]\n* [Children\u2019s Care][28]\n* [Eye Care][29]\n* [Feminine Care][30]\n* [First Aid][31]\n* [Mom & Baby][32]\n* [Pain Relief][33]\n* [Sports Recovery][34]\n* [Temperature][35]\n* [Hot Treatment][36]\n* [Cold Treatment][37]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][38]\n* [Private Label][39]\n* [Resources][40]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][41]\n* [News & Articles][42]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][43]\n* [Literature][44]\n* [Customer Service][45]\n* [Contact Us][46]\n* [English][47]\n* [French][48]\n* [Home][49]\n* [About Us][50]\n* [Our History][51]\n* [Manufacturing And Distribution][52]\n* [Research and Innovation][53]\n* [Safety and Compliance][54]\n* [Careers][55]\n* [Products][56]\n* [Body Area][57]\n* [Back & Neck][58]\n* [Head & Face][59]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][60]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][61]\n* [Sensitive Areas][62]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][63]\n* [Product Category][64]\n* [Gel Strips][65]\n* [Heat Bands][66]\n* [Refillable Packs][67]\n* [Instant Packs][68]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][69]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][70]\n* [Medicated Patches][71]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][72]\n* [Segment-Department][73]\n* [Children\u2019s Care][74]\n* [Eye Care][75]\n* [Feminine Care][76]\n* [First Aid][77]\n* [Mom & Baby][78]\n* [Pain Relief][79]\n* [Sports Recovery][80]\n* [Temperature][81]\n* [Hot Treatment][82]\n* [Cold Treatment][83]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][84]\n* [Private Label][85]\n* [Resources][86]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][87]\n* [News & Articles][88]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][89]\n* [Literature][90]\n* [Customer Service][91]\n* [Contact Us][92]\n* [English][93]\n* [French][94]\n* [Home][95]\n* [About Us][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Our History][98]\n* [Manufacturing & Distribution][99]\n* [Research & Innovation][100]\n* [Safety and Compliance][101]\n* [Careers][102]\n* [Global Manufacturing Locations][103]\n* [Menu Item mobile-none][104]\n* [Rapid Aid Corporate Headquarters and North American Production][105]\n* [North American Warehouse][106]\n* [About image][107]\n* [Vietnam Manufacturing and QA][108]\n* [China Office and Production][109]\n* [Products][110]\n* * [View All Products][111]\n* Body Area\n* [Back & Neck][112]\n* [Head & Face][113]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][114]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][115]\n* [Sensitive Areas][116]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][117]\n* * Product Category\n* [Gel Strips][118]\n* [Heat Bands][119]\n* [Refillable Packs][120]\n* [Instant Packs][121]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][122]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][123]\n* [Medicated Patches][124]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][125]\n* * Segment-Department\n* [Children\u2019s Care][126]\n* [Eye Care][127]\n* [Feminine Care][128]\n* [First Aid][129]\n* [Mom & Baby][130]\n* [Pain Relief][131]\n* [Sports Recovery][132]\n* * [Temperature][133]\n* [Hot Treatment][134]\n* [Cold Treatment][135]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][136]\n* [Private Label][137]\n* [Resources][138]\n* * [Resources][139]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][140]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][141]\n* [News & Articles][142]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][143]\n* [Literature][144]\n* [Customer Service Resources][145]\n* * [The Latest Tips & News][146]\n* * [How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend][147]\n* * [Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief?][148]\n* * [[Everything You Need to Know About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs]Everything You Need to\nKnow About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs][149]\n* [Contact Us][150]\n* [English][151]\n* [French][152]\n[ Linkedin-in ][153] [ Youtube ][154]\n\n# About Rapid Aid\n\nSince 1975, Rapid Aid has been a global leader in developing and manufacturing temperature-based\nsolutions for the healthcare and retail sectors. Now celebrating 50 years of innovation, we offer\nthe industry\u2019s widest range of temperature-based therapy products\u2014designed for injury recovery,\npost-surgical care, and everyday wellness.\n\nOur products are available under our trusted Rapid Relief\u2122 brand or can be customized under your\nprivate label to meet specific market needs. With over 500 SKUs, we proudly partner with many of the\nworld\u2019s leading retailers, brands, and medical suppliers.\n\nHeadquartered in North America, we operate manufacturing facilities in Canada, the U.S., China, and\nVietnam\u2014producing over 50 million units monthly with full global distribution capabilities.\n\nBacked by patented designs and regulatory excellence, Rapid Aid sets the standard for\ntemperature-controlled solutions that promote well-being, reduce costs, and deliver lasting value.\n\n[Image 2025 08 13 092429 869 e1758236358366]\n[Group 8851]\n\n### Founded\n\n1975\n\n[Group 8861]\n\n### Headquarters\n\nMississauga, Ontario, Canada\n\n[Group 887]\n\n### Global Presence\n\nManufacturing in Canada, United States, China, and Vietnam\n\n[Group 530]\n\n### Product Portfolio\n\n[Over 500 Product Skus][155]\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### Industries Served\n\nHealthcare and Retail\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### 50+ Million Units\n\nMonthly Capacity\n\n## What Sets Us Apart\n\nOur mission is to provide innovative, high-quality temperature-related solutions that enhance\ncomfort and care. We are dedicated to delivering products that are safe, effective, and tailored to\nmeet the unique needs of our clients.\n\nGlobally Diversified\nWe\u2019re Experts\nGlobally Diversified\n\nFor five decades, Rapid Aid has been the only company exclusively dedicated to hot and cold therapy\nsolutions\u2014growing from a small entrepreneurial venture into the global leader in our category.\nBacked by decades of innovation and a leadership team deeply rooted in this market, we continue to\nset the standard for safe, effective, and trusted therapeutic care.\n\nSafety and quality are our foundation. Our in-house regulatory experts conduct regular audits, and\nour products are certified across FDA, Health Canada, CE, and ISO 13485. Every item is ammonium\nnitrate-free and RCR-compliant, ensuring reliable performance. With four state-of-the-art facilities\nstrategically located across North America and Asia, we deliver millions of units each month with\nspeed and consistency. This diversified footprint gives our partners unmatched supply chain\nflexibility, regional redundancy, and cost efficiency\u2014while helping them mitigate tariff challenges\nin an evolving global market.\n\nWe\u2019re Experts\nOur expert team brings decades of industry experience to every resource we create, so you get the\ninsights you need to make informed decisions. From in-depth knowledge base articles, to timely blogs\nand tools, to guidance from our executive leadership, everything is written or reviewed by\nprofessionals who know the industry inside and out. We\u2019ve earned our reputation as a trusted source\nby evolving with the needs of our clients, delivering clarity in a constantly changing market.\n[[Shutterstock 2343004303]][156] Rapid Aid, Mississauga, Canada\n\n## How We Help Customers\n\nWe don\u2019t just manufacture products\u2014we solve problems, remove complexity, and empower our partners to\ngrow.\n\n[Rapid aid vietnam]\n[ View Our Products ][157]\n\n### Here\u2019s how we support our clients every step of the way:\n\n### Global Brand & Private Label Solutions\n\nWhether under our trusted Rapid Relief\u2122 brand or your own private label, we help expand your global\nreach with proven, ready-to-market temperature-based therapy products.\n\n### Innovation That Keeps You Ahead\n\nWe stay on the cutting edge of industry needs, developing new products that respond to emerging\nmarket demands, regulatory changes, and consumer expectations.\n\n### End-to-End Customization\n\nFrom product design and packaging to regulatory compliance and logistics, our team works with you to\nbuild fully customized solutions that align with your brand, goals, and supply chain.\n\n### Quality You Can Rely On\n\nWe remove the stress of quality control by maintaining the highest international standards for\nsafety, compliance, and performance, so you can focus on your business.\n\n### Partnerships That Last\n\nWe believe in long-term collaboration, not one-time transactions. Our clients count on us as an\nextension of their team, committed to shared success.\n\n## Global Locations\n\nThrough our wholly owned, vertically integrated manufacturing facilities in the U.S., Canada,\nVietnam, and China, we produce therapy products supported by global distribution capabilities. This\nend-to-end production model, from concept to delivery, delivers unmatched capacity, flexibility, and\ncost efficiency.\n\n[Ra danyang china 2500 x 959 e1753719276270]\n\n### Rapid Aid China Office and Production\n\nGlasses Industrial Park, Danfu Road Danyang, Jiangsu, China, 212300\n\n[Vector22]\n[ [Ra vietnam 2500 x 959] ][158]\n\n### [Rapid Aid Vietnam Office and Production][159]\n\n[Cau Ha a Hamlet, Quang Trung Commune, An Lao District, Hai Phong City, Vietnam][160]\n\n[ [Ra toronto 2500 x 959] ][161]\n\n### [Rapid Aid Corporate Headquarters and North American Production][162]\n\n[4120A Sladeview Crescent Mississauga, ON Canada L5L 5Z3][163]\n\n[ [Rapid aid moberly e1755533328936] ][164]\n\n### [Rapid Aid North American Warehouse][165]\n\n[4085 Sladeview Crescent Units 11 \u2013 14 Mississauga ON L5L 5X3][166]\n\n## News and Events\n\n[Period pain]\n][167]\n\n### [ How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend ][168]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][169]\n[Rapid aid]\n][170]\n\n### [ Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief? ][171]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][172]\n[Everything you need to know about reusable hot and cold packs]\n][173]\n\n### [ Everything You Need to Know About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs ][174]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][175]\n\n## Get Started with Rapid Aid\n\nWhether you\u2019re launching a wellness line or expanding your global presence, Rapid Aid helps you move\nfrom concept to shelf quickly and confidently.\n\nWith deep category expertise, proven compliance, and a consumer-first approach, we\u2019re your ideal\npartner for private label success.\n\n## Peace of mind. Brand protection. Satisfied customers.\n\nContact us today to discover how we can help you build a private label product line safely,\ncompetitively, and globally.\n\n[ Contact us Today ][176]\n[ ][177]\n\n**Corporate HQ & North American Operations**\n\n[4120A Sladeview Crescent\nMississauga, ON Canada L5L 5Z3][178]\n\nPhone: [905-820-4788][179]\n\n**Vietnam Office**\n\n[Cau Ha a Hamlet][180]\n[An Quang Commune][181]\n[Hai Phong City, Vietnam][182]\n\n**China Office**\n\nGlasses Industrial Park\nDanfu Road Danyang\nJiangsu, China, 212300905-820-4788\n\n### Quick Links\n* [ About Us ][183]\n* [ Products ][184]\n* [ Resource Center ][185]\n* [ Contact Us ][186]\n\n### Follow Us\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][187] [ Youtube ][188] [ Facebook ][189]\n\n### Latest Updates\n\n][190]\n\n#### [ How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend ][191]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][192]\n][193]\n\n#### [ Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief? ][194]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][195]\n\n### Get the Latest in Your Inbox\n\nYour Email\nSubscribe\n\u00a9 2026 Rapid Aid. All Rights Reserved.\n\n**[Bribery, Fraud, and Corruption Policy][196]**\n\n[**Labour & Human Rights Policy **][197]\n\n**[Privacy Policy][198]**\n\n**[Quality Policy][199]**\n* [ English][200]\n* [ Fran\u00e7ais (French)][201]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://rapidaid.com\n[3]: https://rapidaid.com/\n[4]: https://rapidaid.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://rapidaid.com/our-history/\n[6]: https://rapidaid.com/manufacturing-and-distribution/\n[7]: https://rapidaid.com/research-and-innovation/\n[8]: https://rapidaid.com/safety-and-compliance/\n[9]: https://rapidaid.com/careers/\n[10]: https://rapidaid.com/products/\n[11]: #\n[12]: /products/body_arears_filter-back-neck/\n[13]: /products/body_arears_filt"
