eatment][82]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][83]\n* [Private Label][84]\n* [Resources][85]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][86]\n* [News & Articles][87]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][88]\n* [Literature][89]\n* [Customer Service][90]\n* [Contact Us][91]\n* [English][92]\n* [French][93]\n* [Home][94]\n* [About Us][95]\n* [About Us][96]\n* [Our History][97]\n* [Manufacturing & Distribution][98]\n* [Research & Innovation][99]\n* [Safety and Compliance][100]\n* [Careers][101]\n* [Global Manufacturing Locations][102]\n* [Menu Item mobile-none][103]\n* [Rapid Aid Corporate Headquarters and North American Production][104]\n* [North American Warehouse][105]\n* [About image][106]\n* [Vietnam Manufacturing and QA][107]\n* [China Office and Production][108]\n* [Products][109]\n* * [View All Products][110]\n* Body Area\n* [Back & Neck][111]\n* [Head & Face][112]\n* [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][113]\n* [Multiple Body Parts][114]\n* [Sensitive Areas][115]\n* [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][116]\n* * Product Category\n* [Gel Strips][117]\n* [Heat Bands][118]\n* [Refillable Packs][119]\n* [Instant Packs][120]\n* [Moist Heat Packs][121]\n* [Reusable Gel Packs][122]\n* [Medicated Patches][123]\n* [Compression Gel Sleeves][124]\n* * Segment-Department\n* [Children\u2019s Care][125]\n* [Eye Care][126]\n* [Feminine Care][127]\n* [First Aid][128]\n* [Mom & Baby][129]\n* [Pain Relief][130]\n* [Sports Recovery][131]\n* * [Temperature][132]\n* [Hot Treatment][133]\n* [Cold Treatment][134]\n* [Hot-or-Cold Treatment][135]\n* [Private Label][136]\n* [Resources][137]\n* * [Resources][138]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][139]\n* [Safety Data Sheets][140]\n* [News & Articles][141]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][142]\n* [Literature][143]\n* [Customer Service Resources][144]\n* * [The Latest Tips & News][145]\n* * [How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend][146]\n* * [Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief?][147]\n* * [[Everything You Need to Know About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs]Everything You Need to\nKnow About Reusable Hot and Cold Packs][148]\n* [Contact Us][149]\n* [English][150]\n* [French][151]\n[ Linkedin-in ][152] [ Youtube ][153]\n\n# Looking for an Ice pack company with global manufacturing capabilities?\n\n[[Woman applying ice pack to her forehead]][154]While hundreds of companies have products on the\nmarket, Rapid Aid stands out from the others because of its long-standing history as one of the\nleading manufacturers for instant hot and cold packs. Established in 1975, they have built a\nbusiness that focuses on providing small and large companies with the highest quality products\npossible. Because they have stayed true to their mission for the past four decades, they have become\na household name for cold pack products that families trust to relieve pain instantly.\n\n## An Ice Pack Company With the Product Line You Need\n\nAmong over 400 products [available][155], their [Instant Hot and Cold packs][156] are by far the\nmost popular. With our patented Fold-to-Pop\u2122 technology, pain relief comes within seconds. The\ninstant technology is available in different levels of pain relief, including gentle touch and\ncomfort styles. They are also available for different areas where pain could occur and in various\nsizes. Some of their other well-known products are:\n* [Reusable gel technology][157] including protective comfort sleeves; compresses that come in\nstandard, deluxe, and premium options; wraps for different parts of the body; joint braces; and\neye masks.\n* [Wellness and comfort products][158] like their hot and cold gel slippers, therapy oat bags, and\nclay wraps.\n\nFor businesses interested in carrying Rapid Aid products, there are two options:\n* [Private Labeling][159]. Here, both medical and retail companies can put their brand on Rapid Aid\nproducts and market them as your own. Working directly with Rapid Aid representatives ensures the\nproducts are customized to reflect your brand. We have over 25 private label brands currently on\nthe market today.\n* Branded Solutions. Companies also have the opportunity to take advantage of our brand, one of the\nleading providers of hot and cold therapy products on the market. These products come with the\nRapid Label brand on them.\n\nNo matter which option you choose, We can provide you the quality and support you need to enhance\nyour current product line or enable you to enter new markets.\n\n## Why Choose Rapid Aid\u2019s Hot and Cold Therapy Products\n\n[Group 8851]\n\n### Founded\n\n1975\n\n[Group 8861]\n\n### Headquarters\n\nMississauga, Ontario, Canada\n\n[Group 530]\n\n### Product Portfolio\n\nOver 1000 Product Skus\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### Industries Served\n\nHealthcare and Retail\n\n[Group 887]\n\n### Global Manufacturing\n\nFacilities in Canada, United States, China, & Vietnam\n\n[Group 8851]\n\n### Founded\n\n1975\n\n[Group 8861]\n\n### Headquarters\n\nMississauga, Ontario, Canada\n\n[Group 530]\n\n### Product Portfolio\n\nOver 1000 Product Skus\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### Industries Served\n\nHealthcare and Retail\n\n[Group 887]\n\n### Global Manufacturing\n\nFacilities in Canada, United States, China, & Vietnam\n\n[Group 8851]\n\n### Founded\n\n1975\n\n[Group 8861]\n\n### Headquarters\n\nMississauga, Ontario, Canada\n\n[Group 530]\n\n### Product Portfolio\n\nOver 1000 Product Skus\n\n[Group 8881]\n\n### Industries Served\n\nHealthcare and Retail\n\n[Group 887]\n\n### Global Manufacturing\n\nFacilities in Canada, United States, China, & Vietnam\n\n## Global Capacity to Meet Any Requirement\n\nAs of 2021, Rapid Aid is producing over 4 million units per month. Because of its massive\nmanufacturing capacity, we can provide your business with several products at once. When working\nwith large manufacturers, shipping times and processes can be a nightmare \u2014 not with Rapid Aid! With\nour global presence and manufacturing facilities in three countries \u2013 Vietnam, Canada, and China \u2013\nwe can provide on demand solutions and rapid delivery times regardless of your location. For\ncompanies that may need products on short notice or have a constant demand for these packs, this is\na significant benefit. Extensive medical facilities and Chain stores rely on Rapid Aid\u2019s dedication\nto highly efficient manufacturing processes to satisfy their customer\u2019s needs.\n\nAs the owner of the manufacturing process from start to finish, we control the labs, design,\ntesting, compliance, production, quality, and distribution of our products. Our unique and\ninnovative approach to the manufacturing process allows for flexibility and the diversity of\nproducts you need to get up to speed quickly and cost-effectively.\n\nFor those buying in large bulk, we offer special pricing. For businesses interested stocking our\ncold packs in bulk, [contact Rapid Aid for a quote][160].\n\n[[citypng. Com]walmart horizontal logo png - 3000x3000 1]\n[5a1ac9daf65d84088faf1386 1]\n[Pharmasave-logo 1]\n[Bausch_and_lomb_logo_2010. Svg 1]\n[Sobeys_logo. Svg 1]\n[A37db48f-e40a-11dc-2262-f5f268dd407d 1]\n[Loblaws-logo-png-transparent 2]\n[Dollar_tree-logo. Wine 2]\n[Rexall_canada_logo. Svg 2]\n[Shoppers-drug-mart-logo. Svg 1]\n[Cvs_pharmacy-logo. Wine 2]\n[Meijer_logo. Svg 1]\n[Walgreens_2020_primary_logo. Svg 2]\n[600d687860095200047e8aaa 1]\n[Cardinal_health_logo. Svg 1]\n[Mckesson_logo. Svg 1]\n[F27983da-a4cf-47d7-93be-1329358d952f 1]\n[Pngfind. Com-grainger-logo-png-4186594 1]\n[Djo-logo 1]\n[Owens_&_minor_2021_logo. Svg 1]\n[Halyard-health-logo-vector 1]\n[School-health-logo-600x193 1]\n[Dynarex_150b2 1]\n[489858388_1184291323127029_8882715197795572189_n 1]\n\n## Get Started with Rapid Aid\n\nWhether you\u2019re launching a wellness line or expanding your global presence, Rapid Aid helps you move\nfrom concept to shelf quickly and confidently.\n\nWith deep category expertise, proven compliance, and a consumer-first approach, we\u2019re your ideal\npartner for private label success.\n\nTo explore how we can build your private label product line \u2013 safely, competitively, and globally.\n\n[ Contact us Today ][161]\nDisclaimer: The information provided in this article is for general educational purposes only and is\nnot intended as medical advice. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional regarding any\npersonal health concerns, symptoms, or medical conditions. Do not use this information to diagnose\nor treat a health problem without guidance from a licensed provider. \u00d7\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n### Contact Us\n\n### Yes, please contact me regarding a custom quote\n\nFirst name*\n\nLast name*\n\nCompany name*\n\nEmail*\n\nPhone number*\n\nMessage\n\n### Related Products\n\n[1000 x 1000 mpd2501705cb camphor patch pkg en 3d]\n][162]\n\n### [ Camphor 1% + Menthol 0.3% + Capsicum 0.2% Gel Patch ][163]\n\n[1000 x 1000 mpn2500808cb plantar fasciitis painpatch en 3d]\n][164]\n\n### [ Plantar Fasciitis Pain Relief Gel Patch ][165]\n\n### Get the Latest Articles and News in Your Inbox\n\n**Corporate HQ & North American Operations**\n\n[4120A Sladeview Crescent\nMississauga, ON Canada L5L 5Z3][166]\n\nPhone: [905-820-4788][167]\n\n**Vietnam Office**\n\n[Cau Ha a Hamlet][168]\n[An Quang Commune][169]\n[Hai Phong City, Vietnam][170]\n\n**China Office**\n\nGlasses Industrial Park\nDanfu Road Danyang\nJiangsu, China, 212300905-820-4788\n\n### Quick Links\n* [ About Us ][171]\n* [ Products ][172]\n* [ Resource Center ][173]\n* [ Contact Us ][174]\n\n### Follow Us\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][175] [ Youtube ][176] [ Facebook ][177]\n\n### Latest Updates\n\n][178]\n\n#### [ How Hot Compresses Help Relieve Period Cramps: A Growing Women\u2019s Wellness Trend ][179]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][180]\n][181]\n\n#### [ Heat vs Cold Therapy: Which One Works Best for Pain Relief? ][182]\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][183]\n\n### Get the Latest in Your Inbox\n\nYour Email\nSubscribe\n\u00a9 2026 Rapid Aid. All Rights Reserved.\n\n**[Bribery, Fraud, and Corruption Policy][184]