      "polished_summary": "Shrushi Polymers Private Limited is a leading manufacturer based in Sanand, Gujarat, specializing in a diverse range of packaging solutions, including corrugated boxes, thermocol products, air bubble wraps, and insulation materials. With a workforce of 26 to 50 employees and an annual turnover between 25 to 100 crore, the company caters to various industries by providing high-quality packaging products designed to meet their specific needs.",
