ified Cold Chain Packaging][93]\n* [Professional & Regulatory Groups][94]\n* [Contact Us][95]\n\n# Looking for Temperature Controlled Packaging?\n\n###### Looking for a temperature controlled packaging solution? Please fill out the form below and a\n###### member of our sales team will reach out as soon as possible. *Please note, sample requests\n###### are assessed on a case by case basis once package needs are gathered.\n\nFrom single-use to reusable, our comprehensive designs cover ambient, cold chain, and freezer\nenvironments. With pre-qualified assurance and up to 240 hours of exceptional performance, we help\nclients deliver reliable shipments from parcel to patient.\n\n## Fill Out the Form Below To Apply for A Sample\n\n#### Thank You!\n\n### LOOKING FOR A CUSTOM SOLUTION OR LAB SERVICES?\n\n[ Contact Us ][96]\n\n**TempAid Cold Chain Packaging** delivers high-performance **temperature-controlled packaging**\nsolutions for the **pharmaceutical**, **healthcare **and **life science** industries. As a division\nof Rapid Aid, we bring over 40 years of expertise in **hot and cold therapy **and **cold chain\npackaging**, manufacturing hundreds of millions of units annually to ensure reliable temperature\nstability.\n\n#### Links\n* [ About Us ][97]\n* [ News and Events ][98]\n* [ Contact Us ][99]\n* [ Our Policies ][100]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][101]\n* [ Terms and Conditions ][102]\n\n[ Linkedin ][103]\n\n#### Contact\n* [ 1-800-COLD-HOT ][104]\n* [ 1-905-820-4788 ][105]\n* [ [email protected] ][106]\n* [ HEAD OFFICE: 4085 Sladeview Crescent, Units 11-14,\nMississauga, ON, Canada L5L 5X3 ][107]\n* [ LAB TESTING: 3330 Ridgeway Drive, Unit 12,\nMississauga, ON, Canada L5L 5Z9 ][108]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 TempAid | Powered by [Astra WordPress Theme][109]\n\nPlease ensure Javascript is enabled for purposes of [website accessibility][110]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: tel:1-800-265-3468\n[3]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/tempaid\n[4]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/abou