hermal Lab can test and validate your products across the entire cold chain.\n[ Read More ][100]\n[IcePack Icon Filled white]\n\n### Packaging Components\n\nCost effective coolers, refrigerants and more, tested for your cold chain needs.\n\n[Read More][101]\n\n### Packaging Components\n\nComponents, such as gel packs, are available individually as well. On their own, TempAid gel packs\nare some of the most innovative on the market with antimicrobial, drain-friendly, reusable, and\ndisposable products to meet the need of each industry.\n[ Read More ][102]\n\n# explore products & solutions\n\n[[SpeedyPac Temperature Controlled Mailer]][103]\n\n### [SpeedyPac Integrated Mailers][104]\n\n[[SteadyPac Cube with components]][105]\n\n### [STEADYPac Long-Duration CUBE][106]\n\n[[EarthWise Recyclable Qualified Packaging from TempAid]][107]\n\n### [RECYCLABLE PACKAGING][108]\n\n[[coolers side by side]][109]\n\n### [Coolers EPS & EPP][110]\n\n[[Untitled 1]][111]\n\n### [FLEXIBLE WATER BLANKETS][112]\n\n[[Temperature Controlled Packaging Solutions]][113]\n\n### [Gel Packs\n### ][114]\n\n### [PCM Mats][115]\n\n### [Laboratory Services][116]\n\n## About US\n\nTempAid Cold Chain Packaging manufactures a complete line of temperature-controlled solutions\ndesigned to maintain temperature stability for the pharmaceutical, pharmacy, and laboratory sectors.\nAs an affiliate of Rapid Aid, the company has been delivering hot and cold solutions for over 40\nyears. Rapid Aid and TempAid currently produce hundreds of millions of units annually.\n\n### LEADERSHIP IN INNOVATION\n\nOur strategic investment in new technologies, materials and methods deliver the best quality\nproducts at the best possible cost.\n\n### Manufacturing Excellence\n\n50 years of manufacturing excellence and experience \u2013 production acumen we pass on to you.\n\n### Global Reach\n\nManufacturing on three continents assures a stable supply chain and cost optimization to meet your\nneeds.\n\n### SUSTAINABility Driven\n\nOur continued sustainability focus helps the world run better and improve people's lives, a guiding\nprinciple to our business strategy.\n\n## Contact Us\n\n## OUR Latest Blogs\n\nIntroducing\n\nThe SpeedyPac^{TM}\nPCM Envelope\n\nLightweight Mailer. Stable Temperatures Up to 48 Hours\n\nGet a Free Sample\n][117]\n\nISTA Certified Thermal\nPackage Testing\n\nEnsure your product meets regulatory standards\nand reaches its destination safely\n\nGet a Free Sample\n][118]\nPrevious\nNext\n\n**TempAid Cold Chain Packaging** delivers high-performance **temperature-controlled packaging**\nsolutions for the **pharmaceutical**, **healthcare **and **life science** industries. As a division\nof Rapid Aid, we bring over 40 years of expertise in **hot and cold therapy **and **cold chain\npackaging**, manufacturing hundreds of millions of units annually to ensure reliable temperature\nstability.\n\n#### Links\n* [ About Us ][119]\n* [ News and Events ][120]\n* [ Contact Us ][121]\n* [ Our Policies ][122]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][123]\n* [ Terms and Conditions ][124]\n\n[ Linkedin ][125]\n\n#### Contact\n* [ 1-800-COLD-HOT ][126]\n* [ 1-905-820-4788 ][127]\n* [ [email protected] ][128]\n* [ HEAD OFFICE: 4085 Sladeview Crescent, Units 11-14,\nMississauga, ON, Canada L5L 5X3 ][129]\n* [ LAB TESTING: 3330 Ridgeway Drive, Unit 12,\nMississauga, ON, Canada L5L 5Z9 ][130]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 TempAid | Powered by [Astra WordPress Theme][131]\n\nPlease ensure Javascript is enabled for purposes of [website accessibility][132]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: tel:1-800-265-3468\n[3]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/tempaid\n[4]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/about-us/#quality\n[7]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/market-segments/\n[8]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/about-us/sustainability/\n[9]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/careers/\n[10]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/packaging-compo