/\n[60]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/packaging-components/refrigerants/flexible-water-blankets/\n[61]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/packaging-components/refrigerants/durable-gel-packs/\n[62]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/low-cost-gel-packs-for-cold-chain-shipping-and-packaging/\n[63]: https://www.tempaidcoldchain.com/packaging-components/refrigerants/pc"
