-10][customer-10]\n[customer-12][customer-12]\n[customer-13][customer-13]\n[customer-14][customer-14]\n[customer-15][customer-15]\n[customer-16][customer-16]\n[customer-17][customer-17]\n\n## Direct From Factory\n\n### WHAT WE PROVIDE\n\nOur main products are gel ice packs, dry ice packs for shipping, Freezer Ice Brick, insulated lunch\nbags, insulated takeaway backpacks, EPP insulated boxes, cold shipping boxes, VPU medical\nrefrigerators, insulated box liners, insulated pallet cover and Cold chain packaging materials,etc.\n\n[ [24cubes Hydrate Dry Ice Pack Technic Ice Reusable Ice Pack (4)][24cubes Hydrate Dry Ice Pack\nTechnic Ice Reusable Ice Pack (4)] ][80]\n[ [product4][product4] ][81]\n[ [product5][product5] ][82]\n[ [product6][product6] ][83]\n[ [Hydration Dry Ice Packs for Cold Chain][Hydration Dry Ice Packs for Cold Chain] ][84]\n[ [product7][product7] ][85]\n[ [product8][product8] ][86]\n[ [9-Cell Hydration Dry Ice Pack 33 Cells For Cold Chain Transport (2)][9-Cell Hydration Dry Ice\nPack 33 Cells For Cold Chain Transport (2)] ][87]\n[ [Flexible Dry Ice Packs For Coolers][Flexible Dry Ice Packs For Coolers] ][88]\n[ [12-Cell Reusable Food-Grade Dry Ice Pack][12-Cell Reusable Food-Grade Dry Ice Pack] ][89]\n[ [92L PU Insulated Plastic Box][92L PU Insulated Plastic Box] ][90]\n[ [10100100211][10100100211] ][91]\n\n## We are Solutions For Packaging\n\n### Your Guide to global solutions in World\n\nInquiry For Pricelist\n\n## Why Choose Us\n\n### Trusted By Thousands Of Happy Customers\n\nShanghai Huizhou Industrial Co., Ltd. was established in 2011 with a registered capital of 30\nmillion. It is a high-tech enterprise dedicated to the research and development, production, sales\nand service of products in the cold chain industry.\n\n[Read More][92]\n[tracking][tracking]\n\n### Real Time Tracking\n\n[headphone][headphone]\n\n### 24/7 Online Support\n\n[tempk Insulated EPP box1][tempk Insulated EPP box1]\n\n## Who We Are\n\n### Global Achievements\n\n## 20000 m\u00b2\n\n### Plant Area\n\n## 1 Billion Units\n\n### Per Year\n\n## Established in 2011\n\n### Goods Delivered\n\n## 0+\n\n### Happy Clients\n\n## Get A Quote\n\nProduct details such as size, color, materials etc. and other specific requirements to receive an\naccurate quote\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName: *\nName: Message: Phone:\nEmail: *\nPhone: *\nMessage: *\nSubmit[Loading][Loading]\n[tempk company][tempk company]\n\n## Latest News\n\n### Our Blogs\n\n[Tempk][93]\n\n[June 26, 2026][94]\n\n##### [McKesson Builds $179M Automated Pharma Distribution Hub with Cold Chain Capability][95]\n\nSource: The Journal Record; supporting source: Modern Distribution Management McKesson\u2019s Moore\nDistribution Hub Shows How...\n\n[ Read More][96]\n\n[Tempk][97]\n\n[June 25, 2026][98]\n\n##### [FedEx Launches Dedicated Life Sciences Organization for Healthcare Logistics][99]\n\nSource: Supply Chain Dive FedEx Life Sciences Signals a More Integrated Model for Global\nPharmaceutical...\n\n[ Read More][100]\n\n[Tempk][101]\n\n[June 24, 2026][102]\n\n##### [HelloFresh Expands Chilled Fulfillment Capacity 5X with Cold-Adapted AMRs][103]\n\nSource: Locus Robotics via Business Wire HelloFresh\u2019s Cold-Adapted AMR Deployment Expands Chilled\nFulfillment Capacity Fivefold...\n\n[ Read More][104]\n\u00d7\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nEmail *\nNumbers\nNumbers Paragraph Name\nSingle Line Text\nParagraph Text\nSubmit[Loading][Loading]\n[ [logo][logo] ][105]\n[Facebook][106] [YouTube][107] [LinkedIn][108] [WhatsApp][109]\n[\n\n#### Address\n\nRoom 207-209, Building 2, No. 7030 Yinggang East Road, Qingpu District, Shanghai, China\n\n][110]\n[\n\n#### Email\n\ninfo@tempk.com\n\n][111]\n[\n\n#### Phone Number\n\n+86-18516076656\n\n][112]\n* [Home][113]\n* [Cold Chain Packagi