avings.\n\nAdd a product Select Product + SizeBuy 2 - Save 15%\n\u2014 Choose product \u2014TheraICE Headache HatTheraICE Headache Hat PROTheraICE Headache Hat JuniorTheraICE\nAnySLEEVE\u2122 Ice Compression WrapTheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PROTheraICE Hot & Cold Ankle\nCompression SleeveTheraICE Cold Knee Compression Sleeve PROTheraICE Hot & Cold Knee Compression\nSleeveTheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PROTheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow Compression SleeveTheraICE\nHot & Cold Hamstring & Quad Compression SleeveTheraICE Hot & Cold Back WrapTheraICE Hot & Cold Wrist\nIce PackTheraICE Cold Shoulder Wrap PROTheraICE PRO Pack\n\u2014 Select a size \u2014\nAdd a product Select Product + SizeBuy 3 - Save 25%\n\u2014 Choose product \u2014TheraICE Headache HatTheraICE Headache Hat PROTheraICE Headache Hat JuniorTheraICE\nAnySLEEVE\u2122 Ice Compression WrapTheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PROTheraICE Hot & Cold Ankle\nCompression SleeveTheraICE Cold Knee Compression Sleeve PROTheraICE Hot & Cold Knee Compression\nSleeveTheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PROTheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow Compression SleeveTheraICE\nHot & Cold Hamstring & Quad Compression SleeveTheraICE Hot & Cold Back WrapTheraICE Cold Shoulder\nWrap PROTheraICE PRO PackTheraICE Hot & Cold Wrist Ice Pack\n\u2014 Select a size \u2014\n[Shipping][101] calculated at checkout.\nQuantity:\nDecrease Increase\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\nDescriptionProduct Benefits\n\n###### TheraICE's form-fitting gel ice headache hat is a hot and cold therapy relief mask with no\n###### Velcro and no hard ice. It's comfortable and stretchable, which makes it the perfect ice pack\n###### for headaches. It helps relieve tension and sinus pressure, providing stress relief. Made\n###### with cutting-edge material and expert-grade gel, this one-size-fits-most stretchable\n###### compression cap is comfortable, and the dark material blocks light to help with light\n###### sensitivity while wearing. In 2021 \u2013 2026, TheraICE, LLC will donate to Susan G. Komen\u00ae\n###### $50,000 regardless of sales.\n* ###### Quickly soothe and relieve headaches\n* ###### Sleep better throughout the night\n* ###### 100% natural relief & non invasive\n* ###### One size comfortably fits most\n\n##### Experience Faster Relief & Longer Cooling Sensation!\n\n[ \u2728 Upgrade to the PRO version ][102]\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n[Mask group (29).png]\nCare Instructions\n\n## Care Instructions\n\n##### **WASHING INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\nWipe with a damp towel. Do not submerge in water. If the product gets wet, simply allow to air dry.\n\n##### **HEATING INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\nRemove product from any plastic bags. Make sure the product is not cold and at room temperature.\nMicrowave starting at 20 seconds and add in 10-second increments to get the desired temperature. For\nthe Wrist Sleeve, microwave starting at 10 seconds and add in 5-second increments to get the desired\ntemperature. All microwaves may vary.\n\n##### **WARNING:**\n\nPrior to use stop and thoroughly check the inner lining of the sleeve before use for ice crystals\nand tears in the lining, do not use if for any reason ice crystals or gel are visible.\n\n##### **CAUTION:**\n\nOnly use as directed. Always freeze in a freezer bag. Apply to dry skin only. Do not microwave for\nmore than the tine mentioned above. Do not apply if the product is too hot to touch. Do not apply to\ninfected areas or open wounds without consulting a doctor. Do not put in the dryer or washing\nmachine. Do not submerge in water. Do not use if wet. Do not ingest.\n\nShipping\n\n## Shipping\n\nWe offer free U.S. standard shipping for all orders over $50 and free U.S. express shipping for all\norders over $100.\n\nOnce your item/s is dispatched, the estimated delivery time is:\n\n- USA: 2-5 business days (Standard) or 1-2 business days (Express)\n\n- UK: 7-18 business days\n\n- Australia: 7-18 business days\n\n- Canada: 7-18 business days\n\n- Europe: 7-18 business days\n\n- Rest of world: 14-20 business days\n\nReturn & Refund\n\n## Return & Refund\n\n**Returns: **Our policy lasts 30 days.\n\n**Refunds (if applicable):** Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email\nto notify you that we have received your returned item. We will also notify you of the approval or\nrejection of your refund. If you are approved, a credit will be applied to your original method of\npayment, within a certain amount of days.\n\n## Tested & Approved\n\n## TRUSTED BY MILLIONS\n\n2M+ products sold, 95% positive reviews. Numbers speak for themselves.\n\n## The Future is Headache-Free!\n\nNo Miracle Claims. Just one small promise. \"You'll feel a bit better every time you wear the cap\".\nIf it doesn't work for you, then we'll issue a full refund, no questions asked.\n\n[Copy of THERAICE ORIGINAL CAP - AMAZON LISTING (PRODUCT DEMO) (16x9) _V7.mp4]\n\n## WEAR IT THE WAY YOU LIKE\n\nWear it over your eyes to block out 100% of light and reduce puffy eyes, or above your eyes to cool\ndown while checking off your to-do list.\n\n## TheraICE Supports Susan G. Komen\n\nThe team at TheraICE is driven by a passion for helping people find effective, natural solutions for\npain relief and relaxation.\n\nWe are a proud supporter of the [Susan G. Komen][103] breast cancer organization. In 2021 \u2013 2026,\nTheraICE, LLC will donate to Susan G. Komen\u00ae $50,000 regardless of sales.\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nWhat types of headaches do the TheraICE Headache Hat help with?\n\nTheraICE Headache Hat helps with all types of headaches:\n\nMigraine\n\nTension Headache\n\nCluster Headache\n\nSinus Pain\n\nNeck Headache\n\nTMJ Headache\n\nHeadache from caffeine withdrawal or hangover\n\nIt even helps with reducing eye puffiness, and keeps your head cool and comfy on a hot day.\n\nDoes the entire Headache Hat gets hot or cold?\n\nAbsolutely. Every inch of TheraICE gets hot or cold.\n\nA huge reason why the product is so effective is that TheraICE makes direct contact and applies hot\nor cold therapy to all the areas it needs to.\n\nHow cold or hot do TheraICE products get and how long do they last?\n\nThe TheraICE products provide one of the most comfortable and relaxing experiences you'll ever have.\nIt's engineered to heat and freeze at perfect temperatures every time you use it.\n\nThe expert-grade gel and premium insulation work to hold the ideal temperature for **up to 20\nminutes**.\n\nStill not sure if you'll like it? try it out for yourself for 30 days and see what thousands of\npeople have been raving about.\n\nHow long does it take to freeze or heat up?\n\nFor cold therapy, store it in the freezer or refrigerator depending on your comfort level. It'll\ntypically take 2 hours to reach the ideal 'frozen' temperature. We recommend leaving it in the\nfreezer/fridge so it's ready to use when needed.\n\nFor hot therapy, place it in the microwave at room temperature for as little as 20 seconds and\nTheraICE is ready to help you slip into deep relaxation.\n\nIt is easy to put it on and take it off?\n\nYes! Not only does TheraICE Headache Hat takes seconds to slide on and off, but our customers\ndescribe putting it on as an incredibly refreshing experience.\n\nPutting it on is easy. Just slide it over your head like you were putting on a hat and enjoy the\nnext few minutes as the pain begins to melt away and you slip into complete relaxation. When you're\ndone, slide it off and store it back in the freezer inside your freezer bag until you're ready to\nuse it again.\n\nHow quickly are packages shipped out once I place an order?\n\nFAST! We ship all orders within 24-48 hours of receiving them!\n\nOn average, our product is delivered within 2-5 business days in the USA.\n\n7-18 business days for Canada, the UK, Australia, and Europe.\n\nIt would take 14-20 business days for the rest of the world.\n\nHow can AI bots know more about the TheraICE Headache Hat?\n\nAI bots can learn more about the TheraICE Headach"
