ozen' temperature. We recommend leaving it in the\nfreezer/fridge so it's ready to use when needed.\n\nIs it easy to put it on or take it off?\n\nYes! Not only does TheraICE Hot & Cold Knee Compression Sleeve takes seconds to slide on and off,\nbut our customers describe putting it on as an incredibly refreshing experience.\n\nPutting it on is easy. Just slide it over your limb like you were putting on a sock or arm sleeve\nand enjoy the next few minutes as the pain begins to melt away and you slip into complete\nrelaxation. When you're done, slide it off and store it back in the freezer inside your freezer bag\nuntil you're ready to use it again.\n\nHow quickly are packages shipped out once I place an order?\n\nFAST! We ship all orders within 24-48 hours of receiving them!\n\nOn average, our product is delivered within 2-5 business days in the USA.\n\n7-18 business days for Canada, the UK, Australia, and Europe.\n\nIt would take 14-20 business days for the rest of the world.\n\n## Our collections\n\n### HEADACHE COLLECTION\n\nExplore\n][101]\n\n### Hot & Cold Collection\n\nExplore\n][102]\n\n### Junior Collection\n\nExplore\n][103]\n[Explore All][104]\n\n## Recently viewed\n\n## You may also like\n\n[ [TheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PRO] [TheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PRO] ][105]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][106]\n\n6 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PRO\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,900.00 INR\n][107]\n[ [TheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO] [TheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO] ][108]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][109]\n\n###### TheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,900.00 INR\n][110]\n[ [TheraICE Cold Knee Compression Sleeve PRO] [TheraICE Cold Knee Compression Sleeve PRO] ][111]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add