d Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO\n\u2014 Select a size \u2014\nAdd a product Select Product + SizeBuy 3 - Save 25%\n\u2014 Choose product \u2014TheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve JuniorTheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow\nCompression SleeveTheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO\n\u2014 Select a size \u2014\n[Shipping][96] calculated at checkout.\nQuantity:\nDecrease Increase\nAdd to cart Add to cart\n\nDescriptionProduct Benefits\n\n###### Experience targeted relief with the TheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve Junior,\n###### designed to provide 360\u00b0 coverage for elbows. This flexible sleeve offers both hot and cold\n###### therapy to alleviate pain from injuries, inflammation, and muscle strains. Its expert-grade\n###### gel and premium insulation maintain the ideal temperature for up to 20 minutes, ensuring\n###### effective relief. The stretchable, form-fitting design ensures comfort and mobility without\n###### the need for hard inserts or Velcro. Easy to use and reusable, it's a clean, convenient, and\n###### travel-friendly solution for pain management.\n* ###### Helps muscle relax naturally\n* ###### Easy to slip on\n* ###### Soft on skin\n* ###### Can be worn under clothing\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n* 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n* FREE SHIPPING ABOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n\nCare Instructions\n\n## Care Instructions\n\n##### **WASHING INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\nWipe with a damp towel. Do not submerge in water. If the product gets wet, simply allow to air dry.\n\n##### **HEATING INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\nRemove product from any plastic bags. Make sure the product is not cold and at room temperature.\nMicrowave starting at 20 seconds and add in 10-second increments to get the desired temperature. For\nthe Wrist Sleeve, microwave starting at 10 seconds and add in 5-second increments to get the desired\ntemperature. All microwaves may vary.\n\n##### **WARNING:**\n\nPrior to use stop and thoroughly check the inner lining of the sleeve before use for ice crystals\nand tears in the lining, do not use if for any reason ice crystals or gel are visible.\n\n##### **CAUTION:**\n\nOnly use as directed. Always freeze in a freezer bag. Apply to dry skin only. Do not microwave for\nmore than the tine mentioned above. Do not apply if the product is too hot to touch. Do not apply to\ninfected areas or open wounds without consulting a doctor. Do not put in the dryer or washing\nmachine. Do not submerge in water. Do not use if wet. Do not ingest.\n\nShipping\n\n## Shipping\n\nWe offer free U.S. standard shipping for all orders over $50 and free U.S. express shipping for all\norders over $100.\n\nOnce your item/s is dispatched, the estimated delivery time is:\n\n- USA: 2-5 business days (Standard) or 1-2 business days (Express)\n\n- UK: 7-18 business days\n\n- Australia: 7-18 business days\n\n- Canada: 7-18 business days\n\n- Europe: 7-18 business days\n\n- Rest of world: 14-20 business days\n\nReturn & Refund\n\n## Return & Refund\n\n**Returns: **Our policy lasts 30 days.\n\n**Refunds (if applicable):** Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email\nto notify you that we have received your returned item. We will also notify you of the approval or\nrejection of your refund. If you are approved, a credit will be applied to your original method of\npayment, within a certain amount of days.\n\n## 360 DEGREE COVERAGE\n\n360\u00b0 arm coverage to stabilize while maintaining mobility\n\n## COMFORT FIRST FIT\n\nState-of-the-art gel liner and buttery- soft, breathable fabric provides a comfortable snug-like\nstretch that doesn't wiggle or slip -- no messy, uncomfortable ice packs or awkward straps here.\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nHow cold or hot do TheraICE products get and how long do they last?\n\nThe TheraICE products provide one of the most comfortable and relaxing experiences you'll ever have.\nIt's engineered to heat and freeze at perfect temperatures every time you use it.\n\nThe expert-grade gel and premium insulation work to hold the ideal temperature for **up to 20\nminutes**.\n\nStill not sure if you'll like it? try it out for yourself for 30 days and see what thousands of\npeople have been raving about.\n\nHow long does it take to freeze or heat up?\n\nFor cold therapy, store it in the freezer or refrigerator depending on your comfort level. It'll\ntypically take 2 hours to reach the ideal 'frozen' temperature. We recommend leaving it in the\nfreezer/fridge so it's ready to use when needed.\n\nFor hot therapy, place it in the microwave at room temperature for as little as 20 seconds and\nTheraICE is ready to help you slip into deep relaxation.\n\nIt is easy to put it on and take it off?\n\nYes! Not only does TheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve Junior takes seconds to slide on and\noff, but our customers describe putting it on as an incredibly refreshing experience.\n\nPutting it on is easy. Just slide it over your limb like you were putting on a sock or arm sleeve\nand enjoy the next few minutes as the pain begins to melt away and you slip into complete\nrelaxation. When you're done, slide it off and store it back in the freezer inside your freezer bag\nuntil you're ready to use it again.\n\nHow quickly are packages shipped out once I place an order?\n\nFAST! We ship all orders within 24-48 hours of receiving them!\n\nOn average, our product is delivered within 2-5 business days in the USA.\n\n7-18 business days for Canada, the UK, Australia, and Europe.\n\nIt would take 14-20 business days for the rest of the world.\n\nDoes the entire TheraICE Hot & Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve Junior gets hot or cold?\n\nDescriptive topic content body text\n\n## Our collections\n\n### Headache Collection\n\nExplore\n][97]\n\n### Hot & Cold Collection\n\nExplore\n][98]\n\n### PRO Collection\n\nExplore\n][99]\n[Explore All][100]\n\n## Recently viewed\n\n## You may also like\n\n[ [TheraICE Headache Hat Junior] [TheraICE Headache Hat Junior] ][101]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][102]\n\n###### TheraICE Headache Hat Junior\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,900.00 INR\n][103]\n[ [TheraICE Hot & Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve Junior] [TheraICE Hot & Cold Ankle Compression\nSleeve Junior] ][104]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][105]\n\n###### TheraICE Hot & Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve Junior\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,900.00 INR\n][106]\n[ [TheraICE Hot & Cold Knee Compression Sleeve Junior] [TheraICE Hot & Cold Knee Compression Sleeve\nJunior] ][107]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][108]\n\n###### TheraICE Hot & Cold Knee Compression Sleeve Junior\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,900.00 INR\n][109]\n[ [TheraICE Hot & Cold Jaw Wrap] [TheraICE Hot & Cold Jaw Wrap] ][110]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][111]\n\n8 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Hot & Cold Jaw Wrap\n\nRegular price Rs. 1,500.00 INR\n][112]\n[ [TheraICE Hot & Cold Wrist Ice Pack] [TheraICE Hot & Cold Wrist Ice Pack] ][113]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][114]\n\n80 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Hot & Cold Wrist Ice Pack\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,000.00 INR\n][115]\n[ [TheraICE Soothing Head Stick] [TheraICE Soothing Head Stick] ][116]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething w