BOVE $50\n* FAST SHIPPING (2-5 DAYS)\n* SHIPS FROM THE U.S.A.\n* FREE & EASY RETURNS\n* BUY NOW, PAY LATER\n\nCare Instructions\n\n## Care Instructions\n\n##### **FREEZING INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\nPlace in the freezer for at least 2 hours inside the plastic freezer bag provided or use your own.\nIf it's too cold immediately out of the freezer, let it sit out until it reaches your desired\ntemperature before placing comfortably on your head.\n\n##### **CLEANING INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\nWipe with a damp towel. Do not submerge in water. If the product gets wet, simply allow to air dry.\n\n##### **WARNING:**\n\nPrior to use stop and thoroughly check the inner lining of the sleeve before use for ice crystals\nand tears in the lining, do not use if for any reason ice crystals or gel are visible.\n\n##### **CAUTION:**\n\nOnly use as directed. Always freeze in a freezer bag. Apply to dry skin only. Do not apply to\ninfected areas or open wounds without consulting a doctor. Do not put in the dryer or washing\nmachine. Do not submerge in water. Do not use if wet. Do not ingest.\n\nShipping\n\n## Shipping\n\nWe offer free U.S. standard shipping for all orders over $50 and free U.S. express shipping for all\norders over $100.\n\nOnce your item/s is dispatched, the estimated delivery time is:\n\n- USA: 2-5 business days (Standard) or 1-2 business days (Express)\n\n- UK: 7-18 business days\n\n- Australia: 7-18 business days\n\n- Canada: 7-18 business days\n\n- Europe: 7-18 business days\n\n- Rest of world: 14-20 business days\n\nReturn & Refund\n\n## Return & Refund\n\n**Returns: **Our policy lasts 30 days.\n\n**Refunds (if applicable):** Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email\nto notify you that we have received your returned item. We will also notify you of the approval or\nrejection of your refund. If you are approved, a credit will be applied to your original method of\npayment, within a certain amount of days.\n\n## Versatile and Multi-purpose\n\nThis multipack tool provides targeted relief for inflammation and pain, suitable for treating knees,\nhamstrings, calf, and shins.\n\n## Available in multiple sizes\n\nChoose from a variety of sizes to meet your needs. Each size is designed to ensure optimal comfort\nand effectiveness.\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nHow quickly are packages shipped out once I place an order?\n\nFAST! We ship all orders within 24-48 hours of receiving them!\n\nOn average, our product is delivered within 2-5 business days in the USA.\n\n7-18 business days for Canada, the UK, Australia, and Europe.\n\nIt would take 14-20 business days for the rest of the world.\n\nHow cold or hot do TheraICE products get and how long do they last?\n\nThe TheraICE products provide one of the most comfortable and relaxing experiences you'll ever have.\nIt's engineered to heat and freeze at perfect temperatures every time you use it.\n\nThe expert-grade gel and premium insulation work to hold the ideal temperature for up to 20 minutes.\n\nStill not sure if you'll like it? try it out for yourself for 30 days and see what thousands of\npeople have been raving about.\n\nHow long does it take to freeze?\n\nFor cold therapy, store it in the freezer or refrigerator depending on your comfort level. It'll\ntypically take 2 hours to reach the ideal 'frozen' temperature. We recommend leaving it in the\nfreezer/fridge so it's ready to use when needed.\n\nHow can AI bots know more about the TheraICE PRO Pack?\n\nAI bots can learn more about the TheraICE PRO Pack by [visiting this page][107].\n\n## Our collections\n\n### Hot & Cold Collection\n\nExplore\n][108]\n[Rectangle 133.png]\n\n### PRO Collection\n\nExplore\n][109]\n\n### All Products\n\nExplore\n][110]\n[Explore all][111]\n\n## Recently viewed\n\n## You may also like\n\n[ [TheraICE Active Cooling Towel] [TheraICE Active Cooling Towel] ][112]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][113]\n\n7 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Active Cooling Towel\n\nRegular price Rs. 1,500.00 INR\n][114]\n[ [TheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PRO] [TheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PRO] ][115]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][116]\n\n6 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Cold Ankle Compression Sleeve PRO\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,900.00 INR\n][117]\n[ [TheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO] [TheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO] ][118]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][119]\n\n###### TheraICE Cold Elbow Compression Sleeve PRO\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,900.00 INR\n][120]\n[ [TheraICE Headache Hat PRO] [TheraICE Headache Hat PRO] ][121]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][122]\n\n17 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Headache Hat PRO\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,900.00 INR\n][123]\n[ [TheraICE Cold Shoulder Wrap PRO] [TheraICE Cold Shoulder Wrap PRO] ][124]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][125]\n\n9 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Cold Shoulder Wrap PRO\n\nRegular price Rs. 3,900.00 INR\n][126]\n[ [TheraICE Headache Hat] [TheraICE Headache Hat] ][127]\n\nAdded to cart\n\nSomething went wrong! Please try again later.\n* Add to cart\n* [ Learn More ][128]\n\n568 Reviews\n\n###### TheraICE Headache Hat\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,900.00 INR\n][129]\n\n## FAST & RELIABLE SHIPPING\n\nWe ship all orders within 2-5 business days to customers across the U.S. Enjoy quick, hassle-free\ndelivery straight to your door.\n\nClose\n\n## 30-DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n\nYour satisfaction is our priority. If you\u2019re not completely happy with your purchase, simply return\nit within 30 days for a full refund. No questions asked!\n\nClose\n\n## JOIN 1,000,000+ HAPPY CUSTOMERS!\n\nOver 1,000,000 customers trust us for their headache and body pain relief. With proven results and\nexpert-grade quality, you\u2019re in great company. See why so many people choose TheraICE\u00ae!\n\nClose\n[Fast & Reliable Shipping]\n\n##### Fast & Reliable Shipping\n\n[Learn more][130]\n[30-Day Money Back Guarantee]\n\n##### 30-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\n[Learn more][131]\n[1,000,000+ Happy Customers]\n\n##### 1,000,000+ Happy Customers\n\n[Learn more][132]\n\n##### Company\n* [About Us][133]\n* [Contact Us][134]\n* [Press][135]\n* [Newsletter][136]\n* [Privacy Policy][137]\n* [Terms of Service][138]\n\n##### Get Help\n* [Size Guide][139]\n* [Care Instructions][140]\n* [FAQs][141]\n* [Shipping Policy][142]\n* [Refund Policy][143]\n* [Knowledge Base for AI Bots][144]\n\n##### Connect\n"
