        "crawl_text": "[\n[Untitled UI logotext]\n][1]\n[Products][2]\nAbout Us\n[\nOverview\nAn introduction to Thermogard. Our story and our people\n][3][\nInnovation\nLatest developments in cool chain technology\n][4][\nSustainability\nOur commitment to closed-cycle solutions\n][5]\nProjects\n[\nPerishable eCommerce\n][6][\nHealth & Life Sciences\n][7][\nSeafood\n][8]\n[Our Process][9]\n[Contact Us][10]\nOrder\n[\nAustralia\n][11][\nNew Zealand\n][12][\nUnited States\n][13]\n\n# The sustainable\n# \u200dchoice is the\n# profitable choice\n\nWe're on a mission to bring cost-effective, sustainable, cool\u2011chain packaging to the world.\n[\nOur Products\n][14]\n\n## Industries we serve\n\nThermogard designs and manufactures solutions for organisations with critical cold chain\nrequirements, without compromise.\n[Mockup]\n\n### Seafood\n\nThermogard understands the unique demands of the seafood industry, and offers considered polystyrene\nalternatives to preserve quality, freshness and flavour.\n[Mockup]\n\n### Perishable eCommerce\n\nWorking with the leading meal-kit providers to provide value to their supply chain, Thermogard\npackaging delivers freshness to their customer's doorstep.\n[Mockup]\n\n### Life Sciences & Healthcare\n\nTrusted by global pharmaceutical companies worldwide to safely transit life-saving product,\nThermogard knows how to engineer pack-out with precision front of mind.\n[\nUse Cases\n][15]\n\n### We\u2019re creating a world where sustainability doesn\u2019t cost more\n\nWhether its recyclable materials, compostable, reusable, paper based or plastic, companies and\nresearchers globally are continually providing new perspectives on the impacts of certain materials.\nWe're at the forefront, bringing new innovations to market, evolving our product range and coming to\nyou with the latest.\n[\nContact Us\n][16]\n[\nLearn more\n][17]\n[Thermogard icon with forst background]\n\n## Use Cases\n\n[\nView all posts\n][18]\n[\n[Office setting]\n][19]\