      "polished_summary": "Trimurti Plast Containers Private Limited, based in Pune, Maharashtra, is a leading manufacturer specializing in blow-moulded bottles, caps, closures, and injection-moulded parts. With a diverse product range that includes HDPE and PET containers for lubricants, pharmaceuticals, and chemicals, the company serves various industries, ensuring high-quality packaging solutions tailored to meet customer needs. Established in 2017, Trimurti Plast is committed to innovation and excellence in the plastics manufacturing sector.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Trimurti Plast Containers Private Limited manufactures gel ice packs, specifically the 'Painzol Cold Gel Ice Pack' and '400 ML Ice Pack Coolent Water Pack', which are directly relevant to the gel ice pack market. Their focus on cold chain products indicates a commitment to this specific market.",
