        "crawl_text": "Cool Relief LLC 1312 NW 14th St, Oklahoma City, OK 73106 search\nclose\n\n**Do you like cookies?** \ud83c\udf6a We use cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website.\n\nAccept cookies close\n\n#### Share and get 15% off!\n\nclose\n\nSimply share this product on one of the following social networks and you will unlock 15% off!\n* share Share\n\n#### Thank you for sharing!\n\nclose\n\nCopy the discount code below and paste it at checkout to get your discount!\n\nApply discount code\n\nItem has been added\n\nView Cart\nclose\n\nYou're away from FREE shipping!\n\nlocal_shipping\n\nLiquid error (sections/dbtfy-cart-goal line 68): comparison of String with 0.0 failed\n\nlocal_shipping\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days (Order within 16:00:00)\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nlocal_shipping Buy now to receive in **** - **** days\nmenu Menu\nclose\n* [Shop Ice ][1]\nadd remove\n* [ Knee Ice Wraps ][2]\n* [ Shoulder Ice Wraps ][3]\n* [ Hip Ice Wraps ][4]\n* [ Back Ice Wraps ][5]\n* [ Ankle/Foot Ice Wraps ][6]\n* [ Wrist/Elbow Ice Wraps ][7]\n* [ Jaw Ice Wrap ][8]\n* [ Face/Neck Ice Wrap ][9]\n* [ Multi-Purpose Ice Wraps ][10]\n* [ Reusable Gel Pack Inserts ][11]\n* [Shop Heat][12]\nadd remove\n* [ Knee Heat Pack ][13]\n* [ Shoulder Heat Wrap ][14]\n* [ Hip Heat Wrap ][15]\n* [ Back Heat Wrap ][16]\n* [ Face Heat Wrap ][17]\n* [ Ankle/Foot Heat Wrap ][18]\n* [ Thigh/Calf Heat Wrap ][19]\n* [ Why Our Ice Packs ][20]\n* [ Shower Shield ][21]\n[ exit_to_app Log In ][22] [ person_add Create Account ][23]\n* [ email dgrunder@coolrelief.net ][24]\n* [ phone 8004751609 ][25]\n* [Blog][26]\n* [Shipping and Returns][27]\n* [Contact Us][28]\n* [Become an Affiliate][29]\n* [Reviews][30]\n[Skip to content][31]\n\nFollow us!\n\nFree Shipping On Orders Over $35\n\n30-Day free returns\n\nGet in touch with us\n* [ phone ][32]\n* [ email ][33]\n* [ menu ][34]\n* [ search ][35]\n* [ Ice/Heat Wraps keyboard_arrow_down ][36]\n* [ Knee ][37]\n* [ Shoulder ][38]\n* [ Hip ][39]\n* [ Back ][40]\n* [ Ankle and Foot ][41]\n* [ Head and Neck ][42]\n* [ Thigh and Calf ][43]\n* [ Gel Packs keyboard_arrow_down ][44]\n* [ Small Hot/Cold Gel Pack ][45]\n* [ Large Hot/Cold Gel Pack ][46]\n* [ Shop by injury ][47]\n* [ Shower Shield ][48]\n* [ About keyboard_arrow_down ][49]\n* [ Blog ][50]\n* [ Why Cool Relief ][51]\n* [ Pain Relief Guide ][52]\n* [ Become an Affiliate ][53]\n* [ Contact Us ][54]\n* account_circle\n* [ exit_to_app Log In ][55]\n* [ person_add Create Account ][56]\n* [ search ][57]\n* language\nCurrency USDCADINRGBPAUDEURJPY sync Update preferences\n* [ shopping_cart0 ][58]\n* [ Ice/Heat Wraps ][59]\n* [ Gel Packs ][60]\n* [ Shop by injury ][61]\n* [ Shower Shield ][62]\n* [ About ][63]\n* [ home ][64]\n* keyboard_arrow_right\n* [About our Hot and Cold Therapy][65]\n* share Share\n\n# About our Hot and Cold Therapy\n\n# Cool Relief \u2013 heat and ice wraps for back, knee, neck, ankles and more.\n\nWhen it comes to injuries and pain, trade-offs are out of the question. Cool Relief's proprietary\ngel pack design stays colder for longer with the flexibility to move with you and your active\nlifestyle. Proper treatment of injuries will get you back to doing what you love whether it's\nrunning, biking, competitive sports or even walking your dog.\n\nNagging joints can drive you crazy and keep you from reaching your full potential. Cool Relief's\ncold and hot therapy systems will assist you in taking care of all the aches and pains that life\nbrings. Sprained ankles, pulled muscles, and post-surgery recovery can be trying, but we are here to\nhelp.\n\nWhen an injury has you down the effects of cold and hot therapy cannot be understated. Applying ice\npacks to various injuries reduces swelling and painful inflammation promoting healing and optimizing\ncomfort. The same gel pack that ices your injury can also be heated up to relieve sore muscles and\ntension after a long day.\n\nOur knowledge and extensive line of products ensure there is the solution you need for every joint\nand part that pains you whether it's your [knee][66], [back][67], [hip][68], [shoulder][69],\n[hands][70]/[feet][71], [jaw][72], or anything else we have the Cool Relief solution you need.\n\n### Recently viewed\n\n## Recently viewed\n\n## From our Instagram\n\n###### Follow-us on social media!\n\n###### Get in Touch\n* [ email dgrunder@coolrelief.net ][73]\n* [ phone 8004751609 ][74]\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [ Blog ][75]\n* [ Shipping and Returns ][76]\n* [ Contact Us ][77]\n* [ Become an Affiliate ][78]\n* [ Reviews ][79]\n\n###### Shop Cool Relief\n* [ Shop Ice ][80]\n* [ Shop Heat ][81]\n* [ Why Our Ice Packs ][82]\n* [ Shower Shield ][83]\n\n###### Subscribe to our newsletter\n\nJoin our newsletter and be the first to receive exclusive promotions and discounts!\n\nEmail me with news and offers\nemail Subscribe\nlanguage\nCurrency USDCADINRGBPAUDEURJPY sync Update preferences\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 [Ice Wraps by Cool Relief][84] | We improve our products and advertising by using\nMicrosoft Clarity to see how you use our website. By using our site, you agree that we and Microsoft\ncan collect and use this data. Our [privacy statement ][85]has more details. | Powered by\n[Shopify][86] | Powered by [Debutify][87]\n* Payment methods\n* [Amazon]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\nkeyboard_arrow_up\n\n[1]: /collections\n[2]: /collections/knee-ice-wraps\n[3]: /collections/ice-wraps\n[4]: /c