      "company_summary": "Direct is a leading manufacturer and supplier of innovative packaging solutions, specializing in products such as pressure-sensitive tapes, protective equipment, and pharmacy supplies. With a focus on serving diverse industries including pharmaceuticals, healthcare, and logistics, the company offers a range of high-quality items designed to meet the specific needs of businesses, from surgical masks to custom packaging options.",
