lable, tear-resistant, and easy to open and fold.\n\nPopularly used in marathons, endurance events, camping, backpacking, and other outdoor activities.\nInclude them as a lightweight, thermal, compact alternative in emergency kits for Survival, Camping,\nCar, Earthquake, Hurricane, Search and Rescue; and First Aid Kits.\n\n48\" x 72\" blanket, 48-gauge metalized polyester\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][63]\n[color: silver ~ size: 250 count ~ alt: Marathon Blankets] [color: silver ~ size: 250 count ~ alt:\nMarathon Blankets] [color: silver ~ size: 250 count ~ alt: Marathon Blankets] [color: silver ~ size:\n250 count ~ alt: Marathon Blankets] [color: silver ~ size: 250 count ~ alt: Marathon Blankets]\n[color: silver ~ size: 250 count ~ alt: Marathon Blankets] [color: silver ~ size: 250 count ~ alt:\nMarathon Blankets]\n* [ Search ][64]\n* [ Refund Policy ][65]\n* [ Terms of Service ][66]\n* [ Shipping Policy ][67]\n* [ Contact ][68]\n* [ 410-825-8300 ][69]\n\n## Subscribe for Email Updates\n\nEmail\n\u00a9 2026, [Universal Packaging][70] [Powered by Shopify][71]\n* [Refund policy][72]\n* [Privacy policy][73]\n* [Terms of service][74]\n* [Shipping policy][75]\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/packaging-tape\n[3]: /collections/masking-tape\n[4]: /collections/filament-tape\n[5]: /collections/double-sided-tape\n[6]: /collections/incrediseal-repulpable-tapes\n[7]: /collections/specialty-tape\n[8]: /collections/advanced-air-system\n[9]: /collections/bubble-wrap-film\n[10]: /collections/bubble-wrap-film/Hybrid\n[11]: /collections/large-air-pillow-film\n[12]: /collections/surgical-masks\n[13]: /collections/n95-masks\n[14]: /collections/gloves\n[15]: /collections/gowns\n[16]: /collections/emergency-blankets\n[17]: /collections/marathon-blankets\n[18]: /collections/pharmacy-bags-line-haul-and-special-purpose\n[19]: /collections/ice-packs-cold-chain\n[20]: 