ecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Stationery Wrapping Packaging Tape, 1&quot; x 110 yds, 1.95 mil,\nClear, 72 Rolls per Case Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Stationery Wrapping Packaging Tape,\n1&quot; x 110 yds, 1.95 mil, Clear, 72 Rolls per Case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal Wrapping Packing Tape, 1\" x 110 yds, 1.95 mil, Clear, 72 Rolls per Case\n* More tape, Less cost - 110 yards of premium packing tape per roll, more than most brands at\nfactory-direct prices\n* Thicker \u2013 1.95 mil commercial durability, so packages stay sealed\n* Better adhesive \u2013 Our acrylic adhesive has a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It holds\ntight from the freezer to extreme heat\n* Easy, quick pack, and ship \u2013 The tough seal guards your packages against rough handling during\nshipping and storage\n* Item # UNPK.AT1-2822\n\nIncrediSeal 1\u201d wide clear wrapping tape saves you money. There are 110 yards of premium packing tape\non each roll. Much more than most brands, at less cost. The 1\" industrial roll seals and secure\nboxes. Our 1\u201d premium IncrediSeal packaging tape is UV resistant and waterproof, making it perfect\nfor storage.\n\nAt 1.95 mil thick, our industrial packaging shipping tape is strong packing & shipping protection.\nIt provides a consistent, reliable seal to guard your boxes.\n\nOur acrylic adhesive is pressure-sensitive, which makes it unwind and seal easily. IncrediSeal\nmailing tape works better because it can endure a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It is\nmade to handle harsh warehouse conditions and keep your boxes sealed from the freezer to extreme\nheat. Each roll has a 3\" core for use with larger tape dispensers. The tape dispenser is not\nincluded.\n\nUses include gift wrapping, packing, mailing, shipping, and crafting.\n\n[Acrylic PSA][63]\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][64]\n[color: clear ~ size 1\" ~ alt: AT1-2822 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Strapping Tape, 1\" x 110 yds, 1.95\nmil