ds, 2.10\nmil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10\nmil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10\nmil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10\nmil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10\nmil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n1 / of 5\n\nIncrediseal \u2122\n\n# IncrediSeal Machine Packing Shipping Tape, Clear, 2\u201d x 1350 Yards, 2.10 mil, 6 rolls per case\n\n## IncrediSeal Machine Packing Shipping Tape, Clear, 2\u201d x 1350 Yards, 2.10 mil, 6 rolls per case\n\n][61]\nRegular price $138.04 USD\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $138.04 USD\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][62] calculated at checkout.\nColor ClearVariant sold out or unavailable Size 2\" widthVariant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Machine Packing Shipping Tape, Clear, 2\u201d x 1350 Yards, 2.10 mil, 6\nrolls per case Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Machine Packing Shipping Tape, Clear, 2\u201d x 1350\nYards, 2.10 mil, 6 rolls per case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal Polypro Machine Packaging Tape, Clear, 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10 mil, 6 rolls/case\n\nMore tape, Less cost - 1350 yards of premium tape per roll, more than most brands at factory-direct\nprices\n\nThicker \u2013 2.10 mil heavy-duty durability, so packages stay sealed\n\nBetter adhesive \u2013 Our acrylic adhesive has a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It holds\ntight from the freezer to extreme heat\n\nEasy, quick pack and ship \u2013 The tough seal guards your packages against rough handling during\nshipping and storage\n\nItem # UNPK.AT2-3023M\n\nIncrediSeal 2\u201d wide clear packing tape saves you money. There are 1350 yards of premium waterproof\ntape on each roll. Much more than most brands, at less cost. The heavy-duty wide 2\u201d industrial roll\nseals and secure boxes with one swipe. Save time sealing more boxes with less work. Our 2\u201d premium\nIncrediSeal moving tape is UV resistant and waterproof, making it perfect for storage.\n\nAt 2.10 mil thick, our industrial packaging shipping tape is strong packing & shipping protection.\nIt provides a consistent, reliable seal to guard your boxes. Even heavyweight packages stay sealed\nduring mailing and storage.\n\nOur acrylic adhesive is pressure-sensitive, which makes it unwind and seal easily. IncrediSeal\nmailing tape works better because it can endure a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It is\nmade to handle harsh warehouse conditions and keep your boxes sealed from the freezer to extreme\nheat.\n\nUses include moving, packing, mailing, shipping, and storage of corrugated or linerboard boxes.\n\n[Incrediseal Polypro Packaging Tape][63] Specifications\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][64]\n[color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10\nmil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case] [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122\nPolypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10 mil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case] [color: clear ~\nsize 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10 mil, Clear Machine\nTape 6 Rolls per Case] [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape\n2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10 mil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls per Case] [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt:\nAT2-3023M IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape 2\" x 1350 yds, 2.10 mil, Clear Machine Tape 6 Rolls\nper Case]\n* [ Search ][65]\n* [ Refund Policy ][66]\n* [ Terms of Service ][67]\n* [ Shipping Policy ][68]\n* [ Contact ][69]\n* [ 410-825-8300 ][70]\n\n## Subscribe for Email Updates\n\nEmail\n\u00a9 2026, [Universal Packaging][71] [Powered by Shopify][72]\n* [Refund policy][73]\n* [Privacy policy][74]\n* [Terms of service][75]\n* [Shipping policy][76]\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/packaging-tape\n[3]: /collections/masking-tape\n[4]: /collections/filament-tape\n[5]: /collections/double-sided-tape\n[6]: /collections/incrediseal-repulpable-tapes\n[7]: /collections/specialty-tape\n[8]: /collections/advanced-air-system\n[9]: /collections/bubble-wrap-film\n[10]: /collections/bubble-wrap-film/Hybrid\n[11]: /collections/large-air-pillow-film\n[12]: /collections/surgical-masks\n[13]: /collections/n95-masks\n[14]: /collections/gloves\n[15]: /collections/gowns\n[16]: /collections/emergency-blankets\n[17]: /collections/marathon-blankets\n[18]: /collections/pharmacy-bags-line-haul-and-special-purpose\n[19]: /collections/ice-packs-cold-chain\n[20]: /pages/shipping-policy\n[21]: /pages/return-and-refund-policy\n[22]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[23]: /pages/contact\n[24]: /pages/contact-2\n[25]: tel:+14108258300\n[26]: https://direct.univpack.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[27]: /\n[28]: /pages/incrediseal-tapes\n[29]: /collections/packaging-tape\n[30]: /collections/masking-tape\n[31]: /collections/filament-tape\n[32]: /collections/double-sided-tape\n[33]: /collections/incrediseal-repulpable-tapes\n[34]: /collections/spec