s, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 6 in modal\n* [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.30\nmil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 7 in modal\n1 / of 7\n\nIncrediseal \u2122\n\n# IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packaging Shipping Tape, 2\" x 110 yards, 2.30 mil, 36 rolls per case\n\n## IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packaging Shipping Tape, 2\" x 110 yards, 2.30 mil, 36 rolls per case\n\n][61]\nRegular price $73.35 USD\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $73.35 USD\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][62] calculated at checkout.\nColor ClearVariant sold out or unavailable Size 2\" widthVariant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packaging Shipping Tape, 2&quot; x 110 yards,\n2.30 mil, 36 rolls per case Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packaging Shipping\nTape, 2&quot; x 110 yards, 2.30 mil, 36 rolls per case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packing Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, 2.30 mil, 36 rolls\n* 2\u201d wide, 110 yards, clear, 2.30 mil, 36 rolls\n* More tape, less cost \u2013 110 yards of premium tape per roll, more than most brands at factory-direct\nprices\n* Thicker \u2013 2.30 mil heavy-duty durability, so packages stay sealed\n* Better adhesive \u2013 Our acrylic adhesive has a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It holds\ntight from the freezer to extreme heat\n* Easy, quick pack and ship \u2013 The tough seal guards your packages against rough handling during\nshipping and storage.\n* Item # UNPK.AT2-3028\n\n[ IncrediSeal 2\" Packing Tape][63] Specifications\n\nIncrediSeal 2\u201d wide clear heavy-duty packing tape saves you money. There are 110 yards of premium\nwaterproof tape on each roll. Much more than most brands, at less cost. The wide 2\u201d industrial roll\nseals and secure boxes with one swipe. Save time sealing more boxes with less work. Our 2\u201d\nhigh-quality IncrediSeal moving tape is UV resistant and waterproof, making it perfect for storage.\n\nAt 2.30 mil thick, our industrial packaging shipping tape is strong packing & shipping protection.\nIt provides a consistent, reliable seal to guard your boxes. Even heavyweight packages stay sealed\nduring mailing and storage.\n\nOur acrylic adhesive is pressure-sensitive, which makes it unwind and seal easily. IncrediSeal\nmailing tape works better because it can endure a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It is\nmade to handle harsh warehouse conditions and keep your boxes sealed from the freezer to extreme\nheat.\n\nUses include moving, packing, mailing, shipping, and storage of corrugated or linerboard boxes.\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][64]\n[color: clear ~ size 2\"