1.77 mil, 36 rolls per case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 1.77 mil, Clear Hand Tape, 36 rolls/case\n* More Tape, Less Money \u2013 110 yards per premium roll, more than most brands and costs less\n* Strong and Durable \u2013 1.77 mil thick tape keeps packages sealed. Strong 18 lbs. tensile strength\n* Grips Better - Our acrylic adhesive is pressure sensitive with a wide temperature range of -15 F\nto 150 F, allowing the tape to keep boxes sealed from the freezer to extremely hot temperatures\n\nSpecifications - [Polypro Packaging Tape][63]\n\nThis 36 roll bulk case of IncrediSeal 2 inch wide clear packaging tape saves you money. Each roll\nhas 110 yards of premium tape. More tape than most brands at less cost. The 2\" wide industrial roll\nseals boxes with one pass. Seal more boxes in less time with IncrediSeal packing tape.\n\nAt 1.77 mil thick IncrediSeal industrial strength packing tape is made for packing & shipping, its\nheavy-duty durability will keep your boxes sealed. It\u2019s made to endure harsh warehouse conditions\nand keep your boxes closed. It holds tight straight from the freezer to extreme heat. Our mailing\ntape provides a consistent, reliable seal that will keep your packages protected.\n\nUse include - moving, mailing, shipping, and storage of corrugated or linerboard boxes\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][64]\n[color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packaging Packing Shipping Tape, 2 Inch\nx 110 Yards x 1.77 Mil (36 Rolls per Case)] [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: IncrediSeal Clear Heavy\nDuty Packaging Packing Shipping Tape, 2 Inch x 110 Yards x 1.77 Mil (36 Rolls per Case)] [color:\nclear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty Packaging Packing Shipping Tape, 2 Inch x 110\nYards x 1.77 Mil (36 Rolls per Case)] [color: clear ~ size 2\" ~ alt: IncrediSeal Clear Heavy Duty\nPackaging Packing Shipping Tape, 2 Inch x 110 Yards x 1.77 Mil (36 Rolls 