, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R3023 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R3023 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R3023 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R3023 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n* [color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R3023 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 6 in modal\n* [color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R3023 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10\nmil, Red Packaging Tape, 36 rolls/case]\nOpen media 7 in modal\n1 / of 7\n\nIncrediseal \u2122\n\n# IncrediSeal Red Packing Shipping Tape, 2\" x 110 yards, 2.10 mil, 36 rolls per case\n\n## IncrediSeal Red Packing Shipping Tape, 2\" x 110 yards, 2.10 mil, 36 rolls per case\n\n][61]\nRegular price $61.10 USD\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $61.10 USD\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][62] calculated at checkout.\nColor RedVariant sold out or unavailable Size 2\" widthVariant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Red Packing Shipping Tape, 2&quot; x 110 yards, 2.10 mil, 36 rolls\nper case Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Red Packing Shipping Tape, 2&quot; x 110 yards, 2.10 mil,\n36 rolls per case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal Red Polypro Packaging Tape, 2\" x 110 yds, x 2.10 mil, 36 rolls/case\n* 2\u201d wide, 110 yards, Red, 2.10 mil, 36 rolls\n* More tape, Less cost \u2013 110 yards of premium tape per roll, more than most brands, factory-direct\nprices\n* Color Code Organization \u2013 Easily color code boxes for quick identification during packing,\nshipping, and storage\n* Thick and Strong \u2013 Durable 2. 1 mil heavy duty thick tape, 45 lb. cross tensile strength keeps\nboxes sealed\n* Better adhesive \u2013 Our acrylic adhesive has a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It holds\ntight from the freezer to extreme heat\n* Item # UNPK.AT2-R3023\n\nIncrediSeal 2\u201d wide heavy duty red packing tape saves you money. There are 110 yards of premium\ncolored tape on each roll. Much more than most brands, at less cost. The wide 2\u201d industrial roll\nseals and secure boxes with one swipe. Save time sealing more boxes with less work. Our 2\u201d\nhigh-quality IncrediSeal moving tape is UV resistant and waterproof, making it perfect for storage.\n\nOrganize your shipping and storage by color-coding with this red tape. Our 2.10 mil thick,\nindustrial tape is strong packing & shipping protection. It provides a consistent, reliable seal to\nguard your boxes. Boxes stay sealed during mailing and storage.\n\nOur acrylic adhesive is pressure-sensitive, which makes it unwind and seal easily. IncrediSeal\nmailing tape works better because it can endure a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It is\nmade to handle harsh warehouse conditions and keep your boxes sealed from the freezer to extreme\nheat.\n\nUses include moving, packing, mailing, shipping, and storage of corrugated or linerboard boxes.\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][63]\n[color: red ~ size 2\" ~ alt: AT2-R2520 IncrediSeal \u2122 Po