IncrediSeal High Tack Masking Tape, 1\" x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 36 rolls/case.\n* Easy to tear and remove, residue-free\n* High tack, UV resistant adhesive Withstands water based or solvent based liquids\n* Bonds quickly creating a reliable seal to wood, drywall, painted walls, glass, plastic, and metal\n* Creates sharp, clean lines that block paint and stain\n* For indoor/outdoor use\n\nUses Include painting, auto mask, crafts, stenciling\n\nIncrediSeal Premium 1 Inch High Tack Painters Masking Tape is pressure-sensitive and easyto-tear. It\nhas an easy release pressure-sensitive adhesive. That means it comes off the roll with ease and is a\nbreeze to apply.\n\nAt 4.30 mil thick It provides a durable layer of protection to the surface you are covering. It\u2019s\nmade to withstand UV light and water-based or solvent-based liquids so it will stay put once it is\napplied.\n\nThis tape creates sharp lines to give your project a professional finish. It\u2019s also easily removed\nwithout leaving residue or damaging the surface to which it is applied. This helps you get the job\ndone right saving you time and money.\n\nOur 36 roll bulk pack saves you cash and eliminates multiple trips to the store. Time is money when\nyou are painting so mask & protect wood trim, painted walls, auto panels & trim, tile floor, or\nglass windows right the first time with IncrediSeal High Tack Painters Masking Tape. We\u2019re an\nAmerican company and stand by our product. Your happiness is our priority.\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][63]\n[color: crepe ~ size 1\" ~ alt: MT1-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1\" x 60 yds, x 4.30\nmil, 36 rolls/case] [color: crepe ~ size 1\" ~ alt: MT1-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape,\n1\" x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 36 rolls/case] [color: crepe ~ size 1\" ~ alt: MT1-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High\nTack Masking Tape, 1\" x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 36 rolls/case] [color: crepe ~ size 1\" ~ alt: MT1-10430\n