,\n18 rollscase]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [color: crepe ~ size 2\" ~ alt: MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2\" x 60 yds, x 4.30\nmil, 18 rolls/case]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [color crepe ~ size 2 ~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2 x 60 yds, x 4.30\nmil, 18 rollscase]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [color: crepe ~ size 2\" ~ alt: MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2\" x 60 yds, x 4.30\nmil, 18 rolls/case]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [color crepe ~ size 2 ~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2 x 60 yds, x 4.30\nmil, 18 rollscase]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n* [color crepe ~ size 2 ~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2 x 60 yds, x 4.30\nmil, 18 rollscase]\nOpen media 6 in modal\n1 / of 6\n\nIncrediseal \u2122\n\n# IncrediSeal Masking Painters Tape, High Tack, 2\" x 60 yds, 4.30 mil, 18 Rolls per Case\n\n## IncrediSeal Masking Painters Tape, High Tack, 2\" x 60 yds, 4.30 mil, 18 Rolls per Case\n\n][61]\nRegular price $42.70 USD\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $42.70 USD\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][62] calculated at checkout.\nColor CrepeVariant sold out or unavailable Size 2\" widthVariant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Masking Painters Tape, High Tack, 2&quot; x 60 yds, 4.30 mil, 18\nRolls per Case Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Masking Painters Tape, High Tack, 2&quot; x 60 yds,\n4.30 mil, 18 Rolls per Case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal Masking Painters Tape, High Tack, 2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 18 Rolls per Case.\n* Residue-free, UV resistant\n* Creates harp lines, Indoor/outdoor use\n* Resists water or solvent-based liquids, easy to tear\n* Bonds quickly creating a reliable seal to wood, drywall, painted walls, glass, plastic, and metal\n* Item# MT2-10430\n\nIncrediSeal high tack premium painters\u2019 masking tape is pressure-sensitive and easy-to-tear. It has\nan easy-release pressure-sensitive adhesive. That means it comes off the roll with ease and is a\nbreeze to apply.\n\nAt 4.30 mil thick it provides a durable layer of protection to the surface you are covering. It\u2019s\nmade to withstand UV light and water-based or solvent-based liquids so it will stay put once it is\napplied.\n\nOur painter's tape creates sharp lines to give your project a professional finish. It\u2019s also easily\nremoved without leaving residue or damaging the surface to which it is applied. This helps you get\nthe job done right saving you time and money.\n\nThe bulk cases save you cash and eliminate multiple trips to the store. Time is money when you are\npainting so mask & protect the wood. trim, painted walls, auto panels & trim, tile floor, or glass\nwindows right the first time with IncrediSeal high tack painters masking tape.\n\nUses include Painting, Auto Mask, Crafts, Stenciling. Use on wood, glass, metal, and plastic.\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][63]\n[color crepe ~ size 2 ~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal High Tack Masking Tape, 2 x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 18\nrollscase] [color: crepe ~ size 2\" ~ alt: MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2\" x 60\nyds, x 4.30 mil, 18 rolls/case] [color crepe ~ size 2 ~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack\nMasking Tape, 2 x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 18 rollscase] [color: crepe ~ size 2\" ~ alt: MT2-10430\nIncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2\" x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 18 rolls/case] [color crepe ~ size 2\n~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 2 x 60 yds, x 4.30 mil, 18 rollscase] [color\ncrepe ~ size 2 ~ alt MT2-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Ta