0 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n1 / of 5\n\nIncrediseal \u2122\n\n# IncrediSeal Masking Painting Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case\n\n## IncrediSeal Masking Painting Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case\n\n][61]\nRegular price $47.77 USD\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $47.77 USD\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][62] calculated at checkout.\nColor CrepeVariant sold out or unavailable Size 1/2\" widthVariant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Masking Painting Tape, 1/2&quot; x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per\nCase Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Masking Painting Tape, 1/2&quot; x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72\nRolls per Case\nAdd to cart\n\nIncrediSeal High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case\n* 1/2 Inch wide x 60 yards x 72 rolls = 4320 total yards, 4.3 mil thick\n* Easy to tear and remove, residue-free, indoor/outdoor\n* High tack, UV resistant adhesive withstands water-based or solvent-based liquids\n* Bonds quickly creating a reliable seal to wood, drywall, painted walls, glass, plastic, and metal\n* 4.3 mil thick, create sharp clean lines that block paint and stain\n* Item# UNPK.MT5-10430\n\nIncrediSeal premium painters\u2019 masking tape is easy-to-tear. The 4.30 mil tape has pressure sensitive\nadhesive that makes it easy to apply and allows it to be removed quicky. It withstands UV light and\nwater-based or solvent-based liquids. Our high tack masking painting tape creates sharp lines. It is\nremoved easily without leaving residue. Save time and money with our bulk case. Get the job done\nright with IncrediSeal masking tape.\n\nUses include painting, auto mask, crafts, stenciling, wood, glass, metal, drywall\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][63]\n[color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.] [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack\nMasking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.] [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt:\nMT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\n[color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack Masking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x\n4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.] [color: crepe ~ size 1/2\" ~ alt: MT5-10430 IncrediSeal \u2122 High Tack\nMasking Tape, 1/2\" x 60 yds x 4.30 mil, 72 Rolls per Case.]\n* [ Search ][64]\n* [ Refund Policy ][65]\n* [ Terms of Service ][66]\n* [ Shipping Policy ][67]\n* [ Contact ][68]\n* [ 410-825-8300 ][69]\n\n## Subscribe for Email Updates\n\nEmail\n\u00a9 2026, [Universal Packaging][70] [Powered by Shopify][71]\n* [Refund policy][72]\n* [Privacy policy][73]\n* [Terms of service][74]\n* [Shipping policy][75]\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/packaging-tape\n[3]: /co