10 yards,\n2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case]\nOpen media 1 in modal\n* [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards,\n2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case]\nOpen media 2 in modal\n* [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards,\n2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case]\nOpen media 3 in modal\n* [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards,\n2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case]\nOpen media 4 in modal\n* [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards,\n2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case]\nOpen media 5 in modal\n1 / of 5\n\nIncrediseal \u2122\n\n# IncrediSeal Packaging Security Tamper Evident Tape, 3\u201d x 110 yds. x 2.30 mil, 24 Rolls per Case\n\n## IncrediSeal Packaging Security Tamper Evident Tape, 3\u201d x 110 yds. x 2.30 mil, 24 Rolls per Case\n\n][61]\nRegular price $86.90 USD\nRegular price \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336Sale price $86.90 USD\nUnit price / per\nSale Sold out\n[Shipping][62] calculated at checkout.\nColor WhiteVariant sold out or unavailable Size 3\" widthVariant sold out or unavailable\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for IncrediSeal Packaging Security Tamper Evident Tape, 3\u201d x 110 yds. x 2.30 mil,\n24 Rolls per Case Increase quantity for IncrediSeal Packaging Security Tamper Evident Tape, 3\u201d x 110\nyds. x 2.30 mil, 24 Rolls per Case\nAdd to cart\n\n3\u201d extra-wide security packing tape, 110 yards, white with red Fragile print, 2.30 mil, 24 rolls\n* Secures shipments - Tamper evident tape protects your packages by revealing if the seal has been\nbroken\n* More tape, Less cost - 110 yards of premium tape per roll, more than most brands\n* Thicker \u2013 2.30 mil durability, so packages stay closed\n* Better adhesive \u2013 Our acrylic adhesive has a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F. It holds\ntight from the freezer to extreme heat\n* Easy, quick pack, and ship \u2013 The tough seal guards your packages against rough handling during\nshipping and storage.\n* Item # UNPK. AT3-W3028\n\n[Acrylic PSA][63] Specifications\n\nIncrediSeal 3\u201d wide heavy duty security packaging tape 24 roll bulk case makes mailing, shipping,\nand storage easy. This tape works well on corrugated or linerboard boxes. We deliver a consistent,\nreliable seal. Save money with each 110-yard roll. There is more premium tape per roll than most\nbrands for less money.\n\nUse tamper-evident tape to protect your boxes. It reveals if the seal has been broken during\nshipping or moving. The extra-wide 3\u201d industrial roll securely seals boxes with one pass. Save time,\nspend less.\n\nAt 2.30 mil thick our tape has a 45 lb. tensile strength to keep your boxes sealed tight even during\nrough handling. We use pressure-sensitive acrylic adhesive making it easy to unwind and seal. The\ntape has a wide temperature range of -15 F to 150 F to endure extreme warehouse conditions.\n\nUses include moving, packing, mailing, shipping, and storage of corrugated or linerboard boxes.\n\nShare Share\nLink\nClose share Copy link\n[ View full details ][64]\n[color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards,\n2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case] [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028\nIncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards, 2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per\ncase] [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110\nyards, 2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case] [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028\nIncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110 yards, 2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per\ncase] [color: white ~ size 3\" ~ alt: AT3-W3028 IncrediSeal \u2122 Polypro White Fragile Tape, 3\" x 110\nyards, 2.30 mil, White w/ Red print, 24 rolls per case]\n* [ Search ][65]\n* [ Refund Policy ][66]\n* [ Terms of Service ][67]\n* [ Shipping Policy ][68]\n* [ Contact ][69]\n* [ 410-825-8300 ][70]\n\n## Subscribe for Email Updates\n\nEmail\n\u00a9 2026, [Universal Packaging][71] [Powered by Shopify][72]\n* [Refund policy][73]\n* [Privacy policy][74]\n* [Terms of service][75]\n* [Shipping policy][76]\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/packaging-tape\n[3]: /collections/masking-tape\n[4]: /collections/filament-tape\n[5]: /collections/double-sided-tape\n[6]: /collections/incrediseal-repulpable-tapes\n[7]: /collections/specialty-tape\n[8]: /collections/advanced-air-system\n[9]: /collections/bubble-wrap-film\n[10]: /collections/bubble-wrap-film/Hybrid\n[11]: /collections/large-air-pillow-film\n[12]: /collections/surgical-masks\n[13]: /collections/n95-masks\n[14]: /collections/gloves\n[15]: /collections/gowns\n[16]: /collections/emergency-blankets\n[17]: /collections/marathon-blankets\n[18]: /collections/pharmacy-bags-line-haul-and-special-purpose\n[19]: /collections/ice-packs-cold-chain\n[20]: /pages/shipping-policy\n[21]: /pages/return-and-refund-policy\n[22]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[23]: /pages/contact\n[24]: /pages/contact-2\n[25]: tel:+14108258300\n[26]: https://direct.univpack.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[27]: /\n[28]: /pages/incrediseal-tapes\n[29]: /collections/packaging-tape\n[30]: /collections/masking-tape\n[31]: /collections/filament-tape\n[32]: /collections/double-sided-tape\n[33]: /collections/incr