        "crawl_text": "Fidelity Paper & Supply Corp Fidelity Paper &amp; Supply - Scale Faster Worry Less\n\nSolutions\n\n')\" class=\"framer-tbg1zr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\nIndustries\n\n')\" class=\"framer-tbg1zr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\nSustainability\n\nOur Company\n\nContact Us\n\nSustainability\n\nOur Company\n\nContact Us\n\nSOLUTIONS\n\nPackaging\n\nCustom Corrugated\n\nProduct Packaging\n\nWax Boxes\n\nPoly/Stretch Film\n\nMoving &amp; Storage\n\nTape\n\nCold Chain\n\nIce Packs\n\nInsulation\n\nFoam Coolers\n\nTesting and Validation\n\nStorage &amp; 3PL\n\nDry Storage\n\nCold Storage\n\nPrivate Dedicated Fleet\n\nTape\n\nKitting\n\nIndustrial Machine\n\nStretch Wrappers\n\nCarton Sealers\n\nCarton Erector\n\nCase Sealers\n\nStrapping Machines\n\nIndustries\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nMeal Kits\n\nSeafood\n\nElectronics\n\nPet Food\n\nProduce\n\nPlants\n\nNot listed here?\n\nWe can help!\n\nContact Us\n\nCOMMUNITY\n\nJoin\n\nEvents\n\nExperts\n\nSustainability\n\nOur Company\n\nContact Us\n\nSOLUTIONS\n\nPackaging\n\nCustom Corrugated\n\nProduct Packaging\n\nWax Boxes\n\nPoly/Stretch Film\n\nMoving &amp; Storage\n\nTape\n\nCold Chain\n\nIce Packs\n\nInsulation\n\nFoam Coolers\n\nTesting and Validation\n\nStorage &amp; 3PL\n\nDry Storage\n\nCold Storage\n\nPrivate Dedicated Fleet\n\nTape\n\nKitting\n\nIndustrial Machine\n\nStretch Wrappers\n\nCarton Sealers\n\nCarton Erector\n\nCase Sealers\n\nStrapping Machines\n\nIndustries\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nMeal Kits\n\nSeafood\n\nElectronics\n\nPet Food\n\nProduce\n\nPlants\n\nNot listed here?\n\nWe can help!\n\nContact Us\n\nCOMMUNITY\n\nJoin\n\nEvents\n\nExperts\n\nEstablished in 1957\n\nScale Faster Worry Less\n\nScale Faster\nWorry Less\n\nScale Faster Worry Less\n\nWe are the one-stop solution helping companies meet all their cold chain and packaging needs\n\nWe are the one-stop solution helping companies meet all their cold chain and packaging needs\n\nContact Us\n\nContact Us\n\nOur Story\n\nOur Story\n\nMeet Fidelity Paper\n\nMeet Fidelity Paper\n\nEstablished in 1957, Fidelity Paper was founded by Pierre Guariglia, envisioning a company with a clear focus: to build business partnerships with customers by providing commitment, quality, service, and value. These key ingredients have allowed Fidelity Paper to grow and thrive.\n\nEstablished in 1957, Fidelity Paper was founded by Pierre Guariglia, envisioning a company with a clear focus: to build business partnerships with customers by providing commitment, quality, service, and value. These key ingredients have allowed Fidelity Paper to grow and thrive.\n\nAs Fidelity Paper expanded from a local to a national distribution company, it now services many Fortune 500 companies across the country. Our National Distribution System is built on a true just-in-time program, centered on the customer, and minimizing supplies by delivering materials on a daily and weekly. We have been a proactive supplier in vendor-managed inventory, partnering with our customers to streamline the supplier base and capitalize on volume discounts.\n\nAs Fidelity Paper expanded from a local to a national distribution company, it now services many Fortune 500 companies across the country. Our National Distribution System is built on a true just-in-time program, centered on the customer, and minimizing supplies by delivering materials on a daily and weekly. We have been a proactive supplier in vendor-managed inventory, partnering with our customers to streamline the supplier base and capitalize on volume discounts.\n\nOur National Coverage 24/7\n\nOur National Coverage 24/7\n\nCoast to Coast distribution centers with a collective 2,000,000+ square feet\n\nCoast to Coast distribution centers with a collective 2,000,000+ square feet\n\nWarehouse Locations\n\nWarehouse Locations\n\nFreezers\n\nFreezers\n\nInsulation Manufacture\n\nInsulation Manufacture\n\nGel Manufacture\n\nGel Manufacture\n\nOur Solutions\n\nPackaging\n\nWe provide comprehensive packaging solutions designed to ensure product protection and efficiency throughout your supply chain. Our approach focuses on delivering reliable, high-quality packaging that supports your operational needs\n\nWe provide comprehensive packaging solutions designed to ensure product protection and efficiency throughout your supply chain. Our approach focuses on delivering reliable, high-quality packaging that supports your operational needs\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nCustom Corrogated\n\nCustom Corrogated\n\nProduct Packaging\n\nProduct Packaging\n\nPoly/Strech Film\n\nMoving &amp; Storage\n\nMoving &amp; Storage\n\nWax Boxes\n\nTape\n\nCold Chain\n\nOur cold chain solutions ensure temperature-sensitive products maintain their integrity from origin to destination.\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nIce packs\n\nInsulation\n\nFoam Coolers\n\nTesting and Validation\n\nStorage &amp; 3PL\n\nLeverage our expansive storage and third-party logistics (3PL) services to ensure your inventory is in the right place at the right time\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nDry Storage\n\nCold Storage\n\nKitting\n\nPrivate Dedicated Fleet\n\nIndustrial Machines\n\nOur industrial machines streamline packaging processes, offering efficient solutions for wrapping, sealing, and more\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nStretch Wrappers\n\nCarton Sealers\n\nCarton Erector\n\nCase Sealers\n\nStrapping Machines\n\nScale Your Industry\n\nWhether you're scaling up or optimizing, our tailored solutions ensure your packaging and cold chain needs are covered, allowing you to focus on growth\n\nPharmaceutical &amp; Life Sciences\n\nMeal Kits\n\nSeafood\n\nElectronics\n\nPet Food\n\nProduce\n\nPlants\n\nNot listed here?\n\nDelivering precise, temperature-controlled solutions for the pharmaceutical industry to ensure the safe and compliant transport of medications and medical supplies.\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nPharmaceutical &amp; Life Sciences\n\nMeal Kits\n\nSeafood\n\nElectronics\n\nPet Food\n\nProduce\n\nPlants\n\nNot listed here?\n\nDelivering precise, temperature-controlled solutions for the pharmaceutical industry to ensure the safe and compliant transport of medications and medical supplies.\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nPharmaceutical &amp; Life Sciences\n\nMeal Kits\n\nSeafood\n\nElectronics\n\nPet Food\n\nProduce\n\nPlants\n\nNot listed here?\n\nDelivering precise, temperature-controlled solutions for the pharmaceutical industry to ensure the safe and compliant transport of medications and medical supplies.\n\nlearn more &gt;\n\nWhy Us\n\nCustomer-Focused Excellence\nin Service and Product\n\nWe are a premier packaging materials distribution company, renowned for our high-quality products and unwavering commitment to customer focus. As the industry leader, we recognize that leadership comes with responsibility. Every day, we demonstrate this by leveraging cutting-edge technology and innovation to deliver tailored solutions for specialized needs. Fidelity Paper &amp; Supply stands apart from the competition, and this distinction is what makes us invaluable to our customers. As a national distribution company, our experienced sales team provides added-value services to businesses both locally and internationally.\n\nWe are a premier packaging materials distribution company, renowned for our high-quality products and unwavering commitment to customer focus. As the industry leader, we recognize that leadership comes with responsibility. Every day, we demonstrate this by leveraging cutting-edge technology and innovation to deliver tailored solutions for specialized needs. Fidelity Paper &amp; Supply stands apart from the competition, and this distinction is what makes us invaluable to our customers. As a national distribution company, our experienced sales team provides added-value services to businesses both locally and internationally.\n\nThrough Innovation &amp; Collaboration\n\nThrough Innovation &amp; Collaboration\n\nWe innovate with our clients and suppliers to deliver sustainable and efficient packaging solutions that meet the demands of today\u2019s marketplace while prioritizing environmental responsibility.\n\nWe innovate with our clients and suppliers to deliver sustainable and efficient packaging solutions that meet the demands of today\u2019s marketplace while prioritizing environmental responsibility.\n\nFidelity Paper is committed to environmental responsibility in today\u2019s marketplace.\nAs a leader in using recycled materials, we prioritize \u201cgoing green\u201d in everything w ][1]\n\nSolutions\n\nIndustries\n\n[Sustainability][2]\n\n[Our Company][3]\n\n[Contact Us][4]\n\n][5]\n\n[Sustainability][6]\n\n[Our Company][7]\n\n[Contact Us][8]\n\nSOLUTIONS\n\n[Packaging][9]\n\n[Custom Corrugated][10]\n\n[Product Packaging][11]\n\n[Wax Boxes][12]\n\n[Poly/Stretch Film][13]\n\n[Moving & Storage][14]\n\n[Tape][15]\n\n[Cold Chain][16]\n\n[Ice Packs][17]\n\n[Insulation][18]\n\n[Foam Coolers][19]\n\n[Testing and Validation][20]\n\n[Storage & 3PL][21]\n\n[Dry Storage][22]\n\n[Cold Storage][23]\n\n[Private Dedicated Fleet][24]\n\n[Tape][25]\n\n[Kitting][26]\n\n[Industrial Machine][27]\n\n[Stretch Wrappers][28]\n\n[Carton Sealers][29]\n\n[Carton Erector][30]\n\n[Case Sealers][31]\n\n[Strapping Machines][32]\n\n[Industries][33]\n\n[Pharmaceutical][34]\n\n[Meal Kits ][35]\n\n[Seafood ][36]\n\n[Electronics ][37]\n\n[Pet Food][38]\n\n[Produce][39]\n\n[Plants][40]\n\nNot listed here?\n\nWe can help!\n\nContact Us\n\n][41]\n\nCOMMUNITY\n\nJoin\n\nEvents\n\nExperts\n\n# About Us\n\nTrusted leaders in packaging and cold chain solutions, delivering excellence for over 60 years.\n\n# About Us\n\nTrusted leaders in packaging and cold chain solutions, delivering excellence for over 60 years.\n\n## Fidelity Paper & Supply Corp has been a trusted leader in the packaging and cold chain solutions\n## industry for over 60 years. With a commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction,\n## we specialize in providing custom packaging solutions for industries ranging from pharmaceuticals\n## to food and beverage. Our deep industry expertise allows us to meet the most demanding needs.\n## Founded with a focus on integrity and excellence, Fidelity Paper has grown to serve businesses\n## nationwide, offering sustainable and innovative solutions that align with modern-day needs. We\n## pride ourselves on our ability to create lasting partnerships with our clients, helping them\n## scale their operations while reducing their environmental impact.\n## Whether you're looking for reliable cold chain packaging, custom corrugated boxes, or sustainable\n## materials, Fidelity Paper is your one-stop solution for all your packaging needs. Partner with us\n## and experience seamless, efficient, and environmentally-conscious packaging solutions that keep\n## your business moving forward.\n\nFidelity Paper & Supply Corp has been a trusted leader in the packaging and cold chain solutions\nindustry for over 60 years. With a commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction, we\nspecialize in providing custom packaging solutions for industries ranging from pharmaceuticals to\nfood and beverage. Our deep industry expertise allows us to meet the most demanding needs.\n\nFounded with a focus on integrity and excellence, Fidelity Paper has grown to serve businesses\nnationwide, offering sustainable and innovative solutions that align with modern-day needs. We pride\nourselves on our ability to create lasting partnerships with our clients, helping them scale their\noperations while reducing their environmental impact.\n\nWhether you're looking for reliable cold chain packaging, custom corrugated boxes, or sustainable\nmaterials, Fidelity Paper is your one-stop solution for all your packaging needs. Partner with us\nand experience seamless, efficient, and environmentally-conscious packaging solutions that keep your\nbusiness moving forward.\n\nFidelity Paper & Supply Corp has been a trusted leader in the packaging and cold chain solutions\nindustry for over 