      "key_products": "Ice Packs, Foam Coolers, Insulation, Cold Storage, Custom Packaging",
      "polished_summary": "Fidelity Paper & Supply Corp is a leading provider of custom packaging and cold chain solutions, specializing in tailored products for diverse industries such as pharmaceuticals, meal kits, seafood, electronics, pet food, produce, and plants. Their extensive product range includes custom corrugated packaging, high-quality product packaging, specialized wax boxes, and cold chain essentials like ice packs and foam coolers, ensuring optimal protection and temperature control for a variety of goods during transport and storage.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Fidelity Paper & Supply Corp manufactures and supplies gel ice packs as part of their cold chain solutions, which are essential for maintaining temperature-sensitive products during transport and storage. Their focus on custom packaging and cold chain essentials directly aligns with the target market.",
