      "company_summary": "Gelfrostpacks specializes in manufacturing, exporting, and wholesaling a diverse range of temperature control products, including gel ice packs, helmet ice packs, and cooling patches. Catering primarily to the pharmaceutical, biotech, life sciences, clinical research, and food industries, the company offers high-quality, customizable solutions designed to meet the specific needs of its clients. With a focus on durability and reusability, Gelfrostpacks is committed to providing effective cooling solutions for both commercial and personal applications.",
