        "crawl_text": "Kalyani Enterprises Manufacturer ISO certified India UAE Africa Spain ISO 14001:2015 ISO 45001:2018 ISO 9001:2015 ISO 22000:2018 State-of-the-art manufacturing unit Custom solutions available Timely delivery of products ISO certified No.1, Srinivasa Building, 2nd Main Road, Tippasandra, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560075 No. 11, Reliance Nagar, Parrys, Chennai - 600001, Tamil Nadu, India India Saudi Arabia Sri Lanka Maldives Singapore Malaysia Dubai Sydney Pan-India Established in 2009, Gel Frost Packs has become a leading manufacturer in temperature control products. The company exports to multiple countries, indicating a strong international presence. They focus on customer satisfaction and offer customized solutions. Expanding product range in temperature control solutions. Enhancing manufacturing capabilities to meet growing demand. Competition from other manufacturers in the temperature control market. Maintaining quality standards while scaling production. Growing demand for temperature-sensitive logistics in pharmaceuticals and food industries. Potential to expand into new international markets. A recognized player in the temperature control product manufacturing sector in India. Increasing demand for cold chain logistics solutions. Expansion of the pharmaceutical and food industries. Gel Packs\n\nSkip to content\n\nMain Menu\n\nHOME\n\nABOUT US Menu Toggle\n\nPROFILE\n\nOUR PRODUCTS Menu Toggle\n\nMy Video Page\n\nGEL ICE COLD PACKS\n\nDRY ICE PACK\n\nHelmet Ice Pack\n\nGel Ice Flowers Packs\n\nSuper Absorbent Polymers\n\nSea Foods Gel Ice Packs\n\nCooling Patch\n\nGel Ice Flexi Pack\n\nHDPE ICE PACK BOTTLE\n\nSHOP Menu Toggle\n\nCheckout\n\nMy account\n\nCart\n\nCONTACT US\n\nAgency that Suit\u2019s your Needs\n\nGet in touch with us for best deals !\n\ngel frost Ice gel Packs are readily available in different sizes or you can contact us for customized solutions we provide as per customer specific requirements for different products and used.\n\nContact US\n\nGEL FROST PACKS\n\nThe Best Deal\n\nABOUT US\n\n1. Under the chief guidance and mentorship of our CEO \u2013 Mr. Elan Van, we are the leading manufacturers, exporters and wholesalers of a wide variety of temperature control products \u2013 since more than a decade now.\n2. These products include: Gel Ice Packs, Helmet Ice Pack, Eye Care Cool Packs, Insulated Vaccine Carriers, Cooling Patch, Vaccine Carrier Box, Sea Food Gel Ice Packs, Foam Brick, Hot and Cold Gel Blanket, Polar Pack Gel Bottles, Gel Ice Flower Packs, Super Absorbent Polymers, and much more in the Cold Chain Equipment department.\n3. The best of raw material is used to make these products from technologically sound machines and infrastructure. Our fully integrated plant is equipped with all the modern facilities to transform an idea / plan into a product.\n4. In other words, Gel Frost Packs makes sure to provide the best products to our customers. We also provide customized products as per the needs and requirements of our clients.\n5. Our state-of-the-art manufacturing unit based in Sydney well equipped with the best of machines is our greatest strength, which facilitates smooth and efficient functioning of our organization.\n6. Gel Frost Packs exports its products to many countries such as Saudi Arabia, Sri Lanka, Maldives, Singapore, Malaysia, Singapore and many more in the list.\n7. Gelice Frost Packs believes in executing and managing all orders in the assured time frame. Our utmost priority is to provide the best quality of our products to the end customers.\n8. We have the intense desire of achieving maximum customer satisfaction and thereby, we assure \u2013 safe, accurate and timely delivery of our range of products through a well-connected distribution network.\n\nWEL COME TO OUR RANGE !\n\nanywhere everywhere\n\nNature of Business\n\nManufacturer\n\nTotal Number of Employees\n\n51 to 100 People\n\nYear of Establishment\n\n2009\n\nAnnual Turnover\n\nRs. 2 - 5 Crore\n\nLegal Status of Firm\u200b\n\nIndividual - Proprieto\u200b\n\nGST No.\u200b\n\n29AFAPT5391L1ZR\u200b\n\nStart\nYour\nJourney\n\nWe are earned a great reputation as one of the pioneer manufacturers, exporters and wholesalers of a broad assortment of gel ice packs, gel ice Flexi packs, hot and cold gel blanket etc. We are an ISO certified company.\n\nLets Start\n\nOur Vision\n\nTo be a leading and trusted supplier of temperature controlled thermal packaging at most affordable process to pharmaceuticals, biotech, life sciences, clinical research and food industry. We dedicate ourselves to provide affordable products, quality and innovative cold chain logistic solutions in the market, to our clients and evolve ourselves as one of the leading manufacturers in this fast growing industry in India. Our vision is to provide total customer satisfaction and value to our clients by providing quality products.\n\nOur Mission\n\nGel Frost Packs Kalyani Enterprises is dedicated to; helping our customers identify solutions for their temperature sensitive packaging needs &amp; design and manufacture, highest quality, most effective and efficient thermal packaging solutions. We believe in responsible industry leadership, creating profitable growth in harmony with environmental sustainability and good corporate citizenship.\n\nOUR\n\nsatisfaction\n\nhappy clients\n\nTrade &amp; Market\n\nExport Percentage\n\nOrder Companies\n\nImport Markets countries\n\nOur Goal\n\nOur goal is meet your cold chain requirement with perfect solution and simplifying the process. Understanding your need &amp; matching them with off the self-products or designing cost effective customized thermal solutions.\n\nEvaluating your present pack outs.\n\nStep by step management of the cold chain.\n\nInitiating innovative ideas and creating new opportunities\n\nSupporting you in training your packaging staff.\n\nMaking ideas become a reality\n\nKnow More\n\nOUR\n\nsatisfaction\n\nGel frost Cool Tech Advantage :\n\nSuperior products as special additives are used.\n\nAffordable pricing structure for all order sizes.\n\nFully stocked warehouse.\n\nShortest lead time in cold logistics industry.\n\nCustom printing, packaging &amp; embossing available.\n\nRead More\n\nOUR\n\nsatisfaction\n\nRECENT WORK GALLERY\n\nOur brand\n\nOur Partners Logos\n\nManufacturing, Exporting and Wholesaling an exclusive range of Temperature Control Products which have gained huge client appreciation.\n\nwww.gelfrostpacks.net.in\n\nNo.1, Srinivasa Building, 2nd Main Road, Tippasandra, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560075\n\nSearch\n\nSearch for:\n\nRecent Pots\n\nCakes\n\nBiochemical Reagent\n\nVegetables\n\nFruits\n\nMeat\n\nGallery\n\n\u00a9 Gel Frost Packs Kalyani Enterprises. All Rights Reserved (Terms of Use) Copyright \u00a9 2020 | Powered by Astra WordPress Theme [ Skip to content][1]\nMain Menu\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT US][3]Menu Toggle\n* [PROFILE][4]\n* [OUR PRODUCTS][5]Menu Toggle\n* [My Video Page][6]\n* [GEL ICE COLD PACKS][7]\n* [DRY ICE PACK][8]\n* [Helmet Ice Pack][9]\n* [Gel Ice Flowers Packs][10]\n* [Super Absorbent Polymers][11]\n* [Sea Foods Gel Ice Packs][12]\n* [Cooling Patch][13]\n* [Gel Ice Flexi Pack][14]\n* [HDPE ICE PACK BOTTLE][15]\n* [SHOP][16]Menu Toggle\n* [Checkout][17]\n* [My account][18]\n* [Cart][19]\n* [CONTACT US][20]\n\n# Our Promising Quality\n\nManufacturing, Exporting and Wholesaling an exclusive range of Temperature Control Products which\nhave gained huge client appreciation.\n\n## Nature of Business\n\n[ Know More ][21]\n\nEstablished in the year 2009, Gel Frost Packs, a Kalyani Enterprises, are Manufacturing, Exporting\nand Wholesaling an exclusive range of Temperature Control Products which have gained huge client\nappreciation. These products are manufactured by picking premium quality raw material by making use\nof technologically sound machines. Our premium temperature control products are comprehensively\nmeeting with the demands and requirements of various organizations, shops, home, communities and\ncommercial transport, shipping and pharmaceutical industries as our products like Gel Ice Flexi\nPack, Vaccine Ice Pack, Gel Ice Packs, Gel Cold Packs, Helmet Ice Pack and much more, make available\nthe optimum option for refrigerated transport and insulation. Our Sydney based state-of-art\nmanufacturing unit is our one of our strengths which are well equipped with all the latest machines\nand facilities to run our operations smoothly and efficiently. We are determined to ensure utmost\nclient satisfaction by supplying a superior and requisite range of products. Along with this, we\nalso develop a customized range as per the specifications and requirements of our clients. We direct\nour all efforts with a client-centric approach on the back of our heads and for this, we abide by\nmoral business etiquettes and a qualitative approach with to build a wide distribution network for\nourselves. Our major export markets are Saudi Arabia, Sri Lanka, Maldives, Singapore, Malaysia,\nDubai and many more.\n\nOur company is supported by extensively experienced quality controllers, who are familiar with set\nindustry standard quality norms. They help us design and develop the products that sustain high on\nstandard quality norms and customers expectations too. Our diligent quality controllers keep vigil\neye over the entire production process and make sure that quality doesn\u2019t hamper in any manner. To\ndetermine the exact quality level, they conduct various essential tests like Leak Proof Test,\nTemperature Logger Report and Data Analysis. Furthermore, our quality controllers also help us in\nselection of vendors from whom, we procure raw material. Quality is the dominant aspect of our\nproduce which has always helped us in providing our clients with high end satisfaction.\n\n## OUR\n\n## satisfaction\n\n# Factsheet\n\n## Basic Information\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250