            "text": "[ Skip to content][1]\nMain Menu\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT US][3]Menu Toggle\n* [PROFILE][4]\n* [OUR PRODUCTS][5]Menu Toggle\n* [My Video Page][6]\n* [GEL ICE COLD PACKS][7]\n* [DRY ICE PACK][8]\n* [Helmet Ice Pack][9]\n* [Gel Ice Flowers Packs][10]\n* [Super Absorbent Polymers][11]\n* [Sea Foods Gel Ice Packs][12]\n* [Cooling Patch][13]\n* [Gel Ice Flexi Pack][14]\n* [HDPE ICE PACK BOTTLE][15]\n* [SHOP][16]Menu Toggle\n* [Checkout][17]\n* [My account][18]\n* [Cart][19]\n* [CONTACT US][20]\n\n# Our Promising Quality\n\nManufacturing, Exporting and Wholesaling an exclusive range of Temperature Control Products which\nhave gained huge client appreciation.\n\n## Nature of Business\n\n[ Know More ][21]\n\nEstablished in the year 2009, Gel Frost Packs, a Kalyani Enterprises, are Manufacturing, Exporting\nand Wholesaling an exclusive range of Temperature Control Products which have gained huge client\nappreciation. These products are manufactured by picking premium quality raw material by making use\nof technologically sound machines. Our premium temperature control products are comprehensively\nmeeting with the demands and requirements of various organizations, shops, home, communities and\ncommercial transport, shipping and pharmaceutical industries as our products like Gel Ice Flexi\nPack, Vaccine Ice Pack, Gel Ice Packs, Gel Cold Packs, Helmet Ice Pack and much more, make available\nthe optimum option for refrigerated transport and insulation. Our Sydney based state-of-art\nmanufacturing unit is our one of our strengths which are well equipped with all the latest machines\nand facilities to run our operations smoothly and efficiently. We are determined to ensure utmost\nclient satisfaction by supplying a superior and requisite range of products. Along with this, we\nalso develop a customized range as per the specifications and requirements of our clients. We direct\nour all efforts with a client-centric approach on the back of our heads and for this, we abide by\nmoral business etiquettes and a qualitative approach with to build a wide distribution network for\nourselves. Our major export markets are Saudi Arabia, Sri Lanka, Maldives, Singapore, Malaysia,\nDubai and many more.\n\nOur company is supported by extensively experienced quality controllers, who are familiar with set\nindustry standard quality norms. They help us design and develop the products that sustain high on\nstandard quality norms and customers expectations too. Our diligent quality controllers keep vigil\neye over the entire production process and make sure that quality doesn\u2019t hamper in any manner. To\ndetermine the exact quality level, they conduct various essential tests like Leak Proof Test,\nTemperature Logger Report and Data Analysis. Furthermore, our quality controllers also help us in\nselection of vendors from whom, we procure raw material. Quality is the dominant aspect of our\nproduce which has always helped us in providing our clients with high end satisfaction.\n\n## OUR\n\n## satisfaction\n\n# Factsheet\n\n## Basic Information\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Business Type** \u2502Manufacturer, Importer, Supplier, Wholesaler, Trader & Exporter\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25