nt Mode \u2502CashChequeCredit CardDDRTGSOnlineBank Transfer\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nShipment Mode \u2502By SeaBy CargoBy Road\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Discuss more about your requirement by contacting us now\n\n[ Contact Us ][22]\n\nWe have edge over our competitors in the form of a fully integrated, state-of-art in-house\nmanufacturing plant which is equipped with all the modern facilities which are required to transform\nan idea into a plan and a plan for a product and our hi-tech manufacturing unit is crowned with the\nlatest technology which enables us to accomplish our journey successfully from a plan to a product\nand to ensure utmost client satisfaction.\n\n# ISO Certification\n\nISO 14001:2015 (Valid till: April 18th 2022)\n\n# Our Certifications\n\nISO 45001:2018 (Valid till: April 18th 2022)\n\n# Recognition\n\nISO 9001:2015 (Valid till: April 18th 2022)\n\n# Awards & Recognition\n\nISO 22000:2018 (Valid till: April 18th 2022)\n\n# Our Team\n\nWe have edge over our competitors in the form of a fully integrated, state-of-art in-house\nmanufacturing plant which is equipped with all the modern facilities which are required to transform\nan idea into a plan and a plan for a product and our hi-tech manufacturing unit is crowned with the\nlatest technology which enables us to accomplish our journey successfully from a plan to a product\nand to ensure utmost client satisfaction.\n\n# Why Us?\n\nWe know our job and we perform it to the utmost perfection and that is why our clients appreciate us\nwith repeated orders and words of admiration. Trust us for your needs and taste the real\nsatisfaction.\n\nWe are the best as we:\n* Follow creative and innovative sourcing strategies\n* Hold market and category domain expertise\n* Have highly skilled and creative professionals\n* Operate Innovative and effective product development process\n* Exhibit sophisticated market approach to achieve optimal sourcing outcome\n\n[ Know More ][23]\n\n## Our brand\n\n# Follow Me on\n\n# Instagram @gel_frost_Packs\n\nManufacturing, Exporting and Wholesaling an exclusive range of Temperature Control Products which\nhave gained huge client appreciation.\n\n# anywhere everywhere !\n\nNo.1, Srinivasa Building, 2nd Main Road, Tippasandra, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560075\n\n## Search\n\nSearch for:\n\n## Recent Pots\n* [Cakes][24]\n* [Biochemical Reagent][25]\n* [Vegetables][26]\n* [Fruits][27]\n* [Meat][28]\n\n## Gallery\n\n\u00a9 Gel Frost Packs Kalyani Enterprises. All Rights Reserved (Terms of Use) Copyright \u00a9 2020 | Powered\nby Astra WordPress Theme\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/\n[3]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/about-us/\n[4]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/profile/\n[5]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/our-products/\n[6]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/my-video-page/\n[7]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/gel-ice-packs/\n[8]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/polar-pack-gel-bottles/\n[9]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/helmet-ice-pack/\n[10]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/gel-ice-flowers-packs/\n[11]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/super-absorbent-polymers/\n[12]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/sea-foods-gel-ice-packs/\n[13]: https://gelfrostpacks.net.in/cooling-patch/\n[14]: https://gelfros