ogger][60]\n  * [Super Absorbent Polymer][61]\n    * [AQUARESERVE^{\u00ae}][62]\n    * [Fluidsorb][63]\n    * [EZTHICK][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n[[Valor Industries]][66]\n* [Home][67]\n* [About Us][68]\n* [Products][69]\n  * [Gel Ice Pack][70]\n    * [Ice Gel Pack (HDPE Hard Bottle)][71]\n    * [Coolant in LDPE (Cool Gel Pouch)][72]\n    * [Foam Ice Brick][73]\n    * [Hot & Cold Pack][74]\n    * [Instant Hot Packs][75]\n  * [Temperature Control Boxes][76]\n    * [Pre-qualified Cold Chain Shippers][77]\n    * [Vaccine Carrier][78]\n  * [Expanded Polystyrene ( EPS )][79]\n    * [EPS boxes (Thermocol boxes)][80]\n    * [Fabricated Articles][81]\n    * [Packing Peanuts][82]\n    * [Bean Balls][83]\n    * [EPS Chips][84]\n    * [EPS Sheets][85]\n  * [Corrugated Box][86]\n    * [Corrugated Rolls][87]\n    * [Corrugated Sheets][88]\n    * [Corrugated Box][89]\n    * [Duplex Box][90]\n    * [Die Punching Box][91]\n  * [Tape][92]\n    * [BOPP Self Adhesive Tape][93]\n    * [Double Sided Tissue Paper Tape][94]\n    * [Paper Tape][95]\n    * [Non Residue Tape][96]\n    * [Specialty Tape][97]\n  * [Stretch Film][98]\n    * [Manual Hand Stretch Film][99]\n    * [Machine Stretch Film][100]\n    * [Cling Film for Food][101]\n    * [PVC Cling Film][102]\n  * [Air Bubble Film Roll][103]\n    * [10 mm Air Bubble Roll][104]\n    * [20 mm Air Bubble Roll][105]\n    * [30 mm Air Bubble Roll][106]\n    * [Air Bubble Sheet][107]\n    * [Air Bubble Bag][108]\n    * [Air Bubble Envelope][109]\n  * [Garbage Bag][110]\n    * [Non Chlorinated Garbage Bags][111]\n  * [Temper Proof Packing][112]\n    * [Tamper Proof Bag][113]\n    * [Tamper Proof Tape][114]\n    * [Tamper Proof Sticker][115]\n  * [EPE Foam][116]\n    * [EPE Foam Sheets][117]\n    * [EPE Box][118]\n    * [EPE Bag][119]\n    * [EPE Gap Fill][120]\n  * [Insulated Boxes & Bags][121]\n    * [PUF Insulated Box][122]\n    * [Insulated Carry Bags][123]\n  * [Temperature Data Logger][124]\n    * [Reusable Data Logger][125]\n    * [Single Use Data Logger][126]\n  * [Super Absorbent Polymer][127]\n    * [AQUARESERVE^{\u00ae}][128]\n    * [Fluidsorb][129]\n    * [EZTHICK][130]\n* [Contact Us][131]\n* Packaging and Cold Chain Solutions\n  GELID^{\u00ae}\n  [KNOW MORE.. ][132]\n* \u2022 HDPE Bottle \u2022 LDPE Pouch \u2022 Foam Brick \u2022 Hot & Cold Pack\n  Gel Ice Pack\n* Pre-qualified Cold Chain Shippers\n\n## Welcome to Valor Industries\n\nValor has sparkling cold chain, temperature controlled and protective packaging products to maintain\nfreshness & enhance shelf life of perishable, medicinal products and allied products. Whenever you\nface damage & decay of your products, you should consider to start using GELID^{\u00ae}\n\nWe at **VALOR INDUSTRIES** take pride to introduce ourselves as most ingenious manufacturer and\nsupplier of cold chain packaging & protective packaging products . Our offerings are PCM pack, gel\nice packs, hot & cold gel pack, instant hot & cold packs, foam bricks, vaccine carriers, insulated\nbox, cooler bags, EPS expanded polystyrene box and allied products under the brand name of\nGELID^{\u00ae}. Our products have carved a niche in the following sectors pharmaceutical, blood banks,\npathology labs, ice cream & dairy products, frozen food, restaurants, poultry, floriculture\nindustry, confectionaries\u2026\n\nGELID^{\u00ae}, the eco friendly ice pack brand is owned, promoted and manufactured by Valor Industries\nhaving manufacturing facility based at Gujarat , the pharmaceutical hub and one of the top\nindustrial states with maximum numbers of upcoming ports in India.\n\n### Use of GELID^{\u00ae} Gel Ice Pack in Different sectors\n\n##### Pharmaceuticals\n\nIt is necessary to use GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack in Pharmaceutical Industries to avoid degradation or\nspoilage of the Capsules, vials, Injectables, medicines, etc which are temperature sensitive.\nEspecially for transportation of the consignments it becomes important to assure that your\ntemperature sensitive Pharma product remains safe & reaches the desired destination without any\nworry. For this reason the GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack provide the utmost solution for your sensitive\nproducts thus appealing a vast range of Pharma experts to go for GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack.\n\n##### Frozen Foods, Ice-cream & Diary\n\nIt is very important in both these industries that Harden ability & texture of the finished product\nbe maintained. It is for this reason that the top brands & other local & domestic suppliers consider\nit inevitable to use the GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack in their Cold chain packaging. In this regard\nGELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack has turned out to be one of the topmost runners because of its sensational\nservice & Quality.\n\n##### CRO\u2019s, Healthcare & Pathological Laboratories\n\nLikewise the Pharmaceutical industry, there are a certain range of generics & health Injectables,\nampoules & vials, medicinal segments & samples, etc which need the same kind of safety precautions &\nCold Chain insulation when they are being transported under extreme temperature profile, diverse\natmospheric conditions,& through different operators involving large number of countries via\nshipping port consignment.\n\n.\n\n##### Blood banks\n\nTo avoid temperature loss & degradation of blood pouches or samples it has become inevitable to\npreserve them by use of GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack. It is essential that the Blood samples remain\nchilled throughout. Henceforth, the use of GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack has excelled in Blood banks,\nhospitals & Dispensaries.\n.\n.\n\n## Our Vision\n\nWe dedicate ourselves to provide affordable products, quality and innovative cold chain logistic\nsolutions in the market, to our clients and evolve ourselves as one of the leading manufacturers in\nthis fast growing industry in India.\n\n[LEARN ABOUT US][133]\n* Products\n  \n  [Gel Ice Pack ][134]\n  [Pre-qualified Cold Chain Shippers][135]\n  [Cold Chain Products][136]\n  [Eps Thermocol][137]\n  [Vaccine Transportation Carriers][138]\n  [Polystyrene Gap Fills][139]\n  [Corrugated Boxes][140]\n  [Adhesive Tapes][141]\n  [Cling Wraps Films ][142]\n  [Stickers & Labels][143]\n* Listed on Business Portals\n  \n  \u2500\n   \n  \u2500\n* Contact Us\n  \n  **Address :** 202, Abhijyot Square,\n  B/h, Divya Bhaskar,\n  Nr. Safal Solitiare,\n  S.G Highway,\n  Ahmedabad \u2013 380051.\n  **Phone :** +91-79-40193947\n  **TeleFax :** +91-79-40032947\n  **E-mail :** valorindustries@yahoo.in\n* Search\n* Follow Us\n  * \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\nAll right rese"
