oducts thus appealing a vast range of Pharma experts to go for GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack.\n\n##### Frozen Foods, Ice-cream & Diary\n\nIt is very important in both these industries that Harden ability & texture of the finished product\nbe maintained. It is for this reason that the top brands & other local & domestic suppliers consider\nit inevitable to use the GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack in their Cold chain packaging. In this regard\nGELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack has turned out to be one of the topmost runners because of its sensational\nservice & Quality.\n\n##### CRO\u2019s, Healthcare & Pathological Laboratories\n\nLikewise the Pharmaceutical industry, there are a certain range of generics & health Injectables,\nampoules & vials, medicinal segments & samples, etc which need the same kind of safety precautions &\nCold Chain insulation when they are being transported under extreme temperature profile, diverse\natmospheric conditions,& through different operators involving large number of countries via\nshipping port consignment.\n\n.\n\n##### Blood banks\n\nTo avoid temperature loss & degradation of blood pouches or samples it has become inevitable to\npreserve them by use of GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack. It is essential that the Blood samples remain\nchilled throughout. Henceforth, the use of GELID^{\u00ae} Ice Gel Pack has excelled in Blood banks,\nhospitals & Dispensaries.\n.\n.\n\n## Our Vision\n\nWe dedicate ourselves to provide affordable products, quality and innovative cold chain logistic\nsolutions in the market, to our clients and evolve ourselves as one of the leading manufacturers in\nthis fast growing industry in India.\n\n[LEARN ABOUT US][133]\n* Products\n  \n  [Gel Ice Pack ][134]\n  [Pre-qualified Cold Chain Shippers][135]\n  [Cold Chain Products][136]\n  [Eps Thermocol][137]\n  [Vaccine Transportation Carriers][138]\n  [Polystyrene Gap Fills][139]\n  [Corrugated Boxes][140]\n  [Adhesive Tapes][141]\n  [Cling Wraps Films ][142]\n  [Stickers & Labels]