      "polished_summary": "Gelid specializes in providing innovative packaging and cold chain solutions, offering a diverse range of products including gel ice packs, insulated boxes, temperature control boxes, and various types of packing materials. The company caters to industries requiring reliable temperature management and secure packaging, ensuring the safe transport of sensitive goods such as pharmaceuticals and perishable items. With a commitment to quality and efficiency, Gelid supports businesses in maintaining optimal conditions throughout their supply chains.",
