      "company_summary": "GIP Atlantic is a premier provider of integrated construction and engineering solutions, specializing in Heavy Civil, Industrial Contracting, Technical Solutions, and Marine and Warehousing services. With a diverse portfolio that caters to government and private sector clients across industries such as hydroelectric, oil & gas, transportation, wind energy, and municipal sectors, the company is committed to delivering innovative and reliable infrastructure solutions for the future.",
