        "crawl_text": "Green Infrastructure Partners ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management System Natural Resources Magazine 2018 Industry Excellence Award for Health and Safety Award of Excellence for Environmental Leadership & Innovation from the Heavy Civil Association of Newfoundland and Labrador (HCANL) Award of Excellence for Safety from the Heavy Civil Association of Newfoundland and Labrador (HCANL) Winner of 10 Silver Coin Awards from ExxonMobil for dedication to safety on the Hebron Project Diverse and skilled workforce Strong commitment to safety and environmental responsibility Proven track record in complex projects Health and Safety regulations Environmental regulations 1309 Topsail Road, P.O. Box 8274, Station A, St. John's, NL, Canada A1B 3N4 1309 Topsail Road, St. John's, NL, Canada A1B 3N4 650 Water Street, St. John's, NL, Canada A1C 5M5 2 Maverick Place, Paradise, NL, Canada A1L 0H6 1925 Hanwell Road, Fredericton, NB, Canada E3C 1M4 20 Sudbury St #20, St. John's, NL, Canada A1E 2V1 2 Northside Rd, Bay Bulls, NL, Canada A0A 1C0 Canada Canada Infrastructure Fit for the Future | GIP Atlantic\n\nWARNING: You are using an outdated browser. Please upgrade your browser to improve your experience.\nUpgrade Now\n\nCapabilities\n\nPeople\n\nProjects\n\nEmployment\n\nIndigenous Relations\n\nContact\n\nHome\n\nWe answer the call. We put on our boots. We go to work.\nExplore Technical Solutions\n\nSpecializing in getting the job done.\nExplore Industrial Contractors\n\nSolutions at every stage of the project. anywhere, anytime.\nExplore Heavy Civil\n\nThe most complex projects, the most challenging places. we&#8217;re there.\nExplore Marine & Warehousing\n\nHeavy Civil Learn More&nbsp;\n\nIndustrial Contractors Learn More&nbsp;\n\nTechnical Solutions Learn More&nbsp;\n\nMarine and Warehousing Learn More&nbsp;\n\nSolutions for every stage of the project\n\nGIP ATLANTIC is a leading provider of integrated solutions across a diverse portfolio\n\nHeavy Civil, Industrial, Services &amp; Maintenance, and Marine.\n\nFrom breaking new ground to commissioning and ongoing site maintenance, we deliver the best solutions, service and quality at every stage of the project. Powered by a diverse team, from coast to coast to coast across Canada, we are united by our passion and determination to deliver results on the most complex jobs and challenging environments.\n\nMarkets We Serve\n\nHydroelectric\n\nOil &#038; Gas\n\nTransportation\n\nWind Energy\n\nMunicipal\n\nFeatured\nProjects\n\nWe\u2019re not afraid of hard work.\nView All\n\nVoisey\u2019s Bay Mine Expansion \u2013 Design and Supply of Fuel Pumphouses Read More&nbsp;\n\nCrane Refit Onboard The CCGS Amundsen For The Canadian Coast Guard Read More&nbsp;\n\nOttawa Light-Rail Transit System &#8211; Phase 2 Trillium Line Read More&nbsp;\n\nOur Clients\n\nProof Is In the Projects\nOur capabilities are best demonstrated in the range and scale of work that we&#8217;ve completed. Browse our projects to see our team at work on some of our country&#8217;s largest projects.\nView Projects\n\n&copy;2026\nGreen Infrastructure Partners. All rights reserved.\n\nSitemap\n\nLegal\n\nFeedback\n\nCapabilities\n\nPeople\n\nProjects\n\nEmployment\n\nIndigenous Relations\n\nContact\n\nSales &#038; Rentals\n\nAbout\n\nMedia Room\n\nVisit our social media\n\nFill out the form below to leave feedback about the website and your browsing experience.\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\nSearch\nGreen Infrastructure Partners\n\nSearch for:\n\nCancel [ [GIP Atlantic] ][1]\n* [Capabilities][2]\n* [People][3]\n* [Projects][4]\n* [Employment][5]\n* [Indigenous Relations][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n[Construction workers in safety gear and high-visibility vests walk across a busy industrial site,\nwith large machinery and equipment visible in the background under clear skies.]\n\n# People\n\nAt GIP Atlantic our people are our greatest resource.\n\n## Driven by Integrity, Defined by Quality\n\nTheir commitment to quality, service, safety, and integrity has been instrumental to the growth that\nwe\u2019ve experienced over our 50+ year history. From our executive team to our division managers, our\nstaff\u2019s goal is to make GIP Atlantic\u2019s name synonymous with quality and ensure all of our projects\nare completed safely, on time, and as sustainably as possible.\n\n[Board of Directors / Executive Leadership][8] [Executive / Senior Management][9] [Business\nDevelopment][10] [Heavy Civil][11] [Industrial Contractors][12] [Technical Solutions & Marine and\nWarehousing][13]\n\n## Executive / Senior Management\n\n### David Mitchell, P.Eng\n\nExecutive Vice President, Atlantic Canada\n\n][14]\n\n### Maggie Smith, CPA, CA\n\nSenior Vice President, Finance Atlantic Canada\n\n][15]\n\n### Lorne Bennett\n\nSenior Vice President, Human Resources\n\n][16]\n\n### Brandon MacDonald\n\nSenior Vice President, Construction Materials\n\n][17]\n\n### Stephanie Maloney\n\nVice President, Strategy & Stakeholder Engagement\n\n][18]\n\n### Mike O\u2019Reilly\n\nVice President, Health, Safety, Environment and Quality\n\n][19]\n\n### Jon Kelly\n\nVice President, Finance\n\n][20]\n\n### Wayne Brushett\n\nManager, Information Technology\n\n][21]\n\n## Heavy Civil\n\n### Lucas Evans\n\nVice President, Pre-Construction, Heavy Civil\n\n][22]\n\n### Josh Oakey\n\nVice President, Construction Operations, Heavy Civil\n\n][23]\n\n### Kaitlin Coombs\n\nVice President Project Controls & Cost Management (Heavy Civil)\n\n][24]\n\n## Industrial Contractors\n\n### Chris King\n\nSenior Vice President, Industrial Contractors\n\n][25]\n\n### Dean Dearing\n\nVice President, Industrial Contractors\n\n][26]\n\n### Ken Dale\n\nVice President \u2013 Business Development, Industrial Contractors\n\n][27]\n\n## Technical Solutions & Marine and Warehousing\n\n### Mark Whalen\n\nVice President, Technical Operations\n\n][28]\n\n### Jeannine Fitzgerald\n\nVice President, Finance and Shared Services.\n\n][29]\n\n### Cecil Wheeler\n\nGeneral Manager, Hydraulic Systems\n\n][30]\n\n### Jim Tobin\n\nGeneral Manager, Technical Services\n\n][31]\n\n### KC Dhiraj, P. ENG\n\nVice President, Marine & Logistics\n\n][32]\n\n## Proof Is In the Projects\n\nOur capabilities are best demonstrated in the range and scale of work that we\u2019ve completed. Browse\nour projects to see our team at work on some of our country\u2019s largest projects.\n\n[View Projects][33]\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][34]\n\n\u00a92026 Green Infrastructure Partners. All rights reserved.\n* [Sitemap][35]\n* [Legal][36]\n* Feedback\n\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][37]\n* [Capabilities][38]\n* [People][39]\n* [Projects][40]\n* [Employment][41]\n* [Indigenous Relations][42]\n* [Contact][43]\n* [Sales & Rentals][44]\n* [About][45]\n* [Media Room][46]\n\nVisit our social media\n\nFill out the form below to leave feedback about the website and your browsing experience.\n\nEmail\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n## Search Green Infrastructure Partners\n\nSearch for:\n\nCancel\n\n[1]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[2]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[3]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[4]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[5]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[6]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[7]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[8]: #Board-of-Directors-Executive-Leadership\n[9]: #Executive-Senior-Management\n[10]: #Business-Development\n[11]: #Heavy-Civil\n[12]: #Industrial-Contractors\n[13]: #Technical-Solutions-amp-Marine-and-Warehousing\n[14]: /people/david-mitchell-p-eng/\n[15]: /people/margaret-smith-cpa-ca/\n[16]: /people/lorne-bennett/\n[17]: /people/brandon-macdonald/\n[18]: /people/stephanie-maloney/\n[19]: /people/mike-oreilly/\n[20]: /people/jon-kelly/\n[21]: /people/wayne-brushett/\n[22]: /people/lucas-evans/\n[23]: /people/josh-oakey/\n[24]: /people/kaitlin-coombs/\n[25]: /people/chris-king/\n[26]: /people/dean-dearing/\n[27]: /people/ken-dale/\n[28]: /people/mark-whalen/\n[29]: /people/jeannine-fitzgerald/\n[30]: /people/cecil-wheeler