            "text": "[ [GIP Atlantic] ][1]\n* [Capabilities][2]\n* [People][3]\n* [Projects][4]\n* [Employment][5]\n* [Indigenous Relations][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n[Construction workers in safety gear and high-visibility vests walk across a busy industrial site,\nwith large machinery and equipment visible in the background under clear skies.]\n\n# People\n\nAt GIP Atlantic our people are our greatest resource.\n\n## Driven by Integrity, Defined by Quality\n\nTheir commitment to quality, service, safety, and integrity has been instrumental to the growth that\nwe\u2019ve experienced over our 50+ year history. From our executive team to our division managers, our\nstaff\u2019s goal is to make GIP Atlantic\u2019s name synonymous with quality and ensure all of our projects\nare completed safely, on time, and as sustainably as possible.\n\n[Board of Directors / Executive Leadership][8] [Executive / Senior Management][9] [Business\nDevelopment][10] [Heavy Civil][11] [Industrial Contractors][12] [Technical Solutions & Marine and\nWarehousing][13]\n\n## Executive / Senior Management\n\n### David Mitchell, P.Eng\n\nExecutive Vice President, Atlantic Canada\n\n][14]\n\n### Maggie Smith, CPA, CA\n\nSenior Vice President, Finance Atlantic Canada\n\n][15]\n\n### Lorne Bennett\n\nSenior Vice President, Human Resources\n\n][16]\n\n### Brandon MacDonald\n\nSenior Vice President, Construction Materials\n\n][17]\n\n### Stephanie Maloney\n\nVice President, Strategy & Stakeholder Engagement\n\n][18]\n\n### Mike O\u2019Reilly\n\nVice President, Health, Safety, Environment and Quality\n\n][19]\n\n### Jon Kelly\n\nVice President, Finance\n\n][20]\n\n### Wayne Brushett\n\nManager, Information Technology\n\n][21]\n\n## Heavy Civil\n\n### Lucas Evans\n\nVice President, Pre-Construction, Heavy Civil\n\n][22]\n\n### Josh Oakey\n\nVice President, Construction Operations, Heavy Civil\n\n][23]\n\n### Kaitlin Coombs\n\nVice President Project Controls & Cost Management (Heavy Civil)\n\n][24]\n\n## Industrial Contractors\n\n### Chris King\n\nSenior Vice President, Industrial Contractors\n\n][25]\n\n### Dean Dearing\n\nVice President, Industrial Contractors\n\n][26]\n\n### Ken Dale\n\nVice President \u2013 Business Development, Industrial Contractors\n\n][27]\n\n## Technical Solutions & Marine and Warehousing\n\n### Mark Whalen\n\nVice President, Technical Operations\n\n][28]\n\n### Jeannine Fitzgerald\n\nVice President, Finance and Shared Services.\n\n][29]\n\n### Cecil Wheeler\n\nGeneral Manager, Hydraulic Systems\n\n][30]\n\n### Jim Tobin\n\nGeneral Manager, Technical Services\n\n][31]\n\n### KC Dhiraj, P. ENG\n\nVice President, Marine & Logistics\n\n][32]\n\n## Proof Is In the Projects\n\nOur capabilities are best demonstrated in the range and scale of work that we\u2019ve completed. Browse\nour projects to see our team at work on some of our country\u2019s largest projects.\n\n[View Projects][33]\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][34]\n\n\u00a92026 Green Infrastructure Partners. All rights reserved.\n* [Sitemap][35]\n* [Legal][36]\n* Feedback\n\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][37]\n* [Capabilities][38]\n* [People][39]\n* [Projects][40]\n* [Employment][41]\n* [Indigenous Relations][42]\n* [Contact][43]\n* [Sales & Rentals][44]\n* [About][45]\n* [Media Room][46]\n\nVisit our social media\n\nFill out the form below to leave feedback about the website and your browsing experience.\n\nEmail\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n## Search Green Infrastructure Partners\n\nSearch for:\n\nCancel\n\n[1]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[2]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[3]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[4]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[5]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[6]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[7]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[8]: #Board-of-Directors-Executive-Leadership\n[9]: #Executive-Senior-Management\n[10]: #Business-Development\n[11]: #Heavy-Civil\n[12]: #Industrial-Contractors\n[13]: #Technical-Solutions-amp-Marine-and-Warehousing\n[14]: /people/david-mitchell-p-eng/\n[15]: /people/margaret-smith-cpa-ca/\n[16]: /people/lorne-bennett/\n[17]: /people/brandon-macdonald/\n[18]: /people/stephanie-maloney/\n[19]: /people/mike-oreilly/\n[20]: /people/jon-kelly/\n[21]: /people/wayne-brushett/\n[22]: /people/lucas-evans/\n[23]: /people/josh-oakey/\n[24]: /people/kaitlin-coombs/\n[25]: /people/chris-king/\n[26]: /people/dean-dearing/\n[27]: /people/ken-dale/\n[28]: /people/mark-whalen/\n[29]: /people/jeannine-fitzgerald/\n[30]: /people/cecil-wheeler/\n[31]: /people/jim-tobin/\n[32]: /people/kc-dhiraj/\n[33]: http://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[34]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[35]: https://gipatlantic.com/?page_id=12\n[36]: https://gipatlantic.com/legal/\n[37]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[38]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[39]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[40]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[41]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[42]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[43]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[44]: https://gipatlantic.com/sales-rentals/\n[45]: https://gipatlantic.com/about/\n[46]: https://gipatlantic.com/media-room/"
