            "text": "[ [GIP Atlantic] ][1]\n* [Capabilities][2]\n* [People][3]\n* [Projects][4]\n* [Employment][5]\n* [Indigenous Relations][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n[A large blank black sign displays the number 1309 in front of a beige commercial building, with a\ntree and overcast sky in the background.]\n\n# Contact\n\n## Contact Us\n\nFull Name\nEmail Address\nTelephone\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n1309 Topsail RoadP.O. Box 8274, Station ASt. John's, NLCanadaA1B 3N4\n\nToll Free: [1-866-782-3404][8] Phone: [(709) 782-3404][9] Fax: [(709) 782-0129][10]\n[[email protected]][11]\n\n#### Divisions\n* #### Heavy Civil\n\n1309 Topsail RoadSt.John's, NLA1B 3N4\n\nTel: [(709) 782-3404][12] Fax: [(709) 782-0129][13]\n* #### Industrial Contractors\n\n1309 Topsail RoadSt. John's, NLA1B 3N4\n\nTel: [(709) 782-3404][14] Fax: [(709) 782-0129][15]\n* #### Technical Solutions\n\n650 Water StreetSt.John's, NLA1C 5M5\n\nTel: [(709) 726-5888][16] Fax: [(709) 726-5887][17]\n\n**Hydraulic Systems**\n\n2 Maverick PlaceParadise, NLCanadaA1L 0H6\n\nTel: [(709) 726-3490][18]Fax: [(709) 726-3729][19][[email protected]][20]\n\n**Technical Services**\n\n650 Water StreetSt. John\u2019s, NLA1C 5M5\n\nTel: [(709) 726-5888][21]Fax: [(709) 726-5887][22][[email protected]][23]\n\n**The Panel Shop**\n\n1925 Hanwell RoadFredericton, NBCanadaE3C 1M4\n\nTel: [(506) 455-1925][24]Fax: [(506) 459-3400][25][[email protected]][26]\n\n**Maintenance Services**\n\n20 Sudbury St #20St. John's, NLA1E 2V1\n\nTel: [(709) 726-5888][27]Fax: [(709) 726-5887][28]\n* #### Marine and Warehousing\n\n2 Northside RdBay Bulls, NLA0A 1C0\n\nTel: [(709) 334-2820][29] Fax: [(709) 334-2123][30]\n\n[ [GIP Atlantic Map] ][31]\n\n## Proof Is In the Projects\n\nOur capabilities are best demonstrated in the range and scale of work that we\u2019ve completed. Browse\nour projects to see our team at work on some of our country\u2019s largest projects.\n\n[View Projects][32]\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][33]\n\n\u00a92026 Green Infrastructure Partners. All rights reserved.\n* [Sitemap][34]\n* [Legal][35]\n* Feedback\n\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][36]\n* [Capabilities][37]\n* [People][38]\n* [Projects][39]\n* [Employment][40]\n* [Indigenous Relations][41]\n* [Contact][42]\n* [Sales & Rentals][43]\n* [About][44]\n* [Media Room][45]\n\nVisit our social media\n\nFill out the form below to leave feedback about the website and your browsing experience.\n\nEmail\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n## Search Green Infrastructure Partners\n\nSearch for:\n\nCancel\n\n[1]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[2]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[3]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[4]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[5]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[6]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[7]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[8]: tel:18667823404\n[9]: tel:7097823404\n[10]: tel:7097820129\n[11]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#543520387a24313a3a31373b3a383d393d20313014333d243d7a373b39\n[12]: tel:7097823404\n[13]: tel:7097820129\n[14]: tel:7097823404\n[15]: tel:7097820129\n[16]: tel:7097265888\n[17]: tel:7097265887\n[18]: tel:7097263490\n[19]: tel:7097263729\n[20]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1565707d66387b795565707b7b70767a7b3b767a78\n[21]: tel:7097265888\n[22]: tel:7097265887\n[23]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#90e0e4e3bdfefcd0e0f5fefef5f3fffebef3fffd\n[24]: tel:5064551925\n[25]: tel:5064593400\n[26]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a9ddc1ccd9c8c7ccc5dac1c6d9e9d9ccc7c7cccac6c787cac6c4\n[27]: tel:7097265888\n[28]: tel:7097265887\n[29]: tel:7093342820\n[30]: tel:7093342123\n[31]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Pennecon+Limited/@47.5297096,-52.8775296,14.16z/data=!4m10!1\nm2!2m1!1spennecon!3m6!1s0x4b0cbb43a2f3104d:0x26362d15bcf5e7ee!8m2!3d47.5328969!4d-52.8379955!15sCghw\nZW5uZWNvbiIDiAEBkgEcYnVzaW5lc3NfdG9fYnVzaW5lc3Nfc2VydmljZaoBWwoNL2cvMTFja2t4OWptbgoLL2cvMXRkeTQxaDkQ\nASoMIghwZW5uZWNvbigAMh8QASIbST11Fk0qBrxCFStn1Pig24fXkHkbLrPhobNIMgwQAiIIcGVubmVjb27gAQA!16s%2Fg%2F1t\ndy41h9?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDcxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\n[32]: http://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[33]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[34]: https://gipatlantic.com/?page_id=12\n[35]: https://gipatlantic.com/legal/\n[36]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[37]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[38]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[39]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[40]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[41]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[42]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[43]: https://gipatlantic.com/sales-rentals/\n[44]: https://gipatlantic.com/about/\n[45]: https://gipatlantic.com/media-room/"
