            "url": "https://gipatlantic.com/about/",
            "text": "[ [GIP Atlantic] ][1]\n* [Capabilities][2]\n* [People][3]\n* [Projects][4]\n* [Employment][5]\n* [Indigenous Relations][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n[A construction worker wearing a hard hat and orange safety jacket stands on a lift platform at an\nindustrial site with large electrical equipment in the background.]\n\n# About\n\n## GIP Atlantic IS A LEADING PROVIDER OF INTEGRATED SOLUTIONS ACROSS A DIVERSE PORTFOLIO OF\n## CAPABILITIES\n\n**Heavy Civil, Industrial Contractors, Technical Solutions, & Marine and Warehousing.**\n\nFrom breaking new ground to commissioning and ongoing site maintenance, we deliver the best\nsolutions, service and quality. Powered by a diverse team, from coast to coast across Canada, we are\nunited by our passion and determination to deliver results on the most complex jobs and challenging\nenvironments.\n\n## Hard work\n## is our tradition at GIP Atlantic.\n\nDiverse Expertise United by a Strong Work Ethic GIP Atlantic\u2019s strength lies in its diverse and\nskilled team, including engineers,\n\n[Play Video][8]\n\n## Our People\n\n### David Mitchell, P.Eng\n\nExecutive Vice President, Atlantic Canada\n\n][9]\n[View All][10]\n\n## Our Beliefs\n\n## Hard Work, Integrity, and Teamwork at the Heart of Our Success\n\nAt GIP Atlantic, we believe in rolling up our sleeves and getting the job done right. With decades\nof experience, our team thrives in challenging environments, tackling tough problems with passion,\ndetermination, and a can-do attitude.\n\nBuilt on a foundation of hard work and mutual respect, we are a trusted partner known for\nreliability and excellence. We work together, supporting one another and our clients every step of\nthe way.\n\nOur commitment to safety, environmental responsibility, and community well-being guides everything\nwe do. We continuously invest in improving our people and processes to deliver superior results\nwithout compromising our core values.\n\nWhen the call comes, we put on our boots and go to work\u2014because at GIP Atlantic, we don\u2019t quit until\nthe job is done.\n\n## One Of Canada\u2019s Best Managed Companies\n\n## GIP Atlantic Achieves Platinum Club Status with Canada\u2019s Best Managed Companies Program\n\nNow in its 25th year, Canada\u2019s Best Managed Companies is one of the country\u2019s leading business\nawards programs recognizing Canadian-owned and managed companies for innovative, world-class\nbusiness practices. Every year, hundreds of entrepreneurial companies compete for this designation\nin a rigorous and independent process that evaluates the calibre of their management abilities and\npractices.\n\nGIP Atlantic recently achieved Platinum Club status with the Canada\u2019s Best Managed Companies program\nby retaining its Best Managed designation for seven consecutive years or more.\n\n[Canada Best Managed Companies - Platinum member]\n\n## Our Commitments\n\n[community]\n\n## Community\n\nWe care about our people, our communities, and our province. Which is why GIP Atlantic has a long\nhistory of investing into the places we work and live.\n\n[Learn More][11]\n[hseq]\n\n## HSEQ\n\nHealth and Safety We\u2019re relentlessly committed to protecting ourselves, our colleagues, and the\nenvironments in which we work. At GIP Atlantic,\n\n[Learn More][12]\n\n## Proof Is In the Projects\n\nOur capabilities are best demonstrated in the range and scale of work that we\u2019ve completed. Browse\nour projects to see our team at work on some of our country\u2019s largest projects.\n\n[View Projects][13]\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][14]\n\n\u00a92026 Green Infrastructure Partners. All rights reserved.\n* [Sitemap][15]\n* [Legal][16]\n* Feedback\n\n[ [GIP Atlantic] ][17]\n* [Capabilities][18]\n* [People][19]\n* [Projects][20]\n* [Employment][21]\n* [Indigenous Relations][22]\n* [Contact][23]\n* [Sales & Rentals][24]\n* [About][25]\n* [Media Room][26]\n\nVisit our social media\n\nFill out the form below to leave feedback about the website and your browsing experience.\n\nEmail\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n## Search Green Infrastructure Partners\n\nSearch for:\n\nCancel\n\n[1]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[2]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[3]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[4]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[5]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[6]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[7]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[8]: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9XpIeqac3-E\n[9]: /people/david-mitchell-p-eng/\n[10]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[11]: /about/community/\n[12]: /about/hseq/\n[13]: http://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[14]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[15]: https://gipatlantic.com/?page_id=12\n[16]: https://gipatlantic.com/legal/\n[17]: https://gipatlantic.com/\n[18]: https://gipatlantic.com/capabilities/\n[19]: https://gipatlantic.com/people/\n[20]: https://gipatlantic.com/projects/\n[21]: https://gipatlantic.com/employment/\n[22]: https://gipatlantic.com/indigenous-relations/\n[23]: https://gipatlantic.com/contact/\n[24]: https://gipatlantic.com/sales-rentals/\n[25]: https://gipatlantic.com/about/\n[26]: https://gipatlantic.com/media-room/"
          },
