nel Management ][37]\n  * [ Microsoft Azure Management ][38]\n  * [ AWS Cloud Management ][39]\n\n# Buy Best Web Hosting for Your Business - Global IT Providers\n\nThe best web hosting company in India - Global IT Providers - a platform that facilitates choice,\nsimplicity & performance. A dedicated server hosting provider, to facilitate you stay focused on\nwhat you do best, win as an individual and succeed as a business.\n\n[Get Started][40]\n\n### Our managed cloud hosting platform takes away all the technical complexities, letting you focus\n### on the growth and success of your website with complete peace of mind.\n\n### WHY CHOOSE GIP?\n\nAre you looking for the most trusted and relied website hosting services and domain name\nregistration services in Jaipur? GIP is counted as among the best web hosting services in Jaipur.\nWith our dedicated server hosting services, we help people realize their dreams of owning a\nsuccessful online business. With GIP, buying a domain name is a piece of cake.\n\n### Create your Personal Space\n### and live Live\n\nFor your every business need, we have covered you.\n\n#### Shared\n#### Hosting\n\nGet your business online now and write your own story\n\n##### Starting at only\n\n###### INR 714*/-\n\n[Get Started][41]\n\n#### Cloud\n#### Hosting\n\nDon\u2019t stop, upgrade at any time on a single call Cloud is yours with SSD Storage\n\n##### Starting at only\n\n###### INR 1299*/-\n\n[Get Started][42]\n\n#### Dedicated\n#### Server\n\nWork faster, Grow faster with lightening fast performance\n\n##### Starting at only\n\n###### INR 4999/mo*\n\n[Get Started][43]\n\n### Learn the way to get online\n### in minutes!\n\nWith Global IT Providers, you not only get the satisfaction of working with the best web hosting\ncompany in Jaipur, but you get a complete package related to website hosting services and domain\nname registration services to help you create an effective and powerful online presence. Are you\ndealing with an old site that doesn\u2019t work properly? No worries, because GIP is here to solve your\nold website problems too!!\n\n##### Webmail\n\n#### How to create an email account in cpanel?\n\n##### IP Blocked?\n\n#### How to allow an IP in firewall in WHM panel?\n\n##### Shared Hosting Account\n\n#### How to create a shared hosting in whm panel?\n\n### Happy Customers are the best,\n### see their stories\n* [Enterprises][44]\n* [Organisations][45]\n* [Development Companies][46]\n\nI must say they are the lifeline for our company, they stand like elder brother shielding &\nproviding us with superb support for all our managed service requirement. With years our\nrelationship has only matured, and from vendors they are like our partner.\n\nGIP is one of the most appreciated companies out there when it comes to website stability,\nperformance and fantastic customer service. I think they are offering superior fully managed web\nhosting services, and all of their plans come with blazing fast SSD drives, server-level caching,\nstaging feature, daily backups, 1-click installers, cPanel/WHM, FREE SSL certificates, FREE\nmigration, and many other excellent included add-ons.\n\nWe are having very nice experience about your services and extreme commitment for your quality\nservices delivered and most amazing part your round the clock quick support ... we are having long\nrelation form past years and hoping for long years in Future ... Thanks and lots of wishes ...\n\n### 24x7\n### Support\n\nWhen our heroes are available why do you worry ?\n\nAsk our Experts and sit relax have a cup of black coffee.\n\n[ 8448444608\nDial 1 for Linux\nDial 2 for Windows ][47]\n\n### Sales\n### Training\n\nWant to generate Revenue?\n\nAsk our performers for some tips & tricks ;)\n\n[ 8448444608\nDial 3 for Sales ][48]\n\n### Control Panel\n### Training\n\nLearn basics how control panel works, and how can you control your data?\n\nDon\u2019t hesitate just Call\n\n[ 8448444608\nDial 1 for Linux\nDial 2 for Windows ][49]\n\n### 24x7\n### Support\n\nWhen our heroes are available why do you worry ?\n\nAsk our Experts and sit relax have a cup of black coffee.\n\n[ 8448444608 Dial 1 for Linux Dial 2 for Windows ][50]\n\n### Sales\n### Training\n\nWant to generate Revenue?\n\nAsk our performers for some tips & tricks ;)\n\n[ 8448444608 Dial 3 for Sales ][51]\n\n### Control Panel\n### Training\n\nLearn basics how control panel works, and how can you control your data?\n\nDon\u2019t hesitate just Call\n\n[ 8448444608 Dial 1 for Linux Dial 2 for Windows ][52]\n\n### We like coffee too!\n\n#### Contact for Any kind of Development support\n\nDon\u2019t bother now our experts are here to fix errors/bugs/malwares.\nContact here for any issue other than hosting.\n\n[ ][53]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Company Profile][54]\n* [Privacy Policy][55]\n* [Terms & Conditions][56]\n* [KnowledgeBase][57]\n* [Contact Us][58]\n* [Shipping Policy][59]\n* [Refund Policy][60]\n* [Pricing Policy][61]\n\n### Sign up for special Offers\n\nand get information about our new products, special offers, and upcoming events.\n\n### Mailing Address\n\nGIP Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\nB4, Third Floor, Vivek Vihar\nOpp. Dainik Bhaskar office\nJaipur,Rajasthan, India. [302018][62]\n\n[Privacy Policies][63] | [Terms & Conditions][64]\n\n\u00a9 2020, globalitproviders.com | All rights reserved.\n* [Domains & SSL][65]\n  \n  ### Domain & SSL\n  \n  Showcase your authenticity and trustworthiness to your visitors through a genuine Domain Name &\n  SSL as soon as they visit your page.\n  \n  ### SSL Certificates\n  * [ Domain Validation SSL ][66]\n  * [ Organization Validation SSL ][67]\n  * [ Extended Validation SSL ][68]\n* [Hosting][69]\n  \n  ### Hosting\n  \n  Give the responsibility of hosting your website to the best and the most trusted host in the\n  country.\n  \n  * [ Shared Hosting ][70]\n  * [ Reseller Hosting ][71]\n  \n  * [ Dedicated Delhi Ncr ][72]\n  * [ VPS Delhi Ncr ][73]\n  * [ Shared Delhi Ncr ][74]\n* [Cloud][75]\n* [VPS Hosting][76]\n* [Dedicated][77]\n* [Email & SMS Solutions][78]\n  \n  ### Email & SMS Solutions\n  \n  No matter where you are working from, your email and SMS is what defines you in your customer\u2019s\n  eyes. Get the best services from the best provider.\n  \n  ### Email\n  * [ Office 365 ][79]\n  * [ Google Apps ][80]\n  * [ SmarterMail ][81]\n  \n  ### SMS\n  * [ Transactional SMS Service ][82]\n  * [ Promotional SMS Service ][83]\n* [Backup & Security][84]\n  \n  ### Backup & Security\n  \n  Gain the trust of your customers by giving them the guarantee of the best security and give\n  yourself some peace of mind with our superb backup services.\n  \n  ### Backup\n  * [ Remote Backup Service ][85]\n  \n  ### Security\n  * [ Fix Hacked Sites & Security Patch Installation ][86]\n  * [ Blacklist Removal Service ][87]\n  * [ Malware Removal Service ][88]\n* [Server Management][89]\n  \n  ### Server Management\n  \n  Hand over the task of managing your server to us so that you can rock from the front.\n  \n  * [ Windows Server Management ][90]\n  * [ Plesk Management ][91]\n  * [ Linux Server Management ][92]\n  * [ WHM/cPanel Management ][93]\n  * [ Microsoft Azure Management ][94]\n  * [ AWS Cloud Management ][95]\n* [ 8448444608 ][96]\n* [ SUPPORT ][97]\n* [ My Account ][98]\n* [ LOGIN ][99]\n* [ Cart ][100]\n\n[1]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/blog\n[2]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/360-marketing\n[3]: tel:84484446080\n[4]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/tlds/submitticket.php\n[5]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/tlds/clientarea.php\n[6]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/tlds/clientarea.php\n[7]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/tlds/cart.php\n[8]: https://www.globalitproviders.in\n[9]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/#\n[10]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/ssl\n[11]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/ssl\n[12]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/ssl\n[13]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/#\n[14]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/shared-hosting\n[15]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/reseller-hosting\n[16]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/dedicated-server-delhi-ncr\n[17]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/vps-hosting-delhi-ncr\n[18]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/shared-web-hosting-delhi-ncr\n[19]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/cloud-web-hosting\n[20]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/vps-hosting\n[21]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/dedicated-server\n[22]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/#\n[23]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/business#officeplan\n[24]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/business\n[25]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/business#smartmainpro\n[26]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/gip_sms\n[27]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/gip_sms\n[28]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/#\n[29]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/#\n[30]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/fix-hacked-dites-and-security-patch-installation\n[31]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/blacklist_removal\n[32]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/malware_removal\n[33]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/#\n[34]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/windows-server-management\n[35]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/plesk-management\n[36]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/linux-server-management\n[37]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/whm-cpanel-management\n[38]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/microsoft-azure-management\n[39]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/aws-cloud-management\n[40]: shared-hosting\n[41]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/shared-hosting\n[42]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/cloud-web-hosting\n[43]: https://www.globalitproviders.in/dedicated-server\n[44]: javascript:void();\n[45]: javascript:void();\n[46]: javascript:void();\n[47]: tel:8448444608 <br /> Dial 1 for Linux <br /> Dial 2 for Windows\n[48]: tel:8448444608 <br /> Dial 3 for Sales\n[49]: tel:8448444608 <br /> Dial 1 for Linux <br /> Dial 2 for Windows\n[50]: tel:8448444608  Dial 1 for Linux  Dial 2 for Windows\n[51]: tel:8448444608  Dial 3 for Sal