      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "vendor",
      "company_summary": "Smicoldtherapy specializes in innovative postoperative cold compression wraps designed to enhance pain relief and recovery for patients. Their product line includes targeted cold therapy solutions for various areas of the body, such as the knee, shoulder, back, and hip, as well as specialized wraps for chemotherapy patients and facial surgeries. With a focus on maximizing mobility and comfort, Smicoldtherapy aims to support individuals recovering from surgery or managing injuries.",
