        "crawl_text": "SMI Cold Therapy, Inc. FDA Certified FDA Certified 100% American Made Continuous cold therapy with gel bags Antimicrobial materials Designed for self-application American-made products Focus on patient comfort and simplicity Rapid distribution capabilities FDA regulations for medical devices Rocky Mount, VA Nationwide SMI Cold Therapy was founded in 2004 and has grown significantly since its inception. The company focuses on providing simple and effective cold therapy solutions for post-operative care. SMI Cold Therapy has been providing innovative cold therapy solutions since 2004, focusing on patient comfort and ease of use. The company has expanded its manufacturing capabilities significantly, moving to a larger facility in 2021 to meet growing demand. Expanding product offerings in post-operative care. Enhancing manufacturing capabilities to meet growing demand. Enhancing product offerings in post-operative care Expanding market reach and distribution capabilities Competition in the medical device market. Maintaining compliance with FDA regulations. Competition from other medical device manufacturers Regulatory compliance and product safety standards Growing demand for effective post-operative care solutions. Expansion into new healthcare markets. Growing demand for effective post-operative care solutions Expansion into new healthcare markets SMI Cold Therapy is positioned as a leader in the cold therapy market for post-operative care, with a focus on patient comfort and product efficacy. Increased awareness of the benefits of cold therapy in post-operative recovery. Expansion of healthcare facilities using SMI products. Increased awareness of the benefits of cold therapy in post-operative recovery Expansion of product lines to cater to various surgical needs SMI Cold Therapy | Postoperative Cold Compression Wraps\n\nFIND A REP\n\nCAREERS\n\n877.423.9727\n\nClose\n\nProducts\n\nALL PRODUCTS\n\nSee all SMI products\n\nSPINE\n\nProducts for use on spine\n\nGENERAL SURGERY\n\nProducts for use with general surgery\n\nORTHO\n\nProducts for use with ortho surgery\n\nONCOLOGY\n\nProducts for use during chemotherapy\n\nPLASTIC SURGERY\n\nProducts for use with plastic surgery\n\nPODIATRY\n\nProducts for use with podiatry\n\nSMALL JOINT\n\nProducts for use on small joints\n\nKNEE\n\nSHOULDER\n\nBACK\n\nHIP\n\nAB BINDER\n\nCHEMO\n\nCOLD VEST\n\nFACIAL\n\nFOOT & ANKLE\n\n3+ HOUR GEL BAGS\n\nSMALL GEL BAGS\n\nHAND WRIST ELBOW\n\nLAG\n\nNECK\n\nTHORACIC\n\nUNIVERSAL\n\nWhy SMI?\n\nWHY SMI?\n\nSee Our Advantages\n\nTYPES OF THERAPY\n\nThree Different Types\n\nFOR PHYSICIANS\n\nTargeted Information\n\nFOR NURSES & STAFF\n\nHelpful Guidance\n\nFREEZER PROGRAM\n\nSMI Supplied Freezers\n\nCAREERS\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nFOR SUPPLY CHAIN\n\nHow SMI Can Help\n\nFOR PATIENTS\n\nThings to Know\n\nHow To\n\nUSE INSTRUCTIONS\n\nHow to apply SMI wraps\n\nVIDEO LIBRARY\n\nApplication videos\n\nFAQs\n\nQuestions Answered\n\nResources\n\nCLINICAL STUDIES\n\nRead scientific data\n\nUSE INSTRUCTIONS\n\nHow to apply SMI wraps\n\nVIDEO LIBRARY\n\nApplication videos\n\nINFO LIBRARY\n\nBrochures & Documents\n\nABOUT US\n\nLearn about SMI\n\nFIND A REP\n\nFind your SMI rep\n\nFDA CERTIFICATION\n\nSee SMI's certification\n\nGET IN TOUCH\n\nLet us hear from you\n\nSHOP NOW\n\nPurchase products online\n\nSHOP\n\nSearch for:\n\nYour Cart (0)\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nLooks like you haven&#039;t added anything yet.\nStart Shopping\n\nSHOP\n\nPhysicians\n\nNurses & Staff\n\nSupply Chain\n\nPatients\n\nUsed in over 600\nHospitals & Facilities\n\nEasy Cold Therapy for Better Patient Outcomes\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Compression Wraps stay icy cold, are simple to use & highly effective for faster recovery with less hassle.\n\nShop Products\n\nDiscover More\n\nMade in the usa since\n\n100% American Made\n\nUsed On Over\n\nPatients per Week\n\nIn Over\n\nFacilities Nationwide\n\nFor Physicians\n\nSMI Wraps Mean\n\nBetter Patient Compliance\n\nSwipe For More\n\nClinical\nStudies\n\nContinuous\nCold Therapy\n\nEase\nof Use\n\nFeatures &\nBenefits\n\nPrivate Label\nProgram\n\nFreezer\nProgram\n\nStudies & Resources\n\nStudies have shown that SMI Cold Therapy wraps are highly effective and can reduce the need for postoperative opioids for pain. Hospital staff satisfaction was higher with the ice/gel pack cryotherapy wrap than with a circulating cold water cotherapy device. Compression wrap users also experienced significantly less pain.\n\nClick on an image to view a study or brochure.\n\nGo To Info Library\n\nColder for Longer\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Wraps maintain a cold temperature for longer than other products. See the chart to the right.\n\nOur wraps come with two sets of gel bags. One set can be kept in the freezer and swapped out with the other gel bags providing continuous cold therapy. Each gel bag maintains it's cold for 3+ hours.\n\nLearn More\n\n3 Easy Steps\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Compression Wraps are easy to use making it easier for patients to comply with a cold therapy regimen. This in turn, results in more positive patient outcomes.\n\nSimply insert the frozen gel bag into the antimicrobial pouch, form the wrap over the forearm to make it more flexible then apply to the affected area with the compression straps.\n\nWatch Application Videos\n\n100% Mobility\n\nNot tethered to any cooler or ice bags allowing for freedom of movement while wearing\n\nAdjustable Compression\n\nEffective compression means visibly reduced edema and effective cold delivery\n\nCold 3+ Hours\n\nNon-toxic gel bags mold perfectly to the targeted area & cool for 3+ hours\n\nBreathable\n\nMoisture wicking fabric keeps condensation away for comfort - won't harbor harmful bacteria\n\nAntimicrobial\n\nGel pouch liners are antimicrobial & wick away moisture, keeping skin dry & protected\n\nStretch Straps\n\nExtra wide proprietary straps hold wrap in place for ambulation\n\nView All SMI Wraps\n\nShowcase Your Practice or Facility\n\nWe offer a unique, low-cost marketing opportunity for your hospital, surgery center or private practice. Easily place any logo on each body-site specific compression wrap to help promote Orthopedic or Spine Programs.\n\nFind A Rep To Learn More\n\nSMI's Freezer Program\n\nWe know that your time, budget and available facility space is precious, which is why we take those burdens out of your hands so that you may be free to focus on what matters most \u2014 Patient Care.\n\nSMI Cold Therapy supplies all of the necessary freezers throughout the patient-pathway at no-charge to our customers without any minimum order requirements or contracts to sign.\n\nLearn More Details\n\nFor Nurses & staff\n\nSMI Wraps Mean\n\nLess Time & Hassle\n\nSwipe For More\n\nEase\nof Use\n\nStandardization\nof Care\n\nFeatures &\nBenefits\n\nApplication\nVideos\n\nDevice\nComparison\n\nFreezer\nProgram\n\nApply in 3 Easy Steps\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Compression Wraps mean less time and less mess for you and your patients. Our wraps are easy to apply and allow your patients to move freely without the concerns of being tethered to a cooling machine with dangerous cords.\n\nSimply insert the frozen gel bag into the antimicrobial pouch & press the velcro tabs to close, form the wrap over the forearm to make it more flexible and then apply to the affected area with the compression straps.\n\nWatch Application Videos\n\n\u2014\u2014Cervical\n\n\u2014\u2014Facial\n\nThoracic\u2014\u2014\n\nElbow\u2014\u2014\n\nBack\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nWrist\u2014\u2014\n\nHand\u2014\u2014\n\nCalf\u2014\n\nAnkle\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014Shoulder\n\n\u2014\u2014Chest\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014Abdomen\n\n\u2014\u2014Hip\n\n\u2014Knee\n\n\u2014\u2014Foot\n\nSMI Makes Things Easy\n\nNurse and patient friendly, SMI Cold Therapy provides a cold therapy system allowing for patient care standardization. We offer wraps for all body sites meaning our products can fit all your needs \u2014 no need for multiple suppliers! Our products also work for both inpatient and outpatient care \u2014 no switching devices necessary!\n\nSMI Cold Therapy wraps are a clear choice for patient care and clinician acceptance.\n\nView All SMI Wraps\n\n100% Mobility\n\nNot tethered to any cooler or ice bags allowing for freedom of movement while wearing\n\nAdjustable Compression\n\nEffective compression means visibly reduced edema & effective cold delivery\n\nCold 3+ Hours\n\nNon-toxic gel bags mold perfectly to the targeted area & cool for 3+ hours\n\nBreathable\n\nMoisture wicking fabric keeps condensation away for comfort - won't harbor harmful bacteria\n\nAntimicrobial\n\nGel pouch liners are antimicrobial & wick away moisture, keeping skin dry & protected\n\nStretch Straps\n\nExtra wide proprietary straps hold wrap in place for ambulation\n\nView All SMI Wraps\n\nSee How Quick & Easy\n\nWith SMI Cold Therapy Wraps you'll avoid the hassles and safety concerns of cooling machines and messy ice packs. Our wraps are easy to apply and allow for full mobility while wearing. They also provide 3+ hours of cold, meaning less hands on time for you and your patients.\n\nSee how easy they are to apply. You can view all our application videos on our Video Library page.\n\nView More Videos\n\nSMI Cold Therapy\n\nActive Rehab\n\nCumbersome\nCooling Machines\n\nPassive Rehab\n\nIneffective\nIce Bags\n\nPassive Rehab\n\nSMI WRAPS\n\nCost Effective\n\nLow patient cost\n\nStandard&shy;ization of patient care\n\nCooling Machines\n\nExpensive Unit Cost\n\nHigh patient cost\n\nHigh staff inter&shy;vention\n\nIce Bags\n\nExpensive Protocol\n\nHigh staff inter&shy;vention\n\nAdd'l expenses for other modalities\n\nSMI WRAPS\n\nSafe\n\nNo electric cords, hoses or leaks\n\nCooling Machines\n\nSafety Concerns\n\nTrip hazard, leaky disconnects\n\nIce Bags\n\nSafety Concerns\n\nTrip hazard, melted ice\n\nNo Condensation\n\nMoisture-wicking, anti-microbial liner\n\nWet Surgical Sites\n\nCondensation & leaks\n\nWet Surgical Sites\n\nCondensation & leaky bags\n\nNo Ice Cubes or Water\n\nIce Cube/Water Regimen\n\nHassle for nursing staff - messy cleanups\n\nIce Cube/Water Regimen\n\nHigh Staff & Patient Compliance\n\nLow Staff & Patient Compliance\n\nLow Staff & Patient Compliance\n\nEffective Compression\n\nSuperior cold delivery & edema reduction\n\nNo Compression\n\nNo Compression\n\nIneffective cold delivery\n\nComplete Patient Mobility\n\nLimited Patient Mobility\n\nLimited Patient Mobility\n\nHigh Standardization of Car [ FIND A REP ][1]\n[ CAREERS ][2]\n877.423.9727\n[ [SMI Cold Therapy Logo] ][3]\n* [SMI Cold Therapy Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Logo] Close\n* Products\n* [ ALL PRODUCTS See all SMI products ][4]\n* [ SPINE Products for use on spine ][5]\n* [ GENERAL SURGERY Products for use with general surgery ][6]\n* [ ORTHO Products for use with ortho surgery ][7]\n* [ ONCOLOGY Products for use during chemotherapy ][8]\n* [ PLASTIC SURGERY Products for use with plastic surgery ][9]\n* [ PODIATRY Products for use with podiatry ][10]\n* [ SMALL JOINT Products for use on small joints ][11]\n* [ KNEE ][12]\n* [ SHOULDER ][13]\n* [ BACK ][14]\n* [ HIP ][15]\n* [ AB BINDER ][16]\n* [ CHEMO ][17]\n* [ COLD VEST ][18]\n* [ FACIAL ][19]\n* [ FOOT & ANKLE ][20]\n* [ 3+ HOUR GEL BAGS ][21]\n* [ SMALL GEL BAGS ][22]\n* [ HAND WRIST ELBOW ][23]\n* [ LAG ][24]\n* [ NECK ][25]\n* [ THORACIC ][26]\n* [ UNIVERSAL ][27]\n* Why SMI?\n* [ WHY SMI? See Our Advantages ][28]\n* [ TYPES OF THERAPY Three Different Types ][29]\n* [ FOR PHYSICIANS Targeted Information ][30]\n* [ FOR NURSES & STAFF Helpful Guidance ][31]\n* [ FREEZER PROGRAM SMI Supplied Freezers ][32]\n* [ CAREERS Join Our Team ][33]\n* [ FOR SUPPLY CHAIN How SMI Can Help ][34]\n* [ FOR PATIENTS Things to Know ][35]\n* How To\n* [ USE INSTRUCTIONS How to apply SMI wraps ][36]\n* [ VIDEO LIBRARY Application videos ][37]\n* [ FAQs Questions Answered ][38]\n* Resources\n* [ CLINICAL STUDIES Read scientific data ][39]\n* [ USE INSTRUCTIONS How to apply SMI wraps ][40]