rap Ice Pack for Hip Injury\n\n$52.95 \u2013 $74.95Price range: $52.95 through $74.95 ][79]\n* [\n[Man wearing an SMI Cold Therapy Back Wrap][Man wearing an SMI Cold Therapy Back Wrap]\n\n## Back Wrap\n\n$57.95 \u2013 $79.95Price range: $57.95 through $79.95 ][80]\n* [\n[Man Wearing an SMI Neck Wrap][Man Wearing an SMI Neck Wrap]\n\n## Neck Wrap\n\n$39.95 \u2013 $49.95Price range: $39.95 through $49.95 ][81]\n\nHear from a user\nThe product makes cold therapy easier for the patients and staff. Our rep works hard to get anything\nwe need and is prompt and straight forward about the service she is able to provide. The product\nsells itself due to the decrease in attached cords to the patients and family involvement in the\ncare.\n\u2015 Nursing Director\nMissouri Hospital\n[SMI Cold Therapy Frosted Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Frosted Logo]\n\n### The Cold Standard in cold therapy.\n\n[ ][82]\n[ ][83]\n[ Products ][84]\n[ Physicians ][85]\n[ Nurses & Staff ][86]\n[ Supply Chain ][87]\n[ Patients ][88]\n[ News ][89]\n[ SHOP NOW ][90]\n[ Find A Rep ][91]\n[ Get In Touch ][92]\n[ My Account ][93]\n[ Return Policy ][94]\n877.423.9727\nSMI Cold Therapy, LLC\n60 Commerce Road\nRocky Mount, VA 24151\ninfo[at]smicoldtherapy.net\n\n# MA DE IN THE USA\n\n[An American Flag][An American Flag]\nAll Rights Reserved \u00a9 SMI Cold Therapy LLC 2026\n[ Terms of Use ][95]\n[ Privacy Policy ][96]\n[Review Badge][Review Badge]\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.Ok\n\n[1]: /find-a-rep/\n[2]: /careers/\n[3]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/\n[4]: /product-category/all-smi-shop-products/\n[5]: /product-category/spine/\n[6]: /product-category/general-surgery/\n[7]: /product-category/orthopedics/\n[8]: /product-category/oncology/\n[9]: /product-category/plastic-surgery/\n[10]: /product-category/podiatry/\n[11]: /product-category/small-joint/\n[12]: /product/knee-wrap/\n[13]: /product/