            "text": "[ FIND A REP ][1]\n[ CAREERS ][2]\n877.423.9727\n[ [SMI Cold Therapy Logo] ][3]\n* [SMI Cold Therapy Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Logo] Close\n* Products\n* [ ALL PRODUCTS See all SMI products ][4]\n* [ SPINE Products for use on spine ][5]\n* [ GENERAL SURGERY Products for use with general surgery ][6]\n* [ ORTHO Products for use with ortho surgery ][7]\n* [ ONCOLOGY Products for use during chemotherapy ][8]\n* [ PLASTIC SURGERY Products for use with plastic surgery ][9]\n* [ PODIATRY Products for use with podiatry ][10]\n* [ SMALL JOINT Products for use on small joints ][11]\n* [ KNEE ][12]\n* [ SHOULDER ][13]\n* [ BACK ][14]\n* [ HIP ][15]\n* [ AB BINDER ][16]\n* [ CHEMO ][17]\n* [ COLD VEST ][18]\n* [ FACIAL ][19]\n* [ FOOT & ANKLE ][20]\n* [ 3+ HOUR GEL BAGS ][21]\n* [ SMALL GEL BAGS ][22]\n* [ HAND WRIST ELBOW ][23]\n* [ LAG ][24]\n* [ NECK ][25]\n* [ THORACIC ][26]\n* [ UNIVERSAL ][27]\n* Why SMI?\n* [ WHY SMI? See Our Advantages ][28]\n* [ TYPES OF THERAPY Three Different Types ][29]\n* [ FOR PHYSICIANS Targeted Information ][30]\n* [ FOR NURSES & STAFF Helpful Guidance ][31]\n* [ FREEZER PROGRAM SMI Supplied Freezers ][32]\n* [ CAREERS Join Our Team ][33]\n* [ FOR SUPPLY CHAIN How SMI Can Help ][34]\n* [ FOR PATIENTS Things to Know ][35]\n* How To\n* [ USE INSTRUCTIONS How to apply SMI wraps ][36]\n* [ VIDEO LIBRARY Application videos ][37]\n* [ FAQs Questions Answered ][38]\n* Resources\n* [ CLINICAL STUDIES Read scientific data ][39]\n* [ USE INSTRUCTIONS How to apply SMI wraps ][40]\n* [ VIDEO LIBRARY Application videos ][41]\n* [ INFO LIBRARY Brochures & Documents ][42]\n* [ ABOUT US Learn about SMI ][43]\n* [ FIND A REP Find your SMI rep ][44]\n* [ FDA CERTIFICATION See SMI's certification ][45]\n* [ GET IN TOUCH Let us hear from you ][46]\n* [ SHOP NOW Purchase products online ][47]\n* [ SHOP ][48]\nSearch for:\n[ 0 ][49]\nYour Cart (0)\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\nLooks like you haven't added anything yet.\n\n[Start Shopping][50]\n[ SHOP ][51]\n* [ Physicians ][52]\n* [ Nurses & Staff ][53]\n* [ Supply Chain ][54]\n* [ Patients ][55]\n\n# Hip Wrap Ice Pack for Hip Injury\n\n[[Man wearing an SMI Cold Therapy Hip Wrap]][56]\n[[Nurse applying an SMI Cold Therapy Hip Wrap on a man]][57]\n[[SMI Cold Therapy Hip Wrap with 4 Gel Bags]][58]\n[[The Back of an SMI Cold Thearpy Hip Wrap with no gel bags]][59]\n[[Nurse Applying an SMI Cold Therapy Hip Wrap]][60]\n\n# Hip Wrap Ice Pack for Hip Injury\n\nGoes over the surgical dressing (or on top of or underneath clothing) to effectively penetrate the\narea to provide comfort and relief from pain and/or swelling. This hip cold wrap features two frozen\n3+ hour gel bags, enclosed in a white, antimicrobial bandage layer, that stay firmly in place. Two\nadditional 3+ hour gel bags are included to allow for continuous cold therapy. See below for more\ninformation. **Made in the USA.** One size fits most. **Includes 1 Wrap and (4) 3+ Hour Gel Bags.**\n\n### Product Details\n* Versatile design provides support, compression, cold therapy and/or heat therapy to both the front\nand back hip areas to target pain/swelling\n* Designed for self-application if necessary\n* Design allows for full mobility while being used\n* Common uses: Post-operative pain & swelling relief, physical therapy, sports injuries & chronic\npain relief\n* Antimicrobial liner that wicks moisture\n* Latex-Free\n* Uses two 3+ Hour Gel Bags\n* Fits around hips measuring 12\" (min.) to 72\" (max.)\n* Recommended HCPCS Code: A9273\n\nGood for: Bursitis \u2022 Hip Dislocation \u2022 Hip Pointer\n\n### Features & Benefits\n\n# Maximum Mobility\n\nNot tethered to any cooler or ice bags allowing for freedom of movement while wearing\n\n# Adjustable Compression\n\nEffective compression means visibly reduced edema & effective cold delivery\n\n# Cold 3+ Hours\n\nNon-toxic gelbags mold perfectly to the targeted area & cool for 3+ hours\n\n# Breathable\n\nMoisture wicking fabric keeps condensation away for comfort \u2014 won't harbor harmful bacteria\n\n# Antimicrobial\n\nGel pouch liners are antimicrobial & wick away moisture, keeping skin dry & protected\n\n# Stretch Straps\n\nExtra wide proprietary straps hold wrap in place for ambulation\n\n### Documentation\n\n[ [SMI Wraps Use Instruction Sheet][SMI Wraps Use Instruction Sheet] ][61][ [SMI Trifold\nBrochure][SMI Trifold Brochure] ][62][ [SMI Spine Surgery Bifold Brochure][SMI Spine Surgery Bifold\nBrochure] ][63][ [SMI General Surgery Bifold Brochure][SMI General Surgery Bifold Brochure] ][64][\n[SMI Effective Enhancement Brochure][SMI Effective Enhancement Brochure] ][65][ [SMI Cold Therapy\nfor Chemo Flyer][SMI Cold Therapy for Chemo Flyer] ][66][ [SMI CIPN Prevention Bifold Brochure][SMI\nCIPN Prevention Bifold Brochure] ][67][ [SMI CIPN Patient Flyer][SMI CIPN Patient Flyer] ][68][ [SMI\nItem Number Catalog][SMI Item Number Catalog] ][69][ [UVMC Postoperative Opioids Study][UVMC\nPostoperative Opioids Study] ][70][ [Multifaceted Comparison Study][Multifaceted Comparison Study]\n][71][ [Temperature Graph Document Cover][Temperature Graph Document Cover] ][72]\n\n### Types of Therapy\n\n##### SMI offers 3 types of proven therapies in one easy-to-use product:\n\n### Cold Therapy\n\nAlso known as Cryotherapy, Cold Therapy is used mainly for joint pain and aches. It reduces blood\nflow to the area of the body to which it's applied. This reduces the inflammation that leads to pain\nand can also temporarily reduce nerve activity. Additional effects include controlling hemorrhage,\npreventing edema (swelling) and blocking pain receptors.\n\nCold Therapy Therapeutic Uses:\n* Reduce or stop bleeding\n* Slow bacterial activity\n* Relieve postoperative pain following surgical procedures, dental surgeries, headaches, or muscle\nor joint injury\n* Prevent swelling in injured tissues\n* Prevent peristalsis in patients with abdominal inflammation\n* Reduce bruising\n* Control pain and fluid loss in the initial treatment of burns\n* Diminish muscle contraction and spasm\n\n### Heat Therapy\n\nHeat Therapy is used mainly for muscle pain and aches. It helps improve blood flow and circulation\nto an injured area and helps to relieve discomfort while improving muscle flexibility for recovery.\nHeat Therapy can also heal damaged tissue. Heat causes vasodilation of the blood vessels, which\nincreases blood flow to the area of application. This in turn, increases the amount of oxygen,\nnutrients, and white blood cells delivered to the body tissues. In addition, vasodilation assists in\nthe removal of waste products from injured tissues.\n\nHeat Therapy Therapeutic Uses:\n* Relieve localized pain, stiffness, or aching in joints or muscles\n* Decrease muscle spasm and tightness\n* Increase muscle flexibility\n* Increase blood flow to the area\n* Promote wound healing\n* Reduce inflammation\n\n### Compression Therapy\n\nCompression Therapy uses controlled pressure to increase blood flow to certain areas and improve\nblood flow to the heart. It supports veins and decreases edema (swelling). Compression Therapy is\nfound to be the most effective when it's combined with movement.\n\nCold Therapy Therapeutic Uses:\n* Prevention of leg swelling for people who stand or sit for long periods of time\n* Effective delivery of cold/heat to a targeted area of the body\n* Management of varicose veins\n* Used to treat Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT)\n* Improves healing of leg ulcers & prevents them from coming back\n* Maintenance therapy for lymphedema\n* Improvement in chronic venous insufficiency & ulcer recurrence in older adults\n* Diminish muscle contraction and spasm\n\n### PRODUCT ITEM # CATALOG\n\n[ [SMI Item Number Catalog][SMI Item Number Catalog] ][73]\n**FOR FACILITY PRICING,** contact a rep by clicking the **FIND A REP** button below.\n[ Find A Rep ][74]\n\n$52.95 \u2013 $74.95Price range: $52.95 through $74.95\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSelect Wrap With or Without Gel \u2502Choose an option1 WRAP + 4 Gel Bags1 WRAP ONLY - NO Gel Bags\nBags \u2502[Clear][75]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nHip Wrap quantity\nAdd to cart\nENJOY FREE SHIPPING! All orders ship 2nd Day delivery. Orders are not processed or shipped on\nweekends or holidays. Orders ship ONLY during regular business hours.** RETURNS** are only allowed\nfor unopened products. See our **[Return Policy][76]** for more details.\n\n## You may also like\u2026\n* [\n[An SMI Cold Therapy Hand/Wrist/Elbow Wrap on the Wrist][An SMI Cold Therapy Hand/Wrist/Elbow Wrap\non the Wrist]\n\n## Hand/Wrist/Elbow Wrap\n\n$32.95 \u2013 $44.95Price range: $32.95 through $44.95 ][77]\n* [\n[SMI Cold Therapy Ab Binder/Lumbar Support on a Patient][SMI Cold Therapy Ab Binder/Lumbar Support\non a Patient]\n\n## Ab Binder / Lumbar Support\n\n$57.95 \u2013 $79.95Price range: $57.95 through $79.95 ][78]\n* [\n[Man wearing an SMI Cold Therapy Back Wrap][Man wearing an SMI Cold Therapy Back Wrap]\n\n## Back Wrap\n\n$57.95 \u2013 $79.95Price range: $57.95 through $79.95 ][79]\n* [\n[Woman Applying an SMI Cold Therapy Knee Wrap][Woman Applying an SMI Cold Therapy Knee Wrap]\n\n## Knee Wrap\n\n$47.95 \u2013 $69.95Price range: $47.95 through $69.95 ][80]\n* [\n[Two SMI 3+ Hour Gel Bags][Two SMI 3+ Hour Gel Bags]\n\n## 3+ Hour Gel Bags\n\n$22.00 \u2013 $46.00Price range: $22.00 through $46.00 ][81]\n\nHear from a user\nWe appreciate the product for its ease of use, durability, cost and mobility. Customer\nservice/responsiveness sets this company apart!\n\u2015 Ortho Service Line Director\nMichigan Hospital\n[SMI Cold Therapy Frosted Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Frosted Logo]\n\n### The Cold Standard in cold therapy.\n\n[ ][82]\n[ ][83]\n[ Products ][84]\n[ Physicians ][85]\n[ Nurses & Staff ][86]\n[ Supply Chain ][87]\n[ Patients ][88]\n[ News ][89]\n[ SHOP NOW ][90]\n[ Find A Rep ][91]\n[ Get In Touch ][92]\n[ My Account ][93]\n[ Return Policy ][94]\n877.423.9727\nSMI Cold Therapy, LLC\n60 Commerce Road\nRocky Mount, VA 24151\ninfo[at]smicoldtherapy.net\n\n# MA DE IN THE USA\n\n[An American Flag][An American Flag]\nAll Rights Reserved \u00a9 SMI Cold Therapy LLC 2026\n[ Terms of Use ][95]\n[ Privacy Policy ][96]\n[Review Badge][Review Badge]\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.Ok\n\n[1]: /find-a-rep/\n[2]: /careers/\n[3]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/\n[4]: /product-category/all-smi-shop-products/\n[5]: /product-category/spine/\n[6]: /product-category/general-surgery/\n[7]: /product-category/orthopedics/\n[8]: /product-category/oncology/\n[9]: /product-category/plastic-surgery/\n[10]: /product-category/podiatry/\n[11]: /product-category/small-joint/\n[12]: /product/knee-wrap/\n[13]: /product/shoulder-wrap/\n[14]: /product/back-wrap/\n[15]: /product/hip-wrap/\n[16]: /p