            "text": "[ FIND A REP ][1]\n[ CAREERS ][2]\n877.423.9727\n[ [SMI Cold Therapy Logo] ][3]\n* [SMI Cold Therapy Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Logo] Close\n* Products\n* [ ALL PRODUCTS See all SMI products ][4]\n* [ SPINE Products for use on spine ][5]\n* [ GENERAL SURGERY Products for use with general surgery ][6]\n* [ ORTHO Products for use with ortho surgery ][7]\n* [ ONCOLOGY Products for use during chemotherapy ][8]\n* [ PLASTIC SURGERY Products for use with plastic surgery ][9]\n* [ PODIATRY Products for use with podiatry ][10]\n* [ SMALL JOINT Products for use on small joints ][11]\n* [ KNEE ][12]\n* [ SHOULDER ][13]\n* [ BACK ][14]\n* [ HIP ][15]\n* [ AB BINDER ][16]\n* [ CHEMO ][17]\n* [ COLD VEST ][18]\n* [ FACIAL ][19]\n* [ FOOT & ANKLE ][20]\n* [ 3+ HOUR GEL BAGS ][21]\n* [ SMALL GEL BAGS ][22]\n* [ HAND WRIST ELBOW ][23]\n* [ LAG ][24]\n* [ NECK ][25]\n* [ THORACIC ][26]\n* [ UNIVERSAL ][27]\n* Why SMI?\n* [ WHY SMI? See Our Advantages ][28]\n* [ TYPES OF THERAPY Three Different Types ][29]\n* [ FOR PHYSICIANS Targeted Information ][30]\n* [ FOR NURSES & STAFF Helpful Guidance ][31]\n* [ FREEZER PROGRAM SMI Supplied Freezers ][32]\n* [ CAREERS Join Our Team ][33]\n* [ FOR SUPPLY CHAIN How SMI Can Help ][34]\n* [ FOR PATIENTS Things to Know ][35]\n* How To\n* [ USE INSTRUCTIONS How to apply SMI wraps ][36]\n* [ VIDEO LIBRARY Application videos ][37]\n* [ FAQs Questions Answered ][38]\n* Resources\n* [ CLINICAL STUDIES Read scientific data ][39]\n* [ USE INSTRUCTIONS How to apply SMI wraps ][40]\n* [ VIDEO LIBRARY Application videos ][41]\n* [ INFO LIBRARY Brochures & Documents ][42]\n* [ ABOUT US Learn about SMI ][43]\n* [ FIND A REP Find your SMI rep ][44]\n* [ FDA CERTIFICATION See SMI's certification ][45]\n* [ GET IN TOUCH Let us hear from you ][46]\n* [ SHOP NOW Purchase products online ][47]\n* [ SHOP ][48]\nSearch for:\n[ 0 ][49]\nYour Cart (0)\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\nLooks like you haven't added anything yet.\n\n[Start Shopping][50]\n[ SHOP ][51]\n* [ Physicians ][52]\n* [ Nurses & Staff ][53]\n* [ Supply Chain ][54]\n* [ Patients ][55]\n\n#### Here For You Since 2004\n\n# All About Us\n\n## We Believe...\n\n[ [Women sewing wraps in the SMI Cold Therapy manufacturing facility] ][56] [ [Man working in the\nSMI Cold Therapy Manufacturing Facility] ][57] [ [Woman working on wraps in the SMI Manufacturing\nFaciliyt] ][58] [ [Woman sewing an SMI Cold Therapy Wrap] ][59] [ [Workers in the SMI Cold Therapy\nManufacturing Facility] ][60]\n[ [Woman working on wraps in the SMI Manufacturing Faciliyt] ][61] [ [Man working in the SMI Cold\nTherapy Manufacturing Facility] ][62] [ [Woman sewing an SMI Cold Therapy Wrap] ][63] [ [Workers in\nthe SMI Cold Therapy Manufacturing Facility] ][64]\nWe believe the highest levels of patient comfort can be achieved with simple American-made products\nof maximum quality. Our \u201cSimple is Always Better\u201d concept continues to be brought to life by\ndesigning, manufacturing, and distributing superior post-operative patient care products.\n\n### \" Simple Is Always Better \"\n\nOur vision began in 2004 when we set out to provide a solution to the common problem, **\u201cwhy does\ncold therapy have to be such a hassle for patients and clinicians?\u201d** The answer we created combines\nthe clinical effectiveness of electric cooling machines with the simplicity of a gel wrap. The\nresult was the first and only product that provides exceptional patient care, increased staff\nefficiency, and unmatched clinical results. Our products are now being used by over 600 programs as\nwe continue to grow our \u201cSimple is Always Better\u201d concept.\n[Woman wearing an SMI Neck Wrap with a man wearing an SMI Shoulder wrap][Woman wearing an SMI Neck\nWrap with a man wearing an SMI Shoulder wrap][Woman wearing an SMI Cold Therapy Shoulder Wrap][Woman\nwearing an SMI Cold Therapy Shoulder Wrap]\n\n## Our Mission\n\nTo provide the highest levels of patient care with our American-made products that combine clinical\nefficacy with simplicity while supporting the comfort of our customers, community, and employees.\n\n#### Our History\n\n## Explore Our Story\n## SMI's Timeline\n\n2004\nSMI Founded\n\nSMI was founded in 2004 by two gentlemen that had a passion for manufacturing & post-operative\nhealthcare product sales. Once the need for a simple solution to post-op pain control was\nidentified, production began in a founder\u2019s basement north of Pittsburgh, PA.\n\n2006\nMoved to 1st Dedicated Manufacturing Facility\n\nIn 2006, SMI moved into their first dedicated manufacturing facility in Butler, PA. Continued growth\nallowed us to build a corporate headquarters and manufacturing facility in Rocky Mount, VA in 2011.\n\n2011\nMoved HQ & Mfg to Rocky Mount, VA\n\nOur geographical proximity along with direct distribution allows our products to be at our customer\nfacilities without ever having a backorder, in as little as two days. Proud to say our products are\nMade in the USA, we take pride in creating jobs for so many individuals in the textile and packaging\nfields.\n\n2021\nMoved into a 25,000 SF Building Expansion\n\nIn 2021, SMI moved into a 25,000 square foot building expansion that will allow us to continue to\nserve our customers, grow our manufacturing capabilities, and provide more career opportunities\nwithin our community.\n\n#### Our Management Team\n\n# Meet Our Team\n# Here to Help\n\n[SMI Cold Therapy's CEO Rick Sell][SMI Cold Therapy's CEO Rick Sell]\n\n### Rick Sell\n\n##### CEO & BOD Member\n\nRick Sell joined SMI in 2009 as COO and has led management, operations, and sales teams that have\ngrown 10-fold since that time. In 2020, Rick was promoted to CEO of SMI. Previously, Rick spent 30\nyears in senior debt structuring and placements specializing in M&A and LBO transactions as Senior\nVice President of Originations for GE Capital and Vice President of Marketing at PPM Finance, Inc.\nHe also worked for BofA and CIT. Rick graduated from York College of Pennsylvania in 1979 with a BS\ndegree in Accounting.\n[SMI Cold Therapy's Dave Hambro][SMI Cold Therapy's Dave Hambro]\n\n### David Hambro\n\n##### Vice President\n\nDavid Hambro joined SMI in 2009 as the company\u2019s first employed sales rep to begin to expand SMI\u2019s\nbusiness outside of the mid-Atlantic states. In 2015, David accepted the role of National Sales\nManager and in November 2020 assumed the role of Vice President. Prior to joining SMI, David spent 5\nyears working in a sales role in the technical staffing industry. David graduated from Penn State\nUniversity in 2003 with a BS degree in Business with an emphasis in Marketing & Management.\n[SMI Cold Therapy's Jeremy Atkins][SMI Cold Therapy's Jeremy Atkins]\n\n### Jeremy Atkins\n\n##### CFO & COO\n\nJeremy Adkins joined SMI in 2013 as Director of Finance responsible for all company accounting\nfunctions. In 2016, Jeremy was promoted to President of SMI adding additional oversight of sales and\nproduction to his role. In 2020, Jeremy was promoted to CFO/COO. Prior to joining SMI, Jeremy spent\n8 years working for BMS Consulting, Inc. gaining experience in accounting, taxation, and employee\nbenefit programs. Jeremy graduated from Ferrum College in 2001 with a BS degree in Accounting.\n[SMI Cold Therapy Frosted Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Frosted Logo]\n\n### The Cold Standard in cold therapy.\n\n[ ][65]\n[ ][66]\n[ Products ][67]\n[ Physicians ][68]\n[ Nurses & Staff ][69]\n[ Supply Chain ][70]\n[ Patients ][71]\n[ News ][72]\n[ SHOP NOW ][73]\n[ Find A Rep ][74]\n[ Get In Touch ][75]\n[ My Account ][76]\n[ Return Policy ][77]\n877.423.9727\nSMI Cold Therapy, LLC\n60 Commerce Road\nRocky Mount, VA 24151\ninfo[at]smicoldtherapy.net\n\n# MA DE IN THE USA\n\n[An American Flag][An American Flag]\nAll Rights Reserved \u00a9 SMI Cold Therapy LLC 2026\n[ Terms of Use ][78]\n[ Privacy Policy ][79]\n[Review Badge][Review Badge]\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.Ok\n\n[1]: /find-a-rep/\n[2]: /careers/\n[3]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/\n[4]: /product-category/all-smi-shop-products/\n[5]: /product-category/spine/\n[6]: /product-category/general-surgery/\n[7]: /product-category/orthopedics/\n[8]: /product-category/oncology/\n[9]: /product-category/plastic-surgery/\n[10]: /product-category/podiatry/\n[11]: /product-category/small-joint/\n[12]: /product/knee-wrap/\n[13]: /product/shoulder-wrap/\n[14]: /product/back-wrap/\n[15]: /product/hip-wrap/\n[16]: /product/ab-binder-lumbar-support/\n[17]: /product/chemo-infusion-cooling-wrap/\n[18]: /product/cold-vest/\n[19]: /product/facial-wrap-3-pk/\n[20]: /product/foot-ankle-wrap/\n[21]: /product/3-hour-gel-bags/\n[22]: /product/small-gel-bags/\n[23]: /product/hand-wrist-elbow-wrap/\n[24]: /product/lag-wrap/\n[25]: /product/neck-wrap/\n[26]: /product/thoracic-wrap/\n[27]: /product/universal-wrap/\n[28]: /why-smi\n[29]: /why-smi/#therapy-types-section\n[30]: /home/#smi-physicians-section\n[31]: /home/#smi-nurses-section\n[32]: /freezer-program\n[33]: /careers\n[34]: /home/#smi-administrators-section\n[35]: /home/#smi-patients-section\n[36]: /use-instructions\n[37]: /video-library\n[38]: /#patients-tabs\n[39]: /clinical-studies\n[40]: /use-instructions\n[41]: /video-library\n[42]: /info-library/\n[43]: /about-us\n[44]: /find-a-rep/\n[45]: /fda\n[46]: /get-in-touch\n[47]: /shop/\n[48]: /shop\n[49]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/cart/\n[50]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/shop/\n[51]: /shop\n[52]: /home/#smi-physicians-section\n[53]: /home/#smi-nurses-section\n[54]: /home/#smi-administrators-section\n[55]: /home/#smi-patients-section\n[56]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-1.avif\n[57]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-2.avif\n[58]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-3.avif\n[59]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-4-Flipped.avif\n[60]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-5.avif\n[61]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-3.avif\n[62]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-2.avif\n[63]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-4-Flipped.avif\n[64]: https://smicoldtherapy.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Plant-Photo-5.avif\n[65]: https://www.facebook.com/smiprowraps\n[66]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/smicoldtherapy/\n[67]: /shop\n[68]: /home/#smi-physicians-section\n[69]: /home/#smi-nurses-section\n[70]: /home/#smi-administrators-section\n[71]: /home/#smi-patients-section\n[72]: /news\n[73]: /shop\n[74]: /find-a-rep/\n[75]: /get-in-touch\n[76]: /my-account\n[77]: /refund-returns-policy\n[78]: /terms-of-use\n[79]: /privacy-policy"
