temperature\u2011simulation applications.\n\n[view more][63]\n\n## MAIN PRODUCTS\n\nInnovation transforms every drop of water into value\n* [\n  \n  Mining Polymer\n  \n  **Mining Polymer**\n  \n  Quick Expansion& Safety, Non-toxic & Repeated used\n  \n  View More\n  ][64] [\n  \n  Drilling Polymer\n  \n  **Drilling Polymer**\n  \n  Faster & Larger Absorption, Quick Expansion& Safety, Non-toxic & Repeated used\n  \n  View More\n  ][65]\n* [\n  \n  Sludge Solidification Polymer\n  \n  **Sludge Solidification Polymer**\n  \n  Faster & Larger Absorption, Harmless & Non-toxic\n  \n  View More\n  ][66] [\n  \n  Gel Ice Pack\n  \n  **Gel Ice Pack**\n  \n  Quick Expansion& Safety, Longer Cooling Time, Non-toxic & Repeated used\n  \n  View More\n  ][67] [\n  \n  Cable Water Blocking Polymer\n  \n  **Cable Water Blocking Polymer **\n  \n  Quick Expansion& Safety, Non-toxic & Repeated used\n  \n  View More\n  ][68]\n* [\n  \n  Fake Snow\n  \n  **Fake Snow**\n  \n  Quick absorption & expansion, Cool & Fluffy Touch, Harmless & Non-toxic\n  \n  View More\n  ][69] [\n  \n  SAP for Expanding Rubber\n  \n  **SAP for Expanding Rubber**\n  \n  Superior Water Absorption, High Expansion Capacity, Pressure Resistance\n  \n  View More\n  ][70] [\n  \n  Medical Waste Solidification\n  \n  **Medical Waste Solidification**\n  \n  Quick Expansion& Safety, Non-toxic & Repeated used\n  \n  View More\n  ][71]\n\n## WHO WE ARE\n\nInnovation transforms every drop of water into value\n\n[QINGDAO SOCO NEW MATERIAL CO.,LTD]\n[View More][72]\n\nFounded in 2009, SOCO Group s a technology-driven manufacturer\u00a0specializing in water absorbing and\nretaining solutions for agricultural and industrial\u00a0applications, recognized for our strong R&D\ncapability, consistent product quality, and customer-oriented technical support for years.\n\n\u00a0\n\nWith advanced R&D and production facilities,\u00a0SOCO introduced the\u00a0\u201dSAP++\u201d\u00a0Strategy - focusing on\nreal\u00a0application scenarios rather than standard products. By understanding end-users\u2019\u00a0needs, we\ndevelop\u00a0high-perfomance, customized solutions tailored for diverse requirements from agricultural\nand industrial\u00a0sectors.\n\n\u00a0\n\nSustainability is an integral part of our development approach.\u00a0Our technologies improve water\nretention, optimize water usage efficiency,\u00a0and suport\u00a0resource-saving practices, contributing to\nmore sustainable agricultural\u00a0and industrial processes.\n\n\u00a0\n\nThrough continuous innovation and close cooperation with global partners,\u00a0SOCO is committed to\ncreating practical\u00a0value for customers and promoting\u00a0toward a greener, sustainable future.\n\n\n\n\n\nContact Us\n\n## Contact Us\n* Country Afghanistan Albania Algeria Angola Argentina Armenia Australia Austria Azerbaijan Bahrain\n  Bangladesh Belarus Belgium Belize Benin Bhutan Bolivia Bosnia and Herzegovina Botswana Brazil\n  British Virgin Islands Brunei Bulgaria Burkina-faso Burundi Cambodia Cameroon Canada Cape Verde\n  Cayman Islands Central African Republic Chad Chile China Colombia Comoros Congo - Brazzaville\n  Congo - Kinshasa Costa Rica Croatia Cyprus Czech Republic Denmark Djibouti Dominican Republic El\n  Salvador Ecuador Egypt Equatorial Guinea Eritrea Estonia Ethiopia Fiji Finland France Gabon Gambia\n  Georgia Germany Ghana Greece Greenland Guatemala Guinea Guyana Haiti Honduras Hong Kong SAR, China\n  Hungary Iceland India Indonesia Iran Iraq Ireland Isle of Man Israel Italy Ivory Coast Jamaica\n  Japan Jordan Kazakhstan Kenya Korea Kuwait Kyrgyzstan Laos Latvia Lebanon Lesotho Liberia Libya\n  Lithuania Luxembourg Macau SAR, China Macedonia Madagascar Malawi Malaysia Maldives Mali Malta\n  Mauritania Mauritius Mexico Moldova Monaco Mongolia Montenegro Morocco Mozambique Myanmar (Burma)\n  Namibia Nepal Netherlands New Zealand Nicaragua Niger Nigeria North Korea Norway Oman Pakistan\n  Panama Paraguay Peru Philippines Poland Portugal Puerto Rico Qatar Reunion Romania Russia Rwanda\n  San Marino Saudi Arabia Senegal Serbia Sierra Leone Singapore Slovakia Slovenia Somalia South\n  Africa Spain Sri Lanka Sudan Suriname Swaziland Sweden Switzerland Syria Taiwan Tajikstan Tanzania\n  Thailand Togo Tonga Trinidad and Tobago Tunisia Turkey Turkmenistan U.S. Virgin Islands USA Uganda\n  Ukraine United Arab Emirates United Kingdom Uruguay Uzbekistan Vatican City Venezuela Vietnam\n  Yemen Yugoslavia Zaire Zambia Zimbabwe\n* Application:* Waste Landfill & Slurry Solidification Drilling & Mining Fluids Polymer SAP For Gel\n  Ice Packs Cable Water Blocking Polymer Medical Waste/Urine Absorbent Polymer Fire-Fighting Gel SAP\n  For Expanding Rubber SAP For Coagulant SAP For Glove Application Fake Snow/Instant Snow Ash\n  Absorption Gel SAP For Agriculture Others\n* SUBMIT\n\n## CERTIFICATES\n\nInnovation transforms every drop of water into value\n\nWHY CHOOSE US?\n\nFounded in 2009, Leading SAP manufacturer. Own R&D Lab & Planting Lab\n\nWe have served the clients from more than 120 countries & regions\n\nWith global warehousing & fast shipment system\n\nOver 30+ international certificates\uff08SGS\u3001ISO\u3001CE\uff09\n\nSafety, Non-toxic, Degradable, Non-heavy metal, Food grade material\n\nIndependent research Lab for salt & alkali resistance research & fast water absorption projects\n\n[_20251103095810_86_8]\n\n## CUSTOMER FEEDBACK\n\nInnovation transforms every drop of water into value\n\nClients: Commercial company in America,Products: SAP packing with water soluble\nfilm(5g),Application: Outdoors & Foldable Port-A-Potty\n\nClients: Medical equipment company in China,Product: SAP packing with water soluble film\n(20g),Application: Solidify medical waste\u00a0\n\nClients: Building materials company in France, Application: Applied to main subway projects in\nEurope, saving cost about 39.8%.\n\nClients: Stope in India, Application: Apply in mining process, solidify the sludge\n\nClients: Medical equipment company in South Africa, Application: Produce ice pack for cold-chain\ntransportation\n\n## Blog\n\nInnovation transforms every drop of water into value\n* [What Are the Best Custom Gel Ice Packs for Shipping and How Do They Work?][73] Sep 25th,2025\n* [What Is Sludge Solidification and Why Does It Matter?][74] Sep 24th,2025\n* [Drilling & Mining Fluids Polymer Supplier in China \u2013 SOCO\u00ae Polymer Solutions][75] Sep 18th,2025\n* [Liquid Waste Solidification Polymer: Innovative Solution for Safe Waste Management][76] Sep\n  17th,2025\n\n[\n[What Are the Best Custom Gel Ice Packs for Shipping and How Do They Work?]\n"
