      "key_products": "PhysioNatural Ice Pack for Knee Pain, PhysioNatural Microwavable Heating Pad, PhysioNatural Microwave Safe Therapy Mittens",
      "polished_summary": "PhysioNatural specializes in manufacturing high-quality, reusable hot and cold therapy packs designed for natural pain relief. Their innovative product line includes ice packs, heating pads, and therapy mittens, catering to individuals seeking relief from conditions such as knee pain, muscle stiffness, and arthritis. With a focus on healthcare, wellness, and physical therapy, PhysioNatural aims to support recovery and enhance overall well-being through versatile and effective therapeutic solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "PhysioNatural manufactures high-quality, reusable hot and cold therapy packs, including gel ice packs specifically designed for pain relief, which directly aligns with the target market of gel ice packs.",
