      "company_summary": "Thermal Shipping Solutions specializes in innovative thermal packaging solutions tailored for the pharmaceutical, food, and beverage industries, ensuring the safe and efficient delivery of temperature-sensitive products. Their product range includes pre-validated shipping kits, eco-friendly mailers, durable box liners, and reusable gel ice packs, all designed to meet the specific needs of pharmaceutical and healthcare companies, as well as food and beverage businesses.",
