ble future.\n\n# Product\n# Coming Soon\n\n## Left out in the cold.\n\nWith innovative high-efficiency thermal protection, Cold Fold is the ideal solution for grocery\nshipping and winter box liner applications.\n\n# Product\n# Coming Soon\n\n### Cold Fold\n\n#### Perfect for short duration shipments up to 48 hours\n\n#### Save my space.\n\nSpace-saving design and flat storage reduces shipping costs.\n\n#### Leakproof.\n\nFood and drinks. Hot or cold. Nothing gets past Cold Fold.\n\n#### Custom sizing from\n#### \u00bd\u201d to 2\u201d+\n\nFor optimal performance in every season and shipping duration.\n\n## It\u2019s harvest season.\n\nLearn how our sustainable cold chain solutions can connect your company to earth-conscious\nconsumers, wherever they are.\n\n[Contact Us][73]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][74]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][75]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Animal Health][79]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][80]\n\n[Food & Beverage][81]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Botanicals][83]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][84]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][85]\n\n[RenewMailer][86]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][87]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][88]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][89]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][90]\n\n[Latest Innovation][91]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][92]\n\n[History][93]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][94]\n\n[Locations][95]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][96]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][97]\n\n[(r) Value][98]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][99]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][100]\n\n[Thermasure][101]\n\n[Careers][102]\n\n[Contact Us][103]\n\n[Privacy Policy][104]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][105]\n\n[Page load link][106]\n[ Go to Top ][107]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/ou