            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nLatest Innovation[Thomas Evans][72]2023-12-28T11:56:10-05:00\n\n# Carbon negative. Earth positive. Human powered.\n\nThe first and only carbon negative, regenerative thermal packaging, coming soon.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Curbside recyclable insulation. Planetary regeneration.\n\n# Welcome a truly [sustainable thermal system.][73]\n\n## The planet is waiting.\n## Let\u2019s get started.\n\nLearn how our [sustainable cold chain solutions][74] can connect your company to earth-conscious\nconsumers, wherever they are.\n\n[Contact Us][75]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][76]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][77]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][79]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][80]\n\n[Animal Health][81]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][82]\n\n[Food & Beverage][83]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][84]\n\n[Botanicals][85]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][86]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][87]\n\n[RenewMailer][88]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][89]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][90]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][91]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][92]\n\n[Latest Innovation][93]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][94]\n\n[History][95]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][96]\n\n[Locations][97]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][98]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][99]\n\n[(r) Value][100]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][101]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][102]\n\n[Thermasure][103]\n\n[Careers][104]\n\n[Contact Us][105]\n\n[Privacy Policy][106]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][107]\n\n[Page load link][108]\n[ Go to Top ][109]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain-exchange/\n[8]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/the-thermalist/\n[9]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/thermasure/\n[10]: https://www.ther