n#### 2008\n\n[TSS][73] is founded with the aim to provide the most innovative shipping solutions possible.\n\n#### 2010\n\n[The Kangaroo Mailer][74] is born, minimizing packaging waste by providing an all-in-one shipping\nsolution.\n\n#### 2012\n\n[DURASHIELD][75] is introduced to ship temperature-sensitive products with a fraction of the\nwarehouse footprint.\n\n#### 2013\n\nTSS develops insulation with recycled materials to minimize the growing environmental impact of\npackaging.\n\n#### 2015/2016\n\nThe debut of Renewliner, the first-ever curbside recyclable insulated shipping system.\n\n#### 2016\n\nTSS receives the \u201cMost Sustainable Temperature-Sensitive Project\u201d at the Cold Chain Global Forum.\n\n#### 2017\n\nTSS works with the Sustainable Packaging Coalition, Association of Plastic Recyclers, and top\nexperts to revolutionize the packaging industry.\n\n#### 2017\n\nTSS builds the most eco-friendly headquarters by implementing a solar system that sustainably powers\nour entire thermalplex.\n\n#### 2019\n\nTSS expands with 10 nationwide [production facilities][76] for the industries\u2019 shortest lead times.\n\n#### 2021\n\nTSS expands to Tennessee and New York.\n\n#### 2022\n\nTSS develops ground breaking first of it\u2019s kind carbon-negative packaging solution.\n\n## History in the making.\n\nLearn how our sustainable cold chain solutions can connect your company to earth-conscious\nconsumers, wherever they are.\n\n[Contact Us][77]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][78]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][79]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][80]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][81]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Animal Health][83]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][84]\n\n[Food & Beverage][85]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][86]\n\n[Botanicals][87]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][88]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n