            "url": "https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/mailer-envelopes/kangaroo-mailer-form/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nKangaroo Mailer \u2013 Form[Thomas Evans][72]2024-07-17T08:47:49-04:00\n\n# Self inflating.\n# Waste reducing.\n# Thermal mailers.\n\nMeet our Kangaroo thermal mailers. Self-inflating mailers with an innovative layer of protection for\nabsolute security and superior thermal performance, whether you\u2019re shipping across town or across\nthe globe.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Pierce it, and watch it do the rest.\n\nThe self-expanding foam mailer inflates when punctured, creating a form-fitting enclosure, that\nminimizes waste.\n\n### Kangaroo Mailer\n\nTSS\u2019s thermal mailers are a reliable and cost-effective solution for shipping temperature-sensitive\nproducts. Our thermal mailers are designed to maintain a consistent temperature during transit,\nensuring your products arrive fresh and intact. Made from eco-friendly materials, our thermal\nmailers are a sustainable option for your business. Whether you\u2019re shipping food, pharmaceuticals,\nor other temperature-sensitive products, our thermal mailers provide a secure and efficient way to\nget your products to their destination. Choose TSS\u2019s thermal mailers for a superior shipping\nexperience and peace of mind knowing your products are safe and secure.\n\n#### Space technology.\n* Save space and reduce shipping costs with vacuum sealed mailers\n* 87% smaller than EPS Coolers\n* 1 truckload condensed to 3 pallets\n* Cut shipping costs by half\n\n#### Crushed it.\n\nCompression-tested for maximal protection in harsh handling environments.\n\n#### More sustainable than Styrofoam.\n\nEliminate environmentally harmful EPS coolers and boxes from the supply chain.\n\n#### Proven protection.\n\nISTA 3A approved\nUN3373 compliant\nLeak-resistant design\n\n## Questions?\n\nTalk to a Thermalist.\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][73]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][74]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][75]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Animal Health][78]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][79]\n\n[Food & Beverage][80]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][81]\n\n[Botanicals][82]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][83]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][84]\n\n[RenewMailer][85]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][86]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][87]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][88]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][89]\n\n[Latest Innovation][90]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][91]\n\n[History][92]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][93]\n\n[Locations][94]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][95]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][96]\n\n[(r) Value][97]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][98]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][99]\n\n[Thermasure][100]\n\n[Careers][101]\n\n[Contact Us][102]\n\n[Privacy Policy][103]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][104]\n\n[Page load link][105]\n[ Go to Top ][106]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain-exchange/\n[8]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/the-thermalist/\n[9]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/thermasure/\n[10]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/careers/\n[11]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/digital-telehealth-pharmacy/\n[15]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/specialty-pharmacy/\n[16]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/mail-order-pharmacy/\n[17]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/animal-health/\n[18]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/independent-pharmacy/\n[19]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/food-and-beverage/\n[20]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/large-retail-pharmacy/\n[21]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/botanicals/\n[22]: https://thermalshipping.com/products/\n[23]: https://thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/tss-pre-validated-solutions/\n[24]: https://www.ther