            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nKangaroo Mailer Sustainability Guide[Thomas Evans][72]2024-07-25T10:41:04-04:00\n\n# Kangaroo Mailer\n# Sustainability Guide\n\nEffortless Steps to Recycle and Reduce Waste with the Kangaroo Mailer.\n\nThe Kangaroo Mailer envelope is crafted from Low-Density Polyethylene (LDPE) 4, also known as\nplastic #4, a versatile and commonly recycled plastic.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Here\u2019s How to Recycle LDPE 4:****\n\n## Check with Your Local Authority\n\nConfirm with your local council or authority if LDPE 4 is accepted in your recycling bins. If not,\nconsider taking it to a nearby Household Waste Recycling Centre (HWRC).\n\n## Utilize Store Drop-Off Points\n\nMany businesses accept plastic films for recycling and provide dedicated bins near their entrances.\nLook for the How2Recycle Store Drop-off label on flexible polyethylene-based plastics, including\nLDPE 4.\n\n## Visit a Recycling Center\n\nLDPE 4 can be taken to a recycling center where it will be washed, shredded, melted, and reformed\ninto pellets. These pellets are then used to manufacture new plastic products such as bags and bins.\n\n## Steps to Recycle Your Kangaroo Mailer:****\n* 1\n\nSeparate the envelope from the interior insulation.\n* 2\n\nReuse or dispose of the interior insulation appropriately.\n* 3\n\nRecycle the envelope using one of the methods mentioned above.\n\n## Hop in, we\u2019re\n## changing the world.\n\nLearn how our sustainable thermal mailers can connect your company to earth-conscious consumers,\nwherever they are.\n\n[Contact Us][73]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][74]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][75]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Animal Health][79]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][80]\n\n[Food & Beverage][81]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Botanicals][83]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][84]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][85]\n\n[RenewMailer][86