or Your Shipments\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## How To Use The RenewMailer\n\n## Step 1\n\nAddress the RenewMailer first, then insert the contents to be shipped.\n\n## Step 2\n\nRemove adhesive release liner and seal, pulling flap tightly over the package.\n\n## Hop in, we\u2019re\n## changing the world.\n\nLearn how our sustainable thermal mailers can connect your company to earth-conscious consumers,\nwherever they are.\n\n[Contact Us][73]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][74]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][75]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Animal Health][79]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][80]\n\n[Food & Beverage][81]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Botanicals][83]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][84]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][85]\n\n[RenewMailer][86]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][87]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][88]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][89]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][90]\n\n[Latest Innovation][91]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][92]\n\n[History][93]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][94]\n\n[Locations][95]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][96]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][97]\n\n[(r) Value][98]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][99]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][100]\n\n[Thermasure][101]\n\n[Careers][102]\n\n[Contact Us][103]\n\n[Privacy Policy][104]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][105]\n\n[Page load link][106]\n[ Go to Top ][107]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain-exchange/\n[8]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/the-thermalist/\n[9]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/thermasure/\n[10]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/careers/\n[11]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/digital-telehealth-pharmacy/\n[15]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/specialty-pharmacy/\n[16]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/mail-order-pharmacy/\n[17]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/animal-health/\n[18]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/independent-pharmacy/\n[19]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/food-and-beverage/\n[20]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/large-retail-pharmacy/\n[21]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/botanicals/\n[22]: https://thermalshipping.com/products/\n[23]: https://thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/tss-pre-validated-solutions/\n[24]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/mailer-envelopes/kangaroo-mailer/\n[25]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/mailer-envelopes/renewmailer/\n[26]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/mailer-envelopes/durashield-envelopes/\n[27]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/renewliner/\n[28]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/durashield-box-liners/\n[29]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/refrigerants/gel-ice-packs/\n[30]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/latest-innovation/\n[31]: #\n[32]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/company/who-we-are/\n[33]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/company/history/\n[34]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/company/tss-innovation-advantage/\n[35]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/company/locations/\n[36]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/sustainable-leadership/\n[37]: #\n[38]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/digital-telehealth-pharmacy/\n[39]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/specialty-pharmacy/\n[40]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/mail-order-pharmacy/\n[41]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/animal-health/\n[42]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/independent-pharmacy/\n[43]: https:/