            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nRenewMailer Sustainability Guide[Thomas Evans][72]2024-08-23T09:41:18-04:00\n\n# RenewMailer\n# Sustainability Guide\n\nEffortless Steps to Recycle and Reduce Waste with the RenewMailer\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## How to Recycle Your Sustainable RenewMailer\n\nThe RenewMailer is an environmentally conscious packaging solution, constructed with a liner\ncomposed of PET plastic (polyethylene terephthalate, #1 plastic) and an outer envelope made from\nLDPE (low-density polyethylene, #4 plastic).\n\nIt\u2019s designed with sustainability in mind, making it easy for you to recycle its components. Follow\nthese simple steps to ensure proper recycling of your RenewMailer.\n\n## Steps to Recycle Your RenewMailer\n\n## Separate the Envelope from the Interior Insulation\n\nGently open the RenewMailer and remove the interior insulation from the outer envelope.\n\n## Reuse or Dispose of the Interior Insulation Appropriately\n\nThe interior insulation is made from PET plastic. Check if your local recycling program accepts PET\nplastic. If not, consider reusing the insulation for other packaging needs or dispose of it\nresponsibly.\n\n## Recycle the Envelope\n\nThe outer envelope is made from LDPE #4 plastic. Recycle it using one of the following methods:\n\n**Curbside Recycling:**\nIf your local recycling program accepts LDPE #4 plastic, place the envelope in your curbside\nrecycling bin.\n\n**Drop-off Locations:**\nMany grocery stores and retail locations have designated bins for recycling plastic bags and films.\nLook for these bins to recycle your envelope.\n\n## Hop in, we\u2019re\n## changing the world.\n\nLearn how our sustainable thermal mailers can connect your company to earth-conscious consumers,\nwherever they are.\n\n[Contact Us][73]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][74]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][75]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Animal Health][79]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][80]\n\n[Food & Beverage][81]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Botanicals][83]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][84]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][85]\n\n[RenewMailer][86]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][87]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][88]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][89]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][90]\n\n[Latest Innovation][91]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][92]\n\n[History][93]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][94]\n\n[Locations][95]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][96]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][97]\n\n[(r) Value][98]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][99]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][100]\n\n[Thermasure][101]\n\n[Careers][102]\n\n[Contact Us][103]\n\n[Privacy Policy][104]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][105]\n\n[Page load link][106]\n[ Go to Top ][107]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain-exchange/\n[8]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/the-thermalist/\n[9]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/thermasure/\n[10]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/careers/\n[11]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/digital-telehealth-pharmacy/\n[15]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/specialty-pharmacy/\n[16]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/mail-order-pharmacy/\n[17]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/animal-health/\n[18]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/independent-pharmacy/\n[19]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/food-and-beverage/\n[20]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/large-retail-pharmacy/\n[21]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/industries/botanicals/\n[22]: https://thermalshipping.com/products/\n[23]: https://thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/tss-pre-validated-solutions/\n[24]: https://www.thermalshipping.