            "url": "https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/mailer-envelopes/kangaroo-mailer-test/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nKangaroo Mailer TEST[Thomas Evans][72]2026-04-08T11:01:31-04:00\n\n# Self inflating.\n# Waste reducing.\n# Thermal mailers.\n\nMeet our Kangaroo thermal mailers. Self-inflating mailers with an innovative layer of protection for\nabsolute security and superior thermal performance, whether you\u2019re shipping across town or across\nthe globe.\n\n[Get Started with Kangaroo Mailers][73]\n\nRequest samples, pricing, or performance\ndata for your shipments.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Pierce it, and watch it do the rest.\n\nThe self-expanding foam mailer inflates when punctured, creating a form-fitting enclosure, that\nminimizes waste.\n\n### Kangaroo Mailer\n\nTSS\u2019s thermal mailers are a reliable and cost-effective solution for shipping temperature-sensitive\nproducts. Our thermal mailers are designed to maintain a consistent temperature during transit,\nensuring your products arrive fresh and intact. Made from eco-friendly materials, our thermal\nmailers are a sustainable option for your business. Whether you\u2019re shipping food, pharmaceuticals,\nor other temperature-sensitive products, our thermal mailers provide a secure and efficient way to\nget your products to their destination. Choose TSS\u2019s thermal mailers for a superior shipping\nexperience and peace of mind knowing your products are safe and secure.\n\n#### Space technology.\n* Save space and reduce shipping costs with vacuum sealed mailers\n* 87% smaller than EPS Coolers\n* 1 truckload condensed to 3 pallets\n* Cut shipping costs by half\n\n#### Crushed it.\n\nCompression-tested for maximal protection in harsh handling environments.\n\n#### More sustainable than Styrofoam.\n\nEliminate environmentally harmful EPS coolers and boxes from the supply chain.\n\n#### Proven protection.\n\nISTA 3A approved\nUN3373 compliant\nLeak-resistant design\n\n## Proven Protection for Temperature-Sensitive Shipments\n\n### Kangaroo Mailers are engineered and tested to maintain temperature integrity across real-world\n### shipping conditions\u2014without the bulk of EPS.\n* Designed for 2\u20138\u00b0C performance across 24\u201372 hour durations\n* Tested for consistency across varying shipping lanes\n* Compact, efficient design without compromising protection\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nPhone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nCompany Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nJob Title\nProjected shipments per week?\nPlease SelectNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPlease tell us briefly, what are you looking to accomplish?\nCAPTCHA\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][74]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][75]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Animal Health][79]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][80]\n\n[Food & Beverage][81]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Botanicals][83]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][84]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][85]\n\n[RenewMailer][86]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][87]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][88]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][89]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][90]\n\n[Latest Innovation][91]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][92]\n\n[History][93]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][94]\n\n[Locations][95]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][96]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][97]\n\n[(r) Value][98]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][99]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][100]\n\n[Thermasure][101]\n\n[Careers][102]\n\n[Contact Us][103]\n\n[Privacy Policy][104]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][105]\n\n[Page load link][106]\n[ Go to Top ][107]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https