            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nGel Ice Packs[Thomas Evans][72]2026-04-08T16:55:18-04:00\n\n# Gel Ice Packs:\n# Reusable. Sustainable. Durable.\n\nA little sensitive? We get it. Gel Packs protect temperature-sensitive products in ambient,\nrefrigerated and frozen temperatures.\n\n[Get Gel Ice Pack Pricing][73]\n\nMultiple sizes, formats, and configurations\navailable for your shipments.\n\n[3D render of gel ice packs | TSS]\n\n## Non-toxic gel.\n\nSafe for the transport of food, pharmaceuticals and medical products.\n\n[Image of Ice pack | Thermal Shipping Solutions]\n\n### Gel Ice Packs\n\n#### Heat-sealed linear low-density polyethylene wrapper.\n\nCost-effective, reusable and durable.\n\n#### Down the drain.\n\nAvailable in drain safe options.\n\n#### Precise climate.\n\nGel packs provide a precise climate, ensuring delicate products are properly delivered.\n\n#### Temperature range.\n\nAmbient, refrigerated, frozen.\n\n#### A variety of sizes.\n\nGel packs come in a variety of sizes, including custom sizing, depending on your specific needs.\n\n#### Standard Gel Ice Pack.\n\n3oz | 4oz | 6oz | 8oz | 12oz | 16oz | 24oz | 32oz | 48oz\n\n#### Gel Ice Brick.\n\n7oz | 15oz | 18oz | 23oz | 24oz 31oz | 56oz | 64oz\n\n#### Non-Sweat Gel Ice Pack.\n\n8oz | 12oz | 16oz | 24oz | 32oz | 48oz\n\n## Reliable Refrigeration for Every Shipment\n\n### Our gel ice packs are designed to maintain consistent temperatures across a wide range of\n### shipping conditions\u2014available in multiple sizes and configurations to fit your packaging system.\n* Maintain 2\u20138\u00b0C for chilled shipments\n* Available in multiple sizes and formats\n* Durable, reusable, and non-toxic\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nCompany Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nJob Title\nProjected shipments per week?\nPlease SelectNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPlease tell us briefly, what are you looking to accomplish?\nCAPTCHA\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][74]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][75]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][76]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Animal Health][79]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][80]\n\n[Food & Beverage][81]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Botanicals][83]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][84]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][85]\n\n[RenewMailer][86]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][87]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][88]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][89]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][90]\n\n[Latest Innovation][91]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][92]\n\n[History][93]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][94]\n\n[Locations][95]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][96]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][97]\n\n[(r) Value][98]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][99]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][100]\n\n[Thermasure][101]\n\n[Careers][102]\n\n[Contact Us][103]\n\n[Privacy Policy][104]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][105]\n\n[Page load link][106]\n[ Go to Top ][107]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain-exchange/\n[8]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/the-thermalist/\n[9]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/thermasure/\n[10]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/careers/\n[11]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/digital-telehealth-pharmacy/\n[15]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/specialty-pharmacy/\n[16]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/mail-order-pharmac