            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nDuraShield Box Liners[Thomas Evans][72]2026-04-08T17:08:19-04:00\n\n# DuraShield Box Liners. Insulated thermal protection.\n\nA thermally resistant, lightweight insulated box liner for cold chain customers concerned about\nweight, size and storage space requirements.\n\n[Get Started with DuraShield Box Liners][73]\n\nRequest samples, pricing, and performance\ndata for your shipments.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Left out in the cold.\n\nWith innovative high-efficiency thermal protection, DuraShield Box Liners are the ideal solution for\ngrocery shipping and winter box liner applications.\n\n### DuraShield\n### Box Liners\n\n#### 3D insulation.\n#### Bottom gusseted.\n#### Flexible metallized bubble materials.\n\n#### Perfect for short duration shipments up to 48 hours\n\n#### Save my space.\n\nSpace-saving design and flat storage reduces shipping costs.\n\n#### Leakproof.\n\nFood and drinks. Hot or cold. Nothing gets past DuraShield Box Liners.\n\n#### Additional padding options available.\n\nFor optimal performance in every season and shipping duration.\n\n## Efficient Thermal Protection for Everyday Shipments\n\n### DuraShield Box Liners deliver reliable temperature control for short-duration shipments\u2014without\n### the bulk, storage challenges, or complexity of traditional packaging.\n* Designed for 24\u201348 hour cold chain performance\n* Lightweight, flat-packed for efficient storage and handling\n* Flexible, leak-resistant construction for real-world shipping\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nCompany Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nJob Title\nProjected shipments per week?\nPlease SelectNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPlease tell us briefly, what are you looking to accomplish?\nCAPTCHA