nvelopes provide some of the most powerful thermal protection for a wide range of\npackaging applications.\n\n[Get Started with DuraShield][73]\n\nExplore a lightweight, high-efficiency\nsolution for short-duration shipments.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Whether it\u2019s food or medication, DuraShield covers it all.\n\n[Ship perishable][74] items with absolute security while minimizing warehouse footprints.\n\n[Durashield envelope profile view]\n\n### DuraShield Envelopes\n\n[Durashield envelope]\n\n#### Less weight.\n#### Smaller size.\n#### Reduced storage.\n\nSpace-saving design reduces shipping costs.\n\n#### Perfect for short duration shipments up to 48 hours.\n\n#### Fit to your needs.\n\n#### Additional padding options available.\n\nFor optimal performance in every season and shipping duration.\n\n#### Leakproof.\n\nFood and drinks. Hot or cold. Nothing gets past DuraShield.\n\n#### Total protection from heat transfer.\n\nShields against conduction, convection and radiant heat transfer.\n\n## Efficient Thermal Protection for Everyday Shipments\n\n### DuraShield Envelopes deliver reliable temperature control for short-duration shipments\u2014without\n### the bulk, weight, or storage challenges of traditional packaging.\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nCompany Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nJob Title\nProjected shipments per week?\nPlese SelectNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPlease tell us briefly, what are you looking to accomplish?\nCAPTCHA\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][75]\n\n[sales@thermalshi