0\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPET-PVS72-13\u2502Small-Al\u250213x11x13 \u25022\u2033 \u25029 x 7 x 9\u201d \u2502(3) 48oz & (1) 24oz\u250272 Hours\n1113 \u2502t \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502Ice Packs \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPET-PVS72-16\u2502Medium \u250216x14x12 \u25022\u2033 \u250212 x 10 x 8\u201d \u2502(4) 48oz Ice Packs \u250272 Hours\n1412 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPET-PVS72-22\u2502Large \u250222x13x14 \u25022\u2033 \u250218 x 9 x 10\u201d \u2502(4) 64oz & (1) 48oz\u250272 Hours\n1314 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502Ice Packs \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n* [\n\n#### 24-Hr Tests\n\n][84]\n\n### 24-Hour Shipper Tests\n### [line]\n\n**1\u2033 Insulation **\n\n* [\n\n#### 48-Hr Tests\n\n][85]\n\n### 48-Hour Shipper Tests\n### [line]\n\n**1.5\u2033 Insulation**\n\n* [\n\n#### 72-Hr Tests\n\n][86]\n\n### 72-Hour Shipper Tests\n### [line]\n\n**2\u2033 Insulation**\n\n* [\n\n#### Instructions\n\n][87]\n\n### Packaging Dimensions\n### [line]\n\nAll written dimensions, when submitted on\nforms/discussed verbally, must be in the order of\nLength x Width x Height.\n\n### Packout Directions\n### [line]\n\nA and B liners must be packed out in the following order for proper use and efficiency.\n\n[Download Instructions][88]\n\n# Optimize pack outs using\n# custom box configurations:\n* Ensure precise temperature control (2-8\u00b0C) with efficient refrigerant usage, maintaining product\nintegrity throughout transit.\n* Enhance performance and protection with tailored insulation thickness for each duration. Each\nshipper is designed with consistent payload space across all durations, while the insulation\nthickness adjusts to ensure optimal thermal performance.\n* Lower shipping costs with compact, lightweight packaging, further supported by our strategically\nlocated production facilities across the U.S., ensuring efficient and cost-effective freight\nsolutions.\n* Optimize performance with shippers designed specifically for the Summer season, ensuring\nefficiency and cost-effectiveness.\n\n[Thermal Testing]\n\n### Thermal Testing\n\nFrom product research and development to raw materials sourcing, and from design and pre-planning to\nproduction and transportation logistics, only TSS employs Thermalists all along the process chain.\n\nThermalists are (r) value industry experts and the leading providers of custom thermal packaging and\nsustainable shipping systems.\n\n**TSS Thermal Eco-Lab**\nTesting\nR&D\nCompetitive Analysis\nPackage-Proofing\n\n[Explore Eco-Lab][89]\n\n**ISTA Qualified**\nRenewliner has undergone rigorous testing in TSS\u2019s environmental chambers, fully compliant with\nInternational Safe Transit Association (ISTA) 7E summer profiles and ISTA 20 packout standards.\nAdditionally, all configurations are re-validated through third-party ISTA-certified thermal test\nlabs, ensuring adherence to ISTA 7E and 3A certification requirements. This comprehensive testing\nprocess is essential for preserving the integrity and quality of temperature-sensitive payloads\nduring transit to the end consumer.\n\n# Custom Solutions\n\nAt our facility, we specialize in creating custom solutions tailored to your unique requirements. By\nadjusting the thickness, dimensions, and density of Renewliner, we can optimize payload space,\nextend shipping duration, and manage dimensional weight. Discover more about our innovative design\npractices by visiting our TSS Eco-lab. If you already have a specific idea in mind, don\u2019t hesitate\nto contact us directly.\n\n[Contact Us][90]\n\n### Samples\n\nIf you\u2019re interested in seeing a sample, please let us know your specific requests. Download our\nform, fill it out, and submit it for further inquiry. This ensures we meet your exact needs and\nprovide the best possible solution.\n\n### Sample Brochure\n\nDownload our sample order form and reach out to us at [sales@thermalshipping.com][91]\n\n[Download][92]\n\n## Tell Us About Your Shipping Needs\n\nWe\u2019ll match you with a pre-validated solution and provide samples, specs, and next steps.\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nPhone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nProjected shipments per week?\nNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nCAPTCHA\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][93]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][94]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][95]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][96]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][97]\n\n[Animal Health][98]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][99]\n\n[Food & Beverage][100]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][101]\n\n[Botanicals][102]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][103]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][104]\n\n[RenewMailer][105]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][106]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][107]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][108]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][109]\n\n[Latest Innovation][110]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][111]\n\n[History][112]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][113]\n\n[Locations][114]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][115]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][116]\n\n[(r) Value][117]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][118]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][119]\n\n[Thermasure][120]\n\n[Careers][121]\n\n[Contact Us][122]\n\n[Privacy Policy][123]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][124]\n\n[Page load link][125]\n[ Go to Top ][126]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain