            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nTSS Pre-Validated Solutions[Thomas Evans][72]2026-04-22T15:07:32-04:00\n\n# Pre-Validated\n# Solutions\n\nExperience thermal packaging that prioritizes dependability, ease of use, and sustainability. Our\npre-validated solutions and custom products are designed and tested for exceptional performance,\nensuring every unique requirement is met with precision and efficiency.\n\n**[Box Liners][73] | [Thermal Testing][74] | [Custom Solutions][75] | [Request\nSamples][76]**\n\n**[Box Liners][77] | [Thermal Testing][78]\n[Custom Solutions][79] | [Request Samples][80]**\n\n[Get A Pre-Validated Shipping Solution][81]\n\n2\u20138\u00b0C solutions proven for 24, 48, and 72-hour\nperformance\u2014ready to use immediately.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n### Renewliner\n\nThe world\u2019s first curbside recyclable insulated box liner,\nsourced from the globe\u2019s most recyclable plastic.\n\n[Renewliner image]\n* [\n\n#### 2-8\u00ba C\n\n][82]\n* [\n\n#### 24-Hr Tests\n\n][83]\n* [\n\n#### 48-Hr Tests\n\n][84]\n* [\n\n#### 72-Hr Tests\n\n][85]\n* [\n\n#### Instructions\n\n][86]\n* [\n\n#### 2-8\u00ba C\n\n][87]\n\n### Temperature Profile\n\n2-8\u00ba C\n\n### 24 Hour Shippers\n### [line]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n#### Item # \u2502#### Siz\u2502#### Box \u2502#### Liner \u2502#### Payload \u2502#### Refrigeran\u2502#### Durati\n\u2502#### e \u2502#### Size \u2502#### Thickness \u2502#### Dimensions \u2502#### t \u2502#### on\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500