 for pharma, food, and temperature-sensitive\n### shipments\u2014designed to reduce risk, lower costs, and improve performance.\n\nKangaroo Mailer\n\nRenewMailer\n\nDuraShield Envelopes\n\nRenewliner\n\nDuraShield Box Liners\n\nGel Ice Packs\n\n### Mailers & Envelopes | Insulated Shipping Products\n\nKangaroo Mailer\n\nSelf-inflating foam mailer for absolute protection in minimal space.\n[Learn more.][73]\n\nRenewMailer\n\nThe first, and only, curbside recyclable thermal mailer.\n[Learn more.][74]\n\nDuraShield Envelopes\n\nHigh-efficiency thermal protection for a wide range of applications.\n[Learn more.][75]\n\n### Box Liners\n\nRenewliner\n\nThe world\u2019s first curbside recyclable insulated shipping system.\n[Learn more.][76]\n\nDuraShield Box Liners\n\nThermally resistant and highly lightweight insulated box liner.\n[Learn more.][77]\n\n### Refrigerants\n\nGel Ice Packs\n\nProtect your shipments in refrigerated and frozen temperatures with our insulated shipping products.\n[Learn more.][78]\n\n## Not Sure Which Solution Fits Best?\n\n### Tell us what you\u2019re shipping, required temperature range, and delivery timeline\u2014we\u2019ll recommend\n### the right system.\n\n[Get My Recommendation][79]\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][80]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][81]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][82]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][83]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][84]\n\n[Animal Health][85]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][86]\n\n[Food & Beverage][87]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][88]\n\n[Botanicals][89]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][90]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][91]\n\n[RenewMailer][92]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][93]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][94]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][95]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][96]\n\n[Latest Innovation][97]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][98]\n\n[History][99]