            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nRenewMailer[Thomas Evans][72]2026-05-04T12:04:32-04:00\n\n# RenewMailer: sustainable and eco-friendly shipping solution, curbside recyclable thermal mailer.\n\nAt the intersection of thermal and sustainable, RenewMailer brings superior thermal performance in\nour most sustainable and environmentally friendly package.\n\n[ Explore RenewMailer][73]\n\nRequest samples, pricing, and performance\ninsights for your shipments.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n## Experience thermal performance and sustainability: one of the most sustainable projects in the\n## world.\n\nRecognized by the Cold Chain Global Forum as one of the most sustainable temperature-controlled\nprojects, our recyclable thermal renewmailer reimagines what\u2019s possible with sustainable packaging.\n\n[picture of insulation product | Renewliner]\n\n### RenewMailer\n\n[3d render renewliner]\n\n#### The loop has been closed.\n\nManufactured from a true closed-loop material by extracting waste from current waste streams for a\nhighly recycled product.\n\n#### Reduced carbon footprint.\n\nRenewMailer has a lower carbon footprint compared to other insulated mailers on the market.\n\n#### Proven protection.\n\nUN3373 compliant.\nLeak-resistant design.\n\n#### Shipping costs, lowered.\n\nLightweight design reduces shipping costs.\n\n#### So fresh, so clean.\n\nAnti-microbial.\nHypoallergenic.\nHygienic.\n\n#### Fit to your needs.\n\nCustom sizing from \u00bd\u201d to 2\u201d+ for optimal performance in every season and shipping duration.\n\n## Sustainable Thermal Protection\u2014Without Compromise\n\n### RenewMailer delivers proven temperature control in a fully recyclable, closed-loop\n### design\u2014helping you reduce environmental impact without sacrificing performance.\n* Closed-loop, curbside recyclable materials\n* Proven protection (UN3373 compliant, leak-resistant)\n* Lightweight design to reduce shipping footprint\n\nEmail(Required)\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when 