            "url": "https://www.thermalshipping.com/products/box-liners/renewliner/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nRenewliner[Thomas Evans][72]2026-06-15T12:26:06-04:00\n\n# Renewliner Insulated Box Liners\n\nValidated insulated box liner systems designed for reliable 2\u20138\u00b0C temperature-controlled shipping\nperformance.\n\nEngineered for scalable direct-to-consumer cold chain fulfillment across life sciences and\nperishable goods.\n\n[Evaluate Renewliner for Your Cold Chain][73]\n\nProven 2\u20138\u00baC performance for 72+ hours with lower total cost of operation.\n\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n### Scalable Cold Chain\n### Performance with\n### Operational\n### Efficiency Built In\n\nRenewLiner insulated box liners deliver dependable temperature-controlled shipping performance for\npharmaceutical, food, beverage, and direct-to-consumer applications.\n\nDesigned to support validated cold chain performance for 24\u201372+ hours, RenewLiner\u2019s flat-shipping\ndesign helps improve pallet density, reduce storage requirements, and lower shipping costs.\n\nManufactured from recyclable PET materials, RenewLiner pioneered the industry\u2019s first curbside\nrecyclable insulated box liner shipping system.\n\n### Built for Temperature-Sensitive Shipments\n\nRenewLiner supports cold chain shipping programs across:\n* Direct-to-Patient Programs\n* Specialty and Compounding Pharmacies\n* Mail Order Pharmacies\n* Home Health Services\n* Telehealth Operations\n* Meal Kits\n* Refrigerated Foods\n* Beverages\n\n### Renewliner Insulated Box Liner\n\nKeeping your products at a consistent temperature is critical. That\u2019s why we offer high-quality\ninsulated box liners designed to protect your products from temperature fluctuations and damage. Our\nRenewliner insulated box liners are made from eco-friendly materials and are a sustainable choice\nfor your business. Whether you\u2019re shipping food, pharmaceuticals, or other temperature-sensitive\nproducts, our insulated box liners provide a reliable and effective solution to keep your products\nfresh and safe. Choose TSS\u2019s insulated box liners for a superior shipping experience.\n\n[Learn more about recycling Renewliner][74]\n\n#### Styrofoam, meet your match.\n\nThe thermal performance of Styrofoam, in a lighter, more sustainable package.\n\n#### Made from recycled water bottles.\n\nAll ink is water-based. No adhesives, PVC, papers or contaminates.\n\n#### Make it yours.\n\nCustom printed packaging helps reinforce your brand and create a more recognizable delivery\nexperience.\n\nDesigned to make every shipment look as professional as the product inside.\n\n#### Inch for inch.\n\nThermal performance on par with Styrofoam pound for pound, inch for inch.\n\n#### The loop has been closed.\n\nManufactured from a true closed-loop material by extracting waste from current waste streams for a\nhighly recycled product.\n\n#### Seal the deal.\n\nInnovative design and highly flexible material improves edge seals and reduces air loss.\n\n#### Crushed it.\n\nCompression-tested for maximal protection in harsh handling environments.\n\n#### So fresh, so clean.\n\nAnti-microbial.\nHypoallergenic.\nHygenic.\n\n#### Shipping costs, lowered.\n\nLightweight design reduces shipping costs through dim-weight package optimization.\n\n#### Full speed ahead.\n\nThe fasted production process on the market, plus high-speed packout.\n\n#### Custom sizing from 1/2\u201d to 2\u201d+\n\nFor optimal performance in every season and shipping duration.\n\n#### FDA approved materials for food and medication.\n\nPET is one of few FDA approved materials for both direct and indirect food and medication contact.\n\n## Upgrade Your Thermal Packaging Without Compromise\n\nRenewliner delivers proven thermal, ISTA validated performance in a recyclable, closed-loop\ndesign\u2014helping you improve efficiency, reduce waste, and replace traditional liner systems.\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nX/Twitter\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nCompany Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nJob Title\nProjected shipments per week?\nPlease SelectNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPlease tell us briefly, what are you looking to accomplish?\nCAPTCHA\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][75]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][76]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][77]\n\n[Specialty Pharmacy][78]\n\n[Mail Order Pharmacy][79]\n\n[Animal Health][80]\n\n[Independent Pharmacy ][81]\n\n[Food & Beverage][82]\n\n[Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][83]\n\n[Botanicals][84]\n\nProducts\n\n[Pre-Validated Shipping Kits][85]\n\nMailer & Envelopes\n\n[Kangaroo Mailer][86]\n\n[RenewMailer][87]\n\n[DuraShield Envelopes][88]\n\nBox Liners\n\n[Renewliner][89]\n\n[DuraShield Box Liners][90]\n\nRefrigerants\n\n[Gel Ice Packs][91]\n\n[Latest Innovation][92]\n\nCompany\n\n[Who we are][93]\n\n[History][94]\n\n[TSS Advantage & Innovation][95]\n\n[Locations][96]\n\n[Sustainable Leadership][97]\n\nGiveback\n\n[Do Better][98]\n\n[(r) Value][99]\n\nResources\n\n[Thermal Ecolab][100]\n\n[Cold Chain Exchange][101]\n\n[Thermasure][102]\n\n[Careers][103]\n\n[Contact Us][104]\n\n[Privacy Policy][105]\n\n[Terms and Conditions][106]\n\n[Page load link][107]\n[ Go to Top ][108]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/our-impact-dodeca/\n[4]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/giveback/r-value/\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/thermal-ecolab/\n[7]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/cold-chain-exchange/\n[8]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/resources/the-thermalist/\n[9]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/thermasure/\n[10]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/careers/\n[11]: https://www.thermalshipping.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://www.thermals