            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Giveback][2]\n* [Do Better][3]\n* [(r) Value][4]\n* [Resources][5]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][6]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange][7]\n* [The Thermalist][8]\n* [Thermasure][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n[ [TSS Logo] ][12]\nMENUMENU\n* [Industries][13]\n* * * [Telehealth Pharmacy][14]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][15]\n* * [Mail Order Pharmacy][16]\n* [Animal Health][17]\n* * [Independent Pharmacy][18]\n* [Food and Beverage][19]\n* * [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][20]\n* [Botanicals][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* * * [**Pre-Validated Shipping Kits**][23]\n* * **Mailers & Envelopes**\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][24]\n* [RenewMailer][25]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][26]\n* * **Box Liners**\n* [Renewliner][27]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][28]\n* * **Refrigerants**\n* [Gel Ice Packs][29]\n* * [Latest Innovation][30]\n* [Company][31]\n* * * [About TSS][32]\n* [History][33]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][34]\n* [TSS Locations][35]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][36]\n* [Industries][37]\n* [Telehealth Pharmacy][38]\n* [Specialty Pharmacy][39]\n* [Mail Order Pharmacy][40]\n* [Animal Health][41]\n* [Independent Pharmacy][42]\n* [Food and Beverage][43]\n* [Retail & Home Delivery Pharmacy][44]\n* [Botanicals][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [TSS Pre-Validated Solutions][47]\n* [Mailer & Envelopes][48]\n* [Kangaroo Mailer][49]\n* [RenewMailer][50]\n* [DuraShield Envelopes][51]\n* [Box Liners][52]\n* [Renewliner][53]\n* [DuraShield Box Liners][54]\n* [Refrigerants][55]\n* [Gel Ice Packs][56]\n* [Latest Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [About TSS][59]\n* [History][60]\n* [TSS Innovation Advantage][61]\n* [Sustainable Leadership][62]\n* [Giveback][63]\n* [Do Better][64]\n* [(r) Value][65]\n* [Resources][66]\n* [Thermal Ecolab][67]\n* [Cold Chain Exchange Strategies][68]\n* [Thermasure][69]\n* [Careers][70]\n* [Contact Us][71]\nThermal Shipping Solutions \u2013 Cold Packaging, Mailers, Liners \u2013 TSS[Thomas\nEvans][72]2026-06-16T11:04:13-04:00\n\n# Cold Chain Packaging & Validation\n\n## Proven Thermal Packaging.\n\n## Built for What\n## Matters Most.\n\nTSS engineers insulated packaging solutions that protect temperature-sensitive pharmaceuticals,\nmedications, and perishables \u2014 validated to maintain 2\u20138\u00b0C for 24 to 72+ hours. Backed by our\nproprietary Thermasure methodology and industry-leading Thermalists.\n\n[Explore Solutions][73]\n[Get Your Thermasure Score][74]\nSorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n\n### ISTA Member\n\nSafe Transit Association\n\n### 2\u20138\u00b0C Validated\n\n24, 48 & 72+ hr profiles\n\n### In-House Testing\n\nThermal Eco-Lab\n\n### Thermalists\n\nCold Chain Engineers\n\n### Sustainably Engineered\n\nCurbside-recyclable Options\n\n### Pre-Validated Kits\n\nShip-ready Solutions\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\n## Cold Chain Solutions for\n## Every Industry We Protect.\n\n## Cold Chain Solutions for Every Industry We Protect.\n\nFrom direct-to-patient pharmacy programs to food and beverage fulfillment, our validated thermal\npackaging meets the demands of every cold chain environment.\n\n# Sp\n\n# Specialty Pharmacy\n\n# Tp\n\n# Digital & Telehealth Pharmacy\n\n# Rp\n\n# Large Retail Pharmacy\n\n# Mo\n\n# Mail Order Pharmacy\n\n# Ip\n\n# Independent Pharmacy\n\n# Ah\n\n# Animal Health\n\n# Fb\n\n# Food & Beverage\n\n# Bo\n\n# Botanicals\n\n## Our Differentiator\n\n## The Industry\u2019s Most Comprehensive Cold Chain Assessment.\n\n### Thermasure is TSS\u2019s proprietary 15-step thermal shipping framework. Built by Thermalists. Proven\n### in the field. No guesswork \u2014 only validated performance.\n\n#### Assess\n\nIdentify product sensitivity, shipping lanes, and risk exposure.\n\n#### Engineer\n\nDesign precise thermal solutions tailored to real-world conditions.\n\n#### Validate\n\nRigorously test against time, temperature, and transit variables.\n\n#### Monitor & Optimize\n\nTrack performance across every shipment and refine continuously.\n\n## Thermasure Score\n\n## Get Your Free Thermal Assessment\n\n### Quantify risk. Prove performance. Own the outcome. Your Thermasure Score delivers a clear,\n### data-backed rating measuring how well your product will be protected across the entire shipping\n### journey.\n\n##### Identify Vulnerabilities\n\nHidden risk in your current program\n\n##### Validate Performance\n\nData-backed proof your packaging works\n\n##### Benchmark Standards\n\nCompare against ISTA & industry norms\n\n##### Unlock Cost Savings\n\nReduce freight & packaging spend\n\n[Get My Thermasure Score][75]\n\n## Our Products\n\n## Engineered for Performance.\n## Designed for Sustainability.\n\n[View All Products][76]\n[View All Products][77]\n\nRenewliner\n\nFirst curbside-recyclable insulated shipping system. Flat-shipping, scalable cold chain fulfillment.\n\n**24\u201372+ hrs | 2\u20138\u00b0C | Recyclable**\n\n[Explore][78]\n\nKangaroo Mailer\n\nIndustry\u2019s first self-expanding protective mailer. Ideal for direct-to-patient pharmacy programs.\n\n**24\u201348+ hrs | 2\u20138\u00b0C**\n\n[Explore][79]\n\nRenewMailer\n\nLightweight insulated mailer. Reduces parcel size and freight costs with validated cold chain\nperformance.\n\n**24\u201348+ hrs | Lightweight**\n\n[Explore][80]\n\nDuraShield Box Liners\n\nThermally resistant, flexible liner. Scalable for enterprise pharmacy fulfillment.\n\n**24\u201348+ hrs | Configurable**\n\n[Explore][81]\n\nDuraShield Envelopes\n\nLightweight insulated envelopes for smaller refrigerated shipments. Reduces dimensional weight.\n\n**Small Payload | Low DIM Wt.**\n\n[Explore][82]\n\nGel Ice Packs\n\nDurable, reusable refrigerants. Supports customized thermal packouts across pharma and food\napplications.\n\n**Reusable | Custom Packout**\n\n[Explore][83]\n\n## The TSS Difference\n\n## We Don\u2019t Speculate. We Validate.\n\n# Thermalists\n\n# Cold chain industry experts embedded across our entire process \u2014 from raw materials sourcing\n# through design, production, and logistics. Only TSS has this.\n\n# Thermal Eco-Lab\n\n# In-house testing, R&D, UX design, competitive analysis, and package-proofing. We test before you\n# ship, not after.\n\n# ISTA Member\n\n# Proud member of the International Safe Transit Association. All solutions developed in alignment\n# with ISTA standards for real-world shipping environments.\n\n# Sustainably Engineered\n\n# Curbside-recyclable materials, flat-shipping designs, and recycled PET insulation \u2014 performance\n# and sustainability without compromise.\n\n### \u201c\n### Simply put, the way the TSS product is made is more effective and efficient \u2014 a better design\n### and a better product. Its R-value, resistance to heat, is two to three times longer than the\n### next competitor. That\u2019s vital.\u201d\n\nAmber Cox\n\nInventory Manager, PharmaLabs\n\n## Work with TSS\n\n## Let Our Thermalists Build Your Cold Chain Solution.\n\nWhether you\u2019re an independent pharmacy launching a delivery program, a telehealth platform scaling\nfulfillment, or a food brand optimizing refrigerated shipping \u2014 TSS has a validated solution ready\nto deploy.\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nComments\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nEmail*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPhone\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nFirst Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nLast Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nCompany Name\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nJob Title\nProjected shipments per week?\nPlease SelectNot Yet Shipping0-99100-499500-9991,000-4,9995,000-9,99910,000+\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPlease tell us briefly, what are you looking to accomplish?\nCAPTCHA\n\n6 Hamilton Lndg.\nSuites 160 + 175\nNovato, CA, 94949, US\n\n[415-389-5004][84]\n\n[sales@thermalshipping.com][85]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026\nThermal Shipping Solutions.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n[ista logo]\n\nIndustries\n\n[Telehealth Pharmacy][8