      "polished_summary": "Vidhya Enterprises is a Chennai-based manufacturer, supplier, trader, exporter, and importer specializing in a diverse range of products, primarily focused on pipe and earthing electrodes. The company offers high-quality solutions such as drilling polymers, sodium bentonite, and various types of lightning arresters, catering to industries such as construction, water treatment, and electrical safety. With a commitment to excellence, Vidhya Enterprises is recognized as a trusted partner in delivering innovative products to meet the needs of its clients.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Vidhya Enterprises manufactures and supplies gel ice packs, which are directly relevant to the gel ice pack market. They offer products such as 'Reusable Gel Ice Packs' and 'Cold Gel Packs' that cater to laboratory and clinical applications.",
