egies. Our science-based targets\nwere officially validated by the Science Based Targets initiative (SBTi). Through continuous\ndecarbonization efforts, we have achieved meaningful progress: in 2024, our absolute GHG emissions\nwere approximately 59% lower than the 2022 base year, demonstrating steady advancement along our\nscience-based reduction pathway.\n\nProduct News\n\n## Cooler Master Brings Next-Generation Cooling to Intel Core Ultra 200S CPUs\n\n[ Read More ][223]\nProduct News\n\n## Cooler Master Brings Next-Gen"
