chieved meaningful progress: in 2024, our absolute GHG emissions\nwere approximately 59% lower than the 2022 base year, demonstrating steady advancement along our\nscience-based reduction pathway.\n\nProduct News\n\n## Cooler Master Brings Next-Generation Cooling to Intel Core Ultra 200S CPUs\n\n[ Read More ][223]\nProduct News\n\n## Cooler Master Brings Next-Generation Cooling to Intel Core Ultra 200S CPUs\n\n[ Read More ][224]\nProduct News\n\n## COOLING X: CLOUD SERVER QUALITY ON YOUR DESK\n\n[ Read More ][225]\n[ELITE SERIES]\nProduct News\n\n## ELITE SERIES\n\n[ Read More ][226]\n[Cooler Master Brings Next-Generation Cooling to Intel Core Ultra 200S CPUs]\nProduct News\n\n## Cooler Master Brings Next-Generation Cooling to Intel Core Ultra 200S CPUs\n\n[ Read More ][227]\n[COOLING X: CLOUD SERVER QUALITY ON YOUR DESK]\nProduct News\n\n## COOLING X: CLOUD SERVER QUALITY ON YOUR DESK\n\n[ Read More ][228]\n\n### About Us\n\n[Social Media][229]\n[News][230]\n[Events][231]\n\n### Support\n\n[Product Registration][232]\n[Warranty][233]\n[FAQ][234]\n[Contact Us][235]\n\n### [Join Us][236]\n\n[Careers][237]\n[China Recruitment][238]\n[Other Regions][239]\n\n### [Resource Center][240]\n\n[Gated Content][241]\n\n**Global Headquarters**\n\nNo. 398, Xinhu 1st Rd, Neihu District, Taipei City, 114, Taiwan\n\n[ facebook ][242] [ youtube ][243] [ instagram ][244] [ x ][245] [ tiktok ][246]\n[Terms of Use][247]\n[Privacy Policy][248]\n[Cookie Policy][249]\n[General terms and Conditions][250]\n[Conformity of products][251]\nCopyright 2026 \u00a9\u00a0Cooler Master\n\n\n\n**\ufeffGlobal headquarters**\n\nNo. 398, Xinhu 1st Rd, Neihu District, Taipei City, 114, Taiwan\n\n[ facebook ][252] [ youtube ][253] [ instagram ][254] [ x ][255] [ tiktok ][256]\n\n\n\nCopyright 2025 Cooler Master\n\n[Warranty Information][257]\n\n[Privacy Policy][258]\n\n#### Confirm your Country\n\nIt looks like you're in ****\n\nTo improve your browsing experience, we invite you to switch to our dedicated 