      "polished_summary": "Cooler Master is a leading innovator in the computer hardware industry, specializing in advanced cooling solutions and customizable PC components. The company offers a wide range of products, including air and liquid cooling systems, power supplies, PC cases, and gaming accessories, catering to builders, gamers, and tech enthusiasts. With a commitment to thermal excellence and user empowerment, Cooler Master continuously pushes the boundaries of technology to enhance the performance and personalization of computing systems.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Cooler Master specializes in computer hardware and cooling solutions for PCs, which does not align with the gel ice pack market. Their products focus on thermal management for electronics rather than medical or consumer cooling products like gel ice packs.",
