462-2-12,P-R-1094643-6-42,P-R-1071441-6-62,P-R-1050538-2-12,P-R-1049154-2-9,P-R-1035877-4-7,P\n-R-1034124-2-19,P-R-1018575-12-25,P-R-1004015-2-21,P-R-95756-2-11,P-R-93960-2-48,P-R-88009-6-9,P-D-1\n839127-1-3,P-D-1822082-3-8,P-D-1779315-2-4,P-D-1775279-3-5,P-D-1773467-1-8,P-D-1774043-1-2,P-D-15386\n69-4-41,P-D-1146262-1-29,P-D-1058394-2-8,P-D-1058392-1-8,P-D-1058393-1-44,P-D-1042850-1-62,P-D-11669\n5-2-15,P-D-116687-1-9,P-D-98651-6-39,P-D-68024-5-262\",\"geoName\":\"cin\",\"domainOrigin\":\"Office\",\"reque\nstOrigin\":\"Direct\",\"sessionId\":\"91dc04db-ba07-4cf0-a75e-3109cfdd4abd\",\"testTraffic\":false,\"cookieCon\nsentRequired\":false,\"officeMarketLcid\":1033,\"useMruS2SFlow\":false,\"useFeedApi\":true,\"oTelAriaTenant\"\n:\"eba120086311400a9b62c4718c0934d3-7ec73bd2-d8e8-450d-84d0-7f0a2ade31ce-7166\",\"oTelAppName\":\"OfficeT\naosHub\",\"oTelAppPlatform\":\"Web\",\"oTelClickEnabled\":true,\"oTelDiagnosticAriaTenant\":\"6dd53ce2cf7c4e9c\na43c3702bdbf521a-0877f49d-9760-44f7-839a-5ece6d961731-6816\",\"oTelDiagnosticEnabled\":false,\"oTelDiagn\nosticNameSpace\":\"Office.Taos.Hub.Diagnostic\",\"oTelEnabled\":true,\"oTelErrorEnabled\":true,\"oTelEudbEnd\npointEnabled\":false,\"oTelFeatureEnabled\":true,\"oTelImpressionEnabled\":true,\"oTelNameSpace\":\"Office.T\naos.Hub\",\"oTelRequestEnabled\":true,\"oTelSamplingEnabled\":false,\"oTelSamplingPerformanceEnabled\":fals\ne,\"oTelSamplingRequestEnabled\":false,\"oTelScrubIpEnabled\":false,\"oTelPageViewEnabled\":true,\"oTelPerf\nEnabled\":true,\"oTelWin11DetectionEnabled\":true,\"pwaV2TokenEnabled\":true,\"embedNAAflowEnabled\":false,\n\"clipchampNAAflowEnabled\":false,\"useMdcppAppId\":false,\"fromcode\":\"cmmiadtp424\"}\n\n# Work smarter across\n# [Word][Excel][PowerPoint] with [Copilot] Microsoft 365\n\nAI built into Microsoft 365 Copilot helps you create, collaborate, and work across documents,\npresentations, and data.\n\n[ Sign in ][96] [ Buy Microsoft 365 ][97]\n\n## Jump into your favorite app\n\n[\n[Word with Copilot]\n\n### Word with Copilot\n\nDraft smarter and finish faster.\n\nOpen Word\n][98] [\n[Excel with Copilot]\n\n### Excel with Copilot\n\nUnlock insights and make informed decisions.\n\nOpen Excel\n][99] [\n[PowerPoint with Copilot]\n\n### PowerPoint with Copilot\n\nTurn ideas into polished presentations.\n\nOpen PowerPoint\n][100] [\n[Outlook with Copilot]\n\n### Outlook with Copilot\n\nMove work forward with email and calendar.\n\nOpen Outlook\n][101]\n[ View all apps ][102]\n\n## Everyday tasks, made simpler\n\n[\n\n### Create with ease\n\nDescribe what you want, and Copilot helps create images for inspiration, storytelling, or polished\nheadshots.\n\nStart creating\n][103] [\n\n### Work from files\n\nAdd files to your prompt to provide context and ground responses in your content.\n\nAdd files\n][104] [\n[Slides in less time]\n\n### Slides in less time\n\nStart building slides from notes, documents, or outlines.\n\nUse PowerPoint agent\n][105] [\n[Brainstorm with agents]\n\n### Brainstorm with agents\n\nPlan and gather insights for your next meeting using the Analyst agent.\n\nGo to Analyst\n][106]\n\n## Get Copilot apps\n\n[Download for desktop]\n\n### Download for desktop\n\nBring Copilot and your work together in a focused desktop experience.\n\n[ Download for Windows ][107]\n[Download on mobile]\n\n### Download on mobile\n\nAccess your work with a mobile experience designed for flexibility.\n\n## Did you know?\n\nExpand all Collapse all\n\n### 01/ Microsoft 365 (formerly Office) includes Microsoft 365 Copilot app\n\nMicrosoft 365 is a subscription service that includes familiar apps like Word, Excel, and\nPowerPoint, plus services like OneDrive, Teams, Outlook, and the Copilot app. With Copilot, you get\nAI assistance built into the Microsoft 365 apps.\n\n### 02/ You can use Word, Excel, and PowerPoint for free on the web\n\nYou can get free access to Word, Excel, and PowerPoint in your browser with a Microsoft account. If\nyou want additional features, you can compare plans and upgrade.\n\n### 03/ If you want to download the Microsoft 365 desktop apps, sign in to install\n\nIf you already have a Microsoft 365 subscription (or a work or school license), sign in to download\nand [install Microsoft 365 apps][108].\n\n### 04/ You're in control of AI\n\nAI features respond only when you choose to use them. You stay in control of when and how you use\nthem, and your existing privacy and security settings sti"
          }
        ]
