t\n\nFeb 10, 2026\n\nMarket Turmoil: Declines in Key Industries and Cryptocurrencies Ignite Concern Amid Easing Oil Prices\n\nFeb 5, 2026\n\nMarket Turmoil: Semiconductor Stocks Plunge Amid Deteriorating Aluminum and Metal Mining Sectors\n\nFeb 4, 2026\n\nDownload CSIMarket Datasets &amp; Subscribe\n\nCSV/JSON for leaders &amp; laggards, stock movers, and the daily economic calendar \ufffd\nunlock full history, breadth, and downloads with Pro.\n\nIndustry Performance (CSV)\n\nStock Movers\n\nSubscribe\n\n10\ufffd15+ yrs history\n\nUnlimited CSV / JSON\n\n90+ industries &amp; sectors\n\nSupply chain &amp; market share\n\nFundamentals &amp; rankings\n\nDaily Economic indicators &amp; earnings calendars\n\nEcon Calendar CSV\n\nEarnings CSV\n\nLeaders/Laggards\n\nMost Active\n\nUsed daily by professionals across media and finance. Data spans companies, industries, sectors, and integrated economic indicators.\nLicensing for internal analytics. Contact data.info@csimarket.com for enterprise.\n\nMarket Breadth &middot; this month\n\nSectors\n\n&#9650;&nbsp;38%\nadvancing / declining\n62%&nbsp;&#9660;\n\n5 of 13 sectors advancing this month.\n\nMarket Breadth &middot; this month\n\nIndustries\n\n&#9650;&nbsp;57%\nadvancing / declining\n43%&nbsp;&#9660;\n\n62 of 108 industries advancing this month.\n\nMarket Breadth &middot; this month\n\nStocks\n\n&#9650;&nbsp;48%\nadvancing / declining\n48%&nbsp;&#9660;\n\n2,723 of 5,615 stocks advancing this month.\n\nRevenue Growth Participation &mdash; YoY\n\nBest performer this month: +4.53%\n\nConglomerates Sector\n\nShare of companies with positive year-over-year revenue growth &middot; Q1 2026\n\n48%\ngrowing YoY\n\n96% of companies have reported results.\n\nCompanies with revenue growth\n48%\n\nCompanies with revenue decline\n43%\n\nCompanies with flat revenue\n10%\n\nExplore Conglomerates Sector revenue growth\n\nRevenue Growth Participation &mdash; YoY\n\nBest performer this month: +18.59%\n\nComputer Peripherals &amp; Office Equipment Industry\n\nShare of companies with positive year-over-year revenue growth &middot; Q1 2026\n\n86%\ngrowing YoY\n\n75% of companies have reported results.\n\nCompanies with revenue growth\n86%\n\nCompanies with revenue decline\n21%\n\nExplore Computer Peripherals &amp; Office Equipment Industry revenue growth\n\nEvents on Mon, Jun 29, 2026\n\nEarnings, Dividends &amp; Economic Indicators\n\n1 events\n\nDownload CSV\n\nDownload Week\n\nEARNINGS\nTVAI\n\nThayer Ventures Acquisition Corporation Ii\n\nToday Monday June 29, 2026, Thayer Ventures Acquisition Corporation Ii reports its full financial results\n\nEvents on Tue, Jun 30, 2026\n\nEarnings, Dividends &amp; Economic Indicators\n\n2 events\n\nDownload CSV\n\nDownload Week\n\nEARNINGS\nTSEM\n\nTower Semiconductor Ltd\n\nI can?t tell the exact release date from that headline alone ? it doesn?t include a date or time. It only says the company?s Q2 2026 result (a record $455M).If this refers to Q2 2026 results, typical timing is:- Quarter ends June 30, 2026.- Public companies usually issue Q2 results 2?6 weeks after quarter end, so most Q2 releases fall in July or August 2026 (often on the same day as an earnings call).How to find the exact release date:- Check the company?s Investor Relations ? News / Events / Press Releases page.- Look for an 8?K filing on SEC EDGAR (U.S. companies) announcing the release or earnings call.- Use earnings calendars on sites like Yahoo Finance, Seeking Alpha, Zacks, or your brokerage.- Search the company name + ?Q2 2026 earnings release? (or ?earnings call?) in Google.If you give me the company name (or a link), I can look up the exact earnings release date for you.,\n\nEARNINGS\nVEON\n\nVeon ltd\n\nThe earnings/financial results will be released on July 31, 2026 (for the quarter and half?year ended June 30, 2026).,\n\nMore Headlines &amp; Data\nSee all\n\nInnovating the Future Vishay Intertechnology?s Groundbreaking Path in AI and EV Technology,\n\nInnovative Solutions and Indu