      "polished_summary": "Csimarket is a leading provider of financial and industry data, offering essential insights for businesses across various sectors, including Retail, Technology, and Health Care. Their core products include an API for seamless financial data integration and comprehensive industry benchmarking datasets, catering to businesses and developers seeking to enhance their performance and competitiveness against industry standards.",
