        "website": "https://www.datainsightsmarket.com",
        "industries": "Aerospace & Defense; Agriculture; Animal Nutrition & Wellness; Automotive; Chemicals & Materials; Consumer Goods and Services; Energy & Power; Financial Services and Investment Intelligence; Food & Beverage; Home and Property Improvement; Hospitality and Tourism; Logistics; Manufacturing Products and Services; Packaging; Professional and Commercial Services; Real Estate and Construction; Retail; Technology, Media and Telecom; Healthcare",
        "products": "",
