outcomes, and streamline operations.\nWith a commitment to excellence and customer focused innovation, we move people forward every day.\n\n## Patients\n\nSupporting recovery with products designed for mobility and comfort.\n\n[ Learn More ][141]\n\n## Providers\n\nInnovative products and solutions that enhance your clients\u2019 recovery.\n\n[ Learn More ][142]\n\n## Services\n\nA customized DME program that simplifies administration and elevates patient care.\n\n[ Learn More ][143]\n\n## Products\n\nOver 320 products, styles, and sizes to fit every orthopedic need.\n\n[ Learn More ][144]\n\n## Patient Stories\n\n#### [Game-Changing Recovery Routine][145]\n\nShaili\u2019s adventures have taken her many places, including the Mt. Everest Base Camp climb. As an\nadventurer she is fearless, but sometimes the world pushes back. A ski accident in February of 2026\nleft her with a full ACL tear and a partial MCL tear. Breg\u2019s Cold Therapy has helped her manage\nswelling, reduce pain, and stay more consistent with her recovery routine.\n[ Read More ][146]\n[ [Joey Bulla wearing knee brace] ][147]\n\n#### [Regained My Flexibility][148]\n\nJoey was actively competing in martial arts and fight contests when his patella tendon suddenly\nrupt [Skip to content][1]\n[ [BREG Logo in White] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About][4]\n  * [About Us][5]\n  * [Our Leadership][6]\n  * [Breg Affiliate Partners][7]\n  * [Breg International][8]\n* [Products][9]\n  * [Knee Braces][10]\n    * [Knee Ligament Bracing][11]\n    * [Adjustable ROM][12]\n    * [Functional OA][13]\n    * [Patellofemoral][14]\n    * [Post Op][15]\n    * [Soft Supports][16]\n  * [Cold Therapy][17]\n    * [Devices][18]\n    * [Gel Accessories][19]\n    * [Pads][20]\n  * [DVT Prophylaxis][21]\n  * [Hip Bracing][22]\n    * [Post Op][23]\n  * [Shoulder Bracing][24]\n    * [Slings and Braces][25]\n    * [Immobilizers and Stabilizers][26]\n  * [Fracture Bracing][27]\n  * [Elbow Wrist Bracing][28]\n    * [Elbow][29]\n    * [Wrist