ns][53]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][54]\n  * [Refrigerants][55]\n  * [Retail][56]\n  * [Temperature Monitoring][57]\n* [Services][58]\n  * [R3 Reuse Program][59]\n  * [Package Testing][60]\n  * [Temperature Mapping][61]\n  * [Thermal Equipment Qualification][62]\n  * [Shipping Lane Mapping][63]\n  * [CFD Modeling and Thermal Simulation][64]\n* [Industries][65]\n  * [Pharma][66]\n  * [Food & Beverage][67]\n  * [Retail][68]\n  * [Cannabis][69]\n* [About][70]\n  * [Company Overview][71]\n  * [Integreon Global][72]\n  * [Careers][73]\n* [Contact][74]\n* [News and Events][75]\nNexBlu\nRing Series\nGraphite\nExpanded\nPolystyrene\nCoolers A Greener Way to Protect\nWhat Matters Engineered\nSustainable\nSolutions and\nOptimized Thermal\nPerformance Contact us to learn more\n\n## Experts in\n\n## Cold Chain Solutions\n\nInnovating and delivering sustainable temperature control solutions worldwide.\n\n[Contact Our Sales Team][76] [Contact Us to Learn More][77] Summer Mapping Ensure Your Product\nStability Amidst Hot Temperatures\n\n# Cold Chain Packaging Design, Engineering and Testing\n\nCryopak is a complete cold chain packaging solutions provider specializing in the field of\ntemperature-controlled packaging. From needs assessment to package qualification, Cryopak handles\nyour packaging projects with one paramount goal: Maintaining the integrity of your products. Our\nmaterials and processes cover the spectrum from converting EPS or fabricating boxes to manufacturing\nphase change materials and temperature monitors.\n\n[ [Cold-chain-Packaging-icon][Cold-chain-Packaging-icon] ][78]\n\n#### [Cold-chain Packaging][79]\n\n[ [Refrigerants][Refrigerants] ][80]\n\n#### [Refrigerants][81]\n\n[ [Temperature Monitoring][Temperature Monitoring] ][82]\n\n#### [Temperature Monitoring][83]\n\n[ [CryopakBucketRetail][CryopakBucketRetail] ][84]\n\n#### [Cryopak Retail][85]\n\n## Services\n\nCryopak offers a wide range of services to go along with our one-of-a-kind solutions. From testing\nand qualification to recycling and reuse, we are a full-service company ready to provide you with\nwhat you need.\n\n[ Learn More ][86]\n[all-products---CPA-CDI--enhanced-sh][all-products---CPA-CDI--enhanced-sh]\n* ### Helping the cannabis industry\n  \n  Prevent mold growth without drying out the cannabinoids and terpenes, and increase shelf life by\n  transporting your products within the proper temperature and humidity ranges, with our\n  specifically design pallet shippers and insulated boxes.\n* ### Serving the Pharmaceutical Industry\n  \n  The pharmaceutical industry demands stringent monitoring of your payload\u2019s temperature. Just one\n  degree off can spoil products and cause financial losses. Don\u2019t risk it. Let Cryopak provide you\n  with accurate monitoring solutions.\n* ### Providing Premium Retail Products\n  \n  Our Ice-Pak Brand is an integral part of any lunch box or cooler. From bottles and blankets to hot\n  packs and coolers, we have the solution for your every need.\n* ### Keeping Food & Beverage Cold\n  \n  There\u2019s no use in crying over spoiled milk. With Cryopak\u00b4s temperature and humidity monitoring\n  solutions, you can track the enviroment of your product in real-time.\n\n## News & Events\n\n[failure points]\n\n### Cryopak Engineering Insights: Common Failure P [Skip to content][1]\n\n\nEnglish\n* English\n* Fran\u00e7ais\n* Espa\u00f1ol\n* Deutsch\n* Nederlands\n* Italiano\n* Portugu\u00eas\n* \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439\n* \u4e2d\u6587\n[ [Cryopak-colour-bk.svg] ][2]\n* [Solutions ][3]\n  \n  ##### Solutions\n  \n  ##### [Cold Chain\n  ##### Packaging][4]\n  \n  [ [Cold Chain Packaging] ][5]\n  \n  ##### [Refrigerants][6]\n  \n  [ [Refrigerants] ][7]\n  \n  ##### [Shop Reusable Ice Packs & Ice Cubes][8]\n  \n  [ [Retail] ][9]\n  \n  ##### [Temperature Monitoring][10]\n  \n  [ [Temperature Monitoring] ][11]\n* [Services ][12]\n  \n  ##### Services\n  \n  ##### [R3 Reuse\n  ##### Program][13]\n  \n  [ [R3 R