        "crawl_text": "Unlocked: Your order ships FREE! Today Only.\n* [(262) 236-3970][1]\n* [Log in][2]\n* [ Cart (0) ][3]\n* [Checkout][4]\n\n[\n][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* Products\u00a0\n  * [Personal Cooling][7]\n  * [Freezable Coolers][8]\n  * [Party Mat][9]\n  * [Health and Wellness][10]\n  * [FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts][11]\n* Learn\u00a0\n  * [FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions][12]\n  * [Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water][13]\n  * [Sizing and Fitting][14]\n* [About FlexiFreeze][15]\n* [ Home ][16]\n* [ Products\u00a0 ][17]\n  * [ Personal Cooling ][18]\n  * [ Freezable Coolers ][19]\n  * [ Party Mat ][20]\n  * [ Health and Wellness ][21]\n  * [ FlexiFreeze Ice and Refilll Inserts ][22]\n* [ Learn\u00a0 ][23]\n  * [ FlexiFreeze Cooler Instructions ][24]\n  * [ Why FlexiFreeze Uses Water ][25]\n  * [ Sizing and Fitting ][26]\n* [ About FlexiFreeze ][27]\n[FlexiFreeze Home Page Product Image]\n\n## What is Flexifreeze?\n\nFlexiFreeze is a sheet of 88 encased cubes filled with 100% water.\u00a0 There are channels which enable\nthe sheet to be flexible and fold-able even when frozen.\u00a0 Water (when frozen), actually absorbs 35%\nmore heat, pound for pound, as it thaws than chemical gels. FlexiFreeze coolers are high performance\n- the only coolers with real, purified ice built right in. A blanket of ice surrounds your food and\nbeverages keeping them refrigerator cold for optimal freshness, safety and taste.\u00a0 FlexiFreeze is\nthe cold without the wet.\n\n## [ Shop our best Sellers ][28]\n\n[\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\n[FlexiFreeze 9 can cooler, gray, open top]\nQuick Shop\nRefreezable Soft Sided Cooler\n*from* $ 24.99\n\n| /\n\n][29]\n[\n[Man wearing FlexiFreeze personal Series Ice Vest - blue, front view]\nQuick Shop\nFlexiFreeze Personal Cooling Ice Vest\n$ 99.99\n\n| /\n\n][30]\n[\n[FlexiFreeze cooler cubes bag of individual refreezable ice cubes spilling out]\n[FlexiFreeze cooler cubes bag of individual refreezable ice cubes spilling out]\