 patient care and enhancing the quality of peoples\u2019 lives.\n\nABOUT US\n\n# We make healthcare run better\u00ae\n\n### We are the largest provider of medical-surgical products and supply chain solutions serving all\n### points of care.\n\nFeatured Products Face Masks Made for Comfort and Protection Latex Surgical Gloves The most options\nfor quality protection Surgical Clipper and Blades Designed for safety, comfort and convenience\nNitrile Exam Gloves Outstanding versatility and protection Gemini Single Sterilization Wrap Proven\nBarrier Protection Surgical Drapes, Gowns and Packs Designed to optimize OR performance Featured\nSolutions Surgical Gowns \u2013 Donning and Doffing How to don and doff a surgical gown and education on\nAAMI levels. QuickSuite\u00ae OR Table Kit Medline\u2019s Quicksuite\u00ae O.R.Table Kit is one way to improve care\nin the OR and to reduce the incidence of skin irritation through moisture management.\n\n## Featured Products\n\n### Face Masks\n\nMade for Comfort and Protection\n\n[Face Masks]\n\n### Latex Surgical Gloves\n\nThe most options for quality protection\n\n[Latex Surgical Gloves]\n\n### Surgical Clipper and Blades\n\nDesigned for safety, comfort and convenience\n\n[Surgical Clipper and Blades]\n\n### Nitrile Exam Gloves\n\nOutstanding versatility and protection\n\n[Nitrile Exam Gloves]\n\n### Gemini Single Sterilization Wrap\n\nProven Barrier Protection\n\n[Gemini Single Sterilization Wrap]\n\n### Surgical Drapes, Gowns and Packs\n\nDesigned to optimize OR performance\n\n[Surgical Drapes, Gowns and Packs]\n\n## Featured Solutions\n\n[[Surgical Gowns \u2013 Donning and Doffing]][62]\n\n### Surgical Gowns \u2013 Donning and Doffing\n\nHow to don and doff a surgical gown and education on AAMI levels.\n\n[QuickSuite\u00ae OR Table Kit]\n\n### QuickSuite\u00ae OR Table Kit\n\nMedline\u2019s Quicksuite\u00ae O.R.Table Kit is one way to improve care in the OR and to reduce the incidence\nof skin irritation through moisture management.\n\n#### About Us\n* [Our Company][63]\n* [Code of Conduct][64]\n\n#### Careers\n* [How to Apply][65]\n\n#### Contact\n\nMedline Offices\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n[Medline-logo]\n\n**ABOUT US**\n\n[Our Company][66]\n\n[Code Of Conduct][67]\n\n**CAREERS**\n\n[How To Apply][68]\n\n**CONTACT**\n\nMedline Offices\n\n1800-266\u20139000\n\n\u00a9 2022 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n### Connect with Medline\n\n#### Contact Us\n\nWe're here to answer your questions and provide any guidance you need\n\n[Get in touch][69]\n\n#### Explore Careers\n\nFind opportunities to do your best work with us every day\n\n[Find your passion][70]\n\n#### Read our news stories\n\nLearn about our partnerships, products and solutions in the news.\n\n[Visit our newsroom][71]\n* [LEGAL][72]\n* [PRIVACY][73]\n\n[ [linkedin] ][74]\n\u00a9 2024 MedlineIndia. All rights reserved. We make healthcare run better is a trademark and Medline\nis a registered trademark of Medline India. All trademarks, regardless of whether they appear with a\ntrademark symbol, are the property of their respective owners unless otherwise noted. Trademark\ndesignations refer to the India only\n\n[1]: https://in.medlineasia.com/\n[2]: https://in.medlineasia.com/catalogsearch/advanced/\n[3]: #contentarea\n[4]: #store.menu\n[5]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin\n[6]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/nursing-supplies\n[7]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/stethoscope\n[8]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/accessories\n[9]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/clipper-blade\n[10]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/cssd-others\n[11]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/electro-surgery\n[12]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/quicksuite\n[13]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/scalpels-blades\n[14]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/skin-markers\n[15]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/sterlization-wrap\n[16]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/surgical-drapes\n[17]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/face-mask\n[18]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/surgical-gowns\n[19]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/therapy-rehabilitation\n[20]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/medication-delivery\n[21]: https://in.medlineasia.com/productsin/oximeter\n[22]: https://in.medlin"
