und the world.\nLearn More\u00a0\nAbout Us\nLearn more about our 140 year legacy\u2026\nLearn More\u00a0\n\n## Delivering Value at Every Step of the Value Chain\n\nWe are designers, manufacturers, product distributors, service providers and healthcare partners.\nOur unique expertise and control across our full value chain differentiates Owens & Minor in the\nhealthcare solutions space. Discover how by watching this video.\n* * Customer Portals\n    * * [Bill Only Management][65]\n      * [OM MarketPlace][66]\n    * * [QSight][67]\n* * Connect With Us\n    * * [Contact Us][68]\n      * [Careers][69]\n* * Follow Us\n    * [Facebook][70]\n    * [\ud835\udd4fX][71]\n    * [Linkedin][72]\n    * [Instagram][73]\n\n\u00a9 2026. All rights reserved.\n* [Website Terms of Use][74]\n* [Privacy Policy][75]\n* [Web Content Statement][76]\n* [Transparency in Coverage \u2013 UHC][77]\n* [Glossary][78]\n* [Sitemap][79]\n* [CA SB 261][80]\n* [Owens & Minor FAQ][81]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.owens-minor.com/\n[3]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[4]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/\n[5]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distribution/3pl-services/\n[6]: https://www.owens-minor.com/distr [Skip to content][1]\n[[Owens & Minor][Owens & Minor]][2]\n* [Distribution & Logistics][3]\n  * Close\n  * [Distribution & Logistics][4]\n  * * [3PL Services][5]\n    * [Customer-Owned Inventory Management][6]\n    * [Emergency & Pandemic Preparedness][7]\n    * [Expanded Access Standardization][8]\n  * * [Logical Unit of Measure (LUM)][9]\n    * [OMFreight+][10]\n    * [Supplier Management][11]\n    * [Supply Chain Consulting][12]\n* [Procedural Services][13]\n  * Close\n  * [Procedural Services][14]\n  * * [QSight][15]\n      * [QSight Tissue Management][16]\n      * [QSight Kanban][17]\n      * [QSight RFID][18]\n      * [QSight Bill Only Management][19]\n  * * [Medical Kitting Services][20]\n    * [SurgiTrack: Unitized Delivery][21]\n    * [PANDAC: Suture Management][22]\n*