        "crawl_text": "[ Skip to content][1]\n\nCold therapy wraps are a simple, cost-efficient alternative to cold therapy machines and cooling\nsystems.\n* [Home][2]\n* [About][3]\n* [Clinical Use][4]\n* [Shop][5]\n* [FAQs][6]\n* [Contact Us][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [About][9]\n* [Clinical Use][10]\n* [Shop][11]\n* [FAQs][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][14]\n* [Home][15]\n* [About][16]\n* [Clinical Use][17]\n* [Shop][18]\n* [FAQs][19]\n* [Contact Us][20]\nMenu\n* [Home][21]\n* [About][22]\n* [Clinical Use][23]\n* [Shop][24]\n* [FAQs][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][27]\n\n## Smart cold therapy wraps\n\nActive Ice cold therapy wraps are a simple, effective treatment throughout the recovery process. Our\ngel pack systems have large adjustable straps that provide continuous cold compression therapy for\ntwo or more hours. Active Ice packs provide a faster recovery without the hassle of expensive\nmachines. Make Active Ice cold therapy wraps part of your post-surgical standard of care and witness\nwhat our simple and affordable products can do for your patients\u2019 recovery.\n[ SHOp NOW ][28]\n\n## About Us\n\n## Our Mission\n\nTo provide safe and effective cold therapy products to post-surgical patients that will last\nthroughout recovery and beyond.\n\n## Customer Service\n\nWhen you do business with Active Ice you can expect a personalized approach, no matter the size of\nyour care facility. Whether you order direct or through major medical distribution, Active Ice\nproducts are available nationwide. Our attention to quality ensures that our products are guaranteed\nto be free from manufacturing defects, or we will replace them hassle-free. Continuous stock means\nno surprise backorders and all items ship within one business day. Our on-site customer service team\nmembers are friendly, knowledgeable, efficient and dedicated to helping you provide the best care\nfor your patients.\n[ Read More ][29]\n\n## Featured Collection\n\n## NEW ARRIVAL\n* [[Ice Jaw]][30][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][31]\n  Ice Products [\n  \n  ## Ice Jaw\n  \n  ][32] [REQUEST A QUOTE][33]\n* [[Ice Shoulder]][34][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][35]\n  Ice Products [\n  \n  ## Ice Shoulder\n  \n  ][36] [REQUEST A QUOTE][37]\n* [[Ice Ankle]][38][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][39]\n  Ice Products [\n  \n  ## Ice Ankle\n  \n  ][40] [REQUEST A QUOTE][41]\n\n[ Shop now all product collection ][42]\n\n## iNNER ICE TECHNOLOGY\n\nActive Ice products are easy to use and time-efficient. With wraps and cold pack inserts designed to\nfit any area of the body, our products are a smart solution for both injuries and post-operative\ncare. Our innovative healing wraps save time for doctors, nurses, trainers, physical therapists, and\npatients, and are a cost-efficient alternative to traditional cold therapy machines.\n\n### Puncture-resistant laminated film\n\n### Interior ice packs extend cold time\n\n### Slow-thaw technology gel\n\n### Longevity-inducing strong seal\n\n## Featured Products\n* [[Ice Jaw]][43][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][44]\n  Ice Products [\n  \n  ## Ice Jaw\n  \n  ][45] [REQUEST A QUOTE][46]\n* [[Soft Knee]][47][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][48]\n  Knee [\n  \n  ## Soft Knee\n  \n  ][49] [REQUEST A QUOTE][50]\n* [[Soft Shoulder]][51][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][52]\n  Shoulder [\n  \n  ## Soft Shoulder\n  \n  ][53] [REQUEST A QUOTE][54]\n* [[Soft Universal]][55][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][56]\n  Soft Products [\n  \n  ## Soft Universal\n  \n  ][57] [REQUEST A QUOTE][58]\n* [[Soft Back]][59][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][60]\n  Back [\n  \n  ## Soft Back\n  \n  ][61] [REQUEST A QUOTE][62]\n* [[Soft Foot]][63][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][64]\n  Foot [\n  \n  ## Soft Foot\n  \n  ][65] [REQUEST A QUOTE][66]\n* [[Soft Hip]][67][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][68]\n  Hip [\n  \n  ## Soft Hip\n  \n  ][69] [REQUEST A QUOTE][70]\n* [[Ice Shoulder]][71][ REQUEST A QUOTE ][72]\n  Ice Products [\n  \n  ## Ice Shoulder\n  \n  ][73] [REQUEST A QUOTE][74]\n\n## What our client say\n\nThe use of your Active Ice packs have helped us out considerably with the treatment of our\nUniversity of Oklahoma hockey players. We use them both in the athletic training room as well as the\nclinic where we see our athletes for further rehabilitation\u2026and have put your Active Ice shoulder\npacks to good use.\n\n**Andrew Hayes**\n\nI am a sports official here in Connecticut and underwent knee surgery. Your fine product was given\nto me in the hospital along with the gel pack system\u2026. I have to tell you that icing my knee for a\nweek was actually a pleasure. The packs stay cold. The \u201cblue pouch\u201d is convenient, snug and\ncomfortable.\n\n**Shams W.Pawel**\n\nAs the director of a busy outpatient physical therapy clinic\u2026I have used Active Ice for the past\nthree years. I have found Active Ice products superior to competitors\u2019 products in both quality and\naffordability..\n\n**Jhon Dik**\n\n## frequently asked questions\n\nQ: How can I order?\n\nThere are three options for ordering Active Ice products:\n1. Call our office at 1 (877) 979-2393\n2. Email your purchase order to\u00a0[orders@activeice.com][75]\n3. Start a chat with us on the website\n\nQ: Does the product contain latex?\n\nA: Our products are not made with natural rubber latex.\n\nQ: Are gel ingredie [ Skip to content][1]\n\nCold therapy wraps are a simple, cost-efficient alternative to cold therapy machines and cooling\nsystems.\n* [Home][2]\n* [About][3]\n* [Clinical Use][4]\n* [Shop][5]\n* [FAQs][6]\n* [Contact Us][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [About][9]\n* [Clinical Use][10]\n* [Shop][11]\n* [FAQs][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][14]\n* [Home][15]\n* [About][16]\n* [Clinical Use][17]\n* [Shop][18]\n* [FAQs][19]\n* [Contact Us][20]\nMenu\n* [Home][21]\n* [About][22]\n* [Clinical Use][23]\n* [Shop][24]\n* [FAQs][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][27]\n\n## Smart cold therapy wraps\n\nActive Ice cold therapy wraps are a simple, effective treatment throughout the recovery process. Our\ngel pack systems have large adjustable