        "crawl_text": "top of page\n[[Coldice gel ice refrigerants insulated shipping containers cold chain]][1]\n* [\n  Products\n  ][2]\n  * [\n    Gel Ice Refrigerants\n    ][3]\n    * [\n      Cold Ice - Our Premium Grade\n      ][4]\n    * [\n      EverCold Gel\n      ][5]\n    * [\n      EverCold Foam Refrgerant Brick\n      ][6]\n    * [\n      EverCold Ice Blanket\n      ][7]\n    * [\n      TheraFlex - Hot & Cold Therapy Packs\n      ][8]\n  * [\n    Insulated Shipping Containers\n    ][9]\n    * [\n      EPS Foam Insulated Shipping Containers\n      ][10]\n    * [\n      EverTemp Urethane Shipping Containers\n      ][11]\n    * [\n      Kangaroo Mailers\n      ][12]\n    * [\n      ThermaFoil Bubble Pouches & Rolls\n      ][13]\n  * [\n    Temperature Indicators\n    ][14]\n    * [\n      Coldmark Temperature Indicators\n      ][15]\n    * [\n      Warmmark Temperature Indicators\n      ][16]\n    * [\n      Marathon Tempcheck3\n      ][17]\n* [\n  Sustainability\n  ][18]\n* [\n  Contact Us\n  ][19]\n* [\n  FAQ\n  ][20]\n* [\n  MSDS Sheets\n  ][21]\n1. Home/\n[Gel Ice Refrigerants insulated shipping containers thermal packaing cold chain]\n\nFor over 40 years, Cold Ice has remained the industry standard in performance, durability and safety\nin Cold Chain shipping products.\n\n\u00a0\n\nCold Ice offers a wide variety of [gel ice refrigerants][22],[\u00a0insulated shipping\ncontainers][23]\u00a0and temperature monitors designed to meet the shipping requirements of any\ntemperature sensitive product. Our Cold Chain products are the most cost effective available today.\nDesigned to withstand even the toughest shipping conditions.\n\n\u00a0\n\nCold Ice refrigerants freeze faster and maintain cold longer than any other product available. \u00a0With\na variety of weights, sizes and freeze points to choose from, you can select exactly the right\ncombination of performance and price for your shipping needs.\n\n\u00a0\n\nOur premium[\u00a0Cold Ice gel ice refrigerant][24] contains a semi-solid, non-toxic, biodegradable gel\nformulation. Cold Ice is the preferred choice for pharmaceutical, biotech, diagnostic laboratory,\nagricultural, floral and gourmet food industries.\n\n\u00a0\n\nTo complement our gel ice, we offer a full line of\u00a0[insulated shipping containers][25]. Cold Ice\n\u00a0insulated shipping containers are C.F.C. free and are designed to meet the highest industry\nstandards for strength, durability and temperature control. Manufactured using the highest grade of\nurethane or molded expanded polystyrene (E.P.S.), Cold Ice has an insulated container for shipping\nand protecting even the most temperature sensitive products.\n\n\u00a0\n\nCall us today. Our team of thermal packaging experts will help design a packaging system for you.\n\n[gel ice refrigerants ]\nGel Ice Refrigerants\nA complete line of high quality refrigerants for the pharmaceutical, biotech, floral, and gourmet\nfoods industry.\n[insulated-shipping-containers]\nInsulated Shipping Containers\nCold Ice offers a complete line of insulated shipping containers: EPS foam, Urethane and radiant air\ncell insulation.\n[temperature indicators]\nTemperature Indicators\nA complete line of temperature indicators, monitors and recorders.\n[theraflex hot and cold thearapy packs]\nHot/Cold Therapy Packs\nThe most advanced hot/cold therapy packs available.\n\nContact Us\n\n9999 San Leandro Street\nOakland, CA 94603 U.S.A.\n\nPhone: (800) 525-4435\nLocal: (510) 568-8129\nFax: (510) 568-2355\n\n###### Cold Chain Products\n\nPharmaceuticals\nDiagnostic Laboratories\nBiotech\nBlood & Tissue Banks\nGourmet Foods\nFloral\nAgricultural\n\n###### Health Care Products\n\nTheraFlex\u00ae\n\u00a0\n\n###### Proudly Made in USA Since 1982\n\n###### Over 40 Years of Excellence\n\n\u00a9 2024 by Cold Ice Inc.\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.coldice.com\n[2]: https://www.coldice.com/products\n[3]: https://www.coldice.com/gel-ice-refrigerants-products\n[4]: https://www.coldice.com/gel-ice-refrigerants-cold-ice\n[5]: https://www.coldice.com/evercold-gel-ice-refrigerant\n[6]: https://www.coldice.com/evercold-foam-refrgerant-brick\n[7]: https://www.coldice.com/evercold-ice-blanket\n[8]: https://www.coldice.com/theraflex-hot-cold-therapy-packs\n[9]: https://www.coldice.com/insulated-shipping-containers-products\n[10]: https://www.coldice.com/eps-foam-insulated-shipping-containers\n[11]: https://www.coldice.com/urethane-insulated-shipping-containers-evertemp\n[12]: https://www.coldice.com/kangaroo-mailers\n[13]: https://www.coldice.com/thermafoil-bubble-pouches\n[14]: https://www.coldice.com/temperature-indicators-products\n[15]: https://www.coldice.com/coldmark\n[16]: https://www.coldice.com/warmmark\n[17]: https://www.coldice.com/marathontempcheck3\n[18]: https://www.coldice.com/gel-ice-sustainabilty-environmental-friendly\n[19]: https://www.coldice.com/contact-us\n[20]: https://www.coldice.com/faq\n[21]: https://www.coldice.com/coldice-msds-sheets\n[22]: https://www.coldice.com/gel-ice-refrigerants-products\n[23]: https://www.coldice.com/insulated-shipping-containers-products\n[24]: https://www.coldice.com/gel-ice-refrigerants-cold-ice\n[25]: https://www.coldice.com/insulated-shipping-containers-products top of page\n[[Coldice gel ice refrigerants insulated shipping containers cold chain]][1]\n* [\n  Products\n  ][2]\n  * [\n    Gel Ice Refrigerants\n    ][3]\n    * [\n      Cold Ice - Our Premium Grade\n      ][4]\n    * [\n      EverCold Gel\n      ][5]\n    * [\n      EverCold Foam Refrgerant Brick\n      ][6]\n    * [\n      EverCold Ice Blanket\n      ][7]\n    * [\n      TheraFlex - Hot & Cold Therapy Packs\n      ][8]\n  * [\n    Insulated Shipping Containers\n    ][9]\n    * [\n      EPS Foam Insulated Shipping Containers\n      ][10]\n    * [\n      EverTemp Urethane Shipping Containers\n      ][11]\n    * [\n      Kangaroo Mailers\n      ][12]\n    * [\n      ThermaFoil Bubble Pouches & Rolls\n      ][13]\n  * [\n    Temperat