        "crawl_text": "[Skip to Content][1]\n* Check out Supplier Passport - collaborative supplier risk intelligence\n  \n  [Learn More][2]\nClose\n[[Craft Logo]][3]\nMenu\n* [Platform][4]\n* [Government][5]\n* [Aerospace and Defense][6]\n* [Other Industries][7]\n  * [\n    \n    Higher Education\n    \n    Protect grants and ensure compliance across your institution.\n    \n    ][8]\n  * [\n    \n    Financial Services\n    \n    Navigate challenges within the financial services sector.\n    \n    ][9]\n  * [\n    \n    Manufacturing\n    \n    Optimize risk management in manufacturing.\n    \n    ][10]\n* [Resources][11]\n  * [\n    \n    Resources\n    \n    Learn more about Craft, our vision, and what we\u2019re doing to strengthen global supply chain\n    resilience.\n    \n    ][12]\n  * [\n    \n    Blog\n    \n    Explore Craft thought leadership from our technology and supply chain experts.\n    \n    ][13]\n  * [\n    \n    Events\n    \n    Get the latest industry news, topics, and trends from Craft experts.\n    \n    ][14]\n* [Company][15]\n  * [\n    \n    About Us\n    \n    Learn about our mission, world-class technology, and esteemed investors.\n    \n    ][16]\n  * [\n    \n    Culture & Careers\n    \n    Learn about our culture and check out our current job postings.\n    \n    ][17]\n  * [\n    \n    Newsroom\n    \n    Stay up to date on our latest news and announcements.\n    \n    ][18]\n  * [\n    \n    Contact Us\n    \n    Learn more about the Craft platform and how we can mitigate risk to your supply chain.\n    \n    ][19]\n* [Login][20]\n* [Request a Demo][21]\n\n# Mission-critical supplier intelligence\n\nAI-powered supplier evaluation, continuous monitoring, and risk management\n\nTrusted by Defense Primes, Fortune 500 Enterprises and the U.S. Federal Government\n\n[U.S. Department of Homeland Security] [US Air Force Logo] [Lockheed Martin Logo]\n\n## Advanced Intelligence for every stage of the supplier lifecycle\n\nSupplier Evaluation\n\nContinuous Monitoring\n\n[\n\n## Sourcing Diligence\n\nEvaluate prospective suppliers and inform RFP/RFQ decisions with confidence using verified third\nparty data.\n\nLearn more\n][22] [\n\n## Supplier Qualification\n\nAccelerate onboarding and qualification by replacing manual surveys with automatically sourced\nintelligence and evidence.\n\nLearn more\n][23] [\n\n## Risk Management\n\nContinuously detect, investigate, and prioritize emerging risks so teams can respond faster and\nstrengthen supply chain resilience.\n\nLearn more\n][24] [\n\n## Relationship Management\n\nEquip teams with on-demand intelligence to know your suppliers, enforce governance, and make the\nbest day-to-day decisions.\n\nLearn more\n][25]\n\nPlatform Architecture\n\n## Unified, AI integrated system of intelligence\n\nOne system to identify, investigate, monitor, and manage supplier risk with the speed and visibility\nteams need\n\nData Fabric\nIntelligence Engine\nWorkspace\n\nData Fabric\n\n## Unified source of supplier truth\n\nAggregated, normalized, and enriched supplier data in one centralized, trusted foundation\n* 250k+ supplier attributes and real-time news from 20+ data pipelines\n* Agentic intelligence to fetch, refresh, normalize, and resolve records across sources\n* Network graph mapping supplier hierarchies, dependencies, and relationships\n\nDecision intelligence\n\n## Data in. High-fidelity intelligence out.\n\nTurn supplier data into decision-quality risk signals and performance insight\n* AI-native risk detection, scoring, and alerts across supplier portfolios\n* Configurable frameworks to assess risk across 6+ domains\n* Intelligence integrated into the tools, workflows, and reports where teams work most\n\nIntelligent workspace\n\n## Where supplier decisions happen\n\nMonitor, analyze, and act in one AI-integrated workspace with alerts, tasks, and collaboration tools\n* Generate comprehensive AI supplier risk assessments in seconds\n* Continuously monitor suppliers with workflows to alert category owners, investigate issues, and\n  drive follow-up actions\n* Organize suppliers by category, region, or spend and collaborate on notes, approvals, and\n  remediation\n\n## Trusted by leading global enterprises\n\nCraft powers procurement intelligence for the world\u2019s most forward-thinking organizations.\n\n> \u201cI was able to build my portfolio in less than an hour, and with previous tools it would have\n> taken a week. I was overwhelmed by the intuitive nature, the capability, and the freedom.\u201d\n\nGlobal Category Manager, US Air Force\n\n\n[US Air Force Logo]\n[US Air Force Logo]\n\nResults\n\n90%\n\nreduction in time to deliver due diligence\n\n87%\n\nfaster supplier onboarding\n\nSolutions\n\n[View government solutions][26] [Get the gov eBook][27]\n\n> \u201cNo supplier is going to call you beforehand to tell you something negative is going to happen, so\n> using Craft to minimize risk much earlier has proved invaluable for us.\u201d\n\nDirector, Supply Chain & Sustainability\n\n\nResults\n\n2,000+\n\ncritical suppliers monitored\n\n95%\n\nof total procurement spend monitored\n\nSolutions\n\n[Read case study][28] [Explore the platform][29]\n\n> \u201cCraft has transformed our approach to supplier risk managem [Skip to Content][1]\n* Check out Supplier Passport - collaborative supplier risk intelligence\n  \n  [Learn More][2]\nClose\n[[Craft Logo]][3]\nMenu\n* [Platform][4]\n* [Government][5]\n* [Aerospace and Defense][6]\n* [Other Industries][7]\n  * [\n    \n    Higher Education\n    \n    Protect grants and ensure compliance across your institution.\n    \n    ][8]\n  * [\n    \n    Financial Services\n    \n    Navigate challenges within the financial services sector.\n    \n    ][9]\n  * [\n    \n    Manufacturing\n    \n    Optimize risk management in manufacturing.\n    \n    ][10]\n* [Resources][11]\n  * [\n    \n    Resources\n    \n    Learn more about Craft, our vision, and what we\u2019re doing to streng