        "crawl_text": "[ Skip to content ][1]\n* Products\n  Products\n  * Incrediseal\u00ae Tapes\n    Incrediseal\u00ae Tapes\n    * [ Packaging Tape ][2]\n    * [ Masking Tape ][3]\n    * [ Filament Tape ][4]\n    * [ Double Sided Tape ][5]\n    * [ Repulpable Tape ][6]\n    * [ Specialty Tape ][7]\n  * Packaging\n    Packaging\n    * [ Advanced Air System ][8]\n    * [ Bubble Wrap Film ][9]\n    * [ Hybrid Bubble Wrap Film ][10]\n    * [ Large Air Pillow Film ][11]\n  * Protective Equipment\n    Protective Equipment\n    * [ Surgical Masks ][12]\n    * [ N95 & KN95 Masks ][13]\n    * [ Gloves ][14]\n    * [ Gowns ][15]\n    * [ Emergency Blankets ][16]\n    * [ Marathon Blankets ][17]\n  * Pharmacy Supplies\n    Pharmacy Supplies\n    * [ Pharmacy Bags ][18]\n    * [ Ice Packs & Cold Chain ][19]\n* About\n  About\n  * Information\n    Information\n    * [ Shipping Policy ][20]\n    * [ Refund Policy ][21]\n    * [ Terms & Conditions ][22]\n  * [ Contact Us ][23]\n* [ Contact Us ][24]\n* [ 410-825-8300 ][25]\n[ Log in][26]\n\n# [\n# [Universal Packaging]\n# ][27]\n* Products\n  * [ Incrediseal\u00ae Tapes ][28]\n    * [ Packaging Tape ][29]\n    * [ Masking Tape ][30]\n    * [ Filament Tape ][31]\n    * [ Double Sided Tape ][32]\n    * [ Repulpable Tape ][33]\n    * [ Specialty Tape ][34]\n  * [ Packaging ][35]\n    * [ Advanced Air System ][36]\n    * [ Bubble Wrap Film ][37]\n    * [ Hybrid Bubble Wrap Film ][38]\n    * [ Large Air Pillow Film ][39]\n  * [ Protective Equipment ][40]\n    * [ Surgical Masks ][41]\n    * [ N95 & KN95 Masks ][42]\n    * [ Gloves ][43]\n    * [ Gowns ][44]\n    * [ Emergency Blankets ][45]\n    * [ Marathon Blankets ][46]\n  * [ Pharmacy Supplies ][47]\n    * [ Pharmacy Bags ][48]\n    * [ Ice Packs & Cold Chain ][49]\n* About\n  * [ Information ][50]\n    * [ Shipping Policy ][51]\n    * [ Refund Policy ][52]\n    * [ Terms & Conditions ][53]\n  * [ Contact Us ][54]\n* [ Contact Us ][55]\n* [ 410-825-8300 ][56]\n\nSearch\n[ Log in ][57][ Cart][58]\n\n## Item added to your cart\n\n[View cart][59] Check out Continue shopping\n\n## **Advanced packaging solutions for growing enterprises**\n\n[Shop Packaging][60]\n* ### Incrediseal\u00ae Tapes\n  \n  The IncrediSeal brand of pressure sensitive tapes was established to solve packaging issues for\n  the end user.\n  \n  [Shop Now\u00a0 ][61]\n* ### Packaging\n  \n  Years of research and development have been dedicated to creating the best possible products for\n  some of the most difficult applications and environments.\n  \n  [Shop Now\u00a0 ][62]\n* ### Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) for Medical and Business Use\n  \n  Personal Protective Equipment is available in bulk quantities and is critical for all businesses\n  to open safely\n  \n  [Shop Now\u00a0 ][63]\n* ### Pharmacy Supplies\n  \n  Shop our healthcare and long-term care selection of color line haul bags, gel packs,\n  insulated mailers, ziplock bags, mylar foil blankets, and more\n  \n  [Shop Now\u00a0 ][64]\n\n## **Trusted By**\n\n## **From Our Customers**\n* \"The staff has been very responsive \u2013 easy to reach and pleasant to talk to. My orders arrive\n  complete and on time. I\u2019m always amazed at how quick their turnaround is!\"\n  \n  **Dee**, Metal Stamping Facility, Nashville, TN\n* \"When my now sales rep first walked in to try to sell their Incrediseal tape to me, I thought\n  \u201cAnother tape salesman\u201d. They convinced me to try a roll of their Incrediseal tape. After trying\n  it, it really does stick better and I like being able to buy direct from the Manufacturer.\"\n  \n  **Chris**, Pharmaceutical Industry, Baltimore, MD\n\n[IncrediSeal Tape, premium tape at factory direct prices. Buy tapes to fit your project that are\nmade to perform - masking, packaging, filament, permanent bond, double sided mounting, electrical,\nduct, and bi-directional filament.]\n\n## **Nothing Grips Tighter.** IncrediSeal\u00ae Tapes\n\nThe IncrediSeal brand of pressure sensitive tapes was established to solve packaging issues for the\nend user. Years of research and development have been dedicated to creating the best possible\nproducts for some of the most difficult applications and environments. Based in Hunt Valley,\nMaryland, we service the entire United States with distribution across the nation.\n\n[ Learn More About Incrediseal\u00ae ][65]\n* ### **Custom Slitting**\n  \n  IncrediSeal tapes are available in custom slit widths upon request. Our minimum slit width is 1/8\u201d\n  or 3 mm wide on rolls that are 6.5\u201d (165 mm in diameter). Custom slit tape ships within 24 hours\n  of when the order is received.\n* ### **Custom Printing**\n  \n  We use the rotogravure process to print our polypropylene tapes giving them the crispest image in\n  the industry. The image is permanent and can\u2019t rub off because it is printed before the adhesive\n  is applied.\n* ### **Free Shipping**\n  \n  FREE Shipping on orders of $500 or more. Same day shipping on orders received before 12:00 PM EST.\n  We can lock in pricing to the resin/plastics pricing index.\n\n## **Getting a quote takes just a minute! Call us today at 410-825-8300**\n\n[Contact Us][66]\n\n\n## **Converting**\n\nUniversal Packaging offers a full line of fulfi [ Skip to content ][1]\n* Products\n  Products\n  * Incrediseal\u00ae Tapes\n    Incrediseal\u00ae Tapes\n    * [ Packaging Tape ][2]\n    * [ Masking Tape ][3]\n    * [ Filament Tape ][4]\n    * [ Double Sided Tape ][5]\n    * [ Repulpable Tape ][6]\n    * [ Specialty Tape ][7]\n  * Packaging\n    Packaging\n    * [ Advanced Air System ][8]\n    * [ Bubble Wrap Film ][9]\n    * [ Hybrid Bubble Wrap Film ][10]\n    * [ Large Air Pillow Film ][11]\n  * Protective Equipment\n    Protective Equipment\n    * [ Surgical Masks ][12]\n    * [ N95 & KN95 Masks ][13]\n    * [ Gloves ][14]\n    * [ Gowns ][15]\n    * [ Emergency Blankets ][16]\n    * [ Marathon Blankets ][17]\n  * Pharmacy Supplies\n    Pharmacy Supplies\n    * [