        "crawl_text": "[ Skip to content][1]\n[\n[cropped-21.png]\n][2]\nMenu\n* [Home][3]\n* [Products][4]\n  * [Pouches][5]\n  * [Container][6]\n  * [Sheets][7]\n  * [Thermocol box][8]\n* [Applications][9]\n* [About Us][10]\n* [Enquire][11]\n* [Blog][12]\n* [Events][13]\n[ Call Us ][14]\n\n# Dove Gel Packs\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\n\n**DOVE Ice Gel** Packs are engineered to deliver superior cooling efficiency, making them ideal for\nmedical, food preservation, pharmaceutical, and packaging applications. With a strong focus on\nquality and reliability, our products are designed to meet your temperature management needs with\nmaximum performance and durability.\n\n[ Enquiry ][15]\n\n# Application\n\n[ice gel packs] FOR EMERGENCY PURPOSE\n[injection use ice gel] MEDICAL INDUSTRY\n[Ice gel] FOR COOL DRINKS\n[ice gel] DAIRY PRODUCTS\n[ice gel] FLOWER INDUSTRY\n[transport] TRANSPORTATION\n\n# Our Services\n\n### On Time Arrival\n\nWe ensure every order is delivered promptly, exactly as promised.\n\n### Quality Service\n\nTrusted support with timely responses and solutions designed around customer needs.\n\n### Quick Freezing\n\nOur gel ice packs are designed for quick freezing, ensuring they are ready to use in less time while\ndelivering consistent and long-lasting cooling performance.\n\n### Reusable\n\nOur reusable gel packs provide long-lasting performance and can be refrozen and used again, making\nthem a cost-effective cooling solution.\n\n### Customer Support\n\nWe provide responsive customer support to ensure a smooth and hassle-free experience.\n\n# Keep your products fresh and protected for up to 24 hours with leak-proof, mess-free, and\n# dependable cooling performance.\n\n[ Call Us ][16]\n\n## About Us\n\nDove Ice Gel Packs keep your shipments colder for longer with durable, leak-proof, and lightweight\ndesign. Ideal for food, groceries, and pharmaceuticals, our thermoplastic gel packs ensure reliable\ncold chain delivery. With over 20 years of innovation, Dove gel packs offers high-quality, versatile\ncooling solutions.\n\n[ Facebook ][17] [ Linkedin ][18] Youtube [ Instagram ][19] [ Whatsapp ][20]\n\n## Quick Links\n\nMenu\n* [Home][21]\n* [Products][22]\n  * [Pouches][23]\n  * [Container][24]\n  * [Sheets][25]\n  * [Thermocol box][26]\n* [Applications][27]\n* [About Us][28]\n* [Enquire][29]\n* [Blog][30]\n* [Events][31]\n\n## Contact Us\n* 12, Rajiv Nagar, P.H.Road, Maduravoyal, Chennai 600095\n* 044-23870015 / +91 86088 11201\n* sales@dovegelpacks.com\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 | Powered by Dove Gel Packs\nScroll to Top\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com\n[3]: /\n[4]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=3937\n[5]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=1953\n[6]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=4372\n[7]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=4373\n[8]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=4375\n[9]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=3938\n[10]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=1957\n[11]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=3940\n[12]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?cat=164\n[13]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?cat=165\n[14]: tel:04423870015\n[15]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/enquire/\n[16]: tel:04423870015\n[17]: https://www.facebook.com/dove.gelpacks\n[18]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/dove-gel-packs-154176224/\n[19]: https://www.instagram.com/dovegelpacks/\n[20]: https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vapq05N3AzNLpO2tkO1x\n[21]: /\n[22]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=3937\n[23]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=1953\n[24]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=4372\n[25]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=4373\n[26]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=4375\n[27]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=3938\n[28]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=1957\n[29]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?page_id=3940\n[30]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?cat=164\n[31]: https://www.dovegelpacks.com/?cat=165 [ Skip to content][1]\n[\n[croppe