rry Less\n\n# Scale Faster Worry Less\n\nWe are the one-stop solution helping companies meet all their cold chain and packaging needs\n\nWe are the one-stop solution helping companies meet all their cold chain and packaging needs\n\n[\n\nContact Us\n\n][79]\n[\n\nContact Us\n\n][80]\n\nOur Story\n\nOur Story\n\n## Meet Fidelity Paper\n\n## Meet Fidelity Paper\n\nEstablished in 1957, Fidelity Paper was founded by Pierre Guariglia, envisioning a company with a\nclear focus: to build business partnerships with customers by providing commitment, quality,\nservice, and value. These key ingredients have allowed Fidelity Paper to grow and thrive.\n\nEstablished in 1957, Fidelity Paper was founded by Pierre Guariglia, envisioning a company with a\nclear focus: to build business partnerships with customers by providing commitment, quality,\nservice, and value. These key ingredients have allowed Fidelity Paper to grow and thrive.\n\nAs Fidelity Paper expanded from a local to a national distribution company, it now services many\nFortune 500 companies across the country. Our National Distribution System is built on a true\njust-in-time program, centered on the customer, and minimizing supplies by delivering materials on a\ndaily and weekly. We have been a proactive supplier in vendor-managed inventory, partnering with our\ncustomers to streamline the supplier base and capitalize on volume discounts.\n\nAs Fidelity Paper expanded from a local to a national distribution company, it now services many\nFortune 500 companies across the country. Our National Distribution System is built on a true\njust-in-time program, centered on the customer, and minimizing supplies by delivering materials on a\ndaily and weekly. We have been a proactive supplier in vendor-managed inventory, partnering with our\ncustomers to streamline the supplier base and capitalize on volume discounts.\n\n## Our National Coverage 24/7\n\n## Our National Coverage 24/7\n\n# Coast to Coast distribution centers wit