        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[[FlexiKold]][2]\n[[FlexiKold]][3]\n\n# FlexiKold Gel Ice Packs Brand\n\nSay goodbye to stiff, clunky ice packs\u2014FlexiKold Gel Cold Packs stay flexible even when frozen for a\nsnug, effective fit. Built with a durable nylon exterior and double-sealed seams, these\nprofessional-grade cold packs deliver long-lasting, leak-proof relief. Whether you\u2019re tackling\nmuscle pain, swelling, or post-workout soreness, enjoy consistent cold therapy trusted by medical\npros.\n\n## Top FlexiKold Gel Ice Packs\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Standard Large - 10.5\" x 14.5\")\n\nThis versatile, heavy-duty cold pack is the brand\u2019s flagship product, designed with a proprietary\ngel that stays pliable at low temperatures to contour perfectly to the back, shoulder, or hip.\n\n[ Check Price ][4]\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Half Size - 7.5\" x 11.5\")\n\nThe Half Size model offers a more targeted application for smaller areas like the neck, wrist, or\nknee, providing the same high-contact cooling in a compact, portable footprint.\n\n[ Check Price ][5]\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Neck Contour - 23\" x 8\")\n\nSpecially shaped to drape over the upper back and shoulders, this model features a curved design\nthat ensures therapeutic cold reaches the cervical spine and trapezius muscles simultaneously.\n\n[ Check Price ][6]\n\nFlexiKold offers a premium selection of reusable gel cold packs, designed to provide targeted relief\nfor various body areas with their flexible, long-lasting cooling technology.\n\n\n## Product Categories\n\n### Standard Size Packs (10.5\u2033 x 14.5\u2033)\n\nPerfect for larger muscle groups like the back, quads, hamstrings, calves, shins, shoulders, and\nknees, these packs provide broad coverage and deep cooling relief.\n\n### Half-Size Packs (7.5\u2033 x 11.5\u2033)\n\nIdeal for smaller or more precise areas, these packs are great for the foot, ankle, shin, calf,\nquad, forearm, elbow, hand, wrist, and neck, ensuring effective localized therapy.\n\n### Neck-Specific Packs (23\u2033 Long)\n\nDesigned to comfortably wrap around the neck, lower back, shoulder, and knee, this pack provides\ntargeted relief while allowing for easy movement.\n\n### Circular Packs (4-Inch Flexible Gel Circles)\n\nThese small, flexible cold packs come with straps for secure placement, making them perfect for\ntargeted relief on joints and smaller body areas.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\n**Johnathan Reed**\nI\u2019ve been using the **FlexiKold Standard Size Pack** for months now, and it has been a lifesaver for\nmy lower back pain. The size is perfect\u2014it covers my entire lower back, providing even, long-lasting\ncold therapy. Unlike other ice packs that become stiff and uncomfortable, this one remains flexible,\neven straight from the freezer. I love that it stays cold for nearly 40 minutes, which is much\nlonger than other brands I\u2019ve tried. Whether I use it after workouts or just to relax after a long\nday, this gel pack is a must-have!\n\n**Sarah Montgomery**\nI purchased the **Neck-Specific Pack** after dealing with persistent neck and shoulder tension, and\nI couldn\u2019t be happier! The length is just right\u2014it wraps around my neck comfortably and stays in\nplace without slipping. The gel remains soft even when frozen, making it easy to adjust. I use it\nevery evening after work, and it provides immediate relief. I highly recommend this for anyone\ndealing with stiff neck muscles or headaches!\n\n**David Thompson**\nThe **Circular FlexiKold Packs** with straps have been a game changer for my knee pain. As a runner,\nI often experience inflammation, and these small, flexible packs fit perfectly over my knee joint.\nThe adjustable straps keep them secure, allowing me to move around without worrying about\nrepositioning. The cooling effect is strong and lasts longer than expected. I even bought a second\nset to keep in rotation. These are a great investment for anyone needing precise cold therapy!\n\n## FlexiKold FAQ\n\n### Do these ice packs stay flexible when frozen?\n\nYes, the primary feature of FlexiKold is that the proprietary gel remains flexible and easy to bend\neven after being stored in a standard household or commercial freezer.\n\n### How long should I freeze the pack before use?\n\nFor maximum therapeutic benefit, it is recommended to freeze the pack for at least 2 hours before\nyour first use to ensure the gel reaches its optimal cold temperature.\n\n### Can FlexiKold packs be heated in the microwave?\n\nNo, these specific packs are designed strictly for **cold therapy**; heating them can damage the gel\nformula and the heavy-duty double-sealed exterior.\n\n### Should I apply the gel pack directly to my skin?\n\nWhile the material is durable, it is always recommended to use a thin towel or a fabric sleeve\nbetween the pack and your skin to prevent frostbite or irritation during a 20-minute session.\n\n### How do I clean my FlexiKold pack?\n\nYou can easily clean the pack by wiping it down with a damp cloth and mild soap or a disinfecting\nwipe, then drying it thoroughly before returning it to the freezer.\n\n## FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack\n\n<spa [Skip to content][1]\n[[FlexiKold]][2]\n[[FlexiKold]][3]\n\n# FlexiKold Gel Ice Packs Brand\n\nSay goodbye to stiff, clunky ice packs\u2014FlexiKold Gel Cold Packs stay flexible even when frozen for a\nsnug, effective fit. Built with a durable nylon exterior and double-sealed seams, these\nprofessional-grade cold packs deliver long-lasting, leak-proof relief. Whether you\u2019re tackling\nmuscle pain, swelling, or post-workout soreness, enjoy consistent cold therapy trusted by medical\npros.\n\n## Top FlexiKold Gel Ice Packs\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Standard Large - 10.5\" x 14.5\")\n\nThis versatile, heavy-duty cold pack is the brand\u2019s flagship product, designed with a proprietary\ngel that stays pliable at low temperatures to contour perfectly to the back, shoulder, or hip.\n\n[ Check Price ][4]\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Half Size - 7.5\" x 11.5\")\n\nThe Half Size model offers a more targeted application for smaller areas like the neck, wrist, or\nknee, providing the same high-contact cooling in a compact, portable footprint.\n\n[ Check Price ][5]\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Neck Contour - 23\" x 8\")\n\nSpecially shaped to drape over the upper back and shoulders, this model features a curved design\nthat ensures therapeutic cold reaches the cervical spine and trapezius muscles simultaneously.\n\n[ Check Price ][6]\n\nFlexiKold offers a premium selection of reusable gel cold packs, designed to provide targeted relief\nfor various body areas with their flexible, long-lasting cooling technology.\n\n\n## Product Categories\n\n### Standard Size Packs (10.5\u2033 x 14.5\u2033)\n\nPerfect for larger muscle groups like the back, quads, hamstrings, calves, shins, shoulders, and\nknees, these packs provide broad coverage and deep cooling relief.\n\n### Half-Size Packs (7.5\u2033 x 11.5\u2033)\n\nIdeal for smaller or more precise areas, these packs are great for the foot, ankle, shin, calf,\nquad, forearm, elbow, hand, wrist, and neck, ensuring effective localized therapy.\n\n### Neck-Specific Packs (23\u2033 Long)\n\nDesigned to comfortably wrap around the neck, lower back, shoulder, and knee, this pack provides\ntargeted relief while allowing for easy movement.\n\n### Circular Packs (4-Inch Flexible Gel Circles)\n\nThese small, flexible cold packs come with straps for secure placement, making them perfect for\ntargeted relief on joints and smaller body areas.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\n**Johnathan Reed**\nI\u2019ve been using the **FlexiKold Standard Size Pack** for months now, and it has been a lifesaver for\nmy lower back pain. The size is perfect\u2014it covers my entire lower back, providing even, long-lasting\ncold therapy. Unlike other ice packs that become stiff and uncomfortable, this one remains flexible,\neven straight from the freezer. I love that it stays cold for nearly 40 minutes, which is much\nlonger than other brands I\u2019ve tried. Whether I use it after workouts or just to relax after a long\nday, this gel pack is a must-have!\n\n**Sarah Montgomery**\nI purchased the **Neck-Specific Pack** after dealing with persistent neck and shoulder tension, and\nI couldn\u2019t be happier! The length is just right\u2014it wraps around my neck comfortably and stays in\nplace without slipping. The gel remains soft even when frozen, making it easy to adjust. I use it\nevery evening after work, and it provides immediate relief. I highly recommend this for anyone\ndealing with stiff neck muscles or headaches!\n\n**David Thompson**\nThe **Circular FlexiKold Packs** with straps have been a game changer for my knee pain. As a runner,\nI often experience inflammation, and these small, flexible packs fit perfectly over my knee joint.\nThe adjustable straps keep them secure, allowing me to move around without worrying about\nrepositioning. The cooling effect is strong and lasts longer than expected. I even bought a second\nset to keep in rotation. These are a great investment for anyone needing precise cold therapy!\n\n## FlexiKold FAQ\n\n### Do these ice packs stay flexible when frozen?\n\nYes, the primary feature of FlexiKold is that the proprietary gel remains flexible and easy to bend\neven after being stored in a standard household or commercial freezer.\n\n### How long should I freeze the pack before use?\n\nFor maximum therapeutic benefit, it is recommended to freeze the pack for at least 2 hours before\nyour first use to ensure the gel reaches its optimal cold temperature.\n\n### Can FlexiKold packs be heated in the microwave?\n\nNo, these specific packs are designed strictly for **cold therapy**; heating them can damage the gel\nformula and the heavy-duty double-sealed exterior.\n\n### Should I apply the gel pack directly to my skin?\n\nWhile the material is durable, it is always recommended to use a thin towel or a fabric sleeve\nbetween the pack and your skin to prevent frostbite or irritation during a 20-minute session.\n\n### How do I clean my FlexiKold pack?\n\nYou can easily clean the pack by wiping it down with a damp cloth and mild soap or a disinfecting\nwipe, then drying it thoroughly before returning it to the freezer.\n\n## FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack\n\n<span data-mce-type=\"bookmark\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden;\nline-height: 0;\" class=\"mce_SELRES_start\">\ufeff</span><span data-mce-type=\"bookmark\" style=\"display:\ninline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\" class=\"mce_SELRES_start\">\ufeff</span>\n\nFlexiKold (flexikold.com) is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an\naffiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by\nadvertising and linking to amazon.com\n\n\u00a0\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - FlexiKold\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://flexikold.com/\n[3]: https://flexikold.com/\n[4]: http://www.amazon.com/FlexiKold-Gel-Pack-Standard-Large/dp/B076PG75QJ?th=1&tag=flexikold.com-20\n[5]: http://www.amazon.com/FlexiKold-Gel-Pack-Half-Size/dp/B008A6M34C?th=1&tag=flexikold.com-20\n[6]: http://www.amazon.com/FlexiKold-Neck-Cold-Pack-A6301-COLD/dp/B008A6MFVS?th=1&tag=flexikold.com-\n20 flexikold.com [Skip to content][1]\n[[FlexiKold]][2]\n[[FlexiKold]][3]\n\n# FlexiKold Gel Ice Packs Brand\n\nSay goodbye to stiff, clunky ice packs\u2014FlexiKold Gel Cold Packs stay flexible even when frozen for a\nsnug, effective fit. Built with a durable nylon exterior and double-sealed seams, these\nprofessional-grade cold packs deliver long-lasting, leak-proof relief. Whether you\u2019re tackling\nmuscle pain, swelling, or post-workout soreness, enjoy consistent cold therapy trusted by medical\npros.\n\n## Top FlexiKold Gel Ice Packs\n\n### FlexiKold Gel Cold Pack (Standard Large - 10.5\" x 14.5\")\n\nThis versatile, heavy-duty cold p