ce packs, or specific messaging, we\ndeliver bespoke excellence.\n\nWithin our Hydropac, Freshpac & Pharmapac ranges, you\u2019ll find an expansive collection of insulated\npackaging and cooling solutions. Yet, our offerings go beyond the ordinary. We craft custom-made\nproducts like drink coolers, ice mats, and shaped ice packs, all designed to your specifications \u2013\nand without the burden of additional tooling costs.\n\n[\nIce packs\n[hydropac-logo]\nDiscover Hydropac\n][120]\n[\nPharmaceutical\nDiscover Pharmapac\n][121] [\nFood packaging\nDiscover Freshpac\n][122]\n\n## Temperature solutions\n\nHydropac is not confined by boundaries; our temperature-controlled solutions transcend industries,\nmeeting unique challenges and safeguarding products\u2019 integrity. With a broad spectrum of\napplications, we cater to diverse markets, ensuring that each sector benefits from our expertise.\n\n[ View all products ][123]\n[ View product ][124]\n\n### [HydroFreeze Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 500g][125]\n\n\u00a30.46\n[ View product ][126]\n\n### [Gel Ice Pack \u2013 1 Pocket \u2013 500g][127]\n\n\u00a30.40\n[ [A sealed clear plastic pouch labelled \u201cWater Ice Pack - 1 Pocket - 500g\u201d features blue text and\nsymbols. The minimalistic design includes a white background and the mar [ Skip to content][1]\nMain Menu\n* [Cold Chain Optimisation][2]\n* [Site visit][3]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][4]\n* [Blog][5]\nSearch\n* [ sales@hydropac.co.uk ][6]\n* [ +441494530182 ][7]\n[\n0\n][8]\n0\nSubtotal: \u00a30.00\n\nNo products in the cart.\n\nNo products in the cart.\n\n[Continue Shopping][9]\nMain Menu\n* [Hydropac ice packs][10]\n  * [Chilled][11]\n    * [Water][12]\n    * [Gel][13]\n    * [Sheets][14]\n    * [Pre-frozen][15]\n    * [Courier boxes][16]\n    * [Freezer trays][17]\n  * [Frozen][18]\n    * [EasiFreeze][19]\n    * [HydroFreeze][20]\n    * [Courier boxes][21]\n    * [Freezer trays][22]\n  * [Hard shell][23]\n    * [Blocks][24]\n    * [Plates][25]\n* [Freshpac food