        "crawl_text": "[[INTCO Healthcare]][1]\n[Products][2]\n[Solution][3]\n[OEM/ODM][4]\n[Service & Support][5]\n\n  [Product Catalog][6]\n  [Certificate][7]\n  [FAQ][8]\n[About Us][9]\n\n  [About][10]\n  [ESG][11]\n  [Founder][12]\n  [News][13]\nEnglish\n\n# INTCO Healthcare \u2014 Leading manufacturer of instant cold packs, hot compress products and personal\n# care solutions.\n\n[Personal care, medical emergency, outdoor sports, food refrigeration, pet care][Personal care,\nmedical emergency, outdoor sports, food refrigeration, pet care]\n\n## PERSONAL CARE/MEDICALEMERGENCYOUTDOOR SPORTSFOOD REFRIGERATION/ PET CARE\n\n[Learn More][14]\n[Comprehensive tailored industry solutions][Comprehensive tailored industry solutions]\n\n## PROVIDE CUSTOMERSWITH A COMPREHENSIVESET OF TAILOREDINDUSTRY SOLUTIONS\n\n[Learn More][15]\n[INTCO protects your health][INTCO protects your health]\n\n## INTCO PROTECTSYOUR HEALTH\n\nLeading enterprise in the globalcold and hot compress industry.Focusing on cold and hotcompress\nproducts for 20 years.\n\n[Learn More][16]\n[\n[INSTANT COLD PACK]\n\n### INSTANT COLD PACK\n\n][17][\n[MULTI-USE HEAT PATCH]\n\n### MULTI-USE HEAT PATCH\n\n][18][\n[PERINEAL INSTANT COLD PACK]\n\n### PERINEAL INSTANT COLD PACK\n\n][19][\n[REUSABLE HOT & COLD GEL BEADS PACK]\n\n### REUSABLE HOT & COLD GEL BEADS PACK\n\n][20][\n[REUSABLE HOT & COLD GEL PACK]\n\n### REUSABLE HOT & COLD GEL PACK\n\n][21][\n[INFANT HEEL WARMER]\n\n### INFANT HEEL WARMER\n\n][22][\n[INSTANT COLD PACK]\n\n### INSTANT COLD PACK\n\n][23][\n[MULTI-USE HEAT PATCH]\n\n### MULTI-USE HEAT PATCH\n\n][24][\n[PERINEAL INSTANT COLD PACK]\n\n### PERINEAL INSTANT COLD PACK\n\n][25]\n\n## Why\n## Choose Us\n\n### Global Production and Manufacturing\n\nChina and Vietnam, as the two major R&D and manufacturing bases of INTCO Medical, enable the company\nto optimize global supply chain resource allocation. As the world's largest hot & cold therapy\nproduct manufacturer, the company achieves an annual output of approximately 149 million instant\ncold & hot packs and 106 million heat patches, providing customers with more cost-effective products\nand services.\n\n[Global Production Facility]\nGlobal Production and Manufacturing\n[Manufacturing]\n20 years of manufacturing experience in the industry\n[R&D]\nProfessional R&D & design team\n[Delivery]\nTimely Delivery\n\n## Industry Solutions\n\nPersonal CareSports InjuriesOutdoor CampingHygiene CarePet Care\n[\n[Reusable cold pack for neck pain, inflammation, and muscle tension relief]\n\n### Personal Care\n\nInstant Cold Pack | Cooling Patch | Ice Bag | Perineal Instant Cold Pack | Magic Warmer | Instant\nHot Pack | Disposable Heat Patch | Steam Eye Mask | Hot Water Bag | Gel Pack | Gel Beads Pack\n\n][26]\n[\n[INTCO Healthcare]\n\n### Sports Injuries\n\nInstant Cold Pack | Migraine Relief Ice Head Wrap | Hot & Cold Compression Sleeve | Massage Ball\nRoller\n\n][27]\n[\n[Perfect picnic setup with ice packs and a cooler for a fresh summer day]\n\n### Outdoor Camping\n\nIce Box | Ice Pack\n\n][28]\n[\n[INTCO Healthcare for Hygiene Care]\n\n### Hygiene Care\n\nHand Sanitizer Gel | Hand Sanitizer Spray\n\n][29]\n[\n[INTCO Healthcare for Pet Care]\n\n### Pet Care\n\nPet Cooling Mat\n\n][30]\n\n## Our Qualifications\n\n[Certificate 1]\n[Certificate 2]\n[Certificate 3]\n[Certificate 4]\n[Certificate 5]\n[Certificate 6]\n[Certificate 7]\n[Certificate 8]\n[Certificate 9]\n[Certificate 10]\n[Certificate 11]\n[Certificate 12]\n[Certificate 13]\n[Certificate 14]\n[Certificate 15]\n\n### Compliance Certification\n\n[FDA]\n[ISO 13485]\n[T\u00dcV]\n[GMP]\n[CE]\n[ASTM]\n[BSCI]\n\n## Latest News\n\n[\n[10 Summer Uses for Instant Cold Packs You May Not Know]\n\n### 10 Summer Uses for Instant Cold Packs You May Not Know\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\n### 10 Summer Uses for Instant Cold Packs You May Not Know\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\n][31][\n[Top 10 Pet Cooling Mat Manufacturers in the World (2026 Guide)]\n\n### Top 10 Pet Cooling Mat Manufacturers in the World (2026 Guide)\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\n### Top 10 Pet Cooling Mat Manufacturers in the World (2026 Guide)\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\n][32][\n[INTCO Medical Live at WHX Miami 2026]\n\n### INTCO Medical Live at WHX Miami 2026\n\nJun 18, 2026\n\n### INTCO Medical Live at WHX Miami 2026\n\nJun 18, 2026\n\n][33]\n[View More News][34]\n\n## Get In Touch With Us\n\nYou can contact us any way that is convenient for you.\n\n[INTCO Healthcare]\n\nOur Products\n* [\u203aInstant Cold Pack][35]\n* [\u203aReusable Hot & Cold Gel Pack][36]\n* [\u203aReusable Hot & Cold Gel Beads Pack][37]\n* [\u203aMulti-Use Heat Patch][38]\n* [\u203aInfant Heel Warmer][39]\n* [\u203aPerineal Instant Cold Pack][40]\n\nQuick Links\n* [\u203aOEM/ODM][41]\n* [\u203aSolution][42]\n* [\u203aAbout Us][43]\n* [\u203aService & Support][44]\n* [\u203aContact Us][45]\n\nFriendship Link\n* [\u203aINTCO Medical][46]\n* [\u203aINTCO Wheelchair][47]\n* [\u203aINTCO Gloves][48]\n\nContact Us\n* Add : No.298 Yandunshan Road, Zhenjiang, Jiangsu, China\n* [Email : [email\u00a0protected]][49]\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 INTCOHEALTHCARE.COM ALL RIGHTS RESERVED\n\n|[PRIVACY-POLICY][50]|[LEGAL-NOTICE][51]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /products\n[3]: /solutions\n[4]: /oem-odm\n[5]: /service-support/product-catalog\n[6]: /service-support/product-catalog\n[7]: /service-support/certificate\n[8]: /service-support/faq\n[9]: /about-us\n[1 [[INTCO Healthcare]][1]\n[Products][2]\n[Solution][3]\n[OEM/ODM][4]\n[Service & Support][5]\n\n  [Product Catalog][6]\n  [Certificate][7]\n  [FAQ][8]\n[About Us][9]\n\n  [About][10]\n  [ESG][11]\n  [Founder][12]\n  [News][13]\nEnglish\n\n# INTCO Healthcare \u2014 Leading manufacturer of instant cold packs, hot compress products and personal\n# care solutions.\n\n[Personal care, medical emergency, outdoor sports, food refrigeration, pet care][Personal care,\nmedical emergency, outdoor sports, food refrigeration, pet care]\n\n## PERSONAL CARE/MEDICALEMERGENCYOUTDOOR SPORTSFOOD REFRIGERATION/ PET CARE\n\n[Learn More][14]