are more than just a supplier\u2014we are a\ntrusted partner, providing cost-efficient products, innovative cold-chain packaging solutions, and\nexpert consultation that help customers reduce risk, improve operational efficiency, and outperform\nlegacy packaging systems.\n\n**We design, customize, and manufacture all our products in the USA**\n\n## Trusted by Brands You Know\n\nCompanies receiving more than 3 years of quality service from IPC\n\n[Thermal Packaging]\n[Insulated Packaging]\n[Cold Chain Packaging]\n[Insulated Shipping Containers]\n[Insulation Packaging]\n[Thermal Shipping Insulation]\n[Beckman Coulter]\n[DHL]\n\n> \u201c\n> \n> IPC's liners provide excellent isolation, keeping the cold \u201cair\u201d inside the box during a 5-day\n> shipment to Asia. IPC quickly produced prototypes we requested and has reliably filled\n> small-quantity orders for these custom liners. Consistency and quality has been key to our\n> large-quantity transport success.\n> \n> John MorganPrincipal Engineer\n\n> \u201c\n> \n> A true partner in sustainability and quality.\n> \n> We\u2019ve received multiple pallets of curbside-recyclable bags, shipping liners, and ice packs from\n> Insulated Products Corp, and every time I\u2019m impressed by the thoughtfulness and consistency of\n> their work. Their products are exceptionally well-made\u2014functional, clean, and clearly designed\n> with sustainability in mind.\n> \n> As a company devoted to providing honest, fresh pasta locally and nationwide, our mission depends\n> on packaging that protects quality while respecting the environment. IPC delivers exactly that.\n> It\u2019s rare to find a supplier so perfectly aligned with our sustainable values. Highly recommend to\n> any business seeking eco-conscious, professional-grade shipping solutions.\n> \n> Mark SpiegelmanPasta Fresh\u00ae\n\n> \u201c\n> \n> WOW, all the staff is doing AWESOME job here. Pulling all the orders and getting them ready for\n> shipping. Very clean boxes, plastic wraps and all the trucks are very clean and well maintain.\n> \n> Harry IrvineCalifornia Air Conditioning Systems\n\n> \u201c\n> \n> Been a loyal customer for years. IPC's quality and value on gel ice packs are UNMATCHED, as is the\n> service.\n> \n> Brad Savage\n\n> \u201c\n> \n> I Have been a customer for several years. very pleased. my order consists of single rolls Hand\n> loaded into a full 53' Trailer. Product, Service and pricing Excellent!\n> \n> Daniel Owens\n\n## Curb"
