        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [NEWGO Website] ][2]\n[][3]\nMenu\n[ [NEWGO Website] ][4]\nMenu\n* [Home][5]\n* [About][6]\n* [Products][7]\n* [Choose Us][8]\n* [Reviews][9]\n* [FAQ][10]\n* [Contact][11]\n[][12]\n[Shop Now][13]\n\n# NEWGO Ice Pack \u2014 Hot and Cold Therapeutic Packs for Shoulder, Knee and Ankle\n\nReusable gel packs for recovery, swelling and restful sleep \u2014 shop now for smarter relief.\n\n[VIEW CATALOG][14]\n[Relaxed scene showing eye mask, shoulder wrap and wine cooler sleeve in everyday use]\n\n## About Us\n\nNEWGO started as a small team of healthcare product designers and physical therapists focused on\nmaking durable, effective cold and heat therapy accessible to everyday people. Over the last decade\nwe\u2019ve grown into a trusted brand that blends clinical insight with practical design. Our products \u2014\nfrom the NEWGO ice pack and NEWGO shoulder ice pack to targeted solutions like the NEWGO knee ice\npack, ankle wraps and a cooling NEWGO eye mask \u2014 are engineered for consistent performance and\ncomfortable wear. We source non-toxic gel formulas and flexible, puncture-resistant laminates, then\ntest longevity and thermal retention in real-world use. Product quality is verified through\nmanufacturing audits and routine lab checks to meet high safety and durability expectations. We\nprioritize materials that reduce waste and extend product life, and our packaging is designed to be\ncompact and largely recyclable. NEWGO\u2019s customer-first approach means clear product labeling,\nclinically informed usage guides, and product variants tailored to recovery, sports, post-surgery\ncare, and everyday comfort. We combine practical expertise with transparent manufacturing practices\nso customers can trust the performance they bring into recovery routines. Our experience,\nreliability and product stewardship reflect a long-term commitment to safe, effective therapy and\nresponsible production.\n\n[VIEW CATALOG][15]\n[Diverse team collaborating around product samples in a warm, professional workspace] [Careful\nfulfillment staff packing reusable gel packs in a bright, organized space]\n\n## Best products\n\nTop-rated reusable gel packs and wraps for eyes, shoulders, knees, ankles and more. Each product is\ntested for thermal retention, comfort and durability so customers can trust consistent relief at\nhome and on the go.\n\n[Reusable cooling eye mask for puffy eyes and post-surgery relief with soft gel pad]\n\n### Cooling Eye Mask for Puffy Eyes, Cold Eye Mask Eye Ice Pack for After Eyes Surgery, Tension\n### Stress Relief, Itchy Eyes, Headaches, Dark Circles \u2013 Blue (Blue-2Pack)\n\nThis cooling eye mask soothes puffiness and reduces discomfort after surgery or long screen\nsessions. The soft fabric and even-weight gel provide gentle compression and temperature control for\nheadaches and itchy eyes. Ideal as a reusable eye mask for daily relief and post-procedure care.\n\n[Check Price][16]\n[Contoured shoulder ice pack wrap for rotator cuff recovery and swelling relief]\n\n### Shoulder Ice Pack Wrap for Rotator Cuff Cold Therapy, FSA Eligible Gel Ice Pack for Injuries\n### Reusable Cold Pack for Shoulder Swelling Discomfort after Surgery, Medium\n\nA contoured shoulder wrap that targets rotator cuff pain and post-surgery swelling with even cold\ncoverage. Adjustable straps and a reusable gel insert make it easy to secure and comfortable for\nlonger wear. A dependable shoulder ice pack for recovery and activity-related soreness.\n\n[Check Price][17]\n[Face ice mask with thick gel pads for forehead and eye-zone cooling and swelling relief]\n\n### Ice Pack Face Ice Mask for Puffy Eyes, Cooling Face Mask Reusable with Thick Gel Pad in Forehead\n### & Eye Zones for Migraines, Post-Surgery, Redness, Allergy Swelling Pain Relief\n\nThis face ice mask combines forehead and eye-zone cooling in one comfortable design to ease\nmigraines, redness and swelling after procedures. Thick gel pads deliver targeted cooling with a\nsoft backing for skin comfort. Use chilled or warmed for versatile facial therapy.\n\n[Check Price][18]\n[Flexible wine cooler sleeve for faster, even chilling of standard wine and champagne bottles]\n\n### Wine Cooler Sleeve Reusable Wine Bottle Cooler Flexible Wine Ice Pack Sleeve Keep Wine Cool and\n### Refreshing for Standard Size Bottles for Red Wine, White Wine & Champagne \u2013 Black\n\nA flexible wine cooler sleeve that contours to bottles for faster, more even chilling. Reusable gel\nconstruction stays cold longer and slips on easily to fit standard bottles of red, white or\nchampagne. Great for picnics, parties and outdoor dining.\n\n[Check Price][19]\n[Reusable horse leg ice wrap with gel packs for comfortable post-ride cooling]\n\n### Horse Ice Pack Reusable Horse Leg Wrap for Injury, Cooling Horse Knee Wrap Full Coverage Leg Ice\n### Boot Cold Pack 2 Wrap with 4 Gel Packs for Knee, Legs, Boots, and Hooves\n\nDesigned for equine care, this horse leg wrap combines thin gel packs with adjustable straps to cool\nlegs comfortably after exercise. Packs slide into pockets for a secure fit and even co [Skip to content][1]\n[ [NEWGO Website] ][2]\n[][3]\nMenu\n[ [NEWGO Website] ][4]\nMenu\n* [Home][5]\n* [About][6]\n* [Products][7]\n* [Choose Us][8]\n* [Reviews][9]\n* [FAQ][10]\n* [Contact][11]\n[][12]\n[Shop Now][13]\n\n# NEWGO Ice Pack \u2014 Hot and Cold Therapeutic Packs for Shoulder, Knee and Ankle\n\nReusable gel packs for recovery, swelling and restful sleep \u2014 shop now for smarter relief.\n\n[VIEW CATALOG][14]\n[Relaxed scene showing eye mask, shoulder wrap and wine cooler sleeve in everyday use]\n\n## About Us\n\nNEWGO started as a small team of healthcare product designers and physical therapists focused on\nmaking durable, effective cold and heat therapy accessible to everyday people. Over the last decade\nwe\u2019ve grown into a trusted brand that blends clinical insight with practical design. Our products \u2