nfo][50]\n\n## About Us\n\nNortech Labs strives to provide\u00a0green, environmentally friendly\u00a0and innovative quality products to\nthe Medical, First Aid, Therapy, Healthcare, & Cold Chain Shipping Industry.\n\nAs the original developer of the *Therma-Kool\u00a0Hot\u00a0Cold Gel Therapy Pack* we are continuously\nstriving to supply the marketplace with safe, cutting edge products.\n\n[Nortech Labs Products]\n\n# Order Nortech Labs Products Online!\n\n[[Buy Nortech Products Online]][51]For Retail Customers \u2013 To order the full line of Nortech Labs\nproducts, visit our brand new E-commerce site at [www.nortechlabsonline.com][52] and **Save 10% +\nFREE SHIPPING** on orders of $100 or more by using Coupon Code NTL344\n\n[Click Here][53]\n\n## Nortech Labs Featured Products\n\nNortech Labs, Inc. is a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing & cold shipping. All of our products\nare proudly manufactured in the USA.\n\n[[Foil Insulated Bubble Box Liners]][54]\n\n## [Foil Insulated Bubble Box Liners][55]\n\nCOOL BLUE\u2122 Foil Insulated Box Liners feature 1/4\u2033 thick foil laminated, metalized bubble cushions\nfor protection and insulation during cold shipping.\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][56]\n\n#### [ThermaKool Hot Cold Gel Pack][57]\n\nTherma-Kool\u00ae\u00a0is a reusable gel pack designed to provide comfortable pain relief when cold or hot\ntherapy is required. Non-toxic & Latex Free.\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][58]\n\n#### [InstaKool Instant Cold Pack][59]\n\nInstaKool\u2122 Instant Cold Pack\u00a0delivers immediate cold therapy for first aid, providing comfort and\nreducing swelling after an injury.\n[[Foil Insulated Bubble Box Liners]][60]\n\n#### [Kodiak Pack Envelopes][61]\n\nKodiak Pack Insulated Metalized Envelopes cold chain system ensures that your valuable temperature\nsensitive payloads arrive in optimum condition.\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][62]\n\n#### [Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs][63]\n\nGel Blox\u2122 Cooler & Shipping Pack \u00a0is a non toxic water-based gel refrigerant shipping pack\nspecifically designed and engineered for COLD transport.\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][64]\n\n#### [Foil Insulated Bubble Mailers][65]\n\nCool Blue\u2122 Foil Bubble Mailers are bubble laminated for durability & protective cushioning and\nfeature heavy duty self-adhesive tape.\n\n## A Leader in the Industry\n\nAs a pioneer and leader in gel manufacturing, Nortech Labs is constantly striving to develop new and\ninnovative ways of incorporating our gel into different products.\n[More About Us][66]\n\n## Reach Us\n\nNortech Labs Inc customer service hours of operation are Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM \u2013 5:00 PM\nEST (4:00 PM Friday).\n\ue081\n\n#### Address\n\n125 Sherwood Ave\nFarmingdale, NY 11735\n\ue00b\n\n#### Phone\n\n1-888-COLDPAK\n(631) 501-1452\n\ue076\n\n#### Email\n\nsales@nortechlabs.com\n[Contact Form][67]\n[Nortech Labs Inc][68]\n[[InstaKool Instant Cold Pack]][69]\n[[Cool Instant Cold Pack]][70]\n[[Cool Blue Foil Insulated Box Liners]][71]\n[[ThermaKool Reusable Hot Cold Pack]][72]\n[[Gel Blox Cold Shipping Packs]][73]\n[[ComfaGel Pressure Reducing Gel]][74]\n\n#### Customer Service\n* [Forms & Data][75]\n* [Help Center][76]\n* [Payment Options][77]\n* [Articles & Press Releases][78]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][79]\n* [Request A Quote][80]\n\n#### Store Policies\n* [Shipping Policy][81]\n* [Return Policy][82]\n* [Privacy Policy][83]\n* [Terms & Conditions][84]\n\n#### Company Info\n* [Nortech History][85]\n* [Contact Us][86]\n* [Request A Quote][87]\n* [Private Labeling][88]\n* [**Order Online** [Order Online]][89]\n* [Locate a Distributor][90]\n* [About Us][91]\n\n[[Nortech Labs 60th Anniversary]][92]\n\n**NORTECH LABS INC***\nThe Leader in First Aid, Therapy and Cold Shipping Supplies for over 60 years.*\n* [Home][93]\n* [Forms & Data (SDS)][94]\n* [Cold Shipping Products][95]\n* [Therapy and First Aid Products][96]\n* [Site Map][97]\n* [ Facebook ][98]\n* [ Twitter ][99]\n* [ Instagram ][100]\n* [ YouTube ][101]\n* [ Instagram ][102]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Nortech Laboratories, Inc. All rights reserved\n\n**Click Below to Purchase Nortech Products from our new E-Commerce Site:**\n\n[[Buy Nortech Products Online]][103]\n\n##### Buy our products on our brand new E-Commerce Site!\n* Limited Time Offer: Save 10% on orders of $100 or more! Use coupon code: **NTL344**\n\n**[Click Here to Order Online!][104]**\n\n**Buy Nortech Products Online Here** <\n\n[1]: mailto:sales@nortechlabs.com\n[2]: http://www.fb.me/NortechLabs\n[3]: http://www.twitter.com/nortech"
