safety ][67]\n[ [PS-Logo-White with tagline][PS-Logo-White with tagline] ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n  * [Life Sciences][70]\n    * [Vaccines][71]\n    * [Blood & Tissue Samples][72]\n    * [Clinical Trials][73]\n  * [Perishables][74]\n    * [Dairy][75]\n    * [Fresh Food][76]\n    * [Meal Kits][77]\n    * [Meat Industry][78]\n  * [Physical Therapy][79]\n  * [Specialty][80]\n  * [Delivered COLD][81]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][82]\n* [Products][83]\n  * [Eco-Friendly Packs][84]\n  * [Shipping Packs][85]\n  * [Precision Packs][86]\n  * [Product Catalog][87]\n* [Resources][88]\n  * [Business FAQ][89]\n  * [Consumer FAQ][90]\n  * [Disposable Instructions][91]\n  * [Blog][92]\n* [About][93]\n  * [About Us][94]\n  * [Locations][95]\n  * [Success Stories][96]\n  * [Join Our Team][97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n  * [Life Sciences][100]\n    * [Vaccines][101]\n    * [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n    * [Clinical Trials][103]\n  * [Perishables][104]\n    * [Dairy][105]\n    * [Fresh Food][106]\n    * [Meal Kits][107]\n    * [Meat Industry][108]\n  * [Physical Therapy][109]\n  * [Specialty][110]\n  * [Delivered COLD][111]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n  * [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n  * [Shipping Packs][115]\n  * [Precision Packs][116]\n  * [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n  * [Business FAQ][119]\n  * [Consumer FAQ][120]\n  * [Disposable Instructions][121]\n  * [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n  * [About Us][124]\n  * [Locations][125]\n  * [Success Stories][126]\n  * [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n[\nTrusted Gel Packs For Shipping\n**Combining the service of a family operated company with the cutting-edge innovation today\u2019s\nbusiness demands,** we\u2019re here to make your cold chain operations as smooth as ice.\nExplore Our Products\n][129]\n[\nSustainable Gel Packs For Shipping\n**Our TerraTemp line of gels packs are sustainable and good for the environment.** When\nsustainability matters, trust our eco-friendly gel packs to get the job done.\nExplore TerraTemp\n][130]\n[\nDelivered COLD\nLeverage our Logistics Team and our network of\n** 100+ Cold Storage Partners** to get frozen pallets of gel packs when you need them and at the\nright temperature.\nlearn more\n][131]\n\n# Cold Chain Shipping Solutions You Can Trust\n\nMitigating temperature fluctuations. Adjusting to emerging and evolving markets. Adopting\nsustainable shipping practices while keeping costs down. Cold chain shipping is a challenge, and\nwe\u2019re here to bring you solutions.\n\n[ Request Quote ][132]\n[A screenshot of a video that describes Pelton Shepherd][A screenshot of a video that describes\nPelton Shepherd]\n\n## Backed by 70 years experience, our team is ready to meet your needs.\n\n[a portrait of Ali Shepherd Reising][a portrait of Ali Shepherd Reising]\n\n## Ali Shepherd Reising\n\n## Vice President of Customer Relations and Logistics\n\n[Tim Shepherd][Tim Shepherd]\n\n## Tim Shepherd\n\n## Chief Executive Officer\n\n[a portrait of Bart Spence][a portrait of Bart Spence]\n\n## Bart Spence\n\n## Vice President of Human Resources\n\n[A portrait of Russ Kenerly][A portrait of Russ Kenerly]\n\n## Russ Kenerly\n\n## Chief Financial Officer\n\n[A portrait of Jim Coc [COVID-19 Update: How we\u2019re prioritizing your health and safety][1]\n\n[ [NEW-PS-Logo with tagline][NEW-PS-Logo with tagline] ][2]\n* Solutions\n  * [Life Sciences][3]\n    * [Vaccines][4]\n    * [Blood & Tissue Samples][5]\n    * [Clinical Trials][6]\n  * [Perishables][7]\n    * [Dairy][8]\n    * [Fresh Food][9]\n    * [Meal Kits][10]\n    * [Meat Industry][11]\n  * [Physical Therapy][12]\n  * [Specialty][13]\n  * [Delivered COLD][14]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][15]\n* [Products][16]\n  * [Eco-Friendly Ice Packs][17]\n  * [Shipping Ice Packs][18]\n  * [Dry Ice Alternatives][19]\n  * [Precision Ice Packs][20]\n* Resources\n  * [Business FAQ][21]\n  * [Consumer FAQ][22]\n  * [Disposal Instructions][23]\n  * [Blog][24]\n* About\n  * [About Us][25