[97]\n* [Contact][98]\n* [Solutions][99]\n  * [Life Sciences][100]\n    * [Vaccines][101]\n    * [Blood & Tissue Samples][102]\n    * [Clinical Trials][103]\n  * [Perishables][104]\n    * [Dairy][105]\n    * [Fresh Food][106]\n    * [Meal Kits][107]\n    * [Meat Industry][108]\n  * [Physical Therapy][109]\n  * [Specialty][110]\n  * [Delivered COLD][111]\n  * [Cold Chain Packaging][112]\n* [Products][113]\n  * [Eco-Friendly Packs][114]\n  * [Shipping Packs][115]\n  * [Precision Packs][116]\n  * [Product Catalog][117]\n* [Resources][118]\n  * [Business FAQ][119]\n  * [Consumer FAQ][120]\n  * [Disposable Instructions][121]\n  * [Blog][122]\n* [About][123]\n  * [About Us][124]\n  * [Locations][125]\n  * [Success Stories][126]\n  * [Join Our Team][127]\n* [Contact][128]\n[\nTrusted Gel Packs For Shipping\n**Combining the service of a family operated company with the cutting-edge innovation today\u2019s\nbusiness demands,** we\u2019re here to make your cold chain operations as smooth as ice.\nExplore Our Products\n][129]\n[\nSustainable Gel Packs For Shipping\n**Our TerraTemp line of gels packs are sustainable and good for the environment.** When\nsustainability matters, trust our eco-friendly gel packs to get the job done.\nExplore TerraTemp\n][130]\n[\nDelivered COLD\nLeverage our Logistics Team and our network of\n** 100+ Cold Storage Partners** to get frozen pallets of gel packs when you need them and at the\nright temperature.\nlearn more\n][131]\n\n# Cold Chain Shipping Solutions You Can Trust\n\nMitigating temperature fluctuations. Adjusting to emerging and evolving markets. Adopting\nsustainable shipping practices while keeping costs down. Cold chain shipping is a challenge, and\nwe\u2019re here to bring you solutions.\n\n[ Request Quote ][132]\n[A screenshot of a video that describes Pelton Shepherd][A screenshot of a video that describes\nPelton Shepherd]\n\n## Backed by 70 years experience, our team is ready to meet your needs.\n\n[a portrait of Ali Shepherd Reising][a portrait of Ali Shepherd Reising]\n\n## Ali Shepherd Reising\n\n## Vice President of Customer Relations and Logistics\n\n[Tim Shepherd][Tim Shepherd]\n\n## Tim Shepherd\n\n## Chief Executive Officer\n\n[a portrait of Bart Spence][a portrait of Bart Spence]\n\n## Bart Spence\n\n## Vice President of Human Resources\n\n[A portrait of Russ Kenerly][A portrait of Russ Kenerly]\n\n## Russ Kenerly\n\n## Chief Financial Officer\n\n[A portrait of Jim Cochonour][A portrait of Jim Cochonour]\n\n## Jim Cochonour\n\n## Vice President of Sales\n\n[A portrait of Sylvain Marseille][A portrait of Sylvain Marseille]\n\n## Sylvain Marseille\n\n## Vice President of New Products Development & Marketing\n\n[A portrait of Eric Dobransky][A portrait of Eric Dobransky]\n\n## Eric Dobransky\n\n## Vice President of Operations\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\nWe serve any industry that requires cold chain solutions.\n\n[a decorative picture of a young adult getting a vaccine injection by a health care worker][a\ndecorative picture of a young adult getting a vaccine injection by a health care worker]\n[Cold Chain Shipping for Life Sciences][Cold Chain Shipping for Life Sciences]\n\n### Life sciences\n\nEvery degree matters when health\u00a0is on the line. Count on us for the\u00a0accuracy and reliability\u00a0you\nneed to\u00a0[ship pharmaceuticals and biologicals][133]\u00a0confidently.\n\n[ Learn More ][134]\n[a decorative picture showing a man picking groceries out of a delivery box][a decorative picture\nshowing a man picking groceries out of a delivery box]\n[Cold Chain Logistics for Perishables][Cold Chain Logistics for Perishables]\n\n### Perishables\n\nYour customers trust you to deliver safe, quality products, and you can trust us to provide\u00a0cold\npacks\u00a0that\u00a0preserve the[\u00a0integrity of your perishables][135].\n\n[ Learn More ][136]\n[a decorative picture of creative professionals reviewing schematics][a decorative picture of\ncreative professionals reviewing schematics]\n[Custom Cold Chain Solutions][Custom Cold Chain Solutions]\n\n### Specialty\n\nWhatever your shipping needs, our expert team is ready to help you design the ideal solution for\nsmooth, reliable cold chain operations.\n\n[ Learn More ][137]\ntrusted\u00a0when\u00a0\u00a0\nCOLD\u00a0\nSustainability\u00a0\nAccuracy\u00a0\nmatters\n\n## Discover our products\n\n### Consistently Accurate, Uniquely Sustainable Commercial Gel Packs\n\nWhatever your priority, our extensive catalog has reliable options to match. Our gel pack lines\ninclude:\n\n[a picture of a glacier ice gel pack in a veg"
