ad more ][155]\n[Rapid aid 50 logo innovation new white v2]\n[[Home icon1]][156]\n\n[Private Label Solutions ][157]\n\nKeep your production costs in check while also improving supply with private, white-label solutions\nfrom Rapid Aid.\n\n[Read More][158]\n\n[[Home icon2]][159]\n\n[Retail Solutions][160]\n\nWhether a global retail giant or a small volume chain, Rapid Aid can provide you with the\ntemperature-controlled solutions your customers want.\n\n[Read More][161]\n\n[[Home icon3]][162]\n\n[Medical Distribution][163]\n\nRapid Aid's temperature-controlled solutions are trusted by the world\u2019s largest distributors in the\nhealthcare, transportation, food, and retail sectors.\n\n[Read More][164]\n\n## Where Does it Hurt?\n\nRapid Aid\u2019s hot and cold therapy solutions are expertly designed to provide relief from various\ntypes of aches, pains, and stiffness. Whether addressing chronic pain, recovering from an injury, or\nsoothing sore muscles after a workout, our products offer a convenient and drug-free approach to\neffective pain management.\n\n[[Back neck]][165]\n\n### [Back & Neck][166]\n\n[[Head face]][167]\n\n### [Head & Face][168]\n\n[[Leg knee ankle foot]][169]\n\n### [Leg, Knee, Ankle & Foot][170]\n\n[[Multiple body parts]][171]\n\n### [Multiple Body Parts][172]\n\n[[Sensitive areas]][173]\n\n### [Select Sensitive Areas][174]\n\n[[Shoulder arm hand finger]][175]\n\n### [Shoulder, Arm, Hand & Finger][176]\n\n## Over 50 years exceeding customer expectations\n\nFor over 50 years, Rapid Aid has been a leader in hot and cold pain relief, consistently delivering\ntrusted solutions that go above and beyond customer expectations. With a long history of innovation,\nprofessionalism, and growth, we\u2019ve helped care for millions of bumps, bruises, and everyday aches\naround the world.\n\n[Icon home 1]\n\nGlobal Manufacturing Capabilities\n\nWe manufacture hot and cold gel packs in the U.S., Canada, Vietnam, and China, with global\ndistribution capabilities. From concept to delivery, our production model ensures capacity,\nflexibility, and cost-effective solutions tailored to your needs.\n\n[Icon home 2]\n\nInnovating Since 1975\n\nOur patented, proprietary products are designed specifically for the needs of each market.\nInnovation is what we do best.\n\n[Icon home 3]\n\nWe service the worlds largest retail & medical brands\n\nWith global manufacturing and over 400 private label and branded SKU's & hot and cold pain relief\nsolutions for medical a"
      }
