cart is empty\n\nLooks like you haven't added anything yet.\n\n[Start Shopping][50]\n[ SHOP ][51]\n* [ Physicians ][52]\n* [ Nurses & Staff ][53]\n* [ Supply Chain ][54]\n* [ Patients ][55]\n[Vizient Logo][Premier Contracted Supplier Logo]\n\n## Used in over 600\n## Hospitals & Facilities\n\n# Easy Cold Therapy for Better Patient Outcomes\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Compression Wraps stay icy cold, are simple to use & highly effective for faster\nrecovery with less hassle.\n[ Shop Products ][56]\n[ Discover More ][57]\nMade in the usa since\n\n\n100% American Made\nUsed On Over\n\n\nPatients per Week\nIn Over\n\n\nFacilities Nationwide\n\n#### For Physicians\n\n# SMI Wraps Mean\n\n## Better Patient Compliance\n\nSwipe For More\nClinical\nStudies Continuous\nCold Therapy Ease\nof Use Features &\nBenefits Private Label\nProgram Freezer\nProgram\n\n### Studies & Resources\n\nStudies have shown that SMI Cold Therapy wraps are highly effective and can reduce the need for\npostoperative opioids for pain. Hospital staff satisfaction was higher with the ice/gel pack\ncryotherapy wrap than with a circulating cold water cotherapy device. Compression wrap users also\nexperienced significantly less pain.\n\nClick on an image to view a study or brochure.\n[ Go To Info Library ][58]\n[ [UVMC Postoperative Opioids Study][UVMC Postoperative Opioids Study] ][59][ [Multifaceted\nComparison Study][Multifaceted Comparison Study] ][60][ [SMI Cold Therapy for Chemo Flyer][SMI Cold\nTherapy for Chemo Flyer] ][61][ [Temperature Graph Document Cover][Temperature Graph Document Cover]\n][62][ [SMI Effective Enhancement Brochure][SMI Effective Enhancement Brochure] ][63][ [SMI Trifold\nBrochure][SMI Trifold Brochure] ][64][ [SMI Spine Surgery Bifold Brochure][SMI Spine Surgery Bifold\nBrochure] ][65][ [SMI General Surgery Bifold Brochure][SMI General Surgery Bifold Brochure] ][66][\n[SMI CIPN Prevention Bifold Brochure][SMI CIPN Prevention Bifold Brochure] ][67][ [SMI CIPN Patient\nFlyer][SMI CIPN Patient Flyer] ][68][ [SMI Wraps Use Instruction Sheet][SMI Wraps Use Instruction\nSheet] ][69][ [SMI Item Number Catalog][SMI Item Number Catalog] ][70]\n\n### Colder for Longer\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Wraps maintain a cold temperature for longer than other products. See the chart to\nthe right.\n\nOur wraps come with two sets of gel bags. One set can be kept in the freezer and swapped out with\nthe other gel bags providing continuous cold therapy. Each gel bag maintains it's cold for 3+ hours.\n[ Learn More ][71]\n[Graph showing SMI gel bags stay colder longer][Graph showing SMI gel bags stay colder longer]\n\n### 3 Easy Steps\n\nSMI Cold Therapy Compression Wraps are easy to use making it easier for patients to comply with a\ncold therapy regimen. This in turn, results in more positive patient outcomes.\n\nSimply insert the frozen gel bag into the antimicrobial pouch, form the wrap over the forearm to\nmake it more flexible then apply to the affected area with the compression straps.\n[ Watch Application Videos ][72]\n[Nurse putting 3 hour + gel bags into the pouch of an SMI wrap][Nurse putting 3 hour + gel bags into\nthe pouch of an SMI wrap][A nurse m [ FIND A REP ][1]\n[ CAREERS ][2]\n877.423.9727\n[ [SMI Cold Therapy Logo] ][3]\n* [SMI Cold Therapy Logo][SMI Cold Therapy Logo] Close\n* Products\n  * [ ALL PRODUCTS See all SMI products ][4]\n  * [ SPINE Products for use on spine ][5]\n  * [ GENERAL SURGERY Products for use with general surgery ][6]\n  * [ ORTHO Products for use with ortho surgery ][7]\n  * [ ONCOLOGY Products for use during chemotherapy ][8]\n  * [ PLASTIC SURGERY Products for use with plastic surgery ][9]\n  * [ PODIATRY Products for use with podiatry ][10]\n  * [ SMALL JOINT Products for use on small joints ][11]\n  * [ KNEE ][12]\n  * [ SHOULDER ][13]\n  * [ BACK ][14]\n  * [ HIP ][15]\n  * [ AB BINDER ][16]\n  * [ CHEMO ][17]\n  * [ COLD VEST ][18]\n  * [ FACIAL ][19]\n  * [ FOOT & ANKLE ][20]\n  * [ 3+ HOUR GEL BAGS ][21]\n  * [ SMALL GEL BAGS 