he antimicrobial pouch, form the wrap over the forearm to\nmake it more flexible then apply to the affected area with the compression straps.\n[ Watch Application Videos ][72]\n[Nurse putting 3 hour + gel bags into the pouch of an SMI wrap][Nurse putting 3 hour + gel bags into\nthe pouch of an SMI wrap][A nurse molding a wrap over her forearm to prepare it for applying to a\npatient][A nurse molding a wrap over her forearm to prepare it for applying to a patient][Nurse\napplying an SMI Knee Wrap to a patient][Nurse applying an SMI Knee Wrap to a patient]\n\n### 100% Mobility\n\nNot tethered to any cooler or ice bags allowing for freedom of movement while wearing\n\n### Adjustable Compression\n\nEffective compression means visibly reduced edema and effective cold delivery\n\n### Cold 3+ Hours\n\nNon-toxic gel bags mold perfectly to the targeted area & cool for 3+ hours\n\n### Breathable\n\nMoisture wicking fabric keeps condensation away for comfort - won't harbor harmful bacteria\n\n### Antimicrobial\n\nGel pouch liners are antimicrobial & wick away moisture, keeping skin dry & protected\n\n### Stretch Straps\n\nExtra wide proprietary straps hold wrap in place for ambulation\n[ View All SMI Wraps ][73]\n\n### Showcase Your Practice or Facility\n\nWe offer a unique, low-cost marketing opportunity for your hospital, surgery center or private\npractice. Easily place any logo on each body-site specific compression wrap to help promote\nOrthopedic or Spine Programs.\n[ Find A Rep To Learn More ][74]\n[An SMI Wrap with a Private Custom Logo][An SMI Wrap with a Private Custom Logo]\n\n### SMI's Freezer Program\n\nWe know that your time, budget and available facility space is precious, which is why we take those\nburdens out of your hands so that you may be free to focus on what matters most \u2014 Patient Care.\n\nSMI Cold Therapy supplies all of the necessary freezers throughout the patient-pathway at no-charge\nto our customers without any minimum order requirements or co