        "crawl_text": "* [ English][1]\n  * [ Espa\u00f1ol][2]\n  * [ Deutsch][3]\n\u00a0 \u00a0\n[[Tempack][Tempack]][4]\n* Products\n  * [[softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon\n    ]Single-use\n    Packaging][5]\n    * [PET Thermpack][6]\n    * [Greenin][7]\n    * [Lipbox][8]\n  * [[softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon]Reusable\n    Packaging][9]\n    * [InTempack Insert][10]\n    * [IsoBox 2Door][11]\n    * [CarryTemp\u00ae Bag][12]\n    * [Pallet Shippers][13]\n  * [[tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu][tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu]Container\n    s for Delivery Vehicles][14]\n    * [CarryTemp\u00ae][15]\n    * [Transforming Vehicles][16]\n  * [[tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue][tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue]Life Sciences\n    Packaging][17]\n    * [DSX Diagnosach][18]\n    * [Patient Bags][19]\n    * [ATP650 Box][20]\n    * [P650 Termovial][21]\n  * [[tempack-cold-packs][tempack-cold-packs]Cold\n    Packs][22]\n    * [Rigid Cold\n      Packs/Plates][23]\n    * [Rigid Frozen\n      Packs/Plates][24]\n    * [Flexible Cold/Frozen Packs][25]\n* [Markets][26]\n* [Cold Chain Insights][27]\n* [About][28]\n* [Contact][29]\nTEMPACK\u00ae\nby CSafe Experts in passive temperature-controlled packaging (TCP) since 1996, we support the\ndistribution of fresh and frozen products [FIND OUT MORE][30] The high-performance, low cost per use\nthermal shipper specifically tailored to the needs of food fulfilment centres CASE STUDY ISOBOX\n2DOOR IsoBox 2Door, the ultimate alternative to EPP shippers FIND OUT MORE TRANSFORMING DELIVERY\nVEHICLES RANGE We transform any conventional vehicle into a multitemperature delivery vehicle in no\ntime and ensure an unbroken food cold chain. ATP certified shippers under request FIND OUT MORE\nTHERMAL PACKAGING FOR THE FOOD SUPPLY CHAIN Wholesalers, Distribution, Fulfilment, Retailers,\neCommerce, Transport & Logistics, Food Service AI-generated image FIND OUT MORE [Fresh food delivery\nbox with fruits, vegetables, and milk being unpacked] TEMPACK\u00ae\nby CSafe Mastering the Cold Chain to prevent Food Waste [FIND OUT MORE][31]\n\n# Temperature-controlled packaging\n\nTempack, by CSafe, is a **leading global provider in the isothermal and refrigerated packaging\nsector.** Our primary activity focuses on the manufacture, development and qualification of\npackaging solutions for transporting and distributing essential, temperature-sensitive goods, **with\na special focus on food products, which require a cold chain delivery**.\n\n## Products\n\n[[softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon]][3\n2]\n\n### [Single-use\n### Packaging][33]\n\nSustainable, disposable solutions offering reliable short-term temperature control for perishable\ngoods, maintaining stability for up to 48 hours.\n\n[][34]\n\n### [Reusable\n### Packaging][35]\n\nDurable, long-lasting shippers designed for daily use, ideal for maintaining the cold chain of\nfresh, chilled and/or frozen perishable foods.\n\n[][36]\n\n### [Containers for Delivery Vehicles][37]\n\nModular units designed to maintain temperature in delivery vehicles (cargo vans, bikes, trikes,\netc), ensuring chilled and frozen food products stay at the required temperature during last-mile\ntransportation.\n\n[][38]\n\n### [Life Sciences\n### Packaging][39]\n\nSpecialized packaging for medical and biological materials requiring strict temperature control.\n\n[][40]\n\n### [Cold\n### Packs][41]\n\nFlexible and rigid packs that keep chilled and frozen shipments within specific temperature ranges,\noffering a safer and more cost-effective alternative to dry ice without the associated handling\nrisks and higher costs.\n\n[][42]\n\n### [Customised\n### Systems][43]\n\nTailor-made solutions designed to meet the strictest requirements and ensure optimal thermal\nprotection.\n\n## Experts in passive temperature controlled packaging\n\nOur passive temperature-controlled packaging solutions are designed to support reliable **food cold\nchain logistics operations**, ensuring the safe **distribution of chilled, fresh and frozen\nproducts** such as fruit, vegetables, dairy, meat and seafood.\n\nDeveloped with the operational realities of **grocery delivery, food retail distribution and\ne-commerce fulfilment** in mind, our systems help maintain product stability throughout preparation,\nstaging, transport and last-mile delivery.\n\nWhile primarily focused on food distribution environments, our solutions can also be adapted to\nother temperature-sensitive transport requirements when operational conditions demand it.\n\nSupported by rigorous testing and qualification processes, our product range combines thermal\nperformance with practical efficiency, enabling temperature control in demanding real-world\nlogistics scenarios.\n\n## Optimize your cold chain management for last-mile home delivery with Tempack\n\nTempack\u2019s passive temperature-controlled solutions are specifically developed to support **food\nlast-mile delivery operations**, ensuring that chilled and frozen products m * [ English][1]\n  * [ Espa\u00f1ol][2]\n  * [ Deutsch][3]\n\u00a0 \u00a0\n[[Tempack][Tempack]][4]\n* Products\n  * [[softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon\n    ]Single-use\n    Packaging][5]\n    * [PET Thermpack][6]\n    * [Greenin][7]\n    * [Lipbox][8]\n  * [[softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-reusable-shipper-icon]Reusable\n    Packaging][9]\n    * [InTempack Insert][10]\n    * [IsoBox 2Door][11]\n    * [CarryTemp\u00ae Bag][12]\n    * [Pallet Shippers][13]\n  * [[tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu][tempack-containers-for-vehicles-mega-menu]Container\n    s for Delivery Vehicles][14]\n    * [CarryTemp\u00ae][15]\n    * [Transforming Vehicles][16]\n  * [[tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue][tempack-life-sciences-packaging-blue]Life Sciences\n    Packaging][17]\n    * [DSX Diagnosach][18]\n    * [Patient Bags][19]\n    * [ATP650 Box][20]\n    * [P650 Termovial][21]\n  * [[tempack-cold-packs][tempack-cold-packs]Cold\n    Packs][22]\n    * [Rigid Cold\n      Packs/Plates][23]\n    * [Rigid Frozen\n      Packs/Plates][24]\n    * [Flexible Cold/Frozen Packs][25]\n* [Markets][26]\n* [Cold Chain Insights][27]\n* [About][28]\n* [Contact][29]\nTEMPACK\u00ae\nby CSafe Experts in passive temperature-controlled packaging (TCP) since 1996, we support the\ndistribution of fresh and frozen products [FIND OUT MORE][30] The high-performance, low cost per use\nthermal shipper specifically tailored to the needs of food fulfilment centres CASE STUDY ISOBOX\n2DOOR IsoBox 2Door, the ultimate alternative to EPP shippers FIND OUT MORE TRANSFORMING DELIVERY\nVEHICLES RANGE We transform any conventional vehicle into a multitemperature delivery vehicle in no\ntime and ensure an unbroken food cold chain. ATP certified shippers under request FIND OUT MORE\nTHERMAL PACKAGING FOR THE FOOD SUPPLY CHAIN Wholesalers, Distribution, Fulfilment, Retailers,\neCommerce, Transport & Logistics, Food Service AI-generated image FIND OUT MORE [Fresh food delivery\nbox with fruits, vegetables, and milk being unpacked] TEMPACK\u00ae\nby CSafe Mastering the Cold Chain to prevent Food Waste [FIND OUT MORE][31]\n\n# Temperature-controlled packaging\n\nTempack, by CSafe, is a **leading global provider in the isothermal and refrigerated packaging\nsector.** Our primary activity focuses on the manufacture, development and qualification of\npackaging solutions for transporting and distributing essential, temperature-sensitive goods, **with\na special focus on food products, which require a cold chain delivery**.\n\n## Products\n\n[[softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon][softbox-systems-single-use-parcel-shipper-icon]][3\n2]\n\n### [Single-use\n### Packaging][33]\n\nSustainable, disposable solutions offering reliable short-term temperature control for perishable\ngoods, maintaining stability for up to 48 hours.\n\n[][34]\n\n### [Reusable\n### Packaging][35]\n\nDurable, long-lasting shippers designed for daily use, ideal for maintaining the cold chain of\nfresh, chilled and/or frozen perishable foods.\n\n[][36]\n\n### [Containers for Delivery Vehicles][37]\n\nModular units designed to maintain temperature in delivery vehicles (cargo vans, bikes, trikes,\netc), ensuring chilled and frozen food products stay at the required temperature during last-mile\ntransportation.\n\n[][38]\n\n### [Life Sciences\n### Packaging][39]\n\nSpecialized packaging for medical and biological materials requiring strict temperature control.\n\n[][40]\n\n### [Cold\n### Packs][41]\n\nFlexible and rigid packs that keep chilled and frozen shipments within specific temperature ranges,\noffering a safer and more cost-effective alternative to dry ice without the associated handling\nrisks and higher costs.\n\n[][42]\n\n### [Customised\n### Systems][43]\n\nTailor-made solutions designed to meet the strictest requirements and ensure optimal thermal\nprotection.\n\n## Experts in passive temperature controlled packaging\n\nOur passive temperature-controlled packaging solutions are designed to support reliable **food cold\nchain logistics operations**, ensuring the safe **distribution of chilled, fresh and frozen\nproducts** such as fruit, vegetables, dairy, meat and seafood.\n\nDeveloped with the operational realities of **grocery delivery, food retail distribution and\ne-commerce fulfilment** in mind, our systems help maintain product stability throughout preparation,\nstaging, transport and last-mile delivery.\n\nWhile primarily focused on food distribution environments, our solutions can also be adapted to\nother temperature-sensitive transport requirements when operational conditions demand it.\n\nSupported by rigorous testing and qualification processes, our product range combines thermal\nperformance with practical efficiency, enabling temperature control in demanding real-world\nlogistics scenarios.\n\n## Optimize your cold chain management for last-mile home delivery with Tempack\n\nTempack\u2019s passive temperature-controlled solutions are specifically developed to support **food\nlast-mile delivery operations**, ensuring that chilled and frozen products maintain stability from\nfulfilment preparation through to final distribution.\nOur systems help retailers, e-grocery operators and logistics providers preserve product quality\nwhile improving operational efficiency in urban delivery environments.\n\n**Preservation of Freshness and Quality**\n\nOur packaging maintains the precise temperature ranges required for chilled and frozen food\ndistribution, preventing spoilage and preserving product quality throughout last-mile delivery\nroutes.\n\n**Guaranteed Cold Chain Integrity**\n\nDesigned specifically for last-mile deliveries, our packaging solutions maintain stable temperatures\neven in varying external conditions, ensuring cold chain integrity from the distribution or\nfulfilment centre to the customer.\n\n**Reduced Spoilage and Waste**\n\nBy protecting chilled and frozen products during home delivery, our solutions minimize product loss,\nreducing waste and supporting both sustainability efforts and cost savings for retailers.\n\n**Compliance with Home Delivery Standards**\n\nAll packaging solutions are built to meet the necessary regulations and best practices for\ntransporting perishable goods, ensuring compliance and reducing the risk of product returns or\ncustomer dissatisfaction upon delivery.\n\n**Traceability and monitoring**\n\nOur packaging solutions can integrate monitoring technologies to provide visibility across food\ndistribution routes, suporting quality assurance and operational control in last-mile\ndelivery.\u00a0\u00a0Depending on operational needs, features may include temperature alerts, location\nvisibility and connectivity tools that help logistics teams maintain product integrity throughout\ndelivery.\n\n## Benefits\n\nPersonalised service\n\n[tempack-custom][tempack-custom]\n\nCustomised to individual requirements\n\nVariable sizes and configurations\n\n[simulation][simulation]\n\nIndustry-specific qualification services\n\nTransport-specific design capabilities\n\nIn-house and external training\n\n[kit-lock][kit-lock]\n\nSpecialised technical support\n"
      }
